values
  ('1147533244441562467', 'King of the Ants', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Stuart Gordon, Mac Ahlberg', 'Charlie Higson', 'Chris L. McKenna, Kari Wührer, George Wendt, Vernon Wells, Lionel Mark Smith, Timm Sharp, Daniel Baldwin, Carissa Kosta', 'R', 'A young drifter, struggling to makes ends meet, accepts a job to kill a prominent accountant. When he isn''t paid for the hit, revenge is now his path.', 'A young drifter, struggling to makes ends meet, accepts a job to kill a prominent accountant. When he isn''t paid for the hit, revenge is now his path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFsxsZlEDo1rMemCLZiR06z9YlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21619'),
  ('306354175808679076', 'King of the Children', 1987, 'Drama', 'Chen Kaige, Gu Changwei, Qiang Xiaolu', 'Chen Kaige, He Jianjun', 'Xie Yuan, Xuewen Yang, Shaohua Chen, Caimei Zhang, Xu Guoqing, Gu Changwei', null, 'An unschooled young man, one of the countless victims of Mao''s Cultural Revolution, is laboring in the countryside when he is assigned to teach in a nearby school. Gradually, he abandons the Maoist textbook and encourages the barely literate kids to write about their own lives and feelings.', 'An unschooled young man, one of the countless victims of Mao''s Cultural Revolution, is laboring in the countryside when he is assigned to teach in a nearby school. Gradually, he abandons the Maoist textbook and encourages the barely literate kids to write about their own lives and feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWU0r0EShawSdv68iFgKFWgQye5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148597'),
  ('605500493725873206', 'King of the Doormen', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zeki Ökten', 'Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Sevil Üstekin, Sevda Ferdağ, Bilge Zobu, Şevket Altuğ, Feridun Çölgeçen, Diler Saraç, Güner Sümer', null, 'Seyit, a resourceful doorman of a middle class apartment in Istanbul, finds himself in a struggle for power when the new superintendent decides to crack down on his slack attitude.', 'Seyit, a resourceful doorman of a middle class apartment in Istanbul, finds himself in a struggle for power when the new superintendent decides to crack down on his slack attitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s55cw0ZNAsAU4o8FnEPwJqfjLR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69610'),
  ('264775072721509298', 'King of the Gypsies', 1978, 'Drama', 'Frank Pierson, Sven Nykvist, Alan Hopkins', 'Frank Pierson', 'Sterling Hayden, Shelley Winters, Susan Sarandon, Judd Hirsch, Eric Roberts, Brooke Shields, Annette O''Toole, Annie Potts', 'R', 'Zharko, leader of the Romanis in NYC, passes his position of leadership on to his unwilling grandson, Dave, leading to infighting between Dave and his father.', 'Zharko, leader of the Romanis in NYC, passes his position of leadership on to his unwilling grandson, Dave, leading to infighting between Dave and his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wLk1iApQx5lxMiB0p6F7iS91c3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20863'),
  ('561329776638910462', 'King of the Hill', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'Elliot Davis, Steven Soderbergh, Gregory Jacobs', 'Steven Soderbergh', 'Jesse Bradford, Jeroen Krabbé, Lisa Eichhorn, Karen Allen, Spalding Gray, Elizabeth McGovern, Cameron Boyd, Adrien Brody', 'PG-13', 'Based on the Depression-era bildungsroman memoir of writer A. E. Hotchner, the film follows the story of a boy struggling to survive on his own in a hotel in St. Louis after his mother is committed to a sanatorium with tuberculosis. His father, a German immigrant and traveling salesman working for the Hamilton Watch Company, is off on long trips from which the boy cannot be certain he will return.', 'Based on the Depression-era bildungsroman memoir of writer A. E. Hotchner, the film follows the story of a boy struggling to survive on his own in a hotel in St. Louis after his mother is committed to a sanatorium with tuberculosis. His father, a German immigrant and traveling salesman working for the Hamilton Watch Company, is off on long trips from which the boy cannot be certain he will return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmV21mWwclW2A3lmlBejn8TyIu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34024'),
  ('159725539082793537', 'King of the Khyber Rifles', 1953, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Henry Weinberger, Leon Shamroy', 'Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts', 'Tyrone Power, Terry Moore, Michael Rennie, John Justin, Guy Rolfe, Richard Wyler, Murray Matheson, Frank De Kova', 'NR', 'Freshly arrived Sandhurst-trained Captain Alan King, better versed in Pashtun then any of the veterans and born locally as army brat, survives an attack on his escort to his Northwest Frontier province garrison near the Khyber pass because of Ahmed, a native Afridi deserter from the Muslim fanatic rebel Karram Khan''s forces. As soon as his fellow officers learn his mother was a native Muslim which got his parents disowned even by their own families, he falls prey to stubborn prejudiced discrimination, Lieutenant Geoffrey Heath even moves out of their quarters, except from half-Irish Lt. Ben Baird.', 'Freshly arrived Sandhurst-trained Captain Alan King, better versed in Pashtun then any of the veterans and born locally as army brat, survives an attack on his escort to his Northwest Frontier province garrison near the Khyber pass because of Ahmed, a native Afridi deserter from the Muslim fanatic rebel Karram Khan''s forces. As soon as his fellow officers learn his mother was a native Muslim which got his parents disowned even by their own families, he falls prey to stubborn prejudiced discrimination, Lieutenant Geoffrey Heath even moves out of their quarters, except from half-Irish Lt. Ben Baird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GMJxDCQ8FyFsd590GSOkZTXLgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47173'),
  ('321563394805490256', 'King of the Lost World', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Steven Parker, Leigh Scott, Justin Jones', 'David Michael Latt, Leigh Scott, Carlos De Los Rios', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Sarah Lieving, Rhett Giles, Christina Rosenberg, Steve Railsback, Chriss Anglin, Amanda Ward, Boni Yanagisawa', null, 'In this modern retelling of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s fantasy action-adventure classic, a commercial airliner crashes deep in the heart of the Amazon. Now, the survivors must face a mysterious and hostile world inhabited by giant scorpions, dragons, and a simian beast that stands ten stories tall.', 'In this modern retelling of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s fantasy action-adventure classic, a commercial airliner crashes deep in the heart of the Amazon. Now, the survivors must face a mysterious and hostile world inhabited by giant scorpions, dragons, and a simian beast that stands ten stories tall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wWIbl85HcxvUjPjLU6Qi4dStWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31394'),
  ('815428940136707559', 'King of the Mountain', 1981, 'Drama, Action', 'Noel Nosseck, Buddy Joe Hooker', 'Leigh Chapman, H.R. Christian', 'Harry Hamlin, Joseph Bottoms, Deborah Van Valkenburgh, Richard Cox, Dennis Hopper, Dan Haggerty, Seymour Cassel, Cassandra Peterson', 'PG', 'A group of friends race their high-powered cars up and down a dangerous and deadly mountain road known as Mulholland Drive to see who can claim the title of "King of the Hill."', 'A group of friends race their high-powered cars up and down a dangerous and deadly mountain road known as Mulholland Drive to see who can claim the title of "King of the Hill."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYSHGnnBJM3APrw8WgWtAxbTiLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75048'),
  ('82991876034635607', 'King of the Night', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lauro Escorel, Héctor Babenco', 'Orlando Senna', 'Paulo José, Marília Pêra, Vic Militello, Isadora de Farias, Cristina Pereira, Yara Amaral, Márcia Real, Ivete Bonfá', null, 'In the 1940s, São Paulo nightlife is the setting for Tezinho''s love affairs. In love with Aninha, he needs to get away from the girl and ends up getting involved with other women, including an obsessive relationship with a prostitute.', 'In the 1940s, São Paulo nightlife is the setting for Tezinho''s love affairs. In love with Aninha, he needs to get away from the girl and ends up getting involved with other women, including an obsessive relationship with a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sozjZb9qN4GQ8N2au2TauVK2NNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263444'),
  ('139027365131587230', 'King of the Pecos', 1936, 'Action, Western', 'Joseph Kane, Jack A. Marta', 'Bernard McConville, Dorrell McGowan', 'John Wayne, Muriel Evans, Cy Kendall, Jack Rube Clifford, Arthur Aylesworth, Herbert Heywood, J. Frank Glendon, Edward Hearn', 'NR', 'Profiteer Alexander Stiles lays claim to a million acres of range in the Pecos River country, but a rancher named Claybor stands in his way as he has already claimed the water-rich location of Sweetwater as his own.', 'Profiteer Alexander Stiles lays claim to a million acres of range in the Pecos River country, but a rancher named Claybor stands in his way as he has already claimed the water-rich location of Sweetwater as his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR575xHoBttUUQhxWz5mb4ocLYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84909'),
  ('739943312979021694', 'King of the Rocket Men', 1949, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Fred C. Brannon, Ellis W. Carter', 'Royal K. Cole, William Lively, Sol Shor', 'Tristram Coffin, Mae Clarke, Don Haggerty, James Craven, I. Stanford Jolley, House Peters Jr., Douglas Evans, Ted Adams', 'NR', 'Prof. Millard pretends to be dead and helps Jeff King ferret out Vulcan, the evil traitor at the science academy. Donning his Rocket Man costume King goes from one hair raising rescue to the next in order to keep the newly invented Decimator out of the clutches of Vulcan and his minions.', 'Prof. Millard pretends to be dead and helps Jeff King ferret out Vulcan, the evil traitor at the science academy. Donning his Rocket Man costume King goes from one hair raising rescue to the next in order to keep the newly invented Decimator out of the clutches of Vulcan and his minions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5Jm2zIwuKnLzxtKCE0dkCHR9C6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33554'),
  ('463199364830271928', 'King of the Underworld', 1939, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Lewis Seiler, Frank Heath, Leo F. Forbstein', 'George Bricker, Vincent Sherman', 'Humphrey Bogart, Kay Francis, James Stephenson, John Eldredge, Jessie Busley, Arthur Aylesworth, Raymond Brown, Harland Tucker', 'NR', 'Physician Carole Nelson, suspected of having ties to notorious gangster Joe Gurney, must prove her innocence or the Medical Board will revoke her license. When Gurney seeks her out for treatment after being shot, it could be the break Nelson needs. Now she has a chance to use her medical know-how to outwit Gurney and his goons and reestablish her professional reputation.', 'Physician Carole Nelson, suspected of having ties to notorious gangster Joe Gurney, must prove her innocence or the Medical Board will revoke her license. When Gurney seeks her out for treatment after being shot, it could be the break Nelson needs. Now she has a chance to use her medical know-how to outwit Gurney and his goons and reestablish her professional reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3UhHLF1qgIWL8GLDJBKiCIkUDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27966'),
  ('612928570434456502', 'King of the Zombies', 1941, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jean Yarbrough, Glenn Rominger, William R. Fox', 'Edmond Kelso', 'Dick Purcell, Joan Woodbury, Mantan Moreland, Henry Victor, John Archer, Patricia Stacey, Guy Usher, Marguerite Whitten', 'NR', 'During World War II, a small plane somewhere over the Caribbean runs low on fuel and is blown off course by a storm. Guided by a faint radio signal, they crash-land on an island. The passenger, his manservant and the pilot take refuge in a mansion owned by a doctor. The quick-witted yet easily-frightened manservant soon becomes convinced the mansion is haunted by zombies and ghosts.', 'During World War II, a small plane somewhere over the Caribbean runs low on fuel and is blown off course by a storm. Guided by a faint radio signal, they crash-land on an island. The passenger, his manservant and the pilot take refuge in a mansion owned by a doctor. The quick-witted yet easily-frightened manservant soon becomes convinced the mansion is haunted by zombies and ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aR8TjqGCHqBWlntgPK2N7nFnNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23104'),
  ('1150402931485179989', 'King of Thieves', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Marsh, Choi Ho Man, Danny Cohen', 'Joe Penhall', 'Michael Caine, Jim Broadbent, Tom Courtenay, Charlie Cox, Paul Whitehouse, Michael Gambon, Ray Winstone, Francesca Annis', 'R', 'London, England, April 2015. Brian Reader, a retired thief, gathers an unlikely gang of burglars to perpetrate the biggest and boldest heist in British history. The thieves assault the Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Company and escape with millions in goods and money. But soon the cracks between the gang members begin to appear when they discuss how to share the loot.', 'London, England, April 2015. Brian Reader, a retired thief, gathers an unlikely gang of burglars to perpetrate the biggest and boldest heist in British history. The thieves assault the Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Company and escape with millions in goods and money. But soon the cracks between the gang members begin to appear when they discuss how to share the loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtfS7y2XQ0vjTrm6khq508N0Ehk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520360'),
  ('733657216577979921', 'King of Thorn', 2010, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuyoshi Katayama, Tomonari Nakajima, Naoyuki Onda', 'Hiroshi Yamaguchi, Kazuyoshi Katayama', 'Kana Hanazawa, Kohsei Hirota, Misaki Kuno, Tsutomu Isobe, Sayaka Ohara, Ayako Kawasumi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'A mysterious virus, nicknamed Medusa, is spreading around Japan, turning its victims into stone. Given the impossibility of finding an immediate cure, the government opts for cryopreserving a select group of patients until they come up with a solution. Kasumi, one of the chosen ones, has been asleep for years and her awakening, more than a bed of roses, is a bed of thorns, and happens in the midst of total chaos where monstrous creatures lie in wait all around.', 'A mysterious virus, nicknamed Medusa, is spreading around Japan, turning its victims into stone. Given the impossibility of finding an immediate cure, the government opts for cryopreserving a select group of patients until they come up with a solution. Kasumi, one of the chosen ones, has been asleep for years and her awakening, more than a bed of roses, is a bed of thorns, and happens in the midst of total chaos where monstrous creatures lie in wait all around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH9SSbsNWKLtZjA4LBQ7P2GwbLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50388'),
  ('1031222278420090267', 'King on Horseback', 1958, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Georges Lampin', 'Georges Lampin, Claude Accursi, Denys de La Patellière', 'Jean Marais, Nadja Tiller, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Cathia Caro, Liliane Bert, Robert Dalban, Paul-Émile Deiber, Raoul Delfosse', null, 'Henri La Tour, a strolling player, is also a daring adventurer. So, when, after accomplishing a brilliant feat, he is awarded a title by King Louis XV, the Duke of Saint-Sever takes offense at it and challenges Henri to a duel. However, while they fight, a group of Austrian soldiers appear suddenly and the two rivals instantly unite to repel their enemies. Unfortunately, Saint-Sever is mortally wounded and, feeling he is about to die, he entreats his new friend to offer protection to Toinon, his natural daughter, whose life is being threatened...', 'Henri La Tour, a strolling player, is also a daring adventurer. So, when, after accomplishing a brilliant feat, he is awarded a title by King Louis XV, the Duke of Saint-Sever takes offense at it and challenges Henri to a duel. However, while they fight, a group of Austrian soldiers appear suddenly and the two rivals instantly unite to repel their enemies. Unfortunately, Saint-Sever is mortally wounded and, feeling he is about to die, he entreats his new friend to offer protection to Toinon, his natural daughter, whose life is being threatened...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caFDZBbN3RMpVOIYZwCbDIUTtg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62712'),
  ('1002802957869721029', 'King Ordinary', 2013, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'David Dietl', 'David Dietl', 'Olli Dittrich, Veronica Ferres, Katrin Bauerfeind, Jella Haase, Wanja Mues, Jonas Nay, Wolfram Koch, Stephan Grossmann', null, 'Thomas Müller is spotted by a marketing agency for his exceptional normality.', 'Thomas Müller is spotted by a marketing agency for his exceptional normality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y03OobXLWuBzNZKZTEIMAhZzxqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212503'),
  ('473426899386918430', 'King Ottokar''s Sceptre', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'E. Shipley Turner, Robert Réa, Martin Brossollet', 'Thierry Wermuth, Marie Vincent, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman', null, 'An absent-minded sigillographer gets Tintin involved in a dangerous political intrigue in the Balkan nation of Syldavia.', 'An absent-minded sigillographer gets Tintin involved in a dangerous political intrigue in the Balkan nation of Syldavia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svb0VM3qee0QuBTInvYRDX4NzEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441125'),
  ('412369502344542991', 'King Ralph', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Kenneth MacMillan, David S. Ward, Derek Cracknell', 'David S. Ward', 'John Goodman, Peter O''Toole, John Hurt, Camille Coduri, Richard Griffiths, Leslie Phillips, James Villiers, Joely Richardson', 'PG', 'As the only relative in line to ascend the Royal throne, a down-on-his-luck American slob must learn the ways of the English.', 'As the only relative in line to ascend the Royal throne, a down-on-his-luck American slob must learn the ways of the English.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRHq4KerVgNRLaDwwuYpCAHIQJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10804'),
  ('222553351093550598', 'King Rat', 1965, 'Drama, War', 'Bryan Forbes, Burnett Guffey, C.M. Florance', 'Bryan Forbes', 'George Segal, James Fox, Tom Courtenay, Patrick O''Neal, James Donald, John Mills, Denholm Elliott, Leonard Rossiter', null, 'When Singapore surrendered to the Japanese in 1942, the Allied POWs, mostly British but including a few Americans, were incarcerated in Changi prison. Among the American prisoners is Cpl. King, a wheeler-dealer who has managed to establish a pretty good life for himself in the camp. King soon forms a friendship with an upper-class British officer who is fascinated with King''s enthusiastic approach to life.', 'When Singapore surrendered to the Japanese in 1942, the Allied POWs, mostly British but including a few Americans, were incarcerated in Changi prison. Among the American prisoners is Cpl. King, a wheeler-dealer who has managed to establish a pretty good life for himself in the camp. King soon forms a friendship with an upper-class British officer who is fascinated with King''s enthusiastic approach to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tofzWLQxmM6ISFsOY1YFKJBiUhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29586'),
  ('388675980179426173', 'King Richard', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Ryan Grossheim, Linia Marie Hardy, Reinaldo Marcus Green', 'Zach Baylin', 'Will Smith, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Saniyya Sidney, Demi Singleton, Jon Bernthal, Mikayla LaShae Bartholomew, Tony Goldwyn, Susie Abromeit', 'PG-13', 'The story of how Richard Williams served as a coach to his daughters Venus and Serena, who will soon become two of the most legendary tennis players in history.', 'The story of how Richard Williams served as a coach to his daughters Venus and Serena, who will soon become two of the most legendary tennis players in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dfujXrxePtYJPiPHj1HkAFQvpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614917'),
  ('173559129200164411', 'King Richard and the Crusaders', 1954, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'David Butler, Yakima Canutt, J. Peverell Marley', 'John Twist', 'Rex Harrison, Virginia Mayo, George Sanders, Laurence Harvey, Robert Douglas, Michael Pate, Paula Raymond, Lester Matthews', 'NR', 'Based on Sir Walter Scott''s The Talisman, this is the story of the romantic adventures of Christians and Muslims during the battle for the Holy Land in the time of King Richard the Lionheart.', 'Based on Sir Walter Scott''s The Talisman, this is the story of the romantic adventures of Christians and Muslims during the battle for the Holy Land in the time of King Richard the Lionheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjOMuydf3GRrm3N0YlNURU8rrjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51227'),
  ('879998611323670086', 'King Shakir Recycle', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Berk Tokay, Haluk Can Dizdaroglu', 'Haluk Can Dizdaroglu', 'Mustafa Oral, Atilla Şendil, Levent Ünsal, Sema Kahriman, Didem Atlıhan, Onur Akgülgil, Arda Tümer, Ismail Yıldız', null, 'Scientists trying to solve the environmental crisis of pollution devise a way to send the collected garbage into space via rocket ships. When this garbage starts to land on alien planets, the outraged aliens head to Earth for revenge. King Shakir and his family must do their best to protect the world from alien destruction.', 'Scientists trying to solve the environmental crisis of pollution devise a way to send the collected garbage into space via rocket ships. When this garbage starts to land on alien planets, the outraged aliens head to Earth for revenge. King Shakir and his family must do their best to protect the world from alien destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0kGpKB2elapYboHklgn9wLTj9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985103'),
  ('517227271956499989', 'King Size', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Juliusz Machulski, Jerzy Łukaszewicz', 'Jolanta Hartwig-Sosnowska, Juliusz Machulski', 'Jacek Chmielnik, Jerzy Stuhr, Katarzyna Figura, Grzegorz Heromiński, Joachim Lamża, Maciej Kozłowski, Jan Machulski, Leonard Pietraszak', null, 'The story follows a young scientist in the contemporary world, who actually came from the world of dwarves, thanks to a magic potion, held by the Big Eater, ruler of the dwarves. The dwarf kingdom, Shuflandia, exists in a cellar of a library, and only the most obedient get the chance to grow to king size and inhabit the larger world. Once there, nobody wants to return to Shuflandia. Also, there are no women in Shuflandia.', 'The story follows a young scientist in the contemporary world, who actually came from the world of dwarves, thanks to a magic potion, held by the Big Eater, ruler of the dwarves. The dwarf kingdom, Shuflandia, exists in a cellar of a library, and only the most obedient get the chance to grow to king size and inhabit the larger world. Once there, nobody wants to return to Shuflandia. Also, there are no women in Shuflandia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxohn09CnLEeDE2rINNxGFkQmQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36391'),
  ('337178164640699202', 'King Solomon''s Mines', 1937, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Robert Stevenson, Glen MacWilliams', 'Michael Hogan, Ralph Spence, Charles Bennett', 'Paul Robeson, Cedric Hardwicke, Anna Lee, Roland Young, John Loder, Frederick Leister, Robert Adams, Tony Wane', null, 'White hunter Allan Quartermain and his enigmatic guide help a young Irish woman locate her missing father in unexplored Darkest Africa.', 'White hunter Allan Quartermain and his enigmatic guide help a young Irish woman locate her missing father in unexplored Darkest Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbOgmmA5K32joQvmDpvAs5Dzfqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43860'),
  ('1134669309000246285', 'King Solomon''s Mines', 1950, 'Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Compton Bennett, Andrew Marton, Robert Surtees', 'Helen Deutsch', 'Deborah Kerr, Stewart Granger, Richard Carlson, Hugo Haas, Lowell Gilmore, Kimursi, Siriaque, Sekaryongo', null, 'Fortune hunter Allan Quatermain teams up with a resourceful woman to help her find her missing husband lost in the wilds of 1900s Africa while being pursued by hostile tribes and a rival German explorer.', 'Fortune hunter Allan Quatermain teams up with a resourceful woman to help her find her missing husband lost in the wilds of 1900s Africa while being pursued by hostile tribes and a rival German explorer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5T4Da7d3f255YRyaWfhMWfoBKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43388'),
  ('344341846603080295', 'King Solomon''s Mines', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'J. Lee Thompson, Álex Phillips Jr., Stephen Chigorimbo', 'Gene Quintano, James R. Silke', 'Richard Chamberlain, Sharon Stone, Herbert Lom, John Rhys-Davies, Ken Gampu, June Buthelezi, Sam Williams, Fidelis Chea', 'PG-13', 'Ever in search of adventure, explorer Allan Quatermain agrees to join the beautiful Jesse Huston on a mission to locate her archaeologist father, who has been abducted for his knowledge of the legendary mines of King Solomon. As the kidnappers, led by sinister German military officer Bockner, journey into the wilds of Africa, Allan and Jesse track the party and must contend with fierce natives and dangerous creatures, among other perils.', 'Ever in search of adventure, explorer Allan Quatermain agrees to join the beautiful Jesse Huston on a mission to locate her archaeologist father, who has been abducted for his knowledge of the legendary mines of King Solomon. As the kidnappers, led by sinister German military officer Bockner, journey into the wilds of Africa, Allan and Jesse track the party and must contend with fierce natives and dangerous creatures, among other perils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpaW2gh0hjMPwoz30JL3gRKi2Ho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9838'),
  ('1061417785998927601', 'King Stag', 1970, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy, Family', 'Pavel Arsenov, Inna Zarafyan, Boris Golev', 'Vadim Korostylyov', 'Yuriy Yakovlev, Valentina Malyavina, Sergei Yursky, Yelena Solovey, Viktor Zozulin, Oleg Tabakov, Oleg Efremov, Vladimir Shlezinger', null, 'A story of court intrigues, love, and betrayal. A vain king is turned into a stag and only true love can save him', 'A story of court intrigues, love, and betrayal. A vain king is turned into a stag and only true love can save him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyy8VjuraQGfckal2YkuDTAyJ0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330057'),
  ('1089153717408853810', 'King Thrushbeard', 1965, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Walter Beck, Lothar Gerber', 'Günter Kaltofen, Walter Beck', 'Karin Ugowski, Manfred Krug, Martin Flörchinger, Helmut Schreiber, Achim Schmidtchen, Gerd E. Schäfer, Arno Wyzniewski, Fritz Decho', null, 'A fairy-tale about a beautiful but very haughty princess Anna who cruelly mocks each of her suitors. Finally she is forced by the king to marry a beggar. The poor life, hard work and love teach the princess a lesson and turn her into a loving and kind person.', 'A fairy-tale about a beautiful but very haughty princess Anna who cruelly mocks each of her suitors. Finally she is forced by the king to marry a beggar. The poor life, hard work and love teach the princess a lesson and turn her into a loving and kind person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s030xxlgT5aMpBoP16E3XMTB9Ir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13302'),
  ('260674580070057058', 'King Thrushbeard', 1984, 'Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Vladimír Holloš, Miloslav Luther, Júlia Gregorová', 'Tibor Vichta, Miloslav Luther, Miloš Ruppeldt', 'Adriana Tarábková, Lukáš Vaculík, Maria Schell, Gerhard Olschewski, Marián Labuda, Zita Furková, Bronislav Poloczek, Ľudovít Kroner', null, 'When a selfless king learns of a beautiful princess in a neighboring kingdom who callously turns down every suitor with an insult, he tries his luck to no avail. So, he hatches a plot with her father in which the princess is married to him, in disguise as a beggar, so he can teach her lessons about humility and compassion.', 'When a selfless king learns of a beautiful princess in a neighboring kingdom who callously turns down every suitor with an insult, he tries his luck to no avail. So, he hatches a plot with her father in which the princess is married to him, in disguise as a beggar, so he can teach her lessons about humility and compassion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6O1sWpVsld2IWou9GeYzv3thFCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155908'),
  ('546599194197557422', 'King Tweety', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Careen Ingle', null, 'Eric Bauza, Candi Milo, Jon Daly, Niccole Thurman, Flula Borg, Carlease Burke, Dana DeLorenzo, Regi Davis', 'PG', 'Everyone''s favorite yellow canary unexpectedly becomes next in line for the crown when the queen of an island paradise disappears. His Little Highness’ entourage includes motorbike daredevil Granny and sly Sylvester, whose allegiance is tested when he uncovers a sinister plot to eliminate Tweety for good.', 'Everyone''s favorite yellow canary unexpectedly becomes next in line for the crown when the queen of an island paradise disappears. His Little Highness’ entourage includes motorbike daredevil Granny and sly Sylvester, whose allegiance is tested when he uncovers a sinister plot to eliminate Tweety for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJatuRAVIsxAIszL3QTxrbIzxzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952217'),
  ('1046914713235469721', 'King Uncle', 1993, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rakesh Roshan, Jawahar Bhandari, Nadeem Khan', 'Ravi Kapoor, Mohan Kaul', 'Jackie Shroff, Anu Aggarwal, Shah Rukh Khan, Nagma, Pooja Ruparel, Nivedita Joshi Saraf, Paresh Rawal, Deven Verma', null, 'Ashok Bansal has a traumatic childhood which teaches him that money matters most to people, even more than their kids. Ashok starts hating poor people & starts working hard to get out of poverty, at the expense of his own family. However, Ashok’s life changes forever when Munna enters his life.', 'Ashok Bansal has a traumatic childhood which teaches him that money matters most to people, even more than their kids. Ashok starts hating poor people & starts working hard to get out of poverty, at the expense of his own family. However, Ashok’s life changes forever when Munna enters his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJAg9UonrhG4yoJTSo70dF99Qp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81551'),
  ('830638499230829682', 'King-Size Canary', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Frank Graham, Sara Berner', null, 'A hungry cat has the idea of giving "Jumbo Gro" fertilizer to a scrawny canary to make him a bigger meal, which leads to a race between the cat, the canary, a dog, and a mouse to see who can grow the biggest.', 'A hungry cat has the idea of giving "Jumbo Gro" fertilizer to a scrawny canary to make him a bigger meal, which leads to a race between the cat, the canary, a dog, and a mouse to see who can grow the biggest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXdN4N3aiBzRqqotk90cjEFW2XP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84893'),
  ('482064686415053868', 'King, Queen, Knave', 1972, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Vladimir Nabokov', 'John Moulder-Brown, David Niven, Gina Lollobrigida, Mario Adorf, Barbara Valentin, Elma Karlowa, Mogens von Gadow, Jerzy Skolimowski', null, 'Based on a novel by Vladimir Nabokov, this English-language satirical drama details the experiences of Frank (John Moulder Brown), a young orphan who finds himself deep in the romantic clutches of his uncle''s sensual wife. After Frank''s parents die, he goes to live with his aunt Martha (Gina Lollabrigida) and uncle Charles (David Niven). Sexy Martha entices Frank into her embrace then wants him to kill her husband so that they can live off of his money. Frank wouldn''t mind so much, but he really likes his uncle.', 'Based on a novel by Vladimir Nabokov, this English-language satirical drama details the experiences of Frank (John Moulder Brown), a young orphan who finds himself deep in the romantic clutches of his uncle''s sensual wife. After Frank''s parents die, he goes to live with his aunt Martha (Gina Lollabrigida) and uncle Charles (David Niven). Sexy Martha entices Frank into her embrace then wants him to kill her husband so that they can live off of his money. Frank wouldn''t mind so much, but he really likes his uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a43zgbhDytD5FMRBOBtzuMPXj77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198646'),
  ('712063530382222604', 'King: A Filmed Record... Montgomery to Memphis', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Wendell Franklin, Sidney Lumet, Joseph L. Mankiewicz', null, 'Martin Luther King Jr., Coretta Scott King, A.D. King, Dexter King, Yolanda King, Martin Luther King III, Bernice King, Ralph Abernathy', null, 'A presentation of key events in the life of civil rights activist Martin Luther King Jr. Beginning with the 1955 bus boycott in Montgomery, Alabama, MLK is followed through major steps in his struggle to promote racial equality. Including footage of King''s stirring speeches, it is a fitting tribute to his legacy, and features clips narrated by a wide range of celebrities, including Harry Belafonte, Paul Newman Charlton Heston, Ruby Dee, Burt Lancaster, Anthony Quinn, Walter Matthau, Ben Gazzara, Clarence Williams III, Joanne Woodward, and James Earl Jones.', 'A presentation of key events in the life of civil rights activist Martin Luther King Jr. Beginning with the 1955 bus boycott in Montgomery, Alabama, MLK is followed through major steps in his struggle to promote racial equality. Including footage of King''s stirring speeches, it is a fitting tribute to his legacy, and features clips narrated by a wide range of celebrities, including Harry Belafonte, Paul Newman Charlton Heston, Ruby Dee, Burt Lancaster, Anthony Quinn, Walter Matthau, Ben Gazzara, Clarence Williams III, Joanne Woodward, and James Earl Jones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yenKpaleqf2QBrMxpeYwVO8AJO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149320'),
  ('1096284173472199188', 'King''s Game', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Nikolaj Arcel, Rasmus Videbæk, Mikkel Nørgaard', 'Nikolaj Arcel, Rasmus Heisterberg', 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Søren Pilmark, Nastja Arcel, Nicolas Bro, Lars Mikkelsen, Ulf Pilgaard, Charlotte Munck, Lars Brygmann', null, 'Starting a new job as a political journalist at a leading newspaper, Ulrik Torp witnesses a brutal struggle for power in the Midparty''s ranks -- a struggle that coincides with the charismatic party leader''s involvement in a near fatal car accident. A flurry of lies and media speculation surrounds the incident. Gradually, Ulrik unearths a ruthless conspiracy involving the incumbent prime minister.', 'Starting a new job as a political journalist at a leading newspaper, Ulrik Torp witnesses a brutal struggle for power in the Midparty''s ranks -- a struggle that coincides with the charismatic party leader''s involvement in a near fatal car accident. A flurry of lies and media speculation surrounds the incident. Gradually, Ulrik unearths a ruthless conspiracy involving the incumbent prime minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3hUu80dYIwusnnU9mYA7lrLIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15961'),
  ('447467170174560970', 'King''s Ransom', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jeffrey W. Byrd, Robert McLachlan', 'Wayne Conley', 'Anthony Anderson, Jay Mohr, Kellita Smith, Brooke D''Orsay, Donald Faison, Christian Potenza, Glenn Bang, Regina Hall', 'PG-13', 'Hoping to foil his own gold-digging wife''s plan, a loathsome businessman arranges his own kidnapping, only to realize that there are plenty of other people interested in his wealth as well.', 'Hoping to foil his own gold-digging wife''s plan, a loathsome businessman arranges his own kidnapping, only to realize that there are plenty of other people interested in his wealth as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH8Nugl7DnMaMHfOChEFNXXQ3zX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27360'),
  ('573680876550272752', 'Kingdom', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, War, History, Fantasy', 'Shinsuke Sato, Taro Kawazu, Sokoku Li', 'Shinsuke Sato, Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Kento Yamazaki, Ryo Yoshizawa, Masami Nagasawa, Kanna Hashimoto, Kanata Hongo, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Masahiro Takashima, Jun Kaname', null, 'Set in Qin Dynasty during the warring states period in ancient China. Shin was a war orphan. He has a dream of becoming a great general Shin has a fateful encounter with young King Eisei. King Eisei aims to unify all of China.', 'Set in Qin Dynasty during the warring states period in ancient China. Shin was a war orphan. He has a dream of becoming a great general Shin has a fateful encounter with young King Eisei. King Eisei aims to unify all of China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TaQdmCvuJx6VqC4CsGlpO5lD0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554805'),
  ('787762607202191248', 'Kingdom', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Gowtam Tinnanuri, Girish Gangadharan, Jomon T. John', 'Gowtam Tinnanuri', 'Vijay Deverakonda, Satyadev Kancharana, Venkitesh V P, Bhagyashri Borse, Ronit Kamra, Baburaj, Ayyappa P. Sharma, Bhanu Prakashan', null, 'Soori, a modest police constable, is unintentionally dragged into a dangerous undercover spy operation in Sri Lanka for the Indian government. His journey is intimately linked to his estranged brother Siva, and the risks involved on their reunion.', 'Soori, a modest police constable, is unintentionally dragged into a dangerous undercover spy operation in Sri Lanka for the Indian government. His journey is intimately linked to his estranged brother Siva, and the risks involved on their reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbyv4V1JJFJ4OD01JYO1ZWrDg5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124838'),
  ('328099180259184656', 'Kingdom 2: Far and Away', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Shinsuke Sato, Akira Sako, Yuji Shimomura', 'Hara Yasuhisa, Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Kento Yamazaki, Ryo Yoshizawa, Kanna Hashimoto, Nana Seino, Amane Okayama, Takahiro Miura, Takayuki Hamatsu, Etsushi Toyokawa', null, 'It follows a young man who dreams of becoming a general and Ying Zheng, whose goal is unification.', 'It follows a young man who dreams of becoming a general and Ying Zheng, whose goal is unification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE4NqJosSPjiyqStBEv67mQbR1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961420'),
  ('229595489162976217', 'Kingdom Come', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Doug McHenry, Francis Kenny', 'Jessie Jones, David Dean Bottrell', 'LL Cool J, Jada Pinkett Smith, Vivica A. Fox, Loretta Devine, Anthony Anderson, Cedric the Entertainer, Toni Braxton, Darius McCrary', 'PG', 'When her husband keels over from a stroke, Raynelle Slocumb calls the entire clan together to remember their dearly departed. Family tensions reach a comedic boil as the wildly dysfunctional Slocumbs squabble and fight their way to the funeral.', 'When her husband keels over from a stroke, Raynelle Slocumb calls the entire clan together to remember their dearly departed. Family tensions reach a comedic boil as the wildly dysfunctional Slocumbs squabble and fight their way to the funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RB7WGRuUhysfAnseiatbKytJsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38803'),
  ('360531395538498672', 'Kingdom Come', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Gary Elmer, Greg A. Sager', 'Geoff Hart, Greg A. Sager, A. Jaye Williams', 'Ry Barrett, Camille Hollett-French, Jason Martorino, William Foley, Soroush Saeidi, Katie Uhlmann, Jo Jo Karume, Chelsey Marie', null, 'A group of strangers wake up in an abandoned hospital to find themselves stalked by a supernatural force with sinister intentions.', 'A group of strangers wake up in an abandoned hospital to find themselves stalked by a supernatural force with sinister intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17ZFwfA92kXR6wD9QlpLDfopvSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295723'),
  ('987833344471658955', 'Kingdom Hospital', 2004, 'Horror', 'Craig R. Baxley', 'Niels Vørsel, Richard Dooling, Stephen King', 'Jamie Harrold, Diane Ladd, Bruce Davison, Jack Coleman, Julian Richings, Andrew McCarthy, Jennifer Cunningham, Jodelle Ferland', null, 'Stephen King''s take on the masterpiece series by Lars von Trier. The story takes place in a hospital in Lewiston, Maine, built on the site of a Civil War-era mill fire in which many children died.', 'Stephen King''s take on the masterpiece series by Lars von Trier. The story takes place in a hospital in Lewiston, Maine, built on the site of a Civil War-era mill fire in which many children died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSk3MOK5ljYql9P2htwkTOd7rfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375569'),
  ('935593304570324127', 'Kingdom III: The Flame of Destiny', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Shinsuke Sato, Akira Sako, Yuji Shimomura', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa, Hara Yasuhisa', 'Kento Yamazaki, Ryo Yoshizawa, Kanna Hashimoto, Nana Seino, Amane Okayama, Takahiro Miura, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Kunito Watanabe', 'PG-13', 'To defend their kingdom against a sudden invasion, a mighty general returns to the battlefield alongside a war orphan, now grown up, who dreams of glory.', 'To defend their kingdom against a sudden invasion, a mighty general returns to the battlefield alongside a war orphan, now grown up, who dreams of glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cIqNt2YPK1nCf904NFISEScCzk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061181'),
  ('1127142142450433596', 'Kingdom of Crooked Mirrors', 1963, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Rou, Vasili Dultsev, Leonid Akimov', 'Vitaliy Gubarev, Lev Arkadyev', 'Olga Yukina, Tatyana Yukina, Anatoliy Kubatskiy, Andrey Fayt, Tamara Nosova, Tatyana Barysheva, Lidiya Vertinskaya, Zoya Vasilkova', null, 'Alice-type Soviet girl, named Olya meets her counterpart Yalo, while looking into the mirror. Yalo is an absolute antipode to Olya, for example where Olya is precise and neat, Yalo is absent-minded, careless, etc. The explicit plot relates to Olya learning to see herself differently, but this occurs through an experience in the Kingdom of Crooked Mirrors which serves as a mechanism for commenting on the ability of a society to manufacture a false reality. Based on a story with the same name by Vitali Gubarev.', 'Alice-type Soviet girl, named Olya meets her counterpart Yalo, while looking into the mirror. Yalo is an absolute antipode to Olya, for example where Olya is precise and neat, Yalo is absent-minded, careless, etc. The explicit plot relates to Olya learning to see herself differently, but this occurs through an experience in the Kingdom of Crooked Mirrors which serves as a mechanism for commenting on the ability of a society to manufacture a false reality. Based on a story with the same name by Vitali Gubarev.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMgXSlo6zXWN5S9JO12w7iBbUC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20891'),
  ('975440286145200968', 'Kingdom of Heaven', 2005, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, History, War', 'John Mathieson, Ridley Scott, Adil Abdelwahab', 'William Monahan', 'Orlando Bloom, Eva Green, Jeremy Irons, David Thewlis, Ghassan Massoud, Liam Neeson, Brendan Gleeson, Marton Csokas', 'R', 'After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.', 'After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNaBe4TwbMef71sgscqabpGKsxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1495'),
  ('324086505626846023', 'Kingdom of the Oceans', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Jacques Cluzaud, Jacques Perrin', null, 'Stéphane Durand', null, 'Diving into the planet’s waters, Kingdom Of The Oceans features astonishing footage that showcases the majesty of the underwater world. Shot at over 50 locations around the world and with eighty different species, this breath-taking four-part special offers a deeper insight into the aquatic side of nature, from the coastal shores to the open sea. 1) Giants Of The Deep: The voyages of blue whales and hordes of tuna through the vast, blue, liquid expanse of the oceans. 2) Sand Wars:The sandy plains of the seabed can appear to be empty, but hide multitudes of moving creatures. 3) Predator''s Paradise: Coral polyps are tiny animals that construct underwater mountains, sheltering an extraordinarily diverse group of species. 4) Fire & Ice: Whales, penguins, iguanas and dolphins have all inherited a burdensome air-breathing legacy from their land-dwelling ancestors.', 'Diving into the planet’s waters, Kingdom Of The Oceans features astonishing footage that showcases the majesty of the underwater world. Shot at over 50 locations around the world and with eighty different species, this breath-taking four-part special offers a deeper insight into the aquatic side of nature, from the coastal shores to the open sea. 1) Giants Of The Deep: The voyages of blue whales and hordes of tuna through the vast, blue, liquid expanse of the oceans. 2) Sand Wars:The sandy plains of the seabed can appear to be empty, but hide multitudes of moving creatures. 3) Predator''s Paradise: Coral polyps are tiny animals that construct underwater mountains, sheltering an extraordinarily diverse group of species. 4) Fire & Ice: Whales, penguins, iguanas and dolphins have all inherited a burdensome air-breathing legacy from their land-dwelling ancestors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCjvzztl4O7Yo2EFd6EPkhgsfL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186382'),
  ('174385666546570386', 'Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Gyula Pados, Justin Muller, Jon Mallard', 'Josh Friedman', 'Owen Teague, Freya Allan, Kevin Durand, Peter Macon, William H. Macy, Eka Darville, Travis Jeffery, Lydia Peckham', 'PG-13', 'Several generations following Caesar''s reign, apes – now the dominant species – live harmoniously while humans have been reduced to living in the shadows. As a new tyrannical ape leader builds his empire, one young ape undertakes a harrowing journey that will cause him to question all he''s known about the past and to make choices that will define a future for apes and humans alike.', 'Several generations following Caesar''s reign, apes – now the dominant species – live harmoniously while humans have been reduced to living in the shadows. As a new tyrannical ape leader builds his empire, one young ape undertakes a harrowing journey that will cause him to question all he''s known about the past and to make choices that will define a future for apes and humans alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKkl37BQuKTanygYQG1pyYgLVgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653346'),
  ('934548667541998438', 'Kingdom of the Silver Lion', 1965, 'Adventure', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Francisco Marín, Robert Ziller', 'J.M. Petersen, Franz Josef Gottlieb, José Antonio de la Loma', 'Lex Barker, Marie Versini, Ralf Wolter, Dieter Borsche, Chris Howland, Sieghardt Rupp, Đorđe Nenadović, Gustavo Rojo', null, 'Kara Ben-Nemsi, friends and rescuers set out to free a young relative of the guardian of the treasure of the Chaldaeans (Christian sect), who is captured for that fabulous ransom.', 'Kara Ben-Nemsi, friends and rescuers set out to free a young relative of the guardian of the treasure of the Chaldaeans (Christian sect), who is captured for that fabulous ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcBtzL836jZLhqmZnpZ5o2ZeiHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19198'),
  ('690291439338476570', 'Kingdom of the Spiders', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Barnwell, John Arthur Morrill, John "Bud" Cardos', 'Alan Caillou, Richard Robinson', 'William Shatner, Tiffany Bolling, Woody Strode, Lieux Dressler, David McLean, Natasha Ryan, Altovise Davis, Joe Ross', 'PG', 'Investigating the mysterious deaths of a number of farm animals, vet Rack Hansen discovers that his town lies in the path of hordes of migrating tarantulas. Before he can take action, the streets are overrun by killer spiders, trapping a small group of townsfolk in a remote hotel.', 'Investigating the mysterious deaths of a number of farm animals, vet Rack Hansen discovers that his town lies in the path of hordes of migrating tarantulas. Before he can take action, the streets are overrun by killer spiders, trapping a small group of townsfolk in a remote hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NMnHnb721MwczHJ486Ltfo68F4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30315'),
  ('334401577139643081', 'Kingdom: Ashin of the North', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Kim Seong-hun, Go Rak-sun, Jo Gyeong-hun', 'Kim Eun-hee', 'Gianna Jun, Park Byung-eun, Kim Si-a, Kim Roi-ha, Koo Kyo-hwan, Jung Suk-won, Ji Hyun-jun, Kwon Beom-taek', null, 'Tragedy, betrayal and a mysterious discovery fuel a woman''s vengeance for the loss of her tribe and family.', 'Tragedy, betrayal and a mysterious discovery fuel a woman''s vengeance for the loss of her tribe and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piGZDwFW4urLYDWGiYJMrt6hdCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845222'),
  ('1043564177991557147', 'Kingdom: Return of the Great General', 2024, 'Action, Adventure', 'Shinsuke Sato, Yuji Shimomura, Sokoku Lee', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa, Hara Yasuhisa', 'Kento Yamazaki, Takao Osawa, Ryo Yoshizawa, Kanna Hashimoto, Nana Seino, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Amane Okayama, Takahiro Miura', 'R', 'Depicts a continuation of the "Battle of Mayang", an all-out war against the neighboring country Zhao that Shin and Wang Ki fought in in the previous work "Flame of Fate".', 'Depicts a continuation of the "Battle of Mayang", an all-out war against the neighboring country Zhao that Shin and Wang Ki fought in in the previous work "Flame of Fate".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZKKwXyZ92K0mIRpf2FbCkQa7oO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241320'),
  ('840038055372300917', 'Kingdoms', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pelayo Lira, Patricio Alfaro', 'Romina Reyes, Pelayo Lira', 'Diego Boggioni, Daniela Castillo Toro, Astrid Roldán, Alex Quevedo, Sol Rodriguez, Gastón Salgado, Mauro Vaca, Paulina Moreno', null, 'Alejandro, a freshman, and Sofia, who’s doing her thesis, meet in college. They build an asymmetrical relationship: he’s in love while she just wants to see her sexual desires fulfilled.', 'Alejandro, a freshman, and Sofia, who’s doing her thesis, meet in college. They build an asymmetrical relationship: he’s in love while she just wants to see her sexual desires fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntauOubYAPmGjTe7Kj7tSjr2iPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521127'),
  ('811485742956550782', 'Kingmaker', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Cho Hyoung-rae, Kim Jung-woo, Lee Gil-gyu', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Kim Min-su', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Lee Sun-kyun, You Chea-myung, Jo Woo-jin, Park In-hwan, Bae Jong-ok, Kim Sae-byuk, Lee Hae-yeong', null, 'Seo Chang-dae, an ambitious political campaign strategist who ends up having ideological differences with his present client, receives a lucrative offer that will put his loyalty under the microscope.', 'Seo Chang-dae, an ambitious political campaign strategist who ends up having ideological differences with his present client, receives a lucrative offer that will put his loyalty under the microscope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkwAlOeqjh2IaXALDZszYEvZqFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573787'),
  ('1043856351663667873', 'Kingmaker', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mikkel Serup, Sine Vadstrup Brooker, Christian ''Krølle'' Pedersen', 'Niels Krause-Kjær', 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Lene Maria Christensen, Nicolas Bro, Tommy Kenter, Sofia Nolsøe Mikkelsen, Patrick A. Hansen, Mathilde Arcel Fock, Charlotte Munck', null, 'Ulrik Torp, once a fearless investigative journalist who is now tackling unemployment and a midlife crisis. He finds himself in the middle of a new political conspiracy.', 'Ulrik Torp, once a fearless investigative journalist who is now tackling unemployment and a midlife crisis. He finds himself in the middle of a new political conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KCiUkHlRUAzWnYtlHvtWLyeSq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290697'),
  ('89811621593696973', 'Kingpin', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Bobby Farrelly, Mark Irwin, Peter Farrelly', 'Barry Fanaro, Mort Nathan', 'Woody Harrelson, Randy Quaid, Vanessa Angel, Bill Murray, Chris Elliott, William Jordan, Nancy Frey-Jarecki, Richard Tyson', 'PG-13', 'After bowler Roy Munson swindles the wrong crowd and is left with a hook for a hand, he settles into impoverished obscurity. That is, until he uncovers the next big thing: an Amish kid named Ishmael. So, the corrupt and the hopelessly naive hit the circuit intent on settling an old score with Big Ern.', 'After bowler Roy Munson swindles the wrong crowd and is left with a hook for a hand, he settles into impoverished obscurity. That is, until he uncovers the next big thing: an Amish kid named Ishmael. So, the corrupt and the hopelessly naive hit the circuit intent on settling an old score with Big Ern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVpejjxzBujSjLpxQ7hGe1s0wP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11543'),
  ('1036198931931872234', 'Kings', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Deniz Gamze Ergüven, David Chizallet, Jacques Terblanche', 'Deniz Gamze Ergüven', 'Halle Berry, Daniel Craig, Lamar Johnson, Rachel Hilson, Issac Ryan Brown, Reece Cody, Flor de Maria Chahua, Janet Song', 'R', 'A foster family in South Central a few weeks before the city erupts in violence following the verdict of the Rodney King trial in 1992.', 'A foster family in South Central a few weeks before the city erupts in violence following the verdict of the Rodney King trial in 1992.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEQIshX0y64hYjjDbE1KqevW04e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408873'),
  ('519447979972986675', 'Kings & Queen', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Éric Gautier', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Roger Bohbot', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Mathieu Amalric, Maurice Garrel, Catherine Deneuve, Nathalie Boutefeu, Joachim Salinger, Hippolyte Girardot, Magali Woch', 'NR', 'Shortly before her wedding, art gallery director Nora travels from Paris to Grenoble to visit her preteen son, Elias, who is spending time with her aging professor father, Louis, recently diagnosed with terminal cancer. During her stay, she reaches out to her former lover, Ismaël, a viola player and father figure to Elias who has been committed against his will to a mental hospital. Ismaël, however, has his own problems to sort out.', 'Shortly before her wedding, art gallery director Nora travels from Paris to Grenoble to visit her preteen son, Elias, who is spending time with her aging professor father, Louis, recently diagnosed with terminal cancer. During her stay, she reaches out to her former lover, Ismaël, a viola player and father figure to Elias who has been committed against his will to a mental hospital. Ismaël, however, has his own problems to sort out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNG2gAM1xqZnV8iTXn5qXF8IMyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44524'),
  ('648669921400559607', 'Kings for a Day', 2018, 'Drama', 'Xabi Molia, Patrick Armisen', 'Xabi Molia, Frédéric Chansel', 'Kad Merad, Kacey Mottet Klein, Sylvie Testud, Tiphaine Daviot, Jenny Bellay, Inedson N''Doumbouk Da Cruz Fortes, Marc Bodnar, Aurélie Boquien', null, 'A wannabe actor must chose between his passion and his father, a crook.', 'A wannabe actor must chose between his passion and his father, a crook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDPlgK3JLBnvJBbvw0n5CNeFDdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464699'),
  ('689579424902628765', 'Kings Go Forth', 1958, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Delmer Daves, Daniel L. Fapp, Edward O. Denault', 'Merle Miller', 'Frank Sinatra, Tony Curtis, Natalie Wood, Leora Dana, Karl Swenson, Ann Codee, Eddie Ryder, Jacques Berthe', 'NR', 'When Harris applies for the position of a radioman in Loggins'' army unit, he is hired immediately. While on a mission together in France, they both fall in love with Monique.', 'When Harris applies for the position of a radioman in Loggins'' army unit, he is hired immediately. While on a mission together in France, they both fall in love with Monique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSMo17VnTpCNBPpgaXNbZRLtIE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78229'),
  ('432522743696411536', 'Kings of Pastry', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Chris Hegedus, D. A. Pennebaker', null, 'Jacquy Pfeiffer, Sébastien Cannone, Rachel Beaudry, Philippe Rigollot, Stéphane Glacier, Regis Lazard, Frédérique Lazard, Philippe Urraca', null, 'The collar awarded to the winners of the Meilleur Ouvrier de France (Best Craftsman in France) is more than the ultimate recognition for every pastry chef - it is a dream and an obsession. The 3-day competition includes everything from delicate chocolates to precarious six foot sugar sculptures and requires that the chefs have extraordinary skill, nerves of steel and luck. The film follows Jacquy Pfeiffer, founder of The French Pastry School in Chicago, as he returns to France to compete against 15 of France''s leading pastry chefs. The filmmakers were given first time/exclusive access to this high-stakes drama of passion, sacrifice, disappointment and joy in the quest to have President Sarkozy declare them one of the best in France.', 'The collar awarded to the winners of the Meilleur Ouvrier de France (Best Craftsman in France) is more than the ultimate recognition for every pastry chef - it is a dream and an obsession. The 3-day competition includes everything from delicate chocolates to precarious six foot sugar sculptures and requires that the chefs have extraordinary skill, nerves of steel and luck. The film follows Jacquy Pfeiffer, founder of The French Pastry School in Chicago, as he returns to France to compete against 15 of France''s leading pastry chefs. The filmmakers were given first time/exclusive access to this high-stakes drama of passion, sacrifice, disappointment and joy in the quest to have President Sarkozy declare them one of the best in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orLXFuV9WGqczVBJRw1tRHF50o0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57722'),
  ('758673021346128764', 'Kings of the Road', 1976, 'Drama', 'Robby Müller, Wim Wenders, Martin Hennig', 'Wim Wenders', 'Rüdiger Vogler, Hanns Zischler, Lisa Kreuzer, Rudolf Schündler, Marquard Bohm, Hans Dieter Trayer, Franziska Stömmer, Patric Kreuzer', null, 'Itinerant projection-equipment repairman Bruno Winter and depressed hitchhiker Robert Lander - a doctor who has just been through a break-up with his wife and a half-hearted suicide attempt - travel along the Western side of the East-German border in a repair truck, visiting worn-out movie theaters, learning to communicate across their differences.', 'Itinerant projection-equipment repairman Bruno Winter and depressed hitchhiker Robert Lander - a doctor who has just been through a break-up with his wife and a half-hearted suicide attempt - travel along the Western side of the East-German border in a repair truck, visiting worn-out movie theaters, learning to communicate across their differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKSQ0pTOXYzDWaEXvJEXlhgj2PY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10834'),
  ('998438760835974885', 'Kings of the Sun', 1963, 'History, Adventure', 'J. Lee Thompson, Joseph MacDonald', 'James R. Webb, Elliott Arnold', 'Yul Brynner, George Chakiris, Shirley Anne Field, Richard Basehart, Brad Dexter, Barry Morse, Armando Silvestre, Leo Gordon', null, 'In order to flee from powerful enemies, young Mayan king Balam leads his people north across the Gulf of Mexico to the coast of what will become the United States. They build a home in the new land but come into conflict with a tribe of Native Americans led by their chief, Black Eagle, while both Balam and Black Eagle fall in love the beautiful Mayan princess Ixchel.', 'In order to flee from powerful enemies, young Mayan king Balam leads his people north across the Gulf of Mexico to the coast of what will become the United States. They build a home in the new land but come into conflict with a tribe of Native Americans led by their chief, Black Eagle, while both Balam and Black Eagle fall in love the beautiful Mayan princess Ixchel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luWboioLUipYdlcfolprXoMi2Fm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80027'),
  ('712712324048461529', 'Kings of the Turf', 1941, 'Documentary', 'Del Frazier', null, 'Knox Manning', null, 'Kings of the Turf is a 1941 American short documentary film about horse racing, directed by Del Frazier. This entry in The Sports Parade series shows us how Mortimer, a Standardbred horse, is trained for harness racing. It was nominated for an Academy Award at the 14th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject.', 'Kings of the Turf is a 1941 American short documentary film about horse racing, directed by Del Frazier. This entry in The Sports Parade series shows us how Mortimer, a Standardbred horse, is trained for harness racing. It was nominated for an Academy Award at the 14th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uZ4fI6e4gzbC3EDPgQW3CephgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236814'),
  ('577590237798328080', 'Kings Ransom', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Peter Berg', null, 'Wayne Gretzky, Janet Jones, Luc Robitaille, Glen Sather, Peter Berg, Bruce McNall', null, 'On August 9, 1988, the NHL was forever changed with the single stroke of a pen. The Edmonton Oilers, fresh off their fourth Stanley Cup victory in five years, signed a deal that sent Wayne Gretzky, a Canadian national treasure and the greatest hockey player ever to play the game, to the Los Angeles Kings in a multi-player, multi-million dollar deal. As bewildered Oiler fans struggled to make sense of the unthinkable, fans in Los Angeles were rushing to purchase season tickets at a rate so fast it overwhelmed the Kings box office. Overnight, a franchise largely overlooked in its 21-year existence was suddenly playing to sellout crowds and standing ovations, and a league often relegated to “little brother” status exploded from 21 teams to 30 in less than a decade.', 'On August 9, 1988, the NHL was forever changed with the single stroke of a pen. The Edmonton Oilers, fresh off their fourth Stanley Cup victory in five years, signed a deal that sent Wayne Gretzky, a Canadian national treasure and the greatest hockey player ever to play the game, to the Los Angeles Kings in a multi-player, multi-million dollar deal. As bewildered Oiler fans struggled to make sense of the unthinkable, fans in Los Angeles were rushing to purchase season tickets at a rate so fast it overwhelmed the Kings box office. Overnight, a franchise largely overlooked in its 21-year existence was suddenly playing to sellout crowds and standing ovations, and a league often relegated to “little brother” status exploded from 21 teams to 30 in less than a decade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAYsPWIER2xyRX2voaXdifZcZox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54684'),
  ('115803797911466479', 'Kings Row', 1942, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Sam Wood, James Wong Howe', 'Casey Robinson', 'Ann Sheridan, Robert Cummings, Ronald Reagan, Betty Field, Charles Coburn, Claude Rains, Judith Anderson, Nancy Coleman', 'NR', 'Five young adults in a small American town face the revelations of secrets that threaten to ruin their hopes and dreams.', 'Five young adults in a small American town face the revelations of secrets that threaten to ruin their hopes and dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjOZms5qzSGibE5b6GVHg2Y5wwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53779'),
  ('875187874441473304', 'Kingsglaive: Final Fantasy XV', 2016, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Takeshi Nozue, Daniel Perez Ferreira', 'Takashi Hasegawa', 'Go Ayano, Shioli Kutsuna, Ayumi Fujimura, Keiji Fujiwara, Koichi Yamadera, Shozo Iizuka, Tomokazu Seki, Yuichi Nakamura', 'PG-13', 'The magical kingdom of Lucis is home to the world’s last remaining Crystal, and the menacing empire of Niflheim is determined to steal it. King Regis of Lucis commands an elite force of soldiers called the Kingsglaive. Wielding their king’s magic, they fight to protect Lucis. As the overwhelming military might of the empire bears down, King Regis is faced with an impossible ultimatum – to marry his son, Prince Noctis to Princess Lunafreya of Tenebrae, captive of Niflheim, and surrender his lands to Niflheim rule. Although the king concedes, it becomes clear that the empire will stop at nothing to achieve their devious goals, with only the Kingsglaive standing between them and world domination.', 'The magical kingdom of Lucis is home to the world’s last remaining Crystal, and the menacing empire of Niflheim is determined to steal it. King Regis of Lucis commands an elite force of soldiers called the Kingsglaive. Wielding their king’s magic, they fight to protect Lucis. As the overwhelming military might of the empire bears down, King Regis is faced with an impossible ultimatum – to marry his son, Prince Noctis to Princess Lunafreya of Tenebrae, captive of Niflheim, and surrender his lands to Niflheim rule. Although the king concedes, it becomes clear that the empire will stop at nothing to achieve their devious goals, with only the Kingsglaive standing between them and world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGMgspge6uYoypRiasAmlluDlXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390734'),
  ('1018161641062608178', 'Kingsman: The Golden Circle', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Matthew Vaughn, George Richmond, Oliver Benson', 'Matthew Vaughn, Jane Goldman', 'Taron Egerton, Colin Firth, Julianne Moore, Mark Strong, Hanna Alström, Halle Berry, Pedro Pascal, Channing Tatum', 'R', 'When an attack on the Kingsman headquarters takes place and a new villain rises, Eggsy and Merlin are forced to work together with the American agency known as the Statesman to save the world.', 'When an attack on the Kingsman headquarters takes place and a new villain rises, Eggsy and Merlin are forced to work together with the American agency known as the Statesman to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34xBL6BXNYFqtHO9zhcgoakS4aP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343668'),
  ('197409773846018919', 'Kingsman: The Secret Service', 2015, 'Crime, Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Matthew Vaughn, George Richmond, Andy Thomson', 'Jane Goldman, Matthew Vaughn', 'Taron Egerton, Colin Firth, Samuel L. Jackson, Mark Strong, Sophie Cookson, Sofia Boutella, Michael Caine, Edward Holcroft', 'R', 'The story of a super-secret spy organization that recruits an unrefined but promising street kid into the agency''s ultra-competitive training program just as a global threat emerges from a twisted tech genius.', 'The story of a super-secret spy organization that recruits an unrefined but promising street kid into the agency''s ultra-competitive training program just as a global threat emerges from a twisted tech genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6q9wZK5a2K51KFj4LWVID6Ja1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207703'),
  ('81285843722962534', 'Kingyo', 2009, 'Drama', 'Edmund Yeo, Shinsuke Kawahara, Yukibumi Josha', 'Edmund Yeo', 'Lukino Fujisaki, Takao Kawaguchi, Qyoko Kudo, Sadaharu Yoshida, Koh Ishibashi, Shusei Nakayama, Toru Hasegawa', null, 'A university professor decides to go for a tour in Akihabara, guided by a young woman dressed up like a French maid. As they both walk through the streets of modern Tokyo, the man and the young woman gradually speak of a past they both share, and ultimately a painful love triangle that continues to haunt them. A poetic rumination in love, memories and loss told almost entirely with split screens.', 'A university professor decides to go for a tour in Akihabara, guided by a young woman dressed up like a French maid. As they both walk through the streets of modern Tokyo, the man and the young woman gradually speak of a past they both share, and ultimately a painful love triangle that continues to haunt them. A poetic rumination in love, memories and loss told almost entirely with split screens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCEqzhJxTT1Ahida4DpMpJGjFnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151390'),
  ('124598549292121481', 'Kinjite: Forbidden Subjects', 1989, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'J. Lee Thompson, Gideon Porath, Robert C. Ortwin Jr.', 'Harold Nebenzal', 'Charles Bronson, Perry Lopez, Juan Fernández, James Pax, Peggy Lipton, Sy Richardson, Marion Yue, Bill McKinney', 'R', 'A brutal Los Angeles police lieutenant is determined to bust up an organization that forces underage girls into prostitution.', 'A brutal Los Angeles police lieutenant is determined to bust up an organization that forces underage girls into prostitution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twGSYhM9d1c2bT5n47xRXDrT8XS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59201'),
  ('12027722373730063', 'Kinki', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kotaro Wajima, Yuki Kondo', 'Kotaro Wajima', 'Kiki Sugino, Taiga Nakano, Shiro Sano, Shoko Fujimura, Sarara Tsukifune, Takeshi Yamamoto, Ryu Morioka, Kenji Yamauchi', null, 'A teacher is sexually involved with an underage student. She visits her father''s home and discovers a boy who''s been kept as a sex slave. The teacher continues harboring the boy out of fear and begins to feel sexually attracted to him.', 'A teacher is sexually involved with an underage student. She visits her father''s home and discovers a boy who''s been kept as a sex slave. The teacher continues harboring the boy out of fear and begins to feel sexually attracted to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBOXzP1MgH3MXIMolJWK6hG5gFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345161'),
  ('1081014483073549088', 'KINKI', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Koji Shiraishi, Fūta Takagi, Kouhei Furukawa', 'Koji Shiraishi, Tetsuya Oishi', 'Miho Kanno, Eiji Akaso, Atom Shukugawa, Kyo Sato, Nose Rin, Keisaku Kimura, Atsuki Yamada, Rio Kanno', null, 'After an editor of an occult magazine suddenly vanishes, his friend Chihiro and his co-worker Yusei set out to discover the reason behind his disappearance.', 'After an editor of an occult magazine suddenly vanishes, his friend Chihiro and his co-worker Yusei set out to discover the reason behind his disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKGZCIffzc4oz3ZFDQ5FxAiqqUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400499'),
  ('240489990856855173', 'Kinky Boots', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Julian Jarrold, Eigil Bryld', 'Geoff Deane, Tim Firth', 'Joel Edgerton, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Sarah-Jane Potts, Nick Frost, Linda Bassett, Jemima Rooper, Robert Pugh, Ewan Hooper', 'PG-13', 'Charles Price may have grown up with his father in the family shoe business in Northampton, central England, but he never thought that he would take his father''s place. Charles has a chance encounter with the flamboyant drag queen cabaret singer Lola and everything changes.', 'Charles Price may have grown up with his father in the family shoe business in Northampton, central England, but he never thought that he would take his father''s place. Charles has a chance encounter with the flamboyant drag queen cabaret singer Lola and everything changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EzwkItfERGB05BOKNJTJFo93Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16367'),
  ('909477260825307113', 'Kinky Boots: The Musical', 2019, 'Music, Comedy', 'Jerry Mitchell, Clayton Jacobsen, Brett Sullivan', 'Geoff Deane, Tim Firth, Harvey Fierstein', 'Killian Donnelly, Matt Henry, Natalie McQueen, Sean Needham, Cordelia Farnworth, Antony Reed, Anna Stolli, Jonathan Carlton', null, 'Charlie is a factory owner struggling to save his family business, and Lola is a fabulous entertainer with a wildly exciting idea. With a little compassion and a lot of understanding, this unexpected pair learn to embrace their differences and create a line of sturdy stilettos unlike any the world has ever seen!', 'Charlie is a factory owner struggling to save his family business, and Lola is a fabulous entertainer with a wildly exciting idea. With a little compassion and a lot of understanding, this unexpected pair learn to embrace their differences and create a line of sturdy stilettos unlike any the world has ever seen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20QfQHWGw0ZSfYaSinnsJoiVZCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607181'),
  ('449247415837229350', 'Kinmoza the Movie: Thank You!!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Munenori Nawa, Hijiri Yamamoto', 'Yuniko Ayana', 'Asuka Nishi, Manami Tanaka, Risa Taneda, Yumi Uchiyama, Nao Toyama', null, 'Time flies when you''re having fun, and it seems like only yesterday that Shinobu Omiya was nervously waiting for her friend Alice Cartelet to arrive from England to study at Shinobu''s school in Japan. Now, in their third and final year, Alice, Shinobu, Aya, and Yoko have truly become the best of friends and even Karen, Honoka, and Kana are part of the gang as well. But since it''s their last year, that means their time will be split between preparing for the big senior trip to Nara and Kyoto, and trying to make plans for whatever is to come next in their lives… and in Shinobu''s case, that may mean something so amazing that she''d never even dared to dream it! Hop on the tour bus for one last wonderful adventure!', 'Time flies when you''re having fun, and it seems like only yesterday that Shinobu Omiya was nervously waiting for her friend Alice Cartelet to arrive from England to study at Shinobu''s school in Japan. Now, in their third and final year, Alice, Shinobu, Aya, and Yoko have truly become the best of friends and even Karen, Honoka, and Kana are part of the gang as well. But since it''s their last year, that means their time will be split between preparing for the big senior trip to Nara and Kyoto, and trying to make plans for whatever is to come next in their lives… and in Shinobu''s case, that may mean something so amazing that she''d never even dared to dream it! Hop on the tour bus for one last wonderful adventure!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiweVIDpxOB69q8xJYgL7w1SP91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693853'),
  ('473101823006871725', 'Kinmoza! Pretty Days', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Kazuyuki Ueda, Takuya Tani, Miyabi Ozeki', 'Tatsuya Takahashi', 'Manami Tanaka, Yumi Uchiyama, Risa Taneda, Nao Toyama, Asuka Nishi, Mari Nakatsu, Satomi Sato, Saori Onishi', null, 'One of the best parts about being in a group of friends is that you usually have a couple of guardian angels watching over you. So, when Shinobu has to both write a script as well as make costumes for a play for the school festival, it doesn''t take long for her classmates to realize that someone might have bitten off more than she can chew. Or write and sew, in this case. Fortunately for Shinobu''s theatrical future, Alice, Yoko, and Aya are glad to pitch in, and that allows for a chance to reflect on their experiences in the days before Alice arrived. Will everything be finished in time, or will the audience be in stitches because of the ones coming apart onstage? There''s no way to be sure until the last curtain call!', 'One of the best parts about being in a group of friends is that you usually have a couple of guardian angels watching over you. So, when Shinobu has to both write a script as well as make costumes for a play for the school festival, it doesn''t take long for her classmates to realize that someone might have bitten off more than she can chew. Or write and sew, in this case. Fortunately for Shinobu''s theatrical future, Alice, Yoko, and Aya are glad to pitch in, and that allows for a chance to reflect on their experiences in the days before Alice arrived. Will everything be finished in time, or will the audience be in stitches because of the ones coming apart onstage? There''s no way to be sure until the last curtain call!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EXPuFc5qPywvfFWrTuKJSHLFpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445475'),
  ('313442869597702053', 'Kino Eye', 1924, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Mikhail Kaufman', 'Dziga Vertov', null, null, 'This documentary promoting the joys of life in a Soviet village centers on the activities of the Young Pioneers. These children are constantly busy, pasting propaganda posters on walls, distributing hand bills, exhorting all to "buy from the cooperative" as opposed to the Public Sector, promoting temperance, and helping poor widows. Experimental portions of the film, projected in reverse, feature the un-slaughtering of a bull and the un-baking of bread.', 'This documentary promoting the joys of life in a Soviet village centers on the activities of the Young Pioneers. These children are constantly busy, pasting propaganda posters on walls, distributing hand bills, exhorting all to "buy from the cooperative" as opposed to the Public Sector, promoting temperance, and helping poor widows. Experimental portions of the film, projected in reverse, feature the un-slaughtering of a bull and the un-baking of bread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgjeOPQJlAYS817QBt00YJBJgm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144611'),
  ('527047311843745928', 'Kino-Pravda No. 1', 1922, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov', null, null, null, 'Dziga Vertov-directed Soviet newsreel covering: Starving children / Requisitioning of valuables possessed by the Russian Orthodox Church / Fundraising flights in support of the hungry / Trial of the Socialist Revolutionaries.', 'Dziga Vertov-directed Soviet newsreel covering: Starving children / Requisitioning of valuables possessed by the Russian Orthodox Church / Fundraising flights in support of the hungry / Trial of the Socialist Revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MkAQwjduyTeHhesJklaOTFEdQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92676'),
  ('714203959241742493', 'Kino-Pravda No. 13: Yesterday, Today, Tomorrow. A Film Poem Dedicated to the October Revolution', 1922, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov', 'Alexander Rodchenko', null, null, 'Dziga Vertov-directed Soviet newsreel. The first themed issue of Kino-Pravda, devoted to the fifth anniversary of the October Revolution in 1922.', 'Dziga Vertov-directed Soviet newsreel. The first themed issue of Kino-Pravda, devoted to the fifth anniversary of the October Revolution in 1922.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLh6dABJHHETFMIR5uocFvwZVKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390392'),
  ('1073293746272449339', 'Kino-Pravda No. 15', 1923, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Boris Frantsisson', null, null, null, 'Dziga Vertov-directed Soviet newsreel covering: Against war / Against Gods / Education / Agitation / Sports and gymnastics / Danger of war.', 'Dziga Vertov-directed Soviet newsreel covering: Against war / Against Gods / Education / Agitation / Sports and gymnastics / Danger of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDIB50mnMR4FatkwmcMCAaLaRbX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335708'),
