  ('286036018955531341', 'Kinsenas, Katapusan', 2022, 'Thriller', 'G.B. Sampedro', null, 'Ayanna Misola, Joko Diaz, Jamilla Obispo, Angela Morena, Janelle Tee, Carlene Aguilar, Kier Legaspi, Jao Mapa', null, 'A man falls for his daughter''s classmate and they get entangled in a steamy affair. When their sexual desire becomes obsession, things turn crazy.', 'A man falls for his daughter''s classmate and they get entangled in a steamy affair. When their sexual desire becomes obsession, things turn crazy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUGrP7WkSCjCVp9pB5Biubw2CKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934384'),
  ('793814427270686355', 'Kinsey', 2004, 'Drama', 'Frederick Elmes, Bill Condon', 'Bill Condon', 'Liam Neeson, Laura Linney, Chris O''Donnell, Peter Sarsgaard, Timothy Hutton, John Lithgow, Tim Curry, Oliver Platt', 'R', 'Kinsey is a portrait of researcher Alfred Kinsey, driven to uncover the most private secrets of a nation. What begins for Kinsey as a scientific endeavor soon takes on an intensely personal relevance, ultimately becoming an unexpected journey into the mystery of human behavior.', 'Kinsey is a portrait of researcher Alfred Kinsey, driven to uncover the most private secrets of a nation. What begins for Kinsey as a scientific endeavor soon takes on an intensely personal relevance, ultimately becoming an unexpected journey into the mystery of human behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cODCjWNRcZkwe4ONQs1GzRqYtRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11184'),
  ('295248775416742338', 'Kipling''s Women', 1961, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Fred Hudson, Larry Smith, Larry Smith', 'Fred Hudson, Larry Smith', 'Felix de Cola, Margie Sutton, Margie Fisco, Malia Olandag, Virginia Rogers, Robin Bliss, Lisa Gordon', null, 'The nudie film is inspired by a Kipling poem and follows retired soldier Tommy Atkins, who recounts his experiences with women around the world while enjoying a pipe and Scotch in a pine lodge.', 'The nudie film is inspired by a Kipling poem and follows retired soldier Tommy Atkins, who recounts his experiences with women around the world while enjoying a pipe and Scotch in a pine lodge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7wE1pUooTxxEOXgmKXKSIpEuxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452691'),
  ('1008588204345663294', 'Kippur', 2000, 'Drama, War', 'Amos Gitai, Renato Berta, Shai Gani', 'Marie-Jose Sanselme, Amos Gitai', 'Liron Levo, Tomer Russo, Uri Klauzner, Yoram Hattab, Guy Amir, Juliano Mer-Khamis, Ran Kauchinsky, Kobi Livne', null, 'The film takes place in 1973 during the Yom Kippur War in which Egypt and Syria launched attacks in Sinai and the Golan Heights. The story is told from the perspective of Israeli soldiers. We are led by Weinraub and his friend Ruso on a day that begins with quiet city streets, but ends with death, destruction and devastation of both body and mind. Various scenes are awash in the surreal, as Weinraub''s head hangs out over a rescue helicopter''s open door, watching with tranquil desperation as the earth passes beneath, the overpowering whir of the blades creating a hypnotic state. It is not a traditional blood, guts and glory film. There are no men in battle, only the rescue crew trying to pick up the broken pieces.', 'The film takes place in 1973 during the Yom Kippur War in which Egypt and Syria launched attacks in Sinai and the Golan Heights. The story is told from the perspective of Israeli soldiers. We are led by Weinraub and his friend Ruso on a day that begins with quiet city streets, but ends with death, destruction and devastation of both body and mind. Various scenes are awash in the surreal, as Weinraub''s head hangs out over a rescue helicopter''s open door, watching with tranquil desperation as the earth passes beneath, the overpowering whir of the blades creating a hypnotic state. It is not a traditional blood, guts and glory film. There are no men in battle, only the rescue crew trying to pick up the broken pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7oZ01TVX0srYXemw35UM04QWGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49709'),
  ('436592012090975981', 'Kira & El Gen', 2022, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Ahmed El Morsy, Marwan Hamed, Lauren Geoffroy', 'Ahmed Mourad', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Ahmed Ezz, Hend Sabry, Ahmed Malek, Sayed Ragab, Sam Hazeldine, Razane Jammal, Huda ElMufti', null, 'The movie focuses on the fury state that was among the people in synchronization with the main event in Egypt: The 1919 Egyptian Revolution which unites the fates of Kira and El Gen to participate in the struggle against the British occupation.', 'The movie focuses on the fury state that was among the people in synchronization with the main event in Egypt: The 1919 Egyptian Revolution which unites the fates of Kira and El Gen to participate in the struggle against the British occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jmKAwiaVRsQCeNAycUryUUfrjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632702'),
  ('176257114109570870', 'Kiracı', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Orhan Aksoy, Demirhan Ersunar', 'Orhan Aksoy, Sulhi Dölek', 'Kemal Sunal, Özlem Onursal, Füsun Demirel, Nevzat Okçugil, Uluer Süer, Nurettin Şen, Renan Fosforoğlu, Tayfun Çorağan', null, 'Kerim lives with his family in a rent house for years. One day his landlord tells him to look for another house or raise the rent money.He finds a house by the help of Sühandan whom he works together and in love.', 'Kerim lives with his family in a rent house for years. One day his landlord tells him to look for another house or raise the rent money.He finds a house by the help of Sühandan whom he works together and in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ2JqfrskCV5NJjgtZQsEq8Oadi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191152'),
  ('537688948653184859', 'Kirara', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy, Animation', 'Kazuhiro Konishi, Fusanobu Fujiyama, Kiyoshi Murayama', 'Ritsuko Hayasaka', 'Kotono Mitsuishi, Chiaki Ōsawa, Machiko Toyoshima, Kentaro Ito, Yumiko Kobayashi, Rokuro Naya, Ryotaro Okiayu, Ai Orikasa', null, 'While heading towards her own wedding, Kirara Imai dies in a car accident. Deeply frustrated for being unable to accomplish her dreams beside Konpei Asai, she asks for the opportunity of being with him once again. Kirara is able to return, but she goes back eight years in time as a ghost. There she is able to meet Konpei and herself when they still weren''t a couple.', 'While heading towards her own wedding, Kirara Imai dies in a car accident. Deeply frustrated for being unable to accomplish her dreams beside Konpei Asai, she asks for the opportunity of being with him once again. Kirara is able to return, but she goes back eight years in time as a ghost. There she is able to meet Konpei and herself when they still weren''t a couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cBEuN1pFshcRBshDRz3YeQPE5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171106'),
  ('1110129627984441781', 'Kireedam', 1989, 'Drama, Action', 'Sibi Malayil, S. Kumar', 'A K Lohithadas', 'Mohanlal, Thilakan, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, Mohan Raj, Sreenath, Sankaradi, Jagathy Sreekumar, Parvathi', null, 'Sethu aspires to become a police officer to fulfil his father''s dream. However, his life turns upside down when he intervenes in a scuffle with a criminal to save his father''s life.', 'Sethu aspires to become a police officer to fulfil his father''s dream. However, his life turns upside down when he intervenes in a scuffle with a criminal to save his father''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mKxljfSzQ9UXpgEPLvGTwXvZUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191017'),
  ('172802150848363961', 'Kiri-Kis', 1907, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, 'A family troupe of acrobats, made up to appear Japanese, perform various unbelievable stunts in front of the camera, achieved through a trick of the camera.', 'A family troupe of acrobats, made up to appear Japanese, perform various unbelievable stunts in front of the camera, achieved through a trick of the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndQDE4CVyRxOptliQtzqXH1bH9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144424'),
  ('333438603277107857', 'Kirikou and the Men and Women', 2012, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Bénédicte Galup, Cendrine Maubourguet, Susie Morgenstern', 'Sabine Pakora, Romann Berrux, Awa Sène Sarr, Eythan Solomon', null, 'The grandfather welcomes us into his blue grotto, there was still beautiful memories of childhood to tell Kirikou: the times when he helped the men and women of his village and elsewhere ... He tells us how Kirikou, thanks to his bravery and intelligence, came to the aid of the strong woman. He tells us by what trick the little hero found the grumpy old man, who had been lost in the bush, and how a cherry threatened by the witch was finally able to pass on his knowledge to the villagers. We also discover the secret of a mysterious blue monster, and finally through a flute linked to the family of our small and valiant heroes, the magical power of music.', 'The grandfather welcomes us into his blue grotto, there was still beautiful memories of childhood to tell Kirikou: the times when he helped the men and women of his village and elsewhere ... He tells us how Kirikou, thanks to his bravery and intelligence, came to the aid of the strong woman. He tells us by what trick the little hero found the grumpy old man, who had been lost in the bush, and how a cherry threatened by the witch was finally able to pass on his knowledge to the villagers. We also discover the secret of a mysterious blue monster, and finally through a flute linked to the family of our small and valiant heroes, the magical power of music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DRmKwTYTf8NaDKT6ky5UZ6Yfuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139649'),
  ('1147481790114251640', 'Kirikou and the Sorceress', 1998, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Doudou Gueye Thiaw, Maimouna N''Diaye, Awa Sène Sarr, Robert Liensol, William Nadylam, Sebastien Hebrant, Thilombo Lubambu, Rémi Bichet', 'PG', 'Drawn from elements of West African folk tales, it depicts how a newborn boy, Kirikou, saves his village from the evil witch Karaba.', 'Drawn from elements of West African folk tales, it depicts how a newborn boy, Kirikou, saves his village from the evil witch Karaba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RNrozaagFmpm6m0CP7q4XDcIXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21348'),
  ('393062475168061299', 'Kirikou and the Wild Beasts', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Michel Ocelot, Bénédicte Galup', 'Philippe Andrieu, Bénédicte Galup, Marie Locatelli', 'Pierre-Ndoffé Sarr, Awa Sène Sarr, Robert Liensol, Marie-Philomène Nga, Emile Abossolo M''bo, Pascal N''Zonzi, Marthe N''Domé, Emilie Gaydu', null, 'Kirikou''s Grandfather says that the story of Kirikou and The Witch was too short, so he proceeds to explain more about Kirikou''s accomplishments. We find out how little boy became a gardener, a detective, a maker of pottery, a merchant, a traveler and a doctor.', 'Kirikou''s Grandfather says that the story of Kirikou and The Witch was too short, so he proceeds to explain more about Kirikou''s accomplishments. We find out how little boy became a gardener, a detective, a maker of pottery, a merchant, a traveler and a doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPWBxCxwMbwdvwcXagHNOPWrCig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13679'),
  ('814415664865658740', 'Kirpi', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Erdal Murat Aktaş', 'Atay Sözer', 'Mazhar Alanson, Güven Kıraç, Irem Altug, Birsen Dürülü, İsmail İncekara, Zuhal Topal, Caner Özyurtlu, Murat Serezli', null, 'Kirpi, the vengeful practical joker finally finds a match for his habit: Tahir Yaman. Prank and revenge loop of the duo will drag them to very complicated situations.', 'Kirpi, the vengeful practical joker finally finds a match for his habit: Tahir Yaman. Prank and revenge loop of the duo will drag them to very complicated situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAZtiO7EQm8bkhR4nqHaVS0jxQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21190'),
  ('997883432593567450', 'Kirtaner Por Kirtan', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Abhimanyu Mukherjee', 'Abhimanyu Mukherjee, Saurav Palodhi', 'Paran Banerjee, Arunima Ghosh, Gourab Chatterjee, Laboni Sarkar, Ishan Mukherjee', null, 'Sequal of Kirtan, the film "kirtan" ended where the father in law abinash and the daughter in law monimala along with her husband arup decide to move to a flat after selling off their ancestral old house.', 'Sequal of Kirtan, the film "kirtan" ended where the father in law abinash and the daughter in law monimala along with her husband arup decide to move to a flat after selling off their ancestral old house.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6M1QaaoTdlfQcPQFXWcOWOmUK5V.jpg', 'plex:movie:kirtaner-por-kirtan-2026'),
  ('275637546268909682', 'Kis Kisko Pyaar Karoon', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Dilshad V.A.', 'Sonu Sinha, Anukalp Goswami', 'Kapil Sharma, Varun Sharma, Elli Avram, Manjari Fadnnis, Simran Kaur Mundi, Sai Lokur, Arbaaz Khan, Supriya Pathak', null, 'A comedy or errors, wherein a married man attempts to juggle his three wives along with his current girlfriend.', 'A comedy or errors, wherein a married man attempts to juggle his three wives along with his current girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3fZkrzWlgX3QDmQelygxKpyB2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358985'),
