  ('1102153263285305024', 'Kisaragi', 2007, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Yuichi Satoh, Akihiro Kawamura, Toshiyuki Honma', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Shun Oguri, Yusuke Santamaria, Keisuke Koide, Muga Tsukaji, Teruyuki Kagawa, Kanako Sakai, Joe Shishido', null, 'The fanclub of a deceased Japanese idol gather together for the one year anniversary of her death. By combining forces they try to unearth the true circumstances surrounding her supposed suicide.', 'The fanclub of a deceased Japanese idol gather together for the one year anniversary of her death. By combining forces they try to unearth the true circumstances surrounding her supposed suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1K5Sz9GBbAyytWPC6xXWX426Pue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27698'),
  ('388777694248540221', 'Kisaragi Station', 2022, 'Horror', 'Jirô Nagae, Shin Hayasaka, 廣瀬萌恵里', 'Takeshi Miyamoto', 'Yuri Tsunematsu, Eriko Sato, Miyu Honda, Riko, Raiga Terasaka, Rui Kihara, Tateto Serizawa, Taki Nanami', null, 'Haruna Tsunematsu is studying folklore at university and she decides the subject of her graduation thesis will be the "Kisaragi Station" urban legend which has been a hot topic on the Internet since 2004.', 'Haruna Tsunematsu is studying folklore at university and she decides the subject of her graduation thesis will be the "Kisaragi Station" urban legend which has been a hot topic on the Internet since 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isEU5kAAtOrKaigjqc8q7ZA3zLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959439'),
  ('1102046677523318283', 'Kishen Kanhaiya', 1990, 'Drama, Family', 'Pushpal Dutta, Rakesh Roshan', 'Mohan Kaul, Ravi Kapoor', 'Anil Kapoor, Amrish Puri, Madhuri Dixit, Kader Khan, Vikas Anand, Bindu Desai, Dinesh Hingoo, Saeed Jaffrey', null, 'Separated at birth, Kishen and Kanhaiya grow up in different worlds, one in opulent luxury, the other in poverty. Fate reunites them as they fight together to end injustice.', 'Separated at birth, Kishen and Kanhaiya grow up in different worlds, one in opulent luxury, the other in poverty. Fate reunites them as they fight together to end injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcQyjd0jWT2VOImJRJIssajfOUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125297'),
  ('1024639293816262191', 'Kishkindha Kaandam', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Adventure', 'Bahul Ramesh, Dinjith Ayyathan', 'Bahul Ramesh', 'Asif Ali, Aparna Balamurali, Vijayaraghavan, Vyshnavi Raj, Ashokan, Jagadish, Nizhalgal Ravi, Major Ravi', null, 'Strange events unfold in a monkey-inhabited village, driving a newlywed couple and forest officials to embark on a mission to uncover the root of the unusual disturbances.', 'Strange events unfold in a monkey-inhabited village, driving a newlywed couple and forest officials to embark on a mission to uncover the root of the unusual disturbances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rniBYHDRs6e8qMkPr4D4ZE5uMhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025125'),
  ('821691203491753834', 'Kisi Ka Bhai... Kisi Ki Jaan', 2023, 'Romance, Action', 'Farhad Samji, V. Manikandan', 'Farhad Samji, Tasha Bhambra, Sparsh Khetarpal', 'Salman Khan, Pooja Hegde, Venkatesh, Jagapati Babu, Jassie Gill, Siddharth Nigam, Raghav Juyal, Shehnaaz Gill', null, 'Bhaijaan, a self-defense trainer lives happily as a bachelor with his three brothers Moh, Ishq and Luv and uses violence to settle disputes. When his brothers, who’ve already found partners, come together to fix a match for him, Bhagya Lakshmi, Bhaijaan decides to mend his ways for his lover''s sake. All hell breaks loose when he learns about Bhagya''s family facing threats from their haunting past.', 'Bhaijaan, a self-defense trainer lives happily as a bachelor with his three brothers Moh, Ishq and Luv and uses violence to settle disputes. When his brothers, who’ve already found partners, come together to fix a match for him, Bhagya Lakshmi, Bhaijaan decides to mend his ways for his lover''s sake. All hell breaks loose when he learns about Bhagya''s family facing threats from their haunting past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ2JqgfWniQLnXPM5WkM7f1rqaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966719'),
  ('10539408258991861', 'Kismat', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Guddu Dhanoa', 'Robin Bhatt, Sutanu Gupta', 'Bobby Deol, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Kabir Bedi, Sanjay Narvekar, Mohan Joshi, Shahbaz Khan, Smita Jaykar, Mushtaq Khan', null, 'Tony works as a hit-man for gangster, Vikas Patil, who owes his allegiance to wealthy Raj Mallya. Raj Mallya is involved in marketing spurious and out-dated drugs, and as a result is the subject of an investigation by the Food & Drugs Administration''s inspector Dr. Hargobind Gosai. Raj asks Vikas to take care of Hargobind through Tony, which Tony does, and in this manner, Raj is absolved of all wrong-doing. Then Tony meets with attractive starlet named Sapna, and falls head over heels in love with her. When Sapna tells him that she is engaged to be married to Dr. Ajay Saxena, he is heart-broken. Then a scandal breaks out, and Hargobind is implicated in the deaths of three children that were killed by Raj''s spurious drugs. All the evidence points against Hargobind, and not a single lawyer is willing to take his case; his wife kills herself, and the marriage of his daughter has been canceled.', 'Tony works as a hit-man for gangster, Vikas Patil, who owes his allegiance to wealthy Raj Mallya. Raj Mallya is involved in marketing spurious and out-dated drugs, and as a result is the subject of an investigation by the Food & Drugs Administration''s inspector Dr. Hargobind Gosai. Raj asks Vikas to take care of Hargobind through Tony, which Tony does, and in this manner, Raj is absolved of all wrong-doing. Then Tony meets with attractive starlet named Sapna, and falls head over heels in love with her. When Sapna tells him that she is engaged to be married to Dr. Ajay Saxena, he is heart-broken. Then a scandal breaks out, and Hargobind is implicated in the deaths of three children that were killed by Raj''s spurious drugs. All the evidence points against Hargobind, and not a single lawyer is willing to take his case; his wife kills herself, and the marriage of his daughter has been canceled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFV0U1TlXRipGNZBTk3OPhMXw6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115153'),
  ('292781181434603217', 'Kismat Konnection', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Aziz Mirza, Binod Pradhan', 'Sai Kabir, Vibha Singh', 'Shahid Kapoor, Vidya Balan, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Om Puri, Vishal Malhotra, Boman Irani, Amit Varma, Himani Shivpuri', null, 'Raj Malhotra is a luckless architect who seeks success but in vain. He bumps into a social activist named Priya. Raj finds out that Priya is a lucky charm for him but unfortunately she is protecting the community center for which he aims to win the contract of demolishing for a brand new shopping mall.', 'Raj Malhotra is a luckless architect who seeks success but in vain. He bumps into a social activist named Priya. Raj finds out that Priya is a lucky charm for him but unfortunately she is protecting the community center for which he aims to win the contract of demolishing for a brand new shopping mall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maIqwcXgvcTLbJm2B8fjQ7BI3RY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15467'),
  ('1904076399340606', 'Kismet', 1944, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Douglas Shearer, William Dieterle, Charles Rosher', 'John Meehan', 'Ronald Colman, Marlene Dietrich, James Craig, Edward Arnold, Hugh Herbert, Joy Page, Florence Bates, Harry Davenport', null, 'Hafiz, a rascally beggar on the periphery of the court of Baghdad, schemes to marry his daughter to royalty and to win the heart of the queen of the castle himself.', 'Hafiz, a rascally beggar on the periphery of the court of Baghdad, schemes to marry his daughter to royalty and to win the heart of the queen of the castle himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuoKJ341mqiRB5hMXEJc49GWpn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43501'),
  ('177525066897174127', 'Kismet', 1955, 'Music, Romance, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Vincente Minnelli, Joseph Ruttenberg, William Shanks', 'Luther Davis, Charles Lederer', 'Howard Keel, Ann Blyth, Dolores Gray, Vic Damone, Monty Woolley, Sebastian Cabot, Jay C. Flippen, Mike Mazurki', null, 'A silver-tongued poet and self-proclaimed "King of the Beggars" searches old Baghdad for a rich bachelor to marry his dreamy daughter, Marsinah. Along the way, he poses as the renowned sorcerer Hajj and gets in and out of scrapes with an elderly thief, a dim-witted wazir, and his wife. Meanwhile, his daughter develops feelings for a handsome caliph.', 'A silver-tongued poet and self-proclaimed "King of the Beggars" searches old Baghdad for a rich bachelor to marry his dreamy daughter, Marsinah. Along the way, he poses as the renowned sorcerer Hajj and gets in and out of scrapes with an elderly thief, a dim-witted wazir, and his wife. Meanwhile, his daughter develops feelings for a handsome caliph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqFy36jp7aDXA6EIzGpz61r7tDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4822'),
  ('1108740942468980979', 'Kisna', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Subhash Ghai', 'Sachin Bhowmick, Farrukh Dhondy', 'Vivek Oberoi, Isha Sharvani, Antonia Bernath, Amrish Puri, Polly Adams, Michael Maloney, Caroline Langrishe, Om Puri', null, 'The film is set in the India of the tumultuous 1930''s when nationalists fighting for the country''s independence rose up as one, urging the British to quit. At this time, a young Indian, Kisna befriends and then shields a British girl Katherine, from an enraged mob of nationalists including Kisna''s own uncle and brother. Katherine is the young daughter of a ruthless British collector. Kisna takes it upon himself to escort Katherine to the safety of the British High Commission in New Delhi, who will arrange for her to board a ship home. A tender attraction develops between Kisna and Katherine during the journey, a love story that is torn between ''Karma'' (the noble deed) and ''Dharma'' (the duty). Laxmi, the Indian girl Kisna is engaged to, forms the third point in an emotional triangle involving the Indo-British romantic pair', 'The film is set in the India of the tumultuous 1930''s when nationalists fighting for the country''s independence rose up as one, urging the British to quit. At this time, a young Indian, Kisna befriends and then shields a British girl Katherine, from an enraged mob of nationalists including Kisna''s own uncle and brother. Katherine is the young daughter of a ruthless British collector. Kisna takes it upon himself to escort Katherine to the safety of the British High Commission in New Delhi, who will arrange for her to board a ship home. A tender attraction develops between Kisna and Katherine during the journey, a love story that is torn between ''Karma'' (the noble deed) and ''Dharma'' (the duty). Laxmi, the Indian girl Kisna is engaged to, forms the third point in an emotional triangle involving the Indo-British romantic pair', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4homgKuE49RXW5d3aUW1C5bRtJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78701'),
  ('382767911586922568', 'Kiss', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Andy Warhol', null, 'Rufus Collins, Johnny Dodd, Fred Herko, Jane Holzer, Robert Indiana, Mark Lancaster, Naomi Levine, Gerard Malanga', null, 'An hour-long paean to the art of the kiss featuring fourteen couples, from passionate participants to lethargic lovers, engaging in the intimate act.', 'An hour-long paean to the art of the kiss featuring fourteen couples, from passionate participants to lethargic lovers, engaging in the intimate act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PCxc68q6vP9uyEHkGUNUAnSHk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153410'),
  ('566338567790067192', 'Kiss & Tell', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michel Blanc, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Michel Blanc', 'Karin Viard, Carole Bouquet, Charlotte Rampling, Jean-Paul Rouve, William Lebghil, Michel Blanc, Jacques Dutronc, Guillaume Labbé', null, 'Sequel to 2002''s "Summer Things" (Embrassez qui vous voudrez). This French comedy follows various people in two families. Bertrand and his wife, Elizabeth, are a wealthy couple who plan to vacation near the same coastal town as their friends, Jerome and Veronique, who are secretly struggling with financial problems. Meanwhile, Bertrand and his daughter, Emilie, have each been hiding a secret, and these deceptions are bound to have repercussions.', 'Sequel to 2002''s "Summer Things" (Embrassez qui vous voudrez). This French comedy follows various people in two families. Bertrand and his wife, Elizabeth, are a wealthy couple who plan to vacation near the same coastal town as their friends, Jerome and Veronique, who are secretly struggling with financial problems. Meanwhile, Bertrand and his daughter, Emilie, have each been hiding a secret, and these deceptions are bound to have repercussions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odgUTXXjm5toRY5qisbYfT10j01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489415'),
  ('868154215669078879', 'Kiss and Cry', 2017, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Chloé Mahieu, Lila Pinell', 'Lila Pinell, Chloé Mahieu', 'Sarah Bramms, Dinara Drukarova, Xavier Dias, Carla-Marie Santerre, Aurélie Faula, Amanda Pierre, Noémie Carroué', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Sarah has returned to Colmar, where she has taken up high-performance figure skating and competition. The rivalry between the girls and the trainer''s harsh words put her body to the test on the ice, while her adolescent desires distract her from her athletic ambitions.', 'Fifteen-year-old Sarah has returned to Colmar, where she has taken up high-performance figure skating and competition. The rivalry between the girls and the trainer''s harsh words put her body to the test on the ice, while her adolescent desires distract her from her athletic ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sspemmgxSwyJyUumHxlYq3GWKzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455202'),
  ('1010433942111018146', 'Kiss and Make-Up', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Harlan Thompson, Leon Shamroy', 'George Marion Jr., Harlan Thompson', 'Cary Grant, Genevieve Tobin, Helen Mack, Edward Everett Horton, Lucien Littlefield, Mona Maris, Helen Cohan, Katherine Williams', null, 'Dr. Maurice Lamar is a noted plastic surgeon who makes his rich clients beautiful, and also makes them. He makes Eve Caron, the wife of Marcel Caron, so satisfied with his skilled hands that she leaves Marcel and marries Maurice. They go on a Mediterranean honeymoon, where he soon finds the effects of his own beauty regulations are more than he can handle. He bids adieu to his new bride, and wings it back to Paris with the intention of giving up his practice and becoming a scientific researcher... after winning back the love of his simple, unadorned secretary, Anne.', 'Dr. Maurice Lamar is a noted plastic surgeon who makes his rich clients beautiful, and also makes them. He makes Eve Caron, the wife of Marcel Caron, so satisfied with his skilled hands that she leaves Marcel and marries Maurice. They go on a Mediterranean honeymoon, where he soon finds the effects of his own beauty regulations are more than he can handle. He bids adieu to his new bride, and wings it back to Paris with the intention of giving up his practice and becoming a scientific researcher... after winning back the love of his simple, unadorned secretary, Anne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/376PGPnQmbeorfNuZSVyrFJbMQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57866'),
  ('578605579521889874', 'Kiss Daddy Goodnight', 1987, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Peter Ily Huemer, Bobby Bukowski, James D. Cooper', 'Michael Gabrieli, Peter Ily Huemer', 'Uma Thurman, Paul Dillon, Paul Richards, Steve Buscemi, Annabelle Gurwitch, David Brisbin, Constance Burg, Lee Coleman', null, 'At night, baby-face Laura dresses up as a vamp and lets random guys at bars pick her up, just to drug and rob them later. But then someone starts stalking her, and a person close to her is killed.', 'At night, baby-face Laura dresses up as a vamp and lets random guys at bars pick her up, just to drug and rob them later. But then someone starts stalking her, and a person close to her is killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sO7ww1DA4CFg5hbTKWhy8ymebP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37143'),
  ('1067851677946766022', 'Kiss Him, Not Me', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Norihisa Hiranuma, Masaya Suzuki, Takaho Ichikawa', 'Nami Kikkawa, Shohei Fukuda, Kei Watanabe', 'Hokuto Yoshino, Fuju Kamio, Nonoka Yamaguchi, Miu Tomita, Asahi Ito, So Okuno, Miku Uehara, Naho Toda', 'NR', 'Kae is a fat high school girl who is a ''fujoshi'', which is girls who enjoy reading homosexual romance novels. She is dismayed when her favourite character is killed off. She is unwell and refuses to eat. She loses weight. As a side-effect she is thin and suddenly popular at school. Boys begin to pursue her. She has a choice of suitors and can pick a boy of her liking. They are all pretty.', 'Kae is a fat high school girl who is a ''fujoshi'', which is girls who enjoy reading homosexual romance novels. She is dismayed when her favourite character is killed off. She is unwell and refuses to eat. She loses weight. As a side-effect she is thin and suddenly popular at school. Boys begin to pursue her. She has a choice of suitors and can pick a boy of her liking. They are all pretty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCocxd4GeHNcaHa2BsCedkdSGHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724273'),
  ('1018001561771533013', 'Kiss Kis Ko', 2004, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Sharad Sharan', 'Pankaj Kapur', 'Chaitanya Bhosle, Sherrin Verghese, Bhumika Puri, Aparna Kumesh, Raj Zutshi, Alyy Khan', null, 'In the background of a lot interest being shown in music groups, a group of young Indian men, calling themselves "Band of Boys", decide to perform publicly, to share their talents India-wide, as well as to make a career for themselves. They run into problems - it seems the public is only interested seeing a group of sexy young girls perform. This group must now compromise to include a young, sexy girl to be included in their band.', 'In the background of a lot interest being shown in music groups, a group of young Indian men, calling themselves "Band of Boys", decide to perform publicly, to share their talents India-wide, as well as to make a career for themselves. They run into problems - it seems the public is only interested seeing a group of sexy young girls perform. This group must now compromise to include a young, sexy girl to be included in their band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yAOTOh2NO4PVDpybXGnpqMycgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404475'),
