  ('1101860803450036655', 'Kiss Kiss Bang Bang', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Shane Black, Michael Barrett, Ty Arnold', 'Shane Black', 'Robert Downey Jr., Val Kilmer, Michelle Monaghan, Corbin Bernsen, Dash Mihok, Larry Miller, Rockmond Dunbar, Shannyn Sossamon', 'R', 'A petty thief posing as an actor is brought to Los Angeles for an unlikely audition and finds himself in the middle of a murder investigation along with his high school dream girl and a detective who''s been training him for his upcoming role...', 'A petty thief posing as an actor is brought to Los Angeles for an unlikely audition and finds himself in the middle of a murder investigation along with his high school dream girl and a detective who''s been training him for his upcoming role...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWfjIkpENFX6Uw82pET7EQ6jnrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5236'),
  ('695907136243344402', 'Kiss Kiss, Kill Kill', 1966, 'Crime', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Francesco Izzarelli', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Giovanni Simonelli, Theo Maria Werner', 'Tony Kendall, Brad Harris, Maria Perschy, Christa Linder, Nikola Popović, Giuseppe Mattei, Jacques Bézard, Danielle Godet', null, 'Tony and Brad investigate the murders of politicians and scientists. They soon face off against a team of super hit women with their usual flair.', 'Tony and Brad investigate the murders of politicians and scientists. They soon face off against a team of super hit women with their usual flair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHHxcwEdLWgxiZBVqfAVFHJXJaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4527'),
  ('253714319644990754', 'Kiss Me a Killer', 1991, 'Thriller', 'Marcus DeLeon, Wade W. Danielson, Susan Kaufer', 'Marcus DeLeon, Christopher Wooden', 'Julie Carmen, Robert Beltran, Guy Boyd, Ramón Franco, Charles Boswell, Sam Vlahos, Brad Blaisdell, A.C. Santos', 'R', 'An ex-convict (Robert Beltran) and his lover (Julie Carmen) plot to kill her husband (Guy Boyd), owner of a nightclub in east Los Angeles.', 'An ex-convict (Robert Beltran) and his lover (Julie Carmen) plot to kill her husband (Guy Boyd), owner of a nightclub in east Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRDo6wbo0bgVwZAK1XbE4jwNfhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91369'),
  ('1100013687013898648', 'Kiss Me Again', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'William Tyler Smith, Christopher LaVasseur', 'Julian Hoxter, William Tyler Smith', 'Jeremy London, Katheryn Winnick, Siri Baruc, Elisa Donovan, Darrell Hammond, Mirelly Taylor, Fred Armisen, Spyder Jonez', 'R', 'A married couple decides to test the boundaries of their relationship with a seductive Spanish woman. When an unlikely relationship ensues, all three are forced to rethink their definition of love.', 'A married couple decides to test the boundaries of their relationship with a seductive Spanish woman. When an unlikely relationship ensues, all three are forced to rethink their definition of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9coG0XpCv61NZeVWR2cFcWkwz6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24397'),
