  ('1662707528674399', 'Kiss Me Deadly', 1955, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Aldrich, Ernest Laszlo', 'A.I. Bezzerides', 'Ralph Meeker, Albert Dekker, Paul Stewart, Juano Hernández, Wesley Addy, Marian Carr, Maxine Cooper, Cloris Leachman', null, 'One evening, Hammer gives a ride to Christina, an attractive hitchhiker on a lonely country road, who has escaped from the nearby lunatic asylum. Thugs waylay them and force his car to crash. When Hammer returns to semi-consciousness, he hears Christina being tortured until she dies. Hammer, both for vengeance and in hopes that "something big" is behind it all, decides to pursue the case.', 'One evening, Hammer gives a ride to Christina, an attractive hitchhiker on a lonely country road, who has escaped from the nearby lunatic asylum. Thugs waylay them and force his car to crash. When Hammer returns to semi-consciousness, he hears Christina being tortured until she dies. Hammer, both for vengeance and in hopes that "something big" is behind it all, decides to pursue the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7me91nrpWLHY1mZOB2v20cK0zY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18030'),
  ('798750623490551019', 'Kiss Me Goodbye', 1982, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Robert Mulligan, Donald Peterman', 'Charlie Peters, Bruno Barreto', 'Sally Field, James Caan, Jeff Bridges, Claire Trevor, Mildred Natwick, Paul Dooley, Michael Ensign, William Prince', 'PG', 'Not until three years after the death of her husband Jolly, Kay dares to move back into their former home, persuaded by her new fiancée Rupert. But soon her worst expectations come true, when not only her old memories haunt her, but also Jolly''s ghost, who doesn''t approve of her new mate. Invisible to anyone but Kay, he tries to prevent the wedding.', 'Not until three years after the death of her husband Jolly, Kay dares to move back into their former home, persuaded by her new fiancée Rupert. But soon her worst expectations come true, when not only her old memories haunt her, but also Jolly''s ghost, who doesn''t approve of her new mate. Invisible to anyone but Kay, he tries to prevent the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUhCiZb4iqG5xZgy66ewCLBd1lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81001'),
  ('202574388116780184', 'Kiss Me Kate', 1953, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'George Sidney, Charles Rosher, George Rhein', 'Dorothy Kingsley', 'Kathryn Grayson, Howard Keel, Ann Miller, Keenan Wynn, Bobby Van, Tommy Rall, James Whitmore, Kurt Kasznar', 'NR', 'A pair of divorced actors are brought together to participate in a musical version of The Taming of the Shrew. Of course, the couple seem to act a great deal like the characters they play, and they must work together when mistaken identities get them mixed up with the mafia.', 'A pair of divorced actors are brought together to participate in a musical version of The Taming of the Shrew. Of course, the couple seem to act a great deal like the characters they play, and they must work together when mistaken identities get them mixed up with the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phJTfsjxxi0a6ibYQ7SCACoTXDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34857'),
  ('663905934820638244', 'Kiss Me Killer', 1977, 'Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Gérard Brisseau', 'Jesús Franco, Gian Franco Riccioni', 'Alberto Dalbés, Olivier Mathot, Alice Arno, Antonio Mayans, Francisco Acosta, Pierre Taylou, Dan van Husen, Gilda Arancio', null, 'A deadly look into the savage world of gangsters. The aftermath of a holdup turns into a game of deceit and doublecross. A vengeful woman brings about the destruction of the entire gang of ruthless killers.', 'A deadly look into the savage world of gangsters. The aftermath of a holdup turns into a game of deceit and doublecross. A vengeful woman brings about the destruction of the entire gang of ruthless killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3H0JpLaWefqSPKP86huhH6J0AxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28412'),
  ('745549950470124373', 'Kiss me Kismet', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Stefan Holtz, Bernhard Jasper', 'Daniel Speck', 'Mandala Tayde, Florian David Fitz, Hilmi Sözer, Ercan Özçelik, Gandi Mukli, Katrin Sass, Charly Hübner, Aykut Kayacık', null, 'Götz, the owner of an record shop in Berlin, Kreuzberg, is in love with Aylin.But Aylin is espoused to an turkey doctor named Tarkan. Götz and Aylin are fallin in love and they want to get married. Their Plans first get strong restistance from the turkish parents-in-law and also from the mother of Götz named Helena. Götz converting to the Islam and tries to get a true turk to marry Aylin at the end. After serveral problems and twists they get finally married.', 'Götz, the owner of an record shop in Berlin, Kreuzberg, is in love with Aylin.But Aylin is espoused to an turkey doctor named Tarkan. Götz and Aylin are fallin in love and they want to get married. Their Plans first get strong restistance from the turkish parents-in-law and also from the mother of Götz named Helena. Götz converting to the Islam and tries to get a true turk to marry Aylin at the end. After serveral problems and twists they get finally married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAQPWUoDmbY01KqZrqg4VRbnqeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38918'),
  ('1066676400260062964', 'Kiss Me Kosher!', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Giora Bejach, Shirel Peleg', 'Shirel Peleg', 'Moran Rosenblatt, Luise Wolfram, Rivka Michaeli, Juliane Köhler, Bernhard Schütz, Irit Kaplan, Salim Daw, Eyal Shikratzi', null, 'When two generations of Israeli women fall for a German woman and a Palestinian man, chaos follows. What happens with lovers who don''t fit but do belong together?', 'When two generations of Israeli women fall for a German woman and a Palestinian man, chaos follows. What happens with lovers who don''t fit but do belong together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vDAURzl96VR9zqdThLX6QgeUJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730585'),
  ('429915640438226389', 'Kiss Me Monster', 1969, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Jorge Herrero, Franz Hofer', 'Jesús Franco, Luis Revenga', 'Janine Reynaud, Rosanna Yanni, Chris Howland, Michel Lemoine, Manuel Velasco, Manolo Otero, Ana Casares, Adrian Hoven', null, 'On an island somewhere in the Caribbean a professor is experimenting with mankind. Meanwhile, The Red Lips are moonlighting on a striptease world tour, but as soon as they hit the stage, the girls are up to their pasties in stiffs, Satanists and Sapphic sadists, all after the professor''s secret formula for human clones!', 'On an island somewhere in the Caribbean a professor is experimenting with mankind. Meanwhile, The Red Lips are moonlighting on a striptease world tour, but as soon as they hit the stage, the girls are up to their pasties in stiffs, Satanists and Sapphic sadists, all after the professor''s secret formula for human clones!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvi2mgbFgyGYU55DMUFZRCB8asx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125176'),
  ('1021967444848556436', 'Kiss Me, Guido', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Tony Vitale, Claudia Raschke', 'Tony Vitale', 'Nick Scotti, Anthony Barrile, Anthony DeSando, Craig Chester, Domenick Lombardozzi, Molly Price, Christopher Lawford, David Deblinger', null, 'When he discovers his girlfriend having sex with his brother, Frankie decides to head to Manhattan, leaving his Bronx pizza shop forever for the fame and fortune of show business. But before stardom, he needs a place to stay. Looking in the personals, he notices GWM. And thinking it "Guy with Money," he heads to the Village and the apartment of gay actor Warren, who''s in desperate need of this month''s rent.', 'When he discovers his girlfriend having sex with his brother, Frankie decides to head to Manhattan, leaving his Bronx pizza shop forever for the fame and fortune of show business. But before stardom, he needs a place to stay. Looking in the personals, he notices GWM. And thinking it "Guy with Money," he heads to the Village and the apartment of gay actor Warren, who''s in desperate need of this month''s rent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aFhsB4ez8ViUofXMaSI9k7bT1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32519'),
  ('993757793074140089', 'Kiss Me, Kill Me', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Yang Jong-hyun', 'Yang Jong-hyun', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Kang Hye-jung, Kim Hye-ok, Park Cheol-min, Kim Han, Baek Do-bin, Lee Tae-rim, Jeong Seong-mo', null, 'A quiet, professional killer, Hyun-jun, arrives at a house to kill a man in his sleep, only to discover a woman alone under the sheets. Jin-young has decided to kill herself after a traumatic break up with her lover of seven years, but she wants to go out with a bang, not with a miserable and lonely dose of commonplace sleeping pills. The most extraordinary love story begins.', 'A quiet, professional killer, Hyun-jun, arrives at a house to kill a man in his sleep, only to discover a woman alone under the sheets. Jin-young has decided to kill herself after a traumatic break up with her lover of seven years, but she wants to go out with a bang, not with a miserable and lonely dose of commonplace sleeping pills. The most extraordinary love story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/symwrxRoPR1vz2wN9F8QQmTfOPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48593'),
  ('291002182105325887', 'Kiss Me, Stupid', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Billy Wilder, Joseph LaShelle, Charles C. Coleman', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Dean Martin, Kim Novak, Ray Walston, Felicia Farr, Cliff Osmond, Barbara Pepper, Skip Ward, Doro Merande', 'PG-13', 'While traveling home from Vegas, an amorous lounge singer named Dino gets conned by a local mechanic/songwriter into staying in town for the night. The mechanic''s songwriting partner, Orville, offers Dino his home for overnight lodging and enlists a local waitress/call girl to pose as his wife in order to placate Dino''s urges.', 'While traveling home from Vegas, an amorous lounge singer named Dino gets conned by a local mechanic/songwriter into staying in town for the night. The mechanic''s songwriting partner, Orville, offers Dino his home for overnight lodging and enlists a local waitress/call girl to pose as his wife in order to placate Dino''s urges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbMILWDfzwQI8ZBIn42zGNU4xqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53021'),
  ('1038990129753008416', 'Kiss Me!', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Cyprien Vial, Pascal Auffray, Romaric Thomas', 'Cyprien Vial, Océan', 'Océan, Alice Pol, Grégory Montel, Sophie-Marie Larrouy, Rudy Milstein, Laure Calamy, Michèle Laroque, Isaach de Bankolé', null, 'Claude falls in love with Cécile. She is convinced that she is the woman of her life unlike her mother who knows the tumultuous sentimental life of her daughter.', 'Claude falls in love with Cécile. She is convinced that she is the woman of her life unlike her mother who knows the tumultuous sentimental life of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2pg2pEg0zpk4ruQse12A3Be7Si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459962'),
  ('696714200999463830', 'KISS Meets the Phantom of the Park', 1978, 'Music, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Horror', 'Robert Caramico, Gordon Hessler', 'Jan Michael Sherman, Don Buday', 'Peter Criss, Ace Frehley, Gene Simmons, Paul Stanley, Anthony Zerbe, Carmine Caridi, Deborah Ryan, John Dennis Johnston', 'PG', 'The tale of rock band KISS and their efforts to thwart a diabolical plan by mad scientist Abner Devereaux. Devereaux has found a way to clone humans into robots in his laboratory at an amusement park. It just so happens that he plans to use the KISS concert as a platform to unleash his plan on the world. KISS must use their special powers to stop him.', 'The tale of rock band KISS and their efforts to thwart a diabolical plan by mad scientist Abner Devereaux. Devereaux has found a way to clone humans into robots in his laboratory at an amusement park. It just so happens that he plans to use the KISS concert as a platform to unleash his plan on the world. KISS must use their special powers to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0u1dRl5UKXmgdfJRlAb5Lui57u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39704'),
