  ('686198296386249147', 'Kiss of Death', 1995, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Barbet Schroeder, Luciano Tovoli, Jack Baran', 'Ben Hecht, Charles Lederer', 'David Caruso, Nicolas Cage, Samuel L. Jackson, Helen Hunt, Kathryn Erbe, Stanley Tucci, Michael Rapaport, Ving Rhames', 'R', 'Jimmy Kilmartin''s an ex-con who''s trying to go straight. But he can''t say no to a quick driving job because his so-called friend''s life is threatened. The job is for Little Junior Brown, a violent and powerful villain. When things go wrong, Jimmy is left to do the time, and his whole life is turned upside-down, but if that wasn''t enough, the cops won''t leave Jimmy alone when he gets out... They want Little Junior Brown.', 'Jimmy Kilmartin''s an ex-con who''s trying to go straight. But he can''t say no to a quick driving job because his so-called friend''s life is threatened. The job is for Little Junior Brown, a violent and powerful villain. When things go wrong, Jimmy is left to do the time, and his whole life is turned upside-down, but if that wasn''t enough, the cops won''t leave Jimmy alone when he gets out... They want Little Junior Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cCxEqeIy6Q8HgVjfT7obOnF5Zi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6071'),
