  ('780619061645701332', 'Kiss of the Spider Woman', 1985, 'Drama', 'Héctor Babenco, Rodolfo Sánchez, Amilcar Monteiro Claro', 'Leonard Schrader', 'William Hurt, Raúl Juliá, Sonia Braga, José Lewgoy, Milton Gonçalves, Miriam Pires, Nuno Leal Maia, Fernando Torres', 'R', 'The story of two radically different men thrown together in a Latin American prison cell. One is Valentin, a journalist being tortured for his political beliefs. The other is Molina, a gay window-dresser who fills their lonely nights by spinning romantic fantasies drawn from memories of old movies.', 'The story of two radically different men thrown together in a Latin American prison cell. One is Valentin, a journalist being tortured for his political beliefs. The other is Molina, a gay window-dresser who fills their lonely nights by spinning romantic fantasies drawn from memories of old movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbrn4gOjYKrLrINn3uUJRlV2NZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11703'),
  ('917675485124570466', 'Kiss of the Spider Woman', 2025, 'Romance, Music, Drama, Thriller', 'Bill Condon, Tobias A. Schliessler, Germán Zecchi', 'Bill Condon', 'Diego Luna, Tonatiuh, Jennifer Lopez, Bruno Bichir, Josefina Scaglione, Aline Mayagoitia, Driton ''Tony'' Dovolani, Lucila Gandolfo', 'R', 'Valentín, a political prisoner, shares a cell with Molina, a window dresser convicted of public indecency. The two form an unlikely bond as Molina recounts the plot of a Hollywood musical starring his favorite silver screen diva, Ingrid Luna.', 'Valentín, a political prisoner, shares a cell with Molina, a window dresser convicted of public indecency. The two form an unlikely bond as Molina recounts the plot of a Hollywood musical starring his favorite silver screen diva, Ingrid Luna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLQcyl6XTu17CfT6g739PbsePDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214684'),
