  ('783799107794782111', 'Kissing a Fool', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Doug Ellin, Don H. Julien, Gary B. Goldman', 'James Frey, Doug Ellin', 'David Schwimmer, Jason Lee, Mili Avital, Bonnie Hunt, Vanessa Angel, Judy Greer, Kari Wührer, Frank Medrano', 'R', 'An egotistical television personality enlists the assistance of his best friend in putting the fidelity of his fiancé to the test in this amiable comedy of the sexes. Told in flashback, the film takes a familiar love-triangle scenario and gives it a bitter twist. With a bride who seems too good for either suitor, the film is sustained by one question - who will she choose?', 'An egotistical television personality enlists the assistance of his best friend in putting the fidelity of his fiancé to the test in this amiable comedy of the sexes. Told in flashback, the film takes a familiar love-triangle scenario and gives it a bitter twist. With a bride who seems too good for either suitor, the film is sustained by one question - who will she choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOHkDefwdH9YxGqeZDEbo9CcGzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15513'),
  ('778431932823685523', 'Kissing and Chimneys', 1993, null, 'Atsushi Kokatsu', null, 'Miyuki Komatsu', null, 'Miyuki, a beautiful woman, is tossed about by the waves of free love, repeatedly engaging in fruitless relationships. While wandering in search of true love, she surrenders herself to impromptu sex once again today.', 'Miyuki, a beautiful woman, is tossed about by the waves of free love, repeatedly engaging in fruitless relationships. While wandering in search of true love, she surrenders herself to impromptu sex once again today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpOlmOL57MlAVh7sQdzlHZcsmRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931090'),
  ('551623347635805960', 'Kissing Gorbaciov', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Salvo Lucchese, Nicola Zambelli, Andrea Paco Mariani', 'Andrea Paco Mariani, Luigi D''Alife, Roberto Zinzi', 'Valentina Avantaggiato, Sergio Blasi, Francesco Costantini, Giovanni Lindo Ferretti, Flavio Giannandrea, Günter Schabowski', null, 'A small town in Salento, some Soviet rock bands, CCCP and an 8-day trip between Moscow and Leningrad. The incredible story of a tour between two worlds that would never be the same again.', 'A small town in Salento, some Soviet rock bands, CCCP and an 8-day trip between Moscow and Leningrad. The incredible story of a tour between two worlds that would never be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5I7zOB7QBNDZ9KCURb15sItBdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1207676'),
  ('863054670316045448', 'Kissing Is the Easy Part', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Fawzia Mirza', 'Christine Duann, Rebecca Webb', 'Asher Angel, Paris Berelc, Jennifer Robertson, Tom Keat, Rosalie Turmel, Daniel Falk, Sorika Horng, Mark Ballantyne', 'PG-13', 'Sean''s gunning for MIT. Flora''s ditching the SAT. A secret deal with her tenured parents sparks a romance that challenges everything they believe in.', 'Sean''s gunning for MIT. Flora''s ditching the SAT. A secret deal with her tenured parents sparks a romance that challenges everything they believe in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPxlb7LLqbsKgjltgVrgYdhfxCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1515615'),
  ('831900457266703947', 'Kissing Jessica Stein', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Charles Herman-Wurmfeld, Lawrence Sher', 'Jennifer Westfeldt, Heather Juergensen', 'Jennifer Westfeldt, Heather Juergensen, Scott Cohen, Jackie Hoffman, Tovah Feldshuh, Michael Mastro, Carson Elrod, Jon Hamm', 'R', 'Jessica, a Jewish copy editor living and working in New York City, is plagued by failed blind dates with men, and decides to answer a newspaper''s personal advertisement. The advertisement has been placed by ''lesbian-curious'' Helen Cooper, a thirtysomething art gallerist.', 'Jessica, a Jewish copy editor living and working in New York City, is plagued by failed blind dates with men, and decides to answer a newspaper''s personal advertisement. The advertisement has been placed by ''lesbian-curious'' Helen Cooper, a thirtysomething art gallerist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b2g8QZRLTJMYyzc3HirTSRQpLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15647'),
