  ('370627744867206342', 'Kleinhoff Hotel', 1977, 'Drama', 'Carlo Lizzani, Gianni Cozzo, Gábor Pogány', 'Faliero Rosati', 'Corinne Cléry, Bruce Robinson, Katja Rupé, Werner Pochath, Peter Kern, Michele Placido, Rodolfo Dal Pra, Carole Fouanon', null, 'Pascale, married to an architect, misses her flight to London and is forced to stay in Berlin, at the Kleinhoff Hotel where she stayed as a student. Karl, a would-be revolutionary lives in the adjoining room and Pascale spies him and his ex-girl-friend through a hole. Then she follows him to a questionable place where she is arrested by the police during a revolutionists raid. When she returns to the Kleinhoff Hotel, Pascale finds Karl crying, and enters his room to console him and they have a love affair.', 'Pascale, married to an architect, misses her flight to London and is forced to stay in Berlin, at the Kleinhoff Hotel where she stayed as a student. Karl, a would-be revolutionary lives in the adjoining room and Pascale spies him and his ex-girl-friend through a hole. Then she follows him to a questionable place where she is arrested by the police during a revolutionists raid. When she returns to the Kleinhoff Hotel, Pascale finds Karl crying, and enters his room to console him and they have a love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTvmpmPLjwtXfM9u8ePpbvgcswq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69571'),
  ('56678941060333135', 'Kleinruppin Forever', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Carsten Fiebeler, Bernhard Jasper', 'Peer Klehmet, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Tobias Schenke, Anna Brüggemann, Michael Gwisdek, Tino Mewes, Tobias Kasimirowicz, Uwe Kockisch, Michael Kind, Florian Panzner', null, 'Two twin brothers are living on a different sides of Berlin Wall after being separated after birth.', 'Two twin brothers are living on a different sides of Berlin Wall after being separated after birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uV58p1QACUo9RRIZyRrW9V1Ra9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11346'),
  ('740814773093892583', 'Kleks Academy', 2024, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Bartek Cierlica, Mojca Tirš, Maciej Kawulski', 'Agnieszka Kruk, Krzysztof Gureczny', 'Antonina Litwiniak, Tomasz Kot, Piotr Fronczewski, Sebastian Stankiewicz, Agnieszka Grochowska, Danuta Stenka, Daniel Walasek, Konrad Repiński', null, 'A seemingly ordinary girl finds her way into the eponymous Academy to explore the world of fairy tales, imagination and creativity. With the help of a crazy, talented teacher, she develops her unique abilities and also stumbles upon a clue that will help her unravel the biggest secret of the family...', 'A seemingly ordinary girl finds her way into the eponymous Academy to explore the world of fairy tales, imagination and creativity. With the help of a crazy, talented teacher, she develops her unique abilities and also stumbles upon a clue that will help her unravel the biggest secret of the family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymbECZscR8BTkdvXziSinMIckAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026999'),
  ('425988132072193852', 'Klimt', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Raúl Ruiz, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Gilbert Adair, Raúl Ruiz, Herbert Vesely', 'John Malkovich, Veronica Ferres, Saffron Burrows, Nikolai Kinski, Stephen Dillane, Sandra Ceccarelli, Aglaia Szyszkowitz, Joachim Bißmeier', null, 'A portrait of Austrian artist Gustav Klimt whose lavish, sexual paintings came to symbolize the art nouveau style of the late 19th and early 20th century.', 'A portrait of Austrian artist Gustav Klimt whose lavish, sexual paintings came to symbolize the art nouveau style of the late 19th and early 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k23zlYZptToVRMJrG7KdKSGTL6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29291'),
  ('55217896106289763', 'Klimt & Schiele: Eros and Psyche', 2018, 'Documentary, History', 'Michele Mally', null, 'Lorenzo Richelmy, Rudolf Buchbinder, Alfred Weidinger', null, '1918. As the roar of the First World War cannons is dying out, in Vienna, the heart of Central Europe, a golden age comes to an end. The Austro-Hungarian Empire is beginning to disintegrate. On the night of October 31st, in the bed of his home, Egon Schiele dies, one of the 20 million deaths caused by the Spanish flu. He dies looking at the invisible evil in the face, in the only he can do: painting it. He is 28 years old. Only a few months earlier, the main hall of the Secession building had welcomed his works: 19 oil paintings and 29 drawings. His first successful exhibition, a celebration of a new painting idea that portrays the restlessness and desires of mankind.A few months earlier, his teacher and friend Gustav Klimt had died. From the turn of the century, he had fundamentally changed the feeling of art and founded a new group: the Secession.', '1918. As the roar of the First World War cannons is dying out, in Vienna, the heart of Central Europe, a golden age comes to an end. The Austro-Hungarian Empire is beginning to disintegrate. On the night of October 31st, in the bed of his home, Egon Schiele dies, one of the 20 million deaths caused by the Spanish flu. He dies looking at the invisible evil in the face, in the only he can do: painting it. He is 28 years old. Only a few months earlier, the main hall of the Secession building had welcomed his works: 19 oil paintings and 29 drawings. His first successful exhibition, a celebration of a new painting idea that portrays the restlessness and desires of mankind.A few months earlier, his teacher and friend Gustav Klimt had died. From the turn of the century, he had fundamentally changed the feeling of art and founded a new group: the Secession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liJ3s6w2mSRGX8byv5MQf9fafqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550159'),
  ('111875291344440514', 'Klitschko', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Sebastian Dehnhardt', 'Sebastian Dehnhardt', 'Vitali Klitschko, Wladimir Klitschko, Nadeshda Uljanowna Klitschko, Hayden Panettiere, Natalia Yegorova, Lennox Lewis, Henry Maske, Larry Merchant', null, 'Klitschko tells the captivating story of the boxing worlds most famous brothers: Vitali and Wladimir Klitschko. From the socialist drill of their childhood in the Ukraine, and their first successes as amateurs, to their move to Germany and subsequent rise as international stars on the verge of holding the championship titles of all five boxing federations (Wladimir secured this with his unanimous World Boxing Association win against David Haye on July 2nd, 2011). Along the way they experience defeats and setbacks, low points and triumphant comebacks as well as conflicts with each other. Exciting conversations with companions and opponents, including the very first with the Klitschkos parents, give insight into their personal lives, plus never-before-seen footage of the draining preparations for a fight, and the spectacular boxing matches. Director Sebastian Dehnhardt composes an intimate and fascinating portrait of two exceptional athletes who are, before all else, brothers.', 'Klitschko tells the captivating story of the boxing worlds most famous brothers: Vitali and Wladimir Klitschko. From the socialist drill of their childhood in the Ukraine, and their first successes as amateurs, to their move to Germany and subsequent rise as international stars on the verge of holding the championship titles of all five boxing federations (Wladimir secured this with his unanimous World Boxing Association win against David Haye on July 2nd, 2011). Along the way they experience defeats and setbacks, low points and triumphant comebacks as well as conflicts with each other. Exciting conversations with companions and opponents, including the very first with the Klitschkos parents, give insight into their personal lives, plus never-before-seen footage of the draining preparations for a fight, and the spectacular boxing matches. Director Sebastian Dehnhardt composes an intimate and fascinating portrait of two exceptional athletes who are, before all else, brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kiCtOWdB73dLeTQMv6YbIeDaK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70808'),
  ('1127781518102503403', 'Klondike', 2022, 'Drama, War', 'Maryna Er Gorbach, Sviatoslav Bulakovskyi', 'Maryna Er Gorbach', 'Oksana Cherkashyna, Serhii Shadrin, Oleh Scherbyna, Oleh Shevchuk, Artur Aramyan, Yevhen Yefremov', null, 'The story of a Ukrainian family living on the border of Russia and Ukraine during the start of the war. Irka refuses to leave her house even as the village gets captured by armed forces. Shortly after they find themselves at the center of an international air crash catastrophe on July 17, 2014.', 'The story of a Ukrainian family living on the border of Russia and Ukraine during the start of the war. Irka refuses to leave her house even as the village gets captured by armed forces. Shortly after they find themselves at the center of an international air crash catastrophe on July 17, 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xo28wr9kK0BGTeGjcMsep2onKs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913760'),
  ('487880550607808487', 'Klondike Annie', 1936, 'Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Raoul Walsh, George T. Clemens', 'Mae West', 'Mae West, Victor McLaglen, Phillip Reed, Helen Jerome Eddy, Harry Beresford, Harold Huber, Lucile Gleason, Conway Tearle', null, 'Singer Rose Carlton, otherwise known as ''The San Francisco Doll'', accidentally kills her controlling boyfriend when he tries to prevent her from leaving. To evade the police, Rose sets sail for Nome with captain Bull Bracket. When the ship takes on another passenger, reformer Annie Alden, Carlton''s life is changed forever, and she sets out to honor a deeply personal debt.', 'Singer Rose Carlton, otherwise known as ''The San Francisco Doll'', accidentally kills her controlling boyfriend when he tries to prevent her from leaving. To evade the police, Rose sets sail for Nome with captain Bull Bracket. When the ship takes on another passenger, reformer Annie Alden, Carlton''s life is changed forever, and she sets out to honor a deeply personal debt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5V1mAyosqsWA6bjKCgdtsHGCwex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75994'),
  ('47902289181276852', 'Klondike Fever', 1980, 'Adventure', 'Peter Carter, Albert J. Dunk', 'R.J. Dryer, Martin Lager', 'Jeff East, Rod Steiger, Angie Dickinson, Lorne Greene, Barry Morse, Lisa Langlois, Robin Gammell, Gordon Pinsent', null, 'This movie chronicles Jack London''s epic journey from San Francisco to the Klondike gold fields in 1898.', 'This movie chronicles Jack London''s epic journey from San Francisco to the Klondike gold fields in 1898.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfsAmmPkIc9VwLRzbYwlnYMuG7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256014'),
  ('110047957822330223', 'Klovn the Final', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mikkel Nørgaard, Jacob Banke Olesen', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam, Mia Lyhne, Camilla Lehmann, Christian Østergaard Sørensen, Lars Hjortshøj, Tina Bilsbo, Marcuz Jess Petersen', null, 'The third and final feature based on the acclaimed Danish TV series finds Frank turning 50 so Casper invites him to Iceland on a boys'' trip. Naturally, the trip does not go quite as planned.', 'The third and final feature based on the acclaimed Danish TV series finds Frank turning 50 so Casper invites him to Iceland on a boys'' trip. Naturally, the trip does not go quite as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gtdFM6c4GaTvkSoqrsh9vSHtsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655713'),
  ('397051522462539091', 'Klown', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Jacob Banke Olesen, Mikkel Nørgaard, Jeanette Nordahl', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam, Iben Hjejle, Mia Lyhne, Marcuz Jess Petersen, Lars Hjortshøj, Tina Bilsbo, Mads Lisby', 'R', 'Frank is left with the responsibility for his nephew Bo on an already planned canoe trip. Frank''s mate Casper is also coming along. Weighed down a with their obligation, Frank and Casper nevertheless look forward to ending the trip at Skanderborg Festival where there''s plenty there for the guys, a spree of drinking and women. Not the best example to set for young Bo. And how do their partners see it all?', 'Frank is left with the responsibility for his nephew Bo on an already planned canoe trip. Frank''s mate Casper is also coming along. Weighed down a with their obligation, Frank and Casper nevertheless look forward to ending the trip at Skanderborg Festival where there''s plenty there for the guys, a spree of drinking and women. Not the best example to set for young Bo. And how do their partners see it all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6ZpiZjP30LB2ElfhqUgQBO9ui4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48748'),
  ('415702372761629469', 'Klute', 1971, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Gordon Willis, Alan J. Pakula, John Jay Moore', 'David E. Lewis, Andy Lewis', 'Jane Fonda, Donald Sutherland, Charles Cioffi, Roy Scheider, Dorothy Tristan, Rita Gam, Nathan George, Vivian Nathan', 'R', 'A high-priced call girl is forced to depend on a reluctant private eye when she is stalked by a psychopath.', 'A high-priced call girl is forced to depend on a reluctant private eye when she is stalked by a psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVyINAsNGSgD1OIstqwCcs7wyGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466'),
  ('39520220584137240', 'Km 31-2', 2016, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Rigoberto Castañeda', null, 'Rosanna Engel, Iliana Fox, Carlos Aragón, Verónica Merchant, Juan Manuel Bernal, Matías del Castillo', null, 'A woman is searching for her son who got lost under mysterious circumstances.', 'A woman is searching for her son who got lost under mysterious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aetM7b9vDwyl8mjdBXxRoAPXmFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269588'),
  ('562384556063432693', 'KM 31: Kilometer 31', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Rigoberto Castañeda', 'Rigoberto Castañeda', 'Iliana Fox, Adrià Collado, Raúl Méndez, Luisa Huertas, Mikel Mateos, Fernando Becerril, Carlos Aragón, Marcela Pezet', null, 'While driving through the kilometer 31 of a lonely road, Agata Hameran hits a boy. She leaves her car to help the victim and another car runs over her and she falls in a deep coma. Her twin sister Catalina telepathically feels the pain of Agata and hears her whispering for help. Together with her boyfriend Nuno and Agata''s mate Omar, they return to the km 31 of the road, and find out that the place is surrounded by supernatural accidents caused by the ghost of a mother that lost her boy many years ago. Further, Catalina discloses that the spirit of Agata is trapped between the worlds of the living and the dead.', 'While driving through the kilometer 31 of a lonely road, Agata Hameran hits a boy. She leaves her car to help the victim and another car runs over her and she falls in a deep coma. Her twin sister Catalina telepathically feels the pain of Agata and hears her whispering for help. Together with her boyfriend Nuno and Agata''s mate Omar, they return to the km 31 of the road, and find out that the place is surrounded by supernatural accidents caused by the ghost of a mother that lost her boy many years ago. Further, Catalina discloses that the spirit of Agata is trapped between the worlds of the living and the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9Tr4hjRm8Z2rjliMomcOwGjsYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20015'),
  ('837243108226118272', 'Km. 0', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yolanda García Serrano, Ángel Luis Fernández, Juan Luis Iborra', 'Yolanda García Serrano, Juan Luis Iborra', 'Georges Corraface, Concha Velasco, Carlos Fuentes, Mercè Pons, Alberto San Juan, Silke, Armando del Río, Tristán Ulloa', null, 'Located in Madrid''s Plaza del Sol, Km. 0 is the point from which all distances in Spain are measured from the capital. In Km. 0, it is also the meeting point for a gallery of characters. Bored, affluent housewife Marga meets up with gigolo Miguel, who co-habitates with gay Benjamin. Sergio, a soon-to-be-married office clerk who can''t wait to lose his virginity, makes the acquaintance of prostitute Tatiana, while gay dancer Bruno meets Maximo. Meanwhile, wannabe director Pedro arranges to meet up with Silvia, an actress who wants to work in musicals directed by Gerardo, and bartender Mario is caught between Amor, who wants to marry him, and her little sister Roma, who is truly in love with him.', 'Located in Madrid''s Plaza del Sol, Km. 0 is the point from which all distances in Spain are measured from the capital. In Km. 0, it is also the meeting point for a gallery of characters. Bored, affluent housewife Marga meets up with gigolo Miguel, who co-habitates with gay Benjamin. Sergio, a soon-to-be-married office clerk who can''t wait to lose his virginity, makes the acquaintance of prostitute Tatiana, while gay dancer Bruno meets Maximo. Meanwhile, wannabe director Pedro arranges to meet up with Silvia, an actress who wants to work in musicals directed by Gerardo, and bartender Mario is caught between Amor, who wants to marry him, and her little sister Roma, who is truly in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRLrKXWZdMBkP2SMi4iDxA3W6pT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40947'),
  ('1131489186104497354', 'Kneecap', 2024, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Rich Peppiatt, Ryan Kernaghan, Peadar Ó Goill', 'Rich Peppiatt', 'Móglaí Bap, Mo Chara, DJ Próvaí, Josie Walker, Fionnuala Flaherty, Jessica Reynolds, Adam Best, Simone Kirby', 'R', 'When fate brings Belfast teacher JJ into the orbit of self-confessed "low life scum" Naoise and Liam Óg, the needle drops on a hip-hop act like no other. Rapping in their native Irish, they lead a movement to save their mother tongue.', 'When fate brings Belfast teacher JJ into the orbit of self-confessed "low life scum" Naoise and Liam Óg, the needle drops on a hip-hop act like no other. Rapping in their native Irish, they lead a movement to save their mother tongue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEbQi5QWUg3CQ9R5dwvPBvbOX17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180629'),
  ('940887022255910641', 'Knick Knack', 1989, 'Animation, Family', 'John Lasseter', 'John Lasseter', null, 'G', 'Life on a shelf as a snowman trapped in a snow-globe blizzard can become wearing, especially when you''re surrounded by knickknacks from sunnier locales. When the jaded snowman finally breaks free of his glass house, his vacation plans are cut short.', 'Life on a shelf as a snowman trapped in a snow-globe blizzard can become wearing, especially when you''re surrounded by knickknacks from sunnier locales. When the jaded snowman finally breaks free of his glass house, his vacation plans are cut short.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouk2QFv4NySNfitAgXqnTtO5vA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13928'),
  ('936081353698199441', 'Knife Edge', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Anthony Hickox, Dan Bronx', 'Fiona Combe, Anthony Hickox, Robb Squire', 'Natalie Press, Hugh Bonneville, Tamsin Egerton, Svetlana Metkina, Joan Plowright, Nina Muschallik, Karen Ferrari, Jamie Harris', null, 'A successful Wall Street trader returns to England with her new husband and five-year-old son, but their new start together turns into a nightmare when they move into a country house which contains a terrible secret.', 'A successful Wall Street trader returns to England with her new husband and five-year-old son, but their new start together turns into a nightmare when they move into a country house which contains a terrible secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7CYn7RYoZvz1RnLkkRibgEEaEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13826'),
  ('242412570468840641', 'Knife in the Head', 1978, 'Drama', 'Reinhard Hauff, Frank Brühne', 'Peter Schneider', 'Bruno Ganz, Angela Winkler, Hans Christian Blech, Heinz Hoenig, Hans Brenner, Udo Samel, Eike Gallwitz, Carla Egerer', 'R', 'One night when seeking his estranged wife, Hoffmann goes to the youth center where she works. The police are there rounding up radicals who frequent the center - Hoffmann runs into the building and ends up being shot in the head. He awakens with brain trauma, partially paralyzed and unable to speak. The police accuse him of stabbing an officer; the radicals herald him as an innocent victim of police brutality. During his slow recovery at the hospital, Hoffmann must piece together his life and struggle to remember the events of that night.', 'One night when seeking his estranged wife, Hoffmann goes to the youth center where she works. The police are there rounding up radicals who frequent the center - Hoffmann runs into the building and ends up being shot in the head. He awakens with brain trauma, partially paralyzed and unable to speak. The police accuse him of stabbing an officer; the radicals herald him as an innocent victim of police brutality. During his slow recovery at the hospital, Hoffmann must piece together his life and struggle to remember the events of that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIuUGnplQc1eKtULn9Udv1p2KJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42208'),
  ('981130953102776901', 'Knife in the Water', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jerzy Lipman, Roman Polanski, Jakub Goldberg', 'Roman Polanski, Jakub Goldberg, Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Leon Niemczyk, Jolanta Umecka, Zygmunt Malanowicz, Roman Polanski, Anna Ciepielewska', 'NR', 'On their way to an afternoon on the lake, husband and wife Andrzej and Krystyna nearly run over a young hitchhiker. Inviting the young man onto the boat with them, Andrzej begins to subtly torment him; the hitchhiker responds by making overtures toward Krystyna. When the hitchhiker is accidentally knocked overboard, the husband''s panic results in unexpected consequences.', 'On their way to an afternoon on the lake, husband and wife Andrzej and Krystyna nearly run over a young hitchhiker. Inviting the young man onto the boat with them, Andrzej begins to subtly torment him; the hitchhiker responds by making overtures toward Krystyna. When the hitchhiker is accidentally knocked overboard, the husband''s panic results in unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkdeCwZhy9hzzVjZFjw0RPGWUIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11502'),
  ('241448169434351366', 'Knife of Ice', 1972, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Umberto Lenzi, José F. Aguayo Jr., Franco Fantasia', 'Umberto Lenzi', 'Carroll Baker, Alan Scott, Ida Galli, Eduardo Fajardo, Silvia Monelli, George Rigaud, Franco Fantasia, Dada Gallotti', null, 'A mute woman, traumatized by her parents'' death, faces new horrors when her cousin is murdered by a suspected killer. As danger looms, the truth proves far more complex.', 'A mute woman, traumatized by her parents'' death, faces new horrors when her cousin is murdered by a suspected killer. As danger looms, the truth proves far more complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unDLopcnKJmCC3bzemgrAelGaIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28488'),
  ('85490269916554857', 'Knife Under the Throat', 1986, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Claude Mulot, Bruno Affret, Jérôme George', 'Claude Mulot', 'Florence Guérin, Alexandre Sterling, Brigitte Lahaie, Natasha Delange, Jean-Pierre Maurin, Pierre Londiche, Francis Lemonnier, Emmanuel Karsen', null, 'A woman posing in erotic magazines is stalked by a maniac who kills the people around her.', 'A woman posing in erotic magazines is stalked by a maniac who kills the people around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3l2CWMM0w6kSy9xa9LZYrOqT7ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85140'),
  ('995282719487705393', 'Knife+Heart', 2018, 'Horror, Romance, Mystery', 'Simon Beaufils, Yann Gonzalez, Maxime L''Anthoën', 'Yann Gonzalez, Cristiano Mangione', 'Vanessa Paradis, Nicolas Maury, Kate Moran, Jonathan Genet, Romane Bohringer, Khaled Alouach, Félix Maritaud, Noé Hernández', 'NR', 'In the summer of 1979, gay porn producer Anne sets out to film her most ambitious film yet, but her actors are picked off, one by one, by a mysterious killer.', 'In the summer of 1979, gay porn producer Anne sets out to film her most ambitious film yet, but her actors are picked off, one by one, by a mysterious killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aodlp3TH6FBti9igUCt8f5KS7Nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475930'),
  ('526939840154105737', 'Knight and Day', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'James Mangold, Nicholas Mastandrea, Maria Mantia', 'Patrick O''Neill', 'Tom Cruise, Cameron Diaz, Peter Sarsgaard, Viola Davis, Jordi Mollà, Paul Dano, Maggie Grace, Marc Blucas', 'PG-13', 'A fugitive couple goes on a glamorous and sometimes deadly adventure where nothing and no one – even themselves – are what they seem. Amid shifting alliances and unexpected betrayals, they race across the globe, with their survival ultimately hinging on the battle of truth vs. trust.', 'A fugitive couple goes on a glamorous and sometimes deadly adventure where nothing and no one – even themselves – are what they seem. Amid shifting alliances and unexpected betrayals, they race across the globe, with their survival ultimately hinging on the battle of truth vs. trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7JmOBMNj5erYTgt4u1mQgvHItu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37834'),
  ('351957263789219171', 'Knight Moves', 1992, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Dietrich Lohmann, Carl Schenkel', 'Brad Mirman', 'Christopher Lambert, Diane Lane, Tom Skerritt, Daniel Baldwin, Ferdy Mayne, Don Thompson, Megan Leitch, Katharine Isabelle', 'R', 'A chess grandmaster is in a big tournament, and when his lover is found painted up and the blood drained out of her body he becomes a chief suspect. After he gets a call from the killer urging him to try and figure out the game, he cooperates with police and a psychologist to try and catch the killer, but doubts linger about the grandmaster''s innocence as the string of grisly murders continues.', 'A chess grandmaster is in a big tournament, and when his lover is found painted up and the blood drained out of her body he becomes a chief suspect. After he gets a call from the killer urging him to try and figure out the game, he cooperates with police and a psychologist to try and catch the killer, but doubts linger about the grandmaster''s innocence as the string of grisly murders continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TbMfJueFlfwdn8pURQdcugjUFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5765'),
  ('695089002616286935', 'Knight of Cups', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Terrence Malick, Emmanuel Lubezki, Paul Atkins', 'Terrence Malick', 'Christian Bale, Cate Blanchett, Natalie Portman, Brian Dennehy, Antonio Banderas, Freida Pinto, Wes Bentley, Isabel Lucas', 'R', 'Rick is a screenwriter living in Los Angeles. While successful in his career, his life feels empty. Haunted and confused, he finds temporary solace in the decadent Hollywood excess that defines his existence. Women provide a distraction to his daily pain, and every encounter brings him closer to finding his place in the world.', 'Rick is a screenwriter living in Los Angeles. While successful in his career, his life feels empty. Haunted and confused, he finds temporary solace in the decadent Hollywood excess that defines his existence. Women provide a distraction to his daily pain, and every encounter brings him closer to finding his place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xejFBC19Nc7Xi1MiIvcf84ZCy2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86835'),
  ('822799377624083820', 'Knight Rider', 2008, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Steve Shill, Jamie Barber, Kris Krosskove', 'Dave Andron', 'Justin Bruening, Deanna Russo, Sydney Tamiia Poitier, Bruce Davison, Greg Ellis, Chris Mulkey, Jonathan Chase, Val Kilmer', 'PG-13', 'When a group of ruthless mercenaries kill a reclusive scientist, his creation, a new model of artificially intelligent supercar, escapes to find his daughter and recruit a ex-soldier to thwart them. Pilot for the reboot of the television series Knight Rider.', 'When a group of ruthless mercenaries kill a reclusive scientist, his creation, a new model of artificially intelligent supercar, escapes to find his daughter and recruit a ex-soldier to thwart them. Pilot for the reboot of the television series Knight Rider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlclgMqgiMWJxYTpsaROHPrM6j2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209379'),
  ('1120137848199826388', 'Knight Rider 2000', 1991, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Billy Dickson, Alan J. Levi, Bob Mayberry', 'Rob Hedden', 'David Hasselhoff, Edward Mulhare, Susan Norman, Carmen Argenziano, Mitch Pileggi, Eugene Clark, Christine Healy, Lou Beatty Jr.', 'G', 'In the future, guns are banned and criminals are frozen for the duration of their sentences. A recent spate of killings involving handguns brings Michael Knight back to fight for justice, but he insists of the help of KITT, his artificially-intelligent car from decades ago. The only problem is that KITT has been deactivated.', 'In the future, guns are banned and criminals are frozen for the duration of their sentences. A recent spate of killings involving handguns brings Michael Knight back to fight for justice, but he insists of the help of KITT, his artificially-intelligent car from decades ago. The only problem is that KITT has been deactivated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hrGmhIdDvVkk9i26lK9QsZNurw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10969'),
  ('11035426598897750', 'Knight Rider 2010', 1994, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Sam Pillsbury, James Bartle, Michael Waxman', 'John Leekley', 'Richard Joseph Paul, Hudson Leick, Michael Beach, Don McManus, Nicky Katt, Badja Djola, Mark Pellegrino, Una Damon', null, 'Loosely based on the popular television series of the 80''s, this movie brings the story into an apocalyptic time and a new "KITT".', 'Loosely based on the popular television series of the 80''s, this movie brings the story into an apocalyptic time and a new "KITT".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEhPxgoSSgYNXw07e3BmDMAKZIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44829'),
  ('1029755546987611074', 'Knight Rusty', 2013, 'Animation, Family', 'Hubert Weiland, Nina Wels, Thomas Bodenstein', 'Gabriele M. Walther, Mark Slater', 'Ulrich Frank, Tom Gerhardt, Christoph Maria Herbst, Rick Kavanian, Carolin Kebekus, Dustin Semmelrogge, Hartmut Neugebauer, Detlev Redinger', 'G', 'Rusty lives with his dragon Cole and faithful friend Bo in the kingdom of Scrapland, a magical world completely made of scrap-metal. With dreams of winning the great knights'' tournament, Rusty acquires a speedy engine for his horse Chopper that propels them into first place. But when the engine turns out to be stolen from ambitious Prince Novel, brave Rusty must redeem his knightly honor, save the kingdom and prove that true friends always stick together.', 'Rusty lives with his dragon Cole and faithful friend Bo in the kingdom of Scrapland, a magical world completely made of scrap-metal. With dreams of winning the great knights'' tournament, Rusty acquires a speedy engine for his horse Chopper that propels them into first place. But when the engine turns out to be stolen from ambitious Prince Novel, brave Rusty must redeem his knightly honor, save the kingdom and prove that true friends always stick together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wENIL5BNYTlqaD1OaT4otxAsX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160873'),
  ('775232547219901308', 'Knight Without Armour', 1937, 'History, Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Hal Waller, Jacques Feyder, Imlay Watts', 'Lajos Biró, Frances Marion', 'Marlene Dietrich, Robert Donat, Irene Vanbrugh, Herbert Lomas, Austin Trevor, Basil Gill, David Tree, John Clements', null, 'British agent working in Russia is forced to remain longer than planned once the revolution begins. After being released from prison in Siberia he poses as a Russian Commissar. Because of his position among the revolutionaries, he is able to rescue a Russian countess from the Bolsheviks.', 'British agent working in Russia is forced to remain longer than planned once the revolution begins. After being released from prison in Siberia he poses as a Russian Commissar. Because of his position among the revolutionaries, he is able to rescue a Russian countess from the Bolsheviks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pd6NFzZqdEHGDEtptHbHrIaNQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87115'),
  ('684644342151390663', 'Knight-Mare Hare', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Chuck Jones, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'An apple falls on Bugs'' head, transporting him back to King Arthur''s England.', 'An apple falls on Bugs'' head, transporting him back to King Arthur''s England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5odXdWDKimzDgiZ3Ui61isGLS33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101512'),
  ('744354331414929533', 'Knightriders', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'George A. Romero, Michael Gornick, Pasquale Buba', 'George A. Romero', 'Ed Harris, Gary Lahti, Tom Savini, Amy Ingersoll, Patricia Tallman, Christine Forrest, Warner Shook, Brother Blue', 'R', 'A medieval reenactment troupe struggles to maintain its family-like dynamic amid pressure from local authorities, interest from talent agents, and their so-called king''s delusions of grandeur.', 'A medieval reenactment troupe struggles to maintain its family-like dynamic amid pressure from local authorities, interest from talent agents, and their so-called king''s delusions of grandeur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lawtQYZvwrjHMNkvrKWAF93tIoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22167'),
  ('1076114804431667236', 'Knights', 1993, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Kelly Cantley-Kashima', 'Albert Pyun', 'Kathy Long, Kris Kristofferson, Lance Henriksen, Scott Paulin, Gary Daniels, Nicholas Guest, Vincent Klyn, Ben McCreary', null, 'In the future, as a result of devastating wars, all suitable for cultivation of land turned into one big lifeless desert. In the search of fertile lands around the world were traveling group of nomadic farmers. But one of the distant city genesis in these lands came cyborgs. For the operation they need human resources, or more simply - blood. To combat this army of Vampire creator has been sent cyborg Gabriel (Kristofferson). In this he will help the girl Nea (Long), whose parents as a child killed the main villain - Job (Henriksen).', 'In the future, as a result of devastating wars, all suitable for cultivation of land turned into one big lifeless desert. In the search of fertile lands around the world were traveling group of nomadic farmers. But one of the distant city genesis in these lands came cyborgs. For the operation they need human resources, or more simply - blood. To combat this army of Vampire creator has been sent cyborg Gabriel (Kristofferson). In this he will help the girl Nea (Long), whose parents as a child killed the main villain - Job (Henriksen).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKcz7slE98nja8ksnjdugLrHW81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52627'),
  ('745342461677737056', 'Knights Must Fall', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs must joust with Sir Pantsalot of Drop Seat Manor when he tosses a partially eaten carrot into a suit of armor.', 'Bugs must joust with Sir Pantsalot of Drop Seat Manor when he tosses a partially eaten carrot into a suit of armor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMofAkEMEtK9Yc6cQHURQULU2Wi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237370'),
  ('1073060884285163806', 'Knights of Badassdom', 2014, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 'Joe Lynch, Sam McCurdy', 'Matt Wall, Kevin Dreyfuss', 'Peter Dinklage, Summer Glau, Steve Zahn, Ryan Kwanten, Margarita Levieva, Jimmi Simpson, Danny Pudi, Michael Gladis', 'R', 'Three best friends and dedicated roleplayers take to the woods to reenact a dungeons and dragons-like scenario as a live action role-playing game. Trouble arises when a prop spellbook purchased from the internet ends up being a genuine grimoire and they unwittingly conjure up a blood-lusting succubus from hell.', 'Three best friends and dedicated roleplayers take to the woods to reenact a dungeons and dragons-like scenario as a live action role-playing game. Trouble arises when a prop spellbook purchased from the internet ends up being a genuine grimoire and they unwittingly conjure up a blood-lusting succubus from hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hxpi2Y7JNGHmETL2VAPONhvHGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74461'),
  ('910969565493092680', 'Knights of Sidonia: Love Woven in the Stars', 2021, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Masayuki Uemoto, Tadahiro Yoshihira, Reiji Nagazono', 'Sadayuki Murai, Tetsuya Yamada', 'Ryota Osaka, Aya Suzaki, Aki Toyosaki, Hisako Kanemoto, Takahiro Sakurai, Ayane Sakura, Eri Kitamura, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'After the Earth was destroyed by mysterious alien lifeforms known as the Gauna, surviving remnants of the human race escaped to space in the enormous generation ship Sidonia. Having drifted through space for millennia, the Sidonia found itself once more under attack from Gauna for the first time in a century. Once again facing the threat of extinction, a temporary victory against the Gauna was eked out thanks to the human-Gauna hybrid Tsumugi Shiraui and ace Guardian mech pilot Nagate Tanikaze. 10 years later... The people of Sidonia enjoy a brief respite. Peaceful days pass, during which Tsumugi begins to realize her feelings for Nagate, who is now celebrated as a hero of Sidonia. However, as Captain Kobayashi has always known, as long as the Gauna remain, peace cannot last. The decision is made: a final battle, upon which rests the fate of humanity''s last survivors. As the end approaches, will the crew be able to protect those they love?', 'After the Earth was destroyed by mysterious alien lifeforms known as the Gauna, surviving remnants of the human race escaped to space in the enormous generation ship Sidonia. Having drifted through space for millennia, the Sidonia found itself once more under attack from Gauna for the first time in a century. Once again facing the threat of extinction, a temporary victory against the Gauna was eked out thanks to the human-Gauna hybrid Tsumugi Shiraui and ace Guardian mech pilot Nagate Tanikaze. 10 years later... The people of Sidonia enjoy a brief respite. Peaceful days pass, during which Tsumugi begins to realize her feelings for Nagate, who is now celebrated as a hero of Sidonia. However, as Captain Kobayashi has always known, as long as the Gauna remain, peace cannot last. The decision is made: a final battle, upon which rests the fate of humanity''s last survivors. As the end approaches, will the crew be able to protect those they love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQx04qrOqktvCsFJCNakMSSOZTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725986'),
  ('126813429309212036', 'Knights of Sidonia: The Movie', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kobun Shizuno, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Hiroaki Ando', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Ryota Osaka, Satomi Arai, Eri Kitamura, Sayaka Ohara, Ayane Sakura, Hisako Kanemoto, Aya Suzaki, Takahiro Sakurai', null, 'The year is 3394. The solar system has been long destroyed by a strange alien race called Gauna. Now humans are barely maintaining population in their seed ships - the ones they also used to escape a thousand years ago. After several years of drifting though space, Sidonia, a seed ship with a population of over 500,000 people, is once again threatened by Gauna. Follow Tanikaze Nagate, a mysterious young man from the deep corners of the ship, and his friends as they try to strike back against these gigantic creatures and at the same time learn what they really are for the sake of humanity''s survival. -MAL', 'The year is 3394. The solar system has been long destroyed by a strange alien race called Gauna. Now humans are barely maintaining population in their seed ships - the ones they also used to escape a thousand years ago. After several years of drifting though space, Sidonia, a seed ship with a population of over 500,000 people, is once again threatened by Gauna. Follow Tanikaze Nagate, a mysterious young man from the deep corners of the ship, and his friends as they try to strike back against these gigantic creatures and at the same time learn what they really are for the sake of humanity''s survival. -MAL', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZR7rPJgkq2M0fUWG0wjdUvBAux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427593'),
  ('456546355094719857', 'Knights of the City', 1986, 'Action, Music', 'Dominic Orlando, Rolf Kestermann', 'Leon Isaac Kennedy', 'Leon Isaac Kennedy, Nicholas Campbell, John Mengatti, Stoney Jackson, Jeff Moldovan, Jay Amor, Peter Nicholas, Floyd Levine', 'R', 'A street Gang that is also a rap group tries to get a record contract.', 'A street Gang that is also a rap group tries to get a record contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YnTLyyQUYZpAizBWV3Laxmc6Ip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105053'),
  ('225081671380427880', 'Knights Of The Quest', 2001, 'Drama, History', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini, Deborah Belford de Furia', 'Pupi Avati', 'Raoul Bova, Edward Furlong, Thomas Kretschmann, Marco Leonardi, Stanislas Merhar, Carlo Delle Piane, F. Murray Abraham, Gigliola Cinquetti', null, 'In 1271, the Seventh Crusade has failed. During their retreat, the troops transport the remains of King Louis IX, the Holy King, across the peninsula. A world has ended, and five young people with nothing in common set out to find the location of the Holy Shroud, stolen by traitors at the French court. Their journey will take them from the Tuscan-Emilian Apennines to Thebes, where the sacred relic is hidden.', 'In 1271, the Seventh Crusade has failed. During their retreat, the troops transport the remains of King Louis IX, the Holy King, across the peninsula. A world has ended, and five young people with nothing in common set out to find the location of the Holy Shroud, stolen by traitors at the French court. Their journey will take them from the Tuscan-Emilian Apennines to Thebes, where the sacred relic is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tQNeEoh1VKEdNHAD2pJ2GhGmFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61217'),
  ('1070784442742158455', 'Knights of the Round Table', 1953, 'Romance, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Richard Thorpe, Freddie Young, Stephen Dade', 'Thomas Malory', 'Robert Taylor, Ava Gardner, Mel Ferrer, Anne Crawford, Stanley Baker, Felix Aylmer, Maureen Swanson, Gabriel Woolf', 'NR', 'In Camelot, kingdom of Arthur and Merlin, Lancelot is well known for his courage and honor. But one day he must quit Camelot and the Queen Guinevere''s love, leaving the Round Table without protection.', 'In Camelot, kingdom of Arthur and Merlin, Lancelot is well known for his courage and honor. But one day he must quit Camelot and the Queen Guinevere''s love, leaving the Round Table without protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkXgVIpzVtDIbIscq5Z4M6sJ8Ex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19957'),
  ('756958551720179029', 'Knights of the Teutonic Order', 1960, 'Adventure, Drama, History, War', 'Aleksander Ford, Mieczysław Jahoda, Karol Chodura', 'Aleksander Ford, Jerzy Stefan Stawiński', 'Urszula Modrzyńska, Grażyna Staniszewska, Andrzej Szalawski, Henryk Borowski, Aleksander Fogiel, Mieczysław Kalenik, Emil Karewicz, Tadeusz Kosudarski', null, 'A tale of a young impoverished nobleman, who with his uncle returns from a war against the order of the Teutonic Knights in Lithuania. He falls in love with a beautiful woman and pledges an oath to bring her "three trophies" from the Teutonic Knights.', 'A tale of a young impoverished nobleman, who with his uncle returns from a war against the order of the Teutonic Knights in Lithuania. He falls in love with a beautiful woman and pledges an oath to bring her "three trophies" from the Teutonic Knights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTptZ0RYGuL9WPDLUDm5aYi4PQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66030'),
  ('876230294225354308', 'Knights of the Zodiac', 2023, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Tomek Bagiński, Tomasz Naumiuk, Andy Cheng', 'Matthew Stuecken, Josh Campbell, Kiel Murray', 'Mackenyu, Madison Iseman, Diego Tinoco, Mark Dacascos, Nick Stahl, Famke Janssen, Sean Bean, Caitlin M Hutson', 'PG-13', 'When a headstrong street orphan, Seiya, in search of his abducted sister unwittingly taps into hidden powers, he discovers he might be the only person alive who can protect a reincarnated goddess, sent to watch over humanity. Can he let his past go and embrace his destiny to become a Knight of the Zodiac?', 'When a headstrong street orphan, Seiya, in search of his abducted sister unwittingly taps into hidden powers, he discovers he might be the only person alive who can protect a reincarnated goddess, sent to watch over humanity. Can he let his past go and embrace his destiny to become a Knight of the Zodiac?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW4crfED8mpNDadSmMdi7ZDzhXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455476'),
  ('683717887196796635', 'Knighty Knight Bugs', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', 'Warren Foster', 'Mel Blanc', 'G', 'King Arthur''s kingdom and the knights of the Round Table are in the doldrums since the Dark Knight stole the Singing Sword and put it under the protection of a fire-breathing dragon. The king''s jester, Bugs Bunny, says only a fool would try to steal it back, so the king orders him to try. The jester boldly enters the Dark Knight''s castle, initially catching his adversaries napping, but when the Singing Sword wakes the knight and the dragon, can Bugs complete his mission? He''s a clever fool. A moat, portcullis, and catapult all figure in the face off.', 'King Arthur''s kingdom and the knights of the Round Table are in the doldrums since the Dark Knight stole the Singing Sword and put it under the protection of a fire-breathing dragon. The king''s jester, Bugs Bunny, says only a fool would try to steal it back, so the king orders him to try. The jester boldly enters the Dark Knight''s castle, initially catching his adversaries napping, but when the Singing Sword wakes the knight and the dragon, can Bugs complete his mission? He''s a clever fool. A moat, portcullis, and catapult all figure in the face off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FstnTDVE1H7fP4E3QutUXcx7Or.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106927'),
  ('313008836234564450', 'Knives of the Avenger', 1966, 'Adventure, History', 'Mario Bava, Antonio Rinaldi, Mario Bava', 'Gene Luotto, Alberto Liberati, Mario Bava', 'Cameron Mitchell, Fausto Tozzi, Elissa Pichelli, Luciano Pollentin, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Amedeo Trilli, Renato Terra, Sergio Cortona', null, 'A mysterious knife-throwing viking warrior protects a young peasant woman and her young son from the clutches of a evil regent bent on claiming the title of king and the woman for himself.', 'A mysterious knife-throwing viking warrior protects a young peasant woman and her young son from the clutches of a evil regent bent on claiming the title of king and the woman for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pptO2dcK30ZuPDRUYCKlHnxZtES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66087'),
  ('846720448117190189', 'Knives Out', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Bruce Wayne Gillies, Ashley Connor, Scooter Perrotta', 'Rian Johnson', 'Daniel Craig, Chris Evans, Ana de Armas, Jamie Lee Curtis, Michael Shannon, Don Johnson, Toni Collette, LaKeith Stanfield', 'PG-13', 'When renowned crime novelist Harlan Thrombey is found dead at his estate just after his 85th birthday, the inquisitive and debonair Detective Benoit Blanc is mysteriously enlisted to investigate. From Harlan''s dysfunctional family to his devoted staff, Blanc sifts through a web of red herrings and self-serving lies to uncover the truth behind Harlan''s untimely death.', 'When renowned crime novelist Harlan Thrombey is found dead at his estate just after his 85th birthday, the inquisitive and debonair Detective Benoit Blanc is mysteriously enlisted to investigate. From Harlan''s dysfunctional family to his devoted staff, Blanc sifts through a web of red herrings and self-serving lies to uncover the truth behind Harlan''s untimely death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pThyQovXQrw2m0s9x82twj48Jq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546554'),
  ('770733356037167653', 'Knock', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Lorraine Lévy, Emmanuel Soyer', 'Lorraine Lévy', 'Omar Sy, Ana Girardot, Alex Lutz, Hélène Vincent, Pascal Elbé, Christian Hecq, Audrey Dana, Sabine Azéma', null, 'Doctor Knock is a former thug who has become a doctor and arrives in the small village of Saint-Maurice to make his fortune according to a particular method. It will make the villagers believe that they are not as healthy as they might think. It is thus that he will find in each one an imaginary symptom, or not, and thus will be able to exercise his profession lucratively. Under his seductive looks and after gaining the confidence of the village, Knock is on the verge of achieving his ends. But his past catches up with him and an old acquaintance disrupts the doctor''s plans.', 'Doctor Knock is a former thug who has become a doctor and arrives in the small village of Saint-Maurice to make his fortune according to a particular method. It will make the villagers believe that they are not as healthy as they might think. It is thus that he will find in each one an imaginary symptom, or not, and thus will be able to exercise his profession lucratively. Under his seductive looks and after gaining the confidence of the village, Knock is on the verge of achieving his ends. But his past catches up with him and an old acquaintance disrupts the doctor''s plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JhwA8uxxb5ZKjMH6eDHLuJLVUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438348'),
  ('225037631006995850', 'Knock at the Cabin', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jarin Blaschke, Adam Druxman, Ramiro A. Quintero', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Michael Sherman, Steve Desmond', 'Dave Bautista, Jonathan Groff, Ben Aldridge, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Rupert Grint, Abby Quinn, Kristen Cui, McKenna Kerrigan', 'R', 'While vacationing at a remote cabin, a young girl and her two fathers are taken hostage by four armed strangers who demand that the family make an unthinkable choice to avert the apocalypse. With limited access to the outside world, the family must decide what they believe before all is lost.', 'While vacationing at a remote cabin, a young girl and her two fathers are taken hostage by four armed strangers who demand that the family make an unthinkable choice to avert the apocalypse. With limited access to the outside world, the family must decide what they believe before all is lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm06L9pxDOL9jNSK4Cb6y139rrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631842'),
  ('755071872346612386', 'Knock Down the House', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Rachel Lears, Rachel Lears', 'Rachel Lears, Ryan Blotnick', 'Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, Cori Bush, Paula Jean Swearingen, Amy Vilela, Joe Crowley, Ilhan Omar, Joe Manchin III, Nancy Pelosi', 'PG', 'In 2018, a young bartender in the Bronx, a coal miner’s daughter in West Virginia, a grieving mother in Nevada and a registered nurse in Missouri join a movement of insurgent candidates challenging powerful incumbents in Congress. Without political experience or corporate money, these four women are attempting to do what many consider impossible.', 'In 2018, a young bartender in the Bronx, a coal miner’s daughter in West Virginia, a grieving mother in Nevada and a registered nurse in Missouri join a movement of insurgent candidates challenging powerful incumbents in Congress. Without political experience or corporate money, these four women are attempting to do what many consider impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAfixuZIFVbWIsWytzROJDY85D7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565312'),
  ('355914438732723314', 'Knock Knock', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alex Lovy, Walter Lantz', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A woodpecker (Woody) repeatedly pecks the roof of Andy Panda''s and his father''s home. Daddy sets out to stop it.', 'A woodpecker (Woody) repeatedly pecks the roof of Andy Panda''s and his father''s home. Daddy sets out to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXgyvCWLPkbZUCYR822KLsKZXgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87244'),
  ('756765003017830386', 'Knock Knock', 2008, 'Horror', 'Joseph Ariola, Leif Husted-Jensen', 'Joseph Ariola', 'Nicole Abisinio, Chris Bashinelli, Kat Castaneda, Suzi Lorraine, Joli Julianna, Matt Fraley, Jim Ford, Misty Dawn Meeler', null, 'Knock Knock is a horror film that combines fear with revenge, hate with justice and responsibility with sacrifice. The bible says an "Eye for an Eye." Rico was just a big fun loving son of a hard working neighborhood business man. The problem is his dad is an undertaker. Some popular high school Students thought he was weird because of it. Rico kept to himself...', 'Knock Knock is a horror film that combines fear with revenge, hate with justice and responsibility with sacrifice. The bible says an "Eye for an Eye." Rico was just a big fun loving son of a hard working neighborhood business man. The problem is his dad is an undertaker. Some popular high school Students thought he was weird because of it. Rico kept to himself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wt8YMw0T3nQcjplvf1A7qxhOYJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18932'),
  ('225584309425381018', 'Knock Knock', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Eli Roth, Constanza B. Majluf, Antonio Quercia', 'Eli Roth, Guillermo Amoedo, Nicolás López', 'Keanu Reeves, Lorenza Izzo, Ana de Armas, Aaron Burns, Colleen Camp, Ignacia Allamand, Antonio Quercia, Dan Baily', 'R', 'When a devoted husband and father is left home alone for the weekend, two stranded young women unexpectedly knock on his door for help. What starts out as a kind gesture results in a dangerous seduction and a deadly game of cat and mouse.', 'When a devoted husband and father is left home alone for the weekend, two stranded young women unexpectedly knock on his door for help. What starts out as a kind gesture results in a dangerous seduction and a deadly game of cat and mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUC4rUb1Cs2KMaZ6RD4uYUEEwls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263472'),
  ('712181330815656098', 'Knock Knock', 2021, 'Thriller, Comedy, Mystery', 'Liu Xiang, Liu Xiang', 'Liu Xiang, Long Zhang', 'Fan Wei, Shawn Dou, Zhang Songwen, Zhu Zhu, Liang Chao, Hu Ming, Gao Shan, Cai Lu', 'NR', 'In one night, in one room, three strangers–a thief, a retired policeman, and a delivery guy–are all present during the murder of the room''s occupant. As the trio tries to figure out this bizarre situation, the stakes are raised when they discover a huge pile of cash. They soon realize that the only way to get out alive is to unravel this mystery. What initially seems like a coincidence, turns out to be destined from the beginning.', 'In one night, in one room, three strangers–a thief, a retired policeman, and a delivery guy–are all present during the murder of the room''s occupant. As the trio tries to figure out this bizarre situation, the stakes are raised when they discover a huge pile of cash. They soon realize that the only way to get out alive is to unravel this mystery. What initially seems like a coincidence, turns out to be destined from the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXWCt3BU3dcNtC8Od9ZXcxRx87k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823526'),
  ('165179717858551741', 'Knock Off', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tsui Hark, Raymond Kwok Siu-Keung, Wong Ying', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Rob Schneider, Lela Rochon, Paul Sorvino, Michael Wong, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Wyman Wong Wai-Man, Glen Chin', 'R', 'A fashion designer and his CIA agent business partner must join forces to stop a group of terrorists from smuggling explosives in counterfeit jeans during the handover of Hong Kong.', 'A fashion designer and his CIA agent business partner must join forces to stop a group of terrorists from smuggling explosives in counterfeit jeans during the handover of Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hK7hKDA51FCbtFCuXZNiQ6gPq3S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37498'),
  ('813627542761653312', 'Knock on Any Door', 1949, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nicholas Ray, Burnett Guffey, Morris Stoloff', 'John Monks Jr., Daniel Taradash', 'Humphrey Bogart, John Derek, George Macready, Allene Roberts, Candy Toxton, Mickey Knox, Barry Kelley, Florence Auer', 'NR', 'An attorney defends a hoodlum of murder, using the oppressiveness of the slums to appeal to the court.', 'An attorney defends a hoodlum of murder, using the oppressiveness of the slums to appeal to the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aig0a88U0gHQw1dfnqqbwo5bjZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41214'),
  ('560516254295461241', 'Knock on Wood', 1954, 'Action, Comedy', 'Norman Panama, Melvin Frank, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Norman Panama, Melvin Frank', 'Danny Kaye, Mai Zetterling, Torin Thatcher, David Burns, Leon Askin, Abner Biberman, Gavin Gordon, Otto Waldis', 'NR', 'Ventriloquist Jerry Morgan has failed with another love affair. The reason: when the relationship reaches the point when it is time to discuss marriage, his two dolls become mean and jealous. Morgan''s dollmaker Papinek is a member of a spy ring who has stolen the secret plans for the top-secret Lafayette airplane. Since Morgan is leaving for Zurich the same night, he decides to hide the secret plan in the heads of the dolls.', 'Ventriloquist Jerry Morgan has failed with another love affair. The reason: when the relationship reaches the point when it is time to discuss marriage, his two dolls become mean and jealous. Morgan''s dollmaker Papinek is a member of a spy ring who has stolen the secret plans for the top-secret Lafayette airplane. Since Morgan is leaving for Zurich the same night, he decides to hide the secret plan in the heads of the dolls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSoZzEcqJl0g3kLGPH4rvvHWiaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55859'),
  ('386799749113902231', 'Knock Out', 2010, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mani Shankar, Abhishek Banerjee, Natarajan Subramaniam', null, 'Sanjay Dutt, Irrfan Khan, Kangana Ranaut, Gulshan Grover, Sushant Singh, Apoorva Lakhia, Rukhsar Rehman, Vinay Varma', null, 'A businessman in a phone-booth is held hostage by a sniper.', 'A businessman in a phone-booth is held hostage by a sniper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biCktF7ea5f16T8JITOpM6PeLLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56534'),
  ('1060986316561044134', 'Knock, Knock, It''s Mom!', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Alain Braconnier, Antoine Roch, Eric Lavaine', 'Héctor Cabello Reyes, Bruno Lavaine, Eric Lavaine', 'Josiane Balasko, Mathilde Seigner, Jérôme Commandeur, Philippe Lefebvre, Didier Flamand, Jean-François Cayrey, Line Renaud, Jean-Marie Marion', null, 'While her apartment is being renovated, Jacqueline is thrilled to be forced into spending "a few days" with her eldest daughter Carole and her son-in-law, who are both in couples therapy. These "few days" turn into "a few months". Jacqueline quickly feels at home. She prepares dinners, monopolizes the television, reorganizes the kitchen... She is here, and no one knows for how long!', 'While her apartment is being renovated, Jacqueline is thrilled to be forced into spending "a few days" with her eldest daughter Carole and her son-in-law, who are both in couples therapy. These "few days" turn into "a few months". Jacqueline quickly feels at home. She prepares dinners, monopolizes the television, reorganizes the kitchen... She is here, and no one knows for how long!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hG4yUTzeWk7728l1C0xZzKLIPtJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723294'),
  ('903515281542617388', 'Knockabout', 1979, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Ricky Lau, Chu Yat-Hung', 'Huang Chik-Chin, Lau Tin-Chi', 'Yuen Biao, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lau Kar-Wing, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Karl Maka, Lee Hoi-Sang, Mars, Lau Tin-Chi', null, 'After being cheated out of some money, two small time crooks convince a martial arts expert to take them on as students.', 'After being cheated out of some money, two small time crooks convince a martial arts expert to take them on as students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAaGCa6X8E0AnwM96nCLvNcDIB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39901'),
