  ('861466493490156281', 'Knocked Up', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Eric Alan Edwards, Judd Apatow, Matt Rebenkoff', 'Judd Apatow', 'Seth Rogen, Katherine Heigl, Paul Rudd, Leslie Mann, Jason Segel, Jay Baruchel, Jonah Hill, Martin Starr', 'R', 'A slacker and a career-driven woman accidentally conceive a child after a one-night stand. As they try to make the relationship work, they must navigate the challenges of parenthood and their differences in lifestyle and maturity.', 'A slacker and a career-driven woman accidentally conceive a child after a one-night stand. As they try to make the relationship work, they must navigate the challenges of parenthood and their differences in lifestyle and maturity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4OaXw2MW97VvIiZE0Sbn1NfxSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4964'),
  ('193213112407779731', 'Knocking', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Frida Kempff, Hannes Krantz', 'Emma Broström', 'Cecilia Milocco, Krister Kern, Albin Grenholm, Ville Virtanen, Alexander Salzberger, Charlotta Åkerblom, Emil Almén, Tobias Almborg', null, 'After suffering a traumatic incident, Molly moves into a new apartment to begin her path to recovery, but it’s not long after her arrival that a series of persistent knocks and screams begin to wake her up at night.', 'After suffering a traumatic incident, Molly moves into a new apartment to begin her path to recovery, but it’s not long after her arrival that a series of persistent knocks and screams begin to wake her up at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blpgrB5znnSSMl1qISj98C3i4Dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776565'),
  ('484894936081388559', 'Knockout', 2011, 'Action, Family, Drama', 'Anne Wheeler, Mark D. Currie, Peter F. Woeste', 'Jack Nasser, Evan Jacobs', 'Steve Austin, Daniel Magder, Janet Kidder, Emma Grabinsky, Jaren Brandt Bartlett, Samuel Patrick Chu, Tess Atkins, Roman Podhora', null, 'Outsider and new kid Matthew desperately wants to join his high school''s boxing team, but resident bully and boxing champion Hector stands in his way. Facing constant torment, Matthew finds an unlikely ally in Dan, the school''s janitor and one-time amateur boxer. Together, they train for the biggest boxing match of Matthew''s life and discover what it truly means to be a winner.', 'Outsider and new kid Matthew desperately wants to join his high school''s boxing team, but resident bully and boxing champion Hector stands in his way. Facing constant torment, Matthew finds an unlikely ally in Dan, the school''s janitor and one-time amateur boxer. Together, they train for the biggest boxing match of Matthew''s life and discover what it truly means to be a winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0YX2BRhyGlwgs7xPNYJUbtJvVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58448'),
