  ('693596759397635350', 'Knucklebones', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mitch Wilson, Philip Roy', 'Mitch Wilson', 'Julin Jean, Tom Zembrod, Erin Marie Garrett, Summer Moore, Cameron Deane Stewart, Brian Tyler Cohen, Justin Arnold, Todd Jenkins', null, 'A group of bored college students unleash a murderous demon while playing a dice game made from human knucklebones.', 'A group of bored college students unleash a murderous demon while playing a dice game made from human knucklebones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YzUnyEcaPZmhvL2wdzuIIKKIuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407775'),
  ('1091775477274125335', 'Knuckledust', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'James Kermack, Pat Aldinger, Chris Malin', 'James Kermack', 'Moe Dunford, Kate Dickie, Gethin Anthony, Sébastien Foucan, Chris Patrick-Simpson, Guillaume Delaunay, Alex Ferns, Dave Bibby', null, 'When Police kicks open the doors of the elite underground fight club Knuckledust, they find seven levels of hell, filled with the dead bodies of countless fighters, assassins and goons. Only one man, beaten up to a pulp, is still breathing: Hard Eight.', 'When Police kicks open the doors of the elite underground fight club Knuckledust, they find seven levels of hell, filled with the dead bodies of countless fighters, assassins and goons. Only one man, beaten up to a pulp, is still breathing: Hard Eight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta9AEpL05L2pUzSoTDRh8S1mncs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749407'),
  ('658807860502486', 'Knucklehead', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael W. Watkins, Kenneth Zunder', 'Adam Rifkin, Bear Aderhold, Tom Sullivan', 'Mark Feuerstein, Dennis Farina, Melora Hardin, Paul Wight, Wendie Malick, Will Patton, Saul Rubinek, Rebecca Creskoff', 'PG-13', 'A fight promoter deeply in debt to his crooked rival and desperate for a new fighter catches a break when a 450 pound church handyman who has spent his entire life in an orphanage agrees to wrestle on behalf of his fellow orphans.', 'A fight promoter deeply in debt to his crooked rival and desperate for a new fighter catches a break when a 450 pound church handyman who has spent his entire life in an orphanage agrees to wrestle on behalf of his fellow orphans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr8ea5YtZHafTkxHWb2OE5ZSEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44946'),
