  ('54839383190113093', 'Kóblic', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Adriana Vior, Sebastián Borensztein, Rolo Pulpeiro', 'Sebastián Borensztein, Alejandro Ocón', 'Ricardo Darín, Oscar Martínez, Inma Cuesta, Marcos Cartoy Díaz, Miriam Odorico, Alejandro Magnone, Ariel Gigena, Bernardo Forteza', null, 'Colonia Helena, Argentina. The mysterious Tomás Kóblic, a former Navy pilot, works as a fumigator while dealing with his dark past and the intrigues of the corrupt police commissioner…', 'Colonia Helena, Argentina. The mysterious Tomás Kóblic, a former Navy pilot, works as a fumigator while dealing with his dark past and the intrigues of the corrupt police commissioner…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTpSCZ8VaqSyUkI3PhEQIHnYzbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391617'),
  ('650541753373199048', 'Kodachrome', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mark Raso, Alan Poon', 'Jonathan Tropper', 'Ed Harris, Jason Sudeikis, Elizabeth Olsen, Bruce Greenwood, Wendy Crewson, Dennis Haysbert, Gethin Anthony, Bill Lake', 'R', 'Matt Ryder is convinced to drive his estranged and dying father Benjamin Ryder cross country to deliver four old rolls of Kodachrome film to the last lab in the world that can develop them before it shuts down for good. Along with Ben''s nurse Zooey, the three navigate a world changing from analogue to digital while trying to put the past behind them.', 'Matt Ryder is convinced to drive his estranged and dying father Benjamin Ryder cross country to deliver four old rolls of Kodachrome film to the last lab in the world that can develop them before it shuts down for good. Along with Ben''s nurse Zooey, the three navigate a world changing from analogue to digital while trying to put the past behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mseyc8v3UD1DhaZ3kSdXs4Dj9Xf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419635'),
  ('199337301016025392', 'Kodachrome Two-Color Test Shots No. III', 1922, 'Documentary', 'John G. Capstaff', null, 'Hope Hampton, Mary Eaton, Mae Murray', null, 'This two-color (green-blue and red) film was produced as a demonstration reel at the Paragon Studios in Fort Lee, New Jersey, under the direction of Kodak scientist John Capstaff. It features leading actresses, including Mae Murray, Hope Hampton, and Mary Eaton, posing and miming for the camera to showcase the capability of the complex Kodachrome process to capture their translucent movie star complexions and colorful, high-fashion clothing.', 'This two-color (green-blue and red) film was produced as a demonstration reel at the Paragon Studios in Fort Lee, New Jersey, under the direction of Kodak scientist John Capstaff. It features leading actresses, including Mae Murray, Hope Hampton, and Mary Eaton, posing and miming for the camera to showcase the capability of the complex Kodachrome process to capture their translucent movie star complexions and colorful, high-fashion clothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMxDxTDIiN6tdAxItbPaXPms4CQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164127'),
  ('205249850693054717', 'Koeputkiaikuinen ja Simon enkelit', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Martti Kakko, Henrik Paersch, Timo Wäre', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Spede Pasanen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Simo Salminen, Tapio Hämäläinen, Olavi Ahonen, Helge Herala, Yrjö Tähtelä, Esa Pakarinen Jr.', null, 'Mathematician Mauno Mutikainen is accidentally pronounced dead as a result of an operation where a splinter is being removed from his finger. He is then cloned into a test-tube adult named Richard Ilyevitch Jyrä by his creator Dr. Jyrä.', 'Mathematician Mauno Mutikainen is accidentally pronounced dead as a result of an operation where a splinter is being removed from his finger. He is then cloned into a test-tube adult named Richard Ilyevitch Jyrä by his creator Dr. Jyrä.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9KolsNLLwd2LBwuXTJCz9Ccaso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36772'),
  ('293164130186981257', 'Kohlhiesel''s Daughters', 1920, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Hanns Kräly, Ernst Lubitsch', 'Emil Jannings, Henny Porten, Jakob Tiedtke, Gustav von Wangenheim, Willy Prager', null, 'Somewhere in Southern Bavaria Xaver wants to marry Gretel, but her father Kohlhiesel wants his elder daughter Liesel to marry first. The problem is, nobody wants to marry her, because she is too brutal. Seppel suggests, that he should marry Liesel first, get rid of her and then he can marry Gretel...', 'Somewhere in Southern Bavaria Xaver wants to marry Gretel, but her father Kohlhiesel wants his elder daughter Liesel to marry first. The problem is, nobody wants to marry her, because she is too brutal. Seppel suggests, that he should marry Liesel first, get rid of her and then he can marry Gretel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9B2QCBV9evODqPMxkDJqsQ6T6rx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175204'),
  ('894629560222120408', 'Kohlhiesel''s Daughters', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Axel von Ambesser, Willy Winterstein', 'Eckart Hachfeld', 'Liselotte Pulver, Helmut Schmid, Dietmar Schönherr, Heinrich Gretler, Peter Vogel, Alexa von Porembsky, Franz-Otto Krüger, Adeline Wagner', null, 'Landlord Kohlhiesl has two twin daughters that nevertheless couldn''t be more different: Liesel is beautiful, feminine, sophisticated, educated and in love with a fellow, Toni, from back home. The other daughter, Susi, is clumsy, masculine, never left home and wants nothing to do with men. Liesel would dearly love to marry Tony, but her father refuses to allow the wedding until her sister Susi has found a husband first...', 'Landlord Kohlhiesl has two twin daughters that nevertheless couldn''t be more different: Liesel is beautiful, feminine, sophisticated, educated and in love with a fellow, Toni, from back home. The other daughter, Susi, is clumsy, masculine, never left home and wants nothing to do with men. Liesel would dearly love to marry Tony, but her father refuses to allow the wedding until her sister Susi has found a husband first...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aL9VDpRq8IXldhd2DrDfHpQgEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79252'),
  ('547122802378782098', 'Koi... Mil Gaya', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Rakesh Roshan, Harish Khatri, Jaideep Sen', 'Sachin Bhowmick, Robin Bhatt, Rakesh Roshan', 'Hrithik Roshan, Preity Zinta, Rekha, Indravardhan Purohit, Anuj Pandit Sharma, Hansika Motwani, Mohit Makkad, Jay Choksi', null, 'A developmentally disabled boy''s life changes after he encounters an extraterrestrial being.', 'A developmentally disabled boy''s life changes after he encounters an extraterrestrial being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iJVauDYcYxRRGciTmAOSjiATf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25516'),
  ('388893066627038494', 'Koko Flanel', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stijn Coninx, Jef Van de Water', 'Alain Berliner, W.L. Luk Janssen', 'Urbanus, Bea Van Der Maet, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Herbert Flack, Jan Decleir, Ann Petersen, Henri Garcin, Leontine Nelissen', null, 'Placide''s dad tells him on his deathbed he''ll haunt Placide if he doesn''t find a wife soon. Placide cautiously agrees, but he only wants to settle for a very beautiful woman. That might be easier said than done, since he is a vagabond. When he accidentally enters a photo shoot, Placide meets Sarah. He falls in love, but she is way out of his reach.', 'Placide''s dad tells him on his deathbed he''ll haunt Placide if he doesn''t find a wife soon. Placide cautiously agrees, but he only wants to settle for a very beautiful woman. That might be easier said than done, since he is a vagabond. When he accidentally enters a photo shoot, Placide meets Sarah. He falls in love, but she is way out of his reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Uabrib0sNCQno7p3owSg1dU9dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35016'),
  ('430087605471276704', 'Koko-di Koko-da', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Johannes Nyholm, Tobias Höiem-Flyckt, Johan Lundborg', 'Johannes Nyholm', 'Leif Edlund, Ylva Gallon, Peter Belli, Katarina Jacobson, Morad Baloo Khatchadorian, Brandy Litmanen, Stine Bruun, Martin Knudsen', null, 'As a couple goes on a trip to find their way back to each other, a sideshow artist and his shady entourage emerge from the woods, terrorizing them, luring them deeper into a maelstrom of psychological terror and humiliating slapstick.', 'As a couple goes on a trip to find their way back to each other, a sideshow artist and his shady entourage emerge from the woods, terrorizing them, luring them deeper into a maelstrom of psychological terror and humiliating slapstick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNHpioGHmg1d8EFsEH0KAbRNUGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565373'),
  ('490194389207618029', 'Koko: A Talking Gorilla', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Barbet Schroeder, George Paul Csicsery, Néstor Almendros', null, 'Penny Patterson, Koko, Saul Kitchener, Carl Pribram, Roger Fouts', null, 'A documentary that follows Dr. Penny Patterson''s current scientific study of Koko, a gorilla who communicates through American Sign Language.', 'A documentary that follows Dr. Penny Patterson''s current scientific study of Koko, a gorilla who communicates through American Sign Language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJPDdTkisIZYXBuH0LCyb7CJb8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54194'),
  ('834556108344895727', 'KoKo''s Earth Control', 1928, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, null, null, 'Ko-Ko the Clown and his dog Fitz walk into a building where levers that control various aspects of the Earth are located. After Fitz presses a particular lever, the world goes topsy-turvy and out-of-control. Note that this cartoon contains strobe flashing.', 'Ko-Ko the Clown and his dog Fitz walk into a building where levers that control various aspects of the Earth are located. After Fitz presses a particular lever, the world goes topsy-turvy and out-of-control. Note that this cartoon contains strobe flashing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9wsVu4jCVs7FC6KAf3nxoRFMg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134757'),
  ('1088756823139756309', 'Kokoda', 2006, 'Action, History, War', 'Jules O''Loughlin, Alister Grierson', 'Alister Grierson, John Lonie', 'Jack Finsterer, Travis McMahon, Simon Stone, Luke Ford, Tom Budge, Steve Le Marquand, Angus Sampson, Christopher James Baker', null, 'A bitter battle is fought between Australian and Japanese soldiers along the Kokoda trail in New Guinea during World War II.', 'A bitter battle is fought between Australian and Japanese soldiers along the Kokoda trail in New Guinea during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99XSpD5ItqGbwECfpspHWQRkwXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9774'),
  ('339048952828698551', 'Kokoda Front Line!', 1942, 'Documentary, War', 'Damien Parer, Ken G. Hall', null, 'Damien Parer', null, 'This iconic and Academy Award-winning newsreel shot by Damien Parer contains some of the most recognised images of Australian troops in the Second World War.', 'This iconic and Academy Award-winning newsreel shot by Damien Parer contains some of the most recognised images of Australian troops in the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggejanvxbBPxSDPI8cHX14dbEYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93331'),
  ('496549137711340135', 'Kokoloko', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gerardo Naranjo, Gerardo Naranjo, José Stempa', 'Gerardo Naranjo', 'Alejandra Herrera, Noé Hernández, Eduardo Mendizabal, Alonso Echánove, Betsabel Ordoñez López', null, 'Marisol (Alejandra Herrera) is caught between her possessive and aggressive cousin, Mauro (Eduardo Mendizábal), and passionate but inert lover, Mundo (Noé Hernández). Violence is a constant presence in their rural Mexican town, with gangs and guerilla fighters a steady presence. When Mundo has to flee, their connection turns from physical to digital even when Marisol is held captive by her cousin. Their communication via text, voicemail, and video is sporadic and frustrating, but is nevertheless a source of comfort, and their longing remains intense despite the distance. When Mundo returns, the stakes for Marisol are even higher, and it''s no longer a question of whether things will come to a head, but how and when. Might their desire and desperation ultimately play to her advantage?', 'Marisol (Alejandra Herrera) is caught between her possessive and aggressive cousin, Mauro (Eduardo Mendizábal), and passionate but inert lover, Mundo (Noé Hernández). Violence is a constant presence in their rural Mexican town, with gangs and guerilla fighters a steady presence. When Mundo has to flee, their connection turns from physical to digital even when Marisol is held captive by her cousin. Their communication via text, voicemail, and video is sporadic and frustrating, but is nevertheless a source of comfort, and their longing remains intense despite the distance. When Mundo returns, the stakes for Marisol are even higher, and it''s no longer a question of whether things will come to a head, but how and when. Might their desire and desperation ultimately play to her advantage?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wvgzGwQYBV87whQj4SOgySorWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694079'),
  ('280359769004727991', 'Kokomo City', 2023, 'Documentary', 'D. Smith, D. Smith', null, 'Daniella Carter, Dominique Silver, Koko Da Doll, Liyah Mitchell, Bancroft Fitzgerald, Lexx Pharaoh, Bebe Smith, Michael Carlos Jones', 'R', 'Four Black transgender sex workers in Atlanta and New York City break down the walls of their profession.', 'Four Black transgender sex workers in Atlanta and New York City break down the walls of their profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6xJwNiO80OfA3YPwcJvtqWNgic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058678'),
  ('67810564312396946', 'Kokoro', 2016, 'Drama', 'Vanja D''Alcantara, Ruben Impens', 'Vanja D''Alcantara, Emmanuelle Beaugrand-Champagne, Gilles Taurand', 'Isabelle Carré, Jun Kunimura, Niels Schneider, Fabrizio Rongione, Mugi Kadowaki, Masanobu Ando', null, 'After her brother''s death, Alice leave France for Japan and takes refuge in a small village just above the cliffs. Her brother Nathan said to her before he died that he finally founded peace there thanks to a certain Daïsuké. Following his footsteps, Alice will in fact find herself, in a strange and hostile but warm place.', 'After her brother''s death, Alice leave France for Japan and takes refuge in a small village just above the cliffs. Her brother Nathan said to her before he died that he finally founded peace there thanks to a certain Daïsuké. Following his footsteps, Alice will in fact find herself, in a strange and hostile but warm place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geFL10TUJ96QQEAJdktg17P6iC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393694'),
  ('932962802672540696', 'Kokowääh', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Til Schweiger, Christof Wahl, Torsten Künstler', 'Til Schweiger', 'Til Schweiger, Emma Schweiger, Jasmin Gerat, Samuel Finzi, Sanny van Heteren, Birthe Wolter, Friederike Kempter, Sönke Möhring', null, 'Henry is a playboy who has no idea that he is the father of a beautiful, cute girl out of a One-night-Stand. Her mother left the daughter in front of Henry door after her husband realized after 8 years of marriage that he is not the father so their relationship now is breaking up... By the way: Kokowääh, is how a German (in this case an 8 Year old child) that has never heard the dish before - would pronounce "Coq Au Vin" (chicken in a wine sauce).', 'Henry is a playboy who has no idea that he is the father of a beautiful, cute girl out of a One-night-Stand. Her mother left the daughter in front of Henry door after her husband realized after 8 years of marriage that he is not the father so their relationship now is breaking up... By the way: Kokowääh, is how a German (in this case an 8 Year old child) that has never heard the dish before - would pronounce "Coq Au Vin" (chicken in a wine sauce).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1xlGUJhPlqRa1FF6Uw73UXuEUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53174'),
  ('545147325491330067', 'Kokowääh 2', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Til Schweiger, Torsten Künstler, Adrian Cranage', 'Til Schweiger', 'Til Schweiger, Emma Schweiger, Jasmin Gerat, Samuel Finzi, Nico Liersch, Matthias Schweighöfer, Julia Jentsch, Steffen Wink', null, 'Who said a patchwork family is without problems? Two years after the turbulence of Kokowääh, everyday life turns to everyday chaos…', 'Who said a patchwork family is without problems? Two years after the turbulence of Kokowääh, everyday life turns to everyday chaos…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwaouRPtEF5Vc5nLA9QvFkwbjhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170759'),
  ('859126571039054734', 'Kokuho', 2025, 'Drama', 'Sang-il Lee, Sofian El Fani, Masunobu Motokawa', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Ryo Yoshizawa, Ryusei Yokohama, Mitsuki Takahata, Shinobu Terajima, Soya Kurokawa, Keitatsu Koshiyama, Min Tanaka, Ken Watanabe', 'NR', 'Nagasaki, 1964: Following the death of his yakuza father, 15-year-old Kikuo is taken under the wing of a famous kabuki actor. Alongside Shunsuke, the actor’s only son, he decides to dedicate himself to this traditional form of theatre. For decades, the two young men grow and evolve together – and one will become the greatest Japanese master of the art of kabuki.', 'Nagasaki, 1964: Following the death of his yakuza father, 15-year-old Kikuo is taken under the wing of a famous kabuki actor. Alongside Shunsuke, the actor’s only son, he decides to dedicate himself to this traditional form of theatre. For decades, the two young men grow and evolve together – and one will become the greatest Japanese master of the art of kabuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a15F5KJ4mleusJR1YKP4zUyZaxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1379266'),
  ('843979406327430999', 'Kolberg', 1945, 'War, History, Drama', 'Veit Harlan, Bruno Mondi', 'Alfred Braun, Veit Harlan', 'Heinrich George, Kristina Söderbaum, Horst Caspar, Gustav Diessl, Paul Wegener, Claus Clausen, Irene von Meyendorff, Paul Bildt', null, 'During Napoleon''s victorious campaign in Germany, the city of Kolberg gets isolated from the retreating Prussian forces. The population of Kolberg refuses to capitulate and organizes the resistance against the French army, which immediately submits the city to massive bombardments.', 'During Napoleon''s victorious campaign in Germany, the city of Kolberg gets isolated from the retreating Prussian forces. The population of Kolberg refuses to capitulate and organizes the resistance against the French army, which immediately submits the city to massive bombardments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgvelWFAN25rGf4BFwK1btv9Idm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8418'),
