  ('1082472785429321641', 'Kolobos', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Liatowitsch, David Todd Ocvirk, Yoram Astrakhan', 'Nne Ebong, David Todd Ocvirk, Daniel Liatowitsch', 'Amy Weber, Donny Terranova, Nichole Pelerine, John Fairlie, Promise LaMarco, Ilia Volok, Linnea Quigley, Mari Weiss', 'R', 'Five young individuals agree to live in an isolated lodge together and have their daily activities filmed. But soon the house is locked down and they each run into the murderous clutches of a faceless serial killer who may not be working alone.', 'Five young individuals agree to live in an isolated lodge together and have their daily activities filmed. But soon the house is locked down and they each run into the murderous clutches of a faceless serial killer who may not be working alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz71EgLOHD7j2SgMdGVrz9d3bfM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40129'),
  ('696250308540109862', 'Kolpachino 3: Chain', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Şafak Sezer', 'Şafak Sezer', 'Şafak Sezer, Aydemir Akbaş, Erkan Petekkaya, Ali Çatalbaş, Kubilay Penbeklioğlu, Ebubekir Öztürk, Serkan Şengül, Volkan Başaran', null, 'Özgür accidentally comes across the money of a mafia leader.', 'Özgür accidentally comes across the money of a mafia leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8kWG7jAJjoAGlsSwX7CXrmXoAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400852'),
  ('589847020222178716', 'Kolpaçino', 2009, 'Action, Comedy', 'Feza Çaldıran, Atıl İnaç', 'Şafak Sezer, Suat Ozkan, Kaan Ertem', 'Şafak Sezer, Aydemir Akbaş, Ali Çatalbaş, Ali Sürmeli, Hakan Ural, Eriş Akman, Abidin Yerebakan, Ebubekir Öztürk', null, 'Lives of several low-level gangsters get intertwined after a game of craps in their underground casino ends in a bloody shootout.', 'Lives of several low-level gangsters get intertwined after a game of craps in their underground casino ends in a bloody shootout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nM2gv65hZbPWnnFp8q3AJiBuV3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50025'),
  ('754956774854515404', 'Kolpaçino: Bomba', 2011, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Şafak Sezer', null, 'Şafak Sezer, Aydemir Akbaş, Ali Çatalbaş, Arzu Yanardağ, Kubilay Penbeklioğlu, Tuğba Melis Türk, Mehmet Ali Kaptanlar, Orhan Aydın', null, 'Born into a wealthy family, Özgür is unhappy with his life. Neither he sees support from his stingy father, nor from his rich father-in-law. Özgür''s love from the past, Sale, expects financial support for the album to be released.', 'Born into a wealthy family, Özgür is unhappy with his life. Neither he sees support from his stingy father, nor from his rich father-in-law. Özgür''s love from the past, Sale, expects financial support for the album to be released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLMYsy2QUXmiExXfujDSuJufJqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75640'),
  ('568416457146186894', 'Koltuk Belası', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Abdullah Gürek, Aysun Sımsıkı', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Sema Çeyrekbaşı, Berna Laçin, Hüseyin Köroğlu, Cem Meto, Gökhan Mete, Erdoğan Aytekin, Uluer Süer', null, 'Political satire comedy featuring the memories of a red leather chair. He is aware that no matter who the next governor will be, more corrupted will the system get. But only until the last governor who decides to set him on fire.', 'Political satire comedy featuring the memories of a red leather chair. He is aware that no matter who the next governor will be, more corrupted will the system get. But only until the last governor who decides to set him on fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45pznsFlu7T7STFpsCGalgXCqZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436068'),
  ('887072366504835874', 'Kolya', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jan Svěrák, Vladimír Smutný, David Rauch', 'Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Andrei Khalimon, Libuše Šafránková, Ondřej Vetchý, Stella Zázvorková, Ladislav Smoljak, Irina Bezrukova, Silvia Šuvadová', null, 'After a fictitious marriage with a Russian emigrant, Cellisten Louka, a Czech man, must suddenly take responsibility for her son. However, it’s not long before the communication barrier is broken between the two new family members.', 'After a fictitious marriage with a Russian emigrant, Cellisten Louka, a Czech man, must suddenly take responsibility for her son. However, it’s not long before the communication barrier is broken between the two new family members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fB0cGiEOngfsfyDHXIpFOmEwFgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784'),
  ('981942347074068977', 'Koma', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin', 'Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Andy Hui Chi-On, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Liu Kai-Chi, Roy Chow Hin-Yeung, Annie Man Chung-Han, Monica Mok Siu-Kei', null, 'A horrid crime was committed at a wedding reception and bridesmaid Chi Ching was the lone eyewitness. At the police station, she recognised the suspect, Suen Ling, in a line up. She also discovered the affair between this stranger and her lover. All of a sudden the emotional turmoil surrounding her chronic illness resurfaced and quickly grew beyond control.', 'A horrid crime was committed at a wedding reception and bridesmaid Chi Ching was the lone eyewitness. At the police station, she recognised the suspect, Suen Ling, in a line up. She also discovered the affair between this stranger and her lover. All of a sudden the emotional turmoil surrounding her chronic illness resurfaced and quickly grew beyond control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4rbbJseIrDJgoecqEyngwOi5v2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40976'),
  ('271192106220718985', 'Komada – A Whisky Family', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Satoshi Namiki, Motonari Ichikawa, Masayuki Yoshihara', 'Muneo Nakamoto, Yukito Kizawa', 'Saori Hayami, Kensho Ono, Maaya Uchida, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Shinpachi Tsuji, Kenichi Suzumura, Kenyu Horiuchi, Kikuko Inoue', null, 'Kotaro visits Komada Distillery for a project on Japanese craft whisky. Led by young female president Rui, who took over the family business, the distillery works hard to reproduce its signature whisky, Koma, which they had to stop making years ago. However, not to mention financial backing, too many clues are missing to revive the once lost whisky.', 'Kotaro visits Komada Distillery for a project on Japanese craft whisky. Led by young female president Rui, who took over the family business, the distillery works hard to reproduce its signature whisky, Koma, which they had to stop making years ago. However, not to mention financial backing, too many clues are missing to revive the once lost whisky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dkLLrNDqrDh2pOPs1UZppDUBP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119211'),
  ('508004550012234185', 'Komisches Reck', 1895, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Max Skladanowsky', null, null, null, 'Part of the Wintergartenprogramm.', 'Part of the Wintergartenprogramm.', null, 'tmdb:movie:194082'),
  ('1105441633547517395', 'Kommt ein Vogel geflogen', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Werner, Aleksandra Medianikova', 'Stefanie Fies', 'Britta Hammelstein, Hans Löw, Pola Friedrichs, Ulrike Krumbiegel, Michael Wittenborn, Andreas Nickl, Ralf Dittrich, Holger Stockhaus', null, 'When the animal keeper Birgit gifts her daughter Sarah a parrot, the joy is great. While Sarah is teased at school because of her speech impediment, the parrot provides her with a sense of security. But when the parrot suddenly begins to constantly spout Nazi slogans, it not only causes problems with Birgit''s Jewish in-laws, but also puts her in the crossfire of the media.', 'When the animal keeper Birgit gifts her daughter Sarah a parrot, the joy is great. While Sarah is teased at school because of her speech impediment, the parrot provides her with a sense of security. But when the parrot suddenly begins to constantly spout Nazi slogans, it not only causes problems with Birgit''s Jewish in-laws, but also puts her in the crossfire of the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95FIKDFKpG64j43Gtfv2I6p6xA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987135'),
  ('769691735033199116', 'Komodo', 1999, 'Adventure, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Michael Lantieri, Phil Cross, David Burr', 'Craig Mitchell, Hans Bauer', 'Kevin Zegers, Jill Hennessy, Billy Burke, Nina Landis, Paul Gleeson, Michael Edward-Stevens, Simon Westaway, Bruce Hughes', 'PG-13', 'During the 70''s, some Komodo Dragon eggs were dumped on an North Carolina island. Somehow, the baby Komodos survived, and twenty years later they have grown up and taken over the island for themselves. Young Patrick has lost his parents and his dog to the lizards, but didn''t see them himself, which has left him traumatized. Now, with his therapist Victoria, they return to confront his fears.', 'During the 70''s, some Komodo Dragon eggs were dumped on an North Carolina island. Somehow, the baby Komodos survived, and twenty years later they have grown up and taken over the island for themselves. Young Patrick has lost his parents and his dog to the lizards, but didn''t see them himself, which has left him traumatized. Now, with his therapist Victoria, they return to confront his fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4kNtYHFB1SbM8OrN206VlXVe2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25172'),
  ('817782953354336509', 'Komodo vs. Cobra', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jim Wynorski, Andrea V. Rossotto, Dan Golden', 'William Langlois, Jim Wynorski', 'Michael Paré, Michelle Borth, Ryan McTavish, Renee Talbert, Jerri Manthey, Ted Monte, Glori-Anne Gilbert, Rene Rivera', null, 'A team of environmentalists, including a reporter, her camera man, and an environmentalist''s famous girlfriend charter a boat and with the captain, sail to a military island. They suspect the island is hosting to illegal activities. Upon arrival, however, they find no one. They finally reach a deserted house, where they find Dr. Susan Richardson, who tells them that everyone on the island is dead, including her father. Richardson''s team were working on a compound that could make edible plants grow to super size, however the military intervened with plans of their own. They wanted to test the compound''s effects on animals, and proceeded to feed it to several komodo dragons and cobras.', 'A team of environmentalists, including a reporter, her camera man, and an environmentalist''s famous girlfriend charter a boat and with the captain, sail to a military island. They suspect the island is hosting to illegal activities. Upon arrival, however, they find no one. They finally reach a deserted house, where they find Dr. Susan Richardson, who tells them that everyone on the island is dead, including her father. Richardson''s team were working on a compound that could make edible plants grow to super size, however the military intervened with plans of their own. They wanted to test the compound''s effects on animals, and proceeded to feed it to several komodo dragons and cobras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dLwpe18MC3nIF5MmkWuB8waba9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28509'),
  ('67942292556602534', 'Kompromat', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Matias Boucard, Jérôme Salle, Dagnė Puodžiūnaitė', 'Jérôme Salle, Caryl Férey', 'Gilles Lellouche, Joanna Kulig, Mikhail Gorevoy, Sasha Piltsin, Mikhail Safronov, Oleksiy Horbunov, Igor Jijikine, Elisa Lasowski', null, 'Mathieu, a member of the French institute in Irkutsk, is arrested overnight by the Russian authorities. Imprisoned and accused of sexual abuse on his own daughter, he realises he is a victim of a Kompromat. With the help of the FSB, someone has built up a case to frame him. Isolated, he has no one to turn to. Proving his innocence is impossible: the only solution is to escape.', 'Mathieu, a member of the French institute in Irkutsk, is arrested overnight by the Russian authorities. Imprisoned and accused of sexual abuse on his own daughter, he realises he is a victim of a Kompromat. With the help of the FSB, someone has built up a case to frame him. Isolated, he has no one to turn to. Proving his innocence is impossible: the only solution is to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OimOLolZ94sy0KVmimRxqfxy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852427'),
  ('954978207892015891', 'Kon-Tiki', 1950, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Thor Heyerdahl, Thor Heyerdahl, Erik Hesselberg', 'Thor Heyerdahl', 'Thor Heyerdahl, Herman Watzinger, Erik Hesselberg, Knut Haugland, Torstein Raaby, Bengt Danielsson, Ben Grauer', null, '"Kon-Tiki" was the name of a wooden raft used by six Scandinavian scientists, led by Thor Heyerdahl, to make a 101-day journey from South America to the Polynesian Islands. The purpose of the expedition was to prove Heyerdal''s theory that the Polynesian Islands were populated from the east- specifically Peru- rather than from the west (Asia) as had been the theory for hundreds of years. Heyerdahl made a study of the winds and tides in the Pacific, and by simulating conditions as closely as possible to those he theorized the Peruvians encountered, set out on the voyage.', '"Kon-Tiki" was the name of a wooden raft used by six Scandinavian scientists, led by Thor Heyerdahl, to make a 101-day journey from South America to the Polynesian Islands. The purpose of the expedition was to prove Heyerdal''s theory that the Polynesian Islands were populated from the east- specifically Peru- rather than from the west (Asia) as had been the theory for hundreds of years. Heyerdahl made a study of the winds and tides in the Pacific, and by simulating conditions as closely as possible to those he theorized the Peruvians encountered, set out on the voyage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGdy7EkyQ9LCpuLptEII5kwjB5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20088'),
  ('14347512965385094', 'Kon-Tiki', 2012, 'Adventure, History', 'Joachim Rønning, Espen Sandberg, Geir Hartly Andreassen', 'Petter Skavlan', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Tobias Santelmann, Gustaf Skarsgård, Odd-Magnus Williamson, Jakob Oftebro, Agnes Kittelsen, Manuel Cauchi', 'PG-13', 'The true story about legendary explorer Thor Heyerdahl and his epic crossing of the Pacific on a balsa wood raft in 1947, in an effort to prove it was possible for South Americans to settle in Polynesia in pre-Columbian times.', 'The true story about legendary explorer Thor Heyerdahl and his epic crossing of the Pacific on a balsa wood raft in 1947, in an effort to prove it was possible for South Americans to settle in Polynesia in pre-Columbian times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tphF7lJZys5ij9BHivbxsqmPiOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70667'),
  ('40739228676280085', 'Kong: Skull Island', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jordan Vogt-Roberts, Larry Fong, Aashrita Kamath', 'Max Borenstein, Dan Gilroy, Derek Connolly', 'Tom Hiddleston, Samuel L. Jackson, John Goodman, Brie Larson, Jing Tian, Toby Kebbell, John Ortiz, Corey Hawkins', 'PG-13', 'Explore the mysterious and dangerous home of the king of the apes as a team of explorers ventures deep inside the treacherous, primordial island.', 'Explore the mysterious and dangerous home of the king of the apes as a team of explorers ventures deep inside the treacherous, primordial island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2517Vz9EhDhj88qwbDVj8DCRZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293167'),
  ('1095987516673406198', 'Konga', 1961, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Lemont, Desmond Dickinson', 'Herman Cohen, Aben Kandel', 'Michael Gough, Margo Johns, Jess Conrad, Claire Gordon, Austin Trevor, Jack Watson, George Pastell, Vanda Godsell', null, 'Dr. Decker returns from Africa after a year, presumed dead. In that year, he discovered a way of growing plants and animals to an enormous size. He brings back a baby chimpanzee to test out his theory. As he has many enemies at home, he decides to use his chimp, ''Konga'', to ''get rid of them''. Then Konga grows to gigantic proportions and wreaks havoc all over London!', 'Dr. Decker returns from Africa after a year, presumed dead. In that year, he discovered a way of growing plants and animals to an enormous size. He brings back a baby chimpanzee to test out his theory. As he has many enemies at home, he decides to use his chimp, ''Konga'', to ''get rid of them''. Then Konga grows to gigantic proportions and wreaks havoc all over London!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4LfBOfM02F8v5AL6Ff4INJ1miW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43023'),
  ('263289993233917356', 'Kongo', 1932, 'Drama, Adventure, Horror', 'William J. Cowen, Harold Rosson', 'Leon Gordon', 'Walter Huston, Lupe Vélez, Conrad Nagel, Virginia Bruce, C. Henry Gordon, Mitchell Lewis, Forrester Harvey, Curtis Nero', 'NR', 'The ruthless Flint, a disabled man, rules an isolated region of Kongo like an omnipotent god, through superstition and sadism, living only for the day when he can get revenge on the man who ruined his life.', 'The ruthless Flint, a disabled man, rules an isolated region of Kongo like an omnipotent god, through superstition and sadism, living only for the day when he can get revenge on the man who ruined his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mDntFmBDmQGLjKW21oIfrxFOst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84505'),
  ('753545998555001557', 'Konsul', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Julian Szczerkowski, Mirosław Bork', 'Mirosław Bork', 'Piotr Fronczewski, Maria Pakulnis, Krzysztof Zaleski, Gustaw Lutkiewicz, Grażyna Krukówna, Henryk Bista, Ryszard Kotys, Jerzy Schejbal', null, 'After a con-man is released from prison, he gradually gets back to his old tricks, but his cons grow ever more elaborate and travel steadily up the ladder of society until he has local politicians and important government ministers involved in his schemes.', 'After a con-man is released from prison, he gradually gets back to his old tricks, but his cons grow ever more elaborate and travel steadily up the ladder of society until he has local politicians and important government ministers involved in his schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wn06dTkkO1oElcr8YiTFQmvRYnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222653'),
  ('944110627017540179', 'Kontrabida Academy', 2025, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Chris Martinez, Ber Cruz, Roi Calilong', 'Chris Martinez', 'Eugene Domingo, Barbie Forteza, Jameson Blake, Michael De Mesa, Ysabel Ortega, Xyriel Manabat, Carmina Villarroel, Yasser Marta', 'PG-13', 'When a mysterious TV transports her to a school for on-screen villains, a restaurant worker finds new purpose — and a way to get back at her enemies.', 'When a mysterious TV transports her to a school for on-screen villains, a restaurant worker finds new purpose — and a way to get back at her enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiW2ff73RZzPABKtnjW5wmt43CU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1428213'),
  ('401050274627758095', 'Kontroll', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Nimród Antal, Gyula Pados, László Janicsek', 'Nimród Antal, Jim Adler', 'Sándor Csányi, Zoltán Mucsi, Csaba Pindroch, Sándor Badár, Zsolt Nagy, Balla Eszter, Lajos Kovács, Bence Mátyássy', 'R', 'A subway enforcement officer working in the oppressively gray Budapest metro gets a chance at love — but first he needs to find out why passengers are jumping — or being pushed — to their deaths onto the tracks.', 'A subway enforcement officer working in the oppressively gray Budapest metro gets a chance at love — but first he needs to find out why passengers are jumping — or being pushed — to their deaths onto the tracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEf7jXTm4oaI4YWTLlqQCukn63j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5204'),
  ('1019455672411249301', 'Kopftuchmafia - Ein Stinatz-Krimi', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Daniel Prochaska, Adrian Bidron', 'Stefan Hafner, Thomas Weingartner, Thomas Stipsits', 'Thomas Stipsits, Erika Deutinger, Linde Prelog, Erika Mottl, Gerhard Liebmann, Christoph Krutzler, Clemens Berndorff, Rainer Doppler', null, 'Something terrible happens at a Croatian wedding in the municipality of Stinatz: the bride disappears without a trace after “stealing the bride“. None of those present can explain what could have happened to her.', 'Something terrible happens at a Croatian wedding in the municipality of Stinatz: the bride disappears without a trace after “stealing the bride“. None of those present can explain what could have happened to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sS838dGWEbIKFTNNaPwK7Ov134l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1355389'),
  ('1061497717771077124', 'Kopps', 2003, 'Action, Comedy', 'Aril Wretblad, Josef Fares, Juan Perrona', 'Vasa, Mikael Håfström, Josef Fares', 'Fares Fares, Torkel Petersson, Göran Ragnerstam, Sissela Kyle, Eva Röse, Christian Fiedler, Erik Ahrnbom, Harry Goldstein', null, 'A small Swedish village, Högboträsk, is so peaceful that crime is nonexistent. The police spend their shifts drinking coffee, eating hot dogs and chasing down runaway cows. This is all well and good for the village''s own police, but the police management board wants to discontinue the local police force for lack of crime.', 'A small Swedish village, Högboträsk, is so peaceful that crime is nonexistent. The police spend their shifts drinking coffee, eating hot dogs and chasing down runaway cows. This is all well and good for the village''s own police, but the police management board wants to discontinue the local police force for lack of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKHXQGqnr1pVfKWv8vGPgWusWuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9256'),
  ('775578054747432721', 'Korczak', 1990, 'Drama, History, War', 'Andrzej Wajda, Robby Müller', 'Agnieszka Holland', 'Wojciech Pszoniak, Ewa Dałkowska, Teresa Budzisz-Krzyżanowska, Marzena Trybała, Piotr Kozłowski, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Jan Peszek, Aleksander Bardini', null, 'The story of Polish pedagogue Janusz Korczak and his dedication to protecting Jewish orphans during the war.', 'The story of Polish pedagogue Janusz Korczak and his dedication to protecting Jewish orphans during the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP0UUZ7AUP711WRSkj3uGM3r2hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47430'),
  ('979422319998123401', 'Korengal', 2014, 'Documentary, War', 'Sebastian Junger', null, 'LaMonta Caldwell, Sterling Jones, Dan Kearney, Juan "Doc" Restrepo, Aron Hijar', 'R', 'Korengal picks up where Restrepo left off; the same men, the same valley, the same commanders, but a very different look at the experience of war.', 'Korengal picks up where Restrepo left off; the same men, the same valley, the same commanders, but a very different look at the experience of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTJF1NOX0HYCRmiuM42F7qjZOxW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267872'),
  ('327848371971823922', 'Korgoth of Barbaria', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Genndy Tartakovsky, Aaron Springer', 'Aaron Springer', 'Diedrich Bader, Corey Burton, Craig Raisner, John DiMaggio, Tom Kenny, Susan Spano', null, 'In a dark future wasteland, the great cities have risen and fallen, primordial beasts have reclaimed the wilderness and thieves and savages populate sparse, dirty towns. From the frozen north emerges a warrior known as Korgoth, and his merciless savagery may be his only key to survival.', 'In a dark future wasteland, the great cities have risen and fallen, primordial beasts have reclaimed the wilderness and thieves and savages populate sparse, dirty towns. From the frozen north emerges a warrior known as Korgoth, and his merciless savagery may be his only key to survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHC5hCLZGRUarYmAiCOqcLGWHPd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278901'),
  ('1071303568752138937', 'Korkusuz Korkak', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Turgut Özatay, Yavuz Şeker, Hikmet Taşdemir, Ayşin Atav, Muhteşem Durukan, Zafer Önen, Rıza Pekkutsal', null, 'He is a civil servant in the bland state office. His whole life changes when his reports get mixed up in the hospital and he gets news that he''s going to die very soon.', 'He is a civil servant in the bland state office. His whole life changes when his reports get mixed up in the hospital and he gets news that he''s going to die very soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lGiT6xEoh423cASVv84NCug39C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123592'),
  ('791902010902387755', 'Koro-sensei Q!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Yoshihito Nishouji, Seiji Kishi', 'Makoto Uezu', 'Jun Fukuyama, Mai Fuchigami, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Ryota Osaka, Shizuka Itoh, Satomi Sato, Tomokazu Sugita, Chie Matsuura', null, 'In the alternate universe set in an RPG world, the students of Kunugigaoka Junior High School are heroes under training and students of Class 3-E are those with bug, making them weaker than other heroes. They ae tasked a defeat Koro-sensei, a Demon King who intentionally teaches them so they can defeat him one day.', 'In the alternate universe set in an RPG world, the students of Kunugigaoka Junior High School are heroes under training and students of Class 3-E are those with bug, making them weaker than other heroes. They ae tasked a defeat Koro-sensei, a Demon King who intentionally teaches them so they can defeat him one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywtsHHAveCvtDMz0ypnxfYtEHKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412380'),
  ('445881078007285553', 'Köroğlu', 1968, 'History, Adventure', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Gani Turanlı', 'Ayşe Şasa', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Fatma Girik, Hayati Hamzaoğlu, Reha Yurdakul, Mümtaz Ener, Hüseyin Baradan, Oktar Durukan, Aynur Akarsu', null, 'The epic tells about the life and heroic deeds of Koroghlu (literally "son of the blind man") as a hero of the people who struggled against unjust rulers, defending his clan or tribe.', 'The epic tells about the life and heroic deeds of Koroghlu (literally "son of the blind man") as a hero of the people who struggled against unjust rulers, defending his clan or tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vUF28u9S5sr9dscJuOuGCAQSAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272600'),
  ('214273244392968839', 'Korpur', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Arindam Sil, Anirban Chatterjee', 'Dipannita Roy', 'Rituparna Sengupta, Bratya Basu, Saheb Chatterjee, Kunal Ghosh, Ananya Banerjee', null, 'A university exam controller disappears in 1997 amid allegations of a 50-crore scam. The official story says she escaped to London, but a detective doubts it. Decades later, a reporter investigates what really happened.', 'A university exam controller disappears in 1997 amid allegations of a 50-crore scam. The official story says she escaped to London, but a detective doubts it. Decades later, a reporter investigates what really happened.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fbj1r88SgQDn6xxxwfrscg3SaoMX.jpg', 'plex:movie:korpur-2026'),
  ('362359112579262858', 'Köşeyi Dönen Adam', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Hüseyin Özşahin, Atıf Yılmaz, Sami Güçlü', 'Müjdat Gezen, Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Meral Orhonsay, Necla Soylu, Ali Şen, Sami Hazinses, Hüseyin Kutman, Necdet Yakın, Nejat Gürçen', null, 'Adem is working as a waiter and he gets fired at that moment he inherits a fortune from his rich uncle in USA. Women start to throw themselves at him, people try to use him, everyone acts nicer to him while he is try to manage his new life.', 'Adem is working as a waiter and he gets fired at that moment he inherits a fortune from his rich uncle in USA. Women start to throw themselves at him, people try to use him, everyone acts nicer to him while he is try to manage his new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s91rUg7CfIcLyyYzfuKbXuz9Dqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68108'),
  ('271796512149296389', 'Kosmos', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Reha Erdem, Selcen Ergun, Florent Herry', 'Reha Erdem', 'Sermet Yeşil, Türkü Turan, Serkan Keskin, Hakan Altuntaş, Akın Anlı, Sencar Sağdıç, Korel Kubilay, Cüneyt Yalaz', null, 'Kosmos is a thief and a miracle-worker. He appears one morning in a tiny, snowbound border village where he is welcomed with open arms – on account of arriving just in time to resuscitate a small boy who would otherwise have drowned.', 'Kosmos is a thief and a miracle-worker. He appears one morning in a tiny, snowbound border village where he is welcomed with open arms – on account of arriving just in time to resuscitate a small boy who would otherwise have drowned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vVT3FvGZ9l97cUUrDoQnqzdI9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43908'),
  ('230553678525453719', 'Kotch', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Lemmon, Richard H. Kline, Charles Dismukes', 'John Paxton', 'Walter Matthau, Deborah Winters, Felicia Farr, Charles Aidman, Ellen Geer, Donald Kowalski, Dean Kowalski, Arlen Stuart', null, 'When retired salesman Joseph Kotcher begins to feel pressure to move out of the house he shares with the family of his son, he opts to embark on a road trip instead of settling in a retirement home. Befriending Erica, a young pregnant woman and his grandson''s former nanny, Kotch begins to finds new meaning in life as he helps her prepare to welcome her baby into the world.', 'When retired salesman Joseph Kotcher begins to feel pressure to move out of the house he shares with the family of his son, he opts to embark on a road trip instead of settling in a retirement home. Befriending Erica, a young pregnant woman and his grandson''s former nanny, Kotch begins to finds new meaning in life as he helps her prepare to welcome her baby into the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPyMVlAD8F159i9uIyPgxwnmmLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76002'),
  ('779629560877784858', 'Kotoko', 2011, 'Drama, Horror', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Satoshi Hayashi, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Cocco', 'Cocco, Shinya Tsukamoto, Yuko Nakamura, Eiichi Takahashi, Ryugo Nakamura', null, 'Suffering from double vision, a single mother tries to take care of her baby in the grip of terrifying hallucinations. Experiencing a nervous breakdown, she is deemed unfit to take care of her child and has it taken away from her. The only respite the mother has from her visions is when she sings. An award-winning novelist overhears her singing whilst riding the bus and the pair subsequently develop a volatile relationship.', 'Suffering from double vision, a single mother tries to take care of her baby in the grip of terrifying hallucinations. Experiencing a nervous breakdown, she is deemed unfit to take care of her child and has it taken away from her. The only respite the mother has from her visions is when she sings. An award-winning novelist overhears her singing whilst riding the bus and the pair subsequently develop a volatile relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0oZUpUVJ3sMBbeyPqShaCdgQ1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85032'),
  ('766072657824933383', 'Kotsutsubo', 2012, 'Horror', 'Jirô Nagae, Tetsuya Kudô', 'Yoshimasa Akamatsu', 'Natsumi Matsubara, Ai Shinozaki, Rurika Yokoyama, Kenta Itogi, Kazuhiko Kanayama, Rina Miyazaki, Mamoru Tsubouchi', null, 'Eri (Matsubara) is a high school student who is anonymous unlike her friend Mitsuko (Yokoyama) who is the target of amorous advances from their teacher, Ichida (Tsubouchi). Eri comes across a novel way to protect Mitsuko: find a cursed funerary urn that contains ashes reputed to cause death and give said ashes to teacher.', 'Eri (Matsubara) is a high school student who is anonymous unlike her friend Mitsuko (Yokoyama) who is the target of amorous advances from their teacher, Ichida (Tsubouchi). Eri comes across a novel way to protect Mitsuko: find a cursed funerary urn that contains ashes reputed to cause death and give said ashes to teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cG2of5T6LrV2i4GfEBpizgyexef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230210'),
  ('297253664757308003', 'Kottayam Kunjachan', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'T S Suresh Babu, Anandakuttan', 'Dennis Joseph', 'Mammootty, Ranjini, Innocent, KPAC Lalitha, Usha, Babu Antony, Prathapa Chandran, Kunchan', null, 'Kottayam Kunjachan, a small-time thug, gets out of jail after serving a term of seven years for killing a person. Once out, he tries to lead a good life but gets embroiled with a family feud.', 'Kottayam Kunjachan, a small-time thug, gets out of jail after serving a term of seven years for killing a person. Once out, he tries to lead a good life but gets embroiled with a family feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4Ko3VPPdisZFmRnU7TuEgJAbsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278042'),
  ('402004836354731518', 'Koxa', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ekrem Engizek', null, 'Burak Doruk, Hivzo Lekovic, Tito Uysal', null, 'When Babo and his brother-in-law Memo, who is also part of Cenk''s clique, go in search of the alleged culprit Serkan, no one is aware yet of the effects this little dizziness would bring. Serkan is threatened, kidnapped, beaten and no longer moves. Memo panics, feels guilty and laments the dreams he has had for a long time and that he did not want all that. He confesses that he has consumed all the cocaine alone with Cenk and his friends, exposing lies to his brother-in-law. At the end of the film, Babo realizes that he may have killed an innocent man.', 'When Babo and his brother-in-law Memo, who is also part of Cenk''s clique, go in search of the alleged culprit Serkan, no one is aware yet of the effects this little dizziness would bring. Serkan is threatened, kidnapped, beaten and no longer moves. Memo panics, feels guilty and laments the dreams he has had for a long time and that he did not want all that. He confesses that he has consumed all the cocaine alone with Cenk and his friends, exposing lies to his brother-in-law. At the end of the film, Babo realizes that he may have killed an innocent man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u78TIRAJuP08s14cZxD7EzJwAVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486937'),
  ('860948911418290972', 'Koyaanisqatsi', 1983, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ron Fricke, Godfrey Reggio', 'Ron Fricke, Michael Hoenig, Alton Walpole', 'Ed Asner, Pat Benatar, Johnny Carson, Dick Cavett, Marilyn Chambers, Sammy Davis Jr., Lou Dobbs, Linda Ellerbee', 'NR', 'Takes us to locations all around the US and shows us the heavy toll that modern technology is having on humans and the earth. The visual tone poem contains neither dialogue nor a vocalized narration: its tone is set by the juxtaposition of images and the exceptional music by Philip Glass.', 'Takes us to locations all around the US and shows us the heavy toll that modern technology is having on humans and the earth. The visual tone poem contains neither dialogue nor a vocalized narration: its tone is set by the juxtaposition of images and the exceptional music by Philip Glass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zCNciRcob8lwuydVXgq0esla8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11314'),
  ('872329392914669408', 'Koyla', 1997, 'Action', 'Rakesh Roshan, Sameer Arya, Harish Khatri', 'Sachin Bhowmick', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Madhuri Dixit, Amrish Puri, Ranjeet Bedi, Salim Ghouse, Johny Lever, Deepshika Nagpal, Ashok Saraf', null, 'A village girl agrees to a marriage to a king she has never met after he sends her a photograph of himself. But the man in the photograph is not the king but his most loyal slave, the handsome but mute Shankar.', 'A village girl agrees to a marriage to a king she has never met after he sends her a photograph of himself. But the man in the photograph is not the king but his most loyal slave, the handsome but mute Shankar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP12AzvscPo6WfKdrkw1Nfv2KrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160265'),
  ('1085598683097253747', 'Kozara', 1962, 'War', 'Veljko Bulajić, Aleksandar Sekulović', 'Veljko Bulajić, Stevan Bulajić, Skender Kulenović', 'Bert Sotlar, Velimir Živojinović, Milena Dravić, Olivera Marković, Dragomir Felba, Ljubiša Samardžić, Mihajlo Kostić ''Pljaka'', Milan Milošević', null, 'In June of 1942 Germans and their collaborators decide to get rid of partisans and their stronghold in the woods of Mount Kozara in Northern Bosnia. They encircle the mountain and begin the mop up operation. Out gunned and outnumbered the partisans must not only take care of themselves but try to protect thousands of refugees too.', 'In June of 1942 Germans and their collaborators decide to get rid of partisans and their stronghold in the woods of Mount Kozara in Northern Bosnia. They encircle the mountain and begin the mop up operation. Out gunned and outnumbered the partisans must not only take care of themselves but try to protect thousands of refugees too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8ZS0F5QdhwCyBCNKbGyogsOAF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73059'),
  ('497384273228628932', 'KPop Demon Hunters', 2025, 'Fantasy, Music, Comedy, Animation', 'Chris Appelhans, Maggie Kang, Joshua Beveridge', 'Maggie Kang, Danya Jimenez, Hannah McMechan', 'Arden Cho, May Hong, Ji-young Yoo, Ahn Hyo-seop, Yunjin Kim, Ken Jeong, Lee Byung-hun, Daniel Dae Kim', 'PG', 'When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren''t selling out stadiums, they''re using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.', 'When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren''t selling out stadiums, they''re using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803796'),
  ('1029249616694866164', 'Kraa! The Sea Monster', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Aaron Osborne, Joe C. Maxwell, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Michael Guerin, Jerry Lentz, Jon Simanton, Alison Lohman, Jeff Rector, Teal Marchande, Stephen Martines, Leon W. Grant', null, 'Lord Doom, evil master of Proyas, the Dark Planet, sends Kraa the Sea Monster to Earth as part of his plan to dominate the galaxy. To keep the meddling hands of the Planet Patrol out of his scheme, he incapacitates their nearby space station. Fortunately, the alien agent Mogyar is on hand to land on Earth to stop the giant sea-beast. Accidentally landing in New Jersey rather than Italy (where scientists could have helped Mogyar build a weapon to stop Kraa), Mogyar must overcome his stereotypical Italian accent and strange appearance in order to ally with nearby humans to save the day.', 'Lord Doom, evil master of Proyas, the Dark Planet, sends Kraa the Sea Monster to Earth as part of his plan to dominate the galaxy. To keep the meddling hands of the Planet Patrol out of his scheme, he incapacitates their nearby space station. Fortunately, the alien agent Mogyar is on hand to land on Earth to stop the giant sea-beast. Accidentally landing in New Jersey rather than Italy (where scientists could have helped Mogyar build a weapon to stop Kraa), Mogyar must overcome his stereotypical Italian accent and strange appearance in order to ally with nearby humans to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0M0R6ZgytDuPAcv8YCbUwsrBq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106067'),
  ('1128886055422174212', 'Krabat', 2008, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Marco Kreuzpaintner, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Michael Gutmann, Marco Kreuzpaintner', 'David Kross, Daniel Brühl, Robert Stadlober, Hanno Koffler, Christian Redl, Paula Kalenberg, Anna Thalbach, Charly Hübner', null, 'A 14-year-old orphan named Krabat flees the horrors of the 30 Years War by becoming an apprentice to an ominous master of a mysterious mill. Krabat is not only taught the craft of milling, but is also instructed in the sinister world of the darker arts. When the life of his friend and protector is threatened, Krabat must struggle to free himself from an evil sorcerer''s control in a gripping fight for freedom, friendship and love.', 'A 14-year-old orphan named Krabat flees the horrors of the 30 Years War by becoming an apprentice to an ominous master of a mysterious mill. Krabat is not only taught the craft of milling, but is also instructed in the sinister world of the darker arts. When the life of his friend and protector is threatened, Krabat must struggle to free himself from an evil sorcerer''s control in a gripping fight for freedom, friendship and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDg4zqjdtSJOFbcqZMGlCD4Jv2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4627'),
  ('747395259167096973', 'Krack', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'G. K. Vishnu, Gopichand Malineni, Gulabi Srinu', 'Gopichand Malineni', 'Ravi Teja, Shruti Haasan, Samuthirakani, Varalaxmi Sarathkumar, P. Ravi Shankar, Posani Krishna Murali, Ali Basha, Mouryani', null, 'Pothuraju Veera Shankar is a hot-headed circle inspector from Andhra who doesn’t like to hear the word ‘background’. Wherever he is appointed in the state, he brings all the notorious gundas to their knees with his signature policing style. When Shankar is appointed in Ongole, the brutal Katari commits a spine-chilling murder and angers Shankar. How the rivalry between Pothuraju Veera Shankar and Katari turns worse is what Krack is all about.', 'Pothuraju Veera Shankar is a hot-headed circle inspector from Andhra who doesn’t like to hear the word ‘background’. Wherever he is appointed in the state, he brings all the notorious gundas to their knees with his signature policing style. When Shankar is appointed in Ongole, the brutal Katari commits a spine-chilling murder and angers Shankar. How the rivalry between Pothuraju Veera Shankar and Katari turns worse is what Krack is all about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMHGXVgtU9Vfb9Xg6S9SWShmRDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784572'),
  ('228765606474954326', 'Kraftwerk: Minimum-Maximum', 2005, 'Music', 'Ralf Hütter, Florian Schneider, Fritz Hilpert', null, 'Ralf Hütter, Henning Schmitz, Fritz Hilpert, Florian Schneider', null, 'Kraftwerk are one of the most influential bands in music history. Over the last two years, Ralf Hütter, Florian Schneider, Fritz Hilpert and Henning Schmitz have toured the world, performing approximately 90 live shows that were unlike anything seen before, prompting global headlines such as this from the London Evening Standard: Is This The Greatest Show London Has Ever Seen? Said performance at London''s Royal Festival Hall was also included in Time Out''s recent list of best shows ever witnessed in the Capital.', 'Kraftwerk are one of the most influential bands in music history. Over the last two years, Ralf Hütter, Florian Schneider, Fritz Hilpert and Henning Schmitz have toured the world, performing approximately 90 live shows that were unlike anything seen before, prompting global headlines such as this from the London Evening Standard: Is This The Greatest Show London Has Ever Seen? Said performance at London''s Royal Festival Hall was also included in Time Out''s recent list of best shows ever witnessed in the Capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BPcrnrHmEtZB53Jxeg7czgDeNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77906'),
  ('98967270606237363', 'Krakatit', 1948, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jindřich Polák, Otakar Vávra, Václav Hanuš', 'Jaroslav R. Vávra, Otakar Vávra', 'Karel Höger, Florence Marly, Jiří Plachý, Nataša Tanská, František Smolík, Miroslav Homola, Eduard Linkers, Vlasta Fabianová', null, 'In early 20th century Czechoslovakia, a gravely ill chemist recalls his discovery of a powerful explosive and how it landed in the hands of anarchists.', 'In early 20th century Czechoslovakia, a gravely ill chemist recalls his discovery of a powerful explosive and how it landed in the hands of anarchists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsAb8uhLbudYHaHpeaWuJmESR5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47393'),
  ('999292760138563680', 'Krakatoa, East of Java', 1969, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Bernard L. Kowalski, Manuel Berenguer', 'Bernard Gordon, Cliff Gould', 'Maximilian Schell, Diane Baker, Barbara Werle, Brian Keith, Sal Mineo, Rossano Brazzi, John Leyton, J.D. Cannon', 'G', 'A team of maritime salvage workers are about to embark on a recovery dive. However the 1883 Krakatoa Volcano eruption provides more pressing problems.', 'A team of maritime salvage workers are about to embark on a recovery dive. However the 1883 Krakatoa Volcano eruption provides more pressing problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c5Z9DkivG1JrpWuO3y4ILloG2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51104'),
  ('887568936969214732', 'Kraken', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Nikolay Lebedev, Sergey Machilsky, Aleksey Samodelko', 'Alexey Sidorov, Nikolay Lebedev', 'Alexander Petrov, Aleksey Guskov, Victor Dobronravov, Sergey Garmash, Diana Pozharskaya, Anton Rival, Aleksandr Ratnikov, Sergey Kempo', null, 'A Russian missile submarine disappears without trace during a secret mission in the Greenland Sea. A vessel is deployed to search for it, captained by the brother of the missing submarine’s commander. The search crew is tasked with locating the submarine and preventing a top-secret weapon from falling into enemy hands. Meanwhile, a geological research operation at the North Pole awakens the Kraken, a giant deep-water monster with an incredible ability to camouflage and an uncanny intelligence. As the search party narrows in on the missing submarine, they will encounter the legendary creature of the deep.', 'A Russian missile submarine disappears without trace during a secret mission in the Greenland Sea. A vessel is deployed to search for it, captained by the brother of the missing submarine’s commander. The search crew is tasked with locating the submarine and preventing a top-secret weapon from falling into enemy hands. Meanwhile, a geological research operation at the North Pole awakens the Kraken, a giant deep-water monster with an incredible ability to camouflage and an uncanny intelligence. As the search party narrows in on the missing submarine, they will encounter the legendary creature of the deep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c97Xlokfn4M6ZOQmt7OfXfLDwd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1258151'),
  ('22031743901444916', 'Kraken', 2026, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Pål Øie, Emeri Abel, Sjur Aarthun', 'Vilde Eide, Kjersti Helen Rasmussen, Natasha Arthur', 'Sara Khorami, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Ingvild Holthe Bygdnes, Øyvind Brandtzæg, Jenny Evensen, Steinar Klouman Hallert, Filip Bargee Ramberg, Jon Erik Myre', null, 'Marine biologist Johanne is doing research on a fish farm in Vangsnes, a rural community located by the fjord, when she encounters several strange occurrences. Along with the brutal deaths of two local teenagers, all signs point to the deep fjord; can there be more to the depths than the eye can see? At the bottom of the deepest fjord rests a mythical monster as large as a mountain, with a myriad of arms ready to crush and devour anything they can grab.', 'Marine biologist Johanne is doing research on a fish farm in Vangsnes, a rural community located by the fjord, when she encounters several strange occurrences. Along with the brutal deaths of two local teenagers, all signs point to the deep fjord; can there be more to the depths than the eye can see? At the bottom of the deepest fjord rests a mythical monster as large as a mountain, with a myriad of arms ready to crush and devour anything they can grab.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVsflOu9WpMqUJ3WwVX2mITi86S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110034'),
  ('1022825968962312559', 'Kraken: Tentacles of the Deep', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Tibor Takács, George Campbell, Craig Powell', 'Sean Keller, Nicholas Garland, Abram Cox', 'Charlie O''Connell, Victoria Pratt, Kristi Angus, Cory Monteith, Jack Scalia, Aleks Paunovic, Nicole McKay, Michal Yannai', null, 'Thirty years ago, Ray Reiter witnessed the brutal death of his parents at sea by a strange, octopus-like creature. Now determined to exact revenge, he joins archaeologist Nicole on a perilous high-seas expedition to find a legendary Greek Opal - said to be guarded by the very beast that murdered his family. As they come face to face with the killer Kraken, they must also battle a ruthless crime lord, who will stop at nothing to seize the coveted treasure for himself.', 'Thirty years ago, Ray Reiter witnessed the brutal death of his parents at sea by a strange, octopus-like creature. Now determined to exact revenge, he joins archaeologist Nicole on a perilous high-seas expedition to find a legendary Greek Opal - said to be guarded by the very beast that murdered his family. As they come face to face with the killer Kraken, they must also battle a ruthless crime lord, who will stop at nothing to seize the coveted treasure for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8myE7Y6hMijQg9Z2bsf9Sbpjr5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42905'),
  ('874004095897902640', 'Kramer vs. Kramer', 1979, 'Drama', 'Robert Benton, Néstor Almendros, Yudi Bennett', 'Robert Benton', 'Dustin Hoffman, Meryl Streep, Jane Alexander, Justin Henry, Howard Duff, George Coe, JoBeth Williams, Bill Moor', 'PG', 'Ted Kramer is a career man for whom his work comes before his family. His wife Joanna cannot take this anymore, so she decides to leave him. Ted is now faced with the tasks of housekeeping and taking care of himself and their young son Billy.', 'Ted Kramer is a career man for whom his work comes before his family. His wife Joanna cannot take this anymore, so she decides to leave him. Ted is now faced with the tasks of housekeeping and taking care of himself and their young son Billy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CUP5V5SWfHSK4qvkZF7lMNyugY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12102'),
  ('67368447944622472', 'Krampus', 2015, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Michael Dougherty, Jules O''Loughlin, Fabiano Petroni', 'Michael Dougherty, Zach Shields, Todd Casey', 'Adam Scott, Toni Collette, David Koechner, Allison Tolman, Conchata Ferrell, Emjay Anthony, Stefania LaVie Owen, Krista Stadler', 'PG-13', 'When his dysfunctional family clashes over the holidays, young Max is disillusioned and turns his back on Christmas. Little does he know, this lack of festive spirit has unleashed the wrath of Krampus: a demonic force of ancient evil intent on punishing non-believers.', 'When his dysfunctional family clashes over the holidays, young Max is disillusioned and turns his back on Christmas. Little does he know, this lack of festive spirit has unleashed the wrath of Krampus: a demonic force of ancient evil intent on punishing non-believers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzPCU6xQ2XQmD76cDVZPm5PZAaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287903'),
  ('609395878672101322', 'Krampus 2: The Devil Returns', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Jason Hull', 'A.J. Leslie, Jason Hull', 'Shawn C. Phillips, Melantha Blackthorne, R.A. Mihailoff, Tiffani Fest, Jason Hull, A.J. Leslie, Darren Barcomb, Michael Mili', null, 'Five years after the murder of his wife and disappearance of his daughter, former police officer Jeremy Duffin is brought back to help in the hunt for a yuletide monster that punishes children that have been "naughty." As the monster becomes more erratic and unpredictable, Jeremy learns the truth about the disappearance of his daughter and the fate that has been bestowed upon him by an unlikely source. Can Jeremy finally end the nightmare Christmas monster that has terrorized this town for years?', 'Five years after the murder of his wife and disappearance of his daughter, former police officer Jeremy Duffin is brought back to help in the hunt for a yuletide monster that punishes children that have been "naughty." As the monster becomes more erratic and unpredictable, Jeremy learns the truth about the disappearance of his daughter and the fate that has been bestowed upon him by an unlikely source. Can Jeremy finally end the nightmare Christmas monster that has terrorized this town for years?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRvTYDZ08mbXOPKx9tdYWNXdu9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419548'),
  ('930679833974358963', 'Krampus Origins', 2018, 'Horror', 'Joseph Mbah, Kodiak Darling, Joseph Mbah', 'Robert Conway', 'Maria Olsen, Anna Harr, Katie Peabody, Amelia Haberman, Shannyn Hall, Luke Waxman, Linda Cushma, Noah Clark', null, 'The first World War rages on when a group of American soldiers find a mysterious artifact that can summon the ancient evil of the Krampus. After the men are killed in action, the artifact is sent to the commanding officer''s widow who is a teacher at a small-town orphanage. The orphans accidentally summon the Krampus and the teacher, and her pupils are forced to battle this ancient evil.', 'The first World War rages on when a group of American soldiers find a mysterious artifact that can summon the ancient evil of the Krampus. After the men are killed in action, the artifact is sent to the commanding officer''s widow who is a teacher at a small-town orphanage. The orphans accidentally summon the Krampus and the teacher, and her pupils are forced to battle this ancient evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB7aWuuRWn3COLcYvlYaGchynaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559740'),
  ('768892601602015382', 'Krampus: The Reckoning', 2015, 'Horror', 'Robert Conway', 'Owen Conway, Robert Conway', 'Monica Engesser, Amelia Haberman, James Ray, Kevin Tye, Sean G.P. Anderson, Robert Conway, Carrie Fee', 'NR', 'Zoe, a strange child has a not so imaginary friend the Krampus who is the dark companion of St. Nicholas.', 'Zoe, a strange child has a not so imaginary friend the Krampus who is the dark companion of St. Nicholas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dK3meJUzjT06lY9LHbSTPqy9pG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366551'),
  ('531566653322722691', 'Krampus: The Return', 2022, 'Horror', 'David Gregory', 'Ben Daly', 'Amber Doig-Thorne, Natasha Rose Mills, Dan Robins, Stephen Staley, Charlie Esquér, Elspeth Foster, Osian Dixon', null, 'After Lisa''s brother mysteriously dies, she and her college friends go to her family home for answers. They are shocked to discover that his killer was non-other than the Christmas demon, Krampus.', 'After Lisa''s brother mysteriously dies, she and her college friends go to her family home for answers. They are shocked to discover that his killer was non-other than the Christmas demon, Krampus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tU6W3mjDZE1gJkNjVAF8qTSySCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985102'),
  ('497327826089822433', 'Krantijyoti Vidyalay Marathi Madhyam', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hemant Dhome, Satyajeet Shobha Shriram', 'Hemant Dhome', 'Nirmal Sharma, Ishwar Tarabai Andhare, Sachin Khedekar, Amey Wagh, Siddharth Chandekar', null, 'A Marathi school''s students and teachers navigate structural hardships and social pressures. Personal challenges merge with institutional struggles as they seek better futures. The school mirrors community change.', 'A Marathi school''s students and teachers navigate structural hardships and social pressures. Personal challenges merge with institutional struggles as they seek better futures. The school mirrors community change.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FxoswfeiBUEnWzBfixEvRbCUIwpV.jpg', 'plex:movie:krantijyoti-vidyalay-marathi-madhyam'),
  ('741277727869230742', 'Krantiveer', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Russi Billimoria, Mehul Kumar', 'K.K. Singh', 'Nana Patekar, Dimple Kapadia, Atul Agnihotri, Mamta Kulkarni, Farida Jalal, Paresh Rawal, Tinnu Anand, Danny Denzongpa', null, 'Lack-lustred and alcoholic Pratap Narayan Tilak is given a rude awakening when he meets with journalist Megha Dixit, and decides to instill some sense of justice and fair play within his community, and get them to assertively defend their rights and freedom. He is met with strong resistance, both from within his very own community, the police, and some very powerful and influential politicians. Unable to bear the injustice, and frustrated at his community to act proactively, Pratap decides to take the law into his own hands, resulting in chaos, violence, and uncertainty for everyone, and a path to his own grave.', 'Lack-lustred and alcoholic Pratap Narayan Tilak is given a rude awakening when he meets with journalist Megha Dixit, and decides to instill some sense of justice and fair play within his community, and get them to assertively defend their rights and freedom. He is met with strong resistance, both from within his very own community, the police, and some very powerful and influential politicians. Unable to bear the injustice, and frustrated at his community to act proactively, Pratap decides to take the law into his own hands, resulting in chaos, violence, and uncertainty for everyone, and a path to his own grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfVjv2SqiqgCfo0EWwLYjpgTlVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143980'),
  ('607290760223504074', 'Krass Klassenfahrt - Der Kinofilm', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Jakob Creutzburg, Vid Spindler, Daria Blažević', 'Felix Charin, Thore Fahrenbach', 'Jonas Ems, Sydney Amoo, Vivien König, Kayla Shyx, Jamie Birrell, Dela Dabulamanzi, Zejhun Demirov, Patrick Heinrich', null, 'Croatia is calling! The 12th grade of a Berlin high school is going on a graduation trip. Together with the stressed teacher Mrs. Gruber and the over-committed teacher Georg, the trip doesn''t start as planned: In the so-called Eco-Hostel the dream of an Insta-worthy beach vacation with endless parties seems to burst before it has even begun. Yet McLarry in particular had high hopes of distraction: he''s the only one who didn''t pass his A-levels and who can''t actually afford the class trip. He is also not yet over his breakup with Bella. But then the ray of hope - his favorite rapper and idol Zeno is also in Croatia! The perfect opportunity for McLarry to present him his own songs. Together with his best buddy Cornelius and Best Friends Bella and Alena, they break away from the class field trip and head to Zeno''s villa. With the hopelessly overtaxed chaperone Georg in tow, they embark on the gnarliest adventure of their lives...', 'Croatia is calling! The 12th grade of a Berlin high school is going on a graduation trip. Together with the stressed teacher Mrs. Gruber and the over-committed teacher Georg, the trip doesn''t start as planned: In the so-called Eco-Hostel the dream of an Insta-worthy beach vacation with endless parties seems to burst before it has even begun. Yet McLarry in particular had high hopes of distraction: he''s the only one who didn''t pass his A-levels and who can''t actually afford the class trip. He is also not yet over his breakup with Bella. But then the ray of hope - his favorite rapper and idol Zeno is also in Croatia! The perfect opportunity for McLarry to present him his own songs. Together with his best buddy Cornelius and Best Friends Bella and Alena, they break away from the class field trip and head to Zeno''s villa. With the hopelessly overtaxed chaperone Georg in tow, they embark on the gnarliest adventure of their lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eycS8Yl87iVcU0te57KNAVqKrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916507'),
  ('693282582843006539', 'Kraven the Hunter', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Ben Davis, Daryn McLaughlan, Nacho Tomás', 'Art Marcum, Matt Holloway, Richard Wenk', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Ariana DeBose, Fred Hechinger, Alessandro Nivola, Christopher Abbott, Russell Crowe, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Levi Miller', 'R', 'Kraven Kravinoff''s complex relationship with his ruthless gangster father, Nikolai, starts him down a path of vengeance with brutal consequences, motivating him to become not only the greatest hunter in the world, but also one of its most feared.', 'Kraven Kravinoff''s complex relationship with his ruthless gangster father, Nikolai, starts him down a path of vengeance with brutal consequences, motivating him to become not only the greatest hunter in the world, but also one of its most feared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GvBhRxY6MELDfxFrete6BNhBB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539972'),
  ('858520385015127906', 'Krazy House', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Steffen Haars, Flip van der Kuil, Joris Kerbosch', 'Steffen Haars, Flip van der Kuil', 'Nick Frost, Alicia Silverstone, Jan Bijvoet, Gaite Jansen, Walt Klink, Chris Peters, Matti Stooker, Kevin Connolly', null, 'When Russian workers in Bernie’s house turn out to be wanted criminals, Bernie has to man up and save his ’90s sitcom family.', 'When Russian workers in Bernie’s house turn out to be wanted criminals, Bernie has to man up and save his ’90s sitcom family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36gDjx56RDhjIpynKkrseJCJJDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607338'),
  ('395660839805151638', 'Krazzy 4', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jaideep Sen, Ajit Bhat', 'Ashwni Dhir', 'Arshad Warsi, Irrfan Khan, Suresh Menon, Rajpal Yadav, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Dia Mirza, Rajat Kapoor, Zakir Hussain', 'PG-13', '4 mental patients formulate the plan to rescue their kidnapped doctor and teach the kidnappers a lesson.', '4 mental patients formulate the plan to rescue their kidnapped doctor and teach the kidnappers a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8owptcZPbNIqugAHQOzawgRQM5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20832'),
  ('1028091651063510684', 'Kreivi', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Peter von Bagh, Lasse Naukkarinen', 'Peter von Bagh', 'Pertti Ylermi Lindgren, Irma Martinkauppi, Titta Karakorpi, Elina Salo, Kirsti Wallasvaara, Petra Frey, Kauko Helovirta, Kullervo Kalske', null, 'Pertti Ylermi Lindgren was engaged to 76 women, married none, but took the money of all. Lindgren is the real thing, as far as swindlers go. Peter von Bagh asked him to play himself in a film that would reconstruct some of his greatest moments, i.e. the most flamboyant stunts – and he agreed.', 'Pertti Ylermi Lindgren was engaged to 76 women, married none, but took the money of all. Lindgren is the real thing, as far as swindlers go. Peter von Bagh asked him to play himself in a film that would reconstruct some of his greatest moments, i.e. the most flamboyant stunts – and he agreed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvqOYagfx2MkluFarvl6RII9d1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161067'),
  ('261920729053922999', 'Krepkiy Oreshek', 1968, 'Romance, Comedy, War, Adventure', 'Samuil Rubashkin, Teodor Vulfovich, Viktor Zorin', 'Efraim Sevela', 'Nadezhda Rumyantseva, Vitali Solomin, Pavel Vinnik, Lidiya Dranovskaya, Mikaela Drozdovskaya, Vladimir Lippart, Valentin Abramov, Yuriy Sorokin', null, 'A comedy about young lieutenant Ivan and his all-girls air defense unit adventures during WWII.', 'A comedy about young lieutenant Ivan and his all-girls air defense unit adventures during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncN72zSYPNtlw3CaH5oidMnQxhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91276'),
