  ('902350320410169230', 'Kreutzer Sonata', 1987, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mikhail Shveitser, Mikhail Agranovich, Sofiya Milkina', 'Mikhail Shveitser', 'Oleg Yankovskiy, Aleksandr Trofimov, Irina Seleznyova, Sergei Erdenko, Alla Demidova, Aleksandr Kalyagin, Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Mikhail Gluzskiy', null, 'A revelatory discussion on a train. Based on Leo Tolstoy''s novel of the same name.', 'A revelatory discussion on a train. Based on Leo Tolstoy''s novel of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYQsQz19jrKYgoGk9Kwv2LP0mOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326833'),
  ('326569226613718980', 'Kriminal', 1966, 'Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Umberto Lenzi, Angelo Lotti', 'Umberto Lenzi, David Moreno Mingote', 'Glenn Saxson, Helga Liné, Andrea Bosic, Ivano Staccioli, Esmeralda Ruspoli, Dante Posani, Mary Arden, Franco Fantasia', null, 'A master criminal is pursued by inspector Milton', 'A master criminal is pursued by inspector Milton', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klzRI8jWgNm0yuRPgvFT56uTnA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107184'),
  ('1108438829815444759', 'Krippendorf''s Tribe', 1998, 'Comedy, Family', 'Todd Holland, Dean Cundey', 'Charlie Peters', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Jenna Elfman, Zakes Mokae, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Natasha Lyonne, Gregory Smith, Lily Tomlin, Stephen Root', 'PG-13', 'After squandering his grant money, despondent and recently widowed anthropologist James Krippendorf must produce hard evidence of the existence of a heretofore undiscovered New Guinea tribe. Grass skirts, makeup, and staged rituals transform his three troubled children into the Shelmikedmu, a primitive culture whose habits enthrall scholars. But when a spiteful rival threatens to blow the whistle on Krippendorf''s ruse, he gets into the act as well.', 'After squandering his grant money, despondent and recently widowed anthropologist James Krippendorf must produce hard evidence of the existence of a heretofore undiscovered New Guinea tribe. Grass skirts, makeup, and staged rituals transform his three troubled children into the Shelmikedmu, a primitive culture whose habits enthrall scholars. But when a spiteful rival threatens to blow the whistle on Krippendorf''s ruse, he gets into the act as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mmGI4O1gWYrwpPQ22hgHu9PkIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31220'),
  ('885689530278555768', 'Krisha', 2016, 'Drama', 'Drew Daniels, Trey Edward Shults', 'Trey Edward Shults', 'Krisha Fairchild, Alex Dobrenko, Robyn Fairchild, Chris Doubek, Victoria Fairchild, Bryan Casserly, Chase Joliet, Atheena Frizzell', 'R', 'When Krisha returns to her estranged family for Thanksgiving dinner, past demons threaten to ruin the festivities.', 'When Krisha returns to her estranged family for Thanksgiving dinner, past demons threaten to ruin the festivities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN4xhl5HYhfO9W8Y1ZZEnqmQEip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323929'),
  ('1052751571699093459', 'Krishna Cottage', 2004, 'Horror, Mystery, Romance', 'Santram Varma', 'Nirav Vidya, R. M. Joshi, Abhigyan Jha', 'Sohail Khan, Isha Koppikar, Anita Hassanandani Reddy, Vrajesh Hirjee, Hiten Tejwani, Divya Palat, Alihassan Turabi, Rati Agnihotri', null, 'After their car breaks down, a group of collegians are forced to take shelter in the mysterious Krishna Cottage for the night. Little do they know that the cottage is haunted by a spirit awaiting its lover.', 'After their car breaks down, a group of collegians are forced to take shelter in the mysterious Krishna Cottage for the night. Little do they know that the cottage is haunted by a spirit awaiting its lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j7Y5CyO10HxZEzCij9XcxmVYSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211105'),
  ('1109051014767551117', 'Krishnagudiyil Oru Pranayakalathu', 1997, 'Romance', 'Kamal, Lal Jose', 'Ranjith', 'Jayaram, Manju Warrier, Biju Menon, Balachandra Menon, Vinaya Prasad, Siddique, Narendra Prasad, Jagadish', null, 'Meenakshi who is confused between the word her father had given to Akhilachandran and her love.', 'Meenakshi who is confused between the word her father had given to Akhilachandran and her love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35Qhv857NBDkR1W78wOtRQEez6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351699'),
  ('568741969709818483', 'Kristian', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ferdinand Pečenka, Martin Frič', 'Eduard Šimáček, Josef Gruss', 'Oldřich Nový, Nataša Gollová, Raoul Schránil, Bedřich Veverka, Adina Mandlová, Jára Kohout, Anna Steimarová, Jaroslav Marvan', null, 'Alois Novák (Oldrich Nový), a minor clerk in a travel agency and the husband of a dowdy housewife Marenka (Natasa Gollová), lives a run-of-the-mill, dull life. In his soul, however, there resides an inextinguishable desire for adventure. And so once a month he poses as a playboy. As the mysterious and wealthy Mr. Kristian he goes to the exclusive Orient Bar where he does not skimp on generous tips and where he platonic-ally seduces beautiful and elegant women. In the salon he speaks of love and the magnificence of exotic lands, which he has supposedly come to know on his wanderings abroad. In reality he has read all of this in the travel agency''s brochures.', 'Alois Novák (Oldrich Nový), a minor clerk in a travel agency and the husband of a dowdy housewife Marenka (Natasa Gollová), lives a run-of-the-mill, dull life. In his soul, however, there resides an inextinguishable desire for adventure. And so once a month he poses as a playboy. As the mysterious and wealthy Mr. Kristian he goes to the exclusive Orient Bar where he does not skimp on generous tips and where he platonic-ally seduces beautiful and elegant women. In the salon he speaks of love and the magnificence of exotic lands, which he has supposedly come to know on his wanderings abroad. In reality he has read all of this in the travel agency''s brochures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRc2Bi66Hjtz3izaHq3SCtR2OhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50795'),
  ('967965114824669992', 'Kristin''s Christmas Past', 2013, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Jim Fall, Ricardo Jacques Gale', 'Rachel Stuhler', 'Shiri Appleby, Hannah Marks, Debby Ryan, Elizabeth Mitchell, Judd Nelson, Will Kemp, Michael-James Olsen, Courtney Henggeler', null, 'Kristin, a cynical 34-year-old, drinks a mysterious champagne on Christmas Eve and wakes up seventeen years in the past, sharing a room with her 17-year-old self. Given the chance to change the worst Christmas of her life, she attempts to fix past mistakes, only to discover surprising truths about her family that may help her mend her present-day relationships.', 'Kristin, a cynical 34-year-old, drinks a mysterious champagne on Christmas Eve and wakes up seventeen years in the past, sharing a room with her 17-year-old self. Given the chance to change the worst Christmas of her life, she attempts to fix past mistakes, only to discover surprising truths about her family that may help her mend her present-day relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3QeiZlAbixGwddpAaEBBhThzmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239347'),
  ('18030430241265514', 'Kristy', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Olly Blackburn, Mariela Comitini, Crille Forsberg', 'Anthony Jaswinski', 'Haley Bennett, Ashley Greene, Lucas Till, Chris Coy, Mike Seal, Lucius Falick, James Ransone, Erica Ash', 'NR', 'When a college girl who is alone on campus over the Thanksgiving break is targeted by a group of outcasts, she must conquer her deepest fears to outwit them and fight back.', 'When a college girl who is alone on campus over the Thanksgiving break is targeted by a group of outcasts, she must conquer her deepest fears to outwit them and fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sT3ZsWbX6VOlgqslJ1l7eWZJqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146229'),
  ('930385441616403024', 'Krocodylus', 2000, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Comedy', 'James D.R. Hickox, Christopher C. Pearson', 'Robert L. Levy, Sam Bernard', 'Kate Fischer, Duncan Regehr, Matt Borlenghi, Joel West, Taryn Reif, Maureen Larrazabal, Cris Vertido, Susan Africa', 'R', 'A sleazy producer develops a concept he dubs "blood surfing" -- tossing bloody fish remains into the water to lure sharks and then surfing through the animals as they chomp about. Along with his camerawoman, the producer brings two thrill-seeking surfers to the coast of Florida to capture some gnarly footage. But, as they blood surf, they encounter something even more deadly: a colossal prehistoric crocodile intent on devouring them.', 'A sleazy producer develops a concept he dubs "blood surfing" -- tossing bloody fish remains into the water to lure sharks and then surfing through the animals as they chomp about. Along with his camerawoman, the producer brings two thrill-seeking surfers to the coast of Florida to capture some gnarly footage. But, as they blood surf, they encounter something even more deadly: a colossal prehistoric crocodile intent on devouring them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKpGM6g3tAxTwbqhR2VbVH3JQNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28346'),
  ('484524535916599878', 'Kroll', 1991, 'Drama, Action', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Paweł Edelman, Wojciech Lepianka', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Bogusław Linda, Dariusz Kordek, Ewa Bukowska, Cezary Pazura, Agnieszka Różańska, Maciej Kozłowski, Tadeusz Szymków', null, 'Marcin Kroll deserts from his military unit that’s headed to the training ground. Lieutenant Arek is sent after him, tasked with bringing Kroll back to the unit before an official investigation begins. The officers fear a scandal: the inquiry could expose the brutal conditions in the unit that drove several soldiers to suicide.', 'Marcin Kroll deserts from his military unit that’s headed to the training ground. Lieutenant Arek is sent after him, tasked with bringing Kroll back to the unit before an official investigation begins. The officers fear a scandal: the inquiry could expose the brutal conditions in the unit that drove several soldiers to suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYu5ndBtYAloUiSqUXqFFlBsTPO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36394'),
