  ('441985020545656745', 'Kshana Kshanam', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Uttej, S. Gopala Reddy', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Sridevi, Venkatesh, Paresh Rawal, Rami Reddy, Brahmanandam, Narsing Yadav, Hema, Horse Babu', null, 'Chandu is a petty thief who comes across Satya, an innocent girl who unwittingly comes across a way to a huge amount of money stolen from a bank. While the gang that robbed the bank go after her for the clue, one member dies in her apartment and she believes she''s the one that killed him. Every one including the original gang that robbed the bank, the police and now Chandu and Satya go after the money.', 'Chandu is a petty thief who comes across Satya, an innocent girl who unwittingly comes across a way to a huge amount of money stolen from a bank. While the gang that robbed the bank go after her for the clue, one member dies in her apartment and she believes she''s the one that killed him. Every one including the original gang that robbed the bank, the police and now Chandu and Satya go after the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qQyvepQkpPeeNFk04tea2vLTuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81072'),
  ('748088398299557063', 'Kto-to dolzhen umeret', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Evgeny Grigoryev, Alexandra Avdonina, Rostislav Korenblit', 'Evgeny Grigoryev, Svetlana Shteba, Vladimir Gryaznov, Yuliana Koshkina', 'Yuliya Snigir, Pavel Derevyanko, Aglaya Tarasova', null, 'When Yulya learns of her beloved husband''s betrayal, she decides to poison both him and his mistress. Now, to get the antidote, the cheaters must prove that they truly love each other, otherwise death is inevitable.', 'When Yulya learns of her beloved husband''s betrayal, she decides to poison both him and his mistress. Now, to get the antidote, the cheaters must prove that they truly love each other, otherwise death is inevitable.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fjm4feYxObAmOJDHA9146xzrbG9a.jpg', 'plex:movie:kto-to-dolzhen-umeret'),
  ('112427643514949211', 'Ku Fu? Dalla Sicilia con furore', 1973, 'Comedy, Action', 'Nando Cicero, Roberto Pariante, Mario Capriotti', 'Marino Onorati', 'Franco Franchi, Gianni Agus, Irina Maleeva, Gino Pagnani, Nino Terzo, Alfonso Tomas, Enzo Andronico, Dante Cleri', null, 'The Sicilian Franco is a sort of imitation of Bruce Lee that Don Vito, a Chinese expelled from his country because he smuggled rice from Palermo to Beijing, tries to train in the art of kung-fu with disastrous results.', 'The Sicilian Franco is a sort of imitation of Bruce Lee that Don Vito, a Chinese expelled from his country because he smuggled rice from Palermo to Beijing, tries to train in the art of kung-fu with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZQyRR3oNKn4ZrLAc6BqiwtRBN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201816'),
  ('685062800644982549', 'Ku! Kin-dza-dza', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Tatyana Ilyina, Konstantin Shchekin', 'Alexander Adabashyan, Tatyana Ilyina', 'Alexander Adabashyan, Georgiy Daneliya, Nikolai Gubenko, Vakhtang Kikabidze, Polina Kutepova, Igor Kvasha, Andrey Leonov, Evgeniy Steblov', null, 'Beginner DJ Shreds and world-renowned cellist Vladimir Chizhov meet on a noisy street in Moscow barefoot man. Clicking on the strange machine, the characters are moved to the desert planet Plyuk. A remake of the beloved animated film "Kin-dza-dza!" No less fascinating and funny than the original, the adventures of the Shred and Uncle Vova. In this world of sand inhabitants are divided into two categories - patsaks and chatlan, a simple match has incredible value, and the people are met and escorted by the color of his pants.', 'Beginner DJ Shreds and world-renowned cellist Vladimir Chizhov meet on a noisy street in Moscow barefoot man. Clicking on the strange machine, the characters are moved to the desert planet Plyuk. A remake of the beloved animated film "Kin-dza-dza!" No less fascinating and funny than the original, the adventures of the Shred and Uncle Vova. In this world of sand inhabitants are divided into two categories - patsaks and chatlan, a simple match has incredible value, and the people are met and escorted by the color of his pants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyS861yvDr0HDvfBebZGTQDvq8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193154'),
  ('1090490911074115983', 'Ku...', 2001, 'Animation', 'Serhii Mindlin, Vadym Pashkevych, Maryna Medvid', 'Serhii Mindlin, Maryna Medvid', null, null, 'In old forgotten place an evil and insidious Koshchiy the Immortal lived. He lived his days among gray mists and vicious howls of unknown animals. There was no longer a magical cat who sang songs and recited poetry, a mermaid died, like many other fairytale characters. There was only him, a miserable old man.', 'In old forgotten place an evil and insidious Koshchiy the Immortal lived. He lived his days among gray mists and vicious howls of unknown animals. There was no longer a magical cat who sang songs and recited poetry, a mermaid died, like many other fairytale characters. There was only him, a miserable old man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwdEnWyTXcZO0i3lct93dSJgdj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077379'),
  ('689022997262612171', 'Kuarup', 1989, null, 'Ruy Guerra, Edgar Moura', 'Ruy Guerra, Rudi Lagemann', 'Taumaturgo Ferreira, Fernanda Torres, Cláudio Mamberti, Umberto Magnani, Ewerton de Castro, Roberto Bonfim, Cláudia Raia, André Ceccato', null, 'This epic Brazilian film was based on the equally epic novel by Antonio Callado. Set between 1954 and 1964, the film''s focus is the saga of Jesuit priest Nando. Fed up with civilization, he ventures deep into Amazon country to live with and work among the Xingu Indians.', 'This epic Brazilian film was based on the equally epic novel by Antonio Callado. Set between 1954 and 1964, the film''s focus is the saga of Jesuit priest Nando. Fed up with civilization, he ventures deep into Amazon country to live with and work among the Xingu Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXPu8QxhDJM0fgo1tTgaqZupBzk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198448'),
  ('738622128308544692', 'Kubi', 2023, 'History, Action, Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Takeshi Hamada, Takeshi Kitano, Hitoshi Takaya', 'Takehiko Minato, Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Ryo Kase, Tadanobu Asano, Nao Omori, Shido Nakamura, Yuichi Kimura, Kenichi Endo', null, 'Lord Oda Nobunaga plans to control Japan where rival warlords battle by waging war against several clans. His vassal Araki Murashige stages a rebellion and promptly disappears.', 'Lord Oda Nobunaga plans to control Japan where rival warlords battle by waging war against several clans. His vassal Araki Murashige stages a rebellion and promptly disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DG3B7D0cLx3gmoySAwHVZ6QPeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795087'),
  ('379019869847260592', 'Kubo and the Two Strings', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Travis Knight, Frank Passingham, Alastair Macleod', 'Marc Haimes, Chris Butler', 'Art Parkinson, Charlize Theron, Brenda Vaccaro, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Meyrick Murphy, George Takei, Rooney Mara, Ralph Fiennes', 'PG', 'Kubo mesmerizes the people in his village with his magical gift for spinning wild tales with origami. When he accidentally summons an evil spirit seeking vengeance, Kubo is forced to go on a quest to solve the mystery of his fallen samurai father and his mystical weaponry, as well as discover his own magical powers.', 'Kubo mesmerizes the people in his village with his magical gift for spinning wild tales with origami. When he accidentally summons an evil spirit seeking vengeance, Kubo is forced to go on a quest to solve the mystery of his fallen samurai father and his mystical weaponry, as well as discover his own magical powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewcOCkuuKAKULGUnbBVaO1htt0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313297'),
  ('1136802215472127365', 'Kubrick by Kubrick', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Grégory Monro, Radek Ładczuk', 'Grégory Monro', 'Stanley Kubrick, Kirk Douglas, James Mason, Christiane Kubrick, Malcolm McDowell, Michel Ciment, Marisa Berenson, Sterling Hayden', null, 'American filmmaker Stanley Kubrick (1928–1999), one of the greatest in history, but also one of the most reserved, gave few interviews throughout his long career, and none of them were filmed. A first-person journey through his life and work, based on a recorded conversation with French film critic Michel Climent.', 'American filmmaker Stanley Kubrick (1928–1999), one of the greatest in history, but also one of the most reserved, gave few interviews throughout his long career, and none of them were filmed. A first-person journey through his life and work, based on a recorded conversation with French film critic Michel Climent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgmWmo2xBghbWXKK8YpJHSR8n1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689705'),
