  ('437190144408679492', 'Kuch Naa Kaho', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rohan Sippy', 'Neeraj Vora', 'Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Abhishek Bachchan, Satish Shah, Suhasini Mulay, Jaspal Bhatti, Himani Shivpuri, Zoya Afroz, Meghna Malik', null, 'Raj a mere bachelor, who has no intention of marrying is being convinced by his uncle. His uncle passes on the duty to Namrata a married woman whose husband Sanjeev leave her five years ago. Namrata is responsible for finding Raj a suitable bride, while she is busy finding girls for him, he is busy along with his mischievous friend Adi straying away all the girls by making up wired plans. But Raj falls in love with the match - maker herself. While this is happening Sanjeev, Namrata''s husband return and foil all plans between Raj and Namrata.', 'Raj a mere bachelor, who has no intention of marrying is being convinced by his uncle. His uncle passes on the duty to Namrata a married woman whose husband Sanjeev leave her five years ago. Namrata is responsible for finding Raj a suitable bride, while she is busy finding girls for him, he is busy along with his mischievous friend Adi straying away all the girls by making up wired plans. But Raj falls in love with the match - maker herself. While this is happening Sanjeev, Namrata''s husband return and foil all plans between Raj and Namrata.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93tOqoycBAcqw7OFMQkBfx6WzrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48923'),
  ('206854555067110355', 'Kuduz', 1989, 'Drama', 'Ademir Kenović, Mustafa Mustafić', 'Ademir Kenović, Abdulah Sidran', 'Slobodan Ćustić, Snežana Bogdanović, Božidar Bunjevac, Branko Đurić, Mustafa Nadarević, Ivana Legin, Radmila Živković, Boro Stjepanović', null, 'After the release from prison, small-time criminal is marrying his girlfriend and lives a straight and poor, but happy life with her and her daughter. However, his happiness is shattered by wife''s infidelity. Driven mad by jealousy, he kills her and her lover and runs into mountains, thus escaping law for months. This film is based on the true story about Junuz Kečo, last Bosnian outlaw.', 'After the release from prison, small-time criminal is marrying his girlfriend and lives a straight and poor, but happy life with her and her daughter. However, his happiness is shattered by wife''s infidelity. Driven mad by jealousy, he kills her and her lover and runs into mountains, thus escaping law for months. This film is based on the true story about Junuz Kečo, last Bosnian outlaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIPY7E0rTV20NWhwjPyjMiUyuPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267186'),
  ('899879326927272440', 'Kuei-mei, a Woman', 1985, 'Drama', 'Chang Yi, Yang Wei-han', 'Chang Yi', 'Loretta Yang Hui-shan, Lee Li-Chun, Elten Ting, Wen Ying, Hu Hsiang-Ping, Liu Ming, Laula Luo, Ying Ying', null, 'Arriving in Taiwan in the 1950s, Kuei-mei makes a disadvantageous marriage to a widower with three unruly kids and a bad gambling habit. Beautifully portrayed by celebrated actress Yang, she weathers pregnancies, her husband''s infidelity, her daughter''s resentment, a stint as servant in Japan, divorce, and illness while struggling to keep the family restaurant business afloat.', 'Arriving in Taiwan in the 1950s, Kuei-mei makes a disadvantageous marriage to a widower with three unruly kids and a bad gambling habit. Beautifully portrayed by celebrated actress Yang, she weathers pregnancies, her husband''s infidelity, her daughter''s resentment, a stint as servant in Japan, divorce, and illness while struggling to keep the family restaurant business afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xf6zzPDBUGOuODHNKfaZGmKTA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256133'),
  ('355581194871667515', 'Kuessipan', 2019, 'Drama', 'Myriam Verreault, Nicolas Canniccioni', 'Myriam Verreault, Naomi Fontaine', 'Sharon Ishpatao Fontaine, Yamie Grégoire, Étienne Galloy, Cédrick Ambroise, Caroline Vachon, Mike Innu Papu Mckenzie, Douglas Grégoire, Anniss Desterres', null, 'Two childhood friends from the same Quebec Innu community begin to realize that they face very different futures.', 'Two childhood friends from the same Quebec Innu community begin to realize that they face very different futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3bbJkJq9wKMT4CW9G8eL8lQbTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589064'),
  ('992351112556270933', 'Kuffs', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Bruce A. Evans, Thomas Del Ruth, David R. Ellis', 'Bruce A. Evans, Raynold Gideon', 'Christian Slater, Milla Jovovich, Tony Goldwyn, Bruce Boxleitner, Troy Evans, George De La Pena, Leon Rippy, Ashley Judd', 'PG-13', 'George Kuffs didn''t finish high-school, just lost his job, and his college-age girlfriend is pregnant. To top it off, George''s brother Brad is killed and George inherits Brad''s "patrol special" privatized police district and all the problems that come with it.', 'George Kuffs didn''t finish high-school, just lost his job, and his college-age girlfriend is pregnant. To top it off, George''s brother Brad is killed and George inherits Brad''s "patrol special" privatized police district and all the problems that come with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF0eKbtnPxMVTPiLeKquUziMW06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14603'),
  ('686567133051907668', 'Kuhle Wampe or Who Owns the World?', 1932, 'Drama', 'Günther Krampf, Slatan Dudow', 'Bertolt Brecht, Ernst Ottwalt', 'Hertha Thiele, Ernst Busch, Max Sablotzki, Lilli Schoenborn, Martha Wolter, Adolf Fischer, Gerhard Bienert, Erwin Geschonneck', null, 'Kuhle Wampe takes place in early-1930s Berlin. The film begins with a montage of newspaper headlines describing steadily-rising unemployment figures. This is followed by scenes of a young man looking for work in the city and the family discussing the unpaid back rent. The young man, brother of the protagonist Anni, removes his wristwatch and throws himself from a window out of despair. Shortly thereafter his family is evicted from their apartment. Now homeless, the family moves into a garden colony of sorts with the name “Kuhle Wampe.”', 'Kuhle Wampe takes place in early-1930s Berlin. The film begins with a montage of newspaper headlines describing steadily-rising unemployment figures. This is followed by scenes of a young man looking for work in the city and the family discussing the unpaid back rent. The young man, brother of the protagonist Anni, removes his wristwatch and throws himself from a window out of despair. Shortly thereafter his family is evicted from their apartment. Now homeless, the family moves into a garden colony of sorts with the name “Kuhle Wampe.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEkaDbgek7TwSkfC6Ft2ReRhOlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785'),
  ('934535668551358889', 'Kuiba', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chuan Wang', 'Chuan Wang', 'Seira Ryu, Kai Wang, Ji Guanlin, Jiang Guangtao, Zhang Lei, Lihong Li', null, 'In this mystifying world, a creature is reborn every 333 years. This creature is Kuiba. The creature is an exploitation of a loophole in the Universe. It brings disaster to all each time it appears. To keep Kuiba from returning, deities and people from the entire world team up and destroy the creature every 333 years, which is known as "The Revival of Kuiba". In the year 1664, Kuiba''s rebirth, the extermination of Kuiba failed, as Kuiba was able to fall into the body of Manji. Manji, a young boy, has no idea of Kuiba being inside of him. Due to the failed extermination, the people of earth recruit for an army to defeat Kuiba. Manji and his Master are eager to prove themselves to be top notch warriors, so they enlist in the army to fight Kuiba. As they prepare for battle against Kuiba, Manji and Master man not only encounter a variety of dynamic characters, but also encounter a beast which will prove if they are ready for the challenges ahead that lay ahead.', 'In this mystifying world, a creature is reborn every 333 years. This creature is Kuiba. The creature is an exploitation of a loophole in the Universe. It brings disaster to all each time it appears. To keep Kuiba from returning, deities and people from the entire world team up and destroy the creature every 333 years, which is known as "The Revival of Kuiba". In the year 1664, Kuiba''s rebirth, the extermination of Kuiba failed, as Kuiba was able to fall into the body of Manji. Manji, a young boy, has no idea of Kuiba being inside of him. Due to the failed extermination, the people of earth recruit for an army to defeat Kuiba. Manji and his Master are eager to prove themselves to be top notch warriors, so they enlist in the army to fight Kuiba. As they prepare for battle against Kuiba, Manji and Master man not only encounter a variety of dynamic characters, but also encounter a beast which will prove if they are ready for the challenges ahead that lay ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/al73OplNnXrfiA3xv16PCHDyb1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184614'),
  ('95398712737335451', 'Kuiba 2', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chuan Wang', null, 'Seira Ryu', null, 'Manji and Master Man board a warship bound headed to Maelstrom Island. Meanwhile, on Maelstrom Island, Kuiba''s fiercest lieutenants are preparing for battle. Manji soon faces conflicts between his father, the gods, and Kuiba''s lieutenants.', 'Manji and Master Man board a warship bound headed to Maelstrom Island. Meanwhile, on Maelstrom Island, Kuiba''s fiercest lieutenants are preparing for battle. Manji soon faces conflicts between his father, the gods, and Kuiba''s lieutenants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bHjuxrh8YUAQ5MFuCjjhV11wtG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331249'),
  ('510134873051805181', 'Kuiba III', 2014, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Chuan Wang', null, 'Kai Wang', null, 'Before he can get close to the real enemy, Manji faces challenges from two powerful opponents : Da Cang - a master of using body pulse, and Hai Wen Xiang - a sea witch who is extremely loyal to Kuiba. When Manji is unwillingly engaged in an intense battle with Hai Wen Xiang. Kuiba reveals its mysterious appearance.', 'Before he can get close to the real enemy, Manji faces challenges from two powerful opponents : Da Cang - a master of using body pulse, and Hai Wen Xiang - a sea witch who is extremely loyal to Kuiba. When Manji is unwillingly engaged in an intense battle with Hai Wen Xiang. Kuiba reveals its mysterious appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEB3BCeEmG2DBQEUxn51J1iWGBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313302'),
  ('5351799193977831', 'Kuka', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Antoine Vivas Denisov, Yaroslav Chevazhevsky, Alexandr Obrant', 'Denis Zamriy, Yaroslav Chevazhevsky', 'Anastasiya Dobrynina, Dina Korzun, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Aleksandr Polovtsev, Pavel Derevyanko, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Irina Kupchenko, Yuri Belyayev', null, 'A woman and a young girl in different cities are struggling to find their way in this world. Will their paths intersect and will that change their destinies?', 'A woman and a young girl in different cities are struggling to find their way in this world. Will their paths intersect and will that change their destinies?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmcHCjpfV0Dp54YLPeyZJHvtMva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70965'),
  ('734498258136676276', 'Kukaracha', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Siko Dolidze, Keti Dolidze, Mikhail Mednikov', 'Nodar Dumbadze', 'Levan Uchaneishvili, Zaza Kolelishvili, Marine Janashia, Lado Tatishvili, Nineli Chankvetadze, Givi Tokhadze, Dudukhana Tserodze, Lia Kapanadze', null, 'A screen adaptation of the novel of the same name by the well-known Georgian writer Nodar Dumbadze. This story about love and loyalty, bravery and betrayal, began shortly before the Patriotic War of 1941-1945. Georgy Tumurashvili, a militia man, was affectionately called “Cucaracha”, by both the kids and the adults. He was a conscientious divisional inspector investigating various incidents, calling to order local hoodlums and settling family arguments. Once he helped out Inga who fell prey to Murtalo, a bandit and murderer. The young people fell in love with each other. But Murtalo decided to take revenge on Kukaracha…', 'A screen adaptation of the novel of the same name by the well-known Georgian writer Nodar Dumbadze. This story about love and loyalty, bravery and betrayal, began shortly before the Patriotic War of 1941-1945. Georgy Tumurashvili, a militia man, was affectionately called “Cucaracha”, by both the kids and the adults. He was a conscientious divisional inspector investigating various incidents, calling to order local hoodlums and settling family arguments. Once he helped out Inga who fell prey to Murtalo, a bandit and murderer. The young people fell in love with each other. But Murtalo decided to take revenge on Kukaracha…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2IzmXWT1smIYIv9k6KUnbYoIzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146969'),
  ('177304469704565626', 'Kull the Conqueror', 1997, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'John Nicolella, Rodney Charters, Pier Luigi Basile', 'Charles Edward Pogue', 'Kevin Sorbo, Tia Carrere, Karina Lombard, Thomas Ian Griffith, Litefoot, Roy Brocksmith, Harvey Fierstein, Edward Tudor-Pole', 'PG-13', 'A barbarian named Kull becomes ruler after defeating the old king in battle. In an effort to regain the throne, the former king''s heirs resurrect Akivasha, a witch queen. However, Akivasha has plans of her own for the throne, and only Kull stands in the way.', 'A barbarian named Kull becomes ruler after defeating the old king in battle. In an effort to regain the throne, the former king''s heirs resurrect Akivasha, a witch queen. However, Akivasha has plans of her own for the throne, and only Kull stands in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgKK2eCdb5LLaQBDQZbmR312q1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17832'),
  ('236491403503536748', 'Kulong', 2024, 'Drama', 'Sigrid Polon', null, 'Jenn Rosa, Aica Veloso, Cariz Manzano, JD Aguas, Ralph Engle, Ghion Layug, Aina Ashley Roque', null, 'Three friends retreat to a resort to collaborate on a daring screenplay for a contest. Faced with the challenge of writing about passion despite their own dry spells, their journey soon blurs the line between imagination and experience.', 'Three friends retreat to a resort to collaborate on a daring screenplay for a contest. Faced with the challenge of writing about passion despite their own dry spells, their journey soon blurs the line between imagination and experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnzrE2WHg3DtZrtmB9AnEbAh17m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266990'),
  ('288838402144880513', 'Kuma: The Second Wife', 2012, 'Drama', 'Umut Dağ, Carsten Thiele', 'Umut Dağ, Petra Ladinigg', 'Nihal Koldaş, Begüm Akkaya, Vedat Erincin, Murathan Muslu, Alev Irmak, Aliye Esra Salebci, Ethem Saygieder, Abdulkadir Tuncer', 'PG-13', 'Fatma is around 50, a housewife with six children. She lives in Vienna but grew up in Turkey and clings stubbornly to the traditions and values of the old country. Ayse is 19, and the film begins with her wedding in rural Turkey, to Fatma’s son Hasan. However, when the family takes Ayse to Vienna this is revealed as a charade, for Ayse is to be the kuma (second wife) of Fatma’s husband Mustafa.', 'Fatma is around 50, a housewife with six children. She lives in Vienna but grew up in Turkey and clings stubbornly to the traditions and values of the old country. Ayse is 19, and the film begins with her wedding in rural Turkey, to Fatma’s son Hasan. However, when the family takes Ayse to Vienna this is revealed as a charade, for Ayse is to be the kuma (second wife) of Fatma’s husband Mustafa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0ivy4ifVKoGuzYTnxfp6e2kknE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133250'),
  ('404020225628526171', 'Kumaré', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Vikram Gandhi', null, 'Vikram Gandhi, Purva Bedi, Kristen Calgaro', 'NR', 'A documentary about a man who impersonates a wise Indian Guru and builds a following in Arizona. At the height of his popularity, the Guru Kumaré must reveal his true identity to his disciples and unveil his greatest teaching of all.', 'A documentary about a man who impersonates a wise Indian Guru and builds a following in Arizona. At the height of his popularity, the Guru Kumaré must reveal his true identity to his disciples and unveil his greatest teaching of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XzJ4RAqNKI4V3K3UarK4MthJA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98886'),
  ('469279971289877897', 'Kumbalangi Nights', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Devadath Shaji, Unnimaya Prasad, Roy T M', 'Syam Pushkaran', 'Shane Nigam, Soubin Shahir, Sreenath Bhasi, Mathew Thomas, Fahadh Faasil, Anna Ben, Grace Antony, Ramesh Thilak', null, 'Four brothers living in the fishing hamlet of Kumbalangi share a love-hate relationship with each other. Their relationship progresses when Saji, Boney and Franky decide to help Bobby stand by his love.', 'Four brothers living in the fishing hamlet of Kumbalangi share a love-hate relationship with each other. Their relationship progresses when Saji, Boney and Franky decide to help Bobby stand by his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJ3RvIirE2C7gdBKvPRaoQ3iCo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575351'),
  ('115956826382401096', 'Kumiko, the Treasure Hunter', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Zellner, Sean Porter, Amber Goerish', 'David Zellner, Nathan Zellner', 'Rinko Kikuchi, Nobuyuki Katsube, Kanako Higashi, Ichi Kyokaku, Ayaka Onishi, Mayuko Kawakita, Asami Tano, Ako Yoshida', null, 'Frustrated with her mundane life, a Tokyo office worker becomes obsessed with a fictional movie that she mistakes for a documentary. Fixating on a scene where stolen cash is buried in North Dakota, she travels to America to find it.', 'Frustrated with her mundane life, a Tokyo office worker becomes obsessed with a fictional movie that she mistakes for a documentary. Fixating on a scene where stolen cash is buried in North Dakota, she travels to America to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZU05LeIZE6azWUCnjYhEHeCDHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244563'),
  ('333810248203964041', 'Kummatty', 1979, 'Family, Fantasy, Drama', 'Shaji N. Karun, Govindan Aravindan, Kavalam Padmanabhan', 'Govindan Aravindan', 'Ramunni, Master Ashokan, Shanker, Vakkil, Sivasankaran Divakaran, Kuttyedathi Vilasini, Kothara Gopalkrishnan, Reema', null, 'A stranger who may be the trickster magician Kummatty comes to a village in Malabar, India.', 'A stranger who may be the trickster magician Kummatty comes to a village in Malabar, India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZ6K2lb4MsUQ5C701TQEtdteOsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256379'),
  ('24352877669889370', 'Kummeli Kultakuume', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Matti Grönberg, Petri Rossi', 'Heikki Vihinen, Timo Kahilainen', 'Heikki Silvennoinen, Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Hela, Heikki Vihinen, Mari Turunen, Kari Hietalahti, Jukka Puotila, Vesa-Matti Loiri', null, 'Psychiatric patient Elmeri knows about the existence of a gold treasure in Finnish Lapland, hidden there by his late father who somehow managed to capture it from withdrawing German troops on the last days of WW2. His openly gay nurse helps him escape from the mental institution, and the two men slowly find their way up north to reach the gold. On their way, the odd couple meets a cavalcade of even odder characters.', 'Psychiatric patient Elmeri knows about the existence of a gold treasure in Finnish Lapland, hidden there by his late father who somehow managed to capture it from withdrawing German troops on the last days of WW2. His openly gay nurse helps him escape from the mental institution, and the two men slowly find their way up north to reach the gold. On their way, the odd couple meets a cavalcade of even odder characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3p1Bi3SUbWHNcJlwBRlte6W2DfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38205'),
  ('634420009946927473', 'Kummeli Stories', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Matti Grönberg, Pertti Mutanen', 'Heikki Hela, Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Silvennoinen', 'Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Silvennoinen, Heikki Hela, Mari Turunen, Heikki Vihinen, Pia Bos, Raimo Helminen, Raimo Summanen', null, 'The war between Luxembourg and Finland sets the outline to a set of comedic stories about a rally team, gay couple''s fishing trip, two hoodlums'' last school days in the spring and a haunted hotel among others.', 'The war between Luxembourg and Finland sets the outline to a set of comedic stories about a rally team, gay couple''s fishing trip, two hoodlums'' last school days in the spring and a haunted hotel among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWgxqxHTVoIjQLeQmsNV7wucJtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62719'),
  ('520443122484614547', 'Kun Hunttalan Matti Suomen osti', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Markku Onttonen, Esko Nevalainen', 'Markku Onttonen', 'Pekka Laiho, Heikki Kinnunen, Ahti Kuoppala, Leena Uotila, Jari Pehkonen, Tuija Töyräs, Martti Tschokkinen', null, 'Matti Hunttala is a businessman who buys, sells, exchanges, and steals—whatever best suits his plans. The men of Hukansalmi municipality do not suspect Hunttala''s grand promises. Business representative Koistinen, municipal manager Kiiskinen, and bank manager Ruotsalainen believe they have met someone who can boost the municipality''s poor economy and factory projects. Hunttala buys Hukanharju from the municipality for free, promising to build factories there to create jobs for the municipality, but Hunttala sells the ridge to the gravel magnate and flees Hukansalmi himself.', 'Matti Hunttala is a businessman who buys, sells, exchanges, and steals—whatever best suits his plans. The men of Hukansalmi municipality do not suspect Hunttala''s grand promises. Business representative Koistinen, municipal manager Kiiskinen, and bank manager Ruotsalainen believe they have met someone who can boost the municipality''s poor economy and factory projects. Hunttala buys Hukanharju from the municipality for free, promising to build factories there to create jobs for the municipality, but Hunttala sells the ridge to the gravel magnate and flees Hukansalmi himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JkRfdUydyZD4NsiiwP1z6ixvSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362204'),
  ('1117223909470262424', 'Kuncen', 2025, 'Horror', 'Jose Poernomo, Jose Poernomo', 'Jose Poernomo', 'Cinta Brian, Davina Karamoy, Azela Putri, Mikha Hernan, Vonny Felicia, Sara Wijayanto, Thomi Baraqbah', null, 'After 24 hours without news from her boyfriend who was climbing a mountain, Awindya, a high school girl, was determined to invite her two friends, Agnes and Mojo to follow her boyfriend to Mount Merbabu. Upon arrival, the caretaker or Kuncen of the mountain had died tragically due to black magic. Together with two other people, Yoga and Diska, who also lost their closest people on the mountain, they agreed to find out who the new Kuncen was in order to find their missing friends. It is said that according to local beliefs, without a Kuncen, the mountain is a place that holds mysteries and all supernatural creatures succeed in terrorizing those who dare to enter it. Will they succeed in finding the successor of the guardian; the Kuncen of the Mountain?', 'After 24 hours without news from her boyfriend who was climbing a mountain, Awindya, a high school girl, was determined to invite her two friends, Agnes and Mojo to follow her boyfriend to Mount Merbabu. Upon arrival, the caretaker or Kuncen of the mountain had died tragically due to black magic. Together with two other people, Yoga and Diska, who also lost their closest people on the mountain, they agreed to find out who the new Kuncen was in order to find their missing friends. It is said that according to local beliefs, without a Kuncen, the mountain is a place that holds mysteries and all supernatural creatures succeed in terrorizing those who dare to enter it. Will they succeed in finding the successor of the guardian; the Kuncen of the Mountain?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XFnCNU1SIa100lI3bM7QDLPTEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1292645'),
  ('66695130998303083', 'Kundo: Age of the Rampant', 2014, 'Action, Drama', 'Yoon Jong-bin, Yu Yeong-jong, Choi Chan-min', 'Jung Jae-woong', 'Ha Jung-woo, Gang Dong-won, Lee Kyung-young, Lee Sung-min, Cho Jin-woong, Don Lee, Yoon Ji-hye, Kim Hae-sook', null, 'In 1862, amidst the rule of the late Joseon dynasty in Korea, a band of fighters named Kundo rise against the unjust authorities.', 'In 1862, amidst the rule of the late Joseon dynasty in Korea, a band of fighters named Kundo rise against the unjust authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAiANYk9aocISH5To89qwC8ZF8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281780'),
  ('379620400529657839', 'Kundun', 1997, 'Drama, History', 'Martin Scorsese, Ahmed Hatimi, Barbara Pastrovich', 'Melissa Mathison', 'Tenzin Thuthob Tsarong, Tencho Gyalpo, Tsewang Migyur Khangsar, Gyurme Tethong, Robert Lin, Tulku Jamyang Kunga Tenzin, Tenzin Yeshi Paichang, Tenzin Topjar', 'PG-13', 'The Tibetans refer to the Dalai Lama as ''Kundun'', which means ''The Presence''. He was forced to escape from his native home, Tibet, when communist China invaded and enforced an oppressive regime upon the peaceful nation. The Dalai Lama escaped to India in 1959 and has been living in exile in Dharamsala ever since.', 'The Tibetans refer to the Dalai Lama as ''Kundun'', which means ''The Presence''. He was forced to escape from his native home, Tibet, when communist China invaded and enforced an oppressive regime upon the peaceful nation. The Dalai Lama escaped to India in 1959 and has been living in exile in Dharamsala ever since.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvdFRDoQIQ5PBk4u8x8gJT8NJAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9746'),
  ('571149459105497518', 'Kung Fu', 2026, 'Action, Drama', 'Giddens Ko, Chou Yi-hsien, Lucy Chen', 'Giddens Ko', 'Leon Dai, Kai Ko, Berant Zhu, Gingle Wang, Liu Kuan-ting, Yen Yi-wen, Vicky Tseng, Ven Kao', null, 'Two loser high school students meet a wandering old man with unparalleled martial arts skills. Together, they not only strive to restore justice to their city but also unravel the mystery of the old man''s identity.', 'Two loser high school students meet a wandering old man with unparalleled martial arts skills. Together, they not only strive to restore justice to their city but also unravel the mystery of the old man''s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceMT5i6aCdkm1cgAamJ6Fn2GTNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1272405'),
  ('715001045624006811', 'Kung Fu Chefs', 2009, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ken Yip Wing-Kin, Kwan Chi-Kan', 'Bob Wang Bo, Simon Lu Zhi-Qian, Cyrus Cheng Tsz-To', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Vanness Wu, Lam Tze-Chung, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Xing Yu, Ku Feng', 'PG-13', 'Ousted chef Wong Bing-Yi is determined to help Shen Qing at her restaurant "Four Seas". He trains a young chef, Lung Kin-Yat to compete against Chef Tin, the head chef at "Imperial Palace", for the title of "Top Chef".', 'Ousted chef Wong Bing-Yi is determined to help Shen Qing at her restaurant "Four Seas". He trains a young chef, Lung Kin-Yat to compete against Chef Tin, the head chef at "Imperial Palace", for the title of "Top Chef".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ar4OpI2E1DmC7nvUz1O349CfEZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25124'),
  ('646118409871822069', 'Kung Fu Cult Master', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Wong Jing, Raymond Yip Wai-Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Jet Li, Sharla Cheung, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Gigi Lai Chi, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Cho Wing', null, 'A wild and rollicking martial arts fantasy extravaganza that features prized swords and swordsmen, a crazy monk attached to a rolling boulder, serious clan and cult rivalries, and lots of magic and flying.', 'A wild and rollicking martial arts fantasy extravaganza that features prized swords and swordsmen, a crazy monk attached to a rolling boulder, serious clan and cult rivalries, and lots of magic and flying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4diDPsEzHDojys2gLgyRVZAMKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10852'),
  ('530951055527574912', 'Kung Fu Dunk', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Kevin Chu', 'Wang Yu-chen, Lam Chiu-Wing, Kevin Chu', 'Jay Chou, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Wang Gang, Chen Bolin, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Baron Chen, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', null, 'Shi-Jie is a brilliant martial artist from the Kung Fu School. One day, he encounters a group of youths playing basketball and shows off how easy it is for him, with his martial arts training, to do a Slam Dunk. Watching him was Chen-Li, a shrewd businessman, who recruits him to play varsity basketball at the local university.', 'Shi-Jie is a brilliant martial artist from the Kung Fu School. One day, he encounters a group of youths playing basketball and shows off how easy it is for him, with his martial arts training, to do a Slam Dunk. Watching him was Chen-Li, a shrewd businessman, who recruits him to play varsity basketball at the local university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNxnBgszvHzx2QrqCORhhzl6JcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17108'),
  ('635210374764961472', 'Kung Fu Games', 2024, 'Action', 'Ryan C. Jaeger, Isi Sarfati', 'Ryan C. Jaeger, H. Daniel Gross', 'Mark Strange, Caitlin Dechelle, Jade Xu, Jose Manuel, Matt Goodwin, Lathrop Walker', 'R', 'Notorious fighters are trapped in lethal martial arts games by a sadistic magnate. Armed only with their combat skills, they face brutal battles for survival in a deadly kill-or-be-killed showdown.', 'Notorious fighters are trapped in lethal martial arts games by a sadistic magnate. Armed only with their combat skills, they face brutal battles for survival in a deadly kill-or-be-killed showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjDdBBUEBMvyUiVohZ8T7W2IFl6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1329912'),
  ('165673254750182696', 'Kung Fu Hustle', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Fantasy', 'Stephen Chow, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Stephen Chow, Tsang Kan-Cheong, Chan Man-Keung', 'Stephen Chow, Yuen Qiu, Yuen Wah, Lam Tze-Chung, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Eva Huang Shengyi, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Chiu Chi-Ling', 'R', 'It''s the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.', 'It''s the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9470'),
  ('978313471230927270', 'Kung Fu Jungle', 2014, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Adventure', 'Teddy Chan, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, Donnie Yen', 'Mak Tin-Shu, Lau Ho-Leung', 'Donnie Yen, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Wang Baoqiang, Michelle Bai, Deep Ng Ho-Hong, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Christie Chen, Yu Kang', null, 'A martial arts instructor working at a police academy gets imprisoned after killing a man by accident. But when a vicious killer starts targeting martial arts masters, the instructor offers to help the police in return for his freedom.', 'A martial arts instructor working at a police academy gets imprisoned after killing a man by accident. But when a vicious killer starts targeting martial arts masters, the instructor offers to help the police in return for his freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myZQ4WocOQQCXNGVJkHeeJ1jTEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290864'),
  ('377920710390794261', 'Kung Fu Killer', 2008, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Philip Spink, Ng Man-Ching', 'Jacqueline Feather, David Seidler', 'David Carradine, Daryl Hannah, Lim Kay Tong, Lim Yu-Beng, Jimmy Taenaka, Osric Chau, Christian Lee, Yan Yan Wu', 'NR', 'China is in unrest, as the Republic falls prey to Warlords like Kahn Xin, who holds an entire province hostage to the opium trade—and destroys all who oppose him. Only the revered Wudang monks dare stand in Kahn’s way in order to protect the very soul of China. Among them is the Westerner, White Crane, a spiritual master of the martial arts and protector of the innocent. Revenge is not in Crane’s heart—until a mercenary army storms the temple and slaughters the beloved female Grandmaster Myling. Out of the ashes of the temple ruins, Crane rises—with vengeance in his heart. Crane comes upon Jane Marshall, a New York lounge singer and her gangster boss Bingo Quo. But it’s Bingo’s dangerous professional ties to Kahn that draw both Crane and Jane deep into the Warlord’s lair. Now torn between the spiritual Wudang teaching and the cold-blooded life of an assassin, Crane is about the cross the fine line between justice and revenge.', 'China is in unrest, as the Republic falls prey to Warlords like Kahn Xin, who holds an entire province hostage to the opium trade—and destroys all who oppose him. Only the revered Wudang monks dare stand in Kahn’s way in order to protect the very soul of China. Among them is the Westerner, White Crane, a spiritual master of the martial arts and protector of the innocent. Revenge is not in Crane’s heart—until a mercenary army storms the temple and slaughters the beloved female Grandmaster Myling. Out of the ashes of the temple ruins, Crane rises—with vengeance in his heart. Crane comes upon Jane Marshall, a New York lounge singer and her gangster boss Bingo Quo. But it’s Bingo’s dangerous professional ties to Kahn that draw both Crane and Jane deep into the Warlord’s lair. Now torn between the spiritual Wudang teaching and the cold-blooded life of an assassin, Crane is about the cross the fine line between justice and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhiuKlczmkQYTVlzsShV6vtch5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25423'),
  ('336371974322655496', 'Kung Fu League', 2018, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Andy On Chi-Kit, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Dennis To Yu-Hang, Ashin Shu, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Lam Tze-Chung, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', null, 'A poor comic book artist summons four legendary Kung Fu masters to learn the highest level of martial arts and help him get his girl.', 'A poor comic book artist summons four legendary Kung Fu masters to learn the highest level of martial arts and help him get his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45xvNQA6hbDRX6eIJ4CZqhtbxTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523873'),
  ('1068314257686712951', 'Kung Fu Magoo', 2010, 'Animation, Family', 'Andrés Couturier', 'Emmy Laybourne, Sam Laybourne', 'Jim Conroy, Dylan Sprouse, Cole Sprouse, Alyson Stoner, Chris Parnell, Kenny Mayne, Jeff Bennett, Rodger Bumpass', null, 'The world’s most notorious bad guys are invited to the island fortress of super-villain Tan-Gu to compete in an Olympic-style tournament of evil, called the Evilympics. Mr. Magoo and his 12 year-old nephew Justin fight giant robot spiders, ninjas on jet skis, and Tan-Gu’s mutant “Beasteens”, as representatives of the anti-evil task force.', 'The world’s most notorious bad guys are invited to the island fortress of super-villain Tan-Gu to compete in an Olympic-style tournament of evil, called the Evilympics. Mr. Magoo and his 12 year-old nephew Justin fight giant robot spiders, ninjas on jet skis, and Tan-Gu’s mutant “Beasteens”, as representatives of the anti-evil task force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4XJ7enIbcAKtkeq4LkVf3iOoMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71797'),
  ('956771062260091111', 'Kung Fu Monster', 2018, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Wong Fei-Fei, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Ronald Chan Kin-Hung, Lui Koon-Nam, Chao Rong', 'Louis Koo, Zhou Dongyu, Chen Xuedong, Bea Hayden Kuo, Bao Bei''er, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Wu Yue, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong', null, 'In the waning years of the Ming Dynasty, the Bruneian Empire offers a rare creature to the nation as a gift. Ocean, a member of the Imperial Secret Police, has been tasked to tame the beast. Though the furry beast appears ferocious on the outside, Ocean discovers that it is kind by nature. Not wanting to turn the beast into a killing machine on the battlefield, Ocean secretly releases the beast into the wild and elopes with Frigid, the daughter of a man executed on false charges.', 'In the waning years of the Ming Dynasty, the Bruneian Empire offers a rare creature to the nation as a gift. Ocean, a member of the Imperial Secret Police, has been tasked to tame the beast. Though the furry beast appears ferocious on the outside, Ocean discovers that it is kind by nature. Not wanting to turn the beast into a killing machine on the battlefield, Ocean secretly releases the beast into the wild and elopes with Frigid, the daughter of a man executed on false charges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1YxmogQ5yda3PmsOFMyrE8KY4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569947'),
  ('435029584213464197', 'Kung Fu Panda', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Comedy, Action, Fantasy', 'Mark Osborne, John Stevenson, Yong Duk Jhun', 'Glenn Berger, Jonathan Aibel', 'Jack Black, Angelina Jolie, Dustin Hoffman, Ian McShane, Jackie Chan, Lucy Liu, Seth Rogen, David Cross', 'PG', 'Chosen by prophecy but doubted by all, Po is an unlikely Dragon Warrior—a clumsy panda thrust into the world of kung fu as a deadly enemy threatens the Valley of Peace. Under reluctant guidance by Master Shifu and the Furious Five, Po must embrace who he is to unlock the power that no scroll can teach.', 'Chosen by prophecy but doubted by all, Po is an unlikely Dragon Warrior—a clumsy panda thrust into the world of kung fu as a deadly enemy threatens the Valley of Peace. Under reluctant guidance by Master Shifu and the Furious Five, Po must embrace who he is to unlock the power that no scroll can teach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWt4JYXTg5Wr3xBW2phBrMKgp3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9502'),
  ('708878637328774750', 'Kung Fu Panda 2', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jennifer Yuh Nelson, Damon O''Beirne', 'Jonathan Aibel, Glenn Berger', 'Jack Black, Angelina Jolie, Dustin Hoffman, Gary Oldman, Jackie Chan, Lucy Liu, Seth Rogen, David Cross', 'PG', 'Po is finally living the dream as the Dragon Warrior—until a dark presence from his past comes roaring back. When the ruthless peacock lord Shen unleashes a devastating new weapon used to wipe out kung fu masters across the land, Po and the Furious Five race across China to put an end to his plans. But if Po is to have any hope of stopping him, he must first confront the truth of his origins—and find inner peace before his past tears him apart.', 'Po is finally living the dream as the Dragon Warrior—until a dark presence from his past comes roaring back. When the ruthless peacock lord Shen unleashes a devastating new weapon used to wipe out kung fu masters across the land, Po and the Furious Five race across China to put an end to his plans. But if Po is to have any hope of stopping him, he must first confront the truth of his origins—and find inner peace before his past tears him apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtqqD00vB4PGRt20gWtGqFhrkd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49444'),
  ('905462940335654700', 'Kung Fu Panda 3', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Jennifer Yuh Nelson, Damon O''Beirne, Alessandro Carloni', 'Jonathan Aibel, Glenn Berger', 'Jack Black, Bryan Cranston, Dustin Hoffman, Angelina Jolie, J.K. Simmons, Jackie Chan, Seth Rogen, Lucy Liu', 'PG', 'While Po and his father are visiting a secret panda village, an evil spirit threatens all of China, forcing Po to form a ragtag army to fight back.', 'While Po and his father are visiting a secret panda village, an evil spirit threatens all of China, forcing Po to form a ragtag army to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oajNi4Su39WAByHI6EONu8G8HYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140300'),
  ('1060273120577423986', 'Kung Fu Panda 4', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Stephanie Ma Stine, Mike Mitchell', 'Jonathan Aibel, Glenn Berger, Darren Lemke', 'Jack Black, Awkwafina, Viola Davis, Dustin Hoffman, Bryan Cranston, James Hong, Ian McShane, Ke Huy Quan', 'PG', 'Po is gearing up to become the spiritual leader of his Valley of Peace, but also needs someone to take his place as Dragon Warrior. As such, he will train a new kung fu practitioner for the spot and will encounter a villain called the Chameleon who conjures villains from the past.', 'Po is gearing up to become the spiritual leader of his Valley of Peace, but also needs someone to take his place as Dragon Warrior. As such, he will train a new kung fu practitioner for the spot and will encounter a villain called the Chameleon who conjures villains from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDp1vUBnMpe8ak4rjgl3cLELqjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011985'),
  ('169460952136510552', 'Kung Fu Panda Holiday', 2010, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tim Johnson', 'Jon Pollack, Jonathan Groff', 'Jack Black, Dustin Hoffman, Angelina Jolie, Seth Rogen, Lucy Liu, David Cross, James Hong, Jack McBrayer', 'G', 'The Winter Feast is Po''s favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.', 'The Winter Feast is Po''s favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJv3pI8pyS13rLjy0ok7a3BiE0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50393'),
  ('592053541977664797', 'Kung Fu Panda: Secrets of the Furious Five', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Action', 'Raman Hui Shing-Ngai', 'Paul McEvoy, Todd Berger', 'Jack Black, Dustin Hoffman, David Cross, Randall Duk Kim, Elizabeth Ann Bennett, Jaycee Chan, Jim Cummings, Jessica DiCicco', 'PG', 'Ordered to teach a martial arts class of rambunctious bunny kittens, Po tells stories of each of the Furious Five''s pasts.', 'Ordered to teach a martial arts class of rambunctious bunny kittens, Po tells stories of each of the Furious Five''s pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HENPRM1tGRswyjgiIbP9b4sult.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15854'),
  ('1039133101057416710', 'Kung Fu Panda: Secrets of the Masters', 2011, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Tony Leondis', 'Paul McEvoy, Todd Berger', 'Jack Black, Angelina Jolie, Seth Rogen, Dustin Hoffman, Randall Duk Kim, Dennis Haysbert, Paul Scheer, Tony Leondis', 'NR', 'Po and the Furious Five uncover the legend of three of kung fu''s greatest heroes: Master Thundering Rhino, Master Storming Ox, and Master Croc.', 'Po and the Furious Five uncover the legend of three of kung fu''s greatest heroes: Master Thundering Rhino, Master Storming Ox, and Master Croc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xON7QZ6yHYt1S1Aji0wfGQ1a7ml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81003'),
  ('258293251172889727', 'Kung Fu Panda: Secrets of the Scroll', 2016, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Rodolphe Guenoden', 'Paul McEvoy', 'Jack Black, James Hong, Dustin Hoffman, Seth Rogen, Lucy Liu, Kari Wahlgren, Tara Macri, Randall Duk Kim', 'G', 'As Po looks for his lost action figures, the story of how the panda inadvertently helped create the Furious Five is told.', 'As Po looks for his lost action figures, the story of how the panda inadvertently helped create the Furious Five is told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LsQpFS3JOLmVfIV38oI9YHMpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381693'),
  ('320273084898825526', 'Kung Fu Vs. Acrobatic', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'David Chung, Taylor Wong Tai-Loi, Yuen Wah', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Joey Wong, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Cutie Mui Siu-Wai, Yuen Wah, Walter Tso Tat-Wah, Lau Shun, David Lau Chi-Wing', null, 'Friends Charles and Chi visit Mainland China and discover an ancient cave that houses what is supposed to be the makeshift tomb of the legendary martial artist Lung Gim-Fei. The friends find an old spell book and practice some magic, which unintentionally breaks open a wall and releases a dormant princess and her handmaiden. Charles and Chi take the Princess and her Handmaiden back to Hong Kong with them, unaware that they were followed by the just-awakened evil warlord, Tien Chien.', 'Friends Charles and Chi visit Mainland China and discover an ancient cave that houses what is supposed to be the makeshift tomb of the legendary martial artist Lung Gim-Fei. The friends find an old spell book and practice some magic, which unintentionally breaks open a wall and releases a dormant princess and her handmaiden. Charles and Chi take the Princess and her Handmaiden back to Hong Kong with them, unaware that they were followed by the just-awakened evil warlord, Tien Chien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3j1zlz6wcyER4MtZMsTIThHiPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172972'),
  ('522990618131093958', 'Kung Fu Yoga', 2017, 'Comedy, Mystery, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Garún Daníelsdóttir, Nicola Marzano', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai', 'Jackie Chan, Aarif Rahman, Zhang Yixing, Miya Muqi, Sonu Sood, Disha Patani, Zhang Guoli, Amyra Dastur', null, 'Two professors team up to locate a lost treasure and embark on an adventure that takes them from a Tibetan ice cave to Dubai, and to a mountain temple in India.', 'Two professors team up to locate a lost treasure and embark on an adventure that takes them from a Tibetan ice cave to Dubai, and to a mountain temple in India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rL6XM4fsr1cM5mN2flEhQ8jQter.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383785'),
  ('838311785455570371', 'Kung Fu Zombie', 1981, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Hua Shan, Hu Rong, Hu Long', 'Hua Shan', 'Willy Dozan, Chiang Tao, Kwon Yeong-Moon, Cheng Kang-Yeh, Chan Lau, Pak Sha-Lik, Woo Wai, Cheng Kei-Ying', 'NR', 'A criminal comes to town in order to kill Billy Chong over a past dispute. But instead of getting his own hands dirty, he hires a Taoist wizard to animate some zombies to do the job for him.', 'A criminal comes to town in order to kill Billy Chong over a past dispute. But instead of getting his own hands dirty, he hires a Taoist wizard to animate some zombies to do the job for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dg5TCrR01mFmAQM9jE6Ps4CQxRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67339'),
  ('362035811734853434', 'Kung Fu: The Movie', 1986, 'Drama, Western, Action', 'Richard Lang, Robert Seaman', 'Durrell Royce Crays', 'David Carradine, Kerrie Keane, Mako, William Lucking, Luke Askew, Keye Luke, Benson Fong, Brandon Lee', 'PG', 'In his travels, Caine meets up with an old man who has several surprises for him. The first being the destruction of the Shaolin order, the second being that the man is the father of the Emperor''s nephew whom he killed in China, and the third is that he seeks his revenge using the son Caine never knew he had sired as the instrument of his death. It will take all of Caine''s skill and wisdom to find a solution to this deadly predicament.', 'In his travels, Caine meets up with an old man who has several surprises for him. The first being the destruction of the Shaolin order, the second being that the man is the father of the Emperor''s nephew whom he killed in China, and the third is that he seeks his revenge using the son Caine never knew he had sired as the instrument of his death. It will take all of Caine''s skill and wisdom to find a solution to this deadly predicament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMriycO3joP1NFjbNwHmWyFH6pS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48290'),
  ('1104345011651454494', 'Kung Fu: The Way of the Tiger, the Sign of the Dragon', 1972, 'Adventure, Western, TV Movie', 'Jerry Thorpe', 'Howard Friedlander, Ed Spielman', 'David Carradine, Barry Sullivan, Albert Salmi, Wayne Maunder, Benson Fong, Richard Loo, Keye Luke, Philip Ahn', null, 'After avenging the death of his teacher, a Shaolin monk flees China to the American West and helps people while being pursued by bounty hunters.', 'After avenging the death of his teacher, a Shaolin monk flees China to the American West and helps people while being pursued by bounty hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIbiAl3ISzS61OuYF95OEERKWIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370843'),
  ('1136193052142289227', 'Kung Fury', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'David Sandberg', 'David Sandberg', 'David Sandberg, Jorma Taccone, Leopold Nilsson, Andreas Cahling, Helene Ahlson, Eos Karlsson, Eleni Young, Erik Hörnqvist', 'NR', 'During an unfortunate series of events, a friend of Kung Fury is assassinated by the most dangerous kung fu master criminal of all time, Adolf Hitler, a.k.a Kung Führer. Kung Fury decides to travel back in time to Nazi Germany in order to kill Hitler and end the Nazi empire once and for all.', 'During an unfortunate series of events, a friend of Kung Fury is assassinated by the most dangerous kung fu master criminal of all time, Adolf Hitler, a.k.a Kung Führer. Kung Fury decides to travel back in time to Nazi Germany in order to kill Hitler and end the Nazi empire once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1QpIlCqlFXp1hjnLplXb5irxip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251516'),
  ('1023071931138966839', 'Kung Pow: Enter the Fist', 2002, 'Comedy, Action', 'Steve Oedekerk, John J. Connor, Lyndon Barrois', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Oedekerk, Lung Fei, Leo Lee, Hsieh Ling-ling, Lau Kar-Wing, Lin Yan, Chen Hui-Lou, Jennifer Tung', 'PG-13', 'A movie within a movie, created to spoof the martial arts genre. Writer/director Steve Oedekerk uses contemporary characters and splices them into a 1970s kung-fu film, weaving the new and old together. As the main character, The Chosen One, Oedekerk sets off to avenge the deaths of his parents at the hands of kung-fu legend Master Pain. Along the way he encounters some strange characters.', 'A movie within a movie, created to spoof the martial arts genre. Writer/director Steve Oedekerk uses contemporary characters and splices them into a 1970s kung-fu film, weaving the new and old together. As the main character, The Chosen One, Oedekerk sets off to avenge the deaths of his parents at the hands of kung-fu legend Master Pain. Along the way he encounters some strange characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVsZ1hsJ9g11oCCav4N8ccp9bRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11891'),
  ('782217071509555624', 'Kung-Fu Master!', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Agnès Varda, Pierre-Laurent Chénieux, Philippe Tourret', 'Agnès Varda', 'Jane Birkin, Mathieu Demy, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Lou Doillon, Gary Chekchak, Cyril Houplain, Frank Laurent, Aurélien Hermant', null, 'A lonely 40-year old woman finds herself shattering taboos by falling in love with the 14-year old Julien – but is it romance, or a desperate attempt to turn back time in the face of middle age?', 'A lonely 40-year old woman finds herself shattering taboos by falling in love with the 14-year old Julien – but is it romance, or a desperate attempt to turn back time in the face of middle age?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymnlN8fhRDx0dmkqmZW4mQCbLXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47429'),
  ('648606173468107676', 'Kung-Fu Zohra', 2022, 'Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Pierre-Yves Bastard, Mabrouk El Mechri', 'Mabrouk El Mechri', 'Sabrina Ouazani, Ramzy Bedia, Eye Haïdara, Tien Shué, Lina Hachani, Matthieu Burnel, Olivia Côte, Ali El Mechri Efira', null, 'Zohra is convinced that separating from her husband Omar would break her little girl’s heart and so determines not to leave him despite the violence he metes out. Then she meets Chang Sue, the caretaker of the gym where she works to make ends meet. When she learns that he’s a kung fu master, Zohra asks him to teach her some self-defence basics…', 'Zohra is convinced that separating from her husband Omar would break her little girl’s heart and so determines not to leave him despite the violence he metes out. Then she meets Chang Sue, the caretaker of the gym where she works to make ends meet. When she learns that he’s a kung fu master, Zohra asks him to teach her some self-defence basics…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHTgTqZCQN5kd22QlyZMpPcFU3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885266'),
  ('1009351080889843640', 'Kunwara', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dhawan', null, 'Govinda, Urmila Matondkar, Nagma, Om Puri, Johny Lever, Gavin Packard, Inder Kumar, Raza Murad', null, 'Raju meets Urmila in New Zealand. They have a fast romance and things are going well until Raju must make a trip back to India...', 'Raju meets Urmila in New Zealand. They have a fast romance and things are going well until Raju must make a trip back to India...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLSmEZTqWrj4NPu7PQJ6IHKRh0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159067'),
  ('742715359347787195', 'Kunwari Dulhan', 1991, 'Thriller, Drama', null, null, 'Kaduvakulam Antony, Prem Leela, Reena', null, 'Kunwari Dulhan is a Hindi thriller starring Prem Leela and Reena.', 'Kunwari Dulhan is a Hindi thriller starring Prem Leela and Reena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYNadPUxOtyaMetqz0zhOtueTz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081422'),
  ('806381181435428446', 'Kurara: The Dazzling Life of Hokusai''s Daughter', 2017, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Taku Katô', 'Mika Ohmori', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Ryuhei Matsuda, Hiroki Miyake, Hideki Noda, Kimiko Yo, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Tomokazu Koshimura, Ayaka Nakata', null, 'Oei, later known as Katsushika Oi, was born the third daughter of Edo’s talented painter Katsushika Hokusai and his second wife Koto. Although Oei became the wife of a town painter for a time, her love of the paintbrush more than her husband spelt disaster and she comes back home to Hokusai from the family she had married into. This is how Oei starts to help her father out in his painting of the “insurmountable high wall”. Meanwhile, Oei can only talk to the painter Ikeda Zenjiro, who is her father’s student, about her pain and worries. Zenjiro has taken Edo by storm as Keisai Eisen, the master of ukiyo-e portraying beautiful women. He visits regularly because he admires Hokusai and secretly likes Oei although their relationship is like childhood friends. Oei respects her father whose paintings fascinated her and continues to work as a painter who supports him behind the scenes. When Hokusai’s masterpiece Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji was completed, she was also by his side.', 'Oei, later known as Katsushika Oi, was born the third daughter of Edo’s talented painter Katsushika Hokusai and his second wife Koto. Although Oei became the wife of a town painter for a time, her love of the paintbrush more than her husband spelt disaster and she comes back home to Hokusai from the family she had married into. This is how Oei starts to help her father out in his painting of the “insurmountable high wall”. Meanwhile, Oei can only talk to the painter Ikeda Zenjiro, who is her father’s student, about her pain and worries. Zenjiro has taken Edo by storm as Keisai Eisen, the master of ukiyo-e portraying beautiful women. He visits regularly because he admires Hokusai and secretly likes Oei although their relationship is like childhood friends. Oei respects her father whose paintings fascinated her and continues to work as a painter who supports him behind the scenes. When Hokusai’s masterpiece Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji was completed, she was also by his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5gWdoXBRqTaMIqOMqXCzpbnRqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517330'),
  ('788391710841875632', 'Kurbaan', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller, Action', 'Renzil D''Silva, Hemant Chaturvedi', 'Renzil D''Silva', 'Saif Ali Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Vivek Oberoi, Dia Mirza, Om Puri, Kirron Kher, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Nauheed Cyrusi', 'R', 'When a handsome young Indian couple (Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor) moves into the suburbs to claim their stake in the American dream, they are shocked to discover that they''ve become enmeshed in a secretive terrorist plot. But as tensions escalate, the bride begins to wonder if her husband has told her everything he knows.', 'When a handsome young Indian couple (Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor) moves into the suburbs to claim their stake in the American dream, they are shocked to discover that they''ve become enmeshed in a secretive terrorist plot. But as tensions escalate, the bride begins to wonder if her husband has told her everything he knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLG5R5pgVpTMFQbVeGhcUu1xSH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24613'),
  ('850391217934575067', 'Kuroko''s Basketball - Movie: Winter Cup - Beyond the Tears', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Shunsuke Tada, Masafumi Mima', null, 'Kensho Ono, Yuki Ono, Kisho Taniyama, Kenichi Suzumura, Takashi Ohara, Kenji Hamada, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Junichi Suwabe', null, 'Second of three compilation films of the Kuroko no Basket franchise. Seirin faces off with Yosen in the quarter finals of the Winter Cup. Facing Yosen’s impenetrable defense with Murasakibara at its center, Kuroko manages to shoot his first point. Meanwhile, the ace battle between Kagami and Himuro also heats up. An intense battle is held until the very end. Next, Seirin faces off with Kaijo in the semi finals. Cautious of Kaijo''s ace, Kise, and his Perfect Copy ability, Seirin works fast and hard to take the lead. Kise hurts his leg and is benched, so Seirin thinks they now have their chance, but then Kaijo shows them exactly what they can do even without Kise.', 'Second of three compilation films of the Kuroko no Basket franchise. Seirin faces off with Yosen in the quarter finals of the Winter Cup. Facing Yosen’s impenetrable defense with Murasakibara at its center, Kuroko manages to shoot his first point. Meanwhile, the ace battle between Kagami and Himuro also heats up. An intense battle is held until the very end. Next, Seirin faces off with Kaijo in the semi finals. Cautious of Kaijo''s ace, Kise, and his Perfect Copy ability, Seirin works fast and hard to take the lead. Kise hurts his leg and is benched, so Seirin thinks they now have their chance, but then Kaijo shows them exactly what they can do even without Kise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xt44vpeYkt8ECe00JcheKVe36h6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448967'),
  ('1097088912626798750', 'Kuroko''s Basketball - Movie: Winter Cup - Crossing the Door', 2016, 'Animation', 'Shunsuke Tada, Masafumi Mima', null, 'Kensho Ono, Yuki Ono, Ryota Osaka, Hiroshi Kamiya, Daisuke Ono', null, 'Third of three compilation films of the Kuroko no Basket franchise. Rakuzan and Shutoku face off in the semi finals at the Winter Cup. Despite struggling with Akashi''s Emperor Eye that sees through everything, Midorima and Takao fight back with their consecutive plays, and the whole Shutoku team bites back at Rakuzan. However, it doesn''t take long before Akashi crushes all of their hopes. It is decided that the finals will be fought between Seirin and Rakuzan. Kagami immediately enters the Zone as soon as the match starts, but it is no match for Akashi. Facing an extreme difference in ability against Rakuzan, Seirin loses their hope a number of times during the match. However, Kuroko doesn''t give up, and continues to strongly fight against Akashi.', 'Third of three compilation films of the Kuroko no Basket franchise. Rakuzan and Shutoku face off in the semi finals at the Winter Cup. Despite struggling with Akashi''s Emperor Eye that sees through everything, Midorima and Takao fight back with their consecutive plays, and the whole Shutoku team bites back at Rakuzan. However, it doesn''t take long before Akashi crushes all of their hopes. It is decided that the finals will be fought between Seirin and Rakuzan. Kagami immediately enters the Zone as soon as the match starts, but it is no match for Akashi. Facing an extreme difference in ability against Rakuzan, Seirin loses their hope a number of times during the match. However, Kuroko doesn''t give up, and continues to strongly fight against Akashi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewSs8KMJDme2LxkFxlp2K35jBOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448969'),
  ('721508539622013393', 'Kuroko''s Basketball - Movie: Winter Cup - Shadow and Light', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Masafumi Mima, Shunsuke Tada', null, 'Kensho Ono, Yuki Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ryohei Kimura, Daisuke Ono, Kenichi Suzumura, Kenji Hamada', null, 'First of three compilation films of the Kuroko no Basket franchise. The first match of Seirin vs Touou Gakuen at the Winter Cup. Seirin swore they would get revenge from the Inter-High, but Aomine''s talents grew even stronger and Kuroko''s new move is seen through. After having all of his efforts denied by his former light, Aomine, Kuroko is benched and faces humiliation. Seeing his partner like this, something almost beast-like awakens within Kagami, and he challenges Aomine. Aomine had lost almost all sense of fighting, until he and Kagami both intensely face off with each other as they go into the Zone.', 'First of three compilation films of the Kuroko no Basket franchise. The first match of Seirin vs Touou Gakuen at the Winter Cup. Seirin swore they would get revenge from the Inter-High, but Aomine''s talents grew even stronger and Kuroko''s new move is seen through. After having all of his efforts denied by his former light, Aomine, Kuroko is benched and faces humiliation. Seeing his partner like this, something almost beast-like awakens within Kagami, and he challenges Aomine. Aomine had lost almost all sense of fighting, until he and Kagami both intensely face off with each other as they go into the Zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3X9KQ9GTw4YxU9YK1RpsfCQQEsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401043'),
  ('600071654329174490', 'Kuroko''s Basketball the Movie: Last Game', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Shunsuke Tada, Akiharu Ishii, Chieko Miyagawa', 'Noboru Takagi', 'Kensho Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ryohei Kimura, Yuki Ono, Daisuke Ono, Kenichi Suzumura, Chiwa Saito', null, 'Kuroko reunites with the "Generation of Miracles" when former rivals are humiliated in an exhibition game against a notorious street basketball team.', 'Kuroko reunites with the "Generation of Miracles" when former rivals are humiliated in an exhibition game against a notorious street basketball team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXJQbwxA0joNv9rGy25rFrm5N1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428707'),
  ('1088464827744182464', 'Kuroneko', 1968, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Kaneto Shindō, Kiyomi Kuroda', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Kichiemon Nakamura II, Nobuko Otowa, Kiwako Taichi, Kei Satō, Taiji Tonoyama, Rokkō Toura, Hideo Kanze, Eimei Esumi', null, 'In the Sengoku period, a woman and her daughter are raped and murdered by soldiers during a time of civil war. Afterwards, a series of samurai returning from the war through that area are found mysteriously dead with their throats torn out. The governor calls in a wild and fierce young hero to quell what is evidently an Onryō ghost. He encounters the two beautiful women in an eerie, beautiful scene. After spiritual purification, he meets the demon in a thrilling fight.', 'In the Sengoku period, a woman and her daughter are raped and murdered by soldiers during a time of civil war. Afterwards, a series of samurai returning from the war through that area are found mysteriously dead with their throats torn out. The governor calls in a wild and fierce young hero to quell what is evidently an Onryō ghost. He encounters the two beautiful women in an eerie, beautiful scene. After spiritual purification, he meets the demon in a thrilling fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43LZYSBRMZoi9QdYntkGXhLSMeI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40149'),
  ('899997430909147772', 'Kurosawa''s Way', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Catherine Cadou', 'Catherine Cadou', 'Akira Kurosawa, Clint Eastwood, Hayao Miyazaki, Bernardo Bertolucci, Martin Scorsese, Bong Joon Ho, Abbas Kiarostami, Shinya Tsukamoto', null, 'Eleven major film makers from Europe, America and Asia talk about Akira Kurosawa and discover surprising influences on their own work.', 'Eleven major film makers from Europe, America and Asia talk about Akira Kurosawa and discover surprising influences on their own work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g368iFD5Bz7ycTkVkwfwTRlvtFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260066'),
  ('68547885652230272', 'Kursk', 2018, 'Drama, History, Thriller, Action', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Anthony Dod Mantle, Toby Whale', 'Robert Rodat', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Léa Seydoux, Peter Simonischek, Max von Sydow, August Diehl, Colin Firth, Bjarne Henriksen, Magnus Millang', 'PG-13', 'Barents Sea, August 12th, 2000. During a Russian naval exercise, and after suffering a serious accident, the K-141 Kursk submarine sinks with 118 crew members on board. While the few sailors who are still alive barely manage to survive, their families push for accurate information and a British officer struggles to obtain from the Russian government a permit to attempt a rescue before it is late. But general incompetence are against all their efforts.', 'Barents Sea, August 12th, 2000. During a Russian naval exercise, and after suffering a serious accident, the K-141 Kursk submarine sinks with 118 crew members on board. While the few sailors who are still alive barely manage to survive, their families push for accurate information and a British officer struggles to obtain from the Russian government a permit to attempt a rescue before it is late. But general incompetence are against all their efforts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y09MkMJ8CESSPW4fcbDm9s5cAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401200'),
  ('425419822104772611', 'Kurt & Courtney', 1998, 'Documentary, Music', 'Nick Broomfield, Alex Vetter, Alex Vendler', null, 'Nick Broomfield, Dylan Carlson, Kurt Cobain, El Duce, Larry Flynt, Tom Grant, Hank Harrison, Courtney Love', 'R', 'After rocker Kurt Cobain''s death, ruled a suicide, a film crew arrives in Seattle to make a documentary. Director Nick Broomfield talks to lots of people. Portraits emerge: a shy, slight Kurt, weary of touring, embarrassed by fame, hooked on heroin; an out-going Courtney, dramatic, controlling, moving from groupie to star.', 'After rocker Kurt Cobain''s death, ruled a suicide, a film crew arrives in Seattle to make a documentary. Director Nick Broomfield talks to lots of people. Portraits emerge: a shy, slight Kurt, weary of touring, embarrassed by fame, hooked on heroin; an out-going Courtney, dramatic, controlling, moving from groupie to star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m60KpD60vXOXjJXRjb4veX88Y8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13907'),
  ('589023171941187531', 'Kurt Cobain: About a Son', 2007, 'Documentary, Music', 'AJ Schnack, Wyatt Troll', null, 'Kurt Cobain', 'NR', 'An intimate and moving meditation on the late musician and artist Kurt Cobain, based on more than 25 hours of previously unheard audiotaped interviews conducted with Cobain by noted music journalist Michael Azerrad for his book "Come As You Are: The Story of Nirvana." In the film, Kurt Cobain recounts his own life - from his childhood and adolescence to his days of musical discovery and later dealings with explosive fame - and offers often piercing insights into his life, music, and times. The conversations heard in the film have never before been made public, and they reveal a highly personal portrait of an artist much discussed but not particularly well understood.', 'An intimate and moving meditation on the late musician and artist Kurt Cobain, based on more than 25 hours of previously unheard audiotaped interviews conducted with Cobain by noted music journalist Michael Azerrad for his book "Come As You Are: The Story of Nirvana." In the film, Kurt Cobain recounts his own life - from his childhood and adolescence to his days of musical discovery and later dealings with explosive fame - and offers often piercing insights into his life, music, and times. The conversations heard in the film have never before been made public, and they reveal a highly personal portrait of an artist much discussed but not particularly well understood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BSHkt8VU2V22lCIewCqn4gJQVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25630'),
  ('620739204167416926', 'Kurt Olsson - filmen om mitt liv som mej själv', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Håkan Wennberg, Magnus Stenberg, Folke Johansson', 'Håkan Wennberg, Lars Brandeby', 'Lars Brandeby, Anki Rahlskog, Ulla Skoog, Hans Wiktorsson, Kent Andersson, Per Oscarsson, Weiron Holmberg, Thomas Nystedt', null, 'How did Kurt become who he was? Why was he never elected class monitor? When did Arne come into the picture? And what happened when this dynamic duo did their military service? And Gudrun, who does she really like best? You''ll find the answers in the film about Kurtan. Kurtan seems to have his fingers in everything... from the shipyard crisis to the switch to right-hand traffic... and somehow everything seems to go wrong...', 'How did Kurt become who he was? Why was he never elected class monitor? When did Arne come into the picture? And what happened when this dynamic duo did their military service? And Gudrun, who does she really like best? You''ll find the answers in the film about Kurtan. Kurtan seems to have his fingers in everything... from the shipyard crisis to the switch to right-hand traffic... and somehow everything seems to go wrong...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEzLivvuq03iN0zsgmlqpkyZrvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71291'),
  ('433451529755773029', 'Kurt Vonnegut: Unstuck in Time', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Robert B. Weide, Cameron S. Mitchell, Don Argott', 'Robert B. Weide', 'Robert B. Weide, Kurt Vonnegut, Sam Waterston, Morley Safer, Edie Vonnegut, Bernard Vonnegut', null, 'A documentary 33 years in the making. A director and friend of Kurt Vonnegut seeks through his archives to create the first film featuring the revolutionary late writer.', 'A documentary 33 years in the making. A director and friend of Kurt Vonnegut seeks through his archives to create the first film featuring the revolutionary late writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35vwi9L8Dwo11GobEhPTLHxgnxs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485432'),
  ('553137318931014149', 'Kurup', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Nimish Ravi, Vini Vishwa Lal, Shaneem Zayed', 'K S Aravind, Daniel Sayooj Nair', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Sobhita Dhulipala, Indrajith Sukumaran, Tovino Thomas, Shine Tom Chacko, Sunny Wayne, P Balachandran, M R Gopakumar', null, 'The Film is based on the infamous ''Charlie Murder Case'' in the Indian State of Kerala where the main culprit Sukumara Kurup has been on the run for decades and is still not been caught. The story revolves around the perspective of Sukumara Kurup and the Police officers who were investigating the case.', 'The Film is based on the infamous ''Charlie Murder Case'' in the Indian State of Kerala where the main culprit Sukumara Kurup has been on the run for decades and is still not been caught. The story revolves around the perspective of Sukumara Kurup and the Police officers who were investigating the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DUKMFykp7pNpppbf8M6YDWrTYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785585'),
  ('917607943087375628', 'Kuruthi', 2021, 'Thriller, Action', 'Abinandhan Ramanujam, Manu Warrier', 'Anish Pallyal', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Roshan Mathew, Mamukkoya, Naslen K. Gafoor, Srindaa, Murali Gopy, Shine Tom Chacko, Navas Vallikkunnu', null, 'Ibrahim, a widower, grieves the loss of his wife and child and lives in a secluded area. However, his life turns upside down after a policeman comes knocking at his door with a criminal.', 'Ibrahim, a widower, grieves the loss of his wife and child and lives in a secluded area. However, his life turns upside down after a policeman comes knocking at his door with a criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArCY77ZQOrzW44OzPmYP99piiFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:813808'),
  ('839801773941249879', 'Kuruthipunal', 1995, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'P. C. Sreeram, P. C. Sreeram', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Arjun Sarja, Nassar, Gautami Tadimalla, Geetha, K. Viswanath, Nizhalgal Ravi, Ajay Rathnam', null, 'Adhi, a policeman, plans Operation Dhanush to catch a dreaded terrorist, Badri, and save innocent lives. However, when Badri, threatens his family, he must choose between his duty and his loved ones.', 'Adhi, a policeman, plans Operation Dhanush to catch a dreaded terrorist, Badri, and save innocent lives. However, when Badri, threatens his family, he must choose between his duty and his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nb44tkZV1eRDCTp7nw2ffQER0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66351'),
  ('624829520800858745', 'Kuruvi', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dharani, Babusivan, Gopinath', 'Dharani', 'Vijay, Trisha Krishnan, Suman Talwar, Manivannan, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Nassar, Vivek, Saranya Ponvannan', null, 'A son sets out to look for the man responsible for his father''s disappearance, which is connected to a stolen diamond. Eventually, he steals the villain''s diamond and also runs away with his sister.', 'A son sets out to look for the man responsible for his father''s disappearance, which is connected to a stolen diamond. Eventually, he steals the villain''s diamond and also runs away with his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR0BpNEuT2IRjCRrcGCRjiV9uQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53877'),
  ('194120013883553992', 'Kusama''s Self-Obliteration', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Jud Yalkut', 'Yayoi Kusama', 'Yayoi Kusama, Don Snyder, Joe Jones', null, 'A film exploration of the work and aesthetic concepts of Yayoi Kusama, painter, sculptor, and environmentalist, conceived in terms of an intense emotional experience with metaphysical overtones, an extension of my ultimate interest in a total fusion of the arts in a spirit of mutual collaboration. —Jud Yalkut', 'A film exploration of the work and aesthetic concepts of Yayoi Kusama, painter, sculptor, and environmentalist, conceived in terms of an intense emotional experience with metaphysical overtones, an extension of my ultimate interest in a total fusion of the arts in a spirit of mutual collaboration. —Jud Yalkut', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEt7wXvt7IFCoe9LgQ5Vglgv1bp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150994'),
  ('1035354630842908291', 'Kushi', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'S. J. Suryah, Jeeva, Andrew Louis', 'S. J. Suryah', 'Vijay, Jyothika, Vivek, Nagendra Prasad, Nizhalgal Ravi, Vijayakumar, Beena Banerjee, Janaki Sabesh', null, 'College friends Jenny and Shiva part ways due to a misunderstanding. Although they are in love and realize they cannot live without each other, their egos prevent them from uniting.', 'College friends Jenny and Shiva part ways due to a misunderstanding. Although they are in love and realize they cannot live without each other, their egos prevent them from uniting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0bz0nX3GqPKfoXY8kH8QFTyWCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69654'),
  ('687739008565556374', 'Kushi', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Shiva Nirvana, G. Murali, Suresh Kumar S.', 'Shiva Nirvana, Naresh Babu', 'Vijay Deverakonda, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Jayaram, Sachin Khedekar, Murali Sharma, Lakshmi, Rohini, Ali Basha', 'NR', 'Worlds and families collide when the son of a prominent atheist falls head over heels for the daughter of his father’s nemesis, a revered Hindu leader.', 'Worlds and families collide when the son of a prominent atheist falls head over heels for the daughter of his father’s nemesis, a revered Hindu leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiEnkpOarH20cCSikeLiWlvY1We.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965489'),
  ('561460973263757212', 'Kuso', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Flying Lotus, Jason Clark, Niki Randa', 'Zack Fox, Flying Lotus, David Firth', 'Iesha Rochelle, Oumi Zumi, David Firth, George Clinton, Byron Bowers, Zack Fox, Anders Holm, Tim Heidecker', 'NR', 'Broadcasting through a makeshift network of discarded televisions, this story is tangled up in the aftermath of Los Angeles''s worst earthquake nightmare. Travel between screens and aftershocks into the twisted lives of the survived.', 'Broadcasting through a makeshift network of discarded televisions, this story is tangled up in the aftermath of Los Angeles''s worst earthquake nightmare. Travel between screens and aftershocks into the twisted lives of the survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Pl3Vptkzaum6FZ5K6iDqybuhp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411549'),
  ('1064104142466750764', 'Kustom Kar Kommandos', 1965, 'Music', 'Kenneth Anger, Kenneth Anger', 'Kenneth Anger', 'Sandy Trent', null, 'A man in tight jeans buffs his car to the strains of The Paris Sisters'' "Dream Lover".', 'A man in tight jeans buffs his car to the strains of The Paris Sisters'' "Dream Lover".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dS06modSGSL5KA7HKKpLFjmwub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46780'),
  ('696433872192413917', 'Kutsal Damacana', 2007, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Varol Şahin, Ahmet Yılmaz, Fulya Yavuzoğlu', 'Ahmet Yılmaz', 'Şafak Sezer, Eyşan Özhim, Ersin Korkut, Büşra Pekin, Berivan Karaman, Settar Tanrıöğen, Yıldırım Memişoğlu, Erdal Tosun', null, 'Former sailor Fikret is having trouble settling into his new life in Istanbul and has begun to make use of the local church''s facilities. When priest Artin goes on a trip to Vatican, Fikret starts selling off the church''s cellar of expensive wines and stays in the priest''s room at night. Fikret spends most of his remaining time gambling on horse races and lecturing Asim, a naïve young boy working at the car wash located next door to the church who perceives him as a surrogate as a father figure. Fikret and Asim learn of a rich widowed businesswoman, Deniz, who thinks that her sister, Selen, has had a spell put upon her and is prepared to pay anything to have it lifted. Fikret decides to go to Deniz''s house disguised as a priest but gets more than he bargained for.', 'Former sailor Fikret is having trouble settling into his new life in Istanbul and has begun to make use of the local church''s facilities. When priest Artin goes on a trip to Vatican, Fikret starts selling off the church''s cellar of expensive wines and stays in the priest''s room at night. Fikret spends most of his remaining time gambling on horse races and lecturing Asim, a naïve young boy working at the car wash located next door to the church who perceives him as a surrogate as a father figure. Fikret and Asim learn of a rich widowed businesswoman, Deniz, who thinks that her sister, Selen, has had a spell put upon her and is prepared to pay anything to have it lifted. Fikret decides to go to Deniz''s house disguised as a priest but gets more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWXTV2ElMaxBl9HsiQFJCrfEvpk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53298'),
  ('1112640053091120281', 'Kutsal Damacana 2: İtmen', 2010, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Korhan Bozkurt, Selahattin Sancakli', 'Soner Günday, Kaan Ertem, Suat Özkan', 'Şafak Sezer, Mustafa Üstündağ, Aydemir Akbaş, Yıldırım Memişoğlu, Güzin Usta, Eriş Akman, Ferhat Güzel, Kemal Kuruçay', null, 'Fikret returns to Istanbul to tangle with Somali pirates and sojourns in a Budhist monastery to battle a werewolf.', 'Fikret returns to Istanbul to tangle with Somali pirates and sojourns in a Budhist monastery to battle a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFvPejZN5HVIt7Zl5m1EA5yUGEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52161'),
  ('499908434032443972', 'Kutsal Damacana 4', 2023, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Kamil Çetin, Bülent Özer', 'Kamuran Süner, Şafak Sezer', 'Şafak Sezer, Ersin Korkut, Müjde Uzman, Nilgün Belgün, Erhan Yazıcıoğlu, Onur Büyüktopçu, Yıldırım Memişoğlu, Deniz Oral', null, 'Fikret accidentally becomes a priest, finding himself in an unpredictable position in the priesthood. Unexpectedly rising to the Vatican, Fikret decides to return home.', 'Fikret accidentally becomes a priest, finding himself in an unpredictable position in the priesthood. Unexpectedly rising to the Vatican, Fikret decides to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvFdPztBqJ0IaudQYFeR7q1LgRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027410'),
  ('383398782364196530', 'Kutsal Damacana: Dracoola', 2011, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Korhan Bozkurt', 'Senol Zencir', 'Ersin Korkut, Şahin Irmak, Özge Ulusoy, Sinan Bengier, Ceyhun Fersoy, Duygu Yıldız, Hüseyin Elmalıpınar, Güzin Usta', null, 'Sebo, who was left in the courtyard of the mosque the day he was born and fed with the bait of pigeons and doves, finds himself beside a wealthy businessman when he grows up. Things change when Sebo falls in love but Count Dracula seeks revenge on Sebo because Sebo''s great-great-grandfather stole Dracula''s lover.', 'Sebo, who was left in the courtyard of the mosque the day he was born and fed with the bait of pigeons and doves, finds himself beside a wealthy businessman when he grows up. Things change when Sebo falls in love but Count Dracula seeks revenge on Sebo because Sebo''s great-great-grandfather stole Dracula''s lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGrgbN6j0NFFsrKJYRpsogse8xi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63363'),
  ('326128705686103256', 'Kuttey', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Aasmaan Bhardwaj, Farhad Ahmed Dehlvi, Vinod K Maurya', 'Aasmaan Bhardwaj', 'Arjun Kapoor, Tabu, Kumud Mishra, Radhikka Madan, Shardul Bhardwaj, Konkona Sen Sharma, Naseeruddin Shah, Ashish Vidhyarthi', null, 'A van carrying crores of cash. One rainy night in the outskirts of Mumbai. Unaware of each other, three stray gangs cross paths on the hunt. Unfortunately, all of them have the same plan. Bullets... Blood... Betrayal... It’s every man for himself... All the dogs after one bone. Will these dogs bite the bone, or will they lose to greed?', 'A van carrying crores of cash. One rainy night in the outskirts of Mumbai. Unaware of each other, three stray gangs cross paths on the hunt. Unfortunately, all of them have the same plan. Bullets... Blood... Betrayal... It’s every man for himself... All the dogs after one bone. Will these dogs bite the bone, or will they lose to greed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwJHR0qzAvJLKy7EioiSRu0QivY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864573'),
  ('75880878128687898', 'Kuuma kissa?', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erkko Kivikoski, Esko Nevalainen', 'Kerttu-Kaarina Suosalmi', 'Maarita Mäkelä, Eero Melasniemi, Kurt Ingvall, Urpo Poikolainen, Marja-Leena Kouki, Asta Backman, Seija Sora, Lasse Viljas', null, 'This love story finds a lonely teacher resisting the advances of an interested co-worker. She is fearful of affection and relationships due to a previous romance that did not work out. The small-town school marm tries to help a male student who has been suspended for drunkenness. She tutors the young man, and soon the two engage in a tender and passionate love affair in which both people reach out and touch each other physically and emotionally.', 'This love story finds a lonely teacher resisting the advances of an interested co-worker. She is fearful of affection and relationships due to a previous romance that did not work out. The small-town school marm tries to help a male student who has been suspended for drunkenness. She tutors the young man, and soon the two engage in a tender and passionate love affair in which both people reach out and touch each other physically and emotionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plcFGLsz70m2pmnQl699paLKgyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128415'),
  ('50256833366722448', 'Kuyank', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Johansyah Jumberan, Elhan Shaleh, Iman Samudera', 'Johansyah Jumberan, Asaf Antariksa', 'Rio Dewanto, Putri Intan Kasela, Ochi Rosdiana, Jolene Marie, Dayu Wijanto, Barry Prima, Hazman Al-Idrus, Ananda George', null, 'Seven years before the Saranjana gate opened. In a village on water and swamps, in the interior of Kalimantan. The secret of the black magic "Kuyang" is about to be revealed.', 'Seven years before the Saranjana gate opened. In a village on water and swamps, in the interior of Kalimantan. The secret of the black magic "Kuyang" is about to be revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EpUfboxaSoqzRE1bjasb0Qt6fT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1319125'),
  ('170670619785215047', 'Kvevri', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Irakli Kvirikadze', 'Luigi Pirandello, Revaz Gabriadze', 'Henrietta Lezhava, Vakhtang Sulakvelidze, Erosi Mandjgaladze, Givi Berikashvili, Otar Zautashvili, Ilia Bakakuri, Leo Sokhashvili, Meri Kandelaki', null, 'Gogia brings home a kvevri (georgian wine vessel) made in Imereti in Kakheti . Kvevri brought from a distance with a sledgehammer breaks carelessly. Gogia takes craftsman Abesalom home, who repairs the kvevri, but he himself will get stuck inside of it .', 'Gogia brings home a kvevri (georgian wine vessel) made in Imereti in Kakheti . Kvevri brought from a distance with a sledgehammer breaks carelessly. Gogia takes craftsman Abesalom home, who repairs the kvevri, but he himself will get stuck inside of it .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5M8UEAQLR6Mykk7oKC7VnvUK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284554'),
