  ('256965214562937487', 'Kyo Kii... Main Jhuth Nahin Bolta', 2001, 'Comedy', 'David Dhawan', 'Imtiaz Patel', 'Govinda, Sushmita Sen, Rambha, Satish Kaushik, Anupam Kher, Sharad S. Kapoor, Kiran Kumar, Ashish Vidhyarthi', null, 'Inpired from the movie "Liar Liar", this movie is about a lawyer (Govinda) who lies his way through marriage and career. His wife (Sushmita Sen) falls in love with him because of his honesty and when she finds out of his dishonesty she threatens to divorce him. Their son, to avoid the divorce, wishes on a shooting star that his father should lose the ability to lie. What happens after that is an enjoyable journey.', 'Inpired from the movie "Liar Liar", this movie is about a lawyer (Govinda) who lies his way through marriage and career. His wife (Sushmita Sen) falls in love with him because of his honesty and when she finds out of his dishonesty she threatens to divorce him. Their son, to avoid the divorce, wishes on a shooting star that his father should lose the ability to lie. What happens after that is an enjoyable journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNw4wVuvtJP15JFKGtpc9VRPsQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166233'),
  ('238795327430876473', 'Kyon Ki...', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'S. Thirunavukkarasu, Priyadarshan', 'Priyadarshan', 'Salman Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Jackie Shroff, Om Puri, Rimi Sen, Suniel Shetty, Arun Bakshi, Manoj Joshi', 'PG-13', 'After accidentally killing his fiancee, Anand becomes insane and is admitted to a psychiatric hospital. Tanvi, his doctor, falls in love with him, but her father does not approve, given his past.', 'After accidentally killing his fiancee, Anand becomes insane and is admitted to a psychiatric hospital. Tanvi, his doctor, falls in love with him, but her father does not approve, given his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j77NdrLrVhyt0e0enEG0ZzWP2v6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161212'),
