  ('675532086936395348', 'L.627', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Alain Choquart, Christine Raspillère', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Michel Alexandre', 'Didier Bezace, Jean-Paul Comart, Charlotte Kady, Jean-Roger Milo, Nils Tavernier, Philippe Torreton, Lara Guirao, Cécile Garcia-Fogel', 'R', 'In Paris, Lulu, a passionate policeman, works with the faith of a rookie, despite the sclerotic bureaucracy and the incompetence or negligence of some of his colleagues. In his new position as a narcotics inspector, he tries to keep his sanity as he witnesses the worst of the human condition.', 'In Paris, Lulu, a passionate policeman, works with the faith of a rookie, despite the sclerotic bureaucracy and the incompetence or negligence of some of his colleagues. In his new position as a narcotics inspector, he tries to keep his sanity as he witnesses the worst of the human condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZDV2rdnx9M2FfQAa4rX5SIHajs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39967'),
  ('129184393746290582', 'L.A. AIDS Jabber', 1994, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Drew Godderis, Rick Bradach', 'Drew Godderis', 'Jason Majik, Marcy Lynn, Justin Mack, Joy Yurada, Justin Godderis, Ralph de Leon, Mitzey Tony, Marcel Femine', null, 'Jeff, who has been diagnosed with AIDS, decides to get his revenge on the world by attacking people with hypodermic needles filled with his blood.', 'Jeff, who has been diagnosed with AIDS, decides to get his revenge on the world by attacking people with hypodermic needles filled with his blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBJGY3yzn54nVHjG3lKE3yAagLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360412'),
  ('89954052968702932', 'L.A. Bounty', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Worth Keeter, Gary Graver', 'Michael W. Leighton', 'Sybil Danning, Wings Hauser, Blackie Dammett, Henry Darrow, Frank Doubleday, Robert Hanley, Lenore Kasdorf, Bob Minor', 'R', 'Mayor candidate Mike Rhodes is kidnapped in his own home outside of Los Angeles by unknown, masked terrorists. His wife Kelly barely survives the attempted murder on her, and is able to identify one of the kidnappers. She''s placed on the police''s protection list while the investigation is ongoing. Ruger, a tough and merciless bounty hunter is out on the streets avenging her partner''s death. With Kelly as her bait, Ruger starts a dangerous game to bring Cavanough, a crazed crime kingpin behind the kidnapping, out of hiding.', 'Mayor candidate Mike Rhodes is kidnapped in his own home outside of Los Angeles by unknown, masked terrorists. His wife Kelly barely survives the attempted murder on her, and is able to identify one of the kidnappers. She''s placed on the police''s protection list while the investigation is ongoing. Ruger, a tough and merciless bounty hunter is out on the streets avenging her partner''s death. With Kelly as her bait, Ruger starts a dangerous game to bring Cavanough, a crazed crime kingpin behind the kidnapping, out of hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUSpfri1ipFjU2v8jcoBcEt3zN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137420'),
  ('1025947607465441480', 'L.A. Confidential', 1997, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Dante Spinotti, Curtis Hanson, Drew Ann Rosenberg', 'Curtis Hanson, Brian Helgeland', 'Kevin Spacey, Russell Crowe, Guy Pearce, James Cromwell, Kim Basinger, Danny DeVito, David Strathairn, Ron Rifkin', 'R', 'Three detectives in the corrupt and brutal L.A. police force of the 1950s use differing methods to uncover a conspiracy behind the shotgun slayings of the patrons at an all-night diner.', 'Three detectives in the corrupt and brutal L.A. police force of the 1950s use differing methods to uncover a conspiracy behind the shotgun slayings of the patrons at an all-night diner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWCgf5sD5FpMljjpkRhcC8pXcch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2118'),
  ('445070117271660532', 'L.A. Story', 1991, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Andrew Dunn, Mick Jackson', 'Steve Martin', 'Steve Martin, Victoria Tennant, Richard E. Grant, Marilu Henner, Sarah Jessica Parker, Susan Forristal, Kevin Pollak, Sam McMurray', 'PG-13', 'With the help of a talking freeway billboard, a "wacky weatherman" tries to win the heart of an English newspaper reporter, who is struggling to make sense of the strange world of early-90s Los Angeles.', 'With the help of a talking freeway billboard, a "wacky weatherman" tries to win the heart of an English newspaper reporter, who is struggling to make sense of the strange world of early-90s Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/At97val6UZyQoQtmH1b2Pe7bWqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2107'),
  ('199653643764138321', 'L.A. Takedown', 1989, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Michael Mann, Ronald Víctor García', 'Michael Mann', 'Scott Plank, Alex McArthur, Michael Rooker, Ely Pouget, Vincent Guastaferro, Richard Chaves, Victor Rivers, Laura Harrington', null, 'The tale of two skilled professionals--one a cop, the other a criminal--who aren''t as different as they think. Vincent Hanna is an intense cop on the trail of ruthless armed robber Patrick McLaren. After a botched heist, the two men confront each via a full scale battle on the seedy streets of Los Angeles.', 'The tale of two skilled professionals--one a cop, the other a criminal--who aren''t as different as they think. Vincent Hanna is an intense cop on the trail of ruthless armed robber Patrick McLaren. After a botched heist, the two men confront each via a full scale battle on the seedy streets of Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzPBYA8CR2m9ChptqiR1Puob04N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25964'),
  ('762934653607979198', 'L.A. Wars', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Martin Morris, Tony Kandah', 'Addison Randall, Tony Kandah', 'Vince Murdocco, Mary E. Zilba, Kerri Kasem, Maria C. Hurtado, Rodrigo Obregón, Sam Sabbagh, A.J. Stephans, David Jean Thomas', null, 'As the drug war rages, a powerful Mafia kingpin and rich drug lord battle for control of Los Angeles streets.', 'As the drug war rages, a powerful Mafia kingpin and rich drug lord battle for control of Los Angeles streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxMF6gigQOnSgsduVmMgGaeon5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137426'),
  ('455464150422794144', 'L.A. Without a Map', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Michel Amathieu', 'Richard Rayner, Mika Kaurismäki', 'David Tennant, Julie Delpy, Vinessa Shaw, Vincent Gallo, Steve Huison, Tony Peers, Margo Stanley, Saskia Reeves', 'NR', 'An aspiring Hollywood actress, on a visit to a charming North England town, has a brief fling with the town undertaker, who also writes obituaries for the local paper. Returning home, where she works as a waitress at a Japanese restaurant, she tells everyone about the handsome "writer" she met on her trip. Unfortunately, he decides to follow her back to Hollywood, setting up the expected light romantic comedy with asides as the newcomer gains experience about the goings on in Hollywood.', 'An aspiring Hollywood actress, on a visit to a charming North England town, has a brief fling with the town undertaker, who also writes obituaries for the local paper. Returning home, where she works as a waitress at a Japanese restaurant, she tells everyone about the handsome "writer" she met on her trip. Unfortunately, he decides to follow her back to Hollywood, setting up the expected light romantic comedy with asides as the newcomer gains experience about the goings on in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2olQqpq5qUVZzEkCm8BORl0G4S2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61675'),
  ('6265701874520153', 'L.E.T.H.A.L. Ladies: Return to Savage Beach', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andy Sidaris, Howard Wexler', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Julie Strain, Rodrigo Obregón, Julie K. Smith, Shae Marks, Marcus Bagwell, Cristian Letelier, Carrie Westcott, Paul Logan', 'R', 'A stolen computer disk contains the location of a hidden tresaure trove. It''s up to the sexy ladies of LETHAL (Legion to Ensure Total Harmony and Law) to find the treasure before the bad guys do.', 'A stolen computer disk contains the location of a hidden tresaure trove. It''s up to the sexy ladies of LETHAL (Legion to Ensure Total Harmony and Law) to find the treasure before the bad guys do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npdoxONT7hHRThjzIS4XYjYoSOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67395'),
  ('394497895636814454', 'L.I.E.', 2001, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael Cuesta, Romeo Tirone', 'Stephen M. Ryder, Michael Cuesta, Gerald Cuesta', 'Paul Dano, Bruce Altman, Brian Cox, Billy Kay, James Costa, Tony Michael Donnelly, Walter Masterson, Adam LeFevre', 'NR', 'With his mother dead and his father busy at work, Howie feels adrift in his New York suburb. He and his friend Gary spend their time burglarizing their neighbors'' homes — until they make the mistake of robbing the house of Big John, a macho former Marine who is also an unrepentant pedophile. He propositions Howie, who declines, but the two eventually develop an unlikely and dangerous friendship.', 'With his mother dead and his father busy at work, Howie feels adrift in his New York suburb. He and his friend Gary spend their time burglarizing their neighbors'' homes — until they make the mistake of robbing the house of Big John, a macho former Marine who is also an unrepentant pedophile. He propositions Howie, who declines, but the two eventually develop an unlikely and dangerous friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ck5Tkq17M6khEN7JQlQznoYl37L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18734'),
  ('322309359902242340', 'L.O.C.A. – Liga das Obsessivas Compulsivas por Amor', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Marina Erlanger, Cláudia Jouvin, Esperança Motta', 'Cláudia Jouvin', 'Mariana Ximenes, Débora Lamm, Roberta Rodrigues, Fábio Assunção, Luis Miranda, Érico Brás, Valentina Bandeira, Victor Lamoglia', null, 'Manuela is journalist in her thirties who faces love and professional crises. In an unexpected incident, she gets to know Elena, who takes her to a support group for women who love too much or are excessively jealous: the League of those who are Obsessive-Compulsive for Affection (L.O.C.A., Brazilian slang for "crazy"). The therapist seems to be an extremely mature and structured psychologist. Manuela sees this group as a chance to write an incredible article about the current female roles and wishes.', 'Manuela is journalist in her thirties who faces love and professional crises. In an unexpected incident, she gets to know Elena, who takes her to a support group for women who love too much or are excessively jealous: the League of those who are Obsessive-Compulsive for Affection (L.O.C.A., Brazilian slang for "crazy"). The therapist seems to be an extremely mature and structured psychologist. Manuela sees this group as a chance to write an incredible article about the current female roles and wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWdTBg9mugmDJPepAnTXrNe1aUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678941'),
  ('668953795822393770', 'L.O.L. Surprise! Winter Fashion Show', 2022, 'Animation', 'John Kafka, Melissa Pragassen', 'Bridgette Nichole Burgess', 'Sabrina Fest, Nerida Bronwen, Ruby Barrios, Randi DeMarco, Hillary Jones, Alex Cazares, Paris Dunbar, Bella Cate', null, 'The collection with which Neonlicious was to make her debut mysteriously disappears. Now you have to use all your creativity and improvise new designs for the big parade!', 'The collection with which Neonlicious was to make her debut mysteriously disappears. Now you have to use all your creativity and improvise new designs for the big parade!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik65OsEXbik1I0Di7SX9Sqv04e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039627'),
  ('909213747656085373', 'L.O.R.D: Legend of Ravaging Dynasties', 2016, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Edward Guo', 'Edward Guo', 'Yang Mi, Fan Bingbing, Lin Yun, Kris Wu, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Aarif Rahman, William Chan, Chen Xuedong', null, 'Based on the novel of the same name, the film depicts the endless battles of four kingdoms as they fight for power and domination of the one ultimate realm.Based on his 2 beloved fantasy novels with 6 million copies sold, L.O.R.D is acclaimed writer and director Guo Jingming’s follow up to his Tiny Times films. The action-adventure odyssey is set in a world of warring Sorcerers, Lords and Beasts. The first CGI Film to come from China', 'Based on the novel of the same name, the film depicts the endless battles of four kingdoms as they fight for power and domination of the one ultimate realm.Based on his 2 beloved fantasy novels with 6 million copies sold, L.O.R.D is acclaimed writer and director Guo Jingming’s follow up to his Tiny Times films. The action-adventure odyssey is set in a world of warring Sorcerers, Lords and Beasts. The first CGI Film to come from China', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIUDi1XDAREkarkwNzOOBgUzqyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369552'),
  ('1027523478696440709', 'L.O.R.D: Legend of Ravaging Dynasties 2', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, War, Animation', 'Edward Guo', 'Edward Guo', 'Kris Wu, Chen Xuedong, William Chan, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Lin Yun, Roy Wang, Karry Wang, Wang Duo', null, 'An upcoming Chinese computer animated motion capture action fantasy adventure film written and directed by Guo Jing Ming, the sequel to the first L.O.R.D: Legend of Ravaging Dynasties film.', 'An upcoming Chinese computer animated motion capture action fantasy adventure film written and directed by Guo Jing Ming, the sequel to the first L.O.R.D: Legend of Ravaging Dynasties film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43MlbzxB5OohgvPHmPIvRi4MCVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630044'),
  ('290336353938967518', 'L.S. Lowry: The Unheard Tapes', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Peter Sweasey, James Kent', null, 'Ian McKellen, Annabel Smith, L.S. Lowry, Angela Barratt, Verity Babbs', null, 'The story of the ''matchstick man'' painter, one of Britain''s most beloved artists, revealed as never before through intimate and previously unheard hidden recordings. Recorded by a young fan, Angela Barratt, in 1972, the tapes uncover much about Lowry''s life story and the changing north he captured in his iconic paintings. The voices in this film are real, lip-synced by actors Ian McKellen and Annabel Smith.', 'The story of the ''matchstick man'' painter, one of Britain''s most beloved artists, revealed as never before through intimate and previously unheard hidden recordings. Recorded by a young fan, Angela Barratt, in 1972, the tapes uncover much about Lowry''s life story and the changing north he captured in his iconic paintings. The voices in this film are real, lip-synced by actors Ian McKellen and Annabel Smith.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6imDWL4lkXRzIts2BzRYB8b8Vyg.jpg', 'plex:movie:l-s-lowry-the-unheard-tapes-2026'),
  ('568492896772777768', 'L.S.S - Love Subscribe Share', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'R. Mahalakshmi Murugan, NS Sathish Kumar', 'R. Mahalakshmi Murugan', 'Aadhav Krishna, Simran Advani', null, 'Shiva and Pooja, college students, travel to meet her mother. After an accident leaves Pooja hospitalized, Shiva faces suspicion. Her family searches desperately. The story''s twist ending reveals unexpected turns in their fate.', 'Shiva and Pooja, college students, travel to meet her mother. After an accident leaves Pooja hospitalized, Shiva faces suspicion. Her family searches desperately. The story''s twist ending reveals unexpected turns in their fate.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhylzMKvq8X750xOxQnx1Gb0rVWM.jpg', 'plex:movie:l-s-s-love-subscribe-share'),
  ('546171956108360906', 'L''abbiamo fatta grossa', 2016, 'Comedy, Family', 'Carlo Verdone, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Pasquale Plastino, Carlo Verdone, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Carlo Verdone, Antonio Albanese, Anna Kasyan, Clotilde Sabatino, Massimo Popolizio, Francesca Fiume, Virginia Da Brescia, Federigo Ceci', null, 'Yuri Pelagatti is a stage actor who is left jobless after a traumatic separation that resulted in his inability to remember his lines. Arturo Merlino is a shabby “investigator” who chases cats escaped from their homes. When Arturo and Yuri cross paths, Yuri is under the mistaken impression that Arturo is a consummate professional. He contracts Arturo to follow his ex-wife in order to find proof of her infidelity. But when he accidentally comes into the possession of a mysterious suitcase containing 1 million Euro, a series of hilarious troubles and daring adventures will result in an unpredictable finale…', 'Yuri Pelagatti is a stage actor who is left jobless after a traumatic separation that resulted in his inability to remember his lines. Arturo Merlino is a shabby “investigator” who chases cats escaped from their homes. When Arturo and Yuri cross paths, Yuri is under the mistaken impression that Arturo is a consummate professional. He contracts Arturo to follow his ex-wife in order to find proof of her infidelity. But when he accidentally comes into the possession of a mysterious suitcase containing 1 million Euro, a series of hilarious troubles and daring adventures will result in an unpredictable finale…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/addAIA6JTAGxPH6EEHQPMumI4R6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379873'),
  ('292502973012114505', 'L''Abribus', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Serge Khalfon, Philippe Sohier', null, 'Florence Foresti, Philippe Elno', null, 'The confrontation between a hypochondriac, stressed-out showbiz star and a peaceful beekeeper. Under a bus shelter in the middle of a country road, their encounter promises to be sharp.', 'The confrontation between a hypochondriac, stressed-out showbiz star and a peaceful beekeeper. Under a bus shelter in the middle of a country road, their encounter promises to be sharp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKY7aaLd8sr69rSQQWa3nyMwBKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75344'),
  ('759132648759390164', 'L''accabadora', 2017, 'Drama', 'Enrico Pau, Piers McGrail, Daniela Baldasarre', 'Enrico Pau, Antonia Iaccarino, Igort', 'Donatella Finocchiaro, Barry Ward, Carolina Crescentini, Anita Kravos, Sara Serraiocco, Federico Noli', null, 'Cagliari in the 1940s is a big city for those who come from a small village. Annetta arrives in the days befpre Italy enters WWII and the Allies begin bombing the city. She''s a 25-year old woman, always dressed in black, solitary and quiet, typical of the beauty of those from the most sparse areas of Sardegna.', 'Cagliari in the 1940s is a big city for those who come from a small village. Annetta arrives in the days befpre Italy enters WWII and the Allies begin bombing the city. She''s a 25-year old woman, always dressed in black, solitary and quiet, typical of the beauty of those from the most sparse areas of Sardegna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGqRqAqjNtsBueabKZwKIInMWlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384620'),
  ('755080554711700296', 'L''Acteur', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Hugo David, Raphaël Quenard', 'Hugo David, Raphaël Quenard', 'Raphaël Quenard, Jean-Baptiste Durand, Anthony Bajon, Galatea Bellugi, Kengo Saïto, Léa Millet, Thibaut Bayard', null, 'Raphaël is an actor. For the first time, he has the lead role in a feature film. No one understands why he was chosen. In fact, no one really understands him.', 'Raphaël is an actor. For the first time, he has the lead role in a feature film. No one understands why he was chosen. In fact, no one really understands him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy5iDrCDNnFh9JdoIFmUuAaC79r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145462'),
  ('321605656205087314', 'L''Addition', 1984, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Denis Amar, Robert Fraisse', 'Denis Amar, Jean-Pierre Bastid', 'Richard Berry, Richard Bohringer, Victoria Abril, Farid Chopel, Jacques Sereys, Fabrice Eberhard, Daniel Sarky, Francis Arnaud', null, 'For having wanted to defend a young girl accused of theft, a comedian finds himself in prison. Embarked in spite of himself in an escape attempt, he is condemned by a particularly incompetent court which follows without thinking the pleadings of an overzealous public prosecutor! Once incarcerated, the poor comedian has to deal with the harassment of one of the guards, a kind of dangerous sociopath frustrated with life.', 'For having wanted to defend a young girl accused of theft, a comedian finds himself in prison. Embarked in spite of himself in an escape attempt, he is condemned by a particularly incompetent court which follows without thinking the pleadings of an overzealous public prosecutor! Once incarcerated, the poor comedian has to deal with the harassment of one of the guards, a kind of dangerous sociopath frustrated with life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAp3pc1EXViY57Ypf2a9b68Qt7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225977'),
  ('144975012566935440', 'L''Affaire Dominici', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Pierre Boutron, Alain Levent', 'Odile Barski, William Reymond', 'Michel Serrault, Michel Blanc, Thomas Jouannet, Bruno Slagmulder, Julie Delarme, Vincent Martin, Armelle Deutsch, Jacques Spiesser', null, 'During the night of August 4-5, 1952, three Englishmen, Jack Drummond, his wife Anne and their daughter Elizabeth were murdered near their car near the farm of the Dominici family, in the commune of Lurs in the Alpes-de-Haute-Provence. Denounced by two of his sons, the patriarch Gaston Dominici was judged and condemned without any real evidence.', 'During the night of August 4-5, 1952, three Englishmen, Jack Drummond, his wife Anne and their daughter Elizabeth were murdered near their car near the farm of the Dominici family, in the commune of Lurs in the Alpes-de-Haute-Provence. Denounced by two of his sons, the patriarch Gaston Dominici was judged and condemned without any real evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yX44PMMzzoe8ZWjHF5KWUvBl0dX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251964'),
  ('1095085304596294925', 'L''affaire Dumont', 2012, 'Drama', 'Podz, Bernard Couture', 'Danielle Dansereau', 'Marc-André Grondin, Marilyn Castonguay, Sarianne Cormier, Kathleen Fortin, Martin Dubreuil, Geneviève Brouillette, Claude Legault, Francis La Haye', null, 'Michel Dumont is charged, judged and sentenced for a rape he denies ever having committed. While he serves his time in prison, Solange, who he fell in love with during his trial, embarks on the colossal task of proving his innocence and having the court rehabilitate him.', 'Michel Dumont is charged, judged and sentenced for a rape he denies ever having committed. While he serves his time in prison, Solange, who he fell in love with during his trial, embarks on the colossal task of proving his innocence and having the court rehabilitate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzbap1WADuEDPM0KjGl2ttgKU7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132875'),
  ('309680745781910863', 'L''Âge d''or', 1930, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, Albert Duverger, Jacques Brunius', 'Salvador Dalí, Luis Buñuel', 'Gaston Modot, Lya Lys, Caridad de Laberdesque, Max Ernst, Josep Llorens Artigas, Lionel Salem, Germaine Noizet, Duchange', null, 'The film consists of a series of tightly interlinked vignettes, the most sustained of which details the story of a man and a woman who are passionately in love. Their attempts to consummate their passion are constantly thwarted, by their families, by the Church and bourgeois society in general.', 'The film consists of a series of tightly interlinked vignettes, the most sustained of which details the story of a man and a woman who are passionately in love. Their attempts to consummate their passion are constantly thwarted, by their families, by the Church and bourgeois society in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3OH9Yk3hOE5uYEK55ASjEtsPfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5729'),
  ('813657211361913342', 'L''agenzia dei bugiardi', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Cristina Corna, Volfango De Biasi, Manfredo Archinto', 'Pierre Dudan, Philippe Lacheau, Julien Arruti', 'Giampaolo Morelli, Massimo Ghini, Alessandra Mastronardi, Paolo Ruffini, Herbert Ballerina, Diana Del Bufalo, Carla Signoris, Paolo Calabresi', null, 'Fred works for a company that creates alibis for cheaters until Clio, the daughter of one of his client, falls in love with him.', 'Fred works for a company that creates alibis for cheaters until Clio, the daughter of one of his client, falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsOavfCGUvNM0AtZsuZyPIz2aqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568240'),
  ('533585785965103609', 'L''allegro fantasma', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Amleto Palermi, Pier Luigi Faraldo, Fede Arnaud', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia', 'Totò, Luigi Pavese, Franco Coop, Augusto Di Giovanni, Paolo Stoppa, Elli Parvo, Giulio Donadio, Amelia Chellini', null, 'The noble Pantaleo Di Santa Paola has just died, and the preamble to his will is a confession in which he claims that in his youth he had a relationship with a circus rider that produced twin sons.', 'The noble Pantaleo Di Santa Paola has just died, and the preamble to his will is a confession in which he claims that in his youth he had a relationship with a circus rider that produced twin sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzVXqPb1jy5nxQpB72XqWKy6zDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72019'),
  ('847017322116009360', 'L''allenatore nel pallone', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Massimo Manasse, Federico Zanni', 'Romolo Guerrieri, Franco Verucci, Sergio Martino', 'Lino Banfi, Camillo Milli, Andrea Roncato, Gigi Sammarchi, Giuliana Calandra, Stefania Spugnini, Viviana Larice, Licinia Lentini', null, 'Oronzo Canà is called to coach Longobarda, the football team of a small town of Northern Italy, newly promoted to the First Division. His only task is not to be relegated, but Longobarda''s owner plots against him, finding the team''s current ranking far too expensive, and his top Brazilian striker is affected by a deep saudade.', 'Oronzo Canà is called to coach Longobarda, the football team of a small town of Northern Italy, newly promoted to the First Division. His only task is not to be relegated, but Longobarda''s owner plots against him, finding the team''s current ranking far too expensive, and his top Brazilian striker is affected by a deep saudade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZioqqIwcJGQ8mckT77QsoDIdxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39371'),
  ('999466907828885705', 'L''allenatore nel pallone 2', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Bruno Cascio, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Sergio Martino, Lino Banfi, Luca Biglione', 'Lino Banfi, Biagio Izzo, Giuliana Calandra, Anna Falchi, Stefania Spugnini, Alessandro Bonanni, Andrea Roncato, Elisa Della Valentina', null, 'The famous Italian football coach Oronzo Canà has retired to a villa in Apulia. Now, old and tired, he is enjoying a quiet life there, cultivating his vineyard, when suddenly he is summoned to Milan, in northern Italy. There the elderly chairman of a great Lombard ("Longobarda") club is suffering from dementia and has lost his powers of judgement, and the club''s manager has been fired. He has decided to bring back Oronzo Canà as trainer, remembering him from his great football team of thirty years before, tasking him with bringing the club back to its old winning ways. Oronzo puts his trust in the intervention of a Russian billionaire who has bought the club for promotion. But it is a deception.', 'The famous Italian football coach Oronzo Canà has retired to a villa in Apulia. Now, old and tired, he is enjoying a quiet life there, cultivating his vineyard, when suddenly he is summoned to Milan, in northern Italy. There the elderly chairman of a great Lombard ("Longobarda") club is suffering from dementia and has lost his powers of judgement, and the club''s manager has been fired. He has decided to bring back Oronzo Canà as trainer, remembering him from his great football team of thirty years before, tasking him with bringing the club back to its old winning ways. Oronzo puts his trust in the intervention of a Russian billionaire who has bought the club for promotion. But it is a deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twjo2WaT6Sdgvnr8x0V0WDJsVuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48805'),
  ('843170904111513280', 'L''amant', 2004, 'Drama', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Kei Shichiri', 'Nozomi Ando, Tomorowo Taguchi, Jun Murakami, Ren Osugi, Yuya Endo, Ayaka Maeda, Kenji Mizuhashi, Tatsuya Nakamura', null, 'When three older men buy a 17-year-old schoolgirl named Chikako for a year''s-worth of sexual services -- her motivation, aside from money, is never explained -- the relationships among the men (whom she calls A. B and C) keep shifting in ways that redefine power and sex.', 'When three older men buy a 17-year-old schoolgirl named Chikako for a year''s-worth of sexual services -- her motivation, aside from money, is never explained -- the relationships among the men (whom she calls A. B and C) keep shifting in ways that redefine power and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXQ4K5FX3DNcuDygewHNMEt8d3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108931'),
  ('517352901449222479', 'L''Américain', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Timsit', 'Jean-Carol Larrivé, Patrick Timsit', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Émilie Dequenne, Lorànt Deutsch, Patrick Le Luherne, Paolo Seganti, Mathias Mlekuz, Richard Berry, Marianne Denicourt', null, 'Francis Farge, alias "The American" could have remained a man like the others but a strange obsession animates him: he feels American body and soul.', 'Francis Farge, alias "The American" could have remained a man like the others but a strange obsession animates him: he feels American body and soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48U539e278OUvoGBzGoXHqThtzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86628'),
  ('853711987248131692', 'L''ami', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Arnaud Louvet, Léo Hinstin, Renaud Fély', 'Arnaud Louvet, Renaud Fély, Julie Peyr', 'Elio Germano, Jérémie Renier, Alba Rohrwacher, Stefano Cassetti, Thomas Doret, Yannick Renier, Éric Caravaca, Marcello Mazzarella', null, 'The movie follows Elia da Cortona, one of the most faithful followers of St. Francis, from 1209 to 1226.', 'The movie follows Elia da Cortona, one of the most faithful followers of St. Francis, from 1209 to 1226.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2396jj6KE2tsHo6Tn27FdHoRxea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419331'),
  ('667480494391328166', 'L''Ami qui n''existe pas', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicolas Cuche', 'Nicolas Cuche, Olivier Norek', 'Audrey Dana, Medi Sadoun, Tiphaine Daviot, Victor Meutelet, Albert Geffrier, Guilaine Londez, Yvan Naubron, Jehanne Pasquet', null, 'Since his father''s death, Martin, 11, has said hardly a word. His mother, Camille, is worried. Then, one day, Martin talks about his new friend Jeff who has made life worth living again. But after one night at Jeff''s, Martin disappears. Then Camille learns that there''s no pupil called Jeff.', 'Since his father''s death, Martin, 11, has said hardly a word. His mother, Camille, is worried. Then, one day, Martin talks about his new friend Jeff who has made life worth living again. But after one night at Jeff''s, Martin disappears. Then Camille learns that there''s no pupil called Jeff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7aYzJLVHbVqzLRyALhRWfGAqRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881672'),
  ('16051347852587640', 'L''Amore', 1948, 'Drama', 'Roberto Rossellini, Aldo Tonti, Robert Juillard', 'Roberto Rossellini, Tullio Pinelli', 'Anna Magnani, Federico Fellini, Peparuolo, Amelia Robert', null, 'L''Amore (''Love'') is a 1948 Italian drama anthology film that consists of two parts, The Human Voice (Una voce umana), based on Jean Cocteau''s 1929 play of the same title, and The Miracle (Il miracolo), based on Ramón del Valle-Inclán''s 1904 novel Flor de santidad.', 'L''Amore (''Love'') is a 1948 Italian drama anthology film that consists of two parts, The Human Voice (Una voce umana), based on Jean Cocteau''s 1929 play of the same title, and The Miracle (Il miracolo), based on Ramón del Valle-Inclán''s 1904 novel Flor de santidad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhnoiJDFM39YYEoVqFnWv1x669e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43444'),
