  ('282515838815072668', 'L''immensità', 2022, 'Drama', 'Gergely Pohárnok, Giuseppe Barletta, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Emanuele Crialese, Francesca Manieri, Vittorio Moroni', 'Penélope Cruz, Luana Giuliani, Vincenzo Amato, Aurora Quattrocchi, Elena Arvigo, Laura Nardi, Francesco Casisa, Filippo Pucillo', 'NR', 'Clara and Felice struggle to raise their three children in 1970s Rome. The eldest, Andrea, is transgender and yearns for another life where he gets to live as the boy he knows himself to be. Clara instinctively strives to protect her son by escaping into their imaginations to defuse family tensions.', 'Clara and Felice struggle to raise their three children in 1970s Rome. The eldest, Andrea, is transgender and yearns for another life where he gets to live as the boy he knows himself to be. Clara instinctively strives to protect her son by escaping into their imaginations to defuse family tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zVoxTnEXEbCAv4BCJRvb54sJKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770724'),
  ('1005857350334904818', 'L''immoralità', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Massimo Pirri, Riccardo Pallottini, Mario Jurisic', 'Massimo Pirri, Federico Tofi, Morando Morandini Jr.', 'Lisa Gastoni, Howard Ross, Karin Trentephol, Mel Ferrer, Andrea Franchetti, Wolfango Soldati', null, 'Federico is a child-killer running from the law. Wounded, he is taken in by an 11 year old girl named Simona. Their strange love affair is interrupted by Simona''s depressed, oversexed mother Vera, who concocts a plan with Federico to kill her wheelchair-bound, reclusive husband. Simona does not take kindly to this new relationship between Federico and Vera.', 'Federico is a child-killer running from the law. Wounded, he is taken in by an 11 year old girl named Simona. Their strange love affair is interrupted by Simona''s depressed, oversexed mother Vera, who concocts a plan with Federico to kill her wheelchair-bound, reclusive husband. Simona does not take kindly to this new relationship between Federico and Vera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1oAr3BFG5nKILdJ9ICeRqdZHpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81671'),
