  ('1093284416492772906', 'La Belle Équipe', 1936, 'Drama', 'Julien Duvivier, Robert Vernay', 'Julien Duvivier, Charles Spaak', 'Jean Gabin, Charles Vanel, Viviane Romance, Charles Dorat, Raphaël Médina, Micheline Cheirel, Marcelle Géniat, Fernand Charpin', null, 'Five unemployed workers win 100,000 Francs in the national lottery. Instead of sharing the money, they buy a ruin and build an open-air cafe. But difficulties come to split their friendly group apart.', 'Five unemployed workers win 100,000 Francs in the national lottery. Instead of sharing the money, they buy a ruin and build an open-air cafe. But difficulties come to split their friendly group apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vMDpc2cD05vys5jWkXoy9co6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67443'),
  ('285959896408157320', 'La Belle Noiseuse', 1991, 'Drama', 'William Lubtchansky, Jacques Rivette, Thomas Pitre', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Jacques Rivette, Christine Laurent', 'Michel Piccoli, Emmanuelle Béart, Jane Birkin, Marianne Denicourt, David Bursztein, Gilles Arbona, Marie Belluc, Marie-Claude Roger', null, 'The former famous painter Frenhofer lives quietly with his wife on a countryside residence in the French Provence. When the young artist Nicolas visits him with his girlfriend Marianne, Frenhofer decides to start again the work on a painting he long ago stopped: La Belle Noiseuse. And he wants Marianne as model.', 'The former famous painter Frenhofer lives quietly with his wife on a countryside residence in the French Provence. When the young artist Nicolas visits him with his girlfriend Marianne, Frenhofer decides to start again the work on a painting he long ago stopped: La Belle Noiseuse. And he wants Marianne as model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6f7I9RUdoDa9AgM9X2oAc3pk4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12627'),
  ('314529133271208776', 'La Belle Noiseuse: Divertimento', 1992, 'Drama', 'Jacques Rivette', 'Jacques Rivette', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Michel Piccoli, Jane Birkin, Marianne Denicourt, David Bursztein, Gilles Arbona', null, 'More than just an abbreviated form of "La Belle Noiseuse", Rivette re-cut his footage with some important differences in point of view - this one being more from Marianne''s point of view', 'More than just an abbreviated form of "La Belle Noiseuse", Rivette re-cut his footage with some important differences in point of view - this one being more from Marianne''s point of view', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o68wLlKRw5c92ryO4S9mrIaBd1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607050'),
