  ('1072807489197403691', 'La bostella', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Baer, Laurent Machuel', 'Édouard Baer, Fabrice Roger-Lacan', 'Édouard Baer, Philippe Laudenbach, Rosine Favey, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Jean-Michel Lahmi, Pierre-Louis Lanier, Joseph Malerba, Sonia Mankaï', null, 'Taking its title from a popular 1960s dance craze, this digital video comedy concerns the exploits of a particularly odd fictional talk-show host, portrayed by real-life French talk-show sensation Edouard Baer. Baer -- who also directed and co-wrote the film -- plays a sarcastic TV personality who decides to gather together the panel members from his live show before they shoot the program so that they have a chance to rehearse. To this end, the absurd group -- including a lawyer, a transvestite, and a grown woman who acts like a child -- rents a villa for a month. It doesn''t take long for resentment to fester among the motley crew.', 'Taking its title from a popular 1960s dance craze, this digital video comedy concerns the exploits of a particularly odd fictional talk-show host, portrayed by real-life French talk-show sensation Edouard Baer. Baer -- who also directed and co-wrote the film -- plays a sarcastic TV personality who decides to gather together the panel members from his live show before they shoot the program so that they have a chance to rehearse. To this end, the absurd group -- including a lawyer, a transvestite, and a grown woman who acts like a child -- rents a villa for a month. It doesn''t take long for resentment to fester among the motley crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K1OBtixhPKLN7kiwRE17Q7iYfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72261'),
  ('259777298022668624', 'La búsqueda', 1985, 'Action, Drama', 'Carlos Abbate, Ricardo Feliú, Juan Carlos Lenardi', 'Lito Espinosa', 'Rodolfo Ranni, Andrea Tenuta, Luisina Brando, Emilio Disi, Darío Grandinetti, Marta González, Jorge Sassi, Boy Olmi', null, 'A family is taken hostage by a trio of criminals. The father is killed, and the daughter swears revenge.', 'A family is taken hostage by a trio of criminals. The father is killed, and the daughter swears revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79TPLPMaRPVgOLwbEZrZLwlxjgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164064'),
  ('599462972548124530', 'La Cabale des oursins', 1992, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Luc Moullet, Gilles Sauzède, Richard Copans', 'Luc Moullet', 'Luc Moullet, Jean Abeillé, Jean Narboni, Noël Simsolo, Gilles Sauzède, Richard Copans, Katell Djian, Olivier Schwob', null, 'A travelogue of abandoned strip mining sites in France extolling their potential for recreational use.', 'A travelogue of abandoned strip mining sites in France extolling their potential for recreational use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GA4JmrW7pobnFYxLNmCfyt1K3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162765'),
  ('100587302276103958', 'La Cage aux folles', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Thiel, Didier Caron', 'Francis Veber', 'Christian Clavier, Didier Bourdon, Thomas Sagols, Manoëlle Gaillard, Daniel-Jean Colloredo, Thierry Laurion, Héléna Grouchka, Marie-Hélène Lentini', null, '"La Cage aux Folles" is a club which has a transvestite show, starring Zaza (whose real name Albin). It forms Renato old homosexual couple. The latter was previously a son, Laurent, who announces his future marriage with the daughter of a deputy. The meeting with the conservative politician is unavoidable ...', '"La Cage aux Folles" is a club which has a transvestite show, starring Zaza (whose real name Albin). It forms Renato old homosexual couple. The latter was previously a son, Laurent, who announces his future marriage with the daughter of a deputy. The meeting with the conservative politician is unavoidable ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZvHpQoBu3s6rLwpG2SydLA8skq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116198'),
  ('963713976991983724', 'La Cage aux Folles', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Molinaro, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Francis Veber, Édouard Molinaro, Marcello Danon', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Michel Serrault, Claire Maurier, Rémi Laurent, Carmen Scarpitta, Benny Luke, Luisa Maneri, Michel Galabru', 'R', 'Two gay men living in St. Tropez have their lives turned upside down when the son of one of the men announces he is getting married. They try to conceal their lifestyle and their ownership of the drag club downstairs when the fiancée and her parents come for dinner.', 'Two gay men living in St. Tropez have their lives turned upside down when the son of one of the men announces he is getting married. They try to conceal their lifestyle and their ownership of the drag club downstairs when the fiancée and her parents come for dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMz9BUs3qIAx5UAO5BLiufzVwrr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4484'),
  ('1027524428022765340', 'La Cage aux Folles 3', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Georges Lautner, Luciano Tovoli', 'Michel Audiard, Jacques Audiard, Francis Veber', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Michel Serrault, Antonella Interlenghi, Michel Galabru, Saverio Vallone, Benny Luke, Stéphane Audran, Gianluca Favilla', null, 'Third and final version of the La Cage aux Folles series has Renato''s drag queen lover Albin learning that he can inherit a vast fortune from a distant relative. But the catch is that Albin must marry (a woman) and produce a heir within a year or the whole inheritance will be forfeited.', 'Third and final version of the La Cage aux Folles series has Renato''s drag queen lover Albin learning that he can inherit a vast fortune from a distant relative. But the catch is that Albin must marry (a woman) and produce a heir within a year or the whole inheritance will be forfeited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eGUWQlo3Dg7zMyrLmJdE81s821.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78159'),
  ('113221490299811138', 'La Cage aux Folles II', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Molinaro, Armando Nannuzzi, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Francis Veber, Jean Poiret, Marcello Danon', 'Michel Serrault, Ugo Tognazzi, Marcel Bozzuffi, Michel Galabru, Paola Borboni, Benny Luke, Giovanni Vettorazzo, Glauco Onorato', null, 'In a move to make his partner, Renato, jealous, the flamboyant Albin waits in a local cafe - dressed as a woman - hoping to be picked up. But Albin gets more than he bargains for when the fly he catches in his web is actually a spy, who uses him as an unwitting courier of secret microfilm. Now on the run from ruthless agents, Albin and Renato flee to Italy where they attempt to hide out on a farm, with Albin posing as Renato''s wife. Can Albin escape the deadly pursuit of these relentless spies or does he have to sustain this charade - as a woman - forever?', 'In a move to make his partner, Renato, jealous, the flamboyant Albin waits in a local cafe - dressed as a woman - hoping to be picked up. But Albin gets more than he bargains for when the fly he catches in his web is actually a spy, who uses him as an unwitting courier of secret microfilm. Now on the run from ruthless agents, Albin and Renato flee to Italy where they attempt to hide out on a farm, with Albin posing as Renato''s wife. Can Albin escape the deadly pursuit of these relentless spies or does he have to sustain this charade - as a woman - forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/larXxegvNf6DwwbUWZ94zYfreWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11684'),
  ('983675876658201540', 'La cambiale', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Alvaro Mancori, Franco Montemurro', 'Luigi Magni, Manlio Scarpelli, Vittorio Metz', 'Vittorio Gassman, Ugo Tognazzi, Totò, Sylva Koscina, Giorgia Moll, Peppino De Filippo, Erminio Macario, Raimondo Vianello', null, 'The Posalaquaglia cousins are two small scammers and make a living of expedients: Dante receives as recognition for Tommaso a bill of one hundred thousand lire from the famous financier Bruscatelli, who ends up in prison immediately afterwards.', 'The Posalaquaglia cousins are two small scammers and make a living of expedients: Dante receives as recognition for Tommaso a bill of one hundred thousand lire from the famous financier Bruscatelli, who ends up in prison immediately afterwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opPyZ5MRHfNdSv2p9MEoTUznNZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76486'),
  ('1097088143076991401', 'La cartomancienne', 1932, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jerome Hill', null, null, null, 'In a European seaside village, a maiden takes clean sheets down from the clothesline. Carrying her basket of linens home, she stops to consult a fortune teller. The cartomancienne sees love in the cards. The young woman pauses to reflect. We then see water, swirling, and into view swims a man, as if just appearing on earth. He arrives on shore - is he just in her mind''s eye, or is he real? She weaves a garland for her hair. Will they meet?', 'In a European seaside village, a maiden takes clean sheets down from the clothesline. Carrying her basket of linens home, she stops to consult a fortune teller. The cartomancienne sees love in the cards. The young woman pauses to reflect. We then see water, swirling, and into view swims a man, as if just appearing on earth. He arrives on shore - is he just in her mind''s eye, or is he real? She weaves a garland for her hair. Will they meet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3HyQ7u9zQjk6mcGtFkiMmeVAR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156529'),
  ('1042556211067425161', 'La Casa', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jorge Olguín, Jorge Olguín, Paulette Lecaros', 'Jorge Olguín', 'Gabriel Cañas, Camila Carreño, Carol Campos, Carlos Cortez, Felipe Silva Rodriguez, Eduardo de la Iglesia, Alejandra Díaz, Daniel Caceres', null, 'Responding to an urgent call for help, a police officer becomes trapped by the evil spirits of a cursed house.', 'Responding to an urgent call for help, a police officer becomes trapped by the evil spirits of a cursed house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvTGWaQejnHQBZbEOrdbb38NBTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648990'),
  ('700704052443985559', 'La casa acecha', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Eric Dawidson, Mariano Dawidson', 'Alberto Andrés Fasce, Dieguillo Fernández, Mariano De Rosa', 'Mike Amigorena, Leonora Balcarce, Edgardo Moreira, Christian Álvarez', null, 'It tells the story of a couple traveling to repair a bucolic country house. As the days pass, the woman begins to sense a strange presence. A sinister figure protects the abandoned house, driving its inhabitants to madness and death.', 'It tells the story of a couple traveling to repair a bucolic country house. As the days pass, the woman begins to sense a strange presence. A sinister figure protects the abandoned house, driving its inhabitants to madness and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVGhkh4tT3j86CNFYWWErSYQWs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713924'),
