  ('214173956975502211', 'La Cicciolina: Godmother of Scandal', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Alessandro Melazzini, Alessandro Soetje', 'Alessandro Melazzini', 'Ilona Staller, Debora Attanasio, Filippo Ceccarelli, Luca Di Carlo, Elvire Duvelle-Charles, Ivo Stefano Germano, Marco Gregoretti, Ludwig Koons', null, 'The personal and professional story of Ilona Staller, known as Cicciolina, is probably unique: she left communist Hungary and moved to Italy, where she found a fertile environment for a life dedicated to scandal.', 'The personal and professional story of Ilona Staller, known as Cicciolina, is probably unique: she left communist Hungary and moved to Italy, where she found a fertile environment for a life dedicated to scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sViD5LTBxH5cfPhZgFVhKGLAuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444261'),
  ('771020105581784568', 'La Ciénaga', 2001, 'Drama', 'Lucrecia Martel, Fabiana Tiscornia, Hugo Colace', 'Lucrecia Martel', 'Mercedes Morán, Graciela Borges, Martín Adjemián, Leonora Balcarce, Silvia Baylé, Sofia Bertolotto, Juan Cruz Bordeu, Noelia Bravo Herrera', 'R', 'Amid the sweltering summer heat in northern Argentina, two middle-class families retreat to a crumbling country estate and a modest townhouse, where strained relationships, simmering tensions, and the presence of children and servants quietly expose the fractures of family life. Between idle days, gossip, and unspoken desires, the boundaries of class, tradition, and faith are reflected in their everyday interactions.', 'Amid the sweltering summer heat in northern Argentina, two middle-class families retreat to a crumbling country estate and a modest townhouse, where strained relationships, simmering tensions, and the presence of children and servants quietly expose the fractures of family life. Between idle days, gossip, and unspoken desires, the boundaries of class, tradition, and faith are reflected in their everyday interactions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcgRKfCRudyWggyHIT9LOPgU3qW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58429'),
