  ('1089882269458943803', 'La descarriada', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Vicente Minaya Ortega, Zacarías Urbiola', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Lina Morgan, Antonio Ozores, Florinda Chico, Rafaela Aparicio, Laly Soldevila, Antonio Ferrandis, Pilar Bardem, Rogelio Madrid', null, 'Nati has no choice but to work as a prostitute to support her siblings. Unfortunately she has not had much success; it''s difficult to get customers and she also owes money to her "protector", Florencio. But one day a kind of Prince Charming shows up...', 'Nati has no choice but to work as a prostitute to support her siblings. Unfortunately she has not had much success; it''s difficult to get customers and she also owes money to her "protector", Florencio. But one day a kind of Prince Charming shows up...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVbyYZT2eDaVS60vJMMXYa08Vxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146146'),
  ('450271859455146576', 'La Désintégration', 2012, 'Drama', 'Philippe Faucon, Laurent Fénart', 'Eric Nebot, Philippe Faucon', 'Rashid Debbouze, Yassine Azzouz, Ymanol Perset, Mohamed Nachit, Zahra Addioui, Kamel Laadaili', null, 'Three young men meet Djamel (Yassine Azzouz), a charismatic manipulator, who turns the three friends against society.', 'Three young men meet Djamel (Yassine Azzouz), a charismatic manipulator, who turns the three friends against society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbpuCowaODrQMVcUM3S414pfpPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133246'),
  ('295216773014344683', 'La Dilettante', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Thomas', 'Jacques Lourcelles, Pascal Thomas', 'Catherine Frot, Sébastien Cotterot, Barbara Schulz, Christian Morin, Marie-Christine Barrault, Odette Laure, Sophie Forte, Jean Desailly', null, 'Pierrette is a woman who describes herself as having "opted for the temporary on a permanent basis." After 15 years of living the good life in Switzerland, Pierrette one day packs her bags full of fashionable outfits and returns to her native Paris with no idea of what she''ll do. Pierette, however, leads a charmed life; while her son is forced to work the graveyard shift at a factory due to poor job prospects, she''s able to find a job right away at a high school. Pierrette soon reintroduces herself to her 23-year-old daughter and one-time best friend, trying to use her charm to skate over years of neglect. She just as suddenly finds a new beau, Ackerman, and starts helping him out with his antique business. However, what would seem like a simple matter -- buying a clock from an elderly woman -- soon turns out to be very complicated and fraught with consequence.', 'Pierrette is a woman who describes herself as having "opted for the temporary on a permanent basis." After 15 years of living the good life in Switzerland, Pierrette one day packs her bags full of fashionable outfits and returns to her native Paris with no idea of what she''ll do. Pierette, however, leads a charmed life; while her son is forced to work the graveyard shift at a factory due to poor job prospects, she''s able to find a job right away at a high school. Pierrette soon reintroduces herself to her 23-year-old daughter and one-time best friend, trying to use her charm to skate over years of neglect. She just as suddenly finds a new beau, Ackerman, and starts helping him out with his antique business. However, what would seem like a simple matter -- buying a clock from an elderly woman -- soon turns out to be very complicated and fraught with consequence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NdRFpFmHFDPZHDFJOSRqAENJbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77776'),
  ('482146867367889607', 'La distancia', 2006, 'Drama', 'Iñaki Dorronsoro, Daniel Aranyó', 'Iñaki Dorronsoro', 'Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Jose Coronado, Federico Luppi, Belén López', null, 'Daniel, a young boxer on the point of winning the title several times, is beaten yet again and commits a robbery that lands him in jail. Guillermo, a self-destructive policeman tormented by his latent homosexuality, blackmails Daniel into committing a murder behind bars. In exchange, Daniel gains his freedom and returns to the only thing he knows how to do: box. But this time the search for pain to relieve the guilt has made his conservative style more aggressive. He remembers the last conversation he had with the man he killed, when he talked about his wife, and goes to meet her. Seeing danger in the relationship between the victim''s murderer and his widow, Guillermo tries to stop it.', 'Daniel, a young boxer on the point of winning the title several times, is beaten yet again and commits a robbery that lands him in jail. Guillermo, a self-destructive policeman tormented by his latent homosexuality, blackmails Daniel into committing a murder behind bars. In exchange, Daniel gains his freedom and returns to the only thing he knows how to do: box. But this time the search for pain to relieve the guilt has made his conservative style more aggressive. He remembers the last conversation he had with the man he killed, when he talked about his wife, and goes to meet her. Seeing danger in the relationship between the victim''s murderer and his widow, Guillermo tries to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oulYJZamvHL3SyiEwwkoSOSzdAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89598'),
  ('314735623808275247', 'La Dolce Villa', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mark Waters, Theo van de Sande', 'Hilary Galanoy, Elizabeth Hackett', 'Scott Foley, Violante Placido, Maia Reficco, Giuseppe Futia, Simone Luglio, Tommaso Basili, Nunzia Schiano, Luisa De Santis', 'PG', 'When his daughter decides to buy a crumbling Tuscan villa, Eric rushes to Italy to talk her out of it — and instead finds beauty, romance and new purpose.', 'When his daughter decides to buy a crumbling Tuscan villa, Eric rushes to Italy to talk her out of it — and instead finds beauty, romance and new purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEma5RN8aZ5Yu2Dkefyn5ULdlc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252377'),
