  ('186404360938431714', 'La Folle Soirée du Palmashow', 2014, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jonathan Barré', null, 'Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Florence Foresti, Christopher Lambert, Alex Lutz, Kyan Khojandi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZn4218xFTDHSZUmA19PdFrLdoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299114'),
  ('141847484678919895', 'La Folle Soirée du Palmashow 3', 2016, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Barré', null, 'Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Laurence Arné, Sixtine Aupetit, Olivier Baroux, Marion Creusvaux, Virginie Efira, Loup-Denis Elion', null, 'For the third time, Palmashow is taking over prime time, led by the irresistible Grégoire Ludig and David Marsais. The program features sketches, parodies, and 100% original "very bad jokes," as well as a fictional segment where the duo is at the top of their game. Throughout the evening, stars from the comedy scene and actors will make surprise appearances. Florence Foresti, Christophe Lambert, Alex Lutz, and Kyan Khojandi have all joined in on the fun with good humor.', 'For the third time, Palmashow is taking over prime time, led by the irresistible Grégoire Ludig and David Marsais. The program features sketches, parodies, and 100% original "very bad jokes," as well as a fictional segment where the duo is at the top of their game. Throughout the evening, stars from the comedy scene and actors will make surprise appearances. Florence Foresti, Christophe Lambert, Alex Lutz, and Kyan Khojandi have all joined in on the fun with good humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHFmLAxCfAV3iQ1ZODmryzK2AnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425898'),
  ('749647594311150794', 'La Forêt de mon père', 2020, 'Drama', 'Vero Cratzborn, Philippe Guilbert', 'Vero Cratzborn', 'Léonie Souchaud, Ludivine Sagnier, Alban Lenoir, Mathis Bour, Saskia de Melo Dillais, Carl Malapa, Yoann Blanc', null, 'Gina, 15, lives in a city on the edge of the forest. She admires her father, unpredictable and whimsical, able to take his children at night in the woods, even to forget them. Jimmy''s more and more frequent skids end up alarming his wife Carole. Soon, the fragile family balance is broken when Jimmy is interned in a psychiatric hospital. When Gina meets Nico, a boy from her neighborhood, she awakens to love and sees a chance to escape her father.', 'Gina, 15, lives in a city on the edge of the forest. She admires her father, unpredictable and whimsical, able to take his children at night in the woods, even to forget them. Jimmy''s more and more frequent skids end up alarming his wife Carole. Soon, the fragile family balance is broken when Jimmy is interned in a psychiatric hospital. When Gina meets Nico, a boy from her neighborhood, she awakens to love and sees a chance to escape her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFJQDla1IzawdEAS3YmOgW2gqSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654862'),
  ('125071007099014977', 'La foule sur la place de l’Opéra', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'A black and white short from the Lumière brothers in which a crowds is filmed at the Place de l''Opèra in Paris.', 'A black and white short from the Lumière brothers in which a crowds is filmed at the Place de l''Opèra in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pndvBGl40U51lQ575InqzsBzlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265028'),
  ('989024547973196954', 'La France', 2007, 'Drama', 'Céline Bozon, Serge Bozon', 'Axelle Ropert', 'Sylvie Testud, Pascal Greggory, Guillaume Depardieu, Guillaume Verdier, François Négret, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Laurent Talon, Pierre Léon', null, 'During the First World War, Camille (Sylvie Testud), a young woman whose husband is away fighting at the front, receives a short letter of break-up from him. Distraught, she decides to go to join him, but is driven back by the rule of the time which forbids women to move around alone. She has no other recourse than to dress herself up as a man so as to be able to take to the road on foot. As she lives near the Western Fromt she hooks up with a passing group of French soldiers without too much trouble. But there''s something a bit odd about these stragglers, and it''s not just their habit of bursting into song at every opportunity.', 'During the First World War, Camille (Sylvie Testud), a young woman whose husband is away fighting at the front, receives a short letter of break-up from him. Distraught, she decides to go to join him, but is driven back by the rule of the time which forbids women to move around alone. She has no other recourse than to dress herself up as a man so as to be able to take to the road on foot. As she lives near the Western Fromt she hooks up with a passing group of French soldiers without too much trouble. But there''s something a bit odd about these stragglers, and it''s not just their habit of bursting into song at every opportunity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52dQ36Rz1ZHfzUAskSgPsDDwMTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75981'),
  ('1145561203545268057', 'La fugue', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Xavier Durringer', 'Olga Vincent, Mikael Ollivier', 'Valérie Karsenti, Samir Guesmi, Sagamore Stévenin, Alysson Paradis, Laurent Olmedo, Mayline Dubois, Roméo Mongault, Robin Migné', null, 'When her daughter Chloé runs away from home, Jeanne is disappointed with the response of the police, for whom a teenager runaway is not a priority, and she realizes she can only rely on herself.', 'When her daughter Chloé runs away from home, Jeanne is disappointed with the response of the police, for whom a teenager runaway is not a priority, and she realizes she can only rely on herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Agck201j4ESsh7f0bCTPYtFNS0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747046'),
  ('816283301247409772', 'La Fuitina Sbagliata', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Mimmo Esposito, Federico Angelucci, Giuseppe Eusepi', 'Annandrea Vitrano, Salvo Rinaudo, Claudio Casisa', 'Claudio Casisa, Annandrea Vitrano, Paride Benassai, Stefania Blandeburgo, Alessandro Bolide, David Coco, Francesco Guzzo, Salvatore La Mantia', null, 'The story of Romeo and Juliet is exactly the opposite: two families, the Casisa and the Vitrano, who adore each other, and their two children, Anna and Claudio, students away from home and longtime lovers, who hate each other and want nothing to do with each other. When they return home, the two find an idyllic situation: the friendship between their families is so strong that they''ve even joined forces in business. The Casisa, ricotta producers, and the Vitrano, producers of cannoli shells, will sell "the lovers'' cannoli," for which Claudio and Anna will be the unwitting ambassadors. It''s so difficult to tarnish that picture that the two not only lack the courage to admit they''ve broken up, but, gripped by an increasingly childish fear, they complicate matters by telling outright lies: not only do they announce their wedding, but also the imminent birth of a child. From here, a hilarious game of misunderstandings begins, which will lead them to commit the wrong elopement.', 'The story of Romeo and Juliet is exactly the opposite: two families, the Casisa and the Vitrano, who adore each other, and their two children, Anna and Claudio, students away from home and longtime lovers, who hate each other and want nothing to do with each other. When they return home, the two find an idyllic situation: the friendship between their families is so strong that they''ve even joined forces in business. The Casisa, ricotta producers, and the Vitrano, producers of cannoli shells, will sell "the lovers'' cannoli," for which Claudio and Anna will be the unwitting ambassadors. It''s so difficult to tarnish that picture that the two not only lack the courage to admit they''ve broken up, but, gripped by an increasingly childish fear, they complicate matters by telling outright lies: not only do they announce their wedding, but also the imminent birth of a child. From here, a hilarious game of misunderstandings begins, which will lead them to commit the wrong elopement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xFWf6XCmvgJfsu0GTzX1tG4y2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546266'),
  ('472855497302616524', 'La Galette du roi', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Michel Ribes, François Catonné', 'Jean-Michel Ribes, Roland Topor', 'Jean Rochefort, Roger Hanin, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Philippe Khorsand, Pierre-Loup Rajot, Pauline Lafont, Jacques Villeret, Eddy Mitchell', null, 'In this conventional, broadly comic farce of greed and royal matrimony, nearly bankrupt businessman Victor Harris is marrying Maria-Helena, a princess who comes with a dowry that is made up of one half of her island kingdom. Her father, the cowardly King Arnold III is counting on the money this marriage will bring him. The country is now almost bankrupt because of the king''s gambling debts. As Harris and the king look forward to their illusory profits from the royal merger, other characters add some liveliness to the otherwise predictable story.', 'In this conventional, broadly comic farce of greed and royal matrimony, nearly bankrupt businessman Victor Harris is marrying Maria-Helena, a princess who comes with a dowry that is made up of one half of her island kingdom. Her father, the cowardly King Arnold III is counting on the money this marriage will bring him. The country is now almost bankrupt because of the king''s gambling debts. As Harris and the king look forward to their illusory profits from the royal merger, other characters add some liveliness to the otherwise predictable story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5TPKjJB9XWg5dDGtxzBoBSRuPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114852'),
  ('229039235675872170', 'La Generala', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller, War, Western', 'Juan Ibáñez, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Juan Ibáñez, Arturo Rosenblueth', 'María Félix, Carlos Bracho, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Ignacio López Tarso, Salvador Sánchez, Eric del Castillo, Evangelina Elizondo, Sergio Jiménez', null, 'During the Mexican Revolution, a hardened and rich lady landowner is overtaken by the violence of the times. Losing her land and house, she falls in love with a revolutionary leader that is killed by a sadistic and corrupt federal officer. She takes the revolutionary flag and leads a rampage of violence and destruction.', 'During the Mexican Revolution, a hardened and rich lady landowner is overtaken by the violence of the times. Losing her land and house, she falls in love with a revolutionary leader that is killed by a sadistic and corrupt federal officer. She takes the revolutionary flag and leads a rampage of violence and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seuTn28r92I92Iik1dvJnHLOqi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330084'),
  ('198399408220391035', 'La Graine', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Eloïse Lang, Fiona Braillon, Caroline De Schryver', 'Eloïse Lang, Pauline Mauroux', 'Stacy Martin, Marie Papillon, François Damiens, Pablo Pauly, Victoire du Bois, Filip Naudts, Stéphanie Van Vyve, Fanny Carbonnel', null, 'Lucie and Ines love each other and want to have a child, but they are missing something. After five attempts at MAP, they leave for a final test in Belgium. Then begins a crazy quest to find THE seed.', 'Lucie and Ines love each other and want to have a child, but they are missing something. After five attempts at MAP, they leave for a final test in Belgium. Then begins a crazy quest to find THE seed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfp2t2jPC81Utig1NNTZ4AydBR2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998587'),
  ('6208508137476793', 'La Grazia', 2025, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Daria D''Antonio, Edoardo Francesco Marini', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Toni Servillo, Anna Ferzetti, Massimo Venturiello, Milvia Marigliano, Orlando Cinque, Giuseppe Gaiani, Giovanna Guida, Alessia Giuliani', null, 'As his tenure as President of Italy nears its end, Mariano De Santis faces wrenching decisions-both political and deeply personal. Amid these moral quandaries, he must confront his own conscience and seek guidance from those closest to him, including his confidante and daughter, Dorotea.', 'As his tenure as President of Italy nears its end, Mariano De Santis faces wrenching decisions-both political and deeply personal. Amid these moral quandaries, he must confront his own conscience and seek guidance from those closest to him, including his confidante and daughter, Dorotea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5RgunQiA4hvDfTeWO9pS0lm4K4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397364'),
  ('197029191453097984', 'La guarida del lobo', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Matías Ghío, Alex Tossenberger', 'Alex Tossenberger', 'Gastón Pauls, José Luis Gioia, Víctor Laplace', null, 'Toco is a hermit mountain man who finds an injured man on the road and decides to take him home to help him recover. They start to get along when a third man, obsessed with buying Toco''s land, appears. Things will escalate and the men will begin to show their animalistic nature.', 'Toco is a hermit mountain man who finds an injured man on the road and decides to take him home to help him recover. They start to get along when a third man, obsessed with buying Toco''s land, appears. Things will escalate and the men will begin to show their animalistic nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/F42doCWHjsTpA2mn6YH1tzmZk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591637'),
  ('951116277964082909', 'La guerra de papá', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Mercero', null, 'Lolo García, Verónica Forqué, Teresa Gimpera, Héctor Alterio, Vicente Parra, Tito Valverde', null, 'Spain, March 1964: Quico is a very naughty child of three belonging to a wealthy middle-class family. Since Cristina''s birth, he feels he has lost the privileged position of "prince" of the house for his eight months old sister. So, with his brother Juan, who is eight years old and is quite disobedient, spend their time committing prank after prank, causing the resulting anger of his mother, the nanny and the old housemaid. The rest of the family members are two much older brothers, his resigned mother and a retrograde father of authoritarian ideas. But many years have passed, and the civil war that won the despot Don Pablo is simply for their children "Dad''s war".', 'Spain, March 1964: Quico is a very naughty child of three belonging to a wealthy middle-class family. Since Cristina''s birth, he feels he has lost the privileged position of "prince" of the house for his eight months old sister. So, with his brother Juan, who is eight years old and is quite disobedient, spend their time committing prank after prank, causing the resulting anger of his mother, the nanny and the old housemaid. The rest of the family members are two much older brothers, his resigned mother and a retrograde father of authoritarian ideas. But many years have passed, and the civil war that won the despot Don Pablo is simply for their children "Dad''s war".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rOTiM7ByVYRbloDI2UIjGRVS9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185508'),
  ('1012208787860373672', 'La guerra degli Antò', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Riccardo Milani, Loredana Conte, Alessandro Pesci', 'Riccardo Milani, Sandro Petraglia, Domenico Starnone', 'Flavio Pistilli, Federico Di Flauro, Paolo Setta, Danilo Mastracci, Regina Orioli, Francesco Bruni, Donatella Raffai, Gianluca Guaitoli', null, 'The story of four implausible young rebellious in the Italy of the 90''s.', 'The story of four implausible young rebellious in the Italy of the 90''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wznVKFOxmIuZF2T50WtKfDDIF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60201'),
  ('512470292353579081', 'La guerra del Tiburtino III', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Giuseppe Chessa, Francesca Scanu, Luna Gualano', 'Emiliano Rubbi, Luna Gualano', 'Antonio Bannò, Sveva Mariani, Paolo Calabresi, Paola Minaccioni, Francesca Stagni, Federico Majorana, Alessio De Persio, Giulia Ricciardi', null, 'In the Tiburtino III neighbourhood, in the outer suburbs of Rome, a small asteroid falls from the sky. In the following days, almost everyone in the suburb starts behaving inexplicably oddly: they all suck AA batteries. An improbable group of young characters finds out that many have been infected by some parasites and the aliens intend to conquer the whole world.', 'In the Tiburtino III neighbourhood, in the outer suburbs of Rome, a small asteroid falls from the sky. In the following days, almost everyone in the suburb starts behaving inexplicably oddly: they all suck AA batteries. An improbable group of young characters finds out that many have been infected by some parasites and the aliens intend to conquer the whole world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vk9Sva0xmkt8R9B21SpV8c9yJGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1133216'),
