  ('1089099771312689156', 'La guerrera vengadora', 1988, 'Action', 'Armando Castillón, Raúl Fernández', null, 'Rosa Gloria Chagoyán, Rolando Fernández, Eric del Castillo, David Reynoso, José René Ruiz, Pedro Infante Jr., Alejandro Suárez, Joaquín García Vargas', null, 'A chemistry teacher decides to take matters into her own hands when her brother is murdered and the police cannot help her.', 'A chemistry teacher decides to take matters into her own hands when her brother is murdered and the police cannot help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzx0SyIlfARnipgVkWx2CPp8hs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448088'),
  ('880234358425379481', 'La guerrera vengadora 2', 1991, 'Action', 'Raúl Fernández Jr.', 'Rolando Fernández, Carlos Valdemar, Raúl Fernández Jr.', 'Rosa Gloria Chagoyán, Rolando Fernández, Jorge Vargas, José René Ruiz, Sandra Nori, Buenaventura Aguilar, José Aguilar, Edna Bolkan', null, 'Shapely Rosa Gloria Chagoyan rips it up as moto-cyclin'' hot shot Ana Rosa, La Guerrera Vengadora (the Avenging Warrior Woman). Accompanied by her dwarf sidekick Reintegro (Refund), La Guerrera battles evildoers in this flick that could been lifted straight from the pages of a cheap action-hero comic book. La Guerrera and her buddies are seemingly impervious to bullets (especially machine gun fire), which gives them plenty of time to pick off their opponents with automatic weapons, including a three-barrel contraption that shoots from La Guerrera''s motorcycle fairing, a shitload of grenades, a crossbow with a laser scope, and whatever else is at hand. Also, our heroine likes to work on her bike in high heels and hot pants -- before breakfast.', 'Shapely Rosa Gloria Chagoyan rips it up as moto-cyclin'' hot shot Ana Rosa, La Guerrera Vengadora (the Avenging Warrior Woman). Accompanied by her dwarf sidekick Reintegro (Refund), La Guerrera battles evildoers in this flick that could been lifted straight from the pages of a cheap action-hero comic book. La Guerrera and her buddies are seemingly impervious to bullets (especially machine gun fire), which gives them plenty of time to pick off their opponents with automatic weapons, including a three-barrel contraption that shoots from La Guerrera''s motorcycle fairing, a shitload of grenades, a crossbow with a laser scope, and whatever else is at hand. Also, our heroine likes to work on her bike in high heels and hot pants -- before breakfast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFIs2kOlbxyzEt9y3OsUtiPwKu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157793'),
