  ('964097159785394498', 'La Leyenda de los Chaneques', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Horror', 'Marvick Núñez, Alberto Rodríguez', 'David Israel Hernández', 'Benny Emmanuel, Emilio Treviño, Jorge Rafael, Mayté Cordero, Annie Rojas, Eduardo España, Andrés Couturier, Alejandro Villeli', null, 'Five years after giving up his powers and separating from his friends, Leo San Juan has started a new life trying to focus on his family and their bakery, staying away from danger and adventures. However, Leo knows that his plans are rarely fulfilled and this time is no exception: while traveling with Nando to Veracruz, things start to get weird, and from the depths of the Tuxtlas jungle, an ancient curse has returned and only Leo can face it.', 'Five years after giving up his powers and separating from his friends, Leo San Juan has started a new life trying to focus on his family and their bakery, staying away from danger and adventures. However, Leo knows that his plans are rarely fulfilled and this time is no exception: while traveling with Nando to Veracruz, things start to get weird, and from the depths of the Tuxtlas jungle, an ancient curse has returned and only Leo can face it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4f9ghI3utknpeBZSAzNuIKKATOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1150394'),
