  ('477423724868581336', 'La madre', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alberto Morais', 'Ignacio Gutiérrez-Solana, Verónica García, Alberto Morais', 'Laia Marull, Nieve de Medina, Sergio Caballero, Javier Mendo, María Albiñana', null, 'Miguel is a 14-year-old kid about to go back to a centre for minors. His mother, out of work and with an unstable personal life, is incapable of taking care of him. This is why Miguel lives in a state of constant urgency, doing the housework, selling Kleenex or stealing from supermarkets. All this ends when Social Services come for him again, and his mother makes him seek refuge in the house of Bogdan, a Rumanian ex-lover of hers who lives in a nearby town. At the same time, María, the owner of a bar, sympathizes with the boy and gives him the virtually maternal treatment that he does not get in his own home. However, everything is thrust forward when the mother suddenly disappears', 'Miguel is a 14-year-old kid about to go back to a centre for minors. His mother, out of work and with an unstable personal life, is incapable of taking care of him. This is why Miguel lives in a state of constant urgency, doing the housework, selling Kleenex or stealing from supermarkets. All this ends when Social Services come for him again, and his mother makes him seek refuge in the house of Bogdan, a Rumanian ex-lover of hers who lives in a nearby town. At the same time, María, the owner of a bar, sympathizes with the boy and gives him the virtually maternal treatment that he does not get in his own home. However, everything is thrust forward when the mother suddenly disappears', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR7yrYPY0zpggsJmR0MGZCsN5Z5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420333'),
  ('890399288109952822', 'La Maison de Himiko', 2005, 'Drama', 'Isshin Inudo, Takahiro Tsutai', 'Aya Watanabe', 'Ko Shibasaki, Joe Odagiri, Min Tanaka, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Shin''ichi Hatori, Hirokazu Inoue, Junkyu Moriyama, Chiharu Muraishi', null, 'Saori is a young woman struggling to make her way in life. Her gay father, Himiko, had abandoned Saori and her mother years before. Now her father''s young lover Haruhiko shows up to tell Saori that her father is dying of cancer. Still angry with her father but in need of money, Saori travels to the House of Himiko, a nursing home established by her father for gay men. Over time, a tenuous relationship begins to develop between Saori, her father, and Haruhiko.', 'Saori is a young woman struggling to make her way in life. Her gay father, Himiko, had abandoned Saori and her mother years before. Now her father''s young lover Haruhiko shows up to tell Saori that her father is dying of cancer. Still angry with her father but in need of money, Saori travels to the House of Himiko, a nursing home established by her father for gay men. Over time, a tenuous relationship begins to develop between Saori, her father, and Haruhiko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYk6IIugk0P7bB5w98k7C3pSGmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151403'),
  ('567964590759032259', 'La Maison de la Radio', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Nicolas Philibert', 'Nicolas Philibert', 'Jean-Francois Achilli, Evelyne Adam, Jean-Claude Ameisen, Arno, Patrick Cohen, Umberto Eco, François Busnel, Laurent Mariotte', null, 'Making a film about a radio station doesn’t sound like the most visually compelling of projects. How many takes do you need before the acoustic transition from the opening to the closing of a door is perfect or the reader''s voice correctly modulated? Nicolas Philibert has accepted the challenge to portray that which cannot be seen. Shouldering his camera, he spent half a year wandering the endless corridors of Radio France’s ‘round house’ on the banks of the Seine where he filmed people who dedicate themselves utterly and meticulously to their work.', 'Making a film about a radio station doesn’t sound like the most visually compelling of projects. How many takes do you need before the acoustic transition from the opening to the closing of a door is perfect or the reader''s voice correctly modulated? Nicolas Philibert has accepted the challenge to portray that which cannot be seen. Shouldering his camera, he spent half a year wandering the endless corridors of Radio France’s ‘round house’ on the banks of the Seine where he filmed people who dedicate themselves utterly and meticulously to their work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iht8E4ouOOXIZsuwkdS3LQhnsdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168360'),
  ('924495721425033876', 'La Maladroite', 2019, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Éléonore Faucher, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Françoise Charpiat, Alexandre Seurat', 'Isabelle Carré, Émilie Dequenne, Damien Jouillerot, India Hair, Elsa Hyvaert', null, 'Stella is 6 but she is going to school for the first time. Happy, exuberant (maybe too much) she is a lovely child, but is often absent. Her parents say she is fragile. She tells her teacher, Céline, she fell when asked why she has a few bruises. Is it child abuse or real immune deficiency? The doubt is growing in the mind of those who meet the child. Worried, Céline notes every injury until the day the family moves without telling anyone.', 'Stella is 6 but she is going to school for the first time. Happy, exuberant (maybe too much) she is a lovely child, but is often absent. Her parents say she is fragile. She tells her teacher, Céline, she fell when asked why she has a few bruises. Is it child abuse or real immune deficiency? The doubt is growing in the mind of those who meet the child. Worried, Céline notes every injury until the day the family moves without telling anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjcyWS3AkmS6GufpNpnjY3xsAwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641900'),
  ('121318594659625495', 'La malagueña', 1947, null, 'Agustín P. Delgado', null, 'Consuelo Frank, Crox Alvarado, Víctor Junco, Pedro Galindo', null, 'Traveling salesman falls for shopkeeper''s daughter in one of the towns on his route. Bad news: she already has two suitors among the local fellers.', 'Traveling salesman falls for shopkeeper''s daughter in one of the towns on his route. Bad news: she already has two suitors among the local fellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PvPlwOFvgnK9enQgSKTUSiZAoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510734'),
  ('511257522764319031', 'La maldición del guapo', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Javier Petit, Imanol Nabea, Beda Docampo Feijóo', 'Beda Docampo Feijóo', 'Gonzalo de Castro, Juan Grandinetti, Malena Alterio, Ginés García Millán, Cayetana Guillén Cuervo, Carlos Hipólito, Andrea Duro', null, 'Humberto, a seductive con artist, lives a quiet life in Madrid after having done his time for a big job that cost him his relationship with his son Jorge, who reaches out to him for help when the jewellery where he works is robbed.', 'Humberto, a seductive con artist, lives a quiet life in Madrid after having done his time for a big job that cost him his relationship with his son Jorge, who reaches out to him for help when the jewellery where he works is robbed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ABPIUINn2zZWtyW8xPsCppT7OB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679898'),
  ('382470453995053343', 'La Mandarine', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Molinaro, Claude Lecomte, Roger Debelmas', 'Édouard Molinaro, Édouard Molinaro, Christine de Rivoyre', 'Annie Girardot, Philippe Noiret, Madeleine Renaud, Murray Head, Marie-Hélène Breillat, Jean-Claude Dauphin, Robert Berri, Madeleine Damien', null, 'Paris, seventies. In a hotel in the glittering Rue de Rivoli an English boy falls in love with the two young grandchildren of the owner. Based on the novel "La Mandarine" by Christine de Rivoyre.', 'Paris, seventies. In a hotel in the glittering Rue de Rivoli an English boy falls in love with the two young grandchildren of the owner. Based on the novel "La Mandarine" by Christine de Rivoyre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSHb2HExlPGrdh2WO1wY68SlfQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65974'),
  ('990441757810677918', 'La máquina de bailar', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Óscar Aibar, Teo Delgado', 'Óscar Aibar, Jimina Sabadú', 'Jordi Vilches, Santiago Segura, Bárbara Muñoz, Eduardo García, Chema Rodríguez, Oscar Salcedo, José Corbacho, Josele Román', null, 'After accidentally killing the albino boa of his boss, and in search of money to buy a new one, Dani and his colleagues sign up for the first national competition of Dance Dance Revolution.', 'After accidentally killing the albino boa of his boss, and in search of money to buy a new one, Dani and his colleagues sign up for the first national competition of Dance Dance Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2m5u7CBCGbJfLaurgtgci1brcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119409'),
  ('1093422411879088897', 'La Marseillaise', 1938, 'History, Drama', 'Jean Renoir, Alain Douarinou, Jean Bourgoin', 'Jean Renoir', 'Pierre Renoir, Lise Delamare, Louis Jouvet, Jaque Catelain, Elisa Ruis, Aimé Clariond, Jean Aymé, Léon Larive', null, 'The early days of the French Revolution, as seen through the eyes of the ordinary citizens in Marseille and the royal court, including King Louis XVI and Marie Antoinette.', 'The early days of the French Revolution, as seen through the eyes of the ordinary citizens in Marseille and the royal court, including King Louis XVI and Marie Antoinette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3O8HLnNFUa2FU7HzSM8oiA2D2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43845'),
  ('842672381130738559', 'La matassa', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Giambattista Avellino', 'Giambattista Avellino, Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Anna Safroncik, Claudio Gioè, Domenico Centamore, Tuccio Musumeci, Pino Caruso, Mario Pupella', null, 'Two cousins haven''t spoken for almost twenty years, thanks to the enmity that their fathers feel toward one another. But an accident suddenly brings the cousins back together and thrusts them deep into the heart of the mafia.', 'Two cousins haven''t spoken for almost twenty years, thanks to the enmity that their fathers feel toward one another. But an accident suddenly brings the cousins back together and thrusts them deep into the heart of the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wdHZjeYSY4TUB0D8wbs5RT4k3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53957'),
  ('32211442454007384', 'La mejor Navidad', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Nicolás Di Blasi', null, 'Juan Soler, Gabriela Spanic, Briggitte Bozzo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZYSgF2aZ6qCbuZ62wqwArITqRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047508'),
  ('150117202347768860', 'La Menace', 1977, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Alain Corneau, Pierre-William Glenn, Alain Centonze', 'Claude Hopkins, Alain Corneau, Daniel Boulanger', 'Yves Montand, Carole Laure, Marie Dubois, Jean-François Balmer, Marc Eyraud, Roger Muni, Jacques Rispal, Michel Ruhl', null, 'Henri Savin has managed a trucking company for his lover, Dominique Montlaur, for many years. Now he is planning to leave her for Julie Manet, the woman he has made pregnant, and Dominique is hysterical. She first threatens suicide, then shows up at a meeting of Savin and Julie. Dominique tries everything she can think of to break Savin and Julie apart, to no avail. Frustrated in her efforts, she jumps off a cliff and dies. Savin insists that he and Julie lie to the police about the encounter, although Dominique''s death was a suicide and therefore they had no direct hand in it. Detective Waldeck investigates Dominique''s death.', 'Henri Savin has managed a trucking company for his lover, Dominique Montlaur, for many years. Now he is planning to leave her for Julie Manet, the woman he has made pregnant, and Dominique is hysterical. She first threatens suicide, then shows up at a meeting of Savin and Julie. Dominique tries everything she can think of to break Savin and Julie apart, to no avail. Frustrated in her efforts, she jumps off a cliff and dies. Savin insists that he and Julie lie to the police about the encounter, although Dominique''s death was a suicide and therefore they had no direct hand in it. Detective Waldeck investigates Dominique''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oW0eOba1Oc3ftSjsJSCqZiACm0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76519'),
  ('658108399169268745', 'La mia banda suona il pop', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Fausto Brizzi, Gino Sgreva, Valerio Esposito', 'Fausto Brizzi, Marco Martani, Alessandro Bardani', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Ghini, Angela Finocchiaro, Paolo Rossi, Natasha Stefanenko, Diego Abatantuono, Rinat Khismatouline, Stefano Ambrogi', null, 'The Russian magnate Ivanov dreams about having The Popcorn, his favorite Italian musical band from the 80s in Saint Petersburg.', 'The Russian magnate Ivanov dreams about having The Popcorn, his favorite Italian musical band from the 80s in Saint Petersburg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5KbGBcHMpl76ksOIY8h6uBEKWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612495'),
  ('932224851920359973', 'La mia ombra è tua', 2022, 'Drama', 'Eugenio Cappuccio', 'Eugenio Cappuccio, Edoardo Nesi, Laura Paolucci', 'Marco Giallini, Giuseppe Maggio, Sidy Diop, Anna Manuelli, Massimo Molea, Isabella Ferrari', null, 'The story of a famous middle-aged writer and a college graduate who embark on a road trip that becomes a cross-generational counterpoint.', 'The story of a famous middle-aged writer and a college graduate who embark on a road trip that becomes a cross-generational counterpoint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MYSKYx9T7Ns62jo3dZLiCEN9zM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:863928'),
