  ('597365478038788968', 'La Mission', 2009, 'Drama', 'Peter Bratt', 'Peter Bratt', 'Benjamin Bratt, Talisa Soto, Max Rosenak, Patrick Shining Elk, Jesse Borrego, Kevin Michael Richardson, Rubén C. González, Tina Huang', 'R', 'Growing up in the Mission district of San Francisco, Che Rivera has always had to be tough to survive. He''s a powerful man respected throughout the Mission barrio for his masculinity and his strength, as well as for his hobby building beautiful lowrider cars. A reformed inmate and recovering alcoholic, Che has worked hard to redeem his life and do right by his pride and joy: his only son, Jes, whom he has raised on his own after the death of his wife. Che''s path to redemption is tested, however, when he discovers Jes is gay. To survive his neighborhood, Che has always lived with his fists. To survive as a complete man, he''ll have to embrace a side of himself he''s never shown.', 'Growing up in the Mission district of San Francisco, Che Rivera has always had to be tough to survive. He''s a powerful man respected throughout the Mission barrio for his masculinity and his strength, as well as for his hobby building beautiful lowrider cars. A reformed inmate and recovering alcoholic, Che has worked hard to redeem his life and do right by his pride and joy: his only son, Jes, whom he has raised on his own after the death of his wife. Che''s path to redemption is tested, however, when he discovers Jes is gay. To survive his neighborhood, Che has always lived with his fists. To survive as a complete man, he''ll have to embrace a side of himself he''s never shown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8X9rNpLLPklX8uGRUgbdYHPfter.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43219'),
  ('976415717656911405', 'La mitad de Ana', 2025, 'Drama', 'Marta Nieto, Antonio Gonzalo Quiroga, Julián Elizalde', 'Marta Nieto, Beatriz Herzog, Marta Nieto', 'Marta Nieto, Noa Álvarez, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Sonia Almarcha, Arnau Comas Quirante, Lorena López, Pablo Alamá, Paula Braguinsky', null, 'Son confesses to his mother, Ana, that he does not feel like a girl; he is a boy. Confused and blocked, Ana will decide to stop in order to observe and understand him and, in the same way, to understand herself. Ana and Son are two sides of the same coin: a mother who does not take care of herself, of her own identity, and a boy in search of his identity with all his strength.', 'Son confesses to his mother, Ana, that he does not feel like a girl; he is a boy. Confused and blocked, Ana will decide to stop in order to observe and understand him and, in the same way, to understand herself. Ana and Son are two sides of the same coin: a mother who does not take care of herself, of her own identity, and a boy in search of his identity with all his strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c24RWnJzwAtWZ039o9u6K7c8jyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034391'),
  ('389849322938396457', 'La moglie in bianco... l''amante al pepe', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Raúl Pérez Cubero, Giovanfrancesco Fantacci', 'Giorgio Mariuzzo, Bruno Di Geronimo', 'Lino Banfi, Pamela Prati, Javier Viñas, Marisa Porcel, Ria De Simone, Raf Baldassarre, Dino Cassio, Tito García', null, 'In order to get his hands on his father''s inheritance and pay all his debts, Don Peppino must see his son Gianluca married and produce an heir within a year. Problem is everybody suspects the boy of playing for the other team.', 'In order to get his hands on his father''s inheritance and pay all his debts, Don Peppino must see his son Gianluca married and produce an heir within a year. Problem is everybody suspects the boy of playing for the other team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hcT1EUhLcoYox6K58uelB83QRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121504'),
  ('22435385086639391', 'La montaña rusa', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Teo Delgado, Susana González', 'Daniela Féjerman, Emilio Martínez Lázaro', 'Verónica Sánchez, Ernesto Alterio, Alberto San Juan, Ara Malikian, Luis Bermejo, Sara Martín, Cristina Zapata, Marisa Zapata', null, 'Three childhood friends meet again many years later, a woman and two men. A triangle. In one corner, sex, in another, love, and in the middle ... the protagonist in a mess. Romantic and sentimental comedy about sex, love and its many complicated combinations.', 'Three childhood friends meet again many years later, a woman and two men. A triangle. In one corner, sex, in another, love, and in the middle ... the protagonist in a mess. Romantic and sentimental comedy about sex, love and its many complicated combinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvNvaPnfu6QlD5gKDsXnGNsCMcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95744'),
  ('978649824979301477', 'La Morte Rouge', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Víctor Erice', 'Víctor Erice', 'Víctor Erice', null, 'Spanish filmmaker Víctor Erice talks about the first movie he probably ever saw, Roy William Neill''s The Scarlet Claw (1944), starring Basil Rathbone as Sherlock Holmes. The remembrances of such a formative cinematic experience leads him to recall the dark days after the end of the Spanish Civil War, to confess the many fears stalking children and to reflect on the nature of memory itself.', 'Spanish filmmaker Víctor Erice talks about the first movie he probably ever saw, Roy William Neill''s The Scarlet Claw (1944), starring Basil Rathbone as Sherlock Holmes. The remembrances of such a formative cinematic experience leads him to recall the dark days after the end of the Spanish Civil War, to confess the many fears stalking children and to reflect on the nature of memory itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngT91LmBJbJbdr2UtQz8B3JZLSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213598'),
  ('388218819883493742', 'La mossa del cavallo', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli, Marco Pieroni, Barbara Daniele', 'Francesco Bruni, Leonardo Marini, Andrea Camilleri', 'Michele Riondino, Ester Pantano, Cocò Gulotta, Antonio Pandolfo, Giovanni Carta, Giancarlo Ratti, Filippo Luna, Maurizio Bologna', null, 'Montelusa, Sicily, Italy, 1877. Giovanni Bovara, the new chief inspector of the mills, is charged with collecting a severe tax. Sicilian by birth, but Ligurian by adoption, he reasons and speaks as a man of northern Italy and does not understand the dynamics of the law of silence that regulate the Sicilian land, so his intransigence immediately gives him several enemies…', 'Montelusa, Sicily, Italy, 1877. Giovanni Bovara, the new chief inspector of the mills, is charged with collecting a severe tax. Sicilian by birth, but Ligurian by adoption, he reasons and speaks as a man of northern Italy and does not understand the dynamics of the law of silence that regulate the Sicilian land, so his intransigence immediately gives him several enemies…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRhJ7TLCPmVZYPu9mWaIOaufCyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507671'),
  ('714819977731018487', 'La mugrosita', 1982, 'Drama, Family', 'Rubén Galindo', null, 'María Rebeca, Manuel Medel, Pedro Infante Jr., Mario Almada, Jose Luis Cobos, Pedro Fernández', null, 'Orphaned boy Andrés and his best friend Maria live in one of the poorest parts of the city. Nevertheless, their hearts are full of love and happiness. Kind-hearted Sócrates has raised the boy as if he were his own son. When Andrés gets to know that Sócrates is about to become evicted, he assumes the identity of the landlord''s long lost son. The plan backfires, because the landlord wants to take the boy away from Sócrates. The friendship of Andrés and Maria threatens to break apart. Written by Anonymous', 'Orphaned boy Andrés and his best friend Maria live in one of the poorest parts of the city. Nevertheless, their hearts are full of love and happiness. Kind-hearted Sócrates has raised the boy as if he were his own son. When Andrés gets to know that Sócrates is about to become evicted, he assumes the identity of the landlord''s long lost son. The plan backfires, because the landlord wants to take the boy away from Sócrates. The friendship of Andrés and Maria threatens to break apart. Written by Anonymous', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spp7L9FbI4GkcAIJdRp74o7uTiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123201'),
  ('182327461196521971', 'La mujer de los dos', 1996, 'Drama, Music', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares, Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares, Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Hugo Stiglitz, Wolf Ruvinskis, Elizabeth Katz, Ariane Pellicer, Michelle Mayer, Claudia Fernández, Daniela Garmendia, Mario Alberto Ortiz', null, 'The boys in a famous pop-band all have girl troubles. And other problems. Sucks being them.', 'The boys in a famous pop-band all have girl troubles. And other problems. Sucks being them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPEJmLIgrtPow0OfPiyy6aKZ9Un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469527'),
  ('140490117664817346', 'La mujer de los gatos', 2020, null, 'Eduardo Guaita, Pedro Vodanovic', null, null, null, 'The story is about Byron, a haughty black cat who supports a lonely and depressive writer (Sandra) in delivering all her love to be given. She raises him as she would her own son; they share life together, and then raise Tom, a younger and playful grey kitten. However, as being henceforth old for a cat, Byron gets ill, and given only three months left to live. Sandra must accept the idea of an end; impotent, she has to make the decision to finish whom she loves above all to avoid his suffering.', 'The story is about Byron, a haughty black cat who supports a lonely and depressive writer (Sandra) in delivering all her love to be given. She raises him as she would her own son; they share life together, and then raise Tom, a younger and playful grey kitten. However, as being henceforth old for a cat, Byron gets ill, and given only three months left to live. Sandra must accept the idea of an end; impotent, she has to make the decision to finish whom she loves above all to avoid his suffering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svRvWfQVPfCHiqtoqAMLWhptmth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750545'),
  ('358851374690988630', 'La mujer del puerto', 1996, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Ángel Goded', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Damián Alcázar, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Alejandro Parodi, Juan Pastor, Evangelina Sosa, Ernesto Yáñez, Fernando Palavicini', null, 'Perla, a prostitute and the star in a miserable cabaret in the docks, falls in love with a sailor without knowing that he is her brother. Tomasa, Perla''s mother, tries to prevent this incestuous relationship at all costs, but fails to do so. Set in a sordid environment, the director makes no concessions in this tragic love affair, which is narrated from three different points of view.', 'Perla, a prostitute and the star in a miserable cabaret in the docks, falls in love with a sailor without knowing that he is her brother. Tomasa, Perla''s mother, tries to prevent this incestuous relationship at all costs, but fails to do so. Set in a sordid environment, the director makes no concessions in this tragic love affair, which is narrated from three different points of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rQwTSeiNw5C0PfEh46aZbS83zH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127636'),
  ('995554684176873170', 'La mujer es un buen negocio', 1977, 'Music, Comedy', 'Valerio Lazarov, Mahnahén Velasco, Cecilio Paniagua', 'Tono', 'Manolo Escobar, Iris Chacón Tapia, Antonio Garisa, Didi Sherman, Mary Santpere, Fernando Sancho, María Luisa Ponte, Juanito Navarro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkV9U3Yw56YHA4r4YCPEPiKvV3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65006'),
  ('106742558118038486', 'La Musica', 1967, 'Drama', 'Paul Seban, Marguerite Duras, Sacha Vierny', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Delphine Seyrig, Robert Hossein, Julie Dassin, Gérard Blain', null, 'A husband and wife meet three years after their formal separation, when they return to the provincial town where they once lived to pick up their divorce decree.', 'A husband and wife meet three years after their formal separation, when they return to the provincial town where they once lived to pick up their divorce decree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0QEAWfcYdx2SCgchH9DuHhB5IS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285413'),
