  ('761075753758698123', 'La Orca', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Eriprando Visconti, Blasco Giurato', 'Lisa Morpurgo, Roberto Gandus', 'Rena Niehaus, Michele Placido, Flavio Bucci, Bruno Corazzari, Gabriele Ferzetti, Miguel Bosé, Carmen Scarpitta, Piero Faggioni', null, 'A teenage girl is kidnapped by 3 guys and taken to an abandoned house in the country, where she is made to write her own ransom letter. She soon discovers that one of her captors is infatuated with her and she will use those feelings to stay alive.', 'A teenage girl is kidnapped by 3 guys and taken to an abandoned house in the country, where she is made to write her own ransom letter. She soon discovers that one of her captors is infatuated with her and she will use those feelings to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Dlor3aJBaigcYdKjhRQpPcCnjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90187'),
