  ('294996829427841862', 'La Pallastrike sull''Isola di Pasqua', 2008, 'Animation', 'Maurizio Forestieri', 'Filippo Fiocchi', 'Letizia Ciampa, Alessio De Filippis, Alex Polidori, Alessandro Vanni, Daniele Raffaeli, Barbara Pitotti, Roberto Certomà, Monica Vulcano', null, 'This movie is set on the Easter Island, where a group of children that must face the mean ruler of the island in a pallastrike match in an arena. Their objective is to free a group of kids that have been petrified during the years.', 'This movie is set on the Easter Island, where a group of children that must face the mean ruler of the island in a pallastrike match in an arena. Their objective is to free a group of kids that have been petrified during the years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO4ebgdkg5686jnFnlDf1AKcMal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609456'),
  ('35636174871182056', 'La Palma', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Julian Krubasik, Erec Brehmer', 'Britta Schwem, Erec Brehmer', 'Marleen Lohse, Daniel Sträßer, Janina Schauer, Michael Tregor, Angelika Bender, Albert Meisl', null, 'Sanne''s and Markus'' relationship is in crisis. They go on holiday together, but accidentally fly to the wrong island. There, in desperation, they break into an empty holiday home and embark on a role-play using new identities. At first, the game is an exciting rediscovery of their relationship, but it becomes increasingly destructive as they force themselves into archaic roles.', 'Sanne''s and Markus'' relationship is in crisis. They go on holiday together, but accidentally fly to the wrong island. There, in desperation, they break into an empty holiday home and embark on a role-play using new identities. At first, the game is an exciting rediscovery of their relationship, but it becomes increasingly destructive as they force themselves into archaic roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oymXulhPDNgk3Pu1i27kiQgQBZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571030'),
