  ('48508696057905532', 'La passione', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Luca Bigazzi', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Doriana Leondeff, Marco Pettenello', 'Silvio Orlando, Giuseppe Battiston, Kasia Smutniak, Marco Messeri, Maria Paiato, Fausto Russo Alesi, Cristiana Capotondi, Stefania Sandrelli', null, 'To avoid being sued, a film director reluctantly agrees to set up and direct the Good Friday celebrations in a small Tuscan town.', 'To avoid being sued, a film director reluctantly agrees to set up and direct the Good Friday celebrations in a small Tuscan town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjFDG3vfz4Ei162qeWZ6zhPXXQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45950'),
  ('646785495160702006', 'La patasola', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Harold Trompetero, Paul Cataño', null, 'Robinson Díaz, Ramiro Meneses, Valentina Garcia Contreras, Walter Luengas, Marcela Carvajal, Luis Fernando Bohórquez, Paul Cataño', null, 'A remote and lonely hotel holds a dark secret. La Patasola, a vengeful being marked by the loss of her son and her leg, seeks to punish the unfaithful. Rodrigo, an investigator, and Susana, his young lover, arrive at the hotel under the pretext of investigating an unsolved disappearance, but they will soon discover that they are locked in a deadly trap. La Patasola, thirsty for revenge, will unleash all her fury against the infidels and make them pay the price for their deceit, transforming their visit into a nightmare with no escape.', 'A remote and lonely hotel holds a dark secret. La Patasola, a vengeful being marked by the loss of her son and her leg, seeks to punish the unfaithful. Rodrigo, an investigator, and Susana, his young lover, arrive at the hotel under the pretext of investigating an unsolved disappearance, but they will soon discover that they are locked in a deadly trap. La Patasola, thirsty for revenge, will unleash all her fury against the infidels and make them pay the price for their deceit, transforming their visit into a nightmare with no escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hAi3I6vxlqtLqvcmP0sRktvNwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1372404'),
  ('1057851696990640692', 'La petite femelle', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Philippe Faucon', 'Philippe Faucon, Antoine Lacomblez', 'Lucie Lucas, Héléna Noguerra, Jean Dell, Lorenzo Lefèbvre, Stéphanie Petit, Mina Poe, Julien Gaillard, Hartmut Reichel', null, 'November, 1953. Pauline Dubuisson is accused of the cold-bloodied murder of her lover Félix. But who exactly is this young woman that the whole of France wants to see convicted? A cold calculating social climber? Or a free spirit, asserting her emancipation before it became fashionable?', 'November, 1953. Pauline Dubuisson is accused of the cold-bloodied murder of her lover Félix. But who exactly is this young woman that the whole of France wants to see convicted? A cold calculating social climber? Or a free spirit, asserting her emancipation before it became fashionable?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfcKJYE0019lnyxEYXguiJreAho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785345'),
  ('979948108072580629', 'La Petite Jérusalem', 2005, 'Drama', 'Karin Albou, Laurent Brunet, Maya Serrulla', 'Karin Albou', 'Fanny Valette, Elsa Zylberstein, Bruno Todeschini, Hédi Tillette de Clermont-Tonnerre, Sonia Tahar, Michaël Cohen, Aurore Clément, François Marthouret', 'NR', 'An orthodox Jewish teen living with her family in France attempts to balance her religious upbringing with her increasingly complex view of the outside world.', 'An orthodox Jewish teen living with her family in France attempts to balance her religious upbringing with her increasingly complex view of the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmb26QhaHFMU0tnl6CnNwnWOGex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50339'),
  ('887829727393409992', 'La Petite mort', 2009, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Marcel Walz, Marcel Walz, Andreas Pape', 'Marcel Walz', 'Manoush, Andreas Pape, Ines Zahmoul, Anna Habeck, Annika Strauss, Magdalena Kalley, Martin Hentschel, Tanja Karius', null, 'Three friends, Simon, Nina and Dodo, travel to Mallorca but their flight is delayed in Frankfurt. Accidentally the get mugged and wind up at a restaurant called "Maison de la Petite Mort", a notorious venue where members of the Elite Class secretly meet in the basement for bloody games of perversion.', 'Three friends, Simon, Nina and Dodo, travel to Mallorca but their flight is delayed in Frankfurt. Accidentally the get mugged and wind up at a restaurant called "Maison de la Petite Mort", a notorious venue where members of the Elite Class secretly meet in the basement for bloody games of perversion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sigI5WojyCG55bIDKJ7orxOaGhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208697'),
  ('361802587435655617', 'La Petite Mort 2: Nasty Tapes', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Marcel Walz', 'Marcel Walz, Annika Strauss', 'Annika Strauss, Mika Metz, Micaela Schäfer, Yvonne Woelke, Gabriela Wirbel, Nicole Neukirch, Bea La Bea, Armin Barwich', null, 'Follow the owners of the infamous "Maison de la petite mort" during their daily work. After the shocking events in part one, you''ll never guess what the new owner Monsieur Matheo Maximè is up to. Torturing for money at it''s very - worst.', 'Follow the owners of the infamous "Maison de la petite mort" during their daily work. After the shocking events in part one, you''ll never guess what the new owner Monsieur Matheo Maximè is up to. Torturing for money at it''s very - worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3C5asVVtARl4UJDZUg6iC27F6zs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304657'),
  ('771375378117176655', 'La piel del amor', 1973, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hugo Flesc, Mario David', 'Isaac Aisemberg', 'Susana Giménez, Claudio García Satur, Héctor Alterio, David Llewellyn, Jesús Berenguer, Graciela Canova, Yaco Lorca, Mario Luciani', null, 'A woman seduces a young man so her homosexual husband can satisfy his desires.', 'A woman seduces a young man so her homosexual husband can satisfy his desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVzvsLoBv0HSP8dGna0kluVErtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128807'),
  ('93405498256145613', 'La Pirate', 1984, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, Bruno Nuytten', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Jane Birkin, Maruschka Detmers, Andrew Birkin, Philippe Léotard, Laure Marsac, Michael Stevens, Didier Chambragne, Arsène Altmeyer', null, 'Shortly after returning home one evening with her husband, Alma is visited by her one-time lesbian lover Carole. In the ensuing emotional torrent, Alma allows herself to be abducted by Carole and taken to a hotel, pursued by a young girl - an unnamed friend of Carole - and an eccentric bystander posing as a private detective. Before Alma and Carole can resolve their situation, Alma''s husband Andrew appears on the scene and, in a mad frenzy, attempts to reclaim his wife…', 'Shortly after returning home one evening with her husband, Alma is visited by her one-time lesbian lover Carole. In the ensuing emotional torrent, Alma allows herself to be abducted by Carole and taken to a hotel, pursued by a young girl - an unnamed friend of Carole - and an eccentric bystander posing as a private detective. Before Alma and Carole can resolve their situation, Alma''s husband Andrew appears on the scene and, in a mad frenzy, attempts to reclaim his wife…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HfySiCkdtaZEZdIlqw3WJNG0Q0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63157'),
  ('22841678564550891', 'La Planque', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Akim Isker', null, 'Jalil Naciri, Gilles Bellomi, Ahcen Titi, Guillaume Verdier, Samira Lachhab, Dany Verissimo-Petit', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgiPZUCpQcPP2oQj2dR9yEpdS8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71191'),
  ('82368859323411217', 'La Plus belle pour aller danser', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Victoria Bedos, Julie Navarro, Sébastien Matuchet', 'Eulalie Elsker', 'Brune Moulin, Philippe Katerine, Pierre Richard, Loup Pinard, Firmine Richard, Guy Marchand, Olivier Saladin, Claire Guillon', null, 'Marie-Luce Bison, 14 years old, is raised by her father in a cheerful boarding house for seniors where he is the director. It is soon the costume party of her new college: her father does not want her to go ... and anyway, she is not invited. But pushed by Albert, her 80-year-old best friend, Marie-Luce crashes the party, dressed as a man. That evening, everyone takes her for a boy... a boy who is looked at and who pleases. She then decides to invent a male double named Leo to finally live her teenage life. Of course, at home, the relationship with her father becomes complicated.', 'Marie-Luce Bison, 14 years old, is raised by her father in a cheerful boarding house for seniors where he is the director. It is soon the costume party of her new college: her father does not want her to go ... and anyway, she is not invited. But pushed by Albert, her 80-year-old best friend, Marie-Luce crashes the party, dressed as a man. That evening, everyone takes her for a boy... a boy who is looked at and who pleases. She then decides to invent a male double named Leo to finally live her teenage life. Of course, at home, the relationship with her father becomes complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKOVYEwXeeG8pB0M5azwO1qSv0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983017'),
  ('353797570251312177', 'La Pointe Courte', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Agnès Varda, Louis Soulanes, Paul Soulignac', 'Agnès Varda', 'Philippe Noiret, Silvia Monfort, Marcel Jouet, Albert Lubrano, Anna Banegas, André Lubrano, Rossette Lubrano', null, 'A penetrating study of a marriage on the rocks, set against the backdrop of a small Mediterranean fishing village. Both a stylized depiction of the complicated relationship between a married couple and a documentary-like look at the daily struggles of the inhabitants of Sète in the South of France.', 'A penetrating study of a marriage on the rocks, set against the backdrop of a small Mediterranean fishing village. Both a stylized depiction of the complicated relationship between a married couple and a documentary-like look at the daily struggles of the inhabitants of Sète in the South of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPT3tkTu9U7oXkLTSpkPBAr5dwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54436'),
