  ('27756684114656289', 'La primera noche de mi vida', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Miguel Albaladejo', 'Miguel Albaladejo, Elvira Lindo', 'Leonor Watling, Juanjo Martínez, Carlos Fuentes, Roberto Hernández, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Adriana Ozores, Antonia San Juan, Mariola Fuentes', null, 'The story is about a couple that sets out for a dinner party on the millennium eve. The woman is pregnant, the guy has no money and no car and has borrowed one from a friend of his. The car of course is not exactly top class and crashes down after few miles. And that''s where the film really starts. The couple start fighting and trying to find a way to the parents'' house before midnight, hitchhiking on the way and getting into several cars and get themselves involved in the funniest situations.', 'The story is about a couple that sets out for a dinner party on the millennium eve. The woman is pregnant, the guy has no money and no car and has borrowed one from a friend of his. The car of course is not exactly top class and crashes down after few miles. And that''s where the film really starts. The couple start fighting and trying to find a way to the parents'' house before midnight, hitchhiking on the way and getting into several cars and get themselves involved in the funniest situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gmyt9YEy8qXpTD9jDjx4x64uqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47225'),
  ('954432346057424462', 'La princesa Paca', 2017, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance, History', 'Joaquín Llamas', 'Joaquín Llamas, Javier Pascual, Antonio Asencio', 'Irene Escolar, Daniel Holguín, Ana Wagener, Petra Martínez, Israel Elejalde, Luisa Martín, Miriel Cejas, Fernando Soto', null, 'The story of Francisca Sánchez del Pozo, " Paca ", and the Prince of letters, the Nicaraguan Rubén Darío. In 1956, Francisca Sánchez, married to José Villacastín, and already in the twilight of her life, receives in Navalsaúz two writers, Antonio Oliver and Carmen Conde.', 'The story of Francisca Sánchez del Pozo, " Paca ", and the Prince of letters, the Nicaraguan Rubén Darío. In 1956, Francisca Sánchez, married to José Villacastín, and already in the twilight of her life, receives in Navalsaúz two writers, Antonio Oliver and Carmen Conde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/As99wgAvA3XpQFKPPxabKiexVMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438403'),
  ('695162820897114836', 'La Promesse', 1996, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Luc Dardenne, Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Leon Michaux', 'Jérémie Renier, Olivier Gourmet, Assita Ouedraogo, Florian Delain, Hachemi Haddad, Rasmané Ouédraogo, Jean-Michel Balthazar, Frédéric Bodson', null, 'Igor, aged 15, and his father Roger deal in housing and peddling illicit labor in the outlying districts of Liege, Belgium. Scams, lies and swindling rule their lives. When one of his father’s illegal workers gets injured on the job and asks Igor to promise to take care of his wife and baby, Igor finds himself at a crossroad. He wants to keep the promise, but the price would be to betray his father.', 'Igor, aged 15, and his father Roger deal in housing and peddling illicit labor in the outlying districts of Liege, Belgium. Scams, lies and swindling rule their lives. When one of his father’s illegal workers gets injured on the job and asks Igor to promise to take care of his wife and baby, Igor finds himself at a crossroad. He wants to keep the promise, but the price would be to betray his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmGx73cJ3gVCCli1JAVQOaLbdnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24183'),
  ('705296827500321308', 'La pulquería', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Manuel Castro', 'Víctor Manuel Castro', 'Rafael Inclán, Luis de Alba, César Escalero, Polo Ortín, Isela Vega, Carmen Salinas, Sasha Montenegro, Jorge Rivero', null, 'The Devil offers a man to help him if he can show him to love.', 'The Devil offers a man to help him if he can show him to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HHFI1xiS3HXgy75TkbWoEtYScK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207196'),
  ('702637915368735425', 'La pulquería 2', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Manuel Castro', 'Víctor Manuel Castro', 'Jorge Rivero, Sasha Montenegro, Carmen Salinas, Rebeca Silva, Rafael Inclán, Alfonso Zayas, Luis de Alba, Manuel Valdés', null, 'In this second part, the devil (Alfonso Zayas) returns to earth in search of a cure for his loss of masculinity; while Gerardo (Jorge Rivero), the rich and handsome character, continues to seduce his beloved.', 'In this second part, the devil (Alfonso Zayas) returns to earth in search of a cure for his loss of masculinity; while Gerardo (Jorge Rivero), the rich and handsome character, continues to seduce his beloved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5aA8ungvVu9cGBT1w4Bs4q8zv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207197'),
  ('685287163029887346', 'La pulquería 3: Entre ficheras anda el diablo', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Víctor Manuel Castro', 'Jorge Rivero, Sasha Montenegro, Carmen Salinas, Rafael Inclán, Alfonso Zayas, Manuel Valdés, Luis de Alba, Jaime Moreno', null, 'After regaining his manliness, he escapes from hell Satan for embezzling Secretary of infernal hacienda, being chased by a couple of poor devils good for nothing, and took refuge in the cabaret ends up working as a transvestite.', 'After regaining his manliness, he escapes from hell Satan for embezzling Secretary of infernal hacienda, being chased by a couple of poor devils good for nothing, and took refuge in the cabaret ends up working as a transvestite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3otPbc2Di0LHZVw7sLbVxwtVxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391294'),
  ('322327267860329822', 'La quattordicesima domenica del tempo ordinario', 2023, 'Drama', 'Cesare Bastelli, Mariantonia Avati, Pupi Avati', 'Pupi Avati', 'Gabriele Lavia, Edwige Fenech, Massimo Lopez, Lodovico Guenzi, Camilla Ciraolo, Nick Russo, Cesare Bocci, Sydne Rome', null, 'Samuele and Marzio, as teenagers, make a promise to be friends forever, but adulthood, women and everyday problems sneak into their lives.', 'Samuele and Marzio, as teenagers, make a promise to be friends forever, but adulthood, women and everyday problems sneak into their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAY3vkg5PvT0tQPeml4NSkrRKkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109148'),
  ('625113162464095490', 'La Querida', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jennie Uy, Carlos S. Montaño Jr., G.B. Sampedro', 'Eric Ramos', 'Angela Morena, Arron Villaflor, Mercedes Cabral, Jay Manalo, Yda Manzano, Alona Navarro, Rey "PJ" Abellana, Irma Adlawan', null, 'A young couple''s romance is cut short when the man learns that his woman is married. Meanwhile, an unhappily married husband meets a lonely teacher and they share an illicit affair.', 'A young couple''s romance is cut short when the man learns that his woman is married. Meanwhile, an unhappily married husband meets a lonely teacher and they share an illicit affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTmMRWqLII3khXfOXRlHAp4UDyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075523'),
  ('311520330544007660', 'La rabbia', 2008, 'Drama', 'Louis Nero', 'Louis Nero, Timothy Keller', 'Franco Nero, Nico Rogner, Gregorio Napoli, Barbara Enrichi, Lucia Luciano, Tinto Brass, Antonella Salvucci, Jun Ichikawa', null, 'A young director years old, lives with a girl. Active part of the Intellectual society, he represents perfectly the union between fear and determination, that changes deeply his way of understanding the world that surrounds him. His only aim is to leave a footstep of his presence on this world realizing a film.', 'A young director years old, lives with a girl. Active part of the Intellectual society, he represents perfectly the union between fear and determination, that changes deeply his way of understanding the world that surrounds him. His only aim is to leave a footstep of his presence on this world realizing a film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFU7LnvyLJcWgiv6Mxl4jXUM72y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115319'),
  ('952147725177212241', 'La Rabbia', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Carlo Di Carlo, Giacinto Solito, Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Giovannino Guareschi', 'Giorgio Bassani, Renato Guttuso, Gigi Artuso, Carlo Romano, Charles de Gaulle, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Yuri Gagarin, Ava Gardner', null, 'Documentary footage (from the 1950s) and accompanying commentary to attempt to answer the existential question, Why are our lives characterized by discontent, anguish, and fear? The film is in two completely separate parts, and the directors of these respective sections, left-wing Pier Paolo Pasolini and conservative Giovanni Guareschi, offer the viewer contrasting analyses of and prescriptions for modern society. Part I, by Pasolini, is a denunciation of the offenses of Western culture, particularly those against colonized Africa. It is at the same time a chronicle of the liberation and independence of the former African colonies, portraying these peoples as the new protagonists of the world stage, holding up Marxism as their "salvation", and suggesting that their "innocent ferocity" will be the new religion of the era. Guareschi''s part, by contrast, constitutes a defense of Western civilization and a word of hope, couched in traditional Christian terms, for man''s future.', 'Documentary footage (from the 1950s) and accompanying commentary to attempt to answer the existential question, Why are our lives characterized by discontent, anguish, and fear? The film is in two completely separate parts, and the directors of these respective sections, left-wing Pier Paolo Pasolini and conservative Giovanni Guareschi, offer the viewer contrasting analyses of and prescriptions for modern society. Part I, by Pasolini, is a denunciation of the offenses of Western culture, particularly those against colonized Africa. It is at the same time a chronicle of the liberation and independence of the former African colonies, portraying these peoples as the new protagonists of the world stage, holding up Marxism as their "salvation", and suggesting that their "innocent ferocity" will be the new religion of the era. Guareschi''s part, by contrast, constitutes a defense of Western civilization and a word of hope, couched in traditional Christian terms, for man''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thP95HJ5eOx0HrZ5jXhDUpqLaA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49152'),
  ('710347182127101630', 'La Rabbia di Pasolini', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Giuseppe Bertolucci, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Carlo Di Carlo', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Giuseppe Bertolucci, Vittorio Magrelli', null, 'An attempt to reconstruct the complete version of Pier Paolo Pasolini''s segment of La rabbia.', 'An attempt to reconstruct the complete version of Pier Paolo Pasolini''s segment of La rabbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4oFkmmNPz4FMapNjQgGwG3vB50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122619'),
