  ('809837218505267476', 'La ribelle', 1993, 'Drama', 'Aurelio Grimaldi, Barbara Daniele, Gianni Zampagni', 'Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Penélope Cruz, Stefano Dionisi, Lorenza Indovina, Marco Leonardi, Tony Palazzo, Lucia Sardo, Rosa Pianeta, Imma Piro', null, 'Enza is a beautiful and lively Sicilian teenager who is starting out in life, but due to her naivety, she always ends up getting into trouble. She has no parents, but lives with her aunt and uncle together with her older sister who acts as her mother and tries to put her on the right path, even ending up in prison for some time. Enza, keeping faith with her rebellious nature, falls in love with Sebastiano, with whom she has her first sexual relations, but for him she also goes as far as stealing. All men are the same.', 'Enza is a beautiful and lively Sicilian teenager who is starting out in life, but due to her naivety, she always ends up getting into trouble. She has no parents, but lives with her aunt and uncle together with her older sister who acts as her mother and tries to put her on the right path, even ending up in prison for some time. Enza, keeping faith with her rebellious nature, falls in love with Sebastiano, with whom she has her first sexual relations, but for him she also goes as far as stealing. All men are the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7btBaBNobXRaU2PUIZNVEdmeMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193350'),
  ('213752108692045209', 'La Ronde', 1950, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Max Ophüls, Paul Feyder, Christian Matras', null, 'Anton Walbrook, Simone Signoret, Serge Reggiani, Simone Simon, Daniel Gélin, Fernand Gravey, Gérard Philipe, Danielle Darrieux', null, 'An all-knowing interlocutor guides us through a series of affairs in Vienna, 1900. A soldier meets an eager young lady of the evening. Later he has an affair with a young lady, who becomes a maid and does similarly with the young man of the house. The young man seduces a married woman. On and on, spinning on the gay carousel of life.', 'An all-knowing interlocutor guides us through a series of affairs in Vienna, 1900. A soldier meets an eager young lady of the evening. Later he has an affair with a young lady, who becomes a maid and does similarly with the young man of the house. The young man seduces a married woman. On and on, spinning on the gay carousel of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMcF0XAD66n1abW1ZZhtrD0AsKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50030'),
  ('288004077407725395', 'La Roue', 1923, 'Drama, Romance', 'Abel Gance, Léonce-Henri Burel, Gaston Brun', 'Abel Gance', 'Séverin-Mars, Ivy Close, Gabriel de Gravone, Pierre Magnier, Max Maxudian, Georges Térof, Gil Clary, Abel Gance', null, 'Sisif, a railwayman, saves a young girl named Norma orphaned by a train crash and raises her as his own daughter alongside his son, Elie. As she becomes an adult, Sisif grapples with whether to tell Norma the truth about her parentage.', 'Sisif, a railwayman, saves a young girl named Norma orphaned by a train crash and raises her as his own daughter alongside his son, Elie. As she becomes an adult, Sisif grapples with whether to tell Norma the truth about her parentage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ed3ywd7lmDPhsCXmcdSih9SxP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50182'),
