  ('670254448066880992', 'La Sapienza', 2014, 'Drama', 'Eugène Green', 'Eugène Green', 'Fabrizio Rongione, Christelle Prot, Ludovico Succio, Arianna Nastro, Hervé Compagne, Sabine Ponte, Clément Cogitore, Michele Franco', null, 'The story is one of an architect that has lost his inspiration and goes looking for those motivations that pushed him as a youngster to take up the profession. Inspiring him was the baroque movement and all of its artifices: the Guarini in Turin and the Borromini in Rome. The film’s central story ends up being the love story that develops between architecture, artistic inspiration and feelings.', 'The story is one of an architect that has lost his inspiration and goes looking for those motivations that pushed him as a youngster to take up the profession. Inspiring him was the baroque movement and all of its artifices: the Guarini in Turin and the Borromini in Rome. The film’s central story ends up being the love story that develops between architecture, artistic inspiration and feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIeCAATbT0zp1I1ezJPXo8t4tlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281968'),
  ('117844393519196667', 'La scuola', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniele Luchetti, Alessio Gelsini Torresi, Sandro De Santis', 'Sandro Petraglia, Daniele Luchetti, Domenico Starnone', 'Silvio Orlando, Anna Galiena, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Antonio Petrocelli, Anita Zagaria, Enrica Maria Modugno, Vittorio Ciorcalo, Roberto Nobile', null, 'In a high school in the outskirts of Rome, it''s the last day before the summer holidays. A literature teacher reminisces the past year and wonders what will become of the students he cared for as if they were his children.', 'In a high school in the outskirts of Rome, it''s the last day before the summer holidays. A literature teacher reminisces the past year and wonders what will become of the students he cared for as if they were his children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFa22abr2WH9Aw49qIAN1B3kmPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58703'),
