  ('381428520466389058', 'La sociedad del semáforo', 2010, 'Drama', 'Rubén Mendoza, Juan Carlos Gil', 'Rubén Mendoza', 'Alexis Zúñiga, Abelardo Jaimes, Gala Bernal, Romelia Cajiao', null, 'By applying all his knowledge in electricity and electronics, Raúl Tréllez, a bum who lives in the downtown streets of Bogotá, struggles to control the time of a red light so that jugglers, cripples and other homeless people can achieve longer shows in the red light corner.', 'By applying all his knowledge in electricity and electronics, Raúl Tréllez, a bum who lives in the downtown streets of Bogotá, struggles to control the time of a red light so that jugglers, cripples and other homeless people can achieve longer shows in the red light corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPGnJZewUX6wzLl2x7LdCLapzpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200281'),
