  ('120037526806677291', 'La solita commedia: Inferno', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Mandelli, Fabrizio Biggio, Martino Ferro', 'Francesco Mandelli, Fabrizio Biggio', 'Fabrizio Biggio, Francesco Mandelli, Giordano De Plano, Tea Falco, Marco Foschi, Walter Leonardi, Paolo Pierobon, Marco Ripoldi', null, '2015: Hell is in chaos. A host of new sinners arrive every day to crowd Minos'' offices. But Hell is an old, antiquated structure: the new sinners, not finding a right place, are dispersed among the circles. Lucifer is received directly by God, who seeks a solution. The winning idea is a cataloging of the new sins on Earth. And who to entrust the task to if not Dante Alighieri, who already once, in his time, carried out this task with excellent results? Dante is thus catapulted into a large Italian city, and finally finds his guide, the one who will accompany him in search of the "new sins": Demetrio Virgilio, a precarious thirty-year-old who is preparing, like every morning, to face another "day of Hell".', '2015: Hell is in chaos. A host of new sinners arrive every day to crowd Minos'' offices. But Hell is an old, antiquated structure: the new sinners, not finding a right place, are dispersed among the circles. Lucifer is received directly by God, who seeks a solution. The winning idea is a cataloging of the new sins on Earth. And who to entrust the task to if not Dante Alighieri, who already once, in his time, carried out this task with excellent results? Dante is thus catapulted into a large Italian city, and finally finds his guide, the one who will accompany him in search of the "new sins": Demetrio Virgilio, a precarious thirty-year-old who is preparing, like every morning, to face another "day of Hell".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qr6eGLZOAbDF1vy5OZ8r10AbEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331444'),
  ('22012049550046487', 'La sombra del gallo', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Nicolás Herzog, Fernando Lorenzale, Mariano Biasin', 'Nicolás Herzog, Gabriel Bobillo', 'Lautaro Delgado Tymruk, Claudio Rissi, Rita Pauls, Alián Devetac, Diego Detona, Diego Alonso, Corina Romero, Ignacio Iriarte', null, 'After spending 8 years in prison, former police officer Román Maidana returns to his childhood town and hallucinates a woman who seems to be encouraging him to disarm a network of prostitution and trafficking in women.', 'After spending 8 years in prison, former police officer Román Maidana returns to his childhood town and hallucinates a woman who seems to be encouraging him to disarm a network of prostitution and trafficking in women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91UviB9FW67pPL7Uyl7kvGhk0NF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629522'),
  ('996861875807316176', 'La Soufrière: Waiting for an Inevitable Catastrophe', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein, Edward Lachman', null, 'Werner Herzog, Edward Lachman, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', null, 'Werner Herzog takes a film crew to the island of Guadeloupe when he hears that the volcano on the island is going to erupt. Everyone has left, except for one old man who refuses to leave.', 'Werner Herzog takes a film crew to the island of Guadeloupe when he hears that the volcano on the island is going to erupt. Everyone has left, except for one old man who refuses to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNoPeBRIE4zEgVBpgPLx2n1gNgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48227'),
  ('228385464206543572', 'La Squale', 2000, 'Drama', 'Fabrice Genestal', 'Nathalie Vailloud', 'Esse Lawson, Tony Harrisson, Khereddine Ennasri, Stéphanie Jaubert, Denis Lavant, Foued Nassah, François Delaive, Lokman Nalcakan', null, 'Désirée, a black girl, is nicknamed "The Shark" by her friends. This nickname comes from her strong rebellion and her ability to win in the suburban city, dominated by the power of boys.', 'Désirée, a black girl, is nicknamed "The Shark" by her friends. This nickname comes from her strong rebellion and her ability to win in the suburban city, dominated by the power of boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cNmaJQYzuDUH3Dl3zrfdDxu29g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60074'),
  ('352887837827741055', 'La stagione della caccia', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Roan Johnson, Claudio Cofrancesco, Marco Teti', 'Leonardo Marini, Francesco Bruni, Andrea Camilleri', 'Francesco Scianna, Miriam Dalmazio, Donatella Finocchiaro, Tommaso Ragno, Antonino Bruschetta, Giorgio Marchesi, Alessio Vassallo, Alice Canzonieri', null, 'Vigàta, Sicily, Italy, 1880. Shortly after the return to the village of Fofò La Matina, pharmacist and son of the late Santo La Matina, jealous guardian of the secrets of certain miraculous plants, the noble Peluso family is ravaged by a series of mysterious deaths…', 'Vigàta, Sicily, Italy, 1880. Shortly after the return to the village of Fofò La Matina, pharmacist and son of the late Santo La Matina, jealous guardian of the secrets of certain miraculous plants, the noble Peluso family is ravaged by a series of mysterious deaths…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42qlH5HsXCJVmZn5hIFbDYe2C2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584201'),
  ('998052447903668067', 'La stella di Andra e Tati', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, War, History', 'Rosalba Vitellaro, Alessandro Belli', null, 'Leo Gullotta, Loretta Goggi, Ludovica Modugno, Alessandra Cannavale, Beatrice Raimo, Laura Morante, Chiara Gristina, Valentina Gristina', null, 'Little Andra and Tati Bucci, Italian Jews from Fiume, were 6 and 4 years old when, on March 29, 1944, they were deported to Auschwitz together with their mother, grandmother, aunt, and little cousin Sergio. They managed to survive the initial selections in the concentration camp because Dr. Mengele mistook them for twins and decided to take them to the Kinderblock, the barracks for children destined for eugenics experiments. The bond they formed with each other and the compassion of a female camp guard allowed the little sisters to survive until the liberation of the camp on January 27, 1945.', 'Little Andra and Tati Bucci, Italian Jews from Fiume, were 6 and 4 years old when, on March 29, 1944, they were deported to Auschwitz together with their mother, grandmother, aunt, and little cousin Sergio. They managed to survive the initial selections in the concentration camp because Dr. Mengele mistook them for twins and decided to take them to the Kinderblock, the barracks for children destined for eugenics experiments. The bond they formed with each other and the compassion of a female camp guard allowed the little sisters to survive until the liberation of the camp on January 27, 1945.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXSnWeuOgfQ3VhdoMSGB5LaCRsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546832'),
  ('776874636434318821', 'La Suerte en tus Manos', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Daniel Burman, Daniel Ortega', 'Daniel Burman, Sergio Dubcovsky', 'Valeria Bertuccelli, Jorge Drexler, Norma Aleandro, Luis Brandoni, Gabriel Schultz, Silvina Bosco, Salo Pasik', null, 'A professional poker player seeks out an old flame after his marriage fizzles.', 'A professional poker player seeks out an old flame after his marriage fizzles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCk5UysWXmz59lD9rX0jnmjCzGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115165'),
