  ('211541186791284810', 'La svergognata', 1974, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Antonio Borghesi, Giuliano Biagetti', 'Giorgio Mariuzzo, Giuliano Biagetti', 'Philippe Leroy, Leonora Fani, Barbara Bouchet, Stefano Amato, Serena Cociani, Filippo De Gara, Maria Pia Conte, Dana Ghia', null, 'In this movie a writer comes to stay at an island resort and gets involved with a teenage lolita who is there with her parents and rather malicious best friend. She teases the older man mercilessly--going to a hotel and dancing with him naked and then suddenly getting dressed and running off to a party with a young American guy. But it''s not so much because she is malicious, but because she is really an insecure virgin. Finally, he gives up on her after his beautiful wife (Barbara Bouchet) shows up. But the younger woman becomes jealous and is not going to give up so easily. . .', 'In this movie a writer comes to stay at an island resort and gets involved with a teenage lolita who is there with her parents and rather malicious best friend. She teases the older man mercilessly--going to a hotel and dancing with him naked and then suddenly getting dressed and running off to a party with a young American guy. But it''s not so much because she is malicious, but because she is really an insecure virgin. Finally, he gives up on her after his beautiful wife (Barbara Bouchet) shows up. But the younger woman becomes jealous and is not going to give up so easily. . .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SfuAJik0PcLXlBPaAsE7rpKuSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293172'),
  ('821244664844023279', 'La Syndicaliste', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Mathieu Thouvenot, Chloé Guedeney, Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Fadette Drouard, Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Isabelle Huppert, Grégory Gadebois, Marina Foïs, Alexandra Maria Lara, Pierre Deladonchamps, François-Xavier Demaison, Gilles Cohen, Yvan Attal', null, 'The true story of the Irish national Maureen Kearney- head tradeunion representative-turned-whistleblower of a French multinational nuclear powerhouse. After denouncing top-secret deals that shook the sector, Kearney’s life is suddenly turned upside-down when she is violently assaulted in her own house.', 'The true story of the Irish national Maureen Kearney- head tradeunion representative-turned-whistleblower of a French multinational nuclear powerhouse. After denouncing top-secret deals that shook the sector, Kearney’s life is suddenly turned upside-down when she is violently assaulted in her own house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppx4Njse3xKDDAylXH5EryaJfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925714'),
  ('562994572496421207', 'La Taranta', 1962, 'Documentary', 'Ugo Piccone, Gianfranco Mingozzi', 'Salvatore Quasimodo', null, null, 'Documentary on a religious practice in the Puglia region of Italy whereby women assert that they have been bitten by a tarantula and dance until they are exorcised of the poison.', 'Documentary on a religious practice in the Puglia region of Italy whereby women assert that they have been bitten by a tarantula and dance until they are exorcised of the poison.', null, 'tmdb:movie:149067'),
  ('373787193407792598', 'La tendresse', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marion Hänsel, Jan Vancaillie', 'Marion Hänsel', 'Olivier Gourmet, Marilyne Canto, Adrien Jolivet, Margaux Chatelier, Sergi López, Patrick Massieu, Hilde Heijnen, Carinne Koeppel', null, 'This is the first film by Hänsel based entirely on her own script and gives a wise and loving significance to the concept of personal and anecdotal. With beautiful leading roles by Canto as mother and Gourmet as her ex. Together, they drive to a ski resort to fetch their son, a ski instructor with a broken leg.', 'This is the first film by Hänsel based entirely on her own script and gives a wise and loving significance to the concept of personal and anecdotal. With beautiful leading roles by Canto as mother and Gourmet as her ex. Together, they drive to a ski resort to fetch their son, a ski instructor with a broken leg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Iprnxu600T5UNzIO9cyIcdkOok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159500'),
  ('808758434885940082', 'La Terra Trema', 1949, 'Drama', 'Luchino Visconti, G.R. Aldo, Francesco Rosi', 'Luchino Visconti, Antonio Pietrangeli', 'Antonio Arcidiacono, Giuseppe Arcidiacono, Venera Bonaccorso, Nicola Castorino, Rosa Catalano, Rosa Costanzo, Alfio Fichera, Carmela Fichera', null, 'In rural Sicily, the fishermen live at the mercy of the greedy wholesalers. One family risks everything to buy their own boat and operate independently.', 'In rural Sicily, the fishermen live at the mercy of the greedy wholesalers. One family risks everything to buy their own boat and operate independently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSaazq8Am0eLjapiAcCXadXZaqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43445'),
  ('361491007062951484', 'La terza stella', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Marras, Alberto Ferrari', 'Ale, Franz, Alberto Ferrari', 'Ale, Franz, Petra Faksova, Francesca Giovannetti, Marica Coco, Sergio Romano, Stefano Venturi, Amerigo Fontani', null, 'In a small italian town everyone''s waiting for the event of the year: the living chess game with a near town.', 'In a small italian town everyone''s waiting for the event of the year: the living chess game with a near town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvXSfOjuOUTMY6qLS7WNWDXPsWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70153'),
  ('409602217142795148', 'La Tête de Normande St-Onge', 1975, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Gilles Carle, François Protat, Michel Brault', 'Ben Barzman', 'Carole Laure, Raymond Cloutier, Reynald Bouchard, Carmen Giroux, Gaetan Guimond, J. Léo Gagnon, Anne-Marie Ducharme, Renée Girard', null, 'Working as a pharmacy clerk while dreaming of escape through dance, Normande St-Onge supports a household of dependent and unstable relatives. As her efforts to protect and hold together her improvised family intensify, the pressures of exploitation, eviction, and emotional isolation push her toward psychological collapse. Directed by Gilles Carle, the film blurs the boundary between fantasy and breakdown.', 'Working as a pharmacy clerk while dreaming of escape through dance, Normande St-Onge supports a household of dependent and unstable relatives. As her efforts to protect and hold together her improvised family intensify, the pressures of exploitation, eviction, and emotional isolation push her toward psychological collapse. Directed by Gilles Carle, the film blurs the boundary between fantasy and breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCxeGTSlaxCd0swj1w2NgnDNZrj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192684'),
  ('165560485823681372', 'La tía de Carlos', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Luis María Delgado, Ricardo Walker, Manuel Rojas', 'Vicente Coello, Dionisio Ramos', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Rafael Alonso, Luis Barbero, María Luisa Bernal, Rafael Hernández, María Kosty, Carmen Lozano, Ricardo Merino', null, 'The father of his girlfriend does not want her to spend a few days with Carlos, so he needs a companion. Therefore, he asks a friend to pretend to be his aunt. This will create endless trouble and confusion, especially when the real aunt of Charles arrives.', 'The father of his girlfriend does not want her to spend a few days with Carlos, so he needs a companion. Therefore, he asks a friend to pretend to be his aunt. This will create endless trouble and confusion, especially when the real aunt of Charles arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIklLQ2vCIAaPe7THmOo9wlQnMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86046'),
  ('690416345042008314', 'La Tigra, Chaco', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Juan Sasiaín, Federico Godfrid', 'Federico Godfrid, Juan Sasiaín', 'Ezequiel Tronconi, Guadalupe Docampo, Roger Grancic, Federico Ibañez, Ana Allende', null, 'La Tigra, Chaco. A quiet town only 20 blocks long. Esteban returns after years of absence to the place where he spent his childhood summers. He returns looking for his father, Cacho, and to talk "about Buenos Aires". But Cacho, a truck driver who has started a new family in La Tigra, is often on the road and their encounter is postponed indefinitely. While he waits, Esteban meets Vero, a childhood friend that has grown into a beautiful woman. Each step together seems to take them back to the most precious moments of a shared memory. But their relationship is not a journey into the past; rather it holds the promise of a future. Federico Godfrid''s and Juan Sasiaín''s first feature film transmits the warmth, honesty and sadness of this reunion, thanks to its mise en scène and the performances of Ezequiel Tronconi and Guadalupe Docampo, who give their characters a rare spontaneity.', 'La Tigra, Chaco. A quiet town only 20 blocks long. Esteban returns after years of absence to the place where he spent his childhood summers. He returns looking for his father, Cacho, and to talk "about Buenos Aires". But Cacho, a truck driver who has started a new family in La Tigra, is often on the road and their encounter is postponed indefinitely. While he waits, Esteban meets Vero, a childhood friend that has grown into a beautiful woman. Each step together seems to take them back to the most precious moments of a shared memory. But their relationship is not a journey into the past; rather it holds the promise of a future. Federico Godfrid''s and Juan Sasiaín''s first feature film transmits the warmth, honesty and sadness of this reunion, thanks to its mise en scène and the performances of Ezequiel Tronconi and Guadalupe Docampo, who give their characters a rare spontaneity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzfHozgjKXhNVq3VhrVUIB3Kf9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252426'),
  ('1010027626176258924', 'La tonta del bote', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Juan de Orduña, Joaquín Vera, Antonio L. Ballesteros', 'Pilar Millán Astray', 'Lina Morgan, Arturo Fernández, María Asquerino, Paca Gabaldón, José Sacristán, Tony Soler, Antonio Durán, Marisol Ayuso', null, 'Susana is an unappreciated, naive and somewhat clumsy orphan who has lived since she was a child at doña Engracia''s house, because her mother died a few days after she was born. In this house, which also houses three nephews of doña Engracia without a penny to one''s name, Susana is the maid of all. Economic necessities lead Engracia to rent a room. Felipe, a handsome man with a bad reputation, will reply to the ad.', 'Susana is an unappreciated, naive and somewhat clumsy orphan who has lived since she was a child at doña Engracia''s house, because her mother died a few days after she was born. In this house, which also houses three nephews of doña Engracia without a penny to one''s name, Susana is the maid of all. Economic necessities lead Engracia to rent a room. Felipe, a handsome man with a bad reputation, will reply to the ad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfhVJS8dSZvZ8KuitO2JdlZCVMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160610'),
  ('848277348515142756', 'La torre de los siete jorobados', 1944, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Edgar Neville, Enrique Barreyre', 'Edgar Neville, José Santugini', 'Antonio Casal, Isabel de Pomés, Guillermo Marín, Félix de Pomés, Julia Lajos, Manolita Morán, Julia Pachelo, Antonio Riquelme', null, 'In Madrid, Spain, at the end of the 19th century, the young and reckless Basilio seems to be the only person who perceives the spectral presence of Professor Robinsón de Mantua, who begs him to take care of his niece Inés, because she is in grave danger.', 'In Madrid, Spain, at the end of the 19th century, the young and reckless Basilio seems to be the only person who perceives the spectral presence of Professor Robinsón de Mantua, who begs him to take care of his niece Inés, because she is in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVymYeVZ2uO0UZmhLpzdepQKmh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118673'),
  ('887779627059259486', 'La torre de Suso', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Tom Fernández', 'Tom Fernández', 'Javier Cámara, Gonzalo de Castro, César Vea, José Luis Alcobendas, Malena Alterio, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Mariana Cordero, Alex Amaral', null, 'Cundo emigrated to Argentina to seek a new life. Ten years later he returns home, to the funeral of an old friend, Suso. The film chronicles the reunion with family and friends and how Cundo wants to fulfill the ultimate dream of Suso. The film is a tribute to friendship. And above all friendship in a age where it is not so clear why you should remain friends with your childhood friends.', 'Cundo emigrated to Argentina to seek a new life. Ten years later he returns home, to the funeral of an old friend, Suso. The film chronicles the reunion with family and friends and how Cundo wants to fulfill the ultimate dream of Suso. The film is a tribute to friendship. And above all friendship in a age where it is not so clear why you should remain friends with your childhood friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10jMl6LlqkzJm5FXt6bNlFhlwHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34916'),
  ('331146404821545563', 'La Tosca', 1973, 'Drama', 'Luigi Magni, Antonio Gabrielli, Antonio Spoletini', 'Luigi Magni', 'Monica Vitti, Vittorio Gassman, Gigi Proietti, Umberto Orsini, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Gianni Bonagura, Marisa Fabbri, Ninetto Davoli', null, 'Rome, 1800. Napoleon threatens the power of the Church and executions of Jacobins are constant. Angelotti, the most famous of them all has escaped from prison and the chief of police is on his tail. Angelotti is being helped by a painter, lover of "La Tosca", a famous singer. The police chief suspects the truth and tries to arouse the jealousy of "La Tosca" to catch the escapee.', 'Rome, 1800. Napoleon threatens the power of the Church and executions of Jacobins are constant. Angelotti, the most famous of them all has escaped from prison and the chief of police is on his tail. Angelotti is being helped by a painter, lover of "La Tosca", a famous singer. The police chief suspects the truth and tries to arouse the jealousy of "La Tosca" to catch the escapee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyJX4h4F1qBGmNj6UfBoBZPalSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229590'),
  ('97579718955631056', 'La Tour', 1928, 'Documentary', 'René Clair, Georges Périnal', 'René Clair', null, null, 'A poetic documentary tribute to the famous Eiffel tower, built for the 1889 World Fair and intended to have been destroyed 20 years later. A vocal subset of Parisians (among which, one may surmise, Clair would''ve been counted) insisted the Tower remain above the River Seine, a continued display of French engineering excellence. Clair makes strategic use of double exposures and dissolves, capturing the mechanical exuberance of the Tower; The great swooping steel latticework edifice a bounding symbol of the modern age.', 'A poetic documentary tribute to the famous Eiffel tower, built for the 1889 World Fair and intended to have been destroyed 20 years later. A vocal subset of Parisians (among which, one may surmise, Clair would''ve been counted) insisted the Tower remain above the River Seine, a continued display of French engineering excellence. Clair makes strategic use of double exposures and dissolves, capturing the mechanical exuberance of the Tower; The great swooping steel latticework edifice a bounding symbol of the modern age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVWku7SmXanyJG7rdD7oYfBGGoc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49307'),
  ('194210667507216457', 'La Tour 2 contrôle infernale', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Éric Judor, Vincent Muller', 'Nicolas Orzeckowski, Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor', 'Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia, Marina Foïs, Philippe Katerine, Serge Riaboukine, Grégoire Oestermann, Lionel Beyeke, Joël Jernidier', null, 'Ernest Krakenkrick and Bachir Bouzouk are about to become pilots in the French army. But after the bad consequences of a test undertaken with the centrifuge, they are forced to give up their dream. They are eventually given the position of baggage handler at Orly-West Airport in Paris. But one night, there is a hostage-taking in the airport and the "Moustachious", a group of terrorists, take hold of the control tower.', 'Ernest Krakenkrick and Bachir Bouzouk are about to become pilots in the French army. But after the bad consequences of a test undertaken with the centrifuge, they are forced to give up their dream. They are eventually given the position of baggage handler at Orly-West Airport in Paris. But one night, there is a hostage-taking in the airport and the "Moustachious", a group of terrorists, take hold of the control tower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIuTXKeLs4COxzRS0PzOuUnkTZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369779'),
  ('1097981180933993902', 'La Traque', 2021, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Kika Ungaro, Yves Rénier', 'Jean-Luc Estèbe', 'Philippe Torreton, Isabelle Gélinas, François-Xavier Demaison, Claire Moigno, Mélanie Bernier, Yves Rénier, Lilea Le Borgne, Luna Bevilacqua', null, 'The Belgian and French police investigate the activities of Michel Fourniret, a serial killer who was active on both sides of the border.', 'The Belgian and French police investigate the activities of Michel Fourniret, a serial killer who was active on both sides of the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqEHK3fE5juPoOcmUY2TGUIMxvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729752'),
  ('625264651863423275', 'La trattativa', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Sabina Guzzanti, Daniele Ciprì', 'Sabina Guzzanti', 'Enzo Lombardo, Sabina Guzzanti, Sabino Civilleri, Filippo Luna, Franz Cantalupo, Michele Franco, Domenico Centamore, Maurizio Bologna', null, 'What are we talking about when we talk about negotiations? About the state''s concessions to the Mafia in exchange for ending the massacres? About who assassinated Falcone and Borsellino? Of the eternal coexistence between the Mafia and politics? Between the mafia and the church? Between the Mafia and law enforcement? Or is there more? A group of actors enacts the most relevant episodes of the affair known as the Mafia-state negotiation, impersonating mobsters, secret service agents, high officials, magistrates, victims and murderers, Freemasons, honest and courageous people, and courageous people up to a point. Thus one of the most intricate events in our history becomes an exciting tale.', 'What are we talking about when we talk about negotiations? About the state''s concessions to the Mafia in exchange for ending the massacres? About who assassinated Falcone and Borsellino? Of the eternal coexistence between the Mafia and politics? Between the mafia and the church? Between the Mafia and law enforcement? Or is there more? A group of actors enacts the most relevant episodes of the affair known as the Mafia-state negotiation, impersonating mobsters, secret service agents, high officials, magistrates, victims and murderers, Freemasons, honest and courageous people, and courageous people up to a point. Thus one of the most intricate events in our history becomes an exciting tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta8xdOBNhytQM409QWr8etJ9KIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288694'),
  ('85105681408156280', 'La traversée', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Varante Soudjian, Cyril Bron', 'Thomas Nlend, Varante Soudjian', 'Alban Ivanov, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Audrey Pirault, Moncef Farfar, Thilla Thiam, Lucie Charles-Alfred, Mamari Diarra, Enzo Lemartinet', null, 'Community workers, Alex and Stéphanie take five teen dropouts on an educational journey across the Mediterranean. But their skipper happens to be an ex cop with a powerful hatred for youths from the hood.', 'Community workers, Alex and Stéphanie take five teen dropouts on an educational journey across the Mediterranean. But their skipper happens to be an ex cop with a powerful hatred for youths from the hood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryVIqBbXINI3BXNBvIXmJnK5hTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947962'),
  ('891148290352464286', 'La Traversée de Paris', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Ghislaine Autant-Lara, Jacques Natteau', 'Pierre Bost, Jean Aurenche', 'Jean Gabin, Bourvil, Louis de Funès, Jeannette Batti, Georgette Anys, Robert Arnoux, Laurence Badie, Myno Burney', null, 'Two unlikely companions must smuggle four suitcases filled with contraband pork across Nazi-occupied Paris.', 'Two unlikely companions must smuggle four suitcases filled with contraband pork across Nazi-occupied Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euq3YhkXJgsDlUxid5cTInsxnqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19178'),
  ('807836922734665570', 'La traviata', 1982, 'Drama, Music', 'Franco Zeffirelli, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Francesco Maria Piave', 'Teresa Stratas, Plácido Domingo, Cornell MacNeil, Allan Monk, Axelle Gall, Pina Cei, Maurizio Barbacini, James Levine', null, 'This “Traviata” became one of the most succesful of all opera films, especially in France, where 800,000 Parisian cinemagoers flocked to it in the first six week. It was nominated for two Oscars (for production and costume design) and won BAFTAs in those two categories, as well as receiving BAFTA and Golden Globe nominations as 1983’s Best Foreign-Language Film.', 'This “Traviata” became one of the most succesful of all opera films, especially in France, where 800,000 Parisian cinemagoers flocked to it in the first six week. It was nominated for two Oscars (for production and costume design) and won BAFTAs in those two categories, as well as receiving BAFTA and Golden Globe nominations as 1983’s Best Foreign-Language Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYGZgwpfS4kutHCcbs1ENxeffHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48561'),
  ('482482440386287758', 'La última noche', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alejandro Gamboa', 'Alejandro Gamboa', 'Andrés García, Cecilia Gabriela, Mariana Ávila, Elizabeth Valdez, Ricardo Palacio, Melissa Perea, Max Kerlow, Rodrigo Cabello', null, 'This film is different from the previous ones; its themes are more mature, and the characters and situations are different. The protagonist is still Mariana Ávila, who now has to face adulthood and marriage.', 'This film is different from the previous ones; its themes are more mature, and the characters and situations are different. The protagonist is still Mariana Ávila, who now has to face adulthood and marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Oa0sHnVoo9paOz06qlsn9nMgOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165268'),
  ('1132109494350497203', 'La Usurpadora', 2023, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Santiago Limón, Danny Hiele', 'María Hinojos, Santiago Limón', 'Isabella Castillo, Alan Estrada, Cecilia Toussaint, Susana Zabaleta, Jesús Ochoa, Shane West, James Levya, Alejandra Ley', 'NR', 'Two identical twin sisters, separated at birth, one truly decent but humble, the other ultra rich, conniving, and truly destructive. They soon find themselves hopelessly intertwined in each other''s lives.', 'Two identical twin sisters, separated at birth, one truly decent but humble, the other ultra rich, conniving, and truly destructive. They soon find themselves hopelessly intertwined in each other''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40UPlmnQcG71KSmjijksZjbsH2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084226'),
  ('1026409062056270575', 'La valigia sul letto', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Eduardo Tartaglia', 'Elvio Porta, Eduardo Tartaglia', 'Eduardo Tartaglia, Veronica Mazza, Maurizio Casagrande, Biagio Izzo, Ernesto Mahieux, Alena Šeredová, Marjo Berasategui, Nunzia Schiano', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bm5k3OQB7mipphAPPDmOD1uGlIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82537'),
  ('692103036435149075', 'La vallée des loups', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', null, 'Secret territories still exist in France today. This film is a personal quest, the story of a crazy gamble taken by a passionate dreamer, an anti-hero capable of breaking all barriers to achieve his goal: to meet wild wolves in their natural habitat. After three years in the field, bivouacking in the wilderness in all weathers, the director managed to track down the wolves. Little by little, he observes, gets closer and ends up being accepted by the pack. Against all odds, the magnificent predators offer a little of their intimacy to this strange character. But the film also raises the question of the limits of this intimacy.', 'Secret territories still exist in France today. This film is a personal quest, the story of a crazy gamble taken by a passionate dreamer, an anti-hero capable of breaking all barriers to achieve his goal: to meet wild wolves in their natural habitat. After three years in the field, bivouacking in the wilderness in all weathers, the director managed to track down the wolves. Little by little, he observes, gets closer and ends up being accepted by the pack. Against all odds, the magnificent predators offer a little of their intimacy to this strange character. But the film also raises the question of the limits of this intimacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcG2JbpRCL2uY12NkaCkUKDMIy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421402'),
  ('137056818954905907', 'La vendedora de ropa interior', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Germán Lorente, Pedro Labat, José García Galisteo', 'Juan José Alonso Millán', 'María José Nieto, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Ramoncín, Julián Navarro, Antonio Ozores, Quique Camoiras, Florinda Chico, Antonio Garisa', null, 'A story of a family whose father tries by all means to maintain the strictest ethics and morality ... or at least appear so. His beautiful young daughter tries to emancipate hereself and looks for a job, but the chance is that the first thing that comes out is underwear seller. She starts to work and problems start for all.', 'A story of a family whose father tries by all means to maintain the strictest ethics and morality ... or at least appear so. His beautiful young daughter tries to emancipate hereself and looks for a job, but the chance is that the first thing that comes out is underwear seller. She starts to work and problems start for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swss5eFWeFTvfs7VSVvU0o8x6hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67815'),
  ('520046446444276197', 'La venganza de Don Mendo', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, José F. Aguayo, Fernando Merino', null, 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Paloma Valdés, Juanjo Menéndez, Antonio Garisa, Joaquín Roa, Lina Canalejas, María Luisa Ponte, José Vivó', null, 'Don Mendo, Marquess of Cabra, gallant and dashing knight of medieval Castilian, is also a virtuous mandoline player and a specialist in climbing towers. But he has a bad run, all played and all lost at seven-thirty (card game), and lost his honor playing in his latest escalation of love to the apartment of his beloved and beautiful Magdalena. Don Nuño Manso de Jarama, father of Magdalena, has pledged the hand of his daughter to the Duke of Toro, and surprises Don Mendo in the room of Magdalena. To save the honor of his beloved one, Don Mendo says that no love has led him to the Tower, but he has climbed to steal. Magdalena is clean of all suspicion, and he is condemned to die buried in the castle wall. The Marquess of Moncada and other noble gentlemen, all friends of Don Mendo, facilitate his escape.', 'Don Mendo, Marquess of Cabra, gallant and dashing knight of medieval Castilian, is also a virtuous mandoline player and a specialist in climbing towers. But he has a bad run, all played and all lost at seven-thirty (card game), and lost his honor playing in his latest escalation of love to the apartment of his beloved and beautiful Magdalena. Don Nuño Manso de Jarama, father of Magdalena, has pledged the hand of his daughter to the Duke of Toro, and surprises Don Mendo in the room of Magdalena. To save the honor of his beloved one, Don Mendo says that no love has led him to the Tower, but he has climbed to steal. Magdalena is clean of all suspicion, and he is condemned to die buried in the castle wall. The Marquess of Moncada and other noble gentlemen, all friends of Don Mendo, facilitate his escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uo3s42LpQOtrBI37aRFRGp6LGMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89310'),
  ('615242726616351817', 'La Venganza De Los Punks', 1987, 'Action, Crime', 'Damián Acosta Esparza', 'Thomas Fuentes', 'Juan Valentín, Olga Ríos, Bruno Rey, Luz María Jerez, Anaís de Melo, El Fantasma, Arturo Mason, Fidel Abrego', null, 'A Charles Bronson look-alike takes on a gaggle of punks terrorizing a small town.', 'A Charles Bronson look-alike takes on a gaggle of punks terrorizing a small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRzRsIHaip9GDFfQ9KiUwXs0Tte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118572'),
  ('654756250882006141', 'La vengeance sans visage', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Claude-Michel Rome', 'Claude-Michel Rome', 'Philippe Bas, Aurore Delplace, Anna D''Annunzio, Satya Dusaugey, Martine Chevallier, Samia Sassi, Bruno Raffaelli, Philypa Phoenix', null, 'Marie is an executive in an airport. During a rafting trip, she meets Maxime, a parachuting and wingsuit enthusiast. However, she is unaware that Maxime and his gang are looting airport cash-in-transit vehicles and planning a robbery. To ensure Marie''s silence, Sofia - leader of the gang - sabotages her parachute during an initiation. Marie falls 2,000 meters but miraculously survives. A year later, handicapped, she took refuge in her parents'' house in Gap, her hometown. Until the day Marie meets Sofia, who thinks she is dead and does not recognize her. Marie decides to take revenge by luring them into a new robbery. But Luc Ferraz, a BRI officer looking for the source of the gang''s information, is not to be trusted. Marie has the ideal profile. So Luc pretends to be an assistant to her in order to trace the robbers.', 'Marie is an executive in an airport. During a rafting trip, she meets Maxime, a parachuting and wingsuit enthusiast. However, she is unaware that Maxime and his gang are looting airport cash-in-transit vehicles and planning a robbery. To ensure Marie''s silence, Sofia - leader of the gang - sabotages her parachute during an initiation. Marie falls 2,000 meters but miraculously survives. A year later, handicapped, she took refuge in her parents'' house in Gap, her hometown. Until the day Marie meets Sofia, who thinks she is dead and does not recognize her. Marie decides to take revenge by luring them into a new robbery. But Luc Ferraz, a BRI officer looking for the source of the gang''s information, is not to be trusted. Marie has the ideal profile. So Luc pretends to be an assistant to her in order to trace the robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9B6g5hhaJJjYWPreWVryJSxNuY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006482'),
  ('122721967562713855', 'La Vénus électrique', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Pierre Salvadori, Michaël Laguens, Julien Poupard', 'Pierre Salvadori, Benoît Graffin, Benjamin Charbit', 'Pio Marmaï, Anaïs Demoustier, Gilles Lellouche, Vimala Pons, Gustave Kervern, Patrice Tépasso', null, 'Artist Antoine has lost all inspiration and slipped into alcoholism since the death of his wife Irène, a loss he blames himself for. Suzanne is a penniless sideshow performer pretending to be a clairvoyant, whom Antoine consults in a bid to connect with Irène. Antoine’s dealer Armand, desperate to keep Antoine from falling apart, urges Suzanne to keep the ruse alive. She stages a series of improvised hypnosis sessions, claiming she can channel Irène in exchange for having her debts paid by Armand.', 'Artist Antoine has lost all inspiration and slipped into alcoholism since the death of his wife Irène, a loss he blames himself for. Suzanne is a penniless sideshow performer pretending to be a clairvoyant, whom Antoine consults in a bid to connect with Irène. Antoine’s dealer Armand, desperate to keep Antoine from falling apart, urges Suzanne to keep the ruse alive. She stages a series of improvised hypnosis sessions, claiming she can channel Irène in exchange for having her debts paid by Armand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srJFksTcU1yxs7bpWgsrMcogRVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1442669'),
