  ('202443549665225878', 'La Verónica', 2022, 'Drama', 'Javiera Lucero, Leo Medel, Pedro García', 'Leo Medel', 'Mariana Di Girolamo, Patricia Rivadeneira, Ariel Mateluna, Willy Semler, Antonia Giesen, Josefina Montané, Gloria Fernández, Coco Páez', null, 'Veronica, a popular social media model married to an international soccer star, falls out of favor when she discovers she is the prime suspect in the investigation into the murder of her first daughter ten years ago. Faced with the pressure of the investigation, her marriage is on the verge of breaking up and she begins to feel jealous of Amanda, her newborn daughter.', 'Veronica, a popular social media model married to an international soccer star, falls out of favor when she discovers she is the prime suspect in the investigation into the murder of her first daughter ten years ago. Faced with the pressure of the investigation, her marriage is on the verge of breaking up and she begins to feel jealous of Amanda, her newborn daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7CgVC1v0D027YHLacGiEF9RiQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737288'),
  ('574299057421787720', 'La vida alegre', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Colomo', 'Fernando Colomo', 'Antonio Resines, Verónica Forqué, Ana Obregón, Guillermo Montesinos, Miguel Rellán, Massiel, Gloria Muñoz, José Antonio Navarro', null, 'Ana starts working as a Doctor in the S.T.I.U. (sexual transmission illnesses unit) at a Hospital. She begins meeting a lot of strange and bizarre characters there, while her jealous husband has to deal with it...', 'Ana starts working as a Doctor in the S.T.I.U. (sexual transmission illnesses unit) at a Hospital. She begins meeting a lot of strange and bizarre characters there, while her jealous husband has to deal with it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZrleT4qzhOk1MfY12THyRjhyK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163910'),
