  ('1122961616608052605', 'La vida de alguien', 2015, 'Drama, Music', 'Ezequiel Acuña', 'Ezequiel Acuña', 'Santiago Pedrero, Ailín Salas', null, 'A decade after the disappearance of his best friend and musical partner, Guille receives the offer from a label to finally release an album that never saw the light of day. His friend Pablo tries to help him overcome loss and grief, and release the album.', 'A decade after the disappearance of his best friend and musical partner, Guille receives the offer from a label to finally release an album that never saw the light of day. His friend Pablo tries to help him overcome loss and grief, and release the album.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8ZWgdJm9pYDg5qxzkf71FYMoRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354867'),
  ('1068095744643534659', 'La vida difícil de una mujer fácil', 1979, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'José María Fernández Unsáin', 'Ramón Obón, Fernando Galiana', 'Sasha Montenegro, Carlos Piñar, Sara García, Julián Bravo, Yolanda Rigel, Jorge Patiño, León Singer, Alma Ferrari', null, 'Friends, co-workers and clients reminisce about a recently-deceased sex-worker.', 'Friends, co-workers and clients reminisce about a recently-deceased sex-worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjzQZcGoaaOP56FarpTmplNZhIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375454'),
  ('342917460194275283', 'La vida en un hilo', 1945, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Valentín Martín Hernández, Edgar Neville, Enrique Barreyre', 'Edgar Neville', 'Conchita Montes, Rafael Durán, Guillermo Marín, Julia Lajos, María Bru, Alicia Romay, Eloísa Muro, Juana Mansó', null, 'After her husband''s sudden death, a young widow leaves her small town to start anew in the big city. On the train, she meets a fortune teller who will fill her in about the life she could''ve led had she never met her late husband.', 'After her husband''s sudden death, a young widow leaves her small town to start anew in the big city. On the train, she meets a fortune teller who will fill her in about the life she could''ve led had she never met her late husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmT2E5gttP8vQccflPTEcggS6Yr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256789'),
  ('238398817688965330', 'La vida mancha', 2003, 'Drama', 'Enrique Urbizu', 'Michel Gaztambide', 'Jose Coronado, Alfonso Torregrosa, Yohana Cobo, Juan Sanz, Silvia Espigado, Enrique Martínez, Cesáreo Estébanez, Paco León', null, 'Fito (Juan Sanz) is a poker addict truck driver and labor problems that his wife Juana (Zay Nuba) tries to overcome. A day will come Pedro (Jose Coronado), the brother Fito, absent from his life for 13 years.', 'Fito (Juan Sanz) is a poker addict truck driver and labor problems that his wife Juana (Zay Nuba) tries to overcome. A day will come Pedro (Jose Coronado), the brother Fito, absent from his life for 13 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJlEnxoX6PdWplaslUKYXAuaNXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115519'),
  ('847379133474145373', 'La Vida No Vale Nada', 1955, 'Drama', 'Rogelio A. González, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Luis Alcoriza, Janet Alcoriza', 'Pedro Infante, Rosario Granados, Domingo Soler, Magda Guzmán, Wolf Ruvinskis, Hortensia Santoveña, Manuel Dondé, Aurora Ruiz', null, 'Pablo, a wandering laborer, has imprisoned himself in a hell of alcoholism. Cruz, a widow, reaches out to the troubled man, but even her compassion may not be enough to save him.', 'Pablo, a wandering laborer, has imprisoned himself in a hell of alcoholism. Cruz, a widow, reaches out to the troubled man, but even her compassion may not be enough to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XmJ5TDfWJ11Pk7SxgqGYU5F6ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167520'),
  ('711167058442966632', 'La Vie de Bohème', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Gilles Charmant', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Matti Pellonpää, Evelyne Didi, André Wilms, Kari Väänänen, Christine Murillo, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Carlos Salgado, Alexis Nitzer', 'NR', 'Three penniless artists become friends in modern-day Paris: Rodolfo, an Albanian painter with no visa, Marcel, a playwright and magazine editor with no publisher, and Schaunard, a post-modernist composer of execrable noise.', 'Three penniless artists become friends in modern-day Paris: Rodolfo, an Albanian painter with no visa, Marcel, a playwright and magazine editor with no publisher, and Schaunard, a post-modernist composer of execrable noise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBd8ZCQY3uW1dDLIzXwAmHsvB5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28212'),
  ('290595759020483209', 'La Vie en miettes', 2011, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Denis Malleval, William Watterlot', 'Antoine Lacomblez', 'Frédéric van den Driessche, Christian Rauth, Marie Denarnaud, Bruno Debrandt, Audrey Fleurot, Christiane Conil, Jean-Pierre Noël', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkN8En1TxeogQbQ8RjVKCGI3pqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256908'),
  ('748630853014385301', 'La Vie en Rose', 2007, 'Music, Drama', 'Olivier Dahan, Tetsuo Nagata, Edouard Dubois', 'Isabelle Sobelman, Olivier Dahan', 'Marion Cotillard, Sylvie Testud, Pascal Greggory, Emmanuelle Seigner, Jean-Paul Rouve, Gérard Depardieu, Clotilde Courau, Jean-Pierre Martins', 'PG-13', 'From the mean streets of the Belleville district of Paris to the dazzling limelight of New York''s most famous concert halls, Edith Piaf''s life was a constant battle to sing and survive, to live and love. Raised in her grandmother''s brothel, Piaf was discovered in 1935 by nightclub owner Louis Leplee, who persuaded her to sing despite her extreme nervousness. Piaf became one of France''s immortal icons, her voice one of the indelible signatures of the 20th century.', 'From the mean streets of the Belleville district of Paris to the dazzling limelight of New York''s most famous concert halls, Edith Piaf''s life was a constant battle to sing and survive, to live and love. Raised in her grandmother''s brothel, Piaf was discovered in 1935 by nightclub owner Louis Leplee, who persuaded her to sing despite her extreme nervousness. Piaf became one of France''s immortal icons, her voice one of the indelible signatures of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3b9DAONAsFRhJKu25R33PE3VwDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1407'),
  ('682384673304999317', 'La Villa Santo-Sospir', 1952, 'Documentary', 'Jean Cocteau, Frédéric Rossif, Wladimir Ivanov', null, 'Jean Cocteau, Edouard Dermithe, Francine Weisweiller', null, 'Cocteau takes the viewer on a tour of a friend''s villa on the French coast (a major location used in Testament of Orpheus). The house itself is heavily decorated, mostly by Cocteau (and a bit by Picasso), and we are given an extensive tour of the artwork. Cocteau also shows us several dozen paintings as well. Most cover mythological themes, of course. He also proudly shows paintings by Edouard Dermithe and Jean Marais and plays around his own home in Villefranche.', 'Cocteau takes the viewer on a tour of a friend''s villa on the French coast (a major location used in Testament of Orpheus). The house itself is heavily decorated, mostly by Cocteau (and a bit by Picasso), and we are given an extensive tour of the artwork. Cocteau also shows us several dozen paintings as well. Most cover mythological themes, of course. He also proudly shows paintings by Edouard Dermithe and Jean Marais and plays around his own home in Villefranche.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUERxRDnR3Tal1XIqD1aYkmdaBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148355'),
  ('915386941998245283', 'La vita facile', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Alessandro Casale, Tiziano Russo', 'Stefano Bises, Andrea Salerno, Laura Paolucci', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Stefano Accorsi, Vittoria Puccini, Camilla Filippi, Angelo Orlando, Pietro Ragusa, Djibril Kébé, Souleymane Sow', null, 'An Italian doctor starts a new life in Kenya to escape the city, but life catches up with him when an old friend offers his assistance along with his wife, who happens to be an old lover.', 'An Italian doctor starts a new life in Kenya to escape the city, but life catches up with him when an old friend offers his assistance along with his wife, who happens to be an old lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xeQHYVxREnwjKxFF8CWUBVZwbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58518'),
  ('1048438919679365234', 'La vita possibile', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ivano De Matteo, Duccio Cimatti, Luciano Lucchi', 'Ivano De Matteo, Valentina Ferlan', 'Margherita Buy, Valeria Golino, Caterina Shulha, Andrea Pittorino, Bruno Todeschini', null, 'Anna and her son Valerio run away from a husband and a father who has destroyed the love of their family with beatings and anger. They seek refuge in Turin, with Carla, a lifelong friend, an actress and a woman who lives against the grain, who welcomes them, and with the example of her own experience, will show them the way to a just and possible rebirth.', 'Anna and her son Valerio run away from a husband and a father who has destroyed the love of their family with beatings and anger. They seek refuge in Turin, with Carla, a lifelong friend, an actress and a woman who lives against the grain, who welcomes them, and with the example of her own experience, will show them the way to a just and possible rebirth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c71XPahY3ygYsK8d6syGvv8KG2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414835'),
  ('903308701277732986', 'La voce di Fantozzi', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Mario Sesti', 'Mario Sesti, Daniele Liburdi, Massimo Mescia', 'Paolo Villaggio, Roberto Benigni, Dario Fo, Lino Banfi, Fiorello, Renzo Arbore, Maurizio Costanzo, Milena Vukotić', null, 'The docufilm tells the story of Paolo Villaggio''s genius through the most iconic Italian character, accountant Ugo Fantozzi. The work was featured in the Classics section of the 74th Venice International Film Festival.', 'The docufilm tells the story of Paolo Villaggio''s genius through the most iconic Italian character, accountant Ugo Fantozzi. The work was featured in the Classics section of the 74th Venice International Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72B8uVxPoAkibIKqrUBQG2wAxY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474209'),
  ('823250833814372669', 'La Voleuse', 1966, 'Drama', 'Jean Chapot, Jean Penzer', 'Jean Chapot, Marguerite Duras', 'Romy Schneider, Michel Piccoli, Hans Christian Blech, Sonja Schwarz, Marius Huth', null, 'Drama of an unmarried mother who regrets having had her child fostered and fights its foster parents to have it restored to her.', 'Drama of an unmarried mother who regrets having had her child fostered and fights its foster parents to have it restored to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d09RDfI5SsvMu22Sn8ukF19H0ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4371'),
  ('717343223687464735', 'La volta buona', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gianluca Laudadio, Vincenzo Marra', 'Vincenzo Marra', 'Massimo Ghini, Ramiro Garcia, Max Tortora, Francesco Montanari, Gioia Spaziani, Massimo Wertmüller, Antonio Gerardi, Alessandro Forcinelli', null, 'Bartholomeo, sports attorney, lives on gimmicks and little tricks. Over the years he has wasted the many opportunities he has had, the vice of gambling has made him lose money and family and now he spends his days in the suburbs hoping to find the new Maradona. Always looking for a stroke of luck, one day he receives a phone call: in Uruguay there is a young boy, Pablito, who is a real phenomenon…', 'Bartholomeo, sports attorney, lives on gimmicks and little tricks. Over the years he has wasted the many opportunities he has had, the vice of gambling has made him lose money and family and now he spends his days in the suburbs hoping to find the new Maradona. Always looking for a stroke of luck, one day he receives a phone call: in Uruguay there is a young boy, Pablito, who is a real phenomenon…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ti8dV6RatKJ9y2guKhVXOpHZgQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640091'),
  ('44690112323107088', 'La Vouivre', 1989, 'Drama', 'Georges Wilson', 'Georges Wilson', 'Jean Carmet, Suzanne Flon, Lambert Wilson, Jacques Dufilho, Macha Méril, Laurence Treil, François Tixier, Anne-Marie Pisani', null, 'Arsène Muselier returns to his home village at the end of the First World War. His only injury is a head wound, which sometimes provokes periods of delirium and fury. As he renews his acquaintance with the people he left behind - his mother, the old farmhand who brought him up after his father''s death, his former girlfriend, and many others - he becomes fascinated by the legend of La Vouivre, a creature with the body of a woman who lives in the marsh, surrounded by vipers. One day, Arsène sees the strange woman - she is naked, beautiful, alluring, and he is instantly enchanted by her. Can she be real, or is she merely a creation of his damaged mind...?', 'Arsène Muselier returns to his home village at the end of the First World War. His only injury is a head wound, which sometimes provokes periods of delirium and fury. As he renews his acquaintance with the people he left behind - his mother, the old farmhand who brought him up after his father''s death, his former girlfriend, and many others - he becomes fascinated by the legend of La Vouivre, a creature with the body of a woman who lives in the marsh, surrounded by vipers. One day, Arsène sees the strange woman - she is naked, beautiful, alluring, and he is instantly enchanted by her. Can she be real, or is she merely a creation of his damaged mind...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q10N0AOvm2hvajqsz9EhwlfQNMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172825'),
  ('1142595113267472741', 'La Yuma', 2009, 'Action, Drama', 'Florence Jaugey', 'Florence Jaugey', 'Alma Blanco, Rigoberto Mayorga, Gabriel Benavides, Juan Carlos García, Eliézer Traña, María Esther López, Salvador Espinoza', null, 'This is the story of Yuma a strong-willed and rebellious girl from the poor neighborhoods of Managua who dreams of being a boxer.', 'This is the story of Yuma a strong-willed and rebellious girl from the poor neighborhoods of Managua who dreams of being a boxer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR1KpfOuPoQLIfiwoPkp64aNDjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162654'),
  ('1010523658762407008', 'Là-Bas: A Criminal Education', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Francesca Amitrano, Guido Lombardi', 'Guido Lombardi', 'Kader Alassane, Esther Elisha, Moussa Mone, Billi Serigne Faye, Alassane Doulougou, Fatima Traore, Salvatore Ruocco, Marco Mario De Notaris', null, 'Castel Volturno, about thirty kilometers from Naples. It is September 18, 2008. A group of Camorra members burst into a tailor''s shop run by African immigrants. They fire a hundred bullets indiscriminately, killing six young black men and seriously wounding another. Yussouf, a young immigrant, decided that same evening to settle the score with his uncle Moses. The man who convinced him to come to Italy. He had promised him a future as an honest craftsman but instead turned him into the cynical manager of a million-dollar cocaine ring. Entangled in their story are another African boy, Germain, who happened to be at the scene of the massacre; his girlfriend Asetù, who sings a Miriam Makeba song in public that same evening; and Suad, a prostitute whom Yussouf dreams of rescuing from her pimps.', 'Castel Volturno, about thirty kilometers from Naples. It is September 18, 2008. A group of Camorra members burst into a tailor''s shop run by African immigrants. They fire a hundred bullets indiscriminately, killing six young black men and seriously wounding another. Yussouf, a young immigrant, decided that same evening to settle the score with his uncle Moses. The man who convinced him to come to Italy. He had promised him a future as an honest craftsman but instead turned him into the cynical manager of a million-dollar cocaine ring. Entangled in their story are another African boy, Germain, who happened to be at the scene of the massacre; his girlfriend Asetù, who sings a Miriam Makeba song in public that same evening; and Suad, a prostitute whom Yussouf dreams of rescuing from her pimps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUloCee16FoRBgQgCnkuFQB21UR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101843'),
  ('172121274385954545', 'Laadla', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Family', 'Raj Kanwar', null, 'Anil Kapoor, Sridevi, Raveena Tandon, Farida Jalal, Aruna Irani, Prem Chopra, Mohnish Behl, Shakti Kapoor', null, 'Laadla is the story of the kind-hearted Raju, who lives with his disabled mom. One day Raju, on his way to a job interview, saves the life of a rich textile mill owner who offers him a job in his factory. The mill is run by his ambitious daughter Sheetal, whose competitive attitude and open insults have made her many enemies. Raju and Sheetal clash often, until Sheetal tries to get the upper hand by forcing Raju to marry her, even though he has already fallen in love with Kaajal.', 'Laadla is the story of the kind-hearted Raju, who lives with his disabled mom. One day Raju, on his way to a job interview, saves the life of a rich textile mill owner who offers him a job in his factory. The mill is run by his ambitious daughter Sheetal, whose competitive attitude and open insults have made her many enemies. Raju and Sheetal clash often, until Sheetal tries to get the upper hand by forcing Raju to marry her, even though he has already fallen in love with Kaajal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19gxqTBRBYoWxypSihK0qKMphKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197483'),
  ('857886786940944417', 'Laaga Chunari Mein Daag', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pradeep Sarkar, Sushil Rajpal', 'Rekha Nigam', 'Rani Mukerji, Konkona Sen Sharma, Jaya Bachchan, Abhishek Bachchan, Anupam Kher, Kunal Kapoor, Kamini Kaushal, Hema Malini', null, 'Badki and Chutki live a fun-filled life in Banaras, playing pranks, sneaking off to see a forbidden mujra, and soaking up all the excitement that goes on the ghats of the Ganga. Badki is aware that the family is in dire straits, but she and her mother protect Chutki at all costs. When things get worse, Badki decides to go to Mumbai and seek a living for the family.', 'Badki and Chutki live a fun-filled life in Banaras, playing pranks, sneaking off to see a forbidden mujra, and soaking up all the excitement that goes on the ghats of the Ganga. Badki is aware that the family is in dire straits, but she and her mother protect Chutki at all costs. When things get worse, Badki decides to go to Mumbai and seek a living for the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCyy2tQ14OmzYN7byobslSEOZz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25638'),
  ('909643958076329393', 'Laagni No Melo', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Rajan Verma, Shailesh Prajapati, Vinod Patil', 'Ashok Upadhyaya', 'Aarjav Trivedi, Rutvi Patel, Sanjay Galsar, Katha Patel, Hemang Shah', null, 'Shubh and Shraddha''s college romance blossoms into marriage, but financial struggles and emotional challenges test whether their love can withstand life''s trials.', 'Shubh and Shraddha''s college romance blossoms into marriage, but financial struggles and emotional challenges test whether their love can withstand life''s trials.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:laagni-no-melo-2026'),
  ('491591273530076253', 'Laal Kaptaan', 2019, 'Drama, Action', 'Navdeep Singh, Dipankar Gupta, Irfan Rashid Sheikh', 'Abdul Rafay Chandio Baloch', 'Saif Ali Khan, Deepak Dobriyal, Zoya Hussain, Manav Vij, Aamir Bashir, Neeraj Kabi, Simone Singh, Madan Deodhar', null, 'In 18th century India, a Naga Sadhu sets out on a journey across Bundelkhand to seek revenge for an injustice committed in the past.', 'In 18th century India, a Naga Sadhu sets out on a journey across Bundelkhand to seek revenge for an injustice committed in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aksVuRiiu9BMetv9f65YjRHucaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621003'),
  ('746809860109766567', 'Laal Rang', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Syed Ahmad Afzal', null, 'Randeep Hooda, Pia Bajpiee, Rajneesh Duggal, Meenakshi Dixit, Akshay Oberoi, Ashutosh Kaushik, Rajendra Sethi', null, 'The lives and friendship of two men involved in blood theft and trading are affected by greed, girlfriends, cops and an unexpected death.', 'The lives and friendship of two men involved in blood theft and trading are affected by greed, girlfriends, cops and an unexpected death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5koaZYQ0s63c7wlX6k75qS9QCpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393423'),
  ('993869258091233115', 'Laal Singh Chaddha', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Satyajit Pande, Mukesh Chhabra, Parvez Shaikh', 'Eric Roth, Atul Kulkarni', 'Aamir Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Naga Chaitanya Akkineni, Mona Singh, Manav Vij, Kamini Kaushal, Ahmad Ibn Umar, Hafsa Ashraf', 'PG-13', 'Events in India''s history — from the Emergency and the famous Cricket World Cup win to the Punjab riots , unfold from the perspective of an innocent Sikh man Laal Singh Chaddha, a person with a low IQ but high optimism. Laal is able to achieve everything under the sun but his childhood love continues to elude him.', 'Events in India''s history — from the Emergency and the famous Cricket World Cup win to the Punjab riots , unfold from the perspective of an innocent Sikh man Laal Singh Chaddha, a person with a low IQ but high optimism. Laal is able to achieve everything under the sun but his childhood love continues to elude him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5rNmcznZX0UPm8CGjfk7kHcAbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601635'),
  ('1070612661719577148', 'Laawaris', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Prakash Mehra', 'Prakash Mehra', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Zeenat Aman, Amjad Khan, Rakhee Gulzar, Ranjeet Bedi, Bindu Desai, Shreeram Lagoo, Suresh Oberoi', null, 'Left in the care of an alcoholic Gangu Ganpat, young Heera, who named himself after a stray dog, wrestles with life in his young age. Years later, now a young man , he works for Mahendar Singh and is in love with Mohini, who will not have anything to do with him due to his lack of ancestry. Heera is now determined to find out who his parents are, and the only one who can help him is the elusive, alcohol-induced and incoherent Gangu Ganpat.', 'Left in the care of an alcoholic Gangu Ganpat, young Heera, who named himself after a stray dog, wrestles with life in his young age. Years later, now a young man , he works for Mahendar Singh and is in love with Mohini, who will not have anything to do with him due to his lack of ancestry. Heera is now determined to find out who his parents are, and the only one who can help him is the elusive, alcohol-induced and incoherent Gangu Ganpat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXe5nIyi5hJhSvjb7CVLVl3KL4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71301'),
  ('388462476299849804', 'Label Me', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kai Kreuser, Malte Hafner', 'Kai Kreuser', 'Renato Schuch, Nikolaus Benda, Jogi Kaiser, Georg Paluza, Timur Ülker, Cem Aydin, Gioele Viola', null, 'Sex is power, and Waseem, a Syrian gay-for-pay hustler seeking asylum in Cologne, wields it like a shield. Keeping his johns at an emotional arm’s length while satisfying their most carnal desires in order to eke out a living, he meets his match in Lars: a kind, affluent professional with a growing personal interest in Waseem. This gripping tale of transactional identity explores the tactical exchange of trust and intimacy in a partnership, and the divisions between immigrants and their host countries in contemporary Europe.', 'Sex is power, and Waseem, a Syrian gay-for-pay hustler seeking asylum in Cologne, wields it like a shield. Keeping his johns at an emotional arm’s length while satisfying their most carnal desires in order to eke out a living, he meets his match in Lars: a kind, affluent professional with a growing personal interest in Waseem. This gripping tale of transactional identity explores the tactical exchange of trust and intimacy in a partnership, and the divisions between immigrants and their host countries in contemporary Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60ujqiAv0d6Sah9Ys3RmEYlQFCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612429'),
  ('1062926283801816186', 'Labor Day', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Jason Reitman, Eric Steelberg, Paul B. Uddo', 'Jason Reitman', 'Kate Winslet, Josh Brolin, Gattlin Griffith, Tobey Maguire, Tom Lipinski, Maika Monroe, Clark Gregg, James Van Der Beek', 'PG-13', 'Two strangers are drawn together under incredible circumstances. What starts as an unforeseen encounter over a long holiday weekend soon becomes a second chance love story.', 'Two strangers are drawn together under incredible circumstances. What starts as an unforeseen encounter over a long holiday weekend soon becomes a second chance love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQdbCtk1Q3TdZRBKSLU1Vh870l7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130150'),
  ('166235732287229275', 'Labor Day', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Julien Rambaldi, Sébastien Deux', 'Thomas Perrier, Julien Rambaldi', 'Josiane Balasko, Léa Drucker, Alice Pol, Julia Piaton, Florence Loiret Caille, Sarah Stern, Fadily Camara, David Marsais', null, 'Five women are about to give birth. They do not know each other, are not alike, but will find themselves in the same maternity to live the best day of their lives. The first contractions at birth, the film traces their journey, between laughter and tears.', 'Five women are about to give birth. They do not know each other, are not alike, but will find themselves in the same maternity to live the best day of their lives. The first contractions at birth, the film traces their journey, between laughter and tears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie96hFRmdWEqiSSegaT3K48yMzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554375'),
  ('1099269264319155450', 'Labor Pains', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Lara Shapiro, Dan Stoloff', 'Stacey Kramer, Lara Shapiro', 'Lindsay Lohan, Luke Kirby, Chris Parnell, Aaron Yoo, Bridgit Mendler, Tracee Ellis Ross, Kevin Covais, Bonnie Somerville', 'PG-13', 'A young woman pretends to be pregnant in order to avoid being fired from her job. When that gets her a bunch of special treatment by everyone involved in her life, she tries to keep up the lie for nine months.', 'A young woman pretends to be pregnant in order to avoid being fired from her job. When that gets her a bunch of special treatment by everyone involved in her life, she tries to keep up the lie for nine months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIjFpM6pPaGAXSaf2rhvxdj9uhV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19794'),
  ('899156261646371124', 'Labyrinth', 1963, 'Animation', 'Jan Lenica, Wactaw Krukowski, Antoni Nurzyński', 'Jan Lenica', null, null, 'A self-consciously Kafkaesque tale of a winged lonely man literally devoured by totalitarian rule.', 'A self-consciously Kafkaesque tale of a winged lonely man literally devoured by totalitarian rule.', null, 'tmdb:movie:148661'),
  ('594479744595497705', 'Labyrinth', 1986, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Jim Henson, Alex Thomson, Jane Jenkins', 'Terry Jones', 'David Bowie, Jennifer Connelly, Toby Froud, Shelley Thompson, Christopher Malcolm, Brian Henson, David Shaughnessy, Ron Mueck', 'PG', 'Frustrated with babysitting on yet another weekend night, Sarah, a teenager with an active imagination, summons the Goblins to take her baby stepbrother away. When little Toby actually disappears, Sarah must follow him into a fantastical world to rescue him from the Goblin King. Guarding his castle is the labyrinth itself, a twisted maze of deception, populated with outrageous characters and unknown dangers.', 'Frustrated with babysitting on yet another weekend night, Sarah, a teenager with an active imagination, summons the Goblins to take her baby stepbrother away. When little Toby actually disappears, Sarah must follow him into a fantastical world to rescue him from the Goblin King. Guarding his castle is the labyrinth itself, a twisted maze of deception, populated with outrageous characters and unknown dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbSdA1DmNA9IlfVoqJkIWYF2oYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13597'),
  ('764118644763052185', 'Labyrinth', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'René Manzor', 'René Manzor', 'Lambert Wilson, Sylvie Testud, Frédéric Diefenthal, Michel Duchaussoy, Édouard Montoute, Tomer Sisley, Jean-Henri Compère, Valérie Lemaître', null, 'Psychologist Dr. Brennac is asked by a colleague to help with the case of Claude, a patient on trial for multiple murders. Is Claude really guilty of the crimes, or is he a victim of his own mind?', 'Psychologist Dr. Brennac is asked by a colleague to help with the case of Claude, a patient on trial for multiple murders. Is Claude really guilty of the crimes, or is he a victim of his own mind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7fD9Ls1qSBLWOpLgcbrM8R0jqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22578'),
  ('747339040244186281', 'Labyrinth', 2011, 'Drama, Action', 'Tolga Örnek', null, 'Timuçin Esen, Meltem Cumbul, Sarp Akkaya, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Aslihan Gurbuz, Umut Kurt, Melike Güner, Altan Gördüm', null, 'A massive explosion rips though a busy street in Istanbul, Turkey. 95 people are dead; 30 Americans and 5 British. The massacre sends shock waves from Turkey to London and Washington, DC. A new terrorist organization is behind the attack. The explosion is just the beginning. Labyrinth'' is the code name of the operation conducted by Turkish intelligence to stop a second, more devastating attack that will plunge Turkey, the only democratic Muslim country in the region, into chaos and destroy the fragile balance of the Middle East. After the initial attack, Turkey becomes a battlefront for terrorists and Turkish, British and American intelligence officers. Everyone has his own agenda in the fight that stretches from Istanbul to Eastern Turkey and from Frankfurt to Northern Iraq.', 'A massive explosion rips though a busy street in Istanbul, Turkey. 95 people are dead; 30 Americans and 5 British. The massacre sends shock waves from Turkey to London and Washington, DC. A new terrorist organization is behind the attack. The explosion is just the beginning. Labyrinth'' is the code name of the operation conducted by Turkish intelligence to stop a second, more devastating attack that will plunge Turkey, the only democratic Muslim country in the region, into chaos and destroy the fragile balance of the Middle East. After the initial attack, Turkey becomes a battlefront for terrorists and Turkish, British and American intelligence officers. Everyone has his own agenda in the fight that stretches from Istanbul to Eastern Turkey and from Frankfurt to Northern Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzvw5Z7NvUDHaJBt4AHMMubB2R3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83103'),
  ('574138322843348911', 'Labyrinth', 2026, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Shoji Kawamori, Shouko Hayashi, Fumiyuki Go, Takuya Chanohara', 'Taichi Hashimoto', 'SUZUKA, Taizo Harada, Aoi Ito, Jun Saito, Takuto Teranishi', null, 'High schooler Shiori''s dream of online stardom turns into a mission to save the world from brainrot after an embarrassing video of her goes viral and she''s trapped in her smartphone by a nefarious alter ego.', 'High schooler Shiori''s dream of online stardom turns into a mission to save the world from brainrot after an embarrassing video of her goes viral and she''s trapped in her smartphone by a nefarious alter ego.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzGnogzGnp327yGj8FNloIiTLCX3.jpg', 'plex:movie:labyrinth-2026'),
  ('989181400039106383', 'Labyrinth of Cinema', 2020, 'History, Fantasy, War', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Kujô Sanbongi', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Tadashi Naitô, Kazuya Konaka', 'Takuro Atsuki, Takahito Hosoyamada, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Rei Yoshida, Riko Narumi, Hirona Yamazaki, Tetsuya Takeda, Takako Tokiwa', null, 'When lightning strikes a theater about to close its doors, three moviegoers are thrust back in time to the world inside the screen.', 'When lightning strikes a theater about to close its doors, three moviegoers are thrust back in time to the world inside the screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WZ19cH1sKO5uQ2lopM5oBdN4Zf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616538'),
  ('1051487426152857739', 'Labyrinth of Dreams', 1997, 'Mystery, Romance, Drama', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Norimichi Kasamatsu, Yoshimasa Fujie', 'Gakuryu Ishii', 'Tadanobu Asano, Rena Komine, Kotomi Kyono, Tomoka Kurotani, Kirina Mano, Reiko Matsuo, Kyūsaku Shimada, Takeshi Ikeda', null, 'Tomiko falls in love with Niitaka, even though she also suspects him of being the Tokyo bus driver serial killer, who killed his female conductors after tiring of them.', 'Tomiko falls in love with Niitaka, even though she also suspects him of being the Tokyo bus driver serial killer, who killed his female conductors after tiring of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49h5yFfzIn1m1ZU0buaCFdDMNcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76760'),
  ('672646435508056236', 'Labyrinth of Lies', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'Giulio Ricciarelli, Roman Osin, Martin Langer', 'Elisabeth Bartel, Giulio Ricciarelli', 'Alexander Fehling, André Szymanski, Friederike Becht, Johann von Bülow, Hansi Jochmann, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Gert Voss, Johannes Krisch', 'R', 'A young prosecutor in postwar West Germany investigates a massive conspiracy to cover up the Nazi pasts of prominent public figures.', 'A young prosecutor in postwar West Germany investigates a massive conspiracy to cover up the Nazi pasts of prominent public figures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCnzlBatc1Rsciny0tRwxb9dnwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287495'),
