  ('171319692083077573', 'Ladies in Black', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Bradshaw, Jane Griffin, Bruce Beresford', 'Sue Milliken, Bruce Beresford', 'Rachael Taylor, Julia Ormond, Angourie Rice, Ryan Corr, Nicholas Hammond, Vincent Perez, Shane Jacobson, Susie Porter', null, 'Adapted from the bestselling novel by Madeleine St John, Ladies in Black is an alluring and tender-hearted comedy drama about the lives of a group of department store employees in 1959 Sydney.', 'Adapted from the bestselling novel by Madeleine St John, Ladies in Black is an alluring and tender-hearted comedy drama about the lives of a group of department store employees in 1959 Sydney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIC0Y0dGLnxbdCksftZ38FZ2c61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483411'),
  ('729878397187900579', 'Ladies in Lavender', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Biziou, Charles Dance, Paul Cowan', 'Charles Dance', 'Judi Dench, Maggie Smith, Daniel Brühl, Freddie Jones, Natascha McElhone, Miriam Margolyes, David Warner, Clive Russell', 'PG-13', 'Andrea, a gifted young Polish violinist from Krakow, is bound for America when he is swept overboard by a storm. When the Widdington sisters discover the handsome stranger on the beach below their house, they nurse him back to health. However, the presence of the musically talented young man disrupts the peaceful lives of Ursula and Janet and the community in which they live.', 'Andrea, a gifted young Polish violinist from Krakow, is bound for America when he is swept overboard by a storm. When the Widdington sisters discover the handsome stranger on the beach below their house, they nurse him back to health. However, the presence of the musically talented young man disrupts the peaceful lives of Ursula and Janet and the community in which they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wm3wG0qf1qhUj0xtgI0BarQpmbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9528'),
  ('971066476796655452', 'Ladies in Retirement', 1941, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Vidor, Morris Stoloff, George Rhein', 'Reginald Denham, Garrett Fort', 'Ida Lupino, Louis Hayward, Evelyn Keyes, Elsa Lanchester, Edith Barrett, Isobel Elsom, Emma Dunn, Queenie Leonard', null, 'Ellen Creed is a housekeeper who looks after Leonora Fiske, a retired actress living in the English countryside. When Ellen''s eccentric sisters visit their sibling at Leonora''s home, tensions soon lead to murder.', 'Ellen Creed is a housekeeper who looks after Leonora Fiske, a retired actress living in the English countryside. When Ellen''s eccentric sisters visit their sibling at Leonora''s home, tensions soon lead to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KULYDhSbuvDdYVMT08mouLLm4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42066'),
  ('207432573559157443', 'Ladies Mafia', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Óscar González Iñiguez, Eugenio Cañas', 'Óscar González Iñiguez', 'Harold Torres, Gerardo Taracena, Ariel Galván, Mario Zaragoza, Joss Waleska, Nuria Gil, Adriana López, Melina Robert', null, 'Tori, a beautiful young woman, accidentally ends up with a criminal''s merchandise and is accused of the death of a member of a Colombian cartel: “El Jefe.” Desperate Tori asks for help from her friends Camila and Priz. The three decide to sell the product to a well-known local cartel to solve their problems and request the help of "Shakira", a hitwoman who knows the market, but they do not know that the buyer with whom they are doing business is the original owner of the merchandise.', 'Tori, a beautiful young woman, accidentally ends up with a criminal''s merchandise and is accused of the death of a member of a Colombian cartel: “El Jefe.” Desperate Tori asks for help from her friends Camila and Priz. The three decide to sell the product to a well-known local cartel to solve their problems and request the help of "Shakira", a hitwoman who knows the market, but they do not know that the buyer with whom they are doing business is the original owner of the merchandise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tpzTmqiQKLmgFa6tElutFKg705.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109932'),
  ('538899901656051149', 'Ladies of Leisure', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker, David Selman', 'Jo Swerling', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Lowell Sherman, Ralph Graves, Marie Prevost, Nance O''Neil, George Fawcett, Juliette Compton, Johnnie Walker', null, 'Kay Arnold is a gold digger who wanders from party to party with the intention of catching a rich suitor. Jerry Strong is a young man from a wealthy family who strives to succeed as an artist. What begins as a relationship of mutual convenience soon turns into something else.', 'Kay Arnold is a gold digger who wanders from party to party with the intention of catching a rich suitor. Jerry Strong is a young man from a wealthy family who strives to succeed as an artist. What begins as a relationship of mutual convenience soon turns into something else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71LYZn15hORP7MKE1jZAEb37ZSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122047'),
  ('253176021254927924', 'Ladies of the Chorus', 1948, 'Music, Romance', 'Phil Karlson, Frank Redman, Carter DeHaven', 'Joseph Carole, Harry Sauber', 'Adele Jergens, Marilyn Monroe, Rand Brooks, Nana Bryant, Eddie Garr, Steven Geray, Dave Barry, Marjorie Hoshelle', null, 'Former burlesque star May and her daughter Peggy dance in the chorus. When May has a fight with featured dancer Bubbles, Bubbles leaves the show and Peggy takes her place. When Peggy falls in love with wealthy Randy, May fears class differences may lead to misery.', 'Former burlesque star May and her daughter Peggy dance in the chorus. When May has a fight with featured dancer Bubbles, Bubbles leaves the show and Peggy takes her place. When Peggy falls in love with wealthy Randy, May fears class differences may lead to misery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6BT1TpxHPlhZlGn7dC09JnYdsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39949'),
