  ('469612389295035953', 'Lady', 2026, 'Drama', 'Olive Nwosu, Alana Mejía González', 'Olive Nwosu', 'Jessica Gabriel''s Ujah, Amanda Oruh, Tinuade Jemiseye, Binta Ayo Mogaji, Seun Kuti', null, 'In the sprawling African metropolis of Lagos, a fiercely independent young cab driver meets a band of radiantly reckless sex workers whose sisterhood pulls her into danger and joy, setting her on a journey toward her own transformation.', 'In the sprawling African metropolis of Lagos, a fiercely independent young cab driver meets a band of radiantly reckless sex workers whose sisterhood pulls her into danger and joy, setting her on a journey toward her own transformation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F92EauLx5f1cKVSzhS6A5WBLRxfj.jpg', 'plex:movie:lady-2026'),
  ('401728553656202023', 'Lady and the Lamp', 1979, 'Animation', 'John Lasseter', 'John Lasseter', 'Jack Hannah, Nancy Beiman', 'NR', 'A lamp causes a ruckus in the shop while the shopkeeper is away.', 'A lamp causes a ruckus in the shop while the shopkeeper is away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h12S7IgSTfd0VLykuu9wwlsMROM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208670'),
  ('673475473810784139', 'Lady and the Tramp', 1955, 'Animation, Family, Romance, Adventure, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Wilfred Jackson, Hamilton Luske', null, 'Barbara Luddy, Larry Roberts, Peggy Lee, Bill Thompson, Bill Baucom, Stan Freberg, Verna Felton, Alan Reed', 'G', 'Lady, a golden cocker spaniel, meets up with a mongrel dog who calls himself the Tramp. He is obviously from the wrong side of town, but happenings at Lady''s home make her decide to travel with him for a while.', 'Lady, a golden cocker spaniel, meets up with a mongrel dog who calls himself the Tramp. He is obviously from the wrong side of town, but happenings at Lady''s home make her decide to travel with him for a while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/340NcWz9SQXWQyf4oicMxjbrLOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10340'),
  ('1017912464092981979', 'Lady and the Tramp', 2019, 'Family, Romance, Comedy', 'Jody Spilkoman, Charlie Bean, Enrique Chediak', 'Kari Granlund, Andrew Bujalski', 'Tessa Thompson, Justin Theroux, Kiersey Clemons, Thomas Mann, Ashley Jensen, Benedict Wong, Janelle Monáe, Yvette Nicole Brown', 'PG', 'The love story between a pampered Cocker Spaniel named Lady and a streetwise mongrel named Tramp. Lady finds herself out on the street after her owners have a baby and is saved from a pack by Tramp, who tries to show her to live her life footloose and collar-free.', 'The love story between a pampered Cocker Spaniel named Lady and a streetwise mongrel named Tramp. Lady finds herself out on the street after her owners have a baby and is saved from a pack by Tramp, who tries to show her to live her life footloose and collar-free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512895'),
  ('645274034027480288', 'Lady and the Tramp II: Scamp''s Adventure', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Romance, Adventure', 'Darrell Rooney, Jeannine Roussel, Steve Trenbirth', 'Bob Roth, Bill Motz', 'Scott Wolf, Alyssa Milano, Chazz Palminteri, Jeff Bennett, Jodi Benson, Bill Fagerbakke, Mickey Rooney, Bronson Pinchot', 'G', 'Lady and Tramp''s mischievous pup, Scamp, gets fed up with rules and restrictions imposed on him by life in a family, and longs for a wild and free lifestyle. He runs away from home and into the streets where he joins a pack of stray dogs known as the "Junkyard Dogs." Buster, the pack''s leader, takes an instant disliking to the "house-dog" and considers him a rival. Angel, a junkyard pup Scamp''s age, longs for the safety and comfort of life in a family and the two become instant companions. Will Scamp choose the wild and free life of a stray or the unconditional love of his family?', 'Lady and Tramp''s mischievous pup, Scamp, gets fed up with rules and restrictions imposed on him by life in a family, and longs for a wild and free lifestyle. He runs away from home and into the streets where he joins a pack of stray dogs known as the "Junkyard Dogs." Buster, the pack''s leader, takes an instant disliking to the "house-dog" and considers him a rival. Angel, a junkyard pup Scamp''s age, longs for the safety and comfort of life in a family and the two become instant companions. Will Scamp choose the wild and free life of a stray or the unconditional love of his family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS3nhUZUSY8dWEsRmKILfiOC3F0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18269'),
  ('317515135455550242', 'Lady Ballers', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Boreing, Kristopher S. Kimlin', 'Jeremy Boreing, Brian A. Hoffman, Nick Sheehan', 'Jeremy Boreing, Billie Rae Brandt, Daniel Considine, Tyler Fischer, Jake Crain, Blain Crain, David Cone, Lexie Contursi', 'NR', 'A once-great basketball coach is on a journey back to victory by reuniting his former high school championship basketball team, but this time, he’s challenging them to play like girls.', 'A once-great basketball coach is on a journey back to victory by reuniting his former high school championship basketball team, but this time, he’s challenging them to play like girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mud8Gr8s7RxNPDQOK7OSFxglyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210646'),
  ('773984423364130065', 'Lady Be Good', 1941, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Oliver T. Marsh, George J. Folsey, Douglas Shearer', 'Kay Van Riper, John McClain, Jack McGowan', 'Eleanor Powell, Ann Sothern, Robert Young, Lionel Barrymore, John Carroll, Red Skelton, Virginia O''Brien, Tom Conway', 'NR', 'Married songwriters almost split up while putting on a big show.', 'Married songwriters almost split up while putting on a big show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSWzGKpEexa1Q6RsRozXfdshHaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43792'),
  ('126969204555099669', 'Lady Beware', 1987, 'Romance, Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Karen Arthur, Tom Neuwirth', 'Charles Zev Cohen, Susan Miller', 'Diane Lane, Michael Woods, Cotter Smith, Tyra Ferrell, Peter Nevargic, Edward Penn, Chelsea Benedict, Don Brockett', 'R', 'A department store window dresser starts being stalked by a married man who’s obsessed with her.', 'A department store window dresser starts being stalked by a married man who’s obsessed with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGtqzTXz7rSrQtg5fQblz3G9UQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85154'),
  ('1060551182792492054', 'Lady Bird', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sam Levy, Brendan Lee, David Feeney-Mosier', 'Greta Gerwig', 'Saoirse Ronan, Laurie Metcalf, Tracy Letts, Lucas Hedges, Timothée Chalamet, Beanie Feldstein, Lois Smith, Stephen McKinley Henderson', 'R', 'Lady Bird McPherson, a strong willed, deeply opinionated, artistic 17 year old comes of age in Sacramento. Her relationship with her mother and her upbringing are questioned and tested as she plans to head off to college.', 'Lady Bird McPherson, a strong willed, deeply opinionated, artistic 17 year old comes of age in Sacramento. Her relationship with her mother and her upbringing are questioned and tested as she plans to head off to college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl66K7zRdtNYGrxyS2YDUP5ASZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391713'),
  ('46620893013357073', 'Lady Bloodfight', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michel Abramowicz, Chris Nahon', 'Bey Logan, Judd Bloch', 'Amy Johnston, Muriel Hofmann, Kathy Wu, Jenny Wu, Jet Tranter, Mayling Ng, Sunny Coelst, Rosemary Vandebrouck', 'R', 'Jane is a beautiful but troubled American girl backpacking through Japan, when her raw street fighting skills draw the attention of Oshima, Japanese karate champion, who recruits and trains her to fight in the vicious, all-female, underground martial arts tournament known as "The Kumite". After months of rigorous preparation, Jane is ready to face off against the deadliest female fighters in the world, including Ling, the Chinese apprentice of Oshima''s nemesis. But other nefarious forces lie in the shadows, and Jane and Ling will have to unite on a journey that will take them from the gritty underworld of Hong Kong to the glitz of Macao, before deciding who really is the best female fighter on the planet.', 'Jane is a beautiful but troubled American girl backpacking through Japan, when her raw street fighting skills draw the attention of Oshima, Japanese karate champion, who recruits and trains her to fight in the vicious, all-female, underground martial arts tournament known as "The Kumite". After months of rigorous preparation, Jane is ready to face off against the deadliest female fighters in the world, including Ling, the Chinese apprentice of Oshima''s nemesis. But other nefarious forces lie in the shadows, and Jane and Ling will have to unite on a journey that will take them from the gritty underworld of Hong Kong to the glitz of Macao, before deciding who really is the best female fighter on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDZzETrYegrB6pYpHKKzdwux6Km.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289269'),
  ('504827400917824266', 'Lady Caliph', 1970, 'Drama', 'Roberto Gerardi, Alberto Bevilacqua', 'Alberto Bevilacqua', 'Romy Schneider, Ugo Tognazzi, Marina Berti, Massimo Farinelli, Roberto Bisacco, Guido Alberti, Gigi Ballista, Massimo Serato', null, 'La Califfa''s husband was killed during the strikes so she takes the side of the strikers. Her conflict with the plant owner Doverdo gradually turns into a love relationship.', 'La Califfa''s husband was killed during the strikes so she takes the side of the strikers. Her conflict with the plant owner Doverdo gradually turns into a love relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gSM7ZGBLW5RuuQucRyVJNHCztc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3422'),
