  ('841853486038145866', 'Lady Chatterley', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pascale Ferran, Julien Hirsch', 'Pascale Ferran, Roger Bohbot', 'Marina Hands, Jean-Louis Coulloc''h, Hippolyte Girardot, Hélène Alexandridis, Hélène Fillières, Bernard Verley, Sava Lolov, Jean-Baptiste Montagut', 'R', 'After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband''s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.', 'After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband''s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1Rk4mtHrai2harr7MM5Vn9mfwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3542'),
