  ('790257158899445510', 'Lady Chatterley''s Lover', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jed Mercurio', 'Jed Mercurio', 'Richard Madden, Holliday Grainger, James Norton, Howard Ward, Elizabeth Rider, Tony Pritchard, Jodie Comer, Enzo Cilenti', null, 'An early-20th-century tale of love across class boundaries which tells the legendary and romantic story of Lady Chatterley’s affair with her gamekeeper. Jed Mercurio’s adaptation of DH Lawrence’s classic.', 'An early-20th-century tale of love across class boundaries which tells the legendary and romantic story of Lady Chatterley’s affair with her gamekeeper. Jed Mercurio’s adaptation of DH Lawrence’s classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RwYNmcMfsTmOtnNm5PC6LNuy0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354743'),
