  ('208967155888372366', 'Lady Cocoa', 1975, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Matt Cimber, Ken Gibb', 'Mikel Angel', 'Lola Falana, Gene Washington, Alex Dreier, Millie Perkins, Joe Greene, James A. Watson, Jr, Matt Cimber, James R. Sweeney', 'R', 'After being given a 24-hour leave from prison, in exchange for which she’ll agree to testify against her mobster boyfriend, Cocoa hits the streets, but quickly discovers that violence lurks around every corner.', 'After being given a 24-hour leave from prison, in exchange for which she’ll agree to testify against her mobster boyfriend, Cocoa hits the streets, but quickly discovers that violence lurks around every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eDDiefdnn0wJs4OtL7wqTiKSgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91259'),
  ('1003849301291993835', 'Lady Cops', 1987, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Josiane Balasko, Dominique Chapuis', 'Josiane Balasko', 'Josiane Balasko, Isaach de Bankolé, Ticky Holgado, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Florent Pagny, Jean-François Perrier, Didier Pain, Catherine Hiegel', null, 'Mireille Molyneux, police inspector, tracks down pimps. With the complicity of Yasmina, a prostitute, she arrested Charlie, her pimp. To take revenge on Mireille, Jean-Pierre, another pimp, accuses him of corruption. It was then the subject of an investigation by two IGS inspectors: Blondel and Lacroix. Soon after, Charlie was released for lack of evidence. To keep Yasmina, he kidnaps his son and threatens to kill him.', 'Mireille Molyneux, police inspector, tracks down pimps. With the complicity of Yasmina, a prostitute, she arrested Charlie, her pimp. To take revenge on Mireille, Jean-Pierre, another pimp, accuses him of corruption. It was then the subject of an investigation by two IGS inspectors: Blondel and Lacroix. Soon after, Charlie was released for lack of evidence. To keep Yasmina, he kidnaps his son and threatens to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xznVG5hzFIUX4hwaHai5Yfg61e4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120910'),
  ('723737261904965943', 'Lady Daddy', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Jae-hoon, Lee Kwang-jae, Oh Seung-Hwan', 'Chun Sung-il', 'Lee Na-young, Lee Pil-mo, Jung Ae-yeun, Kim Ji-seok, Kim Hee-soo, Kim Eung-soo, Won Jong Rye, Kim Hie-won', null, 'Ji-hyeon is enjoying her life after a female sex-change operation. One day a boy knocks on her door claiming that she is his father. Her attempts to act like an ordinary father conflicts with her life as a woman.', 'Ji-hyeon is enjoying her life after a female sex-change operation. One day a boy knocks on her door claiming that she is his father. Her attempts to act like an ordinary father conflicts with her life as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqcL2a2aaNPdiNZ2jnHXICsU6Fn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44849'),
  ('850921213029983629', 'Lady Death', 2004, 'Fantasy, Animation, Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Andy Orjuela', 'Carl Macek', 'Christine McPeters Auten, Mike Kleinhenz, Andy McAvin, Rob Mungle, Mike MacRae, Chris Patton', 'NR', 'When accused by the townspeople of being in league with the Devil, Hope finds herself in a satanic deal for her life. After refusing the terms of the deal, she transforms into the powerful Lady Death and vows to wrest control of hell from her father.', 'When accused by the townspeople of being in league with the Devil, Hope finds herself in a satanic deal for her life. After refusing the terms of the deal, she transforms into the powerful Lady Death and vows to wrest control of hell from her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVK9NOhb2jhkVqzTOjjnrQ3BUxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16226'),
  ('1108089361622208072', 'Lady Dragon', 1992, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'David Worth, David Worth, Ackyl Anwari', 'Clifford Mohr', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Richard Norton, Robert Ginty, Bella Esperance, Hengky Tornando, Thomas Forcher, Piet Burnama, Advent Bangun', 'R', 'An ex-CIA agent living in Indonesia tracks the arms dealer who killed her husband. Along the way, she meets a young boy and his grandfather, who teach her in the ways of the Lady Dragon.', 'An ex-CIA agent living in Indonesia tracks the arms dealer who killed her husband. Along the way, she meets a young boy and his grandfather, who teach her in the ways of the Lady Dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znBk8IhKmIhrdHNiXhgJ7Aeuwhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80343'),
  ('240191322400823643', 'Lady Driver', 2020, 'Drama', 'Reuben Steinberg, Shaun Paul Piccinino', 'John Ducey', 'Grace Van Dien, Sean Patrick Flanery, Christina Moore, Casper Van Dien, Amanda Detmer, John Ducey, Matthew Joel Kranyak, David Gridley', 'PG', 'When a rebellious teen embarks on a solo summer journey to connect with her roots, she finds herself in a new world, geared up for the ride of her life, and discovers she had the drive in her all along.', 'When a rebellious teen embarks on a solo summer journey to connect with her roots, she finds herself in a new world, geared up for the ride of her life, and discovers she had the drive in her all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/co6rMdGpL8q549uf6GAqzOFQA94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591629'),
  ('317241304899023142', 'Lady Emanuelle', 1989, 'Drama', 'Pasquale Fanetti, Pasquale Fanetti', 'Pasquale Fanetti', 'Malù, Micaela, Gianni Macchia, Antonio Zequila, José Dingeo', null, 'Unhappily married rich lady Emanuelle is fed up with her sleazy, disgusting and overbearing lout husband Michael and other men insensitively treating her like a piece of meat. So Emanuelle dumps Michael and gets involved in a torrid lesbian affair with enticing novelist Leona.', 'Unhappily married rich lady Emanuelle is fed up with her sleazy, disgusting and overbearing lout husband Michael and other men insensitively treating her like a piece of meat. So Emanuelle dumps Michael and gets involved in a torrid lesbian affair with enticing novelist Leona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikKkbJ7fgG3FeSeKaulHfBxJ7ST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351164'),
  ('507799297750396007', 'Lady Football', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Nando Cicero, Federico Zanni, Amanzio Todini', 'Francesco Milizia, Nando Cicero', 'Alvaro Vitali, Carmen Russo, Mario Carotenuto, Franca Valeri, Cristiano Censi, Bobby Rhodes, Tiberio Murgia, Gian Carlo Fusco', null, 'It is the story of the brilliant football player Cotechiño, hired by the Napoli team as a centre-forward. Too bad that his professional career will be strongly influenced by the frequent absence of his fiancée, for which he feels an inexplicable, almost obsessive jealousy. That''s why he hires a plumber very similar to him to keep an eye on his beloved, but that won''t be enough when Cotechiño is kidnapped.', 'It is the story of the brilliant football player Cotechiño, hired by the Napoli team as a centre-forward. Too bad that his professional career will be strongly influenced by the frequent absence of his fiancée, for which he feels an inexplicable, almost obsessive jealousy. That''s why he hires a plumber very similar to him to keep an eye on his beloved, but that won''t be enough when Cotechiño is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjt0jwI6DimgBeaLzPlFbMJ0AHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151029'),
  ('974991482758787757', 'Lady for a Day', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker', 'Robert Riskin', 'Warren William, May Robson, Guy Kibbee, Glenda Farrell, Ned Sparks, Walter Connolly, Jean Parker, Nat Pendleton', 'NR', 'Apple Annie is an aging New York City fruit seller whose daughter Louise has been raised in a Spanish convent since she was an infant. As she grows up, Louise is led to believe that her mother is a society matron called Mrs. E. Worthington Manville. Annie worries that her lie is in danger of being uncovered when she learns that Louise is sailing to New York with her new fiancé and his nobleman father.', 'Apple Annie is an aging New York City fruit seller whose daughter Louise has been raised in a Spanish convent since she was an infant. As she grows up, Louise is led to believe that her mother is a society matron called Mrs. E. Worthington Manville. Annie worries that her lie is in danger of being uncovered when she learns that Louise is sailing to New York with her new fiancé and his nobleman father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qOtbnBKhcM66wtYgUViasKdj6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43130'),
  ('509237121246263715', 'Lady for a Night', 1942, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leigh Jason, Norbert Brodine', 'Isabel Dawn, Boyce DeGaw', 'Joan Blondell, John Wayne, Philip Merivale, Blanche Yurka, Ray Middleton, Edith Barrett, Leonid Kinskey, Hattie Noel', null, 'Gambling boat operator Jenny Blake throws over her gambler beau Jack Morgan in order to marry into high society.', 'Gambling boat operator Jenny Blake throws over her gambler beau Jack Morgan in order to marry into high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRj6EvtggPJUHavWWT8I2j87RlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40684'),
  ('50050181045635019', 'Lady Frankenstein', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mel Welles, Aureliano Luppi, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Edward di Lorenzo', 'Joseph Cotten, Rosalba Neri, Paul Müller, Herbert Fux, Renate Kasché, Mickey Hargitay, Lorenzo Terzon, Andrea Aureli', 'R', 'When Dr. Frankenstein is killed by a monster he created, his daughter and his lab assistant continue his experiments.', 'When Dr. Frankenstein is killed by a monster he created, his daughter and his lab assistant continue his experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMZgGVXHzL6Ixy2zy8ac81TQMzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3122'),
  ('1145802494877065203', 'Lady from Chungking', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'William Nigh', 'Sam Robins', 'Anna May Wong, Mae Clarke, Harold Huber, Rick Vallin, Paul Bryar, Ted Hecht, Ludwig Donath, James B. Leong', 'NR', 'During World War II, Chinese guerrillas fight against the occupying Japanese forces. A young woman is the secret leader of the villagers, who plot to rescue two downed Flying Tigers pilots, who are currently in the custody of the Japanese. The rescue mission takes on even more importance with the arrival of a Japanese general, which signals a major offensive taking place in the area.', 'During World War II, Chinese guerrillas fight against the occupying Japanese forces. A young woman is the secret leader of the villagers, who plot to rescue two downed Flying Tigers pilots, who are currently in the custody of the Japanese. The rescue mission takes on even more importance with the arrival of a Japanese general, which signals a major offensive taking place in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eck8Viyvi4UTCplL5yR1doboC0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100254'),
  ('496000634568581600', 'Lady from Louisiana', 1941, 'Drama', 'Bernard Vorhaus, Cy Feuer, Jack A. Marta', 'Vera Caspary, Michael Hogan, Guy Endore', 'John Wayne, Ona Munson, Ray Middleton, Henry Stephenson, Helen Westley, Jack Pennick, Dorothy Dandridge, Shimen Ruskin', 'NR', 'Northern lawyer John Reynolds travels to New Orleans to try and clean up the local crime syndicate based around a lottery. Although he meets Julie Mirbeau and they are attracted to each other, the fact that her father heads the lottery means they end up on opposite sides. When her father is killed, Julie becomes more and more involved in the shady activities and in blocking Reynolds'' attempts at prosecution.', 'Northern lawyer John Reynolds travels to New Orleans to try and clean up the local crime syndicate based around a lottery. Although he meets Julie Mirbeau and they are attracted to each other, the fact that her father heads the lottery means they end up on opposite sides. When her father is killed, Julie becomes more and more involved in the shady activities and in blocking Reynolds'' attempts at prosecution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iK1OgJxdH91Nx8QycJkfNCAuAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65506'),
  ('479622313645168534', 'Lady Gaga Presents: The Monster Ball Tour at Madison Square Garden', 2011, 'Music, Documentary', 'Laurieann Gibson', null, 'Lady Gaga, Liza Minnelli, Amanda Balen, Allison Hagendorf, Graham Breitenstein, Molly D''Amour, Mainda Dennis, Montana Efaw', null, 'Lady Gaga Presents The Monster Ball Tour at Madison Square Garden is a 2011 concert special documenting the February 21 and 22, 2011 shows of Lady Gaga''s The Monster Ball Tour. It features concert footage as well as pre-concert and backstage content.', 'Lady Gaga Presents The Monster Ball Tour at Madison Square Garden is a 2011 concert special documenting the February 21 and 22, 2011 shows of Lady Gaga''s The Monster Ball Tour. It features concert footage as well as pre-concert and backstage content.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4R7ZyMAatFpCJiT2ELSwfaaCoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63513'),
  ('142021528013411066', 'Lady Gangster', 1942, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Florey, Arthur L. Todd', 'Anthony Coldeway', 'Faye Emerson, Julie Bishop, Frank Wilcox, Roland Drew, Jackie Gleason, Ruth Ford, Virginia Brissac, Dorothy Vaughan', null, 'An actress gets involved with a criminal gang and winds up taking the rap for a $40,000 bank robbery. Before being sent to prison, she steals the money from her partners and hides it, thinking to use it as a bargaining chip to be released from prison. However, her former partners have different ideas.', 'An actress gets involved with a criminal gang and winds up taking the rap for a $40,000 bank robbery. Before being sent to prison, she steals the money from her partners and hides it, thinking to use it as a bargaining chip to be released from prison. However, her former partners have different ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJQq62hlK4R3voTQ1nyq5jhuG1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23107'),
