  ('172828225139996060', 'Lady in a Jam', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance, Western', 'Gregory La Cava, Hal Mohr, Joseph A. McDonough', 'Eugene Thackrey, Francis M. Cockrell, Otho Lovering', 'Irene Dunne, Patric Knowles, Ralph Bellamy, Eugene Pallette, Samuel S. Hinds, Queenie Vassar, Jane Garland, Edward McWade', 'NR', 'A psychiatrist''s patient, a nutty heiress, travels west to find gold in her grandfather''s abandoned mine. The psychiatrist, unable to talk her out of it, decides to follow her out there.', 'A psychiatrist''s patient, a nutty heiress, travels west to find gold in her grandfather''s abandoned mine. The psychiatrist, unable to talk her out of it, decides to follow her out there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faENa3QWpE5jJN25hEchxChgF6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151106'),
  ('81725523385857881', 'Lady in Cement', 1968, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Gordon Douglas, Joseph F. Biroc, Richard Lang', 'Jack Guss, Marvin H. Albert', 'Frank Sinatra, Raquel Welch, Richard Conte, Martin Gabel, Lainie Kazan, Pat Henry, Steve Peck, Virginia Wood', 'R', 'While diving for sunken treasure, street-smart gumshoe Tony Rome finds the body of a gorgeous blonde, her feet stuck in a block of cement. Soon after, tough guy Waldo Gronski hires him to find a missing woman named Sandra Lomax, and Rome wonders if there''s a connection. He sets about trying to locate the woman, and in no time finds himself mixed up with a beautiful party girl and a slippery racketeer.', 'While diving for sunken treasure, street-smart gumshoe Tony Rome finds the body of a gorgeous blonde, her feet stuck in a block of cement. Soon after, tough guy Waldo Gronski hires him to find a missing woman named Sandra Lomax, and Rome wonders if there''s a connection. He sets about trying to locate the woman, and in no time finds himself mixed up with a beautiful party girl and a slippery racketeer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r70X120GasMpDDsInD6Y1vE7Y5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42630'),
  ('805574988751209162', 'Lady in the Dark', 1944, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Ray Rennahan', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett', 'Ginger Rogers, Ray Milland, Warner Baxter, Jon Hall, Barry Sullivan, Mischa Auer, Phyllis Brooks, Mary Philips', 'NR', 'A neurotic editor sees a psychoanalyst about the advertising man, movie star and other man in her life.', 'A neurotic editor sees a psychoanalyst about the advertising man, movie star and other man in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7tekCG1oCpAY6RTzR0YIucfu4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120801'),
