  ('529118059480997279', 'Lady in the Lake', 1946, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Montgomery, Paul Vogel, Dolph Zimmer', 'Raymond Chandler, Steve Fisher', 'Robert Montgomery, Audrey Totter, Lloyd Nolan, Tom Tully, Leon Ames, Jayne Meadows, Dick Simmons, Morris Ankrum', 'NR', 'Private eye Phillip Marlowe wants to get out of the detective racket and into crime writing. But when he''s called to the office of editor Adrienne Fromsett, it''s not to talk about his story ideas — she wants him to locate the missing wife of her boss, Mr. Kingsby. The assignment quickly becomes complicated when bodies start turning up.', 'Private eye Phillip Marlowe wants to get out of the detective racket and into crime writing. But when he''s called to the office of editor Adrienne Fromsett, it''s not to talk about his story ideas — she wants him to locate the missing wife of her boss, Mr. Kingsby. The assignment quickly becomes complicated when bodies start turning up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15iAyxIgD8bKqwKALaVJ5vf5pBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1841'),
  ('756982912897641360', 'Lady in the Water', 2006, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Christopher Doyle, Hinju Kim', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Paul Giamatti, Bryce Dallas Howard, Jeffrey Wright, Bob Balaban, Sarita Choudhury, Cindy Cheung, M. Night Shyamalan, Freddy Rodríguez', 'PG-13', 'Apartment building superintendent Cleveland Heep rescues what he thinks is a young woman from the pool he maintains. When he discovers that she is actually a character from a bedtime story who is trying to make the journey back to her home, he works with his tenants to protect his new friend from the creatures that are determined to keep her in our world.', 'Apartment building superintendent Cleveland Heep rescues what he thinks is a young woman from the pool he maintains. When he discovers that she is actually a character from a bedtime story who is trying to make the journey back to her home, he works with his tenants to protect his new friend from the creatures that are determined to keep her in our world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddNmoSy1Jd3PBF5XDZvrrBIfrja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9697'),
  ('226642777609242845', 'Lady in Waiting', 1994, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Fred Gallo', 'Dennis Manuel', 'Shannon Whirry, Robert Costanzo, Michael Nouri, William Devane, Crystal Chappell, Karen Kopins, Meg Foster, Charles Grant', null, 'A divorced cop investigating the sadistic murders of high-class prostitutes discovers that the prime suspect is his ex-wife''s new boyfriend...', 'A divorced cop investigating the sadistic murders of high-class prostitutes discovers that the prime suspect is his ex-wife''s new boyfriend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlufpQoBuFIk5SI9b3kjeNqiSEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95206'),
  ('600341588175776352', 'Lady in White', 1988, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Frank LaLoggia, Russell Carpenter', 'Frank LaLoggia', 'Lukas Haas, Len Cariou, Alex Rocco, Katherine Helmond, Jason Presson, Renata Vanni, Angelo Bertolini, Joelle Jacobi', 'PG-13', 'Locked in a school closet during Halloween 1962, young Frank witnesses the ghost of a young girl and the man who murdered her years ago. Shortly afterward he finds himself stalked by the killer and is soon drawn to an old house where a mysterious Lady In White lives. As he discovers the secret of the woman he soon finds that the killer may be someone close to him.', 'Locked in a school closet during Halloween 1962, young Frank witnesses the ghost of a young girl and the man who murdered her years ago. Shortly afterward he finds himself stalked by the killer and is soon drawn to an old house where a mysterious Lady In White lives. As he discovers the secret of the woman he soon finds that the killer may be someone close to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AevfLQ5c0ZGtO3clHawg9L2XAQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49365'),
  ('393796737195997474', 'Lady Into Lassie', 1995, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Aleksey Sakharov, Nikolay Nemolyaev', 'Aleksandr Zhitinsky, Aleksey Sakharov', 'Elena Korikova, Dmitriy Shcherbina, Leonid Kuravlyov, Vasili Lanovoy, Yekaterina Rednikova, Lyudmila Artemeva, Yevgeni Zharikov, Natalya Gvozdikova', null, 'Based on a famous short story by Pushkin, this film tells of a youthful, innocent and pure love story that begins as a girlish joke. Liza is eager to get to know her young neighbor but cannot do so as their fathers are not on speaking terms. Her response is simple and direct. With the help of her loyal servant Nastya, she dresses up as a peasant girl and goes pick mushrooms in the nearby woods....', 'Based on a famous short story by Pushkin, this film tells of a youthful, innocent and pure love story that begins as a girlish joke. Liza is eager to get to know her young neighbor but cannot do so as their fathers are not on speaking terms. Her response is simple and direct. With the help of her loyal servant Nastya, she dresses up as a peasant girl and goes pick mushrooms in the nearby woods....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3zLMrdCWSQBuQEp8VxLXI88twH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137889'),
  ('536272224752352513', 'Lady J', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Laurent Desmet, Thibault Lejeune', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Cécile de France, Édouard Baer, Laure Calamy, Alice Isaaz, Natalia Dontcheva, Manon Kneusé, Arnaud Dupont, Emilie Aubertot', null, 'When a romance between a widow and a notorious libertine takes an unexpected turn, Mademoiselle de Joncquières becomes instrumental to one lover’s plans for revenge.', 'When a romance between a widow and a notorious libertine takes an unexpected turn, Mademoiselle de Joncquières becomes instrumental to one lover’s plans for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMws6ZcTwEynkst5PU3Z8OD9wiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515911'),
  ('815359577995483443', 'Lady Jane', 1986, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Trevor Nunn, Derek V. Browne, Douglas Slocombe', 'David Edgar', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Cary Elwes, John Wood, Patrick Stewart, Joss Ackland, Michael Hordern, Jane Lapotaire, Ian Hogg', null, 'The death of King Henry VIII throws his kingdom into chaos because of succession disputes. His weak son, Edward, is on his deathbed. Anxious to keep England true to the Reformation, a scheming minister John Dudley marries off his son, Guildford to Lady Jane Grey, whom he places on the throne after Edward dies. At first hostile to each other, Guildford and Jane fall in love, but they cannot withstand the course of power which will lead to their ultimate downfall.', 'The death of King Henry VIII throws his kingdom into chaos because of succession disputes. His weak son, Edward, is on his deathbed. Anxious to keep England true to the Reformation, a scheming minister John Dudley marries off his son, Guildford to Lady Jane Grey, whom he places on the throne after Edward dies. At first hostile to each other, Guildford and Jane fall in love, but they cannot withstand the course of power which will lead to their ultimate downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0N4lG6g2r77C4yGTuvOBHhGYXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21867'),
  ('782462918041055437', 'Lady Jane', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Guédiguian, Pierre Milon', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Meylan, Yann Trégouët, Frédérique Bonnal, Pascale Roberts, Jacques Boudet, Pascal Cervo', null, 'After having perpetrated a serious crime, Muriel, François and René, childhood friends born in the working-class streets of Marseille, go their separate ways, until, 15 years later, they meet again when another crime is committed.', 'After having perpetrated a serious crime, Muriel, François and René, childhood friends born in the working-class streets of Marseille, go their separate ways, until, 15 years later, they meet again when another crime is committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrAz6dwk1XaRqhexwy5sXm2kudF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78236'),
  ('349903778110398555', 'Lady Killer', 1933, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Roy Del Ruth, Tony Gaudio, Maxwell Arnow', 'Ben Markson, Lillie Hayward', 'James Cagney, Mae Clarke, Margaret Lindsay, Leslie Fenton, Douglass Dumbrille, Russell Hopton, Raymond Hatton, Henry O''Neill', 'NR', 'An ex-gang member tries to resist his old cohorts'' criminal influence after he suddenly becomes a Hollywood movie star.', 'An ex-gang member tries to resist his old cohorts'' criminal influence after he suddenly becomes a Hollywood movie star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmXopDZNpyOHAixxmZSJCk4W9u4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43597'),
  ('141188094684162046', 'Lady Killer', 1937, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Jean Grémillon, Günther Rittau, Roger Blanc', 'Charles Spaak', 'Jean Gabin, Mireille Balin, Pierre Etchepare, Henri Poupon, Jean Aymé, Pierre Magnier, Marguerite Deval, René Lefèvre', null, 'Lucien Bourrache, a good looking non-commissioned officer at the Spahis, is used to charm many women. He met Madeleine Courtois at Cannes. She is beautiful and lives in luxury. He lends her a large amount of money, which she loses gambling. Then she drops him. But Lucien is now in love, and once demobilized, he goes to Paris to find her again. But he''s not so sexy without his uniform, and Madeleine and him do not belong to the same milieu.', 'Lucien Bourrache, a good looking non-commissioned officer at the Spahis, is used to charm many women. He met Madeleine Courtois at Cannes. She is beautiful and lives in luxury. He lends her a large amount of money, which she loses gambling. Then she drops him. But Lucien is now in love, and once demobilized, he goes to Paris to find her again. But he''s not so sexy without his uniform, and Madeleine and him do not belong to the same milieu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYk44YiSS0kD2vXVxdECvBJZltm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78537'),
  ('109906577921342334', 'Lady L', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Peter Ustinov, Paul Feyder, Margot Capelier', 'Peter Ustinov', 'Sophia Loren, Paul Newman, David Niven, Peter Ustinov, Marcel Dalio, Michel Piccoli, Claude Dauphin, Cecil Parker', null, 'Lady L is an elegant 80-year-old woman who recalls her amorous life story, including past loves and lusty, scandalous adventures she has lived through.', 'Lady L is an elegant 80-year-old woman who recalls her amorous life story, including past loves and lusty, scandalous adventures she has lived through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyH9h8H897au6Rf7PTipN4MrZEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71006'),
  ('182071148373517141', 'Lady Libertine', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gérard Kikoïne, Gérard Loubeau', 'Gérard Kikoïne, Harry Alan Towers', 'Christopher Pearson, Jennifer Inch, Sophie Favier, Emmanuel Karsen, Alain Dumaurier, April Hyde, Eloïse Beaune, Jane Val', null, 'Charlie, a young aristocrat in turn of the century England, meets a boy named Frank on the road to Portsmouth. What Charlie doesn''t realize is that Frank is actually Frances, who''s donned a disguise to escape working at a brothel. Charlie takes Frank/Frances into his home, and when he discovers her true identity, the two become lovers.', 'Charlie, a young aristocrat in turn of the century England, meets a boy named Frank on the road to Portsmouth. What Charlie doesn''t realize is that Frank is actually Frances, who''s donned a disguise to escape working at a brothel. Charlie takes Frank/Frances into his home, and when he discovers her true identity, the two become lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZsaBHB8RvNvcKeEsG5YhxH3zyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165612'),
  ('480968363137459108', 'Lady Liberty', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Alfio Contini, Mario Garbuglia', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Mario Monicelli, Ring Lardner, Jr.', 'Sophia Loren, Gigi Proietti, William Devane, Beeson Carroll, María Luisa Sala, Danny DeVito, Tommaso Bianco, Susan Sarandon', null, 'An Italian woman faces challenges at JFK Airport when Customs confiscates the mortadella sausage she brought as a gift for her fiancé, leading to a humorous and frustrating ordeal.', 'An Italian woman faces challenges at JFK Airport when Customs confiscates the mortadella sausage she brought as a gift for her fiancé, leading to a humorous and frustrating ordeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gqFXFpk4VSB7txx31RmSdMctU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216736'),
  ('236765505385830038', 'Lady Macbeth', 2016, 'Drama', 'William Oldroyd, Ari Wegner, Shaheen Baig', 'Alice Birch', 'Florence Pugh, Cosmo Jarvis, Paul Hilton, Naomi Ackie, Christopher Fairbank, Golda Rosheuvel, Anton Palmer, Rebecca Manley', 'R', 'Rural England, 1865. Katherine, suffocated by her loveless marriage to a bitter man and restrained by his father''s tyranny, unleashes an irresistible force within her, so powerful that she will stop at nothing to get what she wants.', 'Rural England, 1865. Katherine, suffocated by her loveless marriage to a bitter man and restrained by his father''s tyranny, unleashes an irresistible force within her, so powerful that she will stop at nothing to get what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWTJbhTwSTJmhLlX5xAOxPhdnXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410117'),
  ('323774677921262957', 'Lady Maiko', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Masayuki Suō, 島根淳, Rokurō Terada', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Mone Kamishiraishi, Hiroki Hasegawa, Sumiko Fuji, Tamiyo Kusakari, Eri Watanabe, Masahiro Takashima, Fumiyo Kohinata, Gaku Hamada', null, 'Country bumpkin Haruko only ever wanted to become a maiko, an apprentice geisha. Initially rebuffed for lack of references, Haruko''s strong accent intrigues a linguistics professor, who undertakes to coach her.', 'Country bumpkin Haruko only ever wanted to become a maiko, an apprentice geisha. Initially rebuffed for lack of references, Haruko''s strong accent intrigues a linguistics professor, who undertakes to coach her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/il5KDWd6xzoZ5zD90LG0D3Mn4iS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295709'),
  ('605911442445643199', 'Lady Morgan''s Vengeance', 1965, 'Horror', 'Massimo Pupillo', 'Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Barbara Nelli, Erika Blanc, Gordon Mitchell, Paul Müller, Michel Forain, Carlo Kechler, Edith MacGoven, Luciano Catenacci', null, 'A young woman is psychologically manipulated and tortured by her treacherous husband while her lost fiancé is missing, presumed dead, and only the ghosts of the castle can tell the tale.', 'A young woman is psychologically manipulated and tortured by her treacherous husband while her lost fiancé is missing, presumed dead, and only the ghosts of the castle can tell the tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHsUjkOkZcm7wgxeXjvIHQtf1K4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281152'),
  ('798051456296338717', 'Lady Nazca', 2025, 'Drama, History, Adventure', 'Damien Dorsaz, Gilles Porte, Uwe Bünker', 'Fadette Drouard, Damien Dorsaz, Franck Ferreira Fernandes', 'Devrim Lingnau, Guillaume Gallienne, Olivia Ross, Amaranta Kun, Jorge Pomacanchari, Víctor Prada, Marina Pumachapi, François Vallaeys', null, 'With the second World War looming and having lost everything before, Maria Reiche flees Germany and ends up in Peru. There, she tries to fit in an inhibited society for the sake of her lover Amy. But she only starts to find her true calling in life when she takes a trip to the desert of Nazca and stumbles upon mysterious Lines, drawn in the soil. Against all odds, against everyone, Maria ties her destiny to the Nazca lines, and takes on the mission to find their meaning. A journey that will throw her into tremendous trouble and danger - but also give her a sense of peace, at last, as she finally finds where she belongs, sweeping the desert.', 'With the second World War looming and having lost everything before, Maria Reiche flees Germany and ends up in Peru. There, she tries to fit in an inhibited society for the sake of her lover Amy. But she only starts to find her true calling in life when she takes a trip to the desert of Nazca and stumbles upon mysterious Lines, drawn in the soil. Against all odds, against everyone, Maria ties her destiny to the Nazca lines, and takes on the mission to find their meaning. A journey that will throw her into tremendous trouble and danger - but also give her a sense of peace, at last, as she finally finds where she belongs, sweeping the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JGfXG3os3trBUQadnuoXwICMRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087209'),
  ('836445774063803731', 'Lady Ninja Kasumi', 2005, 'Action', 'Hiroyuki Kawasaki, Tomoyuki Iwasaki', 'Ribon Kawasaki', 'Young-mi, Saki Anz, Yui Mamiya, Tomotake Shigematsu, Ginji, Shôichi Imai, Masanobu Matsuda, Hidenori Yanagi', null, 'A girl from a peaceful, Edo-era Japanese village seeks revenge for the death of a disgraced elder with the help of her sister and a lethal lady ninja nun. It''s the time of the samurai and ninja, and Shogun Yoshimune rules Japan. Beneath the idyllic façade of the quant villages populating the countryside dwells a twisted sexual underbelly that affects the wealthy and impoverished alike. When one of the village elders commits seppuku after being raped, Kaede and her sister decide to take justice into their own hands and track down the perpetrator. Aided by a nun who believes in Old Testament-style retribution, the two sisters embark on a bloody mission of vengeance. Along the way, the three women slice and dice their way through lies and secrets while discovering that the story behind the rape is much more complex than any of them suspected.', 'A girl from a peaceful, Edo-era Japanese village seeks revenge for the death of a disgraced elder with the help of her sister and a lethal lady ninja nun. It''s the time of the samurai and ninja, and Shogun Yoshimune rules Japan. Beneath the idyllic façade of the quant villages populating the countryside dwells a twisted sexual underbelly that affects the wealthy and impoverished alike. When one of the village elders commits seppuku after being raped, Kaede and her sister decide to take justice into their own hands and track down the perpetrator. Aided by a nun who believes in Old Testament-style retribution, the two sisters embark on a bloody mission of vengeance. Along the way, the three women slice and dice their way through lies and secrets while discovering that the story behind the rape is much more complex than any of them suspected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FCiXwRPe5DgFjQC29thGAwMLhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60072'),
  ('918884158224186605', 'Lady of Burlesque', 1943, 'Mystery, Comedy, Music, Crime', 'William A. Wellman, Robert De Grasse', null, 'Barbara Stanwyck, Michael O''Shea, J. Edward Bromberg, Iris Adrian, Gloria Dickson, Victoria Faust, Stephanie Bachelor, Charles Dingle', 'NR', 'After one member of their group is murdered, the performers at a burlesque house must work together to find out who the killer is before they strike again.', 'After one member of their group is murdered, the performers at a burlesque house must work together to find out who the killer is before they strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bng9HQoCP4i62cKHK0E1EoqZu0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50001'),
  ('740802964725723298', 'Lady of Steel', 1970, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Lam Kwok-Cheung, Yeh Shen', 'Liang Jen', 'Cheng Pei-Pei, Elliot Ngok Wah, Huang Tsung-Hsun, Fang Mian, Ku Wen-Chung, Lee Wan-Chung, Lee Pang-Fei, Chiang Lung', null, 'A young swordswoman named Fang Ying-qi (Cheng Pei-Pei) sets out to join a gathering of the martial world’s leading warriors under the banner of Lord Xia (Fang Mien) and the Flying Dragon Clan. Their mission is to organize the defense of their country against invading Jin forces. Fang also intends to avenge the murder of her parents 20 years past by bandit leader Han Shi-xiong (Huang Chung-hsin). Han has since taken on a new, false identity as a reputable member of the Flying Dragon Clan while secretly working with the Jin to bring down the resistance. Han uses cunning and a network of criminal fighters in an attempt to assassinate Fang, and when that fails, to frame her as a traitor. Once his true identity and intentions are revealed, a determined Fang must rely on her deadly sword skills and assistance from a clever beggar clan leader (Yueh Hua) to stop Han and restore her reputation.', 'A young swordswoman named Fang Ying-qi (Cheng Pei-Pei) sets out to join a gathering of the martial world’s leading warriors under the banner of Lord Xia (Fang Mien) and the Flying Dragon Clan. Their mission is to organize the defense of their country against invading Jin forces. Fang also intends to avenge the murder of her parents 20 years past by bandit leader Han Shi-xiong (Huang Chung-hsin). Han has since taken on a new, false identity as a reputable member of the Flying Dragon Clan while secretly working with the Jin to bring down the resistance. Han uses cunning and a network of criminal fighters in an attempt to assassinate Fang, and when that fails, to frame her as a traitor. Once his true identity and intentions are revealed, a determined Fang must rely on her deadly sword skills and assistance from a clever beggar clan leader (Yueh Hua) to stop Han and restore her reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEo0WMrTNe6rSzzmOGuwg0YKXW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107899'),
  ('453795099687828988', 'Lady of the Camelias', 1981, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Enrico Medioli, Vladimir Pozner, Jean Aurenche', 'Isabelle Huppert, Gian Maria Volonté, Bruno Ganz, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Clio Goldsmith, Fernando Rey, Mario Maranzana, Yann Babilée', null, 'A young girl from the provinces, comes to Paris with one goal: to become a part of the rich bourgeoisie. To achieve this she will use her unique beauty and charm.', 'A young girl from the provinces, comes to Paris with one goal: to become a part of the rich bourgeoisie. To achieve this she will use her unique beauty and charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEF5EywsWfTVWVkpXjWl8LdCZlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67539'),
  ('1009499985850335500', 'Lady of the Damned Forest', 2017, 'Horror, Adventure, Fantasy', 'George Karja', 'George Karja', 'Bea Urzaiz, Daniela M. Xandru, George Karja, José Fopiani, Giselle Carrera, Rubén del Álamo Gómez', null, 'A group of friends climb the mountain in search of a new adventure. But their trip takes an unexpected turning point after the first night, since Marta tells her friends an ancient legend about "the lady of the damned forest". Nobody knows if that tale could be true.', 'A group of friends climb the mountain in search of a new adventure. But their trip takes an unexpected turning point after the first night, since Marta tells her friends an ancient legend about "the lady of the damned forest". Nobody knows if that tale could be true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7A8Uh9LCkKXQFAlL6ZFjQywqr9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634141'),
  ('730069892521115658', 'Lady of the Dynasty', 2015, 'History, Romance, War', 'Cheng Shiqing, Tian Zhuangzhuang, Zhang Yimou', 'Cheng Shiqing, Bian Zhihong, Wu Nan', 'Fan Bingbing, Leon Lai Ming, Wu Chun, Joan Chen, Ning Jing, Wu Gang, Mohetaer, Liu Chao', null, 'The tragic story of a Tang Dynasty imperial consort who was the favorite of the Emperor Xuanzong.', 'The tragic story of a Tang Dynasty imperial consort who was the favorite of the Emperor Xuanzong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cT0jxsiN2ESUORY4EJfF9h6ptX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139319'),
  ('443755551130888960', 'Lady of the Manor', 2021, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Christian Long, Justin Long, Nick Morgulis', 'Christian Long, Justin Long', 'Melanie Lynskey, Judy Greer, Justin Long, Ryan Phillippe, Luis Guzmán, Patrick Duffy, Tamara Austin, Wallace Jean', 'R', 'Past and present collide when aimless slacker Hannah gets hired to portray Lady Wadsworth -- a Southern belle from the 1800s -- for tours at Wadsworth Manor. Hannah figures she can fake it well enough, until the ghost of Lady Wadsworth appears and tells her it''s time to change her wild ways -- or she''ll haunt her forever.', 'Past and present collide when aimless slacker Hannah gets hired to portray Lady Wadsworth -- a Southern belle from the 1800s -- for tours at Wadsworth Manor. Hannah figures she can fake it well enough, until the ghost of Lady Wadsworth appears and tells her it''s time to change her wild ways -- or she''ll haunt her forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3G5XLqmJSs4RvozoIsqaTWTHRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761388'),
  ('759353297663489582', 'Lady of the Night', 1925, 'Drama, Romance', 'Monta Bell, André Barlatier', 'Alice D.G. Miller', 'Norma Shearer, Malcolm McGregor, Dale Fuller, George K. Arthur, Fred Esmelton, Lew Harvey, Gwen Lee, Betty Morrissey', null, 'The story of two baby girls, born near in proximity but worlds apart in society: Molly Helmer, the daughter of a thief, and Florence Banning, the daughter of the judge who sent Molly''s father to prison. The girls'' lives come together as they reach the age of eighteen, when Florence leaves the security of the exclusive Girls Select School, and Molly, now orphaned, begins her life after reform school.', 'The story of two baby girls, born near in proximity but worlds apart in society: Molly Helmer, the daughter of a thief, and Florence Banning, the daughter of the judge who sent Molly''s father to prison. The girls'' lives come together as they reach the age of eighteen, when Florence leaves the security of the exclusive Girls Select School, and Molly, now orphaned, begins her life after reform school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2Ye6NDb6HtqS9JvYjxvaprahzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83531'),
  ('709973347652272817', 'Lady of the Night', 1986, 'Drama', 'Piero Schivazappa', 'Galliano Juso', 'Serena Grandi, Fabio Sartor, Alberto Di Stasio, Emanuela Taschini, Stanko Molnar, Sergio Guidi, Antonella Giacomini, Tiberio Mitri', null, 'Angelina is tired of long serious relationships. One day she is brutally raped and she changes dramatically. Suddenly she is getting involved in more and more dangerous relations with unknown men until her behavior leads to a fatal crime.', 'Angelina is tired of long serious relationships. One day she is brutally raped and she changes dramatically. Suddenly she is getting involved in more and more dangerous relations with unknown men until her behavior leads to a fatal crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9K3oy3q2ydrpGo0e6PO1FA4UfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244908'),
  ('1137452962498517039', 'Lady on a Train', 1945, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Elwood Bredell, Charles David', 'Edmund Beloin, Robert O''Brien', 'Deanna Durbin, Ralph Bellamy, David Bruce, George Coulouris, Allen Jenkins, Dan Duryea, Edward Everett Horton, Patricia Morison', 'NR', 'While watching from her train window, Nikki Collins witnesses a murder in a nearby building. When she alerts the police, they think she has read one too many mystery novels. She then enlists a popular mystery writer to help her solve the crime on her own, but her sleuthing attracts the attentions of suitors and killers.', 'While watching from her train window, Nikki Collins witnesses a murder in a nearby building. When she alerts the police, they think she has read one too many mystery novels. She then enlists a popular mystery writer to help her solve the crime on her own, but her sleuthing attracts the attentions of suitors and killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DylvvWcb52Qjq6lzN4lJxOcYyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30022'),
  ('837753112110654862', 'Lady on the Bus', 1978, 'Drama', 'Guará Rodrigues, Paulo Sérgio de Almeida, Neville D''Almeida', 'Neville D''Almeida', 'Sonia Braga, Nuno Leal Maia, Jorge Dória, Paulo César Peréio, Yara Amaral, Cláudio Marzo, Márcia Rodrigues, Paulo Villaça', null, 'Solange is a recently married young woman whose wedding night did not end well. After constant fights with her husband, she decides to live through her sexual frustration by sleeping with strangers she picks up on crowded buses in Rio de Janeiro.', 'Solange is a recently married young woman whose wedding night did not end well. After constant fights with her husband, she decides to live through her sexual frustration by sleeping with strangers she picks up on crowded buses in Rio de Janeiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG6TRKnIsAqFRDCCXSml7lVj3fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84255'),
  ('687518376425722992', 'Lady Oscar', 1979, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Jean Penzer', 'Jacques Demy, Patricia Louisianna Knop', 'Catriona MacColl, Barry Stokes, Jonas Bergström, Christine Böhm, Terence Budd, Patsy Kensit, Mark Kingston, Georges Wilson', null, 'Oscar François de Jarjayes was born female, but her father insisted she be raised as a boy as he had no sons. She becomes the captain of the guards at Versailles under King Louis XVI and Marie Antonette. Her privileged, noble life comes under fire as she discovers the hard life of the poor people of France. She is caught up in the French Revolution, and must choose between her loyalty and love.', 'Oscar François de Jarjayes was born female, but her father insisted she be raised as a boy as he had no sons. She becomes the captain of the guards at Versailles under King Louis XVI and Marie Antonette. Her privileged, noble life comes under fire as she discovers the hard life of the poor people of France. She is caught up in the French Revolution, and must choose between her loyalty and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OHOjlLZUFgvXWeKWanpaYvmAwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31551'),
  ('622711535136702494', 'Lady Paname', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Henri Jeanson, Robert Lefebvre', 'Henri Jeanson', 'Louis Jouvet, Suzy Delair, Jane Marken, Germaine Montero, Véra Norman, Monique Mélinand, Claire Olivier, Odette Laure', null, 'The evocation of Paris in the 1920s mingles with the rapid rise of the irresistible Caprice, a talented singer, and her tumultuous love affair with Jeff the composer. A photographer nicknamed Bagnolet, a gentle anarchist, gently monitors the activities of Caprice, who has become Lady Paname and, in the absence of morality, makes love triumph.', 'The evocation of Paris in the 1920s mingles with the rapid rise of the irresistible Caprice, a talented singer, and her tumultuous love affair with Jeff the composer. A photographer nicknamed Bagnolet, a gentle anarchist, gently monitors the activities of Caprice, who has become Lady Paname and, in the absence of morality, makes love triumph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDW4yVIRPJsWPOXxNUQJaY202ox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79023'),
  ('944072723030418579', 'Lady Rancho', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Rafael Montero', 'Molo Alcocer Délano, Mineko Mori', 'Danae Reynaud, Hoze Meléndez, Renata Vaca, Juan Carlos Colombo, Azela Robinson, Costanza Andrade, Delia Casanova, Jorge Victoria', null, 'A spoiled girl is sent to her family''s ranch to work during summer vacations.', 'A spoiled girl is sent to her family''s ranch to work during summer vacations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioFDYy0DuYrpAB3UhZfEUuMhvIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554567'),
  ('569617661482088267', 'Lady Red Rose', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara, Takashi Matsuo', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara', 'Tsunekichi Fujiwara, Katsuya, Koran Kuroda, Hikari Nagase, Mikio Osawa, Kaori Sakagami, Akihiro Shimizu, Masaaki Takarai', null, 'Based on the novel by Oniroku Dan.', 'Based on the novel by Oniroku Dan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPnm4hlqw1tUd14r1WGPSjKzoFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186058'),
  ('544055285139594468', 'Lady Reporter', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Mang Hoi, Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Sam Chi-Leung', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Chin Siu-Ho, Mang Hoi, Elizabeth Lee Mei-Fung, Ronny Yu, Melvin Wong, Wu Ma, Tai Bo', null, 'Cindy, an American FBI agent, travels to Hong Kong to investigate a newspaper editor, Wong Tak, who is suspected of printing counterfeit money using the newspaper’s presses. The American teams up with a rival reporter and her friend Yu, an undercover law enforcer. Cindy’s investigation takes a sharp turn, however, when Yu’s father, the prosecuting lawyer in the counterfeiting case, is kidnapped.', 'Cindy, an American FBI agent, travels to Hong Kong to investigate a newspaper editor, Wong Tak, who is suspected of printing counterfeit money using the newspaper’s presses. The American teams up with a rival reporter and her friend Yu, an undercover law enforcer. Cindy’s investigation takes a sharp turn, however, when Yu’s father, the prosecuting lawyer in the counterfeiting case, is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozooALPXf1W1n1F9JTwshqTybnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88553'),
  ('1128038916313943248', 'Lady Scarface', 1941, 'Crime', 'Nicholas Musuraca, Frank Woodruff, Doran Cox', 'Arnaud d''Usseau, Richard Collins', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Judith Anderson, Frances E. Neal, Mildred Coles, Eric Blore, Marc Lawrence, Damian O''Flynn, Andrew Tombes', null, 'A Chicago gang led by Slade carries out an audacious brokerage robbery. Lieutenant Bill Mason takes the case, continuing his friendly-enemy relationship with crime reporter Ann Rogers. One gang member is caught; eventually, others follow. But Mason hasn''t a clue to Slade, principally because he''s unaware she''s a woman.', 'A Chicago gang led by Slade carries out an audacious brokerage robbery. Lieutenant Bill Mason takes the case, continuing his friendly-enemy relationship with crime reporter Ann Rogers. One gang member is caught; eventually, others follow. But Mason hasn''t a clue to Slade, principally because he''s unaware she''s a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuKFGcMxYp7bq8LA7DbBlEvRl6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87914'),
  ('993951543558082758', 'Lady Scorpions', 2024, 'Action, Crime', 'Ernesto Lomeli, Bruce Del Castillo, Barbarella Pardo', 'H. Daniel Gross, Stephen Carolan, Bruce Del Castillo', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Caitlin Dechelle, Jeff Fahey, David W. Rice, Jose Manuel, Miguel Peralta, Nicolas Sotnikoff, Sofia O''Brien', 'R', 'An ex-FBI agent''s fight against a crime syndicate becomes personal when they kidnap her granddaughter. She and her daughter, both martial arts masters, form an unstoppable team. Together, they outmaneuver and defeat the syndicate''s henchmen in a calculated game of cat and mouse, on a relentless mission to save her and topple the criminal empire.', 'An ex-FBI agent''s fight against a crime syndicate becomes personal when they kidnap her granddaughter. She and her daughter, both martial arts masters, form an unstoppable team. Together, they outmaneuver and defeat the syndicate''s henchmen in a calculated game of cat and mouse, on a relentless mission to save her and topple the criminal empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLKsSOCASmJU6oUbiE2msiDsSmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252896'),
  ('283422381028613859', 'Lady Sings the Blues', 1972, 'Drama, Music', 'Sidney J. Furie, John A. Alonzo', 'Suzanne de Passe, Chris Clark, Terence McCloy', 'Diana Ross, Billy Dee Williams, Richard Pryor, James T. Callahan, Paul Hampton, Sid Melton, Virginia Capers, Yvonne Fair', 'R', 'Chronicles the rise and fall of legendary blues singer Billie Holiday, beginning with her traumatic youth. The story depicts her early attempts at a singing career and her eventual rise to stardom, as well as her difficult relationship with Louis McKay, her boyfriend and manager. Casting a shadow over even Holiday''s brightest moments is the vocalist''s severe drug addiction, which threatens to end both her career and her life.', 'Chronicles the rise and fall of legendary blues singer Billie Holiday, beginning with her traumatic youth. The story depicts her early attempts at a singing career and her eventual rise to stardom, as well as her difficult relationship with Louis McKay, her boyfriend and manager. Casting a shadow over even Holiday''s brightest moments is the vocalist''s severe drug addiction, which threatens to end both her career and her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jr528gGK1RrOW6YAZHUj5lF9RrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23148'),
  ('478851922017305130', 'Lady Snowblood', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Toshiya Fujita, Masaki Tamura, Kiyoshi Segawa', 'Norio Osada', 'Meiko Kaji, Toshio Kurosawa, Masaaki Daimon, Miyoko Akaza, Shinichi Uchida, Takeo Chii, Noboru Nakaya, Yoshiko Nakada', 'NR', 'Yuki''s family is nearly wiped out before she is born due to the machinations of a band of criminals. These criminals kidnap and brutalize her mother but leave her alive. Later her mother ends up in prison with only revenge to keep her alive. She creates an instrument for this revenge by purposefully getting pregnant. Yuki never knows the love of a family but only killing and revenge.', 'Yuki''s family is nearly wiped out before she is born due to the machinations of a band of criminals. These criminals kidnap and brutalize her mother but leave her alive. Later her mother ends up in prison with only revenge to keep her alive. She creates an instrument for this revenge by purposefully getting pregnant. Yuki never knows the love of a family but only killing and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkcbaqCoYEXDUnSQ6NTnB2C7H05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2487'),
  ('1029761373496626174', 'Lady Snowblood 2: Love Song of Vengeance', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tatsuo Suzuki, Toshiya Fujita, Kazuo Matsuzawa', 'Norio Osada, Kiyohide Ohara', 'Meiko Kaji, Yoshio Harada, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Shin Kishida, Kōji Nanbara, Rinichi Yamamoto, Tōru Abe, Masasuke Hirose', 'NR', 'Lady Snowblood is caught by the police and sentenced to death for her crimes. As she is sent to the gallows she is rescued by the secret police who offer her a deal to assassinate some revolutionaries.', 'Lady Snowblood is caught by the police and sentenced to death for her crimes. As she is sent to the gallows she is rescued by the secret police who offer her a deal to assassinate some revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmORZTEqJuTIJ28XAF3jnQUnUyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18818'),
  ('456419880699302601', 'Lady Street Fighter', 1977, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'James Bryan', 'Renee Harmon', 'Jody McCrea, Renee Harmon, Trace Carradine, Liz Renay, Tony Romano, Bob Morris, Steve Sexton, Stephen Machey', null, 'Exotic Eastern European beauty, Linda Allen, flies in to Los Angeles to track down the evil mobsters who tortured and murdered her sister. Meanwhile, the mobsters are trying to find a tape with information that would be incriminating to them. Linda''s investigation deals with a pimp who may be the murderer she is after, and a helpful FBI agent who may not be the crime hunter he pretends to be. Cunning and deadly she is, but will she be up to the tangled web of corruption, violence, and death she falls into?', 'Exotic Eastern European beauty, Linda Allen, flies in to Los Angeles to track down the evil mobsters who tortured and murdered her sister. Meanwhile, the mobsters are trying to find a tape with information that would be incriminating to them. Linda''s investigation deals with a pimp who may be the murderer she is after, and a helpful FBI agent who may not be the crime hunter he pretends to be. Cunning and deadly she is, but will she be up to the tangled web of corruption, violence, and death she falls into?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h1fLMCk6YbEKE9fTmMnZ9SnISl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85604'),
  ('762782912031379277', 'Lady Terminator', 1988, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'H. Tjut Djalil, Kenneth Thimoty, Chuchu Suteja', 'Karr Kruinowz', 'Barbara Anne Constable, Christopher J. Hart, Claudia Angelique Rademaker, Ikang Fawzi, H.I.M. Damsyik, Joseph P. McGlynn, Adam Jagwani, Eddy Gunawan', null, 'The spirit of an ancient evil queen possesses the body of a young anthropological student, who then goes on a murderous rampage.', 'The spirit of an ancient evil queen possesses the body of a young anthropological student, who then goes on a murderous rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwOK1GHK8KRgiWhfBkEnQKPLgEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61904'),
  ('742768065157339926', 'Lady Usher', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'George Adams, Jeff Dubray', 'George Adams', 'Theresa Santiago, Billie D. Merritt, John Tupy, John Ferguson, Michael Gibbons, Allyson Cristofaro, Peter Anthony Seay, Kim Titus', 'R', 'An updated re-telling based in the Gothic South with the Usher Family, led by Mother. The family has been cursed by madness, unrequited love and when Roderick comes home with his girlfriend Morgan, it spells the beginning of the end as her sister Madeline will stop at nothing to prevent their marriage as Morgan fights to take Roderick away from the madness that is the House of Usher.', 'An updated re-telling based in the Gothic South with the Usher Family, led by Mother. The family has been cursed by madness, unrequited love and when Roderick comes home with his girlfriend Morgan, it spells the beginning of the end as her sister Madeline will stop at nothing to prevent their marriage as Morgan fights to take Roderick away from the madness that is the House of Usher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99yWXiMWoVFriv4Gyulc6cngOAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750587'),
  ('749422138093109540', 'Lady Vengeance', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Chung-hoon, Seok Min-u', 'Chung Seo-kyung', 'Lee Young-ae, Choi Min-sik, Kwon Yea-young, Kim Si-hoo, Nam Il-woo, Kim Byeong-ok, Oh Dal-su, Lee Seung-shin', 'R', 'Released after being wrongfully convicted and imprisoned for 13 years, a woman begins executing her elaborate plan of retribution.', 'Released after being wrongfully convicted and imprisoned for 13 years, a woman begins executing her elaborate plan of retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Oy3iLMqD79us2iAUD6fKqWebYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4550'),
  ('954812241258893571', 'Lady Whirlwind', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Huang Feng, Huang Pa-Ching, Danny Lee Yau-Tong', 'Wa Toi-Chung', 'Angela Mao Ying, Chang Yi, Pai Ying, Oh Kyung-ah, Liu Ah-Na, Chin Yuet-Sang, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Kim Nam-il', 'R', 'A young woman determines to help a man who is being pursued by gangsters, so that she would have the pleasure of killing him herself as revenge for causing the death of her sister.', 'A young woman determines to help a man who is being pursued by gangsters, so that she would have the pleasure of killing him herself as revenge for causing the death of her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6KdF2gEJvj3ECo9sTNH6nX1p9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90071'),
  ('190683037811857689', 'Lady Windermere''s Fan', 1925, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ernst Lubitsch, George Hippard, Ernst Laemmle', null, 'Ronald Colman, May McAvoy, Bert Lytell, Irene Rich, Edward Martindel, Carrie Daumery', null, 'A society woman believes her husband is having an affair, a misconception which may have dire personal consequences for all involved.', 'A society woman believes her husband is having an affair, a misconception which may have dire personal consequences for all involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpDPAhrWuLiF28KMwDhYAj5ofTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121379'),
  ('1072780527417330845', 'Lady with the Dog', 1960, 'Romance, Drama', 'Iosif Kheifits, Dmitri Meskhiyev, Andrey Moskvin', 'Iosif Kheifits', 'Iya Savvina, Aleksey Batalov, Nina Alisova, Pantelejmon Krymov, Yuri Medvedev, Pavel Pervushin, Lev Stepanov, Zinaida Dorogova', null, 'On holiday in Yalta, Muscovite banker Dimitri Gurov contrives to meet a young woman who walks her dog. She’s Anna Sergeyevna, trapped in a loveless marriage to a lackey. He’s unhappy in an arranged marriage. With neither spouse at hand, Dimitri and Anna begin an affair. After a short time, she returns to Saratov, he to Moscow, believing it’s good-by forever. All winter he is miserable, enervated, distracted by tristesse. In desperation, he contrives to go to Saratov, surprising her at a concert. Fearing discovery in her home town, she promises to come to Moscow. Will they cast aside reputation to live together, or will theirs be an affair of infrequent encounters in hotel rooms?', 'On holiday in Yalta, Muscovite banker Dimitri Gurov contrives to meet a young woman who walks her dog. She’s Anna Sergeyevna, trapped in a loveless marriage to a lackey. He’s unhappy in an arranged marriage. With neither spouse at hand, Dimitri and Anna begin an affair. After a short time, she returns to Saratov, he to Moscow, believing it’s good-by forever. All winter he is miserable, enervated, distracted by tristesse. In desperation, he contrives to go to Saratov, surprising her at a concert. Fearing discovery in her home town, she promises to come to Moscow. Will they cast aside reputation to live together, or will theirs be an affair of infrequent encounters in hotel rooms?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1B3lRTxrbMOD9lCx3Xf2CLQxzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38831'),
