  ('392582695483649941', 'Lady, Stay Dead', 1981, 'Horror', 'Eddie Prylinski, Ray Henman, Terry Bourke', 'Terry Bourke', 'Chard Hayward, Louise Howitt, Deborah Coulls, Roger Ward, Les Foxcroft, James Elliott, Brian Hinzlewood, George Murray', null, 'A young woman is looking after her sister''s house, unaware that her sister and neighbor have been murdered by their handyman who also happens to be a serial killer.', 'A young woman is looking after her sister''s house, unaware that her sister and neighbor have been murdered by their handyman who also happens to be a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDb7sZzjAeqc2Jng28WkCq6Fx3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84991'),
  ('403446670377801463', 'Ladybird Ladybird', 1994, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd', 'Rona Munro', 'Crissy Rock, Vladimir Vega, Sandie Lavelle, Mauricio Venegas, Ray Winstone, Clare Perkins, Jason Stracey, Luke Brown', null, 'Maggie has had four children, by four different fathers, removed by social services because of a previous violent relationship. When she meets Jorge, a gentle Latin American refugee, she gradually sees her chance for happiness, but her history still haunts her.', 'Maggie has had four children, by four different fathers, removed by social services because of a previous violent relationship. When she meets Jorge, a gentle Latin American refugee, she gradually sees her chance for happiness, but her history still haunts her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91KSK1xKdVEIDASKRo9ahBFCtM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49980'),
  ('142276590283471923', 'Ladybug Ladybug', 1963, 'Drama', 'Frank Perry, Tony LaMarca, Leonard Hirschfield', 'Eleanor Perry', 'Jane Connell, William Daniels, James Frawley, Richard Hamilton, Kathryn Hays, Jane Hoffman, Elena Karam, Judith Lowry', null, 'The teachers and students of a countryside elementary school are thrown into a panic when an air raid siren goes off, warning them of a imminent nuclear attack.', 'The teachers and students of a countryside elementary school are thrown into a panic when an air raid siren goes off, warning them of a imminent nuclear attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OBTSlJE2VJZOa25BdRevFCzaPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85510'),
  ('1127669698498725374', 'Ladybugs', 1992, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Sidney J. Furie, Dan Burstall, James M. Freitag', 'Curtis Burch', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Jackée Harry, Jonathan Brandis, Ilene Graff, Vinessa Shaw, Tom Parks, Jeannetta Arnette, Nancy Parsons', 'PG-13', 'To climb the corporate ladder to success, a businessman agrees to coach his company''s all-girl soccer team with the help of his secret weapon: his fiancee''s son.', 'To climb the corporate ladder to success, a businessman agrees to coach his company''s all-girl soccer team with the help of his secret weapon: his fiancee''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC0DmdJu7rHaqYjyXeo8GLLJ2Oa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19087'),
  ('401285192408403329', 'Ladygrey', 2015, 'Drama', 'Alain Choquart, Nigel Bluck', 'Alain Choquart, Laurence Coriat', 'Peter Sarsgaard, Jérémie Renier, Emily Mortimer, Claude Rich, Liam Cunningham, Sibongile Mlambo, Clare Marshall, Jude Foley', null, 'Estelle fights to maintain her sense of self while sleeping with Angus for money.', 'Estelle fights to maintain her sense of self while sleeping with Angus for money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUiYiid5DR1PkAqtkG3Fm3aTIR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335663'),
  ('739602249220473490', 'Ladyhawke', 1985, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Richard Donner, Vittorio Storaro, Luciano Sacripanti', 'Edward Khmara, David Webb Peoples, Tom Mankiewicz', 'Matthew Broderick, Rutger Hauer, Michelle Pfeiffer, Alfred Molina, John Wood, Leo McKern, Ken Hutchison, Giancarlo Prete', 'PG-13', 'Captain Etienne Navarre is a man on whose shoulders lies a cruel curse. Punished for loving each other, Navarre must become a wolf by night whilst his lover, Lady Isabeau, takes the form of a hawk by day. Together, with the thief Philippe Gaston, they must try to overthrow the corrupt Bishop and in doing so break the spell.', 'Captain Etienne Navarre is a man on whose shoulders lies a cruel curse. Punished for loving each other, Navarre must become a wolf by night whilst his lover, Lady Isabeau, takes the form of a hawk by day. Together, with the thief Philippe Gaston, they must try to overthrow the corrupt Bishop and in doing so break the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJA2Fhw2uBMiVFdBde2kH7kZ2gw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526'),
  ('729610323563518294', 'Laerte-se', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Adrian Teijido, Lygia Barbosa da Silva, Eliane Brum', 'Raphael Scire', 'Laerte Coutinho, Eliane Brum, Rita Lee, Glamour Garcia, Angeli', null, 'In this film, Laerte conjugates the body in the feminine, and scrutinizes concepts and prejudices. Not in search of an identity, but in search of un-identities. Laerte creates and sends creatures to face reality in the fictional world of comic strips as a vanguard of the self. And, on the streets, the one who becomes the fiction of a real character. Laerte, of all the bodies, and of none, complicates all binaries. In following Laerte, this documentary chooses to clothe the nudity beyond the skin we inhabit.', 'In this film, Laerte conjugates the body in the feminine, and scrutinizes concepts and prejudices. Not in search of an identity, but in search of un-identities. Laerte creates and sends creatures to face reality in the fictional world of comic strips as a vanguard of the self. And, on the streets, the one who becomes the fiction of a real character. Laerte, of all the bodies, and of none, complicates all binaries. In following Laerte, this documentary chooses to clothe the nudity beyond the skin we inhabit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pefmBwp0xuHdUXbJEPHAwQjHjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450628'),
  ('600831155290555606', 'Lafangey Parindey', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Pradeep Sarkar, Natarajan Subramaniam', 'Gopi Puthran', 'Neil Nitin Mukesh, Deepika Padukone, Kay Kay Menon, Piyush Mishra, Namit Das, Manish Choudhary, Ameya Pandya, Pankaj Jha', null, 'The path of a street fighter and a dancer on skates, who are in love, is paved by friendship, grit and hope.', 'The path of a street fighter and a dancer on skates, who are in love, is paved by friendship, grit and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJurtDFPuOaSYUJQvmvwGxL2ntP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44613'),
  ('449412939659019710', 'Lafayette Escadrille', 1958, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'William H. Clothier, George Vieira, William A. Wellman', 'Albert Sidney Fleischman', 'Tab Hunter, Etchika Choureau, Marcel Dalio, David Janssen, Paul Fix, Veola Vonn, Will Hutchins, Clint Eastwood', 'NR', 'A hotshot young flyer falls for a French prostitute during World War I.', 'A hotshot young flyer falls for a French prostitute during World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwFd9wnPmbY3VcjCllGf4ywPlEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130134'),
  ('455197032685726364', 'Lagaan: Once Upon a Time in India', 2001, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, Urvashi Chugani', 'Ashutosh Gowariker', 'Aamir Khan, Gracy Singh, Rachel Shelley, Paul Blackthorne, Suhasini Mulay, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Raghubir Yadav, Rajesh Vivek', 'PG', 'The year is 1893 and India is under British occupation. In a small village, the tyrannical Captain Russell has imposed an unprecedented land tax on its citizens. Outraged, Bhuvan, a rebellious farmer, rallies the villagers to publicly oppose the tax. Russell offers a novel way to settle the dispute: he challenges Bhuvan and his men to a game of cricket, a sport completely foreign to India. If Bhuvan and his men can defeat Russell''s team, the tax will be repealed.', 'The year is 1893 and India is under British occupation. In a small village, the tyrannical Captain Russell has imposed an unprecedented land tax on its citizens. Outraged, Bhuvan, a rebellious farmer, rallies the villagers to publicly oppose the tax. Russell offers a novel way to settle the dispute: he challenges Bhuvan and his men to a game of cricket, a sport completely foreign to India. If Bhuvan and his men can defeat Russell''s team, the tax will be repealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNX9lFRAFeNLNRIXdqZK9gYrYKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19666'),
  ('108190898208869351', 'Lagan Laagii Re', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Saandeep Patel, Tapan Vyas', 'Mitai Shukla, Nehal Bakshi', 'Niren Bhatt, Aarohi Patel, Malhar Thakar, Tatsat Munshi', null, 'In a world full of love stories, two friends are on a mission to stop one.', 'In a world full of love stories, two friends are on a mission to stop one.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Ff3pzYlkaS4QWQT2ZmR1vWM97piq.jpg', 'plex:movie:lagan-laagii-re'),
  ('490515214923082025', 'Lage Raho Munna Bhai', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rajkumar Hirani, C.K. Muraleedharan', 'Rajkumar Hirani, Abhijat Joshi', 'Sanjay Dutt, Arshad Warsi, Vidya Balan, Boman Irani, Dilip Prabhavalkar, Dia Mirza, Supriya Shukla, Kulbhushan Kharbanda', 'PG-13', 'Lovable goon Munna falls for a morning radio host by the name of Jahnvi, who also runs an elders'' home which an unscrupulous builder seeks to attain. In order to gain Jahnvi’s attention, he cheats his way to winning a Mahatma Gandhi radio quiz. When Jahnvi consequently expresses interest in Munna, he and his best friend Circuit attempt to keep up the facade.', 'Lovable goon Munna falls for a morning radio host by the name of Jahnvi, who also runs an elders'' home which an unscrupulous builder seeks to attain. In order to gain Jahnvi’s attention, he cheats his way to winning a Mahatma Gandhi radio quiz. When Jahnvi consequently expresses interest in Munna, he and his best friend Circuit attempt to keep up the facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgSn1tXDstMXSHJYkSibKkHqW8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21461'),
  ('806111233028074029', 'Lagerfeld Confidential', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Rodolphe Marconi', null, 'Karl Lagerfeld, Nicole Kidman, Brad Kroenig, Princess Caroline of Monaco, Sébastien Jondeau, Lily Donaldson, Emmanuelle Alt, Virginie Viard', null, 'For the first time Karl Lagerfeld has agreed to let someone create an artwork on his every day life and to trust in the director. Until today there is no authorised biography existing and the memories who Karl Lagerfeld would compose stay perfectly confidential. After three years of work, and over three hundred hours of footage, Rodolphe Marconi discloses the daily life of the star through his personal lens as a filmmaker.', 'For the first time Karl Lagerfeld has agreed to let someone create an artwork on his every day life and to trust in the director. Until today there is no authorised biography existing and the memories who Karl Lagerfeld would compose stay perfectly confidential. After three years of work, and over three hundred hours of footage, Rodolphe Marconi discloses the daily life of the star through his personal lens as a filmmaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6d4gvX9CmxzrimTMdl42uw65rE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36718'),
  ('551039273834427734', 'Laggam Time', 2026, null, 'Prajoth K Vennam', 'Prajoth K Vennam', 'Srinivas Bhogireddy, Navya Chityala, Praneeth Reddy Kallem, Mirchi Kiran, Kiran Macha', null, 'Amid the chaos of a vibrant Telugu wedding, Surya races against Laggam Time to confess his love to the bride-to-be, only to trigger a groom''s disappearance that sends the entire celebration into comic mayhem.', 'Amid the chaos of a vibrant Telugu wedding, Surya races against Laggam Time to confess his love to the bride-to-be, only to trigger a groom''s disappearance that sends the entire celebration into comic mayhem.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNzI2MjBhZmEtZDcwMy00NWZhLWE0NzAtZjU0ZDI2N2VlMzRiXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:laggam-time'),
  ('955097643769956826', 'Laggies', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Benjamin Kasulke, Lynn Shelton', 'Andrea Seigel', 'Keira Knightley, Chloë Grace Moretz, Sam Rockwell, Kaitlyn Dever, Ellie Kemper, Mark Webber, Jeff Garlin, Daniel Zovatto', 'R', 'Overeducated and underemployed, 28 year old Megan is in the throes of a quarterlife crisis. Squarely into adulthood with no career prospects, no particular motivation to think about her future and no one to relate to, Megan is comfortable lagging a few steps behind - while her friends check off milestones and celebrate their new grown-up status. When her high-school sweetheart proposes, Megan panics and- given an unexpected opportunity to escape for a week - hides out in the home of her new friend, 16-year old Annika and Annika''s world-weary single dad Craig.', 'Overeducated and underemployed, 28 year old Megan is in the throes of a quarterlife crisis. Squarely into adulthood with no career prospects, no particular motivation to think about her future and no one to relate to, Megan is comfortable lagging a few steps behind - while her friends check off milestones and celebrate their new grown-up status. When her high-school sweetheart proposes, Megan panics and- given an unexpected opportunity to escape for a week - hides out in the home of her new friend, 16-year old Annika and Annika''s world-weary single dad Craig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL2ccASO8O6v92gGTaaY5gOCAI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244264'),
  ('799118004746464909', 'Lagnacha Shot', 2026, 'Drama', 'Akshay Gore', 'Akshay Gore', 'Abhijit Amkar, Jayesh Shivaji Bhor, Abhijeet Chavan', null, 'Two runaway brides, Abhi and Kriti, meet by chance on a train while fleeing unwanted marriages. Their journey transforms from conflict to connection as they discover whether escape brings true freedom.', 'Two runaway brides, Abhi and Kriti, meet by chance on a train while fleeing unwanted marriages. Their journey transforms from conflict to connection as they discover whether escape brings true freedom.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fg9HZNWceR17jXgHmgDubmJlH7Br.jpg', 'plex:movie:lagnacha-shot'),
  ('843165954609264800', 'Lágrimas de mi barrio', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rubén Galindo', 'Rubén Galindo', 'Cornelio Reyna, Roberto ''El Flaco'' Guzmán, Antonio Espino ''Clavillazo'', Ana Martín, Rafael Inclán, Lucy Tovar, Aurora Alonso ''La Pantera'', José L. Murillo', null, 'A working-class man, left to raise his son after his wife’s death, makes a living as a street vendor. When he buys a set of car rims, he is wrongfully accused of dealing in stolen parts—and sentenced to a year behind bars.', 'A working-class man, left to raise his son after his wife’s death, makes a living as a street vendor. When he buys a set of car rims, he is wrongfully accused of dealing in stolen parts—and sentenced to a year behind bars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hW8K9Gz6JeCH6m5nWwdhcdM3aHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466923'),
