  ('11387503082532473', 'Lajja', 2001, 'Drama', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', null, 'Rekha, Anil Kapoor, Jackie Shroff, Madhuri Dixit, Ajay Devgn, Manisha Koirala, Mahima Chaudhry, Gulshan Grover', null, 'Vaidehi (Manisha Koirala) gets married to Raghuvir (Jackie Shroff), an NRI. Suffering the agony of an unhappy marriage, she decides to run away from him when she learns that she is pregnant and he wants to take the child away from her. In her pursuit for freedom, she meets Mythili (Mahima Chaudhury) a bride-to-be, Janaki (Madhuri Dixit) a theatre artist and Ramdulari (Rekha) a village midwife - all of whom are victims of male chauvinism. They however refuse to be put down and fight for their rights.', 'Vaidehi (Manisha Koirala) gets married to Raghuvir (Jackie Shroff), an NRI. Suffering the agony of an unhappy marriage, she decides to run away from him when she learns that she is pregnant and he wants to take the child away from her. In her pursuit for freedom, she meets Mythili (Mahima Chaudhury) a bride-to-be, Janaki (Madhuri Dixit) a theatre artist and Ramdulari (Rekha) a village midwife - all of whom are victims of male chauvinism. They however refuse to be put down and fight for their rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFvCS5h3TyixKaBintDoVjYGyVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56317'),
  ('818653994323175302', 'Lake Bodom', 2016, 'Horror', 'Taneli Mustonen, Daniel Lindholm, Imre Paabo', 'Taneli Mustonen, Aleksi Hyvärinen', 'Nelly Hirst-Gee, Mimosa Willamo, Mikael Gabriel, Santeri Helinheimo Mäntylä, Pirjo Lankinen, Ilkka Heiskanen, Sami Eerola, Otso Ahosola', null, 'Four friends are spending the night at Lake Bodom, where unsolved murders took place many years ago. The young men are determined to venture into the dense forest to solve the mystery.', 'Four friends are spending the night at Lake Bodom, where unsolved murders took place many years ago. The young men are determined to venture into the dense forest to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PZThccJqH2rlkIqaiNWfZO3q2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369202'),
  ('506207734617469075', 'Lake Consequence', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rafael Eisenman, Harris Savides, Roee Sharon Peled', 'Henry Cobbold, Melanie Finn, Zalman King', 'Joan Severance, Christi Allen, Andria Litto, May Karasun, Billy Zane, Whip Hubley, Courtland Mead, Dan Reed', 'R', 'A repressed housewife is plunged into erotic ecstasy by the arrival of a handsome groundskeeper. At a remote lake, she is encouraged by the groundskeeper and his lover to explore her deepest sexual desires.', 'A repressed housewife is plunged into erotic ecstasy by the arrival of a handsome groundskeeper. At a remote lake, she is encouraged by the groundskeeper and his lover to explore her deepest sexual desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mU6CwKO7QwxRlutmUSIS4hjJJUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37333'),
  ('107331892459985395', 'Lake Dead', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'George Bessudo', 'Daniel P. Coughlin', 'Kelsey Crane, Kelsey Wedeen, Vanessa Viola, Tara Gerard, Alex A. Quinn, James Devoti, Lydia Hyslop, Malea Rose', 'R', 'Three sisters and a group of their friends take a trip to the home of the recently deceased grandfather -- who died a particularly grisly death -- to learn more about the promise of an inheritance, only to encounter a family of psychos who have taken up residence in the old man''s cabin.', 'Three sisters and a group of their friends take a trip to the home of the recently deceased grandfather -- who died a particularly grisly death -- to learn more about the promise of an inheritance, only to encounter a family of psychos who have taken up residence in the old man''s cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghGlBeist58eJQkzGUZOPiQQqC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14025'),
  ('566518965099955884', 'Lake Eerie', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chris Majors', 'Meredith Majors', 'Lance Henriksen, Marilyn Ghigliotti, Betsy Baker, Allen Sarven, Meredith Majors, Jason K. Wixom, Anne Leigh Cooper, Chris Majors', 'NR', 'A young widow moves into an old house on Lake Erie to recover from the sudden loss of her husband; however, she soon discovers a dark secret and that she is not alone.', 'A young widow moves into an old house on Lake Erie to recover from the sudden loss of her husband; however, she soon discovers a dark secret and that she is not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1jF5MyaYOV6Is1FSGYj2cnM9Vg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316268'),
  ('39807453749386949', 'Lake Fear', 2014, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Michael Crum', 'Gerald Crum', 'Jessica Willis, Shanon Snedden, Joshua Winch, Jori Gill, Taylor LeeAnn Graham, Carly Capra, Gerald Crum, Michael Crum', null, 'Four girls go to a cabin in the woods, which is inhabited by evil. This cabin then ensnares them in a labyrinth of macabre as they must battle their way out.', 'Four girls go to a cabin in the woods, which is inhabited by evil. This cabin then ensnares them in a labyrinth of macabre as they must battle their way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXchehxiyWvKrV8PzjDKYjDwLMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356690'),
  ('1027927968155272833', 'Lake George', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Jeffrey Reiner, Tod Campbell, Cleta Elaine Ellington', 'Jeffrey Reiner', 'Shea Whigham, Carrie Coon, Max Casella, Glenn Fleshler, Derek Phillips, Ashley Fink, Troy Metcalf, Joey Oglesby', 'NR', 'Newly released from prison, a white-collar criminal, used to dealing with numbers, is tasked with one last job by his boss: kill the boss’ girlfriend before she talks.', 'Newly released from prison, a white-collar criminal, used to dealing with numbers, is tasked with one last job by his boss: kill the boss’ girlfriend before she talks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nqwvs1DORz65GtV7MeNBfqBxQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275998'),
  ('543999317156150735', 'Lake Jesup: Bonecrusher''s Revenge', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy, Adventure', 'Michael Houston King', 'Michael Houston King', 'Derek Russo, Jeff Benninghofen, Michael Houston King, Essex O''Brien, Sarah Voigt, Danny Nucci', null, 'In 2003, Lake Jesup became the stage for a real-life horror story, as a monstrous alligator escaped from captivity and began a reign of terror. As the body count rose, a desperate hunt ensued to stop the creature.', 'In 2003, Lake Jesup became the stage for a real-life horror story, as a monstrous alligator escaped from captivity and began a reign of terror. As the body count rose, a desperate hunt ensued to stop the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Z1TgGXS1MD4DDfIkBNloM43vvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1381216'),
  ('545768872560026532', 'Lake Mungo', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joel Anderson, Dina Mann, Iain Pirret', 'Joel Anderson', 'Rosie Traynor, David Pledger, Martin Sharpe, Talia Zucker, Tania Lentini, Cameron Strachan, Judith Roberts, Robin Cuming', 'R', 'After 16-year-old Alice Palmer drowns at a local dam, her family experiences a series of strange, inexplicable events centered in and around their home. Unsettled, the Palmers seek the help of a psychic and parapsychologist, who discovers that Alice led a secret, double life. At Lake Mungo, Alice''s secret past emerges.', 'After 16-year-old Alice Palmer drowns at a local dam, her family experiences a series of strange, inexplicable events centered in and around their home. Unsettled, the Palmers seek the help of a psychic and parapsychologist, who discovers that Alice led a secret, double life. At Lake Mungo, Alice''s secret past emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0zCELYfBfSv8TOGC13buABVN53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27374'),
  ('1095733087937723680', 'Lake of Dracula', 1971, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michio Yamamoto, Yoshisuke Kawasaki, Rokurô Nishigaki', 'Masaru Takesue, Ei Ogawa', 'Midori Fujita, Choei Takahashi, Sanae Emi, Shin Kishida, Tatsuo Matsushita, Yasuzō Ogawa, Wataru Ōmae, Mika Katsuragi', null, 'A young girl suffers a terrifying nightmare of a vampire with blazing golden eyes. Eighteen years later, it is revealed to be a hellish prophecy when a strange package containing an empty coffin mysteriously turns up at a nearby lake.', 'A young girl suffers a terrifying nightmare of a vampire with blazing golden eyes. Eighteen years later, it is revealed to be a hellish prophecy when a strange package containing an empty coffin mysteriously turns up at a nearby lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFJ6jAfO7j9mc6CzDt8HOOjRZYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108737'),
  ('986797943228633704', 'Lake of Fire', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Tony Kaye', 'Tony Kaye', 'Noam Chomsky, Flip Benham, Bill Baird', null, 'An unflinching look at the how the battle over abortion rights has played out in the United States over the last 15 years.', 'An unflinching look at the how the battle over abortion rights has played out in the United States over the last 15 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFdUv0neGCpaYLRJN45mnpc0pdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44260'),
  ('753280301248015192', 'Lake of the Dead', 1958, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kåre Bergstrøm, Ragnar Sørensen', 'Kåre Bergstrøm', 'André Bjerke, Bjørg Engh, Henki Kolstad, Per Lillo-Stenberg, Erling Lindahl, Henny Moan, Georg Richter, Øyvind Øyen', null, 'A group of friends travel to a cabin in the Norwegian forest. It''s a rumour that at night a crazy man can be heard screaming at a lake nearby the cabin.', 'A group of friends travel to a cabin in the Norwegian forest. It''s a rumour that at night a crazy man can be heard screaming at a lake nearby the cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79ot6SgnQA3NxDthxsV7qUaLDSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36792'),
  ('255741518935382450', 'Lake Placid', 1999, 'Horror, Comedy, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Steve Miner, Daryn Okada, Mark Cotone', 'David E. Kelley', 'Bill Pullman, Bridget Fonda, Oliver Platt, Brendan Gleeson, Betty White, David James Lewis, Tim Dixon, Natassia Malthe', 'R', 'When a man is eaten alive by an unknown creature, the local Game Warden teams up with a paleontologist from New York to find the beast. Add to the mix an eccentric philanthropist with a penchant for "Crocs", and here we go! This quiet, remote lake is suddenly the focus of an intense search for a crocodile with a taste for live animals...and people!', 'When a man is eaten alive by an unknown creature, the local Game Warden teams up with a paleontologist from New York to find the beast. Add to the mix an eccentric philanthropist with a penchant for "Crocs", and here we go! This quiet, remote lake is suddenly the focus of an intense search for a crocodile with a taste for live animals...and people!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEszakCP8j9E9S0UPLfEa3Cad3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9825'),
  ('215942010512262402', 'Lake Placid 2', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Flores, Lorenzo Senatore, Todor Chapkanov', 'Todd Hurvitz, Howie Miller', 'John Schneider, Sam McMurray, Sarah Lafleur, Chad Michael Collins, Alicia Ziegler, Joe Holt, Ian Reed Kesler, Justin Urich', 'R', 'Man-eating crocodiles return to the lake as two males and one aggressive female crocodile, which is protecting her nest, wreak havoc on the locals.', 'Man-eating crocodiles return to the lake as two males and one aggressive female crocodile, which is protecting her nest, wreak havoc on the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XJlJZClpMi48PB51NXt5ZWm4Vr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17038'),
  ('582139907125377399', 'Lake Placid 3', 2010, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Anton Bakarski, Griff Furst, Mariana Vodenicharova', 'David Reed', 'Colin Ferguson, Yancy Butler, Kirsty Mitchell, Kacey Barnfield, Michael Ironside, Mark Evans, Nils Hognestad, Bianca Ilich', 'R', 'A game warden moves his family to Lake Placid, once the site of deadly crocodile attacks. Locals assure him the crocs are gone, but his mischievous young son finds a few baby crocs and begins feeding them. They quickly grow into very big adults and start attacking the game warden''s family and nearby town.', 'A game warden moves his family to Lake Placid, once the site of deadly crocodile attacks. Locals assure him the crocs are gone, but his mischievous young son finds a few baby crocs and begins feeding them. They quickly grow into very big adults and start attacking the game warden''s family and nearby town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHH3fy5ZVs4nrzNLZYIe1p2PJSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44037'),
  ('791468284005029237', 'Lake Placid vs. Anaconda', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'A.B. Stone, Ivo Peitchev, Ivan Mitov', 'Berkeley Anderson', 'Yancy Butler, Corin Nemec, Skye Lourie, Robert Englund, Annabel Wright, Oliver Walker, Laura Dale, Ali Eagle', 'R', 'A giant alligator goes head to head with a giant Anaconda. The town sheriff must find a way to destroy the two monsters before they kill the whole town.', 'A giant alligator goes head to head with a giant Anaconda. The town sheriff must find a way to destroy the two monsters before they kill the whole town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niqnnjhw5W4J66Psn6GFGreLwes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336560'),
  ('547868243925702429', 'Lake Placid: Legacy', 2018, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Darrell James Roodt, Justin van der Merwe, Antony Stone', 'Jonathan Walker', 'Katherine Barrell, Tim Rozon, Luke Newton, Craig Stein, Greg Kriek, Joe Pantoliano, Sai Bennett, Maxim Baldry', 'R', 'A group of young explorers discover a secret area hidden from all maps and GPS devices. When they reach the center of the lake, they discover an abandoned facility that houses one of the largest, and deadliest apex-predators known to man.', 'A group of young explorers discover a secret area hidden from all maps and GPS devices. When they reach the center of the lake, they discover an abandoned facility that houses one of the largest, and deadliest apex-predators known to man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBZXrR5zlGdRAXuugtUQo9D4dCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520466'),
  ('226829061999658411', 'Lake Placid: The Final Chapter', 2013, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Don Michael Paul, Martin Chichov, Mariana Vodenicharova', 'David Reed', 'Yancy Butler, Robert Englund, Daniel Black, Elisabeth Röhm, Caroline Ford, Paul Nicholls, Poppy Lee Friar, Benedict Smith', null, 'Black Lake is now a crocodile sanctuary, surrounded by an electric fence. When the fence is left open, a high-school bus unknowingly enters the park. It''s up to Reba and the Sheriff to save the kids from becoming crocodile food.', 'Black Lake is now a crocodile sanctuary, surrounded by an electric fence. When the fence is left open, a high-school bus unknowingly enters the park. It''s up to Reba and the Sheriff to save the kids from becoming crocodile food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiKZELy3QivFVVSuHOAJtYNAwaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135309'),
  ('64421573727216687', 'Lake Tahoe', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fernando Eimbcke, Alexis Zabé', 'Fernando Eimbcke, Paula Markovitch', 'Diego Cataño, Héctor Herrera, Daniela Valentine, Juan Carlos Lara, Yemil Sefani, Olda López, Mariana Elizondo, Joshua Habid', null, 'After crashing the family car, Juan encounters a cast of eccentric and fantastic characters who each try to help. But what begins as a mundane adventure quickly becomes a transformative journey exploring issues of death, family, love and sex.', 'After crashing the family car, Juan encounters a cast of eccentric and fantastic characters who each try to help. But what begins as a mundane adventure quickly becomes a transformative journey exploring issues of death, family, love and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmnvrgHZE6CKDAJMVI5nGsBKNME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65726'),
  ('708620885016059066', 'Lake Titicaca', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Bill Roberts', null, 'Clarence Nash, Fred Shields', 'PG', 'Donald is visiting South America, where he is first overcome by altitude sickness. He spends some time in the picturesque market. Then he takes a llama up into the mountains, with exciting results.', 'Donald is visiting South America, where he is first overcome by altitude sickness. He spends some time in the picturesque market. Then he takes a llama up into the mountains, with exciting results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoMCZhKhEo3cvci7h64AVQ7KeNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222597'),
  ('553693832517435706', 'Lakeview Terrace', 2008, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Neil LaBute, Donald Murphy, Peter Dress', 'Howard Korder, David Loughery', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Patrick Wilson, Kerry Washington, Ron Glass, Justin Chambers, Jay Hernandez, Regine Nehy, Jaishon Fisher', 'PG-13', 'A young interracial couple has just moved into their California dream home when they become the target of their next-door neighbor, who disapproves of their relationship. A tightly wound LAPD officer has appointed himself the watchdog of the neighborhood. His nightly foot patrols and overly watchful eyes bring comfort to some, but he becomes increasingly aggressive to the newlyweds. These persistent intrusions into their lives cause the couple to fight back.', 'A young interracial couple has just moved into their California dream home when they become the target of their next-door neighbor, who disapproves of their relationship. A tightly wound LAPD officer has appointed himself the watchdog of the neighborhood. His nightly foot patrols and overly watchful eyes bring comfort to some, but he becomes increasingly aggressive to the newlyweds. These persistent intrusions into their lives cause the couple to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1kqp2hALf8Gd03vDACnR0EtFWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13279'),
  ('696740928006502739', 'Lakki... The Boy Who Could Fly', 1992, 'Drama', 'Svend Wam', 'Svend Wam', 'Anders Borchgrevink, Bjørn Skagestad, Gabriel Paaske, Jorunn Kjellsby, Nina Gunke, Jan Grønli, Øyvin Bang Berven, Stian Bonnevie Arntzen', null, 'Surreal tale of a 14 year-old boy who dreams of escaping the loneliness from an unhappy home &amp; sexual abuse (from his mother''s boyfriend who is also his school swimming coach). One day his back mysteriously sprouts feathers and he can metaphorically fly away from it all.', 'Surreal tale of a 14 year-old boy who dreams of escaping the loneliness from an unhappy home &amp; sexual abuse (from his mother''s boyfriend who is also his school swimming coach). One day his back mysteriously sprouts feathers and he can metaphorically fly away from it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjoU2hinepLtQMTDxW8iwQe00T9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185034'),
  ('1004272909441320234', 'Lakshya', 2004, 'War, Action, Drama, Romance', 'Farhan Akhtar, Vic Armstrong, Chris Anderson', 'Javed Akhtar', 'Hrithik Roshan, Preity Zinta, Amitabh Bachchan, Om Puri, Boman Irani, Sushant Singh, Raj Zutshi, Ranvir Shorey', null, 'An aimless, jobless, irresponsible grown man joins the army and matures into a battlefield hero.', 'An aimless, jobless, irresponsible grown man joins the army and matures into a battlefield hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctB8RWoK2LHn5skqN4eUWVSvpyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21175'),
  ('504313792995866462', 'Lal Baadshah', 1999, 'Action, Drama', 'K. C. Bokadia', null, 'Amitabh Bachchan, Manisha Koirala, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Shakti Kapoor, Raghuvaran, Mukesh Rishi, Nirupa Roy, Amrish Puri', null, 'A man who got separated from his biological parents at birth, grows up to become the voice of the people. His caring nature for others, eventually leads him on a dangerous journey to uncover the truth about who his real parents are.', 'A man who got separated from his biological parents at birth, grows up to become the voice of the people. His caring nature for others, eventually leads him on a dangerous journey to uncover the truth about who his real parents are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PKMyhYqeuKifjfUfha18wtp0uF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458939'),
  ('365083074104303945', 'Lala Pipo: A Lot of People', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Masayuki Miyano, Katsumi Nojiri, Atsushi Ozawa', 'Tetsuya Nakashima', 'Yuri Nakamura, Hiroki Narimiya, Saori Hara, Sayuki Matsumoto, Tomoko Murakami, Sarutoki Minagawa, Takashi Yoshimura, Mari Hamada', null, 'Adapted from a sex-stuffed cult novel, LALAPIPO (a play on the phrase “A Lot of People”) follows divergent seedy strands of sexual and narrative spaghetti through the sticky Tokyo night. There’s a chubby freelance writer who’s so obsessed with masturbating to the sound of his upstairs neighbors going at it that he forgets to deal with his own love life and when he finally does have sex he is immediately filled with self-loathing. The upstairs neighbor’s story then splits off like an amoeba: she’s an office lady seduced by a “talent scout” who is falling down the sex industry ladder, moving from hostess, to massage girl, to private karaoke attendant. The talent scout’s story then splits off and runs in its own direction, revealing the sorry state of this young pimp’s soul. From there, the movie takes more and more time to consider the lives of more and more characters until the entire Japanese sex industry is filled with the wailing of lost souls.', 'Adapted from a sex-stuffed cult novel, LALAPIPO (a play on the phrase “A Lot of People”) follows divergent seedy strands of sexual and narrative spaghetti through the sticky Tokyo night. There’s a chubby freelance writer who’s so obsessed with masturbating to the sound of his upstairs neighbors going at it that he forgets to deal with his own love life and when he finally does have sex he is immediately filled with self-loathing. The upstairs neighbor’s story then splits off like an amoeba: she’s an office lady seduced by a “talent scout” who is falling down the sex industry ladder, moving from hostess, to massage girl, to private karaoke attendant. The talent scout’s story then splits off and runs in its own direction, revealing the sorry state of this young pimp’s soul. From there, the movie takes more and more time to consider the lives of more and more characters until the entire Japanese sex industry is filled with the wailing of lost souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTS73GCMGntBeGgVaqL71HDROn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39025'),
  ('363919822653403759', 'Lamarca', 1994, 'Drama, History', 'Sérgio Rezende', 'Alfredo Oroz, Sérgio Rezende', 'Paulo Betti, Carla Camurati, José de Abreu, Deborah Evelyn, Eliezer de Almeida, Ernani Moraes, Roberto Bomtempo, Orlando Vieira', null, 'The real story of Carlos Lamarca, a captain who, during the military dictatorship in Brazil, deserted Brazilian Army and got involved in left-wing guerilla groups, becoming one of their most prominent leaders.', 'The real story of Carlos Lamarca, a captain who, during the military dictatorship in Brazil, deserted Brazilian Army and got involved in left-wing guerilla groups, becoming one of their most prominent leaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noo6PkWWG1RLcJa1xteXqA7N9A9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260987'),
  ('206930171752839372', 'Lamb', 1986, 'Drama', 'Colin Gregg, Michael Garfath', 'Bernard MacLaverty', 'Liam Neeson, Hugh O''Conor, Ian Bannen, Harry Towb, Frances Tomelty, Ian McElhinney, Ronan Wilmot, Denis Carey', null, 'Michael Lamb is a Father questioning his calling, in a Reform School in Ireland. When young epileptic runaway Eoin is sent to the school, the two recognise kindred spirits and escape to London together. With the police on their tail and the money running out however, Lamb is forced to make some terrible decisions.', 'Michael Lamb is a Father questioning his calling, in a Reform School in Ireland. When young epileptic runaway Eoin is sent to the school, the two recognise kindred spirits and escape to London together. With the police on their tail and the money running out however, Lamb is forced to make some terrible decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjAhrlGuaIQTgDG1HgZFKP7QyTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218606'),
  ('963421425392262272', 'Lamb', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ross Partridge, Nathan M. Miller, Drew Langer', 'Ross Partridge', 'Oona Laurence, Ross Partridge, Jess Weixler, Scoot McNairy, Lindsay Pulsipher, Joel Murray, Tom Bower, Jennifer Lafleur', 'R', 'Lamb, based on the novel by Bonnie Nadzam, traces the self-discovery of David Lamb in the weeks following the disintegration of his marriage and the death of his father. Hoping to regain some faith in his own goodness, he turns his attention to Tommie, an awkward and unpopular eleven-year-old girl. Lamb is convinced that he can help her avoid a destiny of apathy and emptiness, and takes Tommie for a road trip from Chicago to the Rockies, planning to initiate her into the beauty of the mountain wilderness. The journey shakes them in ways neither expects.', 'Lamb, based on the novel by Bonnie Nadzam, traces the self-discovery of David Lamb in the weeks following the disintegration of his marriage and the death of his father. Hoping to regain some faith in his own goodness, he turns his attention to Tommie, an awkward and unpopular eleven-year-old girl. Lamb is convinced that he can help her avoid a destiny of apathy and emptiness, and takes Tommie for a road trip from Chicago to the Rockies, planning to initiate her into the beauty of the mountain wilderness. The journey shakes them in ways neither expects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aj0pgKR4dWlRRb1Q05JGQtwxHbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324284'),
  ('414506223315104844', 'Lamb', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Eli Arenson, Valdimar Jóhannsson', 'Valdimar Jóhannsson, Sjón', 'Noomi Rapace, Hilmir Snær Guðnason, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Ester Bibi, Sigurður Elvar Viðarson, Theodór Ingi Ólafsson, Arnþruður Dögg Sigurðardóttir', 'R', 'An Icelandic couple live with their herd of sheep on a beautiful but remote farm. When they discover a mysterious newborn on their land, they decide to keep it and raise it as their own. This unexpected development and the prospects of a new family brings them much joy before ultimately destroying them.', 'An Icelandic couple live with their herd of sheep on a beautiful but remote farm. When they discover a mysterious newborn on their land, they decide to keep it and raise it as their own. This unexpected development and the prospects of a new family brings them much joy before ultimately destroying them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gP9yviboTGWGolqUZKIB1UkF1C2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788929'),
  ('320406645242205870', 'Lamb in the Down Right Corner', 1992, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Lembit Ulfsak, Ago Ruus, Leo Lätti', 'Lembit Ulfsak, Janno Põldma', 'Tõnu Kark, Margus Alver, Kaur Sinissaar, Dan Põldroos, Ain Lutsepp, Kalju Orro, Aarne Üksküla, Maria Klenskaja', null, 'A warm movie about two boys, who discover a secret of a painting that was considered to be lost. The adventures begin, when a boss of a bunch of criminals finds out about the painting.', 'A warm movie about two boys, who discover a secret of a painting that was considered to be lost. The adventures begin, when a boss of a bunch of criminals finds out about the painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pP1xoGY8GkOacj2wIgtCf1Ke95a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70179'),
  ('214712072357857932', 'Lambada', 1990, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Joel Silberg, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Joel Silberg, Sheldon Renan', 'Melora Hardin, J. Eddie Peck, Leticia Vasquez, Adolfo Quinones, Rita Maye Bland, Ricky Paull Goldin, Basil Hoffman, Dennis Burkley', 'PG-13', 'Kevin Laird is a Beverly Hills school teacher by day and a mystery man by night. Using his lambada dance moves to first earn the kid''s respect and acceptance, Kevin then teaches them academics. But when a jealous student exposes Kevin''s double life, his two worlds collide, threatening his job and reputation.', 'Kevin Laird is a Beverly Hills school teacher by day and a mystery man by night. Using his lambada dance moves to first earn the kid''s respect and acceptance, Kevin then teaches them academics. But when a jealous student exposes Kevin''s double life, his two worlds collide, threatening his job and reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvSbOvacS0gzykkfenuaqLEPoic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117269'),
  ('560151329397530470', 'Lambchops', 1929, 'Comedy, Music', 'Murray Roth', 'Al Boasberg, George Burns', 'George Burns, Gracie Allen', null, 'George and Gracie enter an elegant drawing room, looking everywhere for something. Turns out, they''re looking for the audience, and when George spots the camera, they start in on their patter. Gracie wants to convince George that she''s smart, not dizzy - it''s an uphill struggle of which she''s blissfully unaware. Midway through, they break into song: "Do You Believe Me?" It includes a little bit of hoofing as the chatting continues. They end on a story Gracie whispers into George''s ear.', 'George and Gracie enter an elegant drawing room, looking everywhere for something. Turns out, they''re looking for the audience, and when George spots the camera, they start in on their patter. Gracie wants to convince George that she''s smart, not dizzy - it''s an uphill struggle of which she''s blissfully unaware. Midway through, they break into song: "Do You Believe Me?" It includes a little bit of hoofing as the chatting continues. They end on a story Gracie whispers into George''s ear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNZzpauD6hsac12KMx2h1Y2jCqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147050'),
  ('1138238331023222045', 'Lambert the Sheepish Lion', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Sterling Holloway, June Foray, Stan Freberg, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Disney Legend Sterling Holloway narrates this classic animated short. A mix-up by Mr. Stork finds a little lion cub in the care of a gentle flock of sheep. Doted on by his mother, but teased by the other lambs, Lambert soon grows to become a massive lion, but as shy and gentle as the ewe who raised him. When a hungry wolf begins to stalk the herd, will Lambert find the courage to protect his mama?', 'Disney Legend Sterling Holloway narrates this classic animated short. A mix-up by Mr. Stork finds a little lion cub in the care of a gentle flock of sheep. Doted on by his mother, but teased by the other lambs, Lambert soon grows to become a massive lion, but as shy and gentle as the ewe who raised him. When a hungry wolf begins to stalk the herd, will Lambert find the courage to protect his mama?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnJpKnhfLG3zPpHk1lFkxbEUCsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54184'),
