  ('796279822453616039', 'Lamborghini: The Man Behind the Legend', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Bobby Moresco, Gian Filippo Corticelli, Blasco Giurato', 'Bobby Moresco', 'Frank Grillo, Romano Reggiani, Gabriel Byrne, Matteo Leoni, Hannah van der Westhuysen, Mira Sorvino, Chiara Primavesi, Francesca Tizzano', 'R', 'Follow the launch of Lamborghini’s career as a manufacturer of tractors, a creator of military vehicles during World War II, and the designer of Lamborghini cars, which he launched in 1963 as the high-end sports car company Automobili Lamborghini.', 'Follow the launch of Lamborghini’s career as a manufacturer of tractors, a creator of military vehicles during World War II, and the designer of Lamborghini cars, which he launched in 1963 as the high-end sports car company Automobili Lamborghini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RKgnYLhCNGCUkrhiCRrs40rEHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457232'),
  ('542261252826670467', 'Lame de fond', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Bruno Garcia, Marc Falchier, Camille Barré', 'Victor Pavy, Fabienne Lesieur', 'Pauline Bression, Akim Omiri, Stéphane Freiss, Antoine Hamel, Éléonore Bernheim, Franz Lang, Florence Muller, William Nadylam', null, 'The Dinard resort prepares for a British film festival when the body of a director is discovered floating. He had been the victim of a shipwreck in which his sister had died. Are these two events linked?', 'The Dinard resort prepares for a British film festival when the body of a director is discovered floating. He had been the victim of a shipwreck in which his sister had died. Are these two events linked?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH2dnWCkTx7q64ZA4VK4gNuUJa7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036798'),
