  ('499563614417784320', 'Lamerica', 1994, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Luca Bigazzi, Marco Turco', 'Gianni Amelio, Andrea Porporati, Alessandro Sermoneta', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Michele Placido, Piro Milkani, Carmelo Di Mazzarelli, Elida Janushi, Sefer Pema, Idajet Sejdia, Marjeta Ljarja', null, 'Fiore, an Italian conman, arrives in post Communist Albania with Gino, his young apprentice, to set up a shoe factory that will never open. The con requires a native Albanian, so they designate Spiro, an impoverished and confused former political prisoner as chairman of the board. When Fiore returns to Italy to get government funds for the project, Spiro unexpectedly disappears and Gino sets out on a journey to find him. The search leads him to discover Spiro''s tragic personal history and witness Albanian poverty firsthand.', 'Fiore, an Italian conman, arrives in post Communist Albania with Gino, his young apprentice, to set up a shoe factory that will never open. The con requires a native Albanian, so they designate Spiro, an impoverished and confused former political prisoner as chairman of the board. When Fiore returns to Italy to get government funds for the project, Spiro unexpectedly disappears and Gino sets out on a journey to find him. The search leads him to discover Spiro''s tragic personal history and witness Albanian poverty firsthand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnLpA4mqb3gvhNJQZ00cOyBmeq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49133'),
  ('834573592641380472', 'Lamhe', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yash Chopra', 'Honey Irani', 'Anil Kapoor, Sridevi, Waheeda Rehman, Anupam Kher, Lalit Tiwari, Manohar Singh, Ila Arun, Richa Pallod', null, 'Viren falls for Pallavi, but she marries Siddharth. The couple dies, leaving behind their daughter, who grows up to look just like her mother and falls in love with Viren.', 'Viren falls for Pallavi, but she marries Siddharth. The couple dies, leaving behind their daughter, who grows up to look just like her mother and falls in love with Viren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aw9xd5GhQkyaAsTblNi3XydvEcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64879'),
  ('96950451913320467', 'Lammbock', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Marc Stoppenbach, Christian Zübert, Sonja Rom', 'Shalini Sonntag, Christian Zübert', 'Lucas Gregorowicz, Moritz Bleibtreu, Marie Zielcke, Julian Weigend, Alexandra Schalaudek, Elmar Wepper, Alexandra Neldel, Antoine Monot Jr.', null, 'Stefan and Kai run a thriving business: a home-grown cannabis trade disguised as a pizza delivery service. For now they just have to fight aphids.', 'Stefan and Kai run a thriving business: a home-grown cannabis trade disguised as a pizza delivery service. For now they just have to fight aphids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1AeFrBKkdZBUi4YvP7TsaQ7zoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1583'),
  ('630392361786950408', 'Lamp Life', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Valerie LaPointe, Derek Williams, Vandana Reddy Sahrawat', 'Valerie LaPointe', 'Annie Potts, Ally Maki, Jim Hanks, Emily Davis', 'G', 'Bo Peep explains what happened to herself and her sheep between the events of Toy Story 2 and Toy Story 4.', 'Bo Peep explains what happened to herself and her sheep between the events of Toy Story 2 and Toy Story 4.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJ95RnlammhYb6ZvBbQFLq8Jqnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594530'),
  ('235532510500832864', 'Lampaansyöjät', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Seppo Huunonen, Esko Jantunen, Pentti Auer', 'Veikko Huovinen, Seppo Huunonen, Pekka Hakala', 'Heikki Kinnunen, Leo Lastumäki, Pentti Auer, Elina Hoffrén, Rose-Marie Precht, Nadja Pyykkö, Jukka Sipilä, Anita Sohlberg', null, 'Valtteri and Sepe, two ordinary white-collar guys from southern Finland drive up north to implement a plan they''ve been hatching for months. Because they simply love the taste of lamb, baked "robber-style" in a hole dug under a campfire, they forge their car''s number plates and other important documents just to be able to poach sheep grazing on the roadside without getting caught. Lots of man talk around the campfire, aided by lots of booze. The summer may be wet, but the vodka is definitely dry.', 'Valtteri and Sepe, two ordinary white-collar guys from southern Finland drive up north to implement a plan they''ve been hatching for months. Because they simply love the taste of lamb, baked "robber-style" in a hole dug under a campfire, they forge their car''s number plates and other important documents just to be able to poach sheep grazing on the roadside without getting caught. Lots of man talk around the campfire, aided by lots of booze. The summer may be wet, but the vodka is definitely dry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0QumHGyGL3uAyDNeGQhpAHqICS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112383'),
  ('1080125501375024943', 'Lan Kwai Fong', 2011, 'Drama', 'Wilson Chin Kwok-Wai', 'Mark Woo Yiu-Fai', 'Chen Zhi-Ming, Shiga Lin Si-Nga, Jeana Ho Pui-Yu, Jason Chan Pak-Yu, Dada Chan Ching, Gregory Wong Chung-Yiu, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Emme Wong Yi-Man', null, 'Lan Kwai Fong (LKF), a well-known party location in Hong Kong with loads of nightclubs and bars. Everyone likes to go to LKF for fun, one night stands or even true love. LKF has captured the joys and sorrows of many... One night, Steven - a regular of LKF met the flight attendant - Jennifer. They had sex on the first night they met but both could feel love come along. They had another date on New Year''s Eve. Unfortunately, misunderstanding tore them apart and Jennifer decided to disappear from LKF. After eight months, Steven meets with Jennifer again and hopes to restart a relationship with her. However, Jennifer is no longer single, she''s now his boss, Leslie''s girlfriend. At the same time, Steven receives a call that his close friend collapsed and had to be sent to hospital. His friend encouraged him to follow his heart. When he finally decides to tell Jennifer about his feelings...', 'Lan Kwai Fong (LKF), a well-known party location in Hong Kong with loads of nightclubs and bars. Everyone likes to go to LKF for fun, one night stands or even true love. LKF has captured the joys and sorrows of many... One night, Steven - a regular of LKF met the flight attendant - Jennifer. They had sex on the first night they met but both could feel love come along. They had another date on New Year''s Eve. Unfortunately, misunderstanding tore them apart and Jennifer decided to disappear from LKF. After eight months, Steven meets with Jennifer again and hopes to restart a relationship with her. However, Jennifer is no longer single, she''s now his boss, Leslie''s girlfriend. At the same time, Steven receives a call that his close friend collapsed and had to be sent to hospital. His friend encouraged him to follow his heart. When he finally decides to tell Jennifer about his feelings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5wPeAF5Vpsh3a5xAnmtxSrJ4LD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78172'),
