  ('84019728269740668', 'Lancaster Skies', 2019, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Callum Burn, Sam Parsons, Bryony James', 'Andrew Burn, Callum Burn, Sam Parsons', 'Kris Saddler, Rosa Coduri-Fulford, Jeffrey Mundell, Vin Hawke, Tom Gordon, Joanne Gale, Joshua Collins, David Dobson', null, 'Douglas, a broken, solitary, Spitfire Ace, must overcome his past to lead a Lancaster bomber crew in the pivotal aerial war over Berlin, in 1944.', 'Douglas, a broken, solitary, Spitfire Ace, must overcome his past to lead a Lancaster bomber crew in the pivotal aerial war over Berlin, in 1944.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOHm72CCU5vvrbWhqaDZMkwZ2IP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517517'),
