  ('819107199497623215', 'Lancelot of the Lake', 1974, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Robert Bresson, Pasqualino De Santis, Bernard Cohn', 'Robert Bresson', 'Luc Simon, Vladimir Antolek-Oresek, Laura Duke Condominas, Patrick Bernhard, Humbert Balsan, Arthur De Montalembert, Daniel Benoin, Charles Balsan', null, 'Having failed in their quest for the Holy Grail, the knights of the Round Table return to Camelot, their number reduced to a mere handful. Seeing a rift developing between Lancelot and Mordred, Arthur urges his knights to bury their differences and become friends. However, the king is unaware that Lancelot is having an affair with his queen, Guinevere. Lancelot is torn between his duty to his king and his love for the queen, whilst Mordred is determined to use his infidelity to destroy him.', 'Having failed in their quest for the Holy Grail, the knights of the Round Table return to Camelot, their number reduced to a mere handful. Seeing a rift developing between Lancelot and Mordred, Arthur urges his knights to bury their differences and become friends. However, the king is unaware that Lancelot is having an affair with his queen, Guinevere. Lancelot is torn between his duty to his king and his love for the queen, whilst Mordred is determined to use his infidelity to destroy him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF5BQro2PC7YG4XY6i70jwXOzbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55848'),
  ('373036150482540748', 'Lancement d''un navire', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'At the launch of a ship, of which we can only see the hull, the audience moves aside.', 'At the launch of a ship, of which we can only see the hull, the audience moves aside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAuwmqt4OJwPfwXPtY0WZB6ArG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190560'),
  ('343443656168610584', 'Land', 2021, 'Drama', 'Bobby Bukowski, Jamie Sarginson, Kim H. Winther', 'Erin Dignam, Jesse Chatham', 'Robin Wright, Demián Bichir, Sarah Dawn Pledge, Kim Dickens, Warren Christie, Finlay Wojtak-Hissong, Brad Leland, Jordan Bullchild', 'PG-13', 'Edee, in the aftermath of an unfathomable event, finds herself unable to stay connected to the world she once knew and in the face of that uncertainty, retreats to the magnificent, but unforgiving, wilds of the Rockies. After a local hunter brings her back from the brink of death, she must find a way to live again.', 'Edee, in the aftermath of an unfathomable event, finds herself unable to stay connected to the world she once knew and in the face of that uncertainty, retreats to the magnificent, but unforgiving, wilds of the Rockies. After a local hunter brings her back from the brink of death, she must find a way to live again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pYhDPzYPGKvDYpxdf0IUE3RDAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598896'),
  ('550068254399396878', 'Land and Freedom', 1995, 'War, Drama, History', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd, Paco Calvo', 'Jim Allen', 'Ian Hart, Rosana Pastor, Frédéric Pierrot, Icíar Bollaín, Tom Gilroy, Angela Clarke, Eoin McCarthy, Suzanne Maddock', null, 'David Carr is a British Communist who is unemployed. In 1936, when the Spanish Civil War begins, he decides to fight for the Republican side, a coalition of liberals, communists and anarchists, so he joins the POUM militia and witnesses firsthand the betrayal of the Spanish revolution by Stalin''s followers and Moscow''s orders.', 'David Carr is a British Communist who is unemployed. In 1936, when the Spanish Civil War begins, he decides to fight for the Republican side, a coalition of liberals, communists and anarchists, so he joins the POUM militia and witnesses firsthand the betrayal of the Spanish revolution by Stalin''s followers and Moscow''s orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5QRqW0vFYMHFzeQJ4oFgJtu5Xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38884'),
  ('254103811544543501', 'Land and Shade', 2015, 'Drama', 'César Augusto Acevedo, Mateo Guzmán, Roberto Espinoza', 'César Augusto Acevedo', 'Haimer Leal, Hilda Ruiz, Edison Raigosa, Marleyda Soto', null, 'Alfonso is an old farmer who has returned home to tend to his son, who is gravely ill. He rediscovers his old house, where the woman who was once his wife still lives, with his daughter-in-law and grandson. The landscape that awaits him resembles a wasteland. Vast sugar cane plantations surround the house, producing perpetual clouds of ash. 17 years after abandoning them, Alfonso tries to fit back in and save his family.', 'Alfonso is an old farmer who has returned home to tend to his son, who is gravely ill. He rediscovers his old house, where the woman who was once his wife still lives, with his daughter-in-law and grandson. The landscape that awaits him resembles a wasteland. Vast sugar cane plantations surround the house, producing perpetual clouds of ash. 17 years after abandoning them, Alfonso tries to fit back in and save his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/se4W7dzlEFGpQYge73Nx9IfMh5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336669'),
  ('740359045440103135', 'Land Ho!', 2014, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Aaron Katz, Andrew Reed, Martha Stephens', 'Aaron Katz, Martha Stephens', 'Paul Eenhoorn, Earl Lynn Nelson, Karrie Crouse, Elizabeth McKee, Alice Olivia Clarke, Gauti Þeyr Másson, Daníel Gylfason, Þrúður Kristjánsdóttir', 'R', 'Martha Stephens and Aaron Katz''s buddy comedy Land Ho! follows former brothers-in-law Mitch (Earl Lynn Nelson) and Colin (Paul Eenhoorn) as they travel through Iceland. The pair of 70-year-olds find themselves in need of an adventure to break out of their rut, and soon the extroverted Mitch has talked Colin into the trip. Along the way they have various amorous encounters, and attempt to recapture the spirit of their youth.', 'Martha Stephens and Aaron Katz''s buddy comedy Land Ho! follows former brothers-in-law Mitch (Earl Lynn Nelson) and Colin (Paul Eenhoorn) as they travel through Iceland. The pair of 70-year-olds find themselves in need of an adventure to break out of their rut, and soon the extroverted Mitch has talked Colin into the trip. Along the way they have various amorous encounters, and attempt to recapture the spirit of their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjRksEzgB70a8KzEEqjsuvPRVwX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252102'),
  ('67763609953031336', 'Land In Between', 1996, 'Drama', 'Matteo Garrone, Marco Onorato, Salvatore Sansone', 'Matteo Garrone', 'Pascal, Barbara, Tina, Euglen Sota, Gertian Durmishi, Ahmed Mahgoub, Guglielmo Ferraiola, Paolo Sassanelli', null, 'On the edge of a road that leads out of town, some Nigerian prostitutes pass the time on sagging sofas, bargaining with white clients for their bodies and their thoughts. On another street, some Slavic boys wait to be hired as bricklayers, but they are willing to do any kind of work. At night, an Egyptian works as an illegal in a gas station.', 'On the edge of a road that leads out of town, some Nigerian prostitutes pass the time on sagging sofas, bargaining with white clients for their bodies and their thoughts. On another street, some Slavic boys wait to be hired as bricklayers, but they are willing to do any kind of work. At night, an Egyptian works as an illegal in a gas station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rS3818CzFjZPrlFcmIKyKtMuo7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258797'),
  ('153866764993215904', 'Land Legs', 2016, 'Drama', 'Samuel Collardey', 'Samuel Collardey, Catherine Paillé', 'Dominique Leborne, Mailys Leborne, Mattéo Leborne, Vincent Bessonnet, Dr. Claude-Estelle Guitter, Patrick d''Assumçao, Sandra Richard, Chantal Leborne', null, 'Dom, 36 years old, is a sailor on board of the fishing boat Petit Gael II from the port of Les Sables d''Olonne, a small town in western France. He is used to leave for the open sea for at least three weeks in a row. Despite of his absences, his teenaged children decided to live with him since the divorce of the parents. But when his daughter Mailys gets pregnant, Dom understands that he will have to choose between the sea and his family.', 'Dom, 36 years old, is a sailor on board of the fishing boat Petit Gael II from the port of Les Sables d''Olonne, a small town in western France. He is used to leave for the open sea for at least three weeks in a row. Despite of his absences, his teenaged children decided to live with him since the divorce of the parents. But when his daughter Mailys gets pregnant, Dom understands that he will have to choose between the sea and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knDMEcjjqWBXqbo3ThFEZiGEvNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359770'),
  ('694550495411340641', 'Land Looters', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Fanny Paloma', 'Fanny Paloma', 'Fiodor Rilov, Bel Bérangère Nankara, Samin Ngach, Sorng Prou, Neth Prak', 'G', 'The Bunong community in Cambodia is fighting to preserve its sacred forests, while in Cameroon villages are resisting oil palm plantations.Part travelogue and part sensitive investigation, the movie tells the universal story of people who refuse to be erased, reminding us that defending the Earth means defending life.', 'The Bunong community in Cambodia is fighting to preserve its sacred forests, while in Cameroon villages are resisting oil palm plantations.Part travelogue and part sensitive investigation, the movie tells the universal story of people who refuse to be erased, reminding us that defending the Earth means defending life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fw2EXW6CCz54yBW3qdAupsZCe177.jpg', 'plex:movie:land-looters'),
  ('127133386954188155', 'Land of Ashes', 2020, 'Drama', 'Sofía Quirós, Francisca Saéz Agurto, Felipe Zúñiga', 'Sofía Quirós', 'Smachleen Gutiérrez, Humberto Samuels, Hortensia Smith, Keha Brown, Yulius Melvin Brown Rudolf, Adeysha Garrido Morales, Krisly Hernández Harris, Danna Murillo Carpio', null, 'Selva, thirteen years old, discovers that when we die we just shed our skin. We can turn into wolves, goats, shadows, or anything as long as your imagination allows it.', 'Selva, thirteen years old, discovers that when we die we just shed our skin. We can turn into wolves, goats, shadows, or anything as long as your imagination allows it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MLHk1iJTSKKbipjD87Lh5HB0Kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596868'),
  ('417662277420139567', 'Land of Bad', 2024, 'Action, War, Thriller', 'William Eubank, Agustin Claramunt, Jared Purrington', 'William Eubank, David Frigerio', 'Liam Hemsworth, Russell Crowe, Luke Hemsworth, Ricky Whittle, Milo Ventimiglia, Chika Ikogwe, Daniel MacPherson, Robert Rabiah', 'R', 'When a Delta Force special ops mission goes terribly wrong, Air Force drone pilot Reaper has 48 hours to remedy what has devolved into a wild rescue operation. With no weapons and no communication other than the drone above, the ground mission suddenly becomes a full-scale battle when the team is discovered by the enemy.', 'When a Delta Force special ops mission goes terribly wrong, Air Force drone pilot Reaper has 48 hours to remedy what has devolved into a wild rescue operation. With no weapons and no communication other than the drone above, the ground mission suddenly becomes a full-scale battle when the team is discovered by the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3jYanWMEJq6JJsCopy1h7cT2Hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969492'),
  ('461189648393926700', 'Land of Black Gold', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Eric Rondeaux, Dennise Fordham', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman', null, 'When cars start to explode, which can lead to a serious oil crisis, Tintin and his friends travel to the Middle East to get to the bottom of the problem.', 'When cars start to explode, which can lead to a serious oil crisis, Tintin and his friends travel to the Middle East to get to the bottom of the problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BEKPLTawJBHm3VC65ECX4NponL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441317'),
  ('115514833495001981', 'Land of Doom', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Peter Maris', 'Craig Rand', 'Deborah Rennard, Garrick Dowhen, Daniel Radell, Frank Garret, Richard Allen, Akut Duz, Bruno Chambon, Fatoş Çelik', null, 'Earth has been ravaged by a nuclear war, and a feminist warrior is forced to join up with a soldier of fortune in her journey to find a rumored "paradise" as they battle gangs of rampaging bandits.', 'Earth has been ravaged by a nuclear war, and a feminist warrior is forced to join up with a soldier of fortune in her journey to find a rumored "paradise" as they battle gangs of rampaging bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQZVZgEcHngOnk2Dcp3y6aYRBex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92426'),
  ('55033124942514420', 'Land of Fear', 2000, 'Drama, Crime', 'Daoud Abdel Sayed, Hani Khalifa, Samir Bahzan', 'Daoud Abdel Sayed', 'Ahmed Zaki, Farah, Samy El Adl, Hamdy Ghaith, Ezzat Abu Ouf, Ahmed Kamal, Abdul Rahman Abu Zahra, Zeina', null, 'A police officer is chosen in the late 1960s for a unique and lifelong mission: to infiltrate Egypt’s criminal underworld. Stripped of his name and reputation, he adopts a new identity, living among smugglers, dealers, and nightclub owners. Over the years, he rises within this hidden world, all the while trying to balance his secret duty with the temptations of wealth, power, and desire. Against the backdrop of Egypt’s shifting political eras, his life becomes a meditation on morality, loyalty, and the fragile boundaries of identity and biblical-level metaphors.', 'A police officer is chosen in the late 1960s for a unique and lifelong mission: to infiltrate Egypt’s criminal underworld. Stripped of his name and reputation, he adopts a new identity, living among smugglers, dealers, and nightclub owners. Over the years, he rises within this hidden world, all the while trying to balance his secret duty with the temptations of wealth, power, and desire. Against the backdrop of Egypt’s shifting political eras, his life becomes a meditation on morality, loyalty, and the fragile boundaries of identity and biblical-level metaphors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Pe4pXItqj1iBMMROIuDGipdPxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103448'),
  ('293754967468298890', 'Land of Happiness', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hong Jae-sik, Kim Jae-keun, Choo Chang-min', 'Heo Jun-seok', 'Cho Jung-seok, Lee Sun-kyun, You Chea-myung, Woo Hyeon, Lee Won-jong, Jeon Bae-soo, Song Young-gyu, Choi Won-young', 'NR', 'October 26, 1979, a presidential assassination shakes the nation. Taking on the defense of Park Tae-joo, the secretary involved in the presidential assassination, lawyer Jung In-hoo enters what would be South Korea''s most notorious political trial. Despite Park Tae-joo facing a predetermined sentence due to his military status, Jung In-hoo fights tirelessly to ensure a fair trial, enraged by the trial''s unfair proceedings.', 'October 26, 1979, a presidential assassination shakes the nation. Taking on the defense of Park Tae-joo, the secretary involved in the presidential assassination, lawyer Jung In-hoo enters what would be South Korea''s most notorious political trial. Despite Park Tae-joo facing a predetermined sentence due to his military status, Jung In-hoo fights tirelessly to ensure a fair trial, enraged by the trial''s unfair proceedings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5xAVbSdJYNVjAqBm9ejjA5BCkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783111'),
  ('824264565086885154', 'Land of Hope', 2018, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Emilia Putkinen, Emma Heino, Markku Pölönen', 'Antti Heikkinen, Markku Pölönen', 'Oona Airola, Konsta Laakso, Helmi Linnosmaa, Antti Virmavirta, Marjaana Maijala, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Arto Heikkilä, Marja Packalén', null, 'Anni, a daughter of a wealthy family and used to secure life, falls in love with Veikko, a war invalid of the Continuation War. Anni leaves her past behind her and starts leading the life of a pioneer, in the wild forests of northern Karelia, in a settlement farm. After a rosy start, the fate crushes Anni’s dreams and her love for Veikko is put to a test.', 'Anni, a daughter of a wealthy family and used to secure life, falls in love with Veikko, a war invalid of the Continuation War. Anni leaves her past behind her and starts leading the life of a pioneer, in the wild forests of northern Karelia, in a settlement farm. After a rosy start, the fate crushes Anni’s dreams and her love for Veikko is put to a test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ee95n13gpoyhFZEakO4jYjfBtrr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489138'),
  ('169927928747588928', 'Land of Legends', 2022, 'History, Romance, Action, Adventure', 'Natalya Troitskaya, Anton Megerdichev, Sergey Astakhov', 'Ilya Tilkin, Sergei Bodrov, Ksenia Datnova', 'Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Evgeny Mironov, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Aleksey Rozin, Elena Erbakova, Sergey Puskepalis, Vitaly Kishchenko, Elena Panova', null, 'The history of the confrontation between two worlds: the Grand Duchy of Moscow and the Ural Parma, the ancient Perm lands inhabited by pagans. Here heroes and ghosts, princes and shamans, Voguls and Muscovites will clash. At the center of the conflict of civilizations is the fate of the Russian prince Mikhail, who fell in love with the young Tiche, a witch-lamia capable of taking on the form of a lynx. Passion for the pagan and fidelity to forbidden love, a campaign against the Voguls, bloody battles and a short peace, the battle between Muscovy and Parma, the hero will face trials in which it is not so terrible to part with life as to commit treason.', 'The history of the confrontation between two worlds: the Grand Duchy of Moscow and the Ural Parma, the ancient Perm lands inhabited by pagans. Here heroes and ghosts, princes and shamans, Voguls and Muscovites will clash. At the center of the conflict of civilizations is the fate of the Russian prince Mikhail, who fell in love with the young Tiche, a witch-lamia capable of taking on the form of a lynx. Passion for the pagan and fidelity to forbidden love, a campaign against the Voguls, bloody battles and a short peace, the battle between Muscovy and Parma, the hero will face trials in which it is not so terrible to part with life as to commit treason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBhVg8LgioUc31OTbjc5O5hLTRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576986'),
  ('35124749620066412', 'Land of Men', 1958, 'History, Western', 'Ismael Rodríguez', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Elvira de la Mora, Carlos Orellana', 'Antonio Aguilar, Joaquín Cordero, Domingo Soler, Julio Aldama, Rosa de Castilla, Raúl Meraz, Elsa Cárdenas, María Teresa Rivas', null, 'On his family''s farm, Gilberto keeps weapons to support the revolutionaries. When his father find out, he runs out from the hacienda to join them.', 'On his family''s farm, Gilberto keeps weapons to support the revolutionaries. When his father find out, he runs out from the hacienda to join them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaaR4cjiHwCVMkSXi3usmnJTKck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376423'),
  ('951487907893458775', 'Land of My Dreams', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yann Gonzalez', 'Yann Gonzalez', 'Julie Brémond, Paula Guedes, Eurico Cardoso, Hugo Alfredo Gomes, Luís Filipe Rodrigues', null, 'Bianca and her mother meet again in Porto after many years. Together, they will hit the road with their stripping show, running after lost time, impossible love and strange fantasies.', 'Bianca and her mother meet again in Porto after many years. Together, they will hit the road with their stripping show, running after lost time, impossible love and strange fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vuPNWwXLexNy2GKal2zA6rlq7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295039'),
  ('1060682277790059610', 'Land of Oblivion', 2012, 'Drama', 'Michale Boganim, Antoine Héberlé, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Michale Boganim, Antoine Lacomblez, Anne Weil', 'Olga Kurylenko, Andrzej Chyra, Ilya Iosifov, Serhiy Strelnykov, Vyacheslav Slanko, Nicolas Wanczycki, Nikita Emshanov, Tatyana Rasskazova', null, 'Chornobyl, 1986, a few hours before the disaster. Piotr and Anya''s wedding is interrupted by a fire at the power station.', 'Chornobyl, 1986, a few hours before the disaster. Piotr and Anya''s wedding is interrupted by a fire at the power station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIQIxClAr0jbq2YSjZdfGaCYXb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99389'),
  ('592621163068705400', 'Land of Plenty', 2004, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Franz Lustig', 'Wim Wenders, Michael Meredith', 'Michelle Williams, John Diehl, Shaun Toub, Burt Young, Jeris Poindexter, Wendell Pierce, Richard Edson, Rhonda Stubbins White', null, 'After living abroad, Lana returns to the United States, and finds that her uncle is a reclusive vagabond with psychic wounds from the Vietnam War.', 'After living abroad, Lana returns to the United States, and finds that her uncle is a reclusive vagabond with psychic wounds from the Vietnam War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oK8z5rPlEjhGBiHk2OqE3bIhyol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1595'),
  ('43507659327987932', 'Land of Silence and Darkness', 1973, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', 'Werner Herzog', 'Fini Straubinger, Heinrich Fleischmann, Vladimir Kokol, M. Baaske, Resi Mittermeier, Rolf Illig', null, 'Through examining Fini Straubinger, an old woman who has been deaf and blind since her teens, and her work on behalf of other deaf-blind people, this film shows how the deaf-blind struggle to understand and accept a world from which they are almost wholly isolated.', 'Through examining Fini Straubinger, an old woman who has been deaf and blind since her teens, and her work on behalf of other deaf-blind people, this film shows how the deaf-blind struggle to understand and accept a world from which they are almost wholly isolated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzruxvZEYZzaFOuL1Ufwe5PYG0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62437'),
  ('906081041784739791', 'Land of Storms', 2014, 'Drama', 'Marcell Rév, Ádám Császi, László Kadar', 'Iván Szabó, Ádám Császi', 'András Sütö, Varga Ádám, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Lajos Ottó Horváth, Enikő Börcsök, Zita Téby, Uwe Lauer, Kristóf Horváth', null, 'Szabolcs plays in a German football team, as does Bernard. They are roommates, best friends, inseparable. A lost match makes him reconsider his life and he goes back to Hungary in hope for more simplicity. Yet his solitude does not last long. Soon after his arrival he meets Áron and a mutual attraction between the two boys develops when suddenly Szabolcs receives an unexpected phone call from Bernard: he has arrived to Hungary...', 'Szabolcs plays in a German football team, as does Bernard. They are roommates, best friends, inseparable. A lost match makes him reconsider his life and he goes back to Hungary in hope for more simplicity. Yet his solitude does not last long. Soon after his arrival he meets Áron and a mutual attraction between the two boys develops when suddenly Szabolcs receives an unexpected phone call from Bernard: he has arrived to Hungary...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oartojnh2YHIwyUFYj6mCLqOZt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254005'),
  ('154175684842957361', 'Land of the Bears', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Guillaume Vincent', 'Guillaume Vincent, Michel Fessler, Yves Paccalet', 'Marion Cotillard, Cécile Corbel', null, 'Set in the wilderness of the Kamchatka Peninsula, the land of legends and the kingdom of wild brown bears, we follow the daily adventures of five wild brown bears.', 'Set in the wilderness of the Kamchatka Peninsula, the land of legends and the kingdom of wild brown bears, we follow the daily adventures of five wild brown bears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQr542U7tsOLOgEi9H48PfWXvoC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236827'),
  ('333688091191675307', 'Land of the Blind', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Emmanuel Kadosh, Robert Edwards, Thomas Brown', 'Robert Edwards', 'Ralph Fiennes, Donald Sutherland, Tom Hollander, Lara Flynn Boyle, Marc Warren, Ron Cook, Mackenzie Crook, Mark Dymond', null, 'A soldier recounts his relationship with a famous political prisoner attempting to overthrow their country''s authoritarian government.', 'A soldier recounts his relationship with a famous political prisoner attempting to overthrow their country''s authoritarian government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BOgSxOThAD1Rym4HQ9bJXeJSAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15414'),
  ('311500072803504968', 'Land of the Dead', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'George A. Romero, Mirosław Baszak, Rob Ballantyne', 'George A. Romero', 'Simon Baker, John Leguizamo, Dennis Hopper, Asia Argento, Robert Joy, Eugene Clark, Joanne Boland, Tony Nappo', 'R', 'The living dead have taken over the world, and the remaining humans live in a walled city to protect themselves as they cope with the situation.', 'The living dead have taken over the world, and the remaining humans live in a walled city to protect themselves as they cope with the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxp0qcZ3n2YA53SIzWilDSfIaA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11683'),
  ('962739065983620211', 'Land of the Free', 1998, 'Thriller, Action', 'Ken Blakey, Michael Melamed, Donald Newman', 'Ronald Jacobs, Maria James, Jerry Jameson', 'Jeff Speakman, William Shatner, Lisa Darr, Larry Cedar, John Furey, Chris Lemmon, Charles Robinson, Cody Dorkin', null, 'A politician''s campaign manager (Speakman) discovers that the candidate (Shatner) is a front for a military organization plotting a political overthrow of the government. In trying to expose the candidate''s right-wing activities, he puts himself and his family in danger of being killed.', 'A politician''s campaign manager (Speakman) discovers that the candidate (Shatner) is a front for a military organization plotting a political overthrow of the government. In trying to expose the candidate''s right-wing activities, he puts himself and his family in danger of being killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeGDHFlT59N2aHgjMmI4mDq0pQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215346'),
  ('1091842867441800439', 'Land of the Lost', 2009, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy, Action', 'Brad Silberling, Michele Panelli-Venetis, John Dexter', 'Dennis McNicholas, Chris Henchy', 'Will Ferrell, Anna Friel, Danny McBride, Jorma Taccone, John Boylan, Matt Lauer, Bobb''e J. Thompson, Sierra McCormick', 'PG-13', 'On his latest expedition, has-been scientist Dr. Rick Marshall is sucked into a space-time vortex alongside his crack-smart research assistant Holly and redneck survivalist Will into a world populated by marauding dinosaurs and painfully slow creatures called Sleestaks. With no weapons, few skills and questionable smarts, the trio must rely on their only ally, a primate named Chaka, to try to survive long enough to figure out a way back home.', 'On his latest expedition, has-been scientist Dr. Rick Marshall is sucked into a space-time vortex alongside his crack-smart research assistant Holly and redneck survivalist Will into a world populated by marauding dinosaurs and painfully slow creatures called Sleestaks. With no weapons, few skills and questionable smarts, the trio must rely on their only ally, a primate named Chaka, to try to survive long enough to figure out a way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVCJzmK9l5FD01LFYAB1zcmmw7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18162'),
  ('483914565064226833', 'Land of the Pharaohs', 1955, 'Drama, History', 'Howard Hawks, Lee Garmes, Russell Harlan', 'William Faulkner, Harry Kurnitz, Harold Jack Bloom', 'Jack Hawkins, Joan Collins, Dewey Martin, Alex Minotis, James Robertson Justice, Luisella Boni, Sydney Chaplin, James Hayter', 'PG', 'A captured architect designs an ingenious plan to ensure the impregnability of the tomb of a self-absorbed Pharaoh, obsessed with the security of his next life.', 'A captured architect designs an ingenious plan to ensure the impregnability of the tomb of a self-absorbed Pharaoh, obsessed with the security of his next life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpSzz9kkxb95vMgJiGyWe3nV99I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42564'),
  ('949947382786992721', 'Land Of The Sons', 2021, 'Science Fiction', 'Gergely Pohárnok, Claudio Cupellini, Davide Zurolo', 'Claudio Cupellini, Guido Iuculano, Filippo Gravino', 'Leon de La Vallée, Paolo Pierobon, Maria Roveran, Fabrizio Ferracane, Maurizio Donadoni, Franco Ravera, Alessandro Tedeschi, Valerio Mastandrea', null, 'Civilisation is coming to an end. The death of his only relative gives a feral boy the pretext to journey beyond the confines of his home environment; only by doing this will he be able to decipher his father''s journal, the most valuable artefact in his legacy. This singular contribution to the post-apocalyptic sci-fi genre tells of a humanity in crisis, while at the same time conveying the adventurous spirit of adolescence.', 'Civilisation is coming to an end. The death of his only relative gives a feral boy the pretext to journey beyond the confines of his home environment; only by doing this will he be able to decipher his father''s journal, the most valuable artefact in his legacy. This singular contribution to the post-apocalyptic sci-fi genre tells of a humanity in crisis, while at the same time conveying the adventurous spirit of adolescence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqGOEzyZCI4uqWf2LeFqvCOCc1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660205'),
  ('871217011664684895', 'Land Shark', 2020, 'Horror, Adventure, Action', 'Cheng Siyu', 'Cheng Siyu, Tao Siwei', 'Luo Liqun, Xi Meili, Tang Xin, Naomen Eerdeni, Yang Yong, Cheng Siyu, Liu Hangyu, Xie Weina', null, 'Qian Cheng, the boss of the pharmaceutical company, has invested in the establishment of a biopharmaceutical research laboratory located deep in the jungle. By modifying the shark gene to develop a new type of anti-cancer drug, but when the drug is about to be put into mass production, a huge crisis also came quietly: due to the change of the shark''s gene, the gene mutation was fierce and showed the characteristics of other organisms.', 'Qian Cheng, the boss of the pharmaceutical company, has invested in the establishment of a biopharmaceutical research laboratory located deep in the jungle. By modifying the shark gene to develop a new type of anti-cancer drug, but when the drug is about to be put into mass production, a huge crisis also came quietly: due to the change of the shark''s gene, the gene mutation was fierce and showed the characteristics of other organisms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjezFKOehU3Hv09UztLZRR2jyv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716831'),
  ('691358894293558351', 'Land van Johan', 2026, 'Drama', 'Eddy Terstall, Zoltan Gabor Déak, Willem Nagtglas', 'Eddy Terstall, Erik Wünsch', 'Roberta Petzoldt, Reinout Scholten van Aschat, Bram Suijker', null, 'In 1969 Amsterdam, two idealistic roommates fall for the same free-spirited young woman, pulling them into a heady world of hippie dreams, artistic rebellion, and emotional turmoil that tests their friendship and the ideals of free love.', 'In 1969 Amsterdam, two idealistic roommates fall for the same free-spirited young woman, pulling them into a heady world of hippie dreams, artistic rebellion, and emotional turmoil that tests their friendship and the ideals of free love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9nDAVbz13ZB5CQpQBQWoucwdasA.jpg', 'plex:movie:land-van-johan'),
  ('117513894249773231', 'Land Without Bread', 1933, 'Documentary', 'Luis Buñuel, Eli Lotar, Rafael Sánchez Ventura', 'Luis Buñuel, Rafael Sánchez Ventura, Pierre Unik', 'Francisco Rabal', null, 'An exploration —manipulated and staged— of life in Las Hurdes, in the province of Cáceres, in Extremadura, Spain, as it was in 1932. Insalubrity, misery and lack of opportunities provoke the emigration of young people and the solitude of those who remain in the desolation of one of the poorest and least developed Spanish regions at that time.', 'An exploration —manipulated and staged— of life in Las Hurdes, in the province of Cáceres, in Extremadura, Spain, as it was in 1932. Insalubrity, misery and lack of opportunities provoke the emigration of young people and the solitude of those who remain in the desolation of one of the poorest and least developed Spanish regions at that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTizDiDbiVPCGqC6uMVDp8GoEeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91'),
  ('357559277794866308', 'Landes', 2013, 'Drama', 'François-Xavier Vives, Emmanuel Soyer', 'François-Xavier Vives, Camille Fontaine, Emmanuel Roy', 'Marie Gillain, Jalil Lespert, Miou-Miou, Rosalia Cuevas, Steve Driesen, Bernard Blancan, Swan Mirabeau, Christelle Cornil', null, 'A young widow wants to carry on with her husband''s work:managing a pine plantation where they extract resin;but most of all,she wants to have electricity installed in her valuable property.In this place,it seems that 1789 never happened and that time stood still:her workers,circa 1920,do not receive any salary and ,like the peasants in the middle ages,have to bring their production to their landlady. But her progressive ideas come up against men still remembering WW1 and against her bourgeois peers.Her foreman ,first bewildered ,is finally won over by his boss'' resilience and strength of character.For her own good,the young heiress is too ahead of her time though.', 'A young widow wants to carry on with her husband''s work:managing a pine plantation where they extract resin;but most of all,she wants to have electricity installed in her valuable property.In this place,it seems that 1789 never happened and that time stood still:her workers,circa 1920,do not receive any salary and ,like the peasants in the middle ages,have to bring their production to their landlady. But her progressive ideas come up against men still remembering WW1 and against her bourgeois peers.Her foreman ,first bewildered ,is finally won over by his boss'' resilience and strength of character.For her own good,the young heiress is too ahead of her time though.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjyvCo5OARrMizmFWvd2f25Gnul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200830'),
  ('733166734307067835', 'Landing of Dreyfus at Quiberon', 1899, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A section of the port Haliquen (Quiberon) Bretagne, at night where Dreyfus was landed by French marines, and officers after his transport from Devil''s Island. He is received by the French authorities, officers, and gendarmes, and conducted to the station for his departure to Rennes. This little scene was enacted on a dark rainy night, which is clearly shown in the film. The effects are further heightened by vivid flashes of lightning which are certainly new in cinematography.', 'A section of the port Haliquen (Quiberon) Bretagne, at night where Dreyfus was landed by French marines, and officers after his transport from Devil''s Island. He is received by the French authorities, officers, and gendarmes, and conducted to the station for his departure to Rennes. This little scene was enacted on a dark rainy night, which is clearly shown in the film. The effects are further heightened by vivid flashes of lightning which are certainly new in cinematography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZvFqhqmASj6GakP4l2n75nTHNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105331'),
  ('1073754529241705729', 'Landing Stripling', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gene Deitch, Václav Bedřich', null, null, null, 'Tom and Jerry are sleeping outside during the day when a yellow bird wearing a red helmet lands on Tom, waking him up. Although the bird brushes Tom''s torso off and reacts politely like "pardon me", Tom goes after the bird, catches it, and proceeds to beat it up.', 'Tom and Jerry are sleeping outside during the day when a yellow bird wearing a red helmet lands on Tom, waking him up. Although the bird brushes Tom''s torso off and reacts politely like "pardon me", Tom goes after the bird, catches it, and proceeds to beat it up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooZQbu20BBYxInF542jHonKz4Pl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223021'),
  ('571028698740448042', 'Landline', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gillian Robespierre, Chris Teague, Scott Lazar', 'Gillian Robespierre, Elisabeth Holm', 'Jenny Slate, Abby Quinn, Edie Falco, John Turturro, Jay Duplass, Finn Wittrock, Marquis Rodriguez, Bobbi Salvör Menuez', 'R', 'A teenager living with her sister and parents in Manhattan during the 1990s discovers that her father is having an affair.', 'A teenager living with her sister and parents in Manhattan during the 1990s discovers that her father is having an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7RVsyi67S95RyNJjX99E1MaOsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419459'),
  ('783076637939343381', 'LandLord', 2026, 'Action, Drama, Family', 'Jadeshaa K Hampi, Swamy J Gowda', 'Jadesh Kumar Hampi, Mastii, Srikanth', 'Duniya Vijay, Rachita Ram, Rithnya Vijay, Raj B Shetty, Narasimha Jalahalli', null, 'In a village under a brutal landlord''s rule, fear silences the poor and justice is denied. A young woman constable challenges the system. When an innocent family is burnt alive, outrage erupts into violent uprising.', 'In a village under a brutal landlord''s rule, fear silences the poor and justice is denied. A young woman constable challenges the system. When an innocent family is burnt alive, outrage erupts into violent uprising.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwsRknSymCpLhKpjSUGRxGl6DaGY.jpg', 'plex:movie:landlord-2026'),
  ('1118763508566388417', 'Landmine Goes Click', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Levan Bakhia, Vigen Vartanov', 'Adrian Colussi', 'Sterling Knight, Spencer Locke, Dean Geyer, Kote Tolordava, Giorgi Tsaava, Helen Nelson, Nana Kiknadze, Nika Apriashvili', null, 'After an American tourist steps on a landmine, he is forced to watch his girlfriend get assaulted.', 'After an American tourist steps on a landmine, he is forced to watch his girlfriend get assaulted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRzCChRwhFXSjamEaj7wUWtTl7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329556'),
  ('386093913000755562', 'Landscape (for Manon)', 1987, 'Documentary', 'Peter Hutton', null, null, null, 'A languid, beautifully shot collection of landscapes, edited into a whimsical and touching film.', 'A languid, beautifully shot collection of landscapes, edited into a whimsical and touching film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbm4UGUsbC2Tyr8XrbzJFDiEnnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230056'),
  ('661043264972627280', 'Landscape After Battle', 1970, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda, Krystyna Grochowicz, Jan Budkiewicz', 'Andrzej Wajda, Andrzej Brzozowski', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Stanisława Celińska, Aleksander Bardini, Tadeusz Janczar, Zygmunt Malanowicz, Mieczysław Stoor, Leszek Drogosz, Stefan Friedmann', null, 'Film opens with the mad rush of haphazard freedom as the concentration camps are liberated. Men are trying to grab food, change clothes, bury their tormentors they find alive. Then they are herded into other camps as the Allies try to devise policy to control the situation. A young poet who cannot quite find himself in this new situation, meets a headstrong Jewish young girl who wants him to run off with her, to the West. He cannot cope with her growing demands for affection, while still harboring the hatred for the Germans and disdain for his fellow men who quickly revert to petty enmities.', 'Film opens with the mad rush of haphazard freedom as the concentration camps are liberated. Men are trying to grab food, change clothes, bury their tormentors they find alive. Then they are herded into other camps as the Allies try to devise policy to control the situation. A young poet who cannot quite find himself in this new situation, meets a headstrong Jewish young girl who wants him to run off with her, to the West. He cannot cope with her growing demands for affection, while still harboring the hatred for the Germans and disdain for his fellow men who quickly revert to petty enmities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFsScY7HSj3PRsflDextkvrtxcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149136'),
  ('837600876189578426', 'Landscape in the Mist', 1988, 'Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis, Aimilios Konitsiotis', 'Tonino Guerra, Thanasis Valtinos, Theo Angelopoulos', 'Michalis Zeke, Tania Palaiologou, Stratos Tzortzoglou, Eva Kotamanidou, Aliki Georgouli, Vasilis Kolovos, Vasilis Bouyiouklakis, Ilias Logothetis', null, 'Two Greek children embark on a journey to search for their father, who supposedly lives in Germany.', 'Two Greek children embark on a journey to search for their father, who supposedly lives in Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icNqzWxjwXuD6FSRtTWNj8sa5B1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47795'),
  ('293300302567754857', 'Landscape Suicide', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Documentary', 'James Benning, James Benning', 'James Benning', 'Rhonda Bell, Elion Sucher, Eve E. Ellis, Lisbeth Jetton, Pegge Winslow, John Benning, Rusty Johnson, Dorothy Zeidman', 'NR', 'Benning continues his examination of Americana in this film through the stories of two murderers. Ed Gein was a Wisconsin farmer and multiple murderer who taxidermied his victims in the 1950s. Bernadette Protti was a California teenager who stabbed a friend to death over an insult in 1984.', 'Benning continues his examination of Americana in this film through the stories of two murderers. Ed Gein was a Wisconsin farmer and multiple murderer who taxidermied his victims in the 1950s. Bernadette Protti was a California teenager who stabbed a friend to death over an insult in 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rqkSNz9eNGL9rpAIBbqho8AcOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125305'),
  ('417161711308598353', 'Landscape with Invisible Hand', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Yohannes Yamassee, John Bonaccorse, Victoria Rupert', 'Cory Finley', 'Asante Blackk, Kylie Rogers, Tiffany Haddish, Brooklynn MacKinzie, Josh Hamilton, Michael Gandolfini, John Newberg, Dev H Patel', 'R', 'Years into a benevolent alien occupation, mankind is still adjusting to its new overlords. Their technology initially held promise for global prosperity, but rendered most human jobs – and steady income – obsolete. When two teenagers discover the aliens are fascinated with human love and will pay for access to it, they decide to livestream their romance to make extra cash for their families.', 'Years into a benevolent alien occupation, mankind is still adjusting to its new overlords. Their technology initially held promise for global prosperity, but rendered most human jobs – and steady income – obsolete. When two teenagers discover the aliens are fascinated with human love and will pay for access to it, they decide to livestream their romance to make extra cash for their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnXvfZrj1azU5Rvbb8D7Fz0wkyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777411'),
  ('111591695040589325', 'Landspeed presents: CKY', 1999, 'Comedy, Documentary, Action', 'Bam Margera', 'Bam Margera, Brandon DiCamillo', 'Bam Margera, Brandon DiCamillo, Ryan Dunn, Phil Margera, April Margera, Rake Yohn, Mike Maldonado, Kerry Getz', null, 'The first entry in the CKY series of skateboarding programs and extreme stunts, directed by Bam Margera and featuring Margera, Brandon DiCamillo, Ryan Dunn, Chris Raab and Rake Yohn.', 'The first entry in the CKY series of skateboarding programs and extreme stunts, directed by Bam Margera and featuring Margera, Brandon DiCamillo, Ryan Dunn, Chris Raab and Rake Yohn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzAacYm2uFveYMYBPnimsgXJTHF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24145'),
  ('1007761717974912931', 'Lang Tong', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Sam Loh', 'Sam Loh, Alex Soh', 'Angeline Yap, Vivienne Tseng, William Lawandi, Esther Goh, Alan Tan, Elizabeth T, Sunny Pang, Cynthia Kuang', null, 'Zach, a remorseless serial womaniser and con man, meets his match in Li Ling, an alluring and well-to-do woman who makes a wicked bowl of pork rib soup. Things take an unexpected turn when Zach meets Li Ling''s younger sister, the drop-dead gorgeous Li Er. Soon enough, Zach turns his lecherous attentions towards Li Er, and they begin an affair behind Li Ling''s back. Li Er convinces Zach to help her execute a heinous plot to murder her older sister, whom she blames for causing her mother''s death. However, things are not as simple as they seem.', 'Zach, a remorseless serial womaniser and con man, meets his match in Li Ling, an alluring and well-to-do woman who makes a wicked bowl of pork rib soup. Things take an unexpected turn when Zach meets Li Ling''s younger sister, the drop-dead gorgeous Li Er. Soon enough, Zach turns his lecherous attentions towards Li Er, and they begin an affair behind Li Ling''s back. Li Er convinces Zach to help her execute a heinous plot to murder her older sister, whom she blames for causing her mother''s death. However, things are not as simple as they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMubsi8VaDPcicAFI4jCetZkciJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443526'),
  ('225134961645408736', 'Language Lessons', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeremy Mackie, Natalie Morales', 'Mark Duplass, Natalie Morales', 'Mark Duplass, Natalie Morales, Desean Terry, Christine Quesada', 'R', 'For his 45th birthday, wealthy Californian Adam receives a surprise gift from his choreographer partner: 100 weekly Spanish lessons with Cariño, a vivacious expat who teaches virtually from her home in Costa Rica. Adam''s unconvinced at first; a self-described “creature-of-habit”, he’s unsure about where or how this new element will fit into his carefully-structured routine.', 'For his 45th birthday, wealthy Californian Adam receives a surprise gift from his choreographer partner: 100 weekly Spanish lessons with Cariño, a vivacious expat who teaches virtually from her home in Costa Rica. Adam''s unconvinced at first; a self-described “creature-of-habit”, he’s unsure about where or how this new element will fit into his carefully-structured routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DLHXdi6B1JeYQ9YElNfdSIYO35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795530'),
  ('729598147608367537', 'Language of Love', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Torgny Wickman', 'Inge Hegeler, Sten Hegeler, Torgny Wickman', 'Inge Hegeler, Sten Hegeler, Maj-Brith Bergström-Walan, Sture Cullhed, Kim Anderzon, Siw Mattson, Barbro Hiort af Ornäs, Julie Bernby', null, 'A panel of real-life doctors discuss sexual hangups, misconceptions, personal prejudices and the ignorance of individuals when it comes to matters sexual. Using on-screen recreations, topics such as petting, contraceptives and sexual anxiety are addressed.', 'A panel of real-life doctors discuss sexual hangups, misconceptions, personal prejudices and the ignorance of individuals when it comes to matters sexual. Using on-screen recreations, topics such as petting, contraceptives and sexual anxiety are addressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2SgWA71ZHoXaVoeCneFgkhWvvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220436'),
  ('1128500127255164526', 'Language Teacher', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Demofilo Fidani', 'Demofilo Fidani, Fernando Popoli', 'Femi Benussi, Pupo De Luca, Daniela Pastorelli, Pietro Tordi, Walter Romagnoli, Mirella D''Aurela, Fausta Bennati', null, 'Michael, the son of a wealthy family, suffers from stuttering, and this leads him to be sent back to English and French. For the September exams, he will have to study all summer with Pamela, a sexy and beautiful teacher who will find a way to help him as he attempts to defend the particular attention of the other members of the family.', 'Michael, the son of a wealthy family, suffers from stuttering, and this leads him to be sent back to English and French. For the September exams, he will have to study all summer with Pamela, a sexy and beautiful teacher who will find a way to help him as he attempts to defend the particular attention of the other members of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxljVwl8ILQGXsfcDSNfK67biPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125572'),
  ('548652497153205232', 'Lansky', 1999, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'John McNaughton, John A. Alonzo', 'Eli Landau, David Mamet', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Illeana Douglas, Anthony LaPaglia, Eric Roberts, Beverly D''Angelo, Yosef Carmon, Mosko Alkalai, Fima Noveck', 'R', 'Organized crime boss Meyer Lansky remembers his life as he is moving about the world looking for some country that will take him in since the USA have put out an extradition order for him.', 'Organized crime boss Meyer Lansky remembers his life as he is moving about the world looking for some country that will take him in since the USA have put out an extradition order for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHdgO6qsUCRy7f7VDfucSdI0Qri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76739'),
  ('293768150322731768', 'Lansky', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Eytan Rockaway, Peter Flinckenberg', 'Robert Rockaway', 'Harvey Keitel, Sam Worthington, John Magaro, Minka Kelly, David James Elliott, Danny A. Abeckaser, David Cade, AnnaSophia Robb', 'R', 'When the aging Meyer Lansky is investigated one last time by the Feds who suspect he has stashed away millions of dollars over half a century, the retired gangster spins a dizzying tale, revealing the untold truth about his life as the notorious boss of Murder Inc. and the National Crime Syndicate.', 'When the aging Meyer Lansky is investigated one last time by the Feds who suspect he has stashed away millions of dollars over half a century, the retired gangster spins a dizzying tale, revealing the untold truth about his life as the notorious boss of Murder Inc. and the National Crime Syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brvSFZ1GMhbMzL3Is8kkvG1LbMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693827'),
  ('315155281690790802', 'Lantana', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ray Lawrence, Mandy Walker', 'Andrew Bovell', 'Anthony LaPaglia, Geoffrey Rush, Barbara Hershey, Kerry Armstrong, Rachael Blake, Vince Colosimo, Russell Dykstra, Daniela Farinacci', 'R', 'Plagued with grief over the murder of her daughter, Valerie Somers suspects that her husband John is cheating on her. When Valerie disappears, Detective Leon Zat attempts to solve the mystery of her absence. A complex web of love, sex and deceit emerges -- drawing in four related couples whose various partners are distrustful and suspicious about each other''s involvement.', 'Plagued with grief over the murder of her daughter, Valerie Somers suspects that her husband John is cheating on her. When Valerie disappears, Detective Leon Zat attempts to solve the mystery of her absence. A complex web of love, sex and deceit emerges -- drawing in four related couples whose various partners are distrustful and suspicious about each other''s involvement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTEUCdpDsfVDZJ5H0ndP1EmVtj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9523'),
  ('396717780444543512', 'Lantern''s Lane', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Justin LaReau', 'Justin LaReau', 'Brooke Serene Butler, Andy Cohen, Ashley Doris, Sydney Carvill, Lisa Roumain, Skip Howland, Justin LaReau, Robbie Allen', null, 'A recent college graduate and her estranged high school friends return to Lantern''s Lane, the location of an evil urban legend and must fight to survive the night.', 'A recent college graduate and her estranged high school friends return to Lantern''s Lane, the location of an evil urban legend and must fight to survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xJXC8tRAUKZeS7YoFK9UvEx8hb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879329'),
  ('767441270681986208', 'Lap Dance', 2014, 'Drama', 'Alexandria Stein, Fabien Hameline, Kyle Behling', 'Greg Carter', 'Ali Cobrin, Robert Hoffman, Carmen Electra, Briana Evigan, K.D. Aubert, Datari Turner, Stacey Dash, Nia Peeples', 'R', 'An aspiring actress makes a pact with her fiancé to take a job as an exotic dancer to care for her cancer stricken father. Once the pact the couple made is broken, their lives are changed forever.', 'An aspiring actress makes a pact with her fiancé to take a job as an exotic dancer to care for her cancer stricken father. Once the pact the couple made is broken, their lives are changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pSg48cUhETZBXpXizrttrGPzBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304336'),
  ('682080602150963033', 'Lap Dancing', 1995, 'Drama', 'Mike Sedan', 'Helen Haxton', 'Lorissa McComas, Tane McClure, Burke Morgan, Kim Dawson, Brye Cooper, Stefan Galio, Chanda, Robert Zachar', null, 'Angie is having no luck auditioning for movies. She thinks about going back home, but her roommate Claudia convinces her to try working at the "gentleman''s club" with her in order to gain more life experience. Angie hopes to be able to turn the experience toward more effective acting but is having difficulty overcoming her inhibitions. She meets a burned out movie director at the club who helps her with her dilemma.', 'Angie is having no luck auditioning for movies. She thinks about going back home, but her roommate Claudia convinces her to try working at the "gentleman''s club" with her in order to gain more life experience. Angie hopes to be able to turn the experience toward more effective acting but is having difficulty overcoming her inhibitions. She meets a burned out movie director at the club who helps her with her dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkyY4YhLQ9QuyYLrpKNXV4oxMiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165518'),
  ('453190927604934738', 'Lapin kullan kimallus', 1999, 'Drama, History', 'Åke Lindman, Pauli Sipiläinen', null, 'Vesa Vierikko, Pirkka-Pekka Petelius, Lasse Pöysti, Jarmo Mäkinen, Martti Suosalo, Mats Långbacka, Kaija Pakarinen, Minna Turunen', null, 'In 1860s Lapland, gold diggers Jakob Ervast and Nils Lepistö, who previously worked in California, embark on an arduous journey towards the north. The friends find gold at the first excavation site, which Kittilä''s crown prince Konrad Planting and Edvard Manninen also start looking for.', 'In 1860s Lapland, gold diggers Jakob Ervast and Nils Lepistö, who previously worked in California, embark on an arduous journey towards the north. The friends find gold at the first excavation site, which Kittilä''s crown prince Konrad Planting and Edvard Manninen also start looking for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZVsK3Rg1FVOmihTOTTiNTO4dNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55410'),
  ('138945556360181996', 'Lapis', 1966, 'Animation', 'James Whitney', null, null, null, 'James Whitney’s Lapis (1966) is a classic work of abstract cinema, a 10-minute animation that took three years to create using primitive computer equipment. In this piece smaller circles oscillate in and out in an array of colors resembling a kaleidoscope while being accompanied with Indian sitar music. The patterns become hypnotic and trance inducing. This work clearly correlates the auditory and the visual and is a wonderful example of the concept of synaesthesia.', 'James Whitney’s Lapis (1966) is a classic work of abstract cinema, a 10-minute animation that took three years to create using primitive computer equipment. In this piece smaller circles oscillate in and out in an array of colors resembling a kaleidoscope while being accompanied with Indian sitar music. The patterns become hypnotic and trance inducing. This work clearly correlates the auditory and the visual and is a wonderful example of the concept of synaesthesia.', null, 'tmdb:movie:145619'),
  ('993393783853584028', 'Lapitch the Little Shoemaker', 1997, 'Animation', 'Milan Blažeković', 'Pajo Kanižaj, Ivo Škrabalo', 'Ivan Gudeljević, Maja Rozman, Tarik Filipović, Pero Juričić, Relja Bašić, Vladimir Kovačić, Marina Nemet, Hrvoje Zalar', null, 'Fed up with the harsh treatment his master has given him, a brave little mouse (and later his dog, Brewster) sets off on an adventure.', 'Fed up with the harsh treatment his master has given him, a brave little mouse (and later his dog, Brewster) sets off on an adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7JecqohVFaffoO47OnMqkNgi9W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38816'),
  ('222811797940835317', 'Laplace''s Witch', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita, Tsuyoshi Sugino', 'Hiroyuki Yatsu', 'Sho Sakurai, Suzu Hirose, Sota Fukushi, Tao Okamoto, Lily Franky, Mirai Shida, Hiroshi Tamaki, Eriko Sato', null, 'An environmental analyst is asked by the police to determine if two deaths by hydrogen sulfide poisoning are an accident - or a murder. But when he meets a young woman at both sites, a scientific mystery begins.', 'An environmental analyst is asked by the police to determine if two deaths by hydrogen sulfide poisoning are an accident - or a murder. But when he meets a young woman at both sites, a scientific mystery begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHo8352V9gA1y3IE1QCvaNdioz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489891'),
  ('158637507228154242', 'Lapland Odyssey', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Dome Karukoski, Antti Lahtinen, Kaisa Roover', 'Pekko Pesonen', 'Jussi Vatanen, Jasper Pääkkönen, Timo Lavikainen, Pamela Tola, Kari Ketonen, Miia Nuutila, Konsta Mäkelä, Sinikka Mokkila', null, 'Lapland Odyssey is a comedy about Janne, a man from Lapland in northern Finland, a man who has made a career out of living on welfare. Inari, his girlfriend, is tired of Janne''s incapability of getting a grip on life, Janne wasn''t even able to buy a digital TV box that Inari had given money for. Inari gives an ultimatum: a digital box needs to arrive by dawn or she leaves. Janne sets out into the night with his two friends to find a box. On their way to the city of Rovaniemi, Janne and his friends face many challenges, obstacles and temptations. They learn that they need to be daring. There''s no room to give into bitterness. The most important thing isn''t success, but rather the journey in itself.', 'Lapland Odyssey is a comedy about Janne, a man from Lapland in northern Finland, a man who has made a career out of living on welfare. Inari, his girlfriend, is tired of Janne''s incapability of getting a grip on life, Janne wasn''t even able to buy a digital TV box that Inari had given money for. Inari gives an ultimatum: a digital box needs to arrive by dawn or she leaves. Janne sets out into the night with his two friends to find a box. On their way to the city of Rovaniemi, Janne and his friends face many challenges, obstacles and temptations. They learn that they need to be daring. There''s no room to give into bitterness. The most important thing isn''t success, but rather the journey in itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Xx7ozeiCRXcfyNZPi9KZEaDMZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58764'),
  ('438371167368736287', 'Lapsis', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Mike Gomes, Alex Burstein, Tony Clemente Jr', 'Noah Hutton', 'Dean Imperial, Madeline Wise, Ivory Aquino, Babe Howard, Dora Madison, James McDaniel, Arliss Howard, Frank Wood', null, 'In a parallel present, delivery man Ray Tincelli is struggling to support himself and his ailing younger brother. After a series of two-bit hustles and unsuccessful swindles, Ray takes a job in a strange new realm of the gig economy: trekking deep into the forest, pulling cable over miles of terrain to connect large, metal cubes that link together the new quantum trading market. As he gets pulled deeper into the zone, he encounters growing hostility and the threat of robot cablers, and must choose to either help his fellow workers or to get rich and get out.', 'In a parallel present, delivery man Ray Tincelli is struggling to support himself and his ailing younger brother. After a series of two-bit hustles and unsuccessful swindles, Ray takes a job in a strange new realm of the gig economy: trekking deep into the forest, pulling cable over miles of terrain to connect large, metal cubes that link together the new quantum trading market. As he gets pulled deeper into the zone, he encounters growing hostility and the threat of robot cablers, and must choose to either help his fellow workers or to get rich and get out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXw5f1O5t930kWa9tJAr90BCeOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665888'),
  ('466563591952975002', 'Lara', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Jan Ole Gerster, Frank Griebe', 'Blaž Kutin', 'Corinna Harfouch, Tom Schilling, Volkmar Kleinert, André Jung, Gudrun Ritter, Rainer Bock, Hildegard Schroedter, Susanne Bredehöft', null, 'Today is Lara’s 60th birthday, which happens to fall on the same day as her pianist son’s career-defining concert. A failed pianist herself, Lara spends the time before his performance pacing about Berlin—boiling with jealousy, nerves, and pride—trying to get hold of her elusive son.', 'Today is Lara’s 60th birthday, which happens to fall on the same day as her pianist son’s career-defining concert. A failed pianist herself, Lara spends the time before his performance pacing about Berlin—boiling with jealousy, nerves, and pride—trying to get hold of her elusive son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EyGScXJoliTgQ0MLdpiCTDcmw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576281'),
  ('458558418370264230', 'Lara Croft: Tomb Raider', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Peter Menzies Jr., Simon West, Terry Bamber', 'Patrick Massett, John Zinman', 'Angelina Jolie, Iain Glen, Daniel Craig, Noah Taylor, Chris Barrie, Jon Voight, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Leslie Phillips', 'PG-13', 'Orphaned heiress, English aristocrat and intrepid archaeologist, Lara Croft, embarks on a dangerous quest to retrieve the two halves of an ancient artifact which controls time before it falls into the wrong hands. As an extremely rare planetary alignment is about to occur for the first time in 5,000 years, the fearless tomb raider will have to team up with rival adventurers and sworn enemies to collect the pieces, while time is running out. But, in the end, who can harness the archaic talisman''s unlimited power?', 'Orphaned heiress, English aristocrat and intrepid archaeologist, Lara Croft, embarks on a dangerous quest to retrieve the two halves of an ancient artifact which controls time before it falls into the wrong hands. As an extremely rare planetary alignment is about to occur for the first time in 5,000 years, the fearless tomb raider will have to team up with rival adventurers and sworn enemies to collect the pieces, while time is running out. But, in the end, who can harness the archaic talisman''s unlimited power?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye5h6fhfz8TkKV4QeuTucvFzxB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1995'),
  ('546025650434454413', 'Lara Croft: Tomb Raider - The Cradle of Life', 2003, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Jan de Bont, David Tattersall, Wai Pun Chan', 'Dean Georgaris', 'Angelina Jolie, Gerard Butler, Ciarán Hinds, Chris Barrie, Noah Taylor, Djimon Hounsou, Til Schweiger, Simon Yam', 'PG-13', 'Off the coast of the volcanic island of Santorini, the intrepid archaeologist Lara Croft makes the unexpected discovery of a pulsating golden orb able to guide its holder to the mythical Pandora''s Box. As the legendary artifact contains ancient mysteries of unfathomable power - said to contain one of the deadliest plagues on Earth, Lara is tasked by MI6 to make sure it doesn''t fall into the wrong hands. With the aid of former Marine turned mercenary Terry Sheridan, she travels the world in pursuit of the precious item in a race against time; she must beat the unscrupulous Nobel Prize-winning scientist turned bioterrorist, Jonathan Reiss, to it.', 'Off the coast of the volcanic island of Santorini, the intrepid archaeologist Lara Croft makes the unexpected discovery of a pulsating golden orb able to guide its holder to the mythical Pandora''s Box. As the legendary artifact contains ancient mysteries of unfathomable power - said to contain one of the deadliest plagues on Earth, Lara is tasked by MI6 to make sure it doesn''t fall into the wrong hands. With the aid of former Marine turned mercenary Terry Sheridan, she travels the world in pursuit of the precious item in a race against time; she must beat the unscrupulous Nobel Prize-winning scientist turned bioterrorist, Jonathan Reiss, to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylIEGeAr2ygSClK4FDj9mi2Ah22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1996'),
  ('449626492447858064', 'Larceny', 1948, 'Drama, Crime', 'George Sherman, Irving Glassberg, Jesse Hibbs', 'Herbert H. Margolis, William Bowers, Lou Morheim', 'John Payne, Joan Caulfield, Dan Duryea, Shelley Winters, Dorothy Hart, Richard Rober, Dan O''Herlihy, Nicholas Joy', 'NR', 'Rick Mason is the no-good lowdown rat who tries to capitalize on postwar patriotism and grief. He finagles a war widow into giving up her savings for a nonexistent memorial. When Mason falls in love with the widow he has pangs of conscience, but he reckons without his con-artist boss, who tends to bolster his arguments with muscle and bullets.', 'Rick Mason is the no-good lowdown rat who tries to capitalize on postwar patriotism and grief. He finagles a war widow into giving up her savings for a nonexistent memorial. When Mason falls in love with the widow he has pangs of conscience, but he reckons without his con-artist boss, who tends to bolster his arguments with muscle and bullets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VOFGu4DNZjRILnOmFXEi25n5GL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25689'),
  ('1053815611642734026', 'Larceny', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'R. Ellis Frazier, Jorge Román', 'Benjamin Budd, Scott Windhauser', 'Dolph Lundgren, Louis Mandylor, Isaac C. Singleton, Jr., Jocelyn Osorio, Fabián López, Mauricio Mendoza, Eddie J. Fernandez, Claudia Villa Iribe', null, 'After being busted for a heist, a former CIA contractor is sent to a Mexican prison. His former CIA boss offers him freedom if he can break into the prison vault and steal $50 Million.', 'After being busted for a heist, a former CIA contractor is sent to a Mexican prison. His former CIA boss offers him freedom if he can break into the prison vault and steal $50 Million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUviwREBPSuST9DQ243hKaUbhgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445962'),
  ('546385950154475483', 'Larceny, Inc.', 1942, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lloyd Bacon, Tony Gaudio', 'Edwin Gilbert, Everett Freeman', 'Edward G. Robinson, Jane Wyman, Broderick Crawford, Jack Carson, Anthony Quinn, Edward Brophy, Harry Davenport, John Qualen', 'NR', 'Three ex-cons buy a luggage shop to tunnel into the bank vault next door. But despite all they can do, the shop prospers...', 'Three ex-cons buy a luggage shop to tunnel into the bank vault next door. But despite all they can do, the shop prospers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2Eb8Y7zv6jcOrLpodmMFrgFxpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69119'),
  ('277819268302129828', 'Larco Ave.: The Movie', 2017, 'History, Music, Drama', 'Jorge Carmona Del Solar, Gianfranco Alcántara', 'Javier Fuentes-León', 'Juan Carlos Rey de Castro, Andrés Salas, Carlos Galiano, Nicolás Galindo, André Silva, Carolina Cano, Daniela Camaiora, Maria Grazia Gamarra', 'PG-13', 'Based on a theater musical, this movie is set in the city of Lima, Peru during the end of the 80''s. The plot is about a group of youngsters from Lima who are participating in a contest for the best new Peruvian rock band. All these while they have to deal with the worst economic situation in Peru, corrupt leaders and terrorism that is rampant throughout the country. Features very popular Peruvian rock songs from the 80''s and 90''s.', 'Based on a theater musical, this movie is set in the city of Lima, Peru during the end of the 80''s. The plot is about a group of youngsters from Lima who are participating in a contest for the best new Peruvian rock band. All these while they have to deal with the worst economic situation in Peru, corrupt leaders and terrorism that is rampant throughout the country. Features very popular Peruvian rock songs from the 80''s and 90''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozG4f0FLr0yPJtU3clFBJVdsNaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450248'),
  ('427647032791732204', 'Larger Than Life', 1996, 'Comedy, Family', 'Howard Franklin, Elliot Davis, Ernie F. Orsatti', 'Roy Blount Jr.', 'Bill Murray, Janeane Garofalo, Matthew McConaughey, Linda Fiorentino, Pat Hingle, Jeremy Piven, Anita Gillette, Maureen Mueller', 'PG', 'Motivational Speaker Jack Corcoran is determined to get his career off the ground, but the biggest gigs he can get are the ones nobody wants. One day, he receives a telegram that his circus clown father has passed away and left a "huge" inheritance: an elephant that was his father''s pride and joy. His main intention to sell the pachyderm off, Jack must choose between loud and rude zookeeper Mo or attractive animal show owner Terry. As the two trek through the country Jack and the elephant develop a bond, and it changes his approach to life for the better.', 'Motivational Speaker Jack Corcoran is determined to get his career off the ground, but the biggest gigs he can get are the ones nobody wants. One day, he receives a telegram that his circus clown father has passed away and left a "huge" inheritance: an elephant that was his father''s pride and joy. His main intention to sell the pachyderm off, Jack must choose between loud and rude zookeeper Mo or attractive animal show owner Terry. As the two trek through the country Jack and the elephant develop a bond, and it changes his approach to life for the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdpEVxE5IUQv1qEBxWcQM49qDF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34170'),
  ('254371249393848511', 'Largo Winch II', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jérôme Salle, Denis Rouden, Roberto De Angelis', 'Jérôme Salle, Julien Rappeneau', 'Tomer Sisley, Sharon Stone, Ulrich Tukur, Olivier Barthélémy, Napakpapha Nakprasitte, Laurent Terzieff, Nicolas Vaude, François Montagut', null, 'Propelled to the head of the W Group after the death of his adoptive father, Largo Winch decides, to everyone''s surprise, to sell it, and use the proceeds to create an ambitious humanitarian foundation. But on the very same day, he finds himself accused of crimes against humanity by a mysterious witness. To prove his innocence, Largo will have to retrace the steps of his past life, in the heart of the Burmese jungle.', 'Propelled to the head of the W Group after the death of his adoptive father, Largo Winch decides, to everyone''s surprise, to sell it, and use the proceeds to create an ambitious humanitarian foundation. But on the very same day, he finds himself accused of crimes against humanity by a mysterious witness. To prove his innocence, Largo will have to retrace the steps of his past life, in the heart of the Burmese jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cS7v9W2OeOQFkTWA9PbeTrXoCEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57331'),
  ('1147075134950785528', 'Larisa', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Elem Klimov, Vladimir Byelov, Yuri Skhirtladze', 'German Klimov, Elem Klimov', 'Larisa Shepitko, Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Elem Klimov, Valentin Rasputin, Stefaniya Stanyuta, Maya Bulgakova', null, 'Elem Klimov''s tribute to his late wife, director Larisa Shepitko, killed in a car accident a year earlier. Features excerpts from all of her films, and archival audio of her discussing life and art.', 'Elem Klimov''s tribute to his late wife, director Larisa Shepitko, killed in a car accident a year earlier. Features excerpts from all of her films, and archival audio of her discussing life and art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbb41PPM4o2TLCDqtj8tPWmCjj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257788'),
