  ('267856647804627547', 'Larks on a String', 1969, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Miloš Kohout', 'Jiří Menzel, Bohumil Hrabal', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Václav Neckář, Jitka Zelenohorská, Vlastimil Brodský, Vladimír Ptáček, Ferdinand Krůta, František Řehák, Leoš Suchařípa', null, 'In post-WWII Communist Czechoslovakia, several characters considered bourgeois are sentenced to work in a junkyard for rehabilitation. Among them is a young man who pines for a female convict.', 'In post-WWII Communist Czechoslovakia, several characters considered bourgeois are sentenced to work in a junkyard for rehabilitation. Among them is a young man who pines for a female convict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyM7dduKJFIH8Ybydp7HYCbd5lI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12078'),
  ('268723710247423967', 'LaRoy, Texas', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Shane Atkinson, Abigail Hunter, Julian Cavett', 'Shane Atkinson', 'John Magaro, Steve Zahn, Galadriel Stineman, Matthew Del Negro, Bob Clendenin, Brad Leland, Dylan Baker, Megan Stevenson', 'NR', 'Broke and depressed, Ray is mistaken for a dangerous hitman and given an envelope of cash. Along with his P.I. friend Skip, he must escape the actual hitman to make it out of LaRoy alive.', 'Broke and depressed, Ray is mistaken for a dangerous hitman and given an envelope of cash. Along with his P.I. friend Skip, he must escape the actual hitman to make it out of LaRoy alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEYfXyWhFJScE0I5rHsS2JxIiPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001783'),
