  ('967166516055006139', 'Larry Gaye: Renegade Male Flight Attendant', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Sam Friedlander, Elisha Christian', 'Mike Sikowitz', 'Mark Feuerstein, Jayma Mays, Rebecca Romijn, Stanley Tucci, Henry Winkler, Danny Pudi, Patrick Warburton, Jason Alexander', 'R', 'A self-anointed ''renegade'' male flight attendant must save the day when the airline he works for tries to eliminate flight attendants as a cost-cutting measure.', 'A self-anointed ''renegade'' male flight attendant must save the day when the airline he works for tries to eliminate flight attendants as a cost-cutting measure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJRHaDoOoA0jcDwrLwljCM0B4Ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339355'),
  ('829028864962166345', 'Larry the Cable Guy: Health Inspector', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Trent Cooper, Kim Marks', 'Jonathan Bernstein, James Greer', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Iris Bahr, Tony Hale, David Koechner, Brooke Dillman, Joanna Cassidy, Megyn Price, Tom Hillmann', 'PG-13', 'A slovenly cable repairman becomes a big-city health inspector and is tasked with uncovering the source of a food poisoning epidemic.', 'A slovenly cable repairman becomes a big-city health inspector and is tasked with uncovering the source of a food poisoning epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlPadYpBkSvgTbGFhYTDgacAOEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15639'),
  ('52771813346004001', 'Lars and the Real Girl', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Craig Gillespie, Adam Kimmel, Patrick Murphy', 'Nancy Oliver', 'Ryan Gosling, Emily Mortimer, Paul Schneider, R.D. Reid, Kelli Garner, Nancy Beatty, Doug Lennox, Joe Bostick', 'PG-13', 'Extremely shy Lars finds it impossible to make friends or socialize. His brother and sister-in-law worry about him, so when he announces that he has a girlfriend he met on the Internet, they are overjoyed. But Lars'' new lady is a life-size plastic woman. On the advice of a doctor, his family and the rest of the community go along with his delusion.', 'Extremely shy Lars finds it impossible to make friends or socialize. His brother and sister-in-law worry about him, so when he announces that he has a girlfriend he met on the Internet, they are overjoyed. But Lars'' new lady is a life-size plastic woman. On the advice of a doctor, his family and the rest of the community go along with his delusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkAt4a7KIPc7Fi1BhxNHhYYbe2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6615'),
  ('832656692325262222', 'Lars Ole, 5c.', 1973, 'Drama', 'Nils Malmros, Erik Nygaard', 'Nils Malmros', 'Søren Rasmussen, Knud Randa Frank Nielsen, Lars Randrup Mikkelsen, Judith Nysom, Ilse Sørensen, Anne-Marie Udsen, Ole Rasmussen, Kim Noes', null, 'An upper grade school class with its inter-relations, scheming and sniffing around for the scent of adult pleasures, all caught in near-cinema verité style.', 'An upper grade school class with its inter-relations, scheming and sniffing around for the scent of adult pleasures, all caught in near-cinema verité style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBWHTQgs6j8LCfZMJcUL1IY3emd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121533'),
  ('546752860473917353', 'Larva', 2005, 'Horror, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Abram Cox, Stephen Lighthill, Dave Rutherford', 'T.M. Van Ostrand, Kevin Moore, J.Paul V.Robert', 'Vincent Ventresca, Rachel Hunter, William Forsythe, David Selby, Jennifer Lyn Quackenbush, Robert Miano, James Daris, James Sheldon', 'R', 'In Host, Missouri, the newcomer Dr. of Veterinary Science Eli Rudkus is called by the farmer Jacob Long to exam one of his cows. The veterinarian finds a strange parasite in the animal and sends it to a friend in the Department of Agriculture for research. Later, he finds the same parasite in a creek and he summons the population for a meeting, warning that the cause might be the animal food. However, Fletcher Odermatt, the wealthy owner of the local Host Tender Meals that has been providing free animal food for the farmers, brings his lawyer Hayley Anderson and discredits Eli. When a huge mutant parasite attacks Eli and Jacob, they discover that the meals are actually an experimental genetic cocktail that is growing parasites inside the cattle and people. Written by Claudio Carvalho, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil', 'In Host, Missouri, the newcomer Dr. of Veterinary Science Eli Rudkus is called by the farmer Jacob Long to exam one of his cows. The veterinarian finds a strange parasite in the animal and sends it to a friend in the Department of Agriculture for research. Later, he finds the same parasite in a creek and he summons the population for a meeting, warning that the cause might be the animal food. However, Fletcher Odermatt, the wealthy owner of the local Host Tender Meals that has been providing free animal food for the farmers, brings his lawyer Hayley Anderson and discredits Eli. When a huge mutant parasite attacks Eli and Jacob, they discover that the meals are actually an experimental genetic cocktail that is growing parasites inside the cattle and people. Written by Claudio Carvalho, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16OwY4VyqeZyLvHdfyjznIqv2TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52244'),
  ('667423611729172895', 'Larva Pendant', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Young-cheol Joe', 'Young-cheol Joe, Chan-me Kwon, Ji-yeon Kim', 'Hong Bum-ki, Kang Shi-hyun', null, 'This silly short-film sequel to "Larva Island" and "The Larva Island Movie" follows farting friends Red and Yellow''s bumbling misadventures in the city.', 'This silly short-film sequel to "Larva Island" and "The Larva Island Movie" follows farting friends Red and Yellow''s bumbling misadventures in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPW5AkzoQSO8dWhE8WZMFvC41iW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973608'),
  ('6176886801425638', 'Las acacias', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Diego Poleri, Pablo Giorgelli', 'Pablo Giorgelli, Salvador Roselli', 'Germán de Silva, Hebe Duarte, Nayra Calle Mamani, Monica Coca, Lili Lopez', null, 'Rubén is a middle-aged Argentinian truck driver transporting timber between Paraguay and Buenos Aires. One day, at a truck stop, he picks up a young Paraguayan woman, Jacinta, whom his employer had told to take to Buenos Aires. To Rubén''s surprise, Jacinta brings along her five-month-old daughter, Anahí.', 'Rubén is a middle-aged Argentinian truck driver transporting timber between Paraguay and Buenos Aires. One day, at a truck stop, he picks up a young Paraguayan woman, Jacinta, whom his employer had told to take to Buenos Aires. To Rubén''s surprise, Jacinta brings along her five-month-old daughter, Anahí.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waAb5FlGzmo7TkCNA0t1P0aymQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85549'),
  ('216436553785934439', 'Las Aparicio', 2016, 'Drama', 'Moisés Ortiz Urquidi', 'Lucía Carreras', 'Ana de la Reguera, Paulina Gaitán, Eréndira Ibarra, Liz Gallardo, Iliana Fox, María del Carmen Farias, Sharon Zundel, Paloma Arredondo', null, 'Three generations of women who share a strange family tradition: all widowed in extraordinary circumstances; all give birth only to girls. This is the film based on the television series.', 'Three generations of women who share a strange family tradition: all widowed in extraordinary circumstances; all give birth only to girls. This is the film based on the television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBrfdWjAnu58AcbCcEUrWhhjIaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273828'),
