  ('159252025679082709', 'Las cinéphilas', 2017, 'Documentary', 'María Álvarez, Tirso Díaz-Jares Rueda', 'María Álvarez', 'Norma Bárbaro, Estela Clavería, Lucía Aguirre, Leopoldina Novoa, Paloma Díez-Picasso, Chelo Plaza Domínguez', null, 'Six elderly retired women, two from Buenos Aires, Argentina; two from Montevideo, Uruguay; and two from Madrid, Spain, have something in common, despite their different interests and lives: they go to the movies almost every day.', 'Six elderly retired women, two from Buenos Aires, Argentina; two from Montevideo, Uruguay; and two from Madrid, Spain, have something in common, despite their different interests and lives: they go to the movies almost every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kwmVWso2ZtpljhKjFrIK3s4eU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453661'),
  ('206236794355464544', 'Las delicias del poder', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Iván Lipkies, Alberto Lee', 'María Elena Velasco', 'María Elena Velasco, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Irma Dorantes, Farnesio de Bernal, Adalberto Martínez, Héctor Ortega, Arturo Echeverría, Alicia Sandoval', null, 'A political candidate has an accident that will bring her out of the campaign unless her twin sister may be able to supplant her while she recovers.', 'A political candidate has an accident that will bring her out of the campaign unless her twin sister may be able to supplant her while she recovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfY7f3xPy5tcpN3HiS1j8y1CMrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346517'),
  ('967737996273884715', 'Las Horas Contigo', 2015, 'Drama', 'Catalina Aguilar Mastretta, Bérénice Eveno', 'Catalina Aguilar Mastretta', 'Cassandra Ciangherotti, María Rojo, Isela Vega, Arcelia Ramírez, Evangelina Martínez, Pablo Cruz Guerrero, Humberto Busto, Julio Bracho', null, 'Ema finds out she is pregnant with an unplanned child she''s not sure she wants to keep, the same week her beloved grandmother becomes gravely ill. Spending her last days at her grandmother''s side, Ema is forced to spend time with her estranged, larger than life mother, getting to know her and seeing her with new eyes. As she spends time with the people gathered around her grandmother in her last days; Ema re-evaluates her beliefs, her fears and her set ideas about family, love and parenthood.', 'Ema finds out she is pregnant with an unplanned child she''s not sure she wants to keep, the same week her beloved grandmother becomes gravely ill. Spending her last days at her grandmother''s side, Ema is forced to spend time with her estranged, larger than life mother, getting to know her and seeing her with new eyes. As she spends time with the people gathered around her grandmother in her last days; Ema re-evaluates her beliefs, her fears and her set ideas about family, love and parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjsVxlqkoZRK8hLXf4XpDdeBfkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262173'),
  ('338560364386498590', 'Las Islas Marias', 1951, 'Drama', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Mauricio Magdaleno, Emilio Fernández', 'Pedro Infante, Rosaura Revueltas, Rocío Sagaón, Esther Luquín, Jaime Fernández, Arturo Soto Rangel, Julio Villarreal, Rodolfo Acosta', null, 'Las Islas Marias stars Pedro Infante as a man who must face time in jail, even though he never committed the crime. While on the inside, he learns important life lessons that actually make him a better man.', 'Las Islas Marias stars Pedro Infante as a man who must face time in jail, even though he never committed the crime. While on the inside, he learns important life lessons that actually make him a better man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BMlnGPmxAsk70ZeeL2iPNx84T9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75965'),
  ('417069335765939489', 'Las Leandras', 1969, 'Comedy, Music', 'Eugenio Martín, Christian Matras', 'José Muñoz Román, Emilio González del Castillo', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Alfredo Landa, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Juanito Navarro, Antonio Garisa, Isabel Garcés, Jeremy Bulloch, Celia Gámez', null, 'After finishing her studies in London, Patricia returns to Spain, excited to see her mother again, a famous revue showgirl. But upon her arrival, she discovers that her mother is ruined and working in a low-tier theater. Mother and daughter decide to fight together to regain fame and fortune.', 'After finishing her studies in London, Patricia returns to Spain, excited to see her mother again, a famous revue showgirl. But upon her arrival, she discovers that her mother is ruined and working in a low-tier theater. Mother and daughter decide to fight together to regain fame and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCgh9Cgms8nRpLvNjv5TAMXb0Vp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383511'),
