  ('871245492862032599', 'Las Zetas', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Samperio', 'Saúl Pérez Santana', 'Carlos Bonavides, José Magaña, Pablo Cheng, Yesenia Spezzia, Jenny Chagolla', null, 'Chief Z is the leader of a small group of criminals made up of three pretty girls and a charismatic gay boy, it is because they are very efficient in their work that Charis, a local command officer is in search his whereabouts and he will not rest until he succeeds in arresting them.', 'Chief Z is the leader of a small group of criminals made up of three pretty girls and a charismatic gay boy, it is because they are very efficient in their work that Charis, a local command officer is in search his whereabouts and he will not rest until he succeeds in arresting them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fl1R4iWblheLXi5FBzvma9kiv97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718432'),
  ('220502875037541025', 'Lascados', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Vitor Mafra, Lili Faria, Pedro Vargas Ionescu', 'Manoel Batista', 'Chay Suede, Paulo Vilela, José Trassi, Paloma Bernardi, Nando Cunha, Guilherme Fontes, João Côrtes, Veridiana Toledo', null, '1994. Felipe, Burunga and Deco are three young friends who want to enjoy the carnival. To do this, they take an old 1970s van, used to sell hot dogs, and leave Sao Paulo for Bahia.', '1994. Felipe, Burunga and Deco are three young friends who want to enjoy the carnival. To do this, they take an old 1970s van, used to sell hot dogs, and leave Sao Paulo for Bahia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OE57E5Snh6U46iGR4bG8Wqp9LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294095'),
  ('1114558253579234164', 'Lasciami Per Sempre', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simona Izzo, Tani Canevari', 'Simona Izzo, Matteo Bondioli', 'Barbora Bobuľová, Max Gazzè, Andrea Bellisario, Vanni Bramati, Veruska Rossi, Maurizio Casagrande, Mariano Rigillo, Myriam Catania', null, 'The romantic entanglements within a colorful family tree that has grown up around three sisters, Carmen, Viola, and Aida, during the celebration of a son''s birthday in a house on the island of Elba. Based on the novel by Simona Izzo.', 'The romantic entanglements within a colorful family tree that has grown up around three sisters, Carmen, Viola, and Aida, during the celebration of a son''s birthday in a house on the island of Elba. Based on the novel by Simona Izzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY1RN80wxAGOxyf72DdzCVJ5Bg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437688'),
  ('18631189173703429', 'Laser Mission', 1989, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'BJ Davis, Hans Kühle Jr., Willie Coetzee', 'Phillip Gutteridge', 'Brandon Lee, Debi A. Monahan, Ernest Borgnine, Graham Clarke, Werner Pochath, BJ Davis, Maureen Lahoud, Pierre Knoesen', 'NR', 'A CIA agent is sent to get Professor Braun before the KGB can seize him as the Prof''s knowledge, together with a recently stolen diamond, could be used to make a laser cannon.', 'A CIA agent is sent to get Professor Braun before the KGB can seize him as the Prof''s knowledge, together with a recently stolen diamond, could be used to make a laser cannon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DVTsh96dGeHJoaUCJd7H6cZE6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35632'),
  ('606263114976405416', 'Laserblast', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Michael Rae, Terry Bowen, Jodie Copelan', 'Franne Schacht, Frank Ray Perilli', 'Kim Milford, Cheryl Smith, Gianni Russo, Ron Masak, Eddie Deezen, Keenan Wynn, Roddy McDowall, Dennis Burkley', 'PG', 'Happy go-lucky teen Billy Duncan discovers an otherworldly laser gun in the southern California desert, making him the target of a pair of aliens who had recently executed its previous owner.', 'Happy go-lucky teen Billy Duncan discovers an otherworldly laser gun in the southern California desert, making him the target of a pair of aliens who had recently executed its previous owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxv1Z0URENuWADDRwvRINUWUsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17874'),
  ('723331762595690255', 'Laserhawk', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Jean Pellerin, Eric Moynier', 'John A. Curtis', 'Jason James Richter, Melissa Galianos, Gordon Currie, Mark Hamill, Ivan Rogers, Joseph Wynne, Richard Zeman, Susan Almgren', null, '250 million years ago, a carnivorous species ''planted'' a crop of humans on an uninhabited planet known as Earth. Now, the alien life form has returned to harvest its yield. With total destruction looming just moments away, a futuristic warrior and a prophetic mental patient join forces against the creatures, but with mortal weapons no match for the superior alien technology, the duo''s only hope for victory lies in finding a 250 million year-old spaceship known as Laserhawk. The future of the world depends on it.', '250 million years ago, a carnivorous species ''planted'' a crop of humans on an uninhabited planet known as Earth. Now, the alien life form has returned to harvest its yield. With total destruction looming just moments away, a futuristic warrior and a prophetic mental patient join forces against the creatures, but with mortal weapons no match for the superior alien technology, the duo''s only hope for victory lies in finding a 250 million year-old spaceship known as Laserhawk. The future of the world depends on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8r1FIRXvqMl8UMUQ6I0xoHMzGw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42777'),
  ('275657805155303023', 'Lasseter-san, Thank You', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Junichi Sato', 'Toshio Suzuki', 'Hayao Miyazaki, John Lasseter, Toshio Suzuki, Rex Jones', null, 'Depicts the 2002 trip by several employees of Studio Ghibli to promote the movie Sen to Chihiro no Kamikakushi (Spirited Away) in North America. It was originally made as a private thank-you gift from Ghibli to John Lasseter, the Lasseter-San of the title. The show appears similar to a home movie, or private documentary. This footage includes snippets from some of Miyazaki''s films, as well as some Pixar shorts. The most striking part were clips from Porco Rosso, interchanging with images of Miyazaki flying a red double-decker.', 'Depicts the 2002 trip by several employees of Studio Ghibli to promote the movie Sen to Chihiro no Kamikakushi (Spirited Away) in North America. It was originally made as a private thank-you gift from Ghibli to John Lasseter, the Lasseter-San of the title. The show appears similar to a home movie, or private documentary. This footage includes snippets from some of Miyazaki''s films, as well as some Pixar shorts. The most striking part were clips from Porco Rosso, interchanging with images of Miyazaki flying a red double-decker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aseEArn89iC7ie8PiDOWEmGwnjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93125'),
  ('301240105176319566', 'Lassie', 1994, 'Family, Adventure', 'Daniel Petrie, Kenneth MacMillan', 'Matthew Jacobs, Elizabeth Anderson, Gary Ross', 'Tom Guiry, Helen Slater, Jon Tenney, Brittany Boyd, Frederic Forrest, Richard Farnsworth, Michelle Williams, Joe Inscoe', 'PG', 'On their way to start a new life at a sheep farm in rural Virginia, the Turner family are halted by a wreck on the highway that has claimed the life of a truck driver. Spotting the trucker''s now-abandoned collie on the side of the road, they take pity on the dog and adopt her. As the city family copes with the change to rural life, including a feud with a neighboring farm family who resent the city interlopers, the ever-loyal Lassie helps them adjust to their new surroundings.', 'On their way to start a new life at a sheep farm in rural Virginia, the Turner family are halted by a wreck on the highway that has claimed the life of a truck driver. Spotting the trucker''s now-abandoned collie on the side of the road, they take pity on the dog and adopt her. As the city family copes with the change to rural life, including a feud with a neighboring farm family who resent the city interlopers, the ever-loyal Lassie helps them adjust to their new surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Tz2rzFivQKmMBz5T8Cj7M7CdnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29918'),
  ('176665800017961733', 'Lassie', 2005, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Charles Sturridge, Howard Atherton', 'Charles Sturridge', 'Peter O''Toole, Samantha Morton, John Lynch, Peter Dinklage, Hester Odgers, Celyn Jones, Gerry O''Brien, Steve Pemberton', 'PG', 'A family in financial crisis is forced to sell Lassie, their beloved dog. Hundreds of miles away from her true family, Lassie escapes and sets out on a journey home.', 'A family in financial crisis is forced to sell Lassie, their beloved dog. Hundreds of miles away from her true family, Lassie escapes and sets out on a journey home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qB7NcROV5GzWLhHyFjSobPq9Eue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14597'),
  ('1132091424922875971', 'Lassie Come Home', 1943, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Fred M. Wilcox, Leonard Smith, Charles P. Boyle', 'Hugo Butler', 'Roddy McDowall, Donald Crisp, May Whitty, Edmund Gwenn, Nigel Bruce, Elsa Lanchester, Elizabeth Taylor, Ben Webster', 'G', 'Hard times come for the Carraclough family and they are forced to sell their dog, Lassie, to the rich Duke of Rudling. Lassie, however, is unwilling to remain apart from young Carraclough son Joe and sets out on a long and dangerous journey to rejoin him.', 'Hard times come for the Carraclough family and they are forced to sell their dog, Lassie, to the rich Duke of Rudling. Lassie, however, is unwilling to remain apart from young Carraclough son Joe and sets out on a long and dangerous journey to rejoin him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boMs7uR8yJEnHKSvzkszS6eenmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2202'),
  ('640937628146303628', 'Lassie Come Home', 2020, 'Adventure, Family', 'Hanno Olderdissen, Martin Schlecht', 'Jane Ainscough', 'Nico Marischka, Sebastian Bezzel, Anna Maria Mühe, Bella Bading, Matthias Habich, Johann von Bülow, Sina Bianca Hentschel, Jana Pallaske', null, '12-year-old Florian and his beloved dog Lassie live in an idyllic village in the German countryside. When Florian''s father loses his job, the family have to move into a small apartment where there are no dogs allowed. Lassie is given away to another family, but Florian and Lassie yearn to be reunited again so Florian sets out on an adventure to find his best friend.', '12-year-old Florian and his beloved dog Lassie live in an idyllic village in the German countryside. When Florian''s father loses his job, the family have to move into a small apartment where there are no dogs allowed. Lassie is given away to another family, but Florian and Lassie yearn to be reunited again so Florian sets out on an adventure to find his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffhVZGWhQdy2RY2EukRr4aQilu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657811'),
  ('783370423712251548', 'Lassie: A New Adventure', 2023, 'Adventure, Family', 'Hanno Olderdissen, Manuel Siebert, Carol Burandt von Kameke', 'Andreas Cordes', 'Nico Marischka, Katharina Schüttler, Justus von Dohnányi, Annette Frier, Anna Lucia Gualano, Pelle Staacken, Dennis Mojen, Maike Jüttendonk', 'PG', 'Flo and his trusted Collie pal Lassie spend the summer at Aunt Cosma''s, alongside her foster children Kleo and Henry, and her dog Pippa. When local canines start disappearing, including Pippa, Lassie rallies the kids to solve the mystery.', 'Flo and his trusted Collie pal Lassie spend the summer at Aunt Cosma''s, alongside her foster children Kleo and Henry, and her dog Pippa. When local canines start disappearing, including Pippa, Lassie rallies the kids to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGFcaPyEMK25fIs5BSAHrKsi2Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088563'),
  ('295829428174005204', 'Lassiter', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Gilbert Taylor, Roger Young, Callum McDougall', 'David Taylor', 'Tom Selleck, Jane Seymour, Lauren Hutton, Bob Hoskins, Joe Regalbuto, Ed Lauter, Warren Clarke, David Warbeck', 'R', 'A handsome jewel thief is arrested and in order to avoid prison, must break into the heavily guarded German Embassy to steal millions in gems.', 'A handsome jewel thief is arrested and in order to avoid prison, must break into the heavily guarded German Embassy to steal millions in gems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rf65AjoTRSXunAbvQ2TDFJaxyOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56821'),
  ('440475340187008428', 'Last Action Hero', 1993, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Dean Semler, John McTiernan, Jim Dultz', 'Shane Black, David Arnott', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Austin O''Brien, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, F. Murray Abraham, Art Carney, Charles Dance, Frank McRae, Tom Noonan', 'PG-13', 'After his father''s death, a young boy finds solace in action movies featuring an indestructible cop. Given a magic ticket by a theater manager, he is transported into the film and teams up with the cop to stop a villain who escapes into the real world.', 'After his father''s death, a young boy finds solace in action movies featuring an indestructible cop. Given a magic ticket by a theater manager, he is transported into the film and teams up with the cop to stop a villain who escapes into the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkhEaWAv5j3qgrOGp3BgMeiYPKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9593'),
  ('626307462581999230', 'Last and First Men', 2020, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Dino Parks, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen, Jóhann Jóhannsson', 'Jóhann Jóhannsson, José Enrique Macián', 'Tilda Swinton', null, 'As the end approaches inexorably, the last humans, living millions of years into the future, send a message to the humanity of the present that is both a plea for help and a warning, but also an epic tale of evolution, decline and hope.', 'As the end approaches inexorably, the last humans, living millions of years into the future, send a message to the humanity of the present that is both a plea for help and a warning, but also an epic tale of evolution, decline and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7B9t8lTFCJQ6GVvSbhrbrA7nsVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566038'),
  ('862975015848307508', 'Last Breath', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alex Parkinson, Richard Da Costa, Alex Parkinson', 'Alex Parkinson, Richard Da Costa', 'Duncan Allcock, Kjetil Ove Alvestad, Stuart Anderson, Glenn Brunskill, Michal Cichorski, Filippo De Filippi, Craig Frederick', null, 'A commercial diver is stranded on the seabed with only five minutes of oxygen supply, but with no chance of rescue for more than 30 minutes. With access to amazing archival footage, this is the true story of one man’s impossible fight for survival.', 'A commercial diver is stranded on the seabed with only five minutes of oxygen supply, but with no chance of rescue for more than 30 minutes. With access to amazing archival footage, this is the true story of one man’s impossible fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfTNsILhmDiChJJ7Zxxl8IUvkUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570973'),
  ('810256134240855593', 'Last Breath', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alex Parkinson, Ian Seabrook, Nick Remy Matthews', 'Mitchell LaFortune, Alex Parkinson, David Brooks', 'Woody Harrelson, Simu Liu, Finn Cole, Cliff Curtis, Mark Bonnar, MyAnna Buring, Josef Altin, Bobby Rainsbury', 'PG-13', 'Seasoned deep-sea divers battle the raging elements to rescue their crewmate trapped hundreds of feet below the ocean''s surface.', 'Seasoned deep-sea divers battle the raging elements to rescue their crewmate trapped hundreds of feet below the ocean''s surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uB8yTnF6YLIIVKuRJAK8LNk8C6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972533'),
  ('1085253549836998024', 'Last Bullet', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Nathalie Chéron, Guillaume Pierret, Cheyenne Corre', 'Guillaume Pierret', 'Alban Lenoir, Stéfi Celma, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Gérard Lanvin, Pascale Arbillot, Julie Tedesco, Anne Serra, Ramzy Bedia', 'R', 'Car genius Lino returns to conclude his vendetta against Areski and the corrupt commander who ruined their lives in this turbo-charged trilogy finale.', 'Car genius Lino returns to conclude his vendetta against Areski and the corrupt commander who ruined their lives in this turbo-charged trilogy finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qycPITRqXgPai7zj1gKffjCdSB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144430'),
  ('969710307089031505', 'Last Cab to Darwin', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Steve E. Andrews, Christopher Turner, Emma Masters', 'Reg Cribb, Jeremy Sims', 'Michael Caton, Jacki Weaver, Emma Hamilton, Ningali Lawford, Brian Taylor, Mark Coles Smith, John Howard, Alan Dukes', null, 'Rex is a loner, and when he''s told he doesn''t have long to live, he embarks on an epic drive through the Australian outback from Broken Hill to Darwin to die on his own terms; but his journey reveals to him that before you can end your life, you have to live it, and to live it, you''ve got to share it.', 'Rex is a loner, and when he''s told he doesn''t have long to live, he embarks on an epic drive through the Australian outback from Broken Hill to Darwin to die on his own terms; but his journey reveals to him that before you can end your life, you have to live it, and to live it, you''ve got to share it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MuEECBQKHTfrDY0HJuLRWwCNTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337958'),
  ('556826558398709647', 'Last Call', 1991, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'James Mathers, Jag Mundhra, Rodney McDonald', 'Steven Iyama', 'Shannon Tweed, Karen Elise Baldwin, William Katt, Stella Stevens, Crisstyn Dante, Joseph Campanella, Matt Roe, Allyson Rees-Stevens', null, 'As a little girl, Cindy had to witness how the shady estate agent Jason Laurence killed her mother. In the 22 years since then, he was never called to account for this crime. So Cindy decides to take vengeance herself.', 'As a little girl, Cindy had to witness how the shady estate agent Jason Laurence killed her mother. In the 22 years since then, he was never called to account for this crime. So Cindy decides to take vengeance herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TZcuO85CSJfOh2G4nIe4pSodfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218226'),
  ('590595996654542371', 'Last Call', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sherif Francis, Ramon Malapetsas, Kyle Bice, Dimitris Abatzis, Dimitris Papathanasis, Makis Gazis', 'Sherif Francis, Katerina Bei', 'Orfeas Avgoustidis, Maria Nafpliotou, Giorgos Benos, Dimitris Lalos, Renia Louizidou', null, 'New Year’s Eve 1999, Athens: a desperate fugitive armed with a live grenade takes a family hostage and demands to go on live TV as the world counts down to the new millennium. Broadcast in real time, the situation pulls in a young journalist, media executives and a divided police force, as an entire nation watches events spiral toward a tragic and irreversible outcome.', 'New Year’s Eve 1999, Athens: a desperate fugitive armed with a live grenade takes a family hostage and demands to go on live TV as the world counts down to the new millennium. Broadcast in real time, the situation pulls in a young journalist, media executives and a divided police force, as an entire nation watches events spiral toward a tragic and irreversible outcome.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcLgbupB4xCyBnGeiDOfYXepM632.jpg', 'plex:movie:last-call-2026'),
  ('875242842213107740', 'Last Call for Istanbul', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gönenç Uyanık, Gökhan Tiryaki, Leo Chen', 'Nuran Evren Şit', 'Beren Saat, Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Senan Kara, Zihan Zhao, Michael Loayza, Susan Slatin, Annie McCain Engman, Joy Donze', 'R', 'A chance meeting at the airport leads two married people to an unforgettable night full of excitement, desire, and temptation in New York City.', 'A chance meeting at the airport leads two married people to an unforgettable night full of excitement, desire, and temptation in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4kAmLjAeQmtFPqlZf4x7Bggu8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1044302'),
  ('622686270927607282', 'Last Call for Mom', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Bouvier, Allen Smith', 'Nathalie Petrowski', 'Sophie Lorain, Patrick Huard, Stéphane Demers, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Patricia Nolin, Julie Le Breton, Anick Lemay, Robert Toupin', null, 'Despite her lover''s feelings, a pro-choice journalist considers having an abortion.', 'Despite her lover''s feelings, a pro-choice journalist considers having an abortion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsNZNm3yaRfrm8QC7eGlmvvDTDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50602'),
  ('890719414068229687', 'Last Call for Nowhere', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Chauveron, Vincent Mathias', 'Philippe de Chauveron', 'Slimane Dazi, Reem Kherici, Medi Sadoun, Loïc Legendre, Ary Abittan, Cyril Lecomte, Jehanguir Byramjee, Jassem Mougari', null, 'French border cop José Fernandez has just one last extradition to do before his long-awaited promotion to the crime bureau. But his detainee Akim, victim of a judiciary glitch, is outraged to find himself saddled with the identity of a potential terrorist and put on a flight back to Kabul, where he has never even set foot before! What starts as a routine trip for Fernandez and his skirt-chasing partner Guy goes haywire when their plane is grounded in Malta, forcing them to bunk up with Akim, who will stop at nothing to avoid extradition!', 'French border cop José Fernandez has just one last extradition to do before his long-awaited promotion to the crime bureau. But his detainee Akim, victim of a judiciary glitch, is outraged to find himself saddled with the identity of a potential terrorist and put on a flight back to Kabul, where he has never even set foot before! What starts as a routine trip for Fernandez and his skirt-chasing partner Guy goes haywire when their plane is grounded in Malta, forcing them to bunk up with Akim, who will stop at nothing to avoid extradition!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0QB2TGtfnl7GxPsWDCLzFKlVDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382518'),
  ('741204265148157057', 'Last Call, Rio!', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Joaquín Mazón, Alfonso Segura', 'Daniel Corpas, Juana Macías, Antonio Mercero', 'Pablo Chiapella, Esther Acebo, Carlos Santos, Fran Perea, Kira Miró, María Botto, Carlos Areces, Jorge Cremades', null, 'Pedro, Kiko and David, three friends in their late thirties, travel to Rio de Janeiro to pick up the lifeless body of Mateo, their best friend from high school, who has died under mysterious circumstances. But when you arrive in Brazil, nothing is what it seems. Mateo, "the dead man", has fled, his house is upside down and one of his ex-girlfriends is desperately looking for him...', 'Pedro, Kiko and David, three friends in their late thirties, travel to Rio de Janeiro to pick up the lifeless body of Mateo, their best friend from high school, who has died under mysterious circumstances. But when you arrive in Brazil, nothing is what it seems. Mateo, "the dead man", has fled, his house is upside down and one of his ex-girlfriends is desperately looking for him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pwOlV2t3fP9z9rC0bHcd89skQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932308'),
  ('1133361551729909719', 'Last Cannibal World', 1977, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Ruggero Deodato, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Tito Carpi, Gianfranco Clerici, Renzo Genta', 'Massimo Foschi, Me Me Lai, Ivan Rassimov, Sheik Razak Shikur, Judy Rosly, Suleiman, Shamsi', 'R', 'An oil prospector escapes from capture by a primitive cannibal tribe in the Philippine rain forest and heads out to locate his missing companion and their plane to return home.', 'An oil prospector escapes from capture by a primitive cannibal tribe in the Philippine rain forest and heads out to locate his missing companion and their plane to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5MEqvaBLueVEEnetKdhax0DXhy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30876'),
  ('261951789339686285', 'Last Chance Harvey', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joel Hopkins, John de Borman', null, 'Dustin Hoffman, Emma Thompson, Eileen Atkins, Kathy Baker, Liane Balaban, Daniel Lapaine, James Brolin, Richard Schiff', 'PG-13', 'In London for his daughter''s wedding, a struggling jingle-writer, Harvey Shine, misses his plane to New York, and thus loses his job. While drowning his sorrows in the airport pub, Harvey meets Kate, a British government worker stuck in an endless cycle of work, phone calls from her mother, and blind dates. A connection forms between the unhappy pair, who soon find themselves falling in love.', 'In London for his daughter''s wedding, a struggling jingle-writer, Harvey Shine, misses his plane to New York, and thus loses his job. While drowning his sorrows in the airport pub, Harvey meets Kate, a British government worker stuck in an endless cycle of work, phone calls from her mother, and blind dates. A connection forms between the unhappy pair, who soon find themselves falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/er7IVSXCIxZt3RBOXqddePlRYua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16409'),
  ('948160428322316492', 'Last Chants for a Slow Dance', 1977, 'Drama', 'Jon Jost, Jon Jost', 'Jon Jost, Peter Trias', 'Tom Blair, Wayne Crouse, Jessica St. John, Steve Voorheis', null, 'A man who is dissatisfied with his family life leaves home for weeks at a time, drifting from town to town.', 'A man who is dissatisfied with his family life leaves home for weeks at a time, drifting from town to town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeUAQdO6q4C7FvwY9Uj4kiFCORh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97030'),
  ('726680986765842683', 'Last Child', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Shin Dong-seok, Lee Ji-hoon, Moon Il-ho', 'Shin Dong-seok', 'Choi Moo-seong, Kim Yeo-jin, Sung Yoo-bin, Kim Kyung-ik, Moon Young-dong, Lee Hwa-ryong, Park Chan, Kim Do-young', null, 'Six months ago the son of the married couple drowned. The couple, together with the teenager that their son saved, begin a journey to cope with the loss.', 'Six months ago the son of the married couple drowned. The couple, together with the teenager that their son saved, begin a journey to cope with the loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLs649rv6q1hJlG4VRnffs0X5IJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499646'),
  ('547753237887426029', 'Last Christmas', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alex Bowens, Paul Feig, Alice Searby', 'Bryony Kimmings, Emma Thompson', 'Emilia Clarke, Henry Golding, Michelle Yeoh, Emma Thompson, Lydia Leonard, Boris Isaković, Rebecca Root, Ingrid Oliver', 'PG-13', 'Kate is a young woman who has a habit of making bad decisions, and her last date with disaster occurs after she accepts work as Santa''s elf for a department store. However, after she meets Tom there, her life takes a new turn.', 'Kate is a young woman who has a habit of making bad decisions, and her last date with disaster occurs after she accepts work as Santa''s elf for a department store. However, after she meets Tom there, her life takes a new turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDEjffiKgjuGo2DRzsqfjvW0CQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549053'),
  ('70477607074093676', 'Last Conversations', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Jacques Cheuiche, Laura Liuzzi', null, 'Eduardo Coutinho, Tayna Veras, Bruna Barcelos, Rafaela Marques, Breno de Souza, Pâmela Luana, Estephane Silva, Thiago Theodoro', null, 'Made from interviews with young Brazilian students by filmmaker Eduardo Coutinho before his death (in February 2014), the film seeks to understand how teenagers think, live and dream nowadays. The footage was edited by Coutinho’s longtime partner, film editor Jordana Berg, and the final cut is signed by João Moreira Salles.', 'Made from interviews with young Brazilian students by filmmaker Eduardo Coutinho before his death (in February 2014), the film seeks to understand how teenagers think, live and dream nowadays. The footage was edited by Coutinho’s longtime partner, film editor Jordana Berg, and the final cut is signed by João Moreira Salles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1v1JZlmYyK5y7rr1j2vPegAmQ1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334636'),
  ('390463641871830692', 'Last Dance', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Peter James, Bruce Beresford', 'Ron Koslow', 'Sharon Stone, Rob Morrow, Randy Quaid, Peter Gallagher, Jack Thompson, Jayne Brook, Pamala Tyson, Skeet Ulrich', 'R', 'Upon taking a new job, young lawyer Rick Hayes is assigned to the clemency case of Cindy Liggett, a woman convicted of first degree murder and sentenced to death. As Hayes investigates the background for her case, the two begin to form a deep friendship, while all the while the date for her execution draws nearer.', 'Upon taking a new job, young lawyer Rick Hayes is assigned to the clemency case of Cindy Liggett, a woman convicted of first degree murder and sentenced to death. As Hayes investigates the background for her case, the two begin to form a deep friendship, while all the while the date for her execution draws nearer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsMe9TYfPs1VfpZs9xVLZBVGcES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46063'),
  ('852925151687717088', 'Last Dance', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Hélène Angel', 'Nacim Mehtar', 'Bernard Le Coq, Christiane Millet, Alexia Chardard, Talid Ariss, Maël Rouin Berrandou, Corentin Jamet, Thomas Chateaureynaud, Owen Nsimba Soba', null, 'Summer holidays, first love and a family secret. When 14-year-old Ali travels to the country with his little brother Selim to visit his grandparents, he is anything but enthusiastic. Ali does not yet know that he will meet the handsome Réjane and that his grandfather André is hiding something from the family. This will be the Summer where Ali will be tested.', 'Summer holidays, first love and a family secret. When 14-year-old Ali travels to the country with his little brother Selim to visit his grandparents, he is anything but enthusiastic. Ali does not yet know that he will meet the handsome Réjane and that his grandfather André is hiding something from the family. This will be the Summer where Ali will be tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfVLbtG8wI5gEIAqaYLeXoHI2ql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633836'),
  ('236598068242554720', 'Last Dance', 2023, 'Comedy, Music, Family', 'Delphine Lehericey, Elena Avdija', 'Delphine Lehericey, Fanny Burdino', 'François Berléand, Kacey Mottet Klein, La Ribot, Astrid Whettnall, Luc Bruchez, Sabine Timoteo, Déborah Lukumuena, Vincent Lecuyer', null, 'Germain, an introspective retiree, abruptly becomes a widower at 75. He barely has the time to realize what has happened to him before his family forces their way into his daily life: non-stop phone calls and visits, meals and activities organized in advance – all meant to make his life as regular as clockwork. But Germain’s mind is elsewhere. Honoring a promise he made to his dear departed wife, he suddenly finds himself at the heart of a contemporary dance company’s newest work.', 'Germain, an introspective retiree, abruptly becomes a widower at 75. He barely has the time to realize what has happened to him before his family forces their way into his daily life: non-stop phone calls and visits, meals and activities organized in advance – all meant to make his life as regular as clockwork. But Germain’s mind is elsewhere. Honoring a promise he made to his dear departed wife, he suddenly finds himself at the heart of a contemporary dance company’s newest work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bf6XRPhjCH7XJsPgbAPpspwhFsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943165'),
  ('826118382858450585', 'Last Day of Summer', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vlad Yudin, Patryk Rebisz', 'Vlad Yudin', 'DJ Qualls, William Sadler, Nikki Reed, Chris Bashinelli, Adam Scarimbolo, Jason Cruz, Heather Dilly, Samantha Kelly', 'R', 'This unpredictable story follows an agitated fast-food employee, Joe, who''s reached his breaking point from being harassed and tormented by his boss...', 'This unpredictable story follows an agitated fast-food employee, Joe, who''s reached his breaking point from being harassed and tormented by his boss...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k38iOe0OldPVr1Yo2BpSSIJCwvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44952'),
  ('1149492892642188284', 'Last Days', 2005, 'Drama', 'Harris Savides, Gus Van Sant', 'Gus Van Sant', 'Michael Pitt, Lukas Haas, Asia Argento, Scott Patrick Green, Nicole Vicius, Ricky Jay, Ryan Orion, Harmony Korine', 'R', 'The life and struggles of a notorious rock musician seeping into a pit of loneliness whose everyday life involves friends and family seeking financial aid and favors, inspired by rock music legend Kurt Cobain and his final hours.', 'The life and struggles of a notorious rock musician seeping into a pit of loneliness whose everyday life involves friends and family seeking financial aid and favors, inspired by rock music legend Kurt Cobain and his final hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btbp47CHXgLhw30kyDoVfNFLB3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1665'),
  ('777794563326209807', 'Last Days in Havana', 2016, 'Drama', 'Raúl Pérez Ureta, Fernando Pérez', 'Fernando Pérez, Abel Rodríguez', 'Patricio Wood, Jorge Martínez, Gabriela Ramos, Yailene Sierra', null, 'The story of a friendship in a city on the verge of substantial change. Miguel dreams of settling in New York while he waits for a visa that never seems to arrive, and Diego, a HIV-positive homosexual man, puts his dreams and cheerfulness to good use in his struggle to carry on enjoying every single day of his life from a rickety old bed in his small bedroom.', 'The story of a friendship in a city on the verge of substantial change. Miguel dreams of settling in New York while he waits for a visa that never seems to arrive, and Diego, a HIV-positive homosexual man, puts his dreams and cheerfulness to good use in his struggle to carry on enjoying every single day of his life from a rickety old bed in his small bedroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzqb9NP5LTKbVO39JKK0tLAuTVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436354'),
  ('104702345386968506', 'Last Days in Shibati', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Hendrick Dusollier', null, null, null, 'Shibati, the last old area of Chongqing, the biggest city in China, is about to disappear. Zhou Hong, 7 years old, little prince of the streets, and Mrs Xue Lian, 70, godmother of the migrant workers, have to leave their beloved life in this charming neighborhood, to be rehoused in one of the thousands anonymous towers of the faraway suburb.', 'Shibati, the last old area of Chongqing, the biggest city in China, is about to disappear. Zhou Hong, 7 years old, little prince of the streets, and Mrs Xue Lian, 70, godmother of the migrant workers, have to leave their beloved life in this charming neighborhood, to be rehoused in one of the thousands anonymous towers of the faraway suburb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emJJI8SRlZOfheE1V89UKecybOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490021'),
  ('1048209334512175944', 'Last Days in the Desert', 2016, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Emmanuel Lubezki, Rodrigo García', 'Rodrigo García', 'Ewan McGregor, Ciarán Hinds, Ayelet Zurer, Tye Sheridan, Susan Gray', null, 'On his way out of the wilderness, Jesus struggles with the Devil over the fate of a family in crisis, setting himself up for a dramatic test.', 'On his way out of the wilderness, Jesus struggles with the Devil over the fate of a family in crisis, setting himself up for a dramatic test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vbP28axycrpchnGSIydUseNkh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310119'),
  ('563104078619747974', 'Last Days in Vietnam', 2014, 'War, Documentary', 'Rory Kennedy, Joan Churchill', 'Keven McAlester, Mark Bailey', null, 'NR', 'During the chaotic final weeks of the Vietnam War, the North Vietnamese Army closes in on Saigon as the panicked South Vietnamese people desperately attempt to escape. On the ground, American soldiers and diplomats confront a moral quandary: whether to obey White House orders to evacuate only U.S. citizens.', 'During the chaotic final weeks of the Vietnam War, the North Vietnamese Army closes in on Saigon as the panicked South Vietnamese people desperately attempt to escape. On the ground, American soldiers and diplomats confront a moral quandary: whether to obey White House orders to evacuate only U.S. citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HUVUGg9DmmMvwXinoJJBUTa4NI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250761'),
  ('314753936252444812', 'Last Days of the Victim', 1982, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antonio Barrio, Daniel Castronuovo, Jorge Gundín', 'Adolfo Aristarain, José Pablo Feinmann', 'Federico Luppi, Soledad Silveyra, Ulises Dumont, Julio De Grazia, Arturo Maly, Elena Tasisto, Enrique Liporace, China Zorrilla', null, 'Mendizábal, a hit man, its ordered by his anonymous clients to murder a man. But in the precise and obsessive persecution, he will discover that he is only part of a game that doesn''t belong to him, a web at the service of greater interests.', 'Mendizábal, a hit man, its ordered by his anonymous clients to murder a man. But in the precise and obsessive persecution, he will discover that he is only part of a game that doesn''t belong to him, a web at the service of greater interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctRPbhNzihncgtrQpOHAwNLkLGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265626'),
  ('607975156608166731', 'Last Door South', 2015, 'Animation', 'Sacha Feiner', 'Sacha Feiner', null, null, '''The world is made of floors. Floors are connected by stairs and made of rooms. Rooms are connected by corridors. And all the floors form the World...'' Such is the theory developed by Toto, the siamese head of a child whose mother has locked away in a family manor, where he has been walled-in since his birth. Between endless corridor exploration, private schooling and fatherly Mausoleum visits, the brothers never questioned the limits of their world. Until one day, when, obsessed by a strange light, seen by accident, they decide to find the its end.', '''The world is made of floors. Floors are connected by stairs and made of rooms. Rooms are connected by corridors. And all the floors form the World...'' Such is the theory developed by Toto, the siamese head of a child whose mother has locked away in a family manor, where he has been walled-in since his birth. Between endless corridor exploration, private schooling and fatherly Mausoleum visits, the brothers never questioned the limits of their world. Until one day, when, obsessed by a strange light, seen by accident, they decide to find the its end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDwzdGcANlkzWREC6kme9CiI68b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358377'),
  ('273474540276094000', 'Last Embrace', 1979, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Jonathan Demme, Evelyn Purcell, Michael Rauch', 'David Shaber', 'Roy Scheider, Janet Margolin, John Glover, Sam Levene, Charles Napier, Christopher Walken, Jacqueline Brookes, David Margulies', 'R', 'Secret agent Harry Hannan suffers a mental breakdown when a botched mission in Mexico results in the death of his wife. He is sent to a mental asylum, after which he eventually returns to work. But, once again, he begins to doubt his sanity when he receives a bizarre death threat written in Hebrew. Not knowing which of his colleagues wants to kill him, Hannan teams up with pretty young college student Ellie Fabian to attempt to unravel the mystery.', 'Secret agent Harry Hannan suffers a mental breakdown when a botched mission in Mexico results in the death of his wife. He is sent to a mental asylum, after which he eventually returns to work. But, once again, he begins to doubt his sanity when he receives a bizarre death threat written in Hebrew. Not knowing which of his colleagues wants to kill him, Hannan teams up with pretty young college student Ellie Fabian to attempt to unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKhZnaSnQT591plckYcFrr0k5ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37923'),
  ('976676681897103916', 'Last Erotic Train', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Minoru Kunizawa, Takuya Hasegawa', 'Kosuke Komatsu', 'Yuho Kitada, Maimi Shinkawa, Takashi Kubo, Teruo Oka', null, 'In a crowded train compartment, Misa felt someone touching her in a sexually harassing way. A man stood up and pointed to a passenger named Yoshi, shouting, “Hey, stop it! You sex maniac!” Misa let Yoshi be arrested, though she could not confirm he was the culprit. However, she could not forget Yoshi until she met him again one day, and her feelings toward the suspect began to change.', 'In a crowded train compartment, Misa felt someone touching her in a sexually harassing way. A man stood up and pointed to a passenger named Yoshi, shouting, “Hey, stop it! You sex maniac!” Misa let Yoshi be arrested, though she could not confirm he was the culprit. However, she could not forget Yoshi until she met him again one day, and her feelings toward the suspect began to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mWjxGTDkBuauoJ9znLKa9SNu0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342374'),
  ('217849054409615033', 'Last Exit', 2006, 'TV Movie, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'John Fawcett, Frank Ruszczynski, Jean Frenette', 'Russ Cochrane', 'Kathleen Robertson, Andrea Roth, Noah Bernett, Linden Ashby, Vincent Davis, Bruce Dinsmore, Gianpaolo Venuta', null, 'The parallel stories of two ordinary women - one, a single mother barely supporting her handicapped son, and the other, a working mom precariously balancing her family with a high-pressure career - on one extraordinary day. Each woman''s life frays under the weight of her circumstances and spirals out of control. As police officers race to save them, pieces of a shattered puzzle fall into place - maybe this wasn''t just a tragic car accident after all. Both women fight for their lives, but ultimately, only one will survive.', 'The parallel stories of two ordinary women - one, a single mother barely supporting her handicapped son, and the other, a working mom precariously balancing her family with a high-pressure career - on one extraordinary day. Each woman''s life frays under the weight of her circumstances and spirals out of control. As police officers race to save them, pieces of a shattered puzzle fall into place - maybe this wasn''t just a tragic car accident after all. Both women fight for their lives, but ultimately, only one will survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yW1bmcDpyqCkjbLuA8jcXQ14fI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23411'),
  ('1127941882533089581', 'Last Exit to Brooklyn', 1989, 'Drama', 'Uli Edel, Stefan Czapsky, Don French', 'Desmond Nakano', 'Stephen Lang, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Burt Young, Peter Dobson, Christopher Murney, Jerry Orbach, Alexis Arquette, Stephen Baldwin', 'R', 'A gallery of characters in Brooklyn in the 1950s are crushed by their surroundings and selves: a union strike leader discovers he is gay; a prostitute falls in love with one of her clients; a family cannot cope with the fact that their daughter is illegitimately pregnant.', 'A gallery of characters in Brooklyn in the 1950s are crushed by their surroundings and selves: a union strike leader discovers he is gay; a prostitute falls in love with one of her clients; a family cannot cope with the fact that their daughter is illegitimately pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89Lg30XE7gwVZpJUk0RKqV8CtND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12774'),
  ('549450358688203786', 'Last Film Show', 2022, 'Drama', 'Dilip Shankar, Swapnil S. Sonawane, Pan Nalin', 'Pan Nalin', 'Bhavin Rabari, Richa Meena, Bhavesh Shrimali, Dipen Raval, Rahul Koli, Vikas Bata, Shoban Makwa, Kishan Parmar', null, 'A 9-year-old boy in a remote village in India begins a lifelong love affair with cinema when he bribes his way into a rundown movie palace and spends a summer watching movies from the projection booth.', 'A 9-year-old boy in a remote village in India begins a lifelong love affair with cinema when he bribes his way into a rundown movie palace and spends a summer watching movies from the projection booth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tvIGzDfcCQjRv8ZTzlEMoszT0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821494'),
  ('84249928755030905', 'Last Flag Flying', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Richard Linklater, Shane F. Kelly', 'Darryl Ponicsan, Richard Linklater', 'Steve Carell, Bryan Cranston, Laurence Fishburne, J. Quinton Johnson, Deanna Reed-Foster, Yul Vazquez, Graham Wolfe, Jeff Monahan', 'R', 'Thirty years after serving together in the Vietnam War, Larry, Sal and Richard reunite for a different type of mission: to bury Doc''s son, a young Marine killed in Iraq. Forgoing the burial, the trio take the casket on a bittersweet trip up the coast to New Hampshire – along the way reminiscing and coming to terms with the shared memories of a war that continues to shape their lives.', 'Thirty years after serving together in the Vietnam War, Larry, Sal and Richard reunite for a different type of mission: to bury Doc''s son, a young Marine killed in Iraq. Forgoing the burial, the trio take the casket on a bittersweet trip up the coast to New Hampshire – along the way reminiscing and coming to terms with the shared memories of a war that continues to shape their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pizynKUzJ9YucGff1O1MYisY1WM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419709'),
  ('1033942002217288665', 'Last Girl Standing', 2015, 'Drama, Horror', 'Benjamin R. Moody, Travis Jones', 'Benjamin R. Moody', 'Akasha Villalobos, Danielle Evon Ploeger, JD Carrera, Brian Villalobos, Jason Vines, Laura Ray, Kelsey Pribilski, Chad Warren', null, 'She survived a brutal massacre, but lost her life. What happens to the final girl once the credits have rolled? Five years ago, a masked killer brutally murdered a group of friends. Since then, Camryn, the lone survivor, has tried to make sense of the homicidal events and struggled to reclaim her shattered life. Wracked with guilt and paranoia, can Camryn ever have a normal existence again or is she destined to cope alone forever? Part slasher movie, part character study, take a penetrating and intimate look at what happens to the remaining true victim of every horror movie.', 'She survived a brutal massacre, but lost her life. What happens to the final girl once the credits have rolled? Five years ago, a masked killer brutally murdered a group of friends. Since then, Camryn, the lone survivor, has tried to make sense of the homicidal events and struggled to reclaim her shattered life. Wracked with guilt and paranoia, can Camryn ever have a normal existence again or is she destined to cope alone forever? Part slasher movie, part character study, take a penetrating and intimate look at what happens to the remaining true victim of every horror movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBAHzXTewsqTmr73KeYEc3C5YQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347848'),
  ('945395271330351965', 'Last Harem', 1999, 'Drama, History', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Pasquale Mari, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianni Romoli', 'Marie Gillain, Alex Descas, Valeria Golino, Lucia Bosè, Serra Yılmaz, Haluk Bilginer, Malick Bowens, Şerif Sezer', null, 'On the eve of the fall of the Ottoman Empire: in the harem of Sultan Abdulhamit II, the odalisque of Italian origin Safiyè dreams of becoming the sultan''s first mistress. To achieve her goal, the girl, aided by the eunuch Nadir, is even willing to kill. But when her dream is finally about to come true, her entire world suddenly collapses: the sultan is exiled, the harem is closed, and the odalisques and eunuchs are abandoned to their fate.', 'On the eve of the fall of the Ottoman Empire: in the harem of Sultan Abdulhamit II, the odalisque of Italian origin Safiyè dreams of becoming the sultan''s first mistress. To achieve her goal, the girl, aided by the eunuch Nadir, is even willing to kill. But when her dream is finally about to come true, her entire world suddenly collapses: the sultan is exiled, the harem is closed, and the odalisques and eunuchs are abandoned to their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vDDKNnt5mp9eVYRh7nCcj3pV7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47953'),
  ('269981913145696968', 'Last Hero in China', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, History', 'Wong Jing, Bosco Lam Tsz-Ho, Yuen Woo-Ping', 'Wong Jing', 'Jet Li, Sharla Cheung, Alan Chui Chung-San, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan', 'PG-13', 'Jet Li stars in this comic spectacle as a Chinese "Robin Hood" who stumbles upon a kidnapping scheme after unwittingly opening a martial arts school next to a brothel!', 'Jet Li stars in this comic spectacle as a Chinese "Robin Hood" who stumbles upon a kidnapping scheme after unwittingly opening a martial arts school next to a brothel!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8uCNayRX5mCgvRwhUVE24qtpnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18731'),
  ('85635391840267579', 'Last Hit', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David M. Parks', 'Anthony Leone, Ovsanna Yepremyan', 'Mike Ferguson, Twana Barnett, LeeAnne Bauer, Trent James, Joe Davison', 'Not Rated', 'Vincent and Maya decide to escape their gang and settle for a peaceful life, but they are trapped into one last hit with hidden agendas, betrayals, and unexpected alliances.', 'Vincent and Maya decide to escape their gang and settle for a peaceful life, but they are trapped into one last hit with hidden agendas, betrayals, and unexpected alliances.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fuxvn90eyEunObxqkMn0k882Dfzk.jpg', 'plex:movie:last-hit-2026'),
  ('466663142644498374', 'Last Holiday', 1950, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Henry Cass, John Arnold, Ray Elton', 'J. B. Priestley', 'Alec Guinness, Beatrice Campbell, Kay Walsh, Grégoire Aslan, Jean Colin, Muriel George, Brian Worth, Esma Cannon', 'NR', 'George Bird is a salesman of agricultural machinery who finds out that he hasn''t long to live. On his doctor''s advice, he goes to an exclusive seaside resort to spend his savings on one last holiday.', 'George Bird is a salesman of agricultural machinery who finds out that he hasn''t long to live. On his doctor''s advice, he goes to an exclusive seaside resort to spend his savings on one last holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rUFvSmkPvMMIhf02uFOfH1TDDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16939'),
  ('461188455299278592', 'Last Holiday', 2006, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Wayne Wang, Jakub Dvorak, Geoffrey Simpson', 'J. B. Priestley', 'Queen Latifah, LL Cool J, Timothy Hutton, Giancarlo Esposito, Alicia Witt, Gérard Depardieu, Jane Adams, Michel Estime', 'PG-13', 'The discovery that she has a terminal illness prompts introverted department store saleswoman Georgia Byrd to reflect on what she realizes has been an overly cautious life. With weeks to live, she withdraws her life savings, sells all her possessions and jets off to Europe where she lives it up at a posh hotel. Upbeat and passionate, Georgia charms everybody she meets, including renowned Chef Didier. The only one missing from her new life is her longtime crush Sean Matthews.', 'The discovery that she has a terminal illness prompts introverted department store saleswoman Georgia Byrd to reflect on what she realizes has been an overly cautious life. With weeks to live, she withdraws her life savings, sells all her possessions and jets off to Europe where she lives it up at a posh hotel. Upbeat and passionate, Georgia charms everybody she meets, including renowned Chef Didier. The only one missing from her new life is her longtime crush Sean Matthews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRNZszPHjIpYGlrMN3o4f6f6cVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17379'),
  ('166216842165601487', 'Last Hurrah for Chivalry', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'John Woo, Ching Po Chang', 'John Woo', 'Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Wai Pak, Lau Kong, Fung Hak-On, Chin Yuet-Sang, Cheng Lui, Lee Hoi-Sang, Hsu Hsia', null, 'Kao has purchased a new wife, but an enemy has paid her more money to kill him. Kao must recruit a pair of swordsmen to help defend himself and his family from his ruthless enemy. But Kao has his dark side as well.', 'Kao has purchased a new wife, but an enemy has paid her more money to kill him. Kao must recruit a pair of swordsmen to help defend himself and his family from his ruthless enemy. But Kao has his dark side as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uv8gmLKluvZBEnKI4cRnQ7r4iKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13514'),
  ('946296177294659384', 'Last Images of the Shipwreck', 1989, 'Drama', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Lorenzo Quinteros, Noemí Frenkel, Hugo Soto, Pablo Brichta, Sara Benítez, Andrés Tiengo, Alicia Aller, Alfredo Stuart', null, 'Roberto is an insurance salesman who dreams of writing his own novel. When he meets Estela, a young woman about to commit suicide, it serves him as material to make this work.', 'Roberto is an insurance salesman who dreams of writing his own novel. When he meets Estela, a young woman about to commit suicide, it serves him as material to make this work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qeiV84N7Be9jKomFmU9nvEKAW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107393'),
  ('95651153169031432', 'Last Kind Words', 2012, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Kevin Barker, Bill Otto', 'Kevin Barker', 'Brad Dourif, Spencer Daniels, Alexia Fast, Marianne Hagan, Sarah Steele, Clay Wilcox, Rich Williams, Ron Eliot', null, '17-year old Eli moves with his family to the isolated farm of reclusive Waylon, a man whose dark past threatens to overtake him. Eli’s family works to restore the desolate fields, while he becomes fascinated with the forests. While on the farm, Eli meets the mysterious Amanda when she gives him an apple. The next day she extracts a promise from him to avoid the deep woods. Reeling from a violent encounter with his father, one night he breaks this promise and finds her body hanging from a tree.', '17-year old Eli moves with his family to the isolated farm of reclusive Waylon, a man whose dark past threatens to overtake him. Eli’s family works to restore the desolate fields, while he becomes fascinated with the forests. While on the farm, Eli meets the mysterious Amanda when she gives him an apple. The next day she extracts a promise from him to avoid the deep woods. Reeling from a violent encounter with his father, one night he breaks this promise and finds her body hanging from a tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDnj5vaAfTPPVkir0RpiKzT1cwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135461'),
  ('19697637350927071', 'Last Knights', 2015, 'Action, Adventure', 'Jung Doo-hong, Marketa Magerova, Karel Kubis', 'Dove Sussman, Michael Konyves', 'Clive Owen, Morgan Freeman, Aksel Hennie, Shohreh Aghdashloo, James Babson, Giorgio Caputo, Cliff Curtis, Tsuyoshi Ihara', 'R', 'When an evil emperor executes their leader, his band of knights – bound by duty and honour – embarks on a journey of vengeance that will not come to an end until they''ve destroyed their mortal foe.', 'When an evil emperor executes their leader, his band of knights – bound by duty and honour – embarks on a journey of vengeance that will not come to an end until they''ve destroyed their mortal foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDDwAQHkqPy8RYQc38lFTuRw8Ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308504'),
  ('743875374402383994', 'Last Known Address', 1970, 'Thriller, Crime', 'José Giovanni, Étienne Becker', 'José Giovanni', 'Lino Ventura, Marlène Jobert, Michel Constantin, Paul Crauchet, Alain Mottet, Béatrice Arnac, Guy Heron, Albert Dagnant', null, 'Marceau Léonetti, a competent and energetic officer stops by chance the son of an influential lawyer driving under the influence of alcohol. A few months later, the lawyer falsely accuses Léonetti as being violent and incompetent. As a result Marceau is transferred to a small police station, where he meets young and beautiful Jeanne. Soon they are faced with a tough investigation.', 'Marceau Léonetti, a competent and energetic officer stops by chance the son of an influential lawyer driving under the influence of alcohol. A few months later, the lawyer falsely accuses Léonetti as being violent and incompetent. As a result Marceau is transferred to a small police station, where he meets young and beautiful Jeanne. Soon they are faced with a tough investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTKwyIFMxwCcsWoeuUxIZqWcedU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70967'),
  ('528062256887664846', 'Last Leap', 1970, 'Drama', 'Édouard Luntz', 'Antoine Blondin', 'Maurice Ronet, Michel Bouquet, Cathy Rosier, Eric Penet, Betty Beckers, Pierre Arditi', null, 'A veteran paratrooper murders his Vietnamese wife when he finds her in the arms of a younger man. Garal (Maurice Ronet) makes it back to the army base where his drunken roommate provides him with an iron clad alibi. Jauran (Michel Bouquet) is the local police inspector who befriends the Garal, unaware he is the killer. The younger man is accused of the woman''s murder, but the paratrooper begins to feel overwhelmed with guilt. The longer he remains silent about the crime, the more psychological torture he must endure.', 'A veteran paratrooper murders his Vietnamese wife when he finds her in the arms of a younger man. Garal (Maurice Ronet) makes it back to the army base where his drunken roommate provides him with an iron clad alibi. Jauran (Michel Bouquet) is the local police inspector who befriends the Garal, unaware he is the killer. The younger man is accused of the woman''s murder, but the paratrooper begins to feel overwhelmed with guilt. The longer he remains silent about the crime, the more psychological torture he must endure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grZdt1b2pUZ0s9AwET1uH2EDZ1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198658'),
  ('644063146718405959', 'Last Letter', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shunji Iwai, Chigi Kanbe', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Zhou Xun, Qin Hao, Du Jiang, Zhang Zifeng, Deng Enxi, Bian Tianyang, Wu Yanshu, Tan Zhuo', 'NR', 'All Yuan Zhinan has left behind when she passed away is a letter and an invitation to a school reunion. Attending the reunion in lieu of her late elder sister, Zhihua accidentally runs into Yin Chuan, on whom she had a crush in her youth. As old memories are evoked, and correspondences travel through different contexts and times, Zhihua slowly uncovers the intricate story of the trio.', 'All Yuan Zhinan has left behind when she passed away is a letter and an invitation to a school reunion. Attending the reunion in lieu of her late elder sister, Zhihua accidentally runs into Yin Chuan, on whom she had a crush in her youth. As old memories are evoked, and correspondences travel through different contexts and times, Zhihua slowly uncovers the intricate story of the trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVwlYlSa2Tu9qT2Rj2bg4OdyuFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551634'),
  ('357364711097562787', 'Last Letter', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shunji Iwai, Chigi Kanbe', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Takako Matsu, Masaharu Fukuyama, Suzu Hirose, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Nana Mori, Miho Nakayama, Etsushi Toyokawa, Hideaki Anno', null, 'It is only at their sister''s and mother''s funeral when a woman meets her niece after many years. The niece is now a grown girl. The sister takes on the task of informing the deceased''s friends of the death while the daughter cannot bring herself to symbolically accept the demise of her mother. In the midst of all this an old flame messages the sister to say he is still in love with her, but is he messaging the living sister or the dead one?', 'It is only at their sister''s and mother''s funeral when a woman meets her niece after many years. The niece is now a grown girl. The sister takes on the task of informing the deceased''s friends of the death while the daughter cannot bring herself to symbolically accept the demise of her mother. In the midst of all this an old flame messages the sister to say he is still in love with her, but is he messaging the living sister or the dead one?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow3bl4VyCdpUd4hLgkkZJVMfgax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542807'),
  ('1016448224471135041', 'Last Life in the Universe', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang, Christopher Doyle, Chedpong Laoyant', 'Prabda Yoon, Pen-Ek Ratanaruang', 'Tadanobu Asano, Daran Boonyasak, Chermarn Boonyasak, Yutaka Matsushige, Riki Takeuchi, Takashi Miike, Yoji Tanaka, Sakichi Sato', null, 'An obsessive-compulsive Japanese librarian living in Bangkok spends most of his days contemplating suicide in his apartment. His life changes when he witnesses the death of a young girl and becomes acquainted with her elder sister.', 'An obsessive-compulsive Japanese librarian living in Bangkok spends most of his days contemplating suicide in his apartment. His life changes when he witnesses the death of a young girl and becomes acquainted with her elder sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pN6e9bMNfFNsIJZqb924KKu8lq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11606'),
  ('535867607351134352', 'Last Light', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Ric Waite', 'Robert Eisele', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Forest Whitaker, Clancy Brown, Lynne Moody, Amanda Plummer, Kathleen Quinlan, Cameron Dye, Tony T. Johnson', 'R', 'Kiefer Sutherland plays Denver Bayliss, a condemned murderer who has killed three people, including a prison guard. He was brought into the system as a juvenile delinquent and never got out. Now he is awaiting execution. Forest Whitaker stars as Fred Whitmore, a death row prison guard who runs into trouble when he refuses to take part in the brutally abusive tactics of the guards. However, something about Denver haunts Fred Whitmore, and the two men form an unexpected friendship that transforms their lives.', 'Kiefer Sutherland plays Denver Bayliss, a condemned murderer who has killed three people, including a prison guard. He was brought into the system as a juvenile delinquent and never got out. Now he is awaiting execution. Forest Whitaker stars as Fred Whitmore, a death row prison guard who runs into trouble when he refuses to take part in the brutally abusive tactics of the guards. However, something about Denver haunts Fred Whitmore, and the two men form an unexpected friendship that transforms their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2g0mFFPMcutkr8CE140ZaZRKzt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70741'),
  ('102922646556341787', 'Last Looks', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lyle Vincent, Tim Kirkby', 'Howard Michael Gould', 'Charlie Hunnam, Mel Gibson, Morena Baccarin, Clancy Brown, Rupert Friend, Lucy Fry, Dominic Monaghan, Jacob Scipio', 'R', 'A disgraced ex-cop seeks solace by moving to the woods, but his quiet life comes to an end when a private eye recruits him to investigate the murder of an eccentric TV star''s wife.', 'A disgraced ex-cop seeks solace by moving to the woods, but his quiet life comes to an end when a private eye recruits him to investigate the murder of an eccentric TV star''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud0XdA2xAghDR66j3I84DnNlC2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557946'),
  ('851365489581327314', 'Last Ma(i)nland', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Vasilisa Yurenkova, Grigory Yaroshenko', null, null, null, 'Photographer Grigory Yaroshenko gets a chance to visit Antarctica and learn about the life of polar explorers. But his wife is expecting their second child, and life changes. Gregory is faced with the question of male self-identification and acceptance of new family circumstances.', 'Photographer Grigory Yaroshenko gets a chance to visit Antarctica and learn about the life of polar explorers. But his wife is expecting their second child, and life changes. Gregory is faced with the question of male self-identification and acceptance of new family circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM9cQPwPURiZ47gVDIrlVUMLmc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327965'),
  ('955820358108848673', 'Last Man Down', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Fansu Njie, Markus Ljungberg', 'Andreas Vasshaug', 'Daniel Stisen, Olga Kent, Daniel Nehme, Stanislav Yanevski, Madeleine Vall, Natassia Malthe, Stephanie Siadatan, Michael Billington', 'R', 'After civilization succumbs to a deadly pandemic and his wife is murdered, a special forces soldier abandons his duty and becomes a hermit in the Nordic wilderness. Years later, a wounded woman appears on his doorstep. She''s escaped from a lab and her pursuers believe her blood is the key to a worldwide cure. He''s hesitant to get involved, but all doubts are cast aside when he discovers her pursuer is none other than Commander Stone, the man that murdered his wife some years ago.', 'After civilization succumbs to a deadly pandemic and his wife is murdered, a special forces soldier abandons his duty and becomes a hermit in the Nordic wilderness. Years later, a wounded woman appears on his doorstep. She''s escaped from a lab and her pursuers believe her blood is the key to a worldwide cure. He''s hesitant to get involved, but all doubts are cast aside when he discovers her pursuer is none other than Commander Stone, the man that murdered his wife some years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4B7liCxNCZIZGONmAMkCnxVlZQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860623'),
  ('271878071991476589', 'Last Man Standing', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Merhi, Ken Blakey, Maurice K. McGuire', 'Joseph Merhi', 'Jeff Wincott, Steve Eastin, Jonathan Fuller, Jillian McWhirter, Michael Greene, Ava Fabian, Jonathan Banks, Michael Greene', 'R', 'A gang of bank robbers, led by the ultra-violent Snake Underwood, pull off a daring mid-day heist that leaves dozens of burning police cars and scores of innocent victims in its wake. Heading the investigation into the gang is the equally violent detective Kurt Bellmore and going by the book just isn''t going to be enough...', 'A gang of bank robbers, led by the ultra-violent Snake Underwood, pull off a daring mid-day heist that leaves dozens of burning police cars and scores of innocent victims in its wake. Heading the investigation into the gang is the equally violent detective Kurt Bellmore and going by the book just isn''t going to be enough...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m54hupYIWFJfAZ4hwxbSpvbfHmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56708'),
  ('262213296685249201', 'Last Man Standing', 1996, 'Crime, Action, Western, Drama', 'Walter Hill, Lloyd Ahern II, Spiro Razatos', 'Akira Kurosawa, Ryuzo Kikushima', 'Bruce Willis, Bruce Dern, William Sanderson, Christopher Walken, David Patrick Kelly, Karina Lombard, Ned Eisenberg, Michael Imperioli', 'R', 'John Smith is a mysterious stranger who is drawn into a vicious war between two Prohibition-era gangs. In a dangerous game, he switches allegiances from one to another, offering his services to the highest bidder. As the death toll mounts, Smith takes the law into his own hands in a deadly race to stay alive.', 'John Smith is a mysterious stranger who is drawn into a vicious war between two Prohibition-era gangs. In a dangerous game, he switches allegiances from one to another, offering his services to the highest bidder. As the death toll mounts, Smith takes the law into his own hands in a deadly race to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8bVMFAN18H7qmwn2KOWWjDQnbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9333'),
  ('23685101505582299', 'Last Men in Aleppo', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Steen Johannessen, Feras Fayyad, Fadi Al Halabi', 'Feras Fayyad', 'Khaled Umar Harah, Batul', null, 'A searing example of boots-on-the-ground reportage follows the efforts of the internationally recognized White Helmets, an organization consisting of ordinary citizens who are the first to rush towards military strikes and attacks in the hope of saving lives. Incorporating moments of both heart-pounding suspense and improbable beauty, the documentary draws us into the lives of three of its founders — Khaled, Subhi, and Mahmoud — as they grapple with the chaos around them and struggle with an ever-present dilemma: do they flee or stay and fight for their country?', 'A searing example of boots-on-the-ground reportage follows the efforts of the internationally recognized White Helmets, an organization consisting of ordinary citizens who are the first to rush towards military strikes and attacks in the hope of saving lives. Incorporating moments of both heart-pounding suspense and improbable beauty, the documentary draws us into the lives of three of its founders — Khaled, Subhi, and Mahmoud — as they grapple with the chaos around them and struggle with an ever-present dilemma: do they flee or stay and fight for their country?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wF3AXsybsoWLQLhkEyG5nrNi0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433085'),
  ('468259329337310281', 'Last Mile', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Ayuko Tsukahara, Kazuyuki Kawasato, Takeshi Seki', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Hikari Mitsushima, Masaki Okada, Sadao Abe, Dean Fujioka, Shōhei Hino, Shohei Uno, Tamae Ando, Tomomi Maruyama', null, 'On the night before ‘Black Friday,’ which is the one of the busiest commerce days, a cardboard box, that is delivered from the world''s largest shopping site, explodes. Soon after, a series of mysterious explosion cases occurs. The entire nation becomes terrorized by the shocking events. Funado Erena has just began to work as the center director for a large distribution warehouse that covers three-quarters of the Kanto area. Erena must gain control over this unprecedented situation with team manager Nashimoto Ko.', 'On the night before ‘Black Friday,’ which is the one of the busiest commerce days, a cardboard box, that is delivered from the world''s largest shopping site, explodes. Soon after, a series of mysterious explosion cases occurs. The entire nation becomes terrorized by the shocking events. Funado Erena has just began to work as the center director for a large distribution warehouse that covers three-quarters of the Kanto area. Erena must gain control over this unprecedented situation with team manager Nashimoto Ko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCs6Jbyfs7HDNEmLwGXK32vlsXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276108'),
  ('981393578366338692', 'Last Minute Marocco', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Falaschi, Antonello Emidi', 'Carla Giulia Casalini, Francesco Falaschi', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Kesia Elwin, Lorenzo Balducci, Daniele De Angelis, Jamil Hammoudi, Esther Elisha, Paolo Sassanelli, Nicolas Vaporidis', null, 'Guided by the spirit of adventure and desire to escape, a group of Italian boys decide to leave secretly for Morocco, soon followed by one of their apprensive parents.', 'Guided by the spirit of adventure and desire to escape, a group of Italian boys decide to leave secretly for Morocco, soon followed by one of their apprensive parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOzHyPQuUDwVcOLCtzzKxxieq4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99721'),
  ('479905314502708079', 'Last Moment of Clarity', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vernon Guinn, Barbara Fiorentino, Arkeisha Roberts', 'Colin Krisel, James Krisel', 'Zach Avery, Samara Weaving, Carly Chaikin, Pasha D. Lychnikoff, Hal Ozsan, Alex Fernandez, Nicole Ansari-Cox, Brian Cox', 'R', 'After his girlfriend Georgia is murdered by European mobsters, Sam flees to Paris to hide out. Years later, he sees a woman in a Hollywood film who he''s certain is Georgia. In L.A. to investigate, he encounters Kat who impulsively decides to help him on his quest. But when Sam meets the mystery actress face to face his life spins out of control.', 'After his girlfriend Georgia is murdered by European mobsters, Sam flees to Paris to hide out. Years later, he sees a woman in a Hollywood film who he''s certain is Georgia. In L.A. to investigate, he encounters Kat who impulsively decides to help him on his quest. But when Sam meets the mystery actress face to face his life spins out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHWbWIB2YntY9865pXfqoVf8vAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567608'),
  ('898959294010038606', 'Last Night', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Don McKellar, Douglas Koch, Annie Bradley', 'Don McKellar', 'Don McKellar, Sarah Polley, Roberta Maxwell, Robin Gammell, Trent McMullen, Sandra Oh, Charmion King, Jessica Booker', 'R', 'Various citizens of Toronto anxiously await the end of the world, which is occurring at the stroke of midnight on New Year''s Day.', 'Various citizens of Toronto anxiously await the end of the world, which is occurring at the stroke of midnight on New Year''s Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlPBctls7n03GOj3qDjFWWzCiFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16129'),
  ('48374064192079895', 'Last Night', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Massy Tadjedin, Timothy Bird, Collin Brazie', 'Massy Tadjedin', 'Keira Knightley, Sam Worthington, Eva Mendes, Guillaume Canet, Griffin Dunne, Stephanie Romanov, Anson Mount, Scott Adsit', 'R', 'Michael and Joanna are a young and successful married couple who appear to have it all. But when Michael finds himself alone on a business trip with an attractive new colleague and Joanna encounters the other great love of her life, each is thrust into an evening of temptation.', 'Michael and Joanna are a young and successful married couple who appear to have it all. But when Michael finds himself alone on a business trip with an attractive new colleague and Joanna encounters the other great love of her life, each is thrust into an evening of temptation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6orMRIVqbQPtuMT14j35rVaLski.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23830'),
  ('975688625769529753', 'Last Night in Soho', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jeremy Lovering, Oliver Curtis, Oli van der Vijver', 'Krysty Wilson-Cairns, Edgar Wright', 'Thomasin McKenzie, Anya Taylor-Joy, Matt Smith, Rita Tushingham, Michael Ajao, Synnøve Karlsen, Pauline McLynn, Terence Stamp', 'R', 'A young girl, passionate about fashion design, is mysteriously able to enter the 1960s where she encounters her idol, a dazzling wannabe singer. But 1960s London is not what it seems, and time seems to be falling apart with shady consequences.', 'A young girl, passionate about fashion design, is mysteriously able to enter the 1960s where she encounters her idol, a dazzling wannabe singer. But 1960s London is not what it seems, and time seems to be falling apart with shady consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1ZRmjlk1BJTY7aASqACfPAaLn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576845'),
  ('1030546882293455277', 'Last Night of Amore', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Andrea Di Stefano, Guido Michelotti', 'Andrea Di Stefano', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Linda Caridi, Antonio Gerardi, Francesco Di Leva, Katia Mironova, Camilla Semino Favro, Shi Yang, Wang Fifi', null, 'On the night before retirement, police lieutenant Amore is called to investigate the off-duty death of his longtime partner, who fell prey of an illegal scheme Amore himself was secretly part of.', 'On the night before retirement, police lieutenant Amore is called to investigate the off-duty death of his longtime partner, who fell prey of an illegal scheme Amore himself was secretly part of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKxmEfFrLjPLutpi7alffLOwMSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978870'),
  ('74992045956927531', 'Last Night of Love', 1980, 'Drama, War', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Dumitru Carabăț, Anusavan Salamanian, Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Vladimir Găitan, Joanna Pacula, Sergiu Nicolaescu, Sebastian Papaiani, Ion Besoiu, Gheorghe Dinică, Colea Răutu, Ernest Maftei', null, 'In 1916, shortly before Romania''s entry in World War One Romanian Army Lieutenant Tudor Gheorghiu is posted to a border patrol unit on Romania''s border with Austria-Hungary. Not receiving any news from his wife he persuades the commanding officer, Captain Dimiu, to allow him a short leave to visit his wife. Tudor married Lena two years before but was very jealous and suspected her of infidelity. When his grandfather dies Tudor inherits most of the fortune. Gigolo lawyer Andrei Nicolau is the executor of the will. He also is the man who lustfully desires Tudor''s beautiful wife. A contest for Lena''s love begins. Romania is plunged into WW1 and ironically Tudor receives his junior Lieutenant commission in the same regiment where gigolo lawyer Nicolau serves as a Major. Their destinies seem intertwined.', 'In 1916, shortly before Romania''s entry in World War One Romanian Army Lieutenant Tudor Gheorghiu is posted to a border patrol unit on Romania''s border with Austria-Hungary. Not receiving any news from his wife he persuades the commanding officer, Captain Dimiu, to allow him a short leave to visit his wife. Tudor married Lena two years before but was very jealous and suspected her of infidelity. When his grandfather dies Tudor inherits most of the fortune. Gigolo lawyer Andrei Nicolau is the executor of the will. He also is the man who lustfully desires Tudor''s beautiful wife. A contest for Lena''s love begins. Romania is plunged into WW1 and ironically Tudor receives his junior Lieutenant commission in the same regiment where gigolo lawyer Nicolau serves as a Major. Their destinies seem intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3R5qDWDSUo5hflgnM1lPF3fixv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403674'),
  ('63043495619670419', 'Last of the Badmen', 1967, 'Western', 'Nando Cicero', 'Fulvio Gicca Palli', 'George Hilton, Frank Wolff, Pamela Tudor, Eduardo Fajardo, Femi Benussi, Franco Balducci, Cristina Iosani, Maria Grazia Marescalchi', null, 'Kitosch is charged with a crime he did not commit and joins up with Joshua Tracy, a vicious outlaw. When Tracy kidnaps and blackmails his former employer Kitosch redeems himself by saving them.', 'Kitosch is charged with a crime he did not commit and joins up with Joshua Tracy, a vicious outlaw. When Tracy kidnaps and blackmails his former employer Kitosch redeems himself by saving them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4z7wAOGiZHDSBIItIlYw0zQ0OuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144343'),
  ('377152084312391525', 'Last of the Comanches', 1953, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Charles Lawton Jr., Ray Cory', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Broderick Crawford, Barbara Hale, Johnny Stewart, Lloyd Bridges, Mickey Shaughnessy, George Mathews, Hugh Sanders, Ric Roman', 'NR', 'It''s 1876 and all the Indians are at peace except the Comanches lead by Black Cloud. When Black Cloud wipes out a town, only six soldiers are left and they head for the nearest fort. In the desert they are reinforced by members of a stagecoach and find some water at a deserted mission. Pinned down by Black Cloud they send an Indian boy who was Black Cloud''s prisoner on to the fort while they try to bargain with Black Cloud whom they learn is without water.', 'It''s 1876 and all the Indians are at peace except the Comanches lead by Black Cloud. When Black Cloud wipes out a town, only six soldiers are left and they head for the nearest fort. In the desert they are reinforced by members of a stagecoach and find some water at a deserted mission. Pinned down by Black Cloud they send an Indian boy who was Black Cloud''s prisoner on to the fort while they try to bargain with Black Cloud whom they learn is without water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zB6ITqEZtk3hLqvU1yLwz3AIYHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41468'),
  ('1109431137115626114', 'Last of the Dogmen', 1995, 'Adventure, Mystery, Thriller, Western', 'Tab Murphy, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Tab Murphy', 'Tom Berenger, Barbara Hershey, Kurtwood Smith, Steve Reevis, Andrew Miller, Gregory Scott Cummins, Graham Jarvis, Mark Boone Junior', 'PG', 'A Montana bounty hunter is sent into the wilderness to track three escaped prisoners. Instead he sees something that puzzles him. Later with a female Native Indian history professor, he returns to find some answers.', 'A Montana bounty hunter is sent into the wilderness to track three escaped prisoners. Instead he sees something that puzzles him. Later with a female Native Indian history professor, he returns to find some answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GkP9w87TAFSXLzJdqxTt0ymbJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30718'),
  ('1086230981351577485', 'Last of the Living', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Logan McMillan', 'Logan McMillan', 'Morgan Williams, Robert Faith, Ashleigh Southam, Mark Hadlow', 'NR', 'A contagious virus is turning everyone into zombies, and the only hope for survival lies in the hands of three couch potatoes.', 'A contagious virus is turning everyone into zombies, and the only hope for survival lies in the hands of three couch potatoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojAA53oMBDLtXw70dSPwQ0Uaes4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22573'),
  ('1017571289681213110', 'Last of the Red Hot Lovers', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gene Saks, Victor J. Kemper, Robert Greenhut', 'Neil Simon', 'Alan Arkin, Sally Kellerman, Paula Prentiss, Renée Taylor, Bella Bruck, Sandy Balson, Frank Loverde, Bert Conroy', 'PG', 'A middle aged restaurateur begins to feel the desire to roam and realizes that one day each week, his mother''s apartment will be empty all afternoon. He makes several attempts at seduction, only to learn that it is much more complicated and difficult than he could have imagined.', 'A middle aged restaurateur begins to feel the desire to roam and realizes that one day each week, his mother''s apartment will be empty all afternoon. He makes several attempts at seduction, only to learn that it is much more complicated and difficult than he could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMTfYhBXqICUMMYgzXcz3ZwhrxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42483'),
  ('99479072878365409', 'Last of the Renegades', 1964, 'Western, Adventure', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Harald G. Petersson', 'Lex Barker, Pierre Brice, Anthony Steel, Karin Dor, Klaus Kinski, Renato Baldini, Terence Hill, Marie-Noëlle Barre', null, 'Forester, a ruthless oil baron, wants to create a war between the native American tribes and the white men. Old Shatterhand, Winnetou and their sidekick Castlepool try to prevent this.', 'Forester, a ruthless oil baron, wants to create a war between the native American tribes and the white men. Old Shatterhand, Winnetou and their sidekick Castlepool try to prevent this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UXTBXX4XsM5HqhDW2vxZtcs0fk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3686'),
  ('132192099818746410', 'Last of the Wild Horses', 1948, 'Western', 'Robert L. Lippert, Paul Landres, Charles S. Gould', 'Jack Harvey', 'James Ellison, Mary Beth Hughes, Jane Frazee, Douglass Dumbrille, James Millican, Reed Hadley, Olin Howland, William Haade', 'NR', 'A cowboy must clear himself of a murder he did not commit.', 'A cowboy must clear himself of a murder he did not commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWaoqgdxjqSmmFZG9skdJARaDXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186585'),
  ('690164793639784482', 'Last of the Wolves', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Kazuya Shiraishi, Ryo Yamamoto, Minoru Kawai', 'Junya Ikegami', 'Tori Matsuzaka, Ryohei Suzuki, Nijiro Murakami, Nanase Nishino, Takuma Otoo, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Katsuya Maiguma, Miwako Kakei', null, 'After Shogo Ogami’s death in Hiroshima, Detective Shuichi Hioka successfully implemented Shogo Ogami’s plan, which was to control the yakuza to prevent further gang wars and save innocent people from getting harmed. Shuichi Hioka manages the criminal organizations, but, due to one evil person who gets released from prison, the situation drastically changes.', 'After Shogo Ogami’s death in Hiroshima, Detective Shuichi Hioka successfully implemented Shogo Ogami’s plan, which was to control the yakuza to prevent further gang wars and save innocent people from getting harmed. Shuichi Hioka manages the criminal organizations, but, due to one evil person who gets released from prison, the situation drastically changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lK1Ueoiy1fbTJjOdseK3Tu0hT6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826691'),
  ('741750228425377277', 'Last Orders', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fred Schepisi, Brian Tufano', 'Fred Schepisi', 'Michael Caine, Tom Courtenay, David Hemmings, Bob Hoskins, Helen Mirren, Ray Winstone, JJ Feild, Cameron Fitch', 'PG-13', 'Jack Dodd was a London butcher who enjoyed a pint with his mates for over 50 years. When he died, he died as he lived, with a smile on his face watching a horse race on which he had bet, with borrowed money. But before he died he had a final request, ''Last Orders'', that his ashes be scattered in the sea at Margate. The movie follows his mates, Ray, Lenny and Vic and his foster son Vince as they journey to the sea with the ashes. Along the way, the threads of their lives, their loves and their disappointments are woven together in their memories of Jack and his wife Amy', 'Jack Dodd was a London butcher who enjoyed a pint with his mates for over 50 years. When he died, he died as he lived, with a smile on his face watching a horse race on which he had bet, with borrowed money. But before he died he had a final request, ''Last Orders'', that his ashes be scattered in the sea at Margate. The movie follows his mates, Ray, Lenny and Vic and his foster son Vince as they journey to the sea with the ashes. Along the way, the threads of their lives, their loves and their disappointments are woven together in their memories of Jack and his wife Amy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcc3eL3wcydEUmXpX1tW9ro8NR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14778'),
  ('425304339754053107', 'Last Passenger', 2013, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Omid Nooshin, Angus Hudson, David Crabtree', 'Omid Nooshin, Andrew Love', 'Dougray Scott, Kara Tointon, David Schofield, Iddo Goldberg, Lindsay Duncan, Joshua Kaynama, Samuel Geker-Kawle', 'R', 'Independent British thriller starring Dougray Scott and Kara Tointon. Lewis (Scott), an overworked doctor, is on his way home from London with his young son Max (Joshua Kaynama). Clearly exhausted from his work, Lewis decides to take a nap on the train while an attractive young woman (Tointon) watches over his son. When he wakes, all but a few passengers have alighted and he realises that the train is not stopping to let anyone else off. Determined to get to the bottom of the mystery, Lewis goes to investigate and finds that the train has been taken over by an unstable driver who is hellbent on destroying the vehicle along with all the remaining passengers on board.', 'Independent British thriller starring Dougray Scott and Kara Tointon. Lewis (Scott), an overworked doctor, is on his way home from London with his young son Max (Joshua Kaynama). Clearly exhausted from his work, Lewis decides to take a nap on the train while an attractive young woman (Tointon) watches over his son. When he wakes, all but a few passengers have alighted and he realises that the train is not stopping to let anyone else off. Determined to get to the bottom of the mystery, Lewis goes to investigate and finds that the train has been taken over by an unstable driver who is hellbent on destroying the vehicle along with all the remaining passengers on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntIHy3C3Xgd5bl0c85pFX6joTFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104329'),
  ('424000947285783850', 'Last Present', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Oh Ki-hwan', 'Park Jung-woo, Oh Ki-hwan', 'Lee Jung-jae, Lee Young-ae, Kwon Hae-hyo, Lee Mu-hyeon, Gong Hyung-jin, Sa Hyeon-jin, Kim Soo-ro, Gong Hyo-jin', null, 'The relationship of a third-rate comedian, Yong-ki, and his wife, Jung-yun is growing cold after the miscarriage of their baby. Yong-ki becomes increasingly suspicious of the wife''s coldness towards him. Little does he know that Jung-yun has a terminal disease and is preparing a last present to her beloved husband when her time is sadly running out.', 'The relationship of a third-rate comedian, Yong-ki, and his wife, Jung-yun is growing cold after the miscarriage of their baby. Yong-ki becomes increasingly suspicious of the wife''s coldness towards him. Little does he know that Jung-yun has a terminal disease and is preparing a last present to her beloved husband when her time is sadly running out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4iG41N1JRcFwaczIKPkhd0jMw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99231'),
  ('224134770436583593', 'Last Radio Call', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Isaac Rodriguez, Cynthia Bergen', 'Isaac Rodriguez', 'Sarah Froelich, Jason Scarbrough, Keekee Suki, Ali Alkhafaji, June Griffin Garcia, Bert Lopez', 'R', 'On June 30th, 2018, Officer David Serling went missing inside an undisclosed abandoned hospital. Using his recovered body cam footage, his wife attempts to piece together what happened to him on that horrible night.', 'On June 30th, 2018, Officer David Serling went missing inside an undisclosed abandoned hospital. Using his recovered body cam footage, his wife attempts to piece together what happened to him on that horrible night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXdu0JG4s1yjQg8XC0CTGMWXQWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912391'),
  ('1037752244087011516', 'Last Rampage', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Dwight H. Little, Tim A. Davison, Rafael Leyva', 'Álvaro Rodríguez', 'Robert Patrick, Heather Graham, Molly C. Quinn, Jason James Richter, John Heard, Chris Browning, Bruce Davison, William Shockley', 'R', 'The true story of the infamous prison break of Gary Tison and Randy Greenwalt from the Arizona State prison in Florence, in the summer of 1978.', 'The true story of the infamous prison break of Gary Tison and Randy Greenwalt from the Arizona State prison in Florence, in the summer of 1978.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZDF2GDto5WCPW9wbRqrqf9yRWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423414'),
  ('274845372799631029', 'Last Resort', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Stephen M. Katz, Alex Nepomniaschy, Zane Buzby', 'Steve Zacharias, Jeff Buhai', 'Charles Grodin, Robin Pearson Rose, John Ashton, Megan Mullally, Jon Lovitz, Gerrit Graham, Mario Van Peebles, Scott Nemes', 'R', 'George Lollar takes his family on vacation with "Club Sand", a shoddy and untrustworthy company. On their tropical island, they find soldiers everywhere, an unhelpful staff, inhospitable accomodation and undesirable holiday makers, but everyone except for George manages to have fun in the sun.', 'George Lollar takes his family on vacation with "Club Sand", a shoddy and untrustworthy company. On their tropical island, they find soldiers everywhere, an unhelpful staff, inhospitable accomodation and undesirable holiday makers, but everyone except for George manages to have fun in the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fcckBOjLDqQj1UyiZpsYbIwtGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148833'),
  ('53702365753079531', 'Last Resort', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paweł Pawlikowski, Ryszard Lenczewski', 'Rowan Joffé, Paweł Pawlikowski', 'Dina Korzun, Paddy Considine, Artyom Strelnikov, Steve Perry, Perry Benson, Katie Drinkwater, Dave Bean, Adrian Scarborough', null, 'Tanya leaves Moscow with her street-wise 10-year-old son Artiom to meet her English fiancée in London. But after he fails to turn up at the airport, Tanya, intent on staying in England, is forced to apply for political asylum and transferred to Stonehaven, a grimy former seaside resort where refugees are housed. Tanya gradually develops a relationship with an amusement arcade manager, who helps them escape. She must then decide whether to stay with him or return to Russia.', 'Tanya leaves Moscow with her street-wise 10-year-old son Artiom to meet her English fiancée in London. But after he fails to turn up at the airport, Tanya, intent on staying in England, is forced to apply for political asylum and transferred to Stonehaven, a grimy former seaside resort where refugees are housed. Tanya gradually develops a relationship with an amusement arcade manager, who helps them escape. She must then decide whether to stay with him or return to Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2sr7f28WuydA3IlvZtSGKVQ26D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31875'),
  ('462550433705279761', 'Last Ride', 2009, 'Drama', 'Glendyn Ivin, Greig Fraser, Karan Monkhouse', 'Mac Gudgeon', 'Hugo Weaving, Tom Russell, Anita Hegh, John Brumpton, Kelton Pell, Sonya Suares, Adam Morgan, Chrissie Page', 'NR', 'A young boy travels across Australia with his father, who''s wanted by the law.', 'A young boy travels across Australia with his father, who''s wanted by the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjwqAsatWpCYbUJc6iS5sCov60X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27480'),
  ('49120950646227843', 'Last Ride', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Cinqué Lee, John Christian Rosenlund, Emeri Abel, Lapa Heikkilä', 'Cinqué Lee', 'Roman Griffin Davis, Felix Jamieson, Charlie Price, Kristofer Hivju, Gustaf Skarsgård', null, 'In the winter of 1982, three American boys find themselves stranded in a cable car with a dead body, suspended midair in the mountains of Norway during a rare celestial event.', 'In the winter of 1982, three American boys find themselves stranded in a cable car with a dead body, suspended midair in the mountains of Norway during a rare celestial event.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F8%2Fgracenote%2F8efb6efb5e42fe815174f9231bc0760a.jpg', 'plex:movie:last-ride-2023-1'),
  ('323787868521044571', 'Last Rites', 1988, 'Romance, Thriller, Horror, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'David Watkin, Donald P. Bellisario, Joe Napolitano', 'Donald P. Bellisario', 'Tom Berenger, Daphne Zuniga, Chick Vennera, Anne Twomey, Dane Clark, Paul Dooley, Vassili Lambrinos, Adrian Paul', 'R', 'After witnessing her lover being murdered by his jealous wife, Angela seeks refuge in a church where she encounters a young priest named Michael, who gives her sanctuary. But the killing was not a simple act of passion, as the victim had ties to organized crime, and, surprisingly, so does Michael, whose father is a powerful don. When the priest finds himself falling in love with Angela, his religious vows and family ties are both severely tested.', 'After witnessing her lover being murdered by his jealous wife, Angela seeks refuge in a church where she encounters a young priest named Michael, who gives her sanctuary. But the killing was not a simple act of passion, as the victim had ties to organized crime, and, surprisingly, so does Michael, whose father is a powerful don. When the priest finds himself falling in love with Angela, his religious vows and family ties are both severely tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bnmtc9TIdibB6hUsDSKpRHve2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95152'),
  ('1003270898789010893', 'Last Scene Alive: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2018, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Kevin Speckmaier, Kelly Marcusson, Ross Langill', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Yannick Bisson, Marilu Henner, Robin Dunne, Miranda Frigon, Peter Benson, Ellie Harvie, Scott Lyster', 'G', 'There is excitement in the air when a Hollywood crew comes to Lawrenceton to film a movie about the town’s sleuthy librarian, Aurora Teagarden. However, when the film’s leading lady is found murdered in her dressing room, Aurora enlists her Real Murders Club members to help gather clues. At the same time, she experiences mounting concern that Aida is becoming attracted to the film’s director who, like everyone else working on the set that day, is considered a suspect. And this time around Martin is especially worried about Aurora’s safety after learning that the film’s screenwriter, who has a romantic history with her, emerges as the prime suspect.', 'There is excitement in the air when a Hollywood crew comes to Lawrenceton to film a movie about the town’s sleuthy librarian, Aurora Teagarden. However, when the film’s leading lady is found murdered in her dressing room, Aurora enlists her Real Murders Club members to help gather clues. At the same time, she experiences mounting concern that Aida is becoming attracted to the film’s director who, like everyone else working on the set that day, is considered a suspect. And this time around Martin is especially worried about Aurora’s safety after learning that the film’s screenwriter, who has a romantic history with her, emerges as the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkNm43jTxBuv46SKUOtIS5enFpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494466'),
  ('703976657182796790', 'Last Seen Alive', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Brian Goodman, Anne McCarthy, Peter A. Holland', 'Marc Frydman', 'Gerard Butler, Jaimie Alexander, Russell Hornsby, Ethan Embry, Michael Irby, Bruce Altman, Jordan Salloum, Dani Deetté', 'R', 'After Will Spann''s wife suddenly vanishes at a gas station, his desperate search to find her leads him down a dark path that forces him to run from authorities and take the law into his own hands.', 'After Will Spann''s wife suddenly vanishes at a gas station, his desperate search to find her leads him down a dark path that forces him to run from authorities and take the law into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvqyDj34Uivokf4qIvK4bH0m0qF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961484'),
  ('980211132049449439', 'Last Sentinel', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mart Ratassepp, Karl Agapuu, Matilde Matvere', 'Malachi Smyth', 'Kate Bosworth, Lucien Laviscount, Martin McCann, Thomas Kretschmann, Ben Pullen, Karin Tammaru, Jan Erik Ehrenberg, Monika Tuvi', null, 'Set in the future on a war-ravaged Earth, four exhausted soldiers man Sentinel - a remote military base in a vast ocean that separates two warring continents. While their tour of duty ended three months ago, the relief crew still hasn''t arrived and as the empty weeks turn to months, paranoia descends, testing relationships to breaking point...', 'Set in the future on a war-ravaged Earth, four exhausted soldiers man Sentinel - a remote military base in a vast ocean that separates two warring continents. While their tour of duty ended three months ago, the relief crew still hasn''t arrived and as the empty weeks turn to months, paranoia descends, testing relationships to breaking point...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pD1o9B0ibENdNroYrBCQemG2jnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516806'),
  ('57475442239801317', 'Last Shift', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Samantha Ubeda, Christian Reynolds, Anthony DiBlasi', 'Anthony DiBlasi, Scott Poiley', 'Juliana Harkavy, Joshua Mikel, Hank Stone, J. LaRose, Sarah Sculco, Kathryn Kilger, Natalie Victoria, Mary Lankford Poiley', 'R', 'Rookie police officer Jessica Loren has been assigned the last shift at a closing police station and must wait for a hazmat crew to collect biomedical evidence. Ordered not to leave the station under any circumstances, Jessica comes to learn that it''s more than just an outdated station, it''s home to the ultimate embodiment of evil and his devoted bloodthirsty followers. Jessica is left to fend for herself in the Devil''s playground.', 'Rookie police officer Jessica Loren has been assigned the last shift at a closing police station and must wait for a hazmat crew to collect biomedical evidence. Ordered not to leave the station under any circumstances, Jessica comes to learn that it''s more than just an outdated station, it''s home to the ultimate embodiment of evil and his devoted bloodthirsty followers. Jessica is left to fend for herself in the Devil''s playground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSTFMqFpVB4yq9SOIxBp8xZ9jh5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296065'),
  ('224048916948153169', 'Last Shoot Out', 2021, 'Western, Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Hank Baumert Jr., Michael Feifer', 'Lee Martin', 'Jay Pickett, Michael Welch, Skylar Witte, Cam Gigandet, Bruce Dern, Brock Harris, Peter Sherayko, David DeLuise', 'PG-13', 'Soon after a newlywed learns that her husband had her father shot down, she flees from the Callahan ranch in fear. She''s rescued by a gunman who safeguards her at a remote outpost as he staves off her husband''s attempts to reclaim his bride.', 'Soon after a newlywed learns that her husband had her father shot down, she flees from the Callahan ranch in fear. She''s rescued by a gunman who safeguards her at a remote outpost as he staves off her husband''s attempts to reclaim his bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvEtPxotI3POlVPvNxgrHJuDXfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887767'),
  ('333280156986156419', 'Last Signal', 2022, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Action', 'Dmitry Kiselev', null, 'Anatoliy Belyy, Veronika Ustimova, Evgeny Egorov, Darya Moroz', 'PG-13', 'A father working on a space station has to save his 15-year-old daughter after a meteorite shower hits Earth, using only satellite phones and cameras.', 'A father working on a space station has to save his 15-year-old daughter after a meteorite shower hits Earth, using only satellite phones and cameras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izegu4cCvAbpu4542OXyWOyni8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1621242'),
  ('756419400150215032', 'Last Stand at Saber River', 1997, 'Action, Drama, TV Movie, Western', 'Dick Lowry, Ric Waite, Walter Scott', null, 'Tom Selleck, Suzy Amis, Rachel Duncan, Haley Joel Osment, Keith Carradine, David Carradine, Tracey Needham, Chris Stacy', null, 'As America recovers from the Civil War, one man tries to put the pieces of his life back together but finds himself fighting a new battle on the frontier. Cable is an embittered Confederate soldier who returns from the war to reclaim his Arizona homestead from rebel pioneers who sympathize with the Union war effort.', 'As America recovers from the Civil War, one man tries to put the pieces of his life back together but finds himself fighting a new battle on the frontier. Cable is an embittered Confederate soldier who returns from the war to reclaim his Arizona homestead from rebel pioneers who sympathize with the Union war effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWKbhAzELISfMVTFgFVx7kDyLA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55576'),
  ('81578571980058414', 'Last Stop 174', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bruno Barreto, Antoine Héberlé', 'Bráulio Mantovani', 'Michel Gomes, Cris Vianna, Marcelo Mello Jr., Gabriela Luiz, Anna Cotrim, Tay Lopez, Vitor Carvalho, Jana Guinond', null, 'Sandro was a boy who loved to sing rap, to kiss, to stare the statue of Christ the Redeemer and dreamed to go visit Copacabana. Growing up on streets, the story culminates at the infamous episode of 12th June 2000, when Sandro hijacked bus 174.', 'Sandro was a boy who loved to sing rap, to kiss, to stare the statue of Christ the Redeemer and dreamed to go visit Copacabana. Growing up on streets, the story culminates at the infamous episode of 12th June 2000, when Sandro hijacked bus 174.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvSZA7HIJMelYSaQ7ObBCylDnsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20268'),
  ('291837048909542028', 'Last Stop: Kurtuluş', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yusuf Pirhasan', 'Barış Pirhasan', 'Belçim Bilgin, Demet Akbağ, Asuman Dabak, Nihal Yalçın, Ayten Soykök, Damla Sönmez, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Mete Horozoğlu', null, 'Meet Vartanus who has devoted her life to her bedridden father; Goncagul who realizes that her Mafioso lover will never marry her. Gulnur who''s resigned herself to daily beatings as long as her husband doesn''t touch the kids, Tulay who''s shattered every time her mother gets beaten; hairdresser Fusun who tends to see things on the bright side. These are the women who transport Eylem, each other and perhaps every woman in the country to Last Stop: Kurtulus. The heroines adopt one unwavering principle: to oppose all forms of violence! A dark comedy that''s rose-tinted, provocative and fantastic...', 'Meet Vartanus who has devoted her life to her bedridden father; Goncagul who realizes that her Mafioso lover will never marry her. Gulnur who''s resigned herself to daily beatings as long as her husband doesn''t touch the kids, Tulay who''s shattered every time her mother gets beaten; hairdresser Fusun who tends to see things on the bright side. These are the women who transport Eylem, each other and perhaps every woman in the country to Last Stop: Kurtulus. The heroines adopt one unwavering principle: to oppose all forms of violence! A dark comedy that''s rose-tinted, provocative and fantastic...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4ouadV2fTAHagBSvTBmCrbsRfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101682'),
  ('1144952622631033632', 'Last Stop: Rocafort St.', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Marc Miró, Luis Prieto', 'Iván Ledesma, Ángel Agudo, Luis Prieto', 'Natalia Azahara, Javier Gutiérrez, Valèria Sorolla, Xavi Sáez, Francesc Albiol, Aimar Vega, Tatín Revenga, Jorge Cabrera', null, 'Laura has recently started working in the Barcelona subway. She has been assigned the old and quiet Rocafort station, but it won''t be long before she discovers that this stop harbors a legend that will begin to haunt her: many people have died there in strange circumstances over the years and no one seems to be interested in knowing the truth.', 'Laura has recently started working in the Barcelona subway. She has been assigned the old and quiet Rocafort station, but it won''t be long before she discovers that this stop harbors a legend that will begin to haunt her: many people have died there in strange circumstances over the years and no one seems to be interested in knowing the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oY6KfZgplGCA4WszBgd5WV2VOKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276210'),
  ('107373326823254406', 'Last Straw', 2024, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Alan Scott Neal, Andrey Nikolaev, Victoria McDevitt', 'Taylor Sardoni', 'Jessica Belkin, Jeremy Sisto, Taylor Kowalski, Tara Raani, Joji Otani Hansen, Glen Gould, Levon Panek, Brian D. Wolfe', null, 'A rural roadside diner becomes the host of a maniacal killing spree – leaving a young waitress to clean up the mess. After hard-headed Nancy fires the staff at her dad’s diner, she decides to cover the last shift of the night by herself. Little does she know, she is far from alone. The day is coming back to haunt her and when things begin to spiral out of control, she must fight for her life over the course of one long night.', 'A rural roadside diner becomes the host of a maniacal killing spree – leaving a young waitress to clean up the mess. After hard-headed Nancy fires the staff at her dad’s diner, she decides to cover the last shift of the night by herself. Little does she know, she is far from alone. The day is coming back to haunt her and when things begin to spiral out of control, she must fight for her life over the course of one long night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgpUvybRQzRK6UagoHNQRrO8sUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137205'),
