  ('14981507708034573', 'Last Woman on Earth', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Roger Corman, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Robert Towne', 'Betsy Jones-Moreland, Antony Carbone, Robert Towne', 'NR', 'Harold Gern, a shady businessman from New York, is spending a holiday in Puerto Rico with his attractive wife Evelyn. They are joined by Martin Joyce, Harold''s lawyer, who has come to discuss the latest indictment. Harold invites him along on a boat trip during which all three try out some newly bought scuba diving equipment. When they resurface, they find out that the world has changed forever.', 'Harold Gern, a shady businessman from New York, is spending a holiday in Puerto Rico with his attractive wife Evelyn. They are joined by Martin Joyce, Harold''s lawyer, who has come to discuss the latest indictment. Harold invites him along on a boat trip during which all three try out some newly bought scuba diving equipment. When they resurface, they find out that the world has changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5ELYfvs7hw2BKEkkRqxBRwPy8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71520'),
