  ('795577223595995123', 'Late Afternoon', 2019, 'Family, Animation, Drama', 'Louise Bagnall', 'Louise Bagnall', 'Fionnula Flanagan, Lucy O''Connell, Louise Bagnall, Niamh Moyles, Michael McGrath, Aislin Konings Ferrari, Caoimhe Ni Bhradaigh', 'PG', 'Emily finds herself disconnected from the world around her. She goes on a journey through her memories and relives different moments from her life. Emily must look to her past so that she may fully embrace the present.', 'Emily finds herself disconnected from the world around her. She goes on a journey through her memories and relives different moments from her life. Emily must look to her past so that she may fully embrace the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMoFkyeFnsquIOgEAtzm4vuvR7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500688'),
  ('1099273966336976103', 'Late August, Early September', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Assayas, Denis Lenoir, Yorick Le Saux', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Mathieu Amalric, Virginie Ledoyen, François Cluzet, Jeanne Balibar, Alex Descas, Arsinée Khanjian, Mia Hansen-Løve, Nathalie Richard', null, 'A book editor juggles relationships with two women while coping with his best friend''s terminal illness.', 'A book editor juggles relationships with two women while coping with his best friend''s terminal illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBIcJIwqKl9DpStlg5rL33yYTQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78568'),
  ('1055029462947348216', 'Late Autumn', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta, Kôzô Tashiro', 'Kōgo Noda, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Setsuko Hara, Yōko Tsukasa, Mariko Okada, Keiji Sada, Miyuki Kuwano, Shinichirō Mikami, Shin Saburi, Chishū Ryū', null, 'A woman and her daughter are each forced to contend with an increasing pressure to marry, particularly from three men who knew her late husband.', 'A woman and her daughter are each forced to contend with an increasing pressure to marry, particularly from three men who knew her late husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3f2dNFbDBjrGBo2iCW57TO4XeyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21967'),
  ('665394622161380327', 'Late Autumn', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nike Imoru, Megan Griffiths, Tyler Beem', 'Kim Ji-heon', 'Hyun Bin, Tang Wei, Jun Kim, John Wu, Danni Lang, Katarina Choi, Kim Seo-ra, Park Mi-hyeon', null, 'Anna learns in prison that her mother has passed away in Seattle. Prison officials grants Anna a three day furlough to attend her mother''s funeral. Anna embarks on a long trip to Seattle. Hoon is a Korean immigrant who works as a gigolo. Hoon is now on the run from a wealthy client''s furious husband. These two seemingly lost souls are about to share three memorable days together.', 'Anna learns in prison that her mother has passed away in Seattle. Prison officials grants Anna a three day furlough to attend her mother''s funeral. Anna embarks on a long trip to Seattle. Hoon is a Korean immigrant who works as a gigolo. Hoon is now on the run from a wealthy client''s furious husband. These two seemingly lost souls are about to share three memorable days together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SNjM2dUrq21TPK2faONOQ8riav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91073'),
  ('985592211828757191', 'Late Bloomer', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Gô Shibata, Masaaki Takakura', 'Satoshi Nakamura', 'Masakiyo Sumida, Ariko Arita, Toshihisa Fukunaga, Naozô Hotta, Sumiko Shirai, Mari Torii', null, 'Late Bloomer is the story of Sumida-san, a severely handicapped man, and his downward spiral into hell.', 'Late Bloomer is the story of Sumida-san, a severely handicapped man, and his downward spiral into hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e90yHVwUu9elHY3ShjwIEbLjk0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91191'),
  ('1028355048743161616', 'Late Bloomers', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Julia Dyer, Mike Dempsey, Bill Schwarz', 'Gretchen Dyer', 'Connie Nelson, Dee Hennigan, Gary Carter, Jonah Lisa Dyer, Esteban Powell, Joe Nemmers, Rene Moreno, Tyrees Allen', null, 'A lonely secretary leaves her family for love with a female basketball coach. But their awakening galvanizes the local conservative community, with the small-town drama permeating everywhere from the teacher’s lounge to the student body to the PTA, yet leads to unexpected love-conquers-all resolutions.', 'A lonely secretary leaves her family for love with a female basketball coach. But their awakening galvanizes the local conservative community, with the small-town drama permeating everywhere from the teacher’s lounge to the student body to the PTA, yet leads to unexpected love-conquers-all resolutions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7drJqkj6mg1cnU6UtmBYYyisYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201445'),
  ('1122792212220772561', 'Late Bloomers', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Stéphane Kuthy, Bettina Oberli', 'Sabine Pochhammer', 'Annemarie Düringer, Heidi Maria Glössner, Monica Gubser, Lilian Naef, Monika Niggeler, Peter Wyssbrod, Manfred Liechti, Ruth Schwegler', null, 'Centers around four older ladies from the Emmental region. When four older women decide to turn the local corner shop into a chic lingerie store, the whole community is thrown into disarray.', 'Centers around four older ladies from the Emmental region. When four older women decide to turn the local corner shop into a chic lingerie store, the whole community is thrown into disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTSJdigkbnpgxM019MNZVdR9skC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30253'),
  ('460716294830977135', 'Late Bloomers', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Lisa Steen, John de Menil', 'Anna Greenfield', 'Karen Gillan, Małgorzata Zajączkowska, Jermaine Fowler, Talia Balsam, Kevin Nealon, Michelle Twarowska, Max Jenkins, Lateefah Holder', null, 'Louise, an aimless, 28 year-old Brooklynite, recently single, sort of a musician, depressed without admitting to it, drunkenly falls while doing something stupid and breaks her hip. This lands her in a physical therapy ward full of people twice her age. There, she meets Antonina - a cranky elderly Polish woman, who speaks no English. Louise gets a job caring for her. Neither woman loves the arrangement but it’s time to face the truth about aging. We all have to grow up sometime.', 'Louise, an aimless, 28 year-old Brooklynite, recently single, sort of a musician, depressed without admitting to it, drunkenly falls while doing something stupid and breaks her hip. This lands her in a physical therapy ward full of people twice her age. There, she meets Antonina - a cranky elderly Polish woman, who speaks no English. Louise gets a job caring for her. Neither woman loves the arrangement but it’s time to face the truth about aging. We all have to grow up sometime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SOHdbnArnILAkv07X0f6uCRBxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999849'),
  ('550294946467930684', 'Late Blossom', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choo Chang-min, Kim Yong-deok, Park Gun-woo', 'Choo Chang-min, Lee Man-hee, Kim Sang-su', 'Lee Soon-jae, Song Jae-ho, Yun So-jeong, Kim Soo-mi, Oh Dal-su, Song Ji-hyo, Kim Bi-bi, Park Nam-hee', null, 'Follows the lives of two couples who live in the same neighborhood. Kim Man-Suk delivers milk on a motorbike at dawn. He curses a lot, but actually has a warm heart. One day when he goes up a slope, he meets Ms. Song - a lonely woman who works hards by collecting and selling scrap paper. Man-Suk feels something special toward Ms. Song. Jang Kun-Bong works in a parking lot. Jang Kun-Bong has a wife who suffers from Alzheimer''s. He works from dawn until late at night. After work he comes home and takes care of his wife.', 'Follows the lives of two couples who live in the same neighborhood. Kim Man-Suk delivers milk on a motorbike at dawn. He curses a lot, but actually has a warm heart. One day when he goes up a slope, he meets Ms. Song - a lonely woman who works hards by collecting and selling scrap paper. Man-Suk feels something special toward Ms. Song. Jang Kun-Bong works in a parking lot. Jang Kun-Bong has a wife who suffers from Alzheimer''s. He works from dawn until late at night. After work he comes home and takes care of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAA98Lb5Z1Bb2uvCms3FjaQ9M83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72575'),
  ('98621351109422922', 'Late Chrysanthemums', 1954, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masao Tamai, Masayoshi Kawanishi', null, 'Haruko Sugimura, Sadako Sawamura, Chikako Hosokawa, Yūko Mochizuki, Ken Uehara, Hiroshi Koizumi, Ineko Arima, Bontarō Miake', null, 'What is the life of a Geisha like once her beauty has faded and she has retired? Kin has saved, and become a wealthy money-lender, spending her days coldly collecting debts. Even her best friends, fellow Geisha Tomi, Nobu, and Tamae, are now indebted to her. For all of them, the glamour of their young lives has passed; Tomi and Tamae have disappointing children. Kin has two former lovers who still pursue her; one she wants to see, and the other she doesn''t. But even the one she remembers fondly, when he shows up, proves less than satisfactory.', 'What is the life of a Geisha like once her beauty has faded and she has retired? Kin has saved, and become a wealthy money-lender, spending her days coldly collecting debts. Even her best friends, fellow Geisha Tomi, Nobu, and Tamae, are now indebted to her. For all of them, the glamour of their young lives has passed; Tomi and Tamae have disappointing children. Kin has two former lovers who still pursue her; one she wants to see, and the other she doesn''t. But even the one she remembers fondly, when he shows up, proves less than satisfactory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3cwwGKhwPcmsdLV8Kktu7BCk7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36871'),
  ('711351087096273830', 'Late Fame', 2026, 'Drama', 'Kent Jones, Wyatt Garfield', 'Samy Burch', 'Willem Dafoe, Greta Lee, Edmund Donovan, Stephen Badalamenti, William Hill', null, 'Legendary New York poet Ed Saxberger''s forgotten works captivate an eccentric group of young creatives, reigniting his artistic passion. Their intrigue intertwines with the bewitching presence of actress Gloria.', 'Legendary New York poet Ed Saxberger''s forgotten works captivate an eccentric group of young creatives, reigniting his artistic passion. Their intrigue intertwines with the bewitching presence of actress Gloria.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiCLsQ34OMyOS1zN8yUhE59SZnfK.jpg', 'plex:movie:late-fame-2026'),
  ('661648102701755379', 'Late for Dinner', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'W.D. Richter, Peter Sova', 'Mark Andrus', 'Peter Berg, Brian Wimmer, Marcia Gay Harden, Cassy Friel, Peter Gallagher, Ross Malinger, Luce Rains, Janeane Garofalo', 'PG', 'Two young men, one in need of medical attention, are cryogenically frozen in the early 1960s. The two are preoccupied with the fact that the police are pursuing them to realise what they are doing. The next thing they know is that they are in a strange new world (thirty years on).', 'Two young men, one in need of medical attention, are cryogenically frozen in the early 1960s. The two are preoccupied with the fact that the police are pursuing them to realise what they are doing. The next thing they know is that they are in a strange new world (thirty years on).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gE5LOeUVc4k1Q4zj4Fxs9c6VMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56120'),
  ('552486239965056379', 'Late Last Night', 1999, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Steven Brill, Eliot Rockett', 'Steven Brill', 'Emilio Estevez, Steven Weber, Kelly Rowan, Leah Lail, Lisa Robin Kelly, Catherine O''Hara, John Carroll Lynch, John Hawkes', 'R', 'After a fight with his wife, who''s leaving him, Dan''s day is getting worse by the minute. He calls an old friend for a night of binge drinking and intoxication. They start a cathartic ride through the city''s underbelly.', 'After a fight with his wife, who''s leaving him, Dan''s day is getting worse by the minute. He calls an old friend for a night of binge drinking and intoxication. They start a cathartic ride through the city''s underbelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92f7FqM7A7X5DuDnGdilDCMz1bf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177085'),
  ('1011860224344474854', 'Late Marriage', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dover Koshashvili', 'Dover Koshashvili', 'Lior Ashkenazi, Ronit Elkabetz, Moni Moshonov, Lili Koshashvili, Aya Steinovitz, Rosina Kambus, Simon Chen, Sapir Kugman', 'NR', 'Zaza is a 31-year old Israeli bachelor, handsome and intelligent, and his family wants to see him married. But tradition dictates that Zaza has to choose a young virgin. She must be beautiful and from a good family, preferably rich. Zaza''s parents, Yasha and Lily drag Zaza to meet potential brides and their families. Zaza has no choice. He plays along with his family, advocates of the suffocating traditions of their Georgian Jewish heritage. But Zaza always manages to somehow get out of being engaged. What his parents don''t know is that Zaza is already in love. Judith is sensuous, strong and intriguing. She''s also a divorcée with a 6-year-old daughter. So Zaza has kept Judith a secret from his family. He will have to choose between respect of the strict confines of family and tradition, or the love of his life.', 'Zaza is a 31-year old Israeli bachelor, handsome and intelligent, and his family wants to see him married. But tradition dictates that Zaza has to choose a young virgin. She must be beautiful and from a good family, preferably rich. Zaza''s parents, Yasha and Lily drag Zaza to meet potential brides and their families. Zaza has no choice. He plays along with his family, advocates of the suffocating traditions of their Georgian Jewish heritage. But Zaza always manages to somehow get out of being engaged. What his parents don''t know is that Zaza is already in love. Judith is sensuous, strong and intriguing. She''s also a divorcée with a 6-year-old daughter. So Zaza has kept Judith a secret from his family. He will have to choose between respect of the strict confines of family and tradition, or the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IcQsfhjfQamVvRgtpYkwdIKilw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49680'),
  ('196100437591153677', 'Late Night', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julie A. Bloom, Eleonora de Simone, Vincent Giarratano', 'Mindy Kaling', 'Emma Thompson, Mindy Kaling, Max Casella, Hugh Dancy, Denis O''Hare, Reid Scott, Amy Ryan, Paul Walter Hauser', 'R', 'A legendary late-night talk show host''s world is turned upside down when she hires her only female staff writer. Originally intended to smooth over diversity concerns, her decision has unexpectedly hilarious consequences as the two women separated by culture and generation are united by their love of a biting punchline.', 'A legendary late-night talk show host''s world is turned upside down when she hires her only female staff writer. Originally intended to smooth over diversity concerns, her decision has unexpectedly hilarious consequences as the two women separated by culture and generation are united by their love of a biting punchline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxwb5KBqS0SHsUcyLgWMk3vuVxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523172'),
  ('470719459870221247', 'Late Night Shopping', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Saul Metzstein, Brian Tufano', 'Jack Lothian', 'Luke de Woolfson, James Lance, Kate Ashfield, Heike Makatsch, Enzo Cilenti, Shauna Macdonald, Sienna Guillory, Laurie Ventry', null, 'Four friends Sean, Vincent, Lenny and Jody find themselves at something of a deadend. Trapped in a twilight world of permanent night shift work, they hang out together in the local cafe, drinking coffee and entertaining themselves by observing Vincent''s unwavering success in pulling women. There seems to be little prospect of change...until Vincent accidently sleeps with Sean''s girlfriend.', 'Four friends Sean, Vincent, Lenny and Jody find themselves at something of a deadend. Trapped in a twilight world of permanent night shift work, they hang out together in the local cafe, drinking coffee and entertaining themselves by observing Vincent''s unwavering success in pulling women. There seems to be little prospect of change...until Vincent accidently sleeps with Sean''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aRREJVPJFQGCv2PqNeeANnspjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18088'),
  ('145675774911826089', 'Late Night Trains', 1975, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Aldo Lado, Gábor Pogány', 'Aldo Lado, Renato Izzo', 'Flavio Bucci, Macha Méril, Gianfranco De Grassi, Enrico Maria Salerno, Marina Berti, Irene Miracle, Laura D''Angelo, Franco Fabrizi', null, 'Two young women, Margaret and Lisa, are set to take the overnight train from Munich in Germany to stay with Lisa''s parents in Italy for Christmas. Unfortunately a pair of psychotic hoodlums and an equally demented nymphomaniac woman terrorize the pair.', 'Two young women, Margaret and Lisa, are set to take the overnight train from Munich in Germany to stay with Lisa''s parents in Italy for Christmas. Unfortunately a pair of psychotic hoodlums and an equally demented nymphomaniac woman terrorize the pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LDH11OuWVH1AdTqUVfSukkSfLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39988'),
  ('977468665636818179', 'Late Night with the Devil', 2024, 'Horror', 'Cameron Cairnes, Colin Cairnes, Andrew Power', 'Colin Cairnes, Cameron Cairnes', 'David Dastmalchian, Laura Gordon, Ian Bliss, Fayssal Bazzi, Ingrid Torelli, Rhys Auteri, Georgina Haig, Josh Quong Tart', 'R', 'A live broadcast of a late-night talk show in 1977 goes horribly wrong, unleashing evil into the nation''s living rooms.', 'A live broadcast of a late-night talk show in 1977 goes horribly wrong, unleashing evil into the nation''s living rooms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mu8LRWT9GHkfiyHm7kgxT6YNvMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938614'),
  ('95104365219382828', 'Late Nights', 2026, null, 'Eric Kiekeben, Hannah Schuh', null, null, null, 'Late Night Mizzou, a club founded by freshmen Cam Koffel, aimed to revolutionize student journalism and comedy with weekly late-night shows filled with live and pre-recorded sketches, mimicking the professional shows they grew up idolizing. Now, entering its fourth year, Cam and his club members are confronted with the harsh reality that their club has barely captured the attention of their fellow students, let alone the national audience they envisioned. With graduation looming, Cam is in a desperate race against time to save their creation from oblivion amid waning student support, a changing industry and discrepancies within the club.', 'Late Night Mizzou, a club founded by freshmen Cam Koffel, aimed to revolutionize student journalism and comedy with weekly late-night shows filled with live and pre-recorded sketches, mimicking the professional shows they grew up idolizing. Now, entering its fourth year, Cam and his club members are confronted with the harsh reality that their club has barely captured the attention of their fellow students, let alone the national audience they envisioned. With graduation looming, Cam is in a desperate race against time to save their creation from oblivion amid waning student support, a changing industry and discrepancies within the club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uI6MDHCPFnwJSfZbJnnWyXxTbew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1662690'),
  ('21460941653131160', 'Late Phases', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adrián García Bogliano, Ernesto Herrera', 'Eric Stolze', 'Nick Damici, Ethan Embry, Lance Guest, Erin Cummings, Rutanya Alda, Tom Noonan, Tina Louise, Caitlin O''Heaney', null, 'When deadly attacks from a nearby forest beset a secluded retirement community, it is up to a blind army veteran to discover what the residents are hiding.', 'When deadly attacks from a nearby forest beset a secluded retirement community, it is up to a blind army veteran to discover what the residents are hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ulbyPajXTNZkki9AtcLI9YYhc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254193'),
  ('741088609865553316', 'Late Show', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Helmut Dietl, Gernot Roll', 'Christoph Müller, Helmut Dietl', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Harald Schmidt, Veronica Ferres, Jasmin Tabatabai, Olli Dittrich, Dieter Pfaff, Jürgen Tarrach, Andrea Sawatzki', null, 'Hannes Engel is a successful radio presenter in the countryside. By chance, he is heard by program director Conrad Scheffer one night, who immediately recognizes the potential of the cheeky presenter and wants to sign him up as the new figurehead for his late show, which is in a ratings slump. But this proves to be more difficult than planned. First of all, they have to get rid of the old show host, then Engel''s wife has just been thrown out of one of the station''s productions, and Engel is also being pursued by a sensationalist tabloid journalist who never misses a chance to drag Engel through the mud....', 'Hannes Engel is a successful radio presenter in the countryside. By chance, he is heard by program director Conrad Scheffer one night, who immediately recognizes the potential of the cheeky presenter and wants to sign him up as the new figurehead for his late show, which is in a ratings slump. But this proves to be more difficult than planned. First of all, they have to get rid of the old show host, then Engel''s wife has just been thrown out of one of the station''s productions, and Engel is also being pursued by a sensationalist tabloid journalist who never misses a chance to drag Engel through the mud....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmDNeiqPXF3a4A2oO6nJNwAvzdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11871'),
  ('839648226756472521', 'Late Spring', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cho Keun-hyun, Shin Kyung-man, Kim Jeong-won', 'Shin Yang-joong', 'Park Yong-woo, Kim Seo-hyung, Lee You-young, Joo Young-ho, Yoon Ye-hee, Kim Su-an, Nam Il-woo, Han Hye-jin', null, 'Set in the 1960''s. Joo-goo is viewed as Korea''s best sculptor, but he suffers from a disease which will slowly paralyze his body. He gives up interests in the arts and just spends his days meaninglessly. His wife, Jung-sook, tries to find a nude model for him, hoping the model might inspire him to sculpt again. One day, Jung-sook meets Min-gyung.', 'Set in the 1960''s. Joo-goo is viewed as Korea''s best sculptor, but he suffers from a disease which will slowly paralyze his body. He gives up interests in the arts and just spends his days meaninglessly. His wife, Jung-sook, tries to find a nude model for him, hoping the model might inspire him to sculpt again. One day, Jung-sook meets Min-gyung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZOrLLSBCCEW3uLQK2r1O97LBLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308420'),
  ('410716836866131529', 'Latency', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'James Croke, Wych Kaosayananda', 'James Croke', 'Sasha Luss, Alexis Ren, Ava Caryofyllis, Robert Coleby, Kelly B. Jones, Willy Zogo, Chloe Schwank, Edward Frame', 'PG-13', 'When professional gamer Hana, who suffers from acute agoraphobia, receives new equipment that enhances her game, she begins to wonder if it is reading her mind – or controlling it.', 'When professional gamer Hana, who suffers from acute agoraphobia, receives new equipment that enhances her game, she begins to wonder if it is reading her mind – or controlling it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNBDVUFmvgCgxzpEl5ZJ9TUSc8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1042657'),
  ('586315292054292823', 'Laterna, Poverty and Carnation', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Stelios Zografakis, Alekos Sakellarios, Dinos Katsouridis', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Mimis Fotopoulos, Vasilis Avlonitis, Jenny Karezi, Nikos Fermas, Lavrentis Dianellos, Periklis Hristoforidis, Alekos Alexandrakis, Haris Kamili', null, 'Pavlaras and Petrakis have spent the money that Kaiti''s father gave them two years ago and continue to travel around Athens with their lantern. However, Pavlaras is not well and needs to rest, as recommended by his doctor. Petrakis collects money from their friends, but it is not enough to cover their expenses. He is then forced to secretly sell the lantern without Pavlaras'' knowledge.', 'Pavlaras and Petrakis have spent the money that Kaiti''s father gave them two years ago and continue to travel around Athens with their lantern. However, Pavlaras is not well and needs to rest, as recommended by his doctor. Petrakis collects money from their friends, but it is not enough to cover their expenses. He is then forced to secretly sell the lantern without Pavlaras'' knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lPpNR6ofU7sCvDFfRSB1Wrwcmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331958'),
  ('257159975520144111', 'Latin Blood – The Ballad of Ney Matogrosso', 2025, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Esmir Filho, Azul Serra, Kity Féo', 'Esmir Filho', 'Jesuíta Barbosa, Rômulo Braga, Hermila Guedes, Davi Malizia, Jullio Reis, Bruno Montaleone, Mauro Soares, Bruno Parmera', null, 'From a repressive childhood to artistic revolution, Ney Matogrosso transforms Brazil''s stages — and himself — through music, creativity and inner fire.', 'From a repressive childhood to artistic revolution, Ney Matogrosso transforms Brazil''s stages — and himself — through music, creativity and inner fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uk2g9LNwSHEsDjwTEBLNb38kcRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212121'),
  ('752541197151474112', 'Latin Boys Go to Hell', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Ela Troyano, James Carman', 'Ela Troyano, Andre Salas', 'Irwin Ossa, John Bryant Davila, Jenifer Lee Simard, Alexis Artiles, Mike Ruiz, Anne Iobst, Norma Maldonado, Guinevere Turner', 'NR', 'A cute, openly gay latin boy''s hormones go into overdrive when his hunky cousin Angel arrives for an extended stay. The two explore the young and sometimes dangerous gay scene in the city''s Latin neighborhood, with surprising outcomes.', 'A cute, openly gay latin boy''s hormones go into overdrive when his hunky cousin Angel arrives for an extended stay. The two explore the young and sometimes dangerous gay scene in the city''s Latin neighborhood, with surprising outcomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VTCqdAd5fprp7kmbwoGsnOeAnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78246'),
  ('789213601271192701', 'Latin for All', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Maxime L''Anthoën, Lucie Baudinaud, Émilie Noblet', 'Émilie Noblet, Clémence Dargent', 'Louise Bourgoin, Xavier Lacaille, Noémie Lvovsky, Francesco Montanari, Issa Perica, Ida Pellegrino, Elias Donada, Gabrielle Garcia', null, 'Delphine, a disillusioned humanities teacher, makes an agreement with her students : they leave her in peace, as they get A+ grades. But these excellent results turn into a nightmare when the class is qualified for the Latin World Championships, in Naples.', 'Delphine, a disillusioned humanities teacher, makes an agreement with her students : they leave her in peace, as they get A+ grades. But these excellent results turn into a nightmare when the class is qualified for the Latin World Championships, in Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2jR6cmMum0cn53ZxQHFFewzqdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018728'),
  ('444415434365839316', 'Latin Lover', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cristina Comencini, Italo Petriccione, Francesca Polic Greco', 'Cristina Comencini, Giulia Calenda', 'Virna Lisi, Angela Finocchiaro, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Marisa Paredes, Candela Peña, Francesco Scianna, Lluís Homar, Pihla Viitala', null, 'The five daughters of a famous actor, all from different mothers and different nationalities, get together on the 10th anniversary of his death for a celebration of his career.', 'The five daughters of a famous actor, all from different mothers and different nationalities, get together on the 10th anniversary of his death for a celebration of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/capuH68SgJDaslK0vK5Ov3Gzqea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330171'),
  ('824264821021704071', 'Latitude Zero', 1969, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Ishirō Honda, Taiichi Kankura, Seiji Tani', 'Ted Sherdeman, Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Joseph Cotten, Cesar Romero, Akira Takarada, Masumi Okada, Richard Jaeckel, Patricia Medina, Mari Nakayama, Akihiko Hirata', 'G', 'A massive underwater volcano erupts and puts a group of investigative scientists in danger. They are rescued by an atomic super submarine named The Alpha under the command of Captain McKenzie. The group is quickly taken to a vast underwater city known as Latitude Zero, a fantastic, Atlantean type utopia, a world beneath the ocean with its own sun. It is soon discovered that Captain McKenzie is at war with the evil Dr. Malic, a cruel scientist who wishes to rule mankind all the while conducting genetic experiments on humans and animals. Malic sends his agents to kidnap Dr. Okada, a human scientist who has created a serum that can immunize exposure to radiation.', 'A massive underwater volcano erupts and puts a group of investigative scientists in danger. They are rescued by an atomic super submarine named The Alpha under the command of Captain McKenzie. The group is quickly taken to a vast underwater city known as Latitude Zero, a fantastic, Atlantean type utopia, a world beneath the ocean with its own sun. It is soon discovered that Captain McKenzie is at war with the evil Dr. Malic, a cruel scientist who wishes to rule mankind all the while conducting genetic experiments on humans and animals. Malic sends his agents to kidnap Dr. Okada, a human scientist who has created a serum that can immunize exposure to radiation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58fofE7vR7eYt8E1DQOa12gzccg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49186'),
  ('972734640735713893', 'Latitudes', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Felipe Braga', null, 'Alice Braga, Daniel de Oliveira, Elisa Volpatto, Michel Noher', null, 'Olívia, a fashion executive, and José, a photographer, gets together in Paris, having casual sex and talking a little about relationships. And, in some days, they meet again in another city. And another one. And another... Latitudes is a trip around the world, the love and the poem of living.', 'Olívia, a fashion executive, and José, a photographer, gets together in Paris, having casual sex and talking a little about relationships. And, in some days, they meet again in another city. And another one. And another... Latitudes is a trip around the world, the love and the poem of living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmmO3DylGTrKzahKuEcW6YeIcWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266723'),
  ('361509761867629955', 'Latte and the Magic Waterstone', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Andrea Deppert, Mimi Maynard, Regina Welker', 'Andrea Deppert, Martin Behnke', 'Luisa Wietzorek, Henning Baum, Timur Bartels, Tim Schwarzmaier, Maud Ackermann, Hans Bayer, Helen Blaschke, Nicolas Böll', null, 'When a greedy bear steals a magic stone to keep the forest’s water for himself, a brave hedgehog and a timid squirrel must work together to retrieve it.', 'When a greedy bear steals a magic stone to keep the forest’s water for himself, a brave hedgehog and a timid squirrel must work together to retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saxPKOrN6rNScTicLpBDZw58Cw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586954'),
  ('527492486736303864', 'Latter Days', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'C. Jay Cox, Carl Bartels', 'C. Jay Cox', 'Steve Sandvoss, Wes Ramsey, Jacqueline Bisset, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Rebekah Johnson, Mary Kay Place, Erik Palladino, Amber Benson', 'R', 'Christian, a hunky, 20-something, West Hollywood party boy gets more than he bargains for when he tries to seduce Aaron, a sexually confused Mormon missionary who moves into his apartment complex.', 'Christian, a hunky, 20-something, West Hollywood party boy gets more than he bargains for when he tries to seduce Aaron, a sexually confused Mormon missionary who moves into his apartment complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwzJL11Xp6h8stocOz6E8e2LWtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15708'),
  ('517523140755282896', 'Lauda - The Untold Story', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Hannes Michael Schalle', 'Alistair Audsley, Hannes Michael Schalle, Guenther Mitterhuber', 'Xaver Hutter, Niki Lauda, David Coulthard, Lewis Hamilton, Nico Rosberg, Mark Webber, Jackie Stewart, Jochen Mass', null, 'In 1976 Niki Lauda survived one of the most famous crashes in Formula One history. Using previously unseen footage, LAUDA: THE UNTOLD STORY explains what happened on that fateful, and near fatal day at the Nurburgring, then follows Lauda’s courageous journey to recovery culminating in a miraculous comeback in Monza just weeks later. The film also investigates the impact that his crash had not just on his own life but on the sport as a whole, looking at the safety developments from the 1900s to the present day. Featuring exclusive access to Mercedes HQ and interviews with Lauda, his family, and motorsports legends past and present including Sir Jackie Stewart, David Coulthard, Mark Webber, Lewis Hamilton, Nico Rosberg, Hans-Joachim Stuck and Jochen Mass. LAUDA: THE UNTOLD STORY is a must-see for all motorsport fans.', 'In 1976 Niki Lauda survived one of the most famous crashes in Formula One history. Using previously unseen footage, LAUDA: THE UNTOLD STORY explains what happened on that fateful, and near fatal day at the Nurburgring, then follows Lauda’s courageous journey to recovery culminating in a miraculous comeback in Monza just weeks later. The film also investigates the impact that his crash had not just on his own life but on the sport as a whole, looking at the safety developments from the 1900s to the present day. Featuring exclusive access to Mercedes HQ and interviews with Lauda, his family, and motorsports legends past and present including Sir Jackie Stewart, David Coulthard, Mark Webber, Lewis Hamilton, Nico Rosberg, Hans-Joachim Stuck and Jochen Mass. LAUDA: THE UNTOLD STORY is a must-see for all motorsport fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kHjvxK6zK0n7E8zBexmzMRxOnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347247'),
  ('712714729092262051', 'Lauderdale', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Bill Milling, Ken Gibb', 'Bill Milling', 'Janine Lindemulder, Darrel Guilbeau, Michelle Kemp, Jeff Greenman, Lara Belmonte, Amy Lynn Baxter, Renee Shugart, Sherrie Rose', null, 'A nerd and his out-of-control friend chase a dream girl to a beach in Florida.', 'A nerd and his out-of-control friend chase a dream girl to a beach in Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7CjQkE1l7jBVJk5ATVXYutGeel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28604'),
  ('438273825021431812', 'Laugh, Clown, Laugh', 1928, 'Drama', 'James Wong Howe, Herbert Brenon, Ray Lissner', 'Elizabeth Meehan, Tom Cushing, David Belasco', 'Lon Chaney, Bernard Siegel, Loretta Young, Cissy Fitzgerald, Nils Asther, Gwen Lee, Robert Brower, Julie DeValora', null, 'A despairing clown suffering a broken heart and a self-indulgent count who uncontrollably laughs learn to help each other with their problems, but both fall in love with the same young woman.', 'A despairing clown suffering a broken heart and a self-indulgent count who uncontrollably laughs learn to help each other with their problems, but both fall in love with the same young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PILNUlID28a2ST8sp5u3l2Ddqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27507'),
  ('1009257893640404766', 'Laughing Gravy', 1931, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Harry Bernard, Charles Dorety, Laughing Gravy, Charlie Hall', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie try to hide their pet dog Laughing Gravy from their exasperated, mean tempered landlord, who has a "No Pets" policy.', 'Stan and Ollie try to hide their pet dog Laughing Gravy from their exasperated, mean tempered landlord, who has a "No Pets" policy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JRB5XGJyFLU0h3nVi8DqE1PqGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50830'),
  ('930786153907056581', 'Laughing Sinners', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harry Beaumont, Douglas Shearer, Charles Rosher', 'Bess Meredyth', 'Joan Crawford, Neil Hamilton, Clark Gable, Marjorie Rambeau, Guy Kibbee, Cliff Edwards, Roscoe Karns, Gertrude Short', 'NR', 'Ivy Stevens is a cafe entertainer in love with a shifty salesman who deserts her. In attempting to commit suicide, she is saved by Carl, a Salvation Army officer. Encouraged by Carl, Ivy joins the Salvation Army. When her old flame re-enters her life, Ivy finds she is still attracted and begins another affair with him.', 'Ivy Stevens is a cafe entertainer in love with a shifty salesman who deserts her. In attempting to commit suicide, she is saved by Carl, a Salvation Army officer. Encouraged by Carl, Ivy joins the Salvation Army. When her old flame re-enters her life, Ivy finds she is still attracted and begins another affair with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIQeViY750gEwIwOpKGL9b4nM8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97327'),
  ('380929068082186974', 'Laughing Target', 1987, 'Animation, Horror', 'Motosuke Takahashi, Shigeharu Shiba, Takeo Kobayashi', 'Hideo Takayashiki, Tomoko Konparu', 'Iyo Matsumoto, Hiromi Tsuru, Yoku Shioya, Kumiko Takizawa, Takahiro Hirai, Toshiko Sawada, Ai Satou, Akiko Hiramatsu', null, 'Things couldn''t have seemed better for Shiga Yuzuru, your average teenage high-schooler. The captain of the school archery team, he''s going steady with teammate and classmate Satomi. He had almost forgotten that he had been betrothed to his cousin, Shiga Azusa, when he was only 6... but all this changes when his aunt dies a peculiar and unnatural death. Now arriving to claim what she feels is rightfully hers, only Satomi stands in Azusa''s way... and with the mysterious and frightening powers that Azusa brings, Satomi won''t stand in her way for long!', 'Things couldn''t have seemed better for Shiga Yuzuru, your average teenage high-schooler. The captain of the school archery team, he''s going steady with teammate and classmate Satomi. He had almost forgotten that he had been betrothed to his cousin, Shiga Azusa, when he was only 6... but all this changes when his aunt dies a peculiar and unnatural death. Now arriving to claim what she feels is rightfully hers, only Satomi stands in Azusa''s way... and with the mysterious and frightening powers that Azusa brings, Satomi won''t stand in her way for long!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uo8vdkendmzKVWUWv6i9ZIPAOW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172347'),
  ('822709527412377398', 'Laughing while on vacations', 1990, 'Comedy', 'René Cardona Jr.', null, 'Pedro Romo, Paco Ibáñez, Pablo Ferrel, Gabriela Barrera, Sol Amin, Anita Romero', null, 'Comedians play pranks on unsuspecting people vacationing at the beach.', 'Comedians play pranks on unsuspecting people vacationing at the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osBTkNb2sF4OQdtgdg5YjjySHXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453629'),
  ('740051389063529132', 'Laughter', 1930, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Harry d''Abbadie d''Arrast, George J. Folsey, Frank Tours', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Nancy Carroll, Fredric March, Frank Morgan, Glenn Anders, Diane Ellis, Ollie Burgoyne, Leonard Carey, Eric Blore', 'NR', 'Zeigfeld Follies beauty Peggy marries an older man, C. Morton Gibson. Although she soon grows tired of their sedate life, she refuses the attentions of her longtime friend, the volatile sculptor Ralph Le Saint. When pianist Paul Lockridge arrives from Paris, he begs Peggy to run away with him to France, where they can share adventure and a full life -- but complications arise for Peggy when Gibson''s attractive daughter visits.', 'Zeigfeld Follies beauty Peggy marries an older man, C. Morton Gibson. Although she soon grows tired of their sedate life, she refuses the attentions of her longtime friend, the volatile sculptor Ralph Le Saint. When pianist Paul Lockridge arrives from Paris, he begs Peggy to run away with him to France, where they can share adventure and a full life -- but complications arise for Peggy when Gibson''s attractive daughter visits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn86T2ci2R0l61teZMcCDCQSMyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166010'),
  ('723457252552727824', 'Laughter and Grief by the White Sea', 1987, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Leonid Nosyrev', 'Leonid Nosyrev, Yuriy Koval', 'Evgeni Leonov, Klara Rumyanova, Mariya Vinogradova, Anatoliy Barantsev, Yuri Volyntsev, Boris Novikov, Tatyana Vasileva, Kira Smirnova', null, 'A celebration of the culture of the Pomors who live around the White Sea.', 'A celebration of the culture of the Pomors who live around the White Sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A49fyoCb99BzUPWu5P6MoyyX9ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245010'),
  ('309604944770326446', 'Laughter and Punishment', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Isabelle Doval, Denis Rouden', 'Olivier Dague, Isabelle Doval, Jean-François Halin', 'José Garcia, Laurent Lucas, Philippe Uchan, Isabelle Doval, Benoît Poelvoorde, Delphine Bibet, Bénédicte Charpiat, Véronique Picciotto', null, 'French director Isabelle Doval directs her husband, popular comedic actor José Garcia, in the comedy Rire et Chatiment (Laughter and Punishment). Vincent (Garcia) is a popular physician whose aggressive need to be funny and get people''s attention annoys his girlfriend, Camille (Doval), to the point that she leaves him. He begins to suspect she might have been onto something when his behavior begins causing people to die.', 'French director Isabelle Doval directs her husband, popular comedic actor José Garcia, in the comedy Rire et Chatiment (Laughter and Punishment). Vincent (Garcia) is a popular physician whose aggressive need to be funny and get people''s attention annoys his girlfriend, Camille (Doval), to the point that she leaves him. He begins to suspect she might have been onto something when his behavior begins causing people to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNr8aZLcyyqz4Kwl4NSQlEXtenX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18295'),
  ('346489936130985976', 'Laughter in Paradise', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Mario Zampi, William McLeod, Gordon Scott', 'Michael Pertwee, Jack Davies', 'Alastair Sim, Fay Compton, Beatrice Campbell, Guy Middleton, George Cole, A.E. Matthews, Joyce Grenfell, Anthony Steel', 'NR', 'When an eccentric practical joker dies, he divides his fortune among four heirs. But before they can collect the cash they must each do something which goes completely against their nature. NB: This is the film which introduced Audrey Hepburn.', 'When an eccentric practical joker dies, he divides his fortune among four heirs. But before they can collect the cash they must each do something which goes completely against their nature. NB: This is the film which introduced Audrey Hepburn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9l8NmkbfL0lN0fC6ZqADGxHv1yo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81724'),
  ('727299434510340555', 'Laura', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Hamilton, Bernard Daillencourt', 'David Hamilton', 'Maud Adams, Dawn Dunlap, James Mitchell, Maureen Kerwin, Anja Schüte, Pierre Londiche, Thierry Redler, Louise Vincent', 'R', 'A blinded French sculptor completes a statue of a friend''s daughter by using his sense of touch.', 'A blinded French sculptor completes a statue of a friend''s daughter by using his sense of touch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMe9eKcaOXNLGkM01KAB4sGpKfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54145'),
