  ('1013806363926243264', 'Laura Hasn''t Slept', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Daniel Clarke, Parker Finn', 'Parker Finn', 'Caitlin Stasey, Lew Temple', null, 'Desperate to rid herself of a recurring nightmare, a young woman seeks the help of her therapist.', 'Desperate to rid herself of a recurring nightmare, a young woman seeks the help of her therapist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IhmHyVaN3wWE806o7VpvjgyFU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689397'),
  ('219112853225420339', 'Laura is Alone', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Conrad Son', 'Conrad Son', 'Dora Venter, Conrad Son, Black Widow, Christina Bella', null, 'Laura is a young and independent girl who is trying to find her way between two men.', 'Laura is a young and independent girl who is trying to find her way between two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fer4h6hmdb5FskhBOPbJY576sjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247659'),
  ('593781002533347205', 'Laura Laune - Le Diable est une gentille petite fille', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Adam', null, 'Laura Laune', null, 'Laura, this young and pretty blonde with the face of such an innocent angel arrives on stage ... What does she have in store for you? Laura Laune has no limits, she dares everything! In a stripping black humor and a total irreverence, the angelic madness of Laura Laune and her characters full of paradoxes gives you chills: is she innocent or mean? Aware of his words or just crazy to link? From a nursery rhyme that goes into a spin, characters of seemingly imperceptible madness, the show has many surprises in store for you. Sheltered under his air of a little fair-haired girl, the Belgian humorist, who caused a sensation by winning all the prizes of the humor festivals of the last two years, uncompromisingly tackles the most difficult themes: maternity, education, parenthood , abuse, homosexuality, racism, homophobia, and many others. With Laura Laune, you will discover the monsters hiding in the closet!', 'Laura, this young and pretty blonde with the face of such an innocent angel arrives on stage ... What does she have in store for you? Laura Laune has no limits, she dares everything! In a stripping black humor and a total irreverence, the angelic madness of Laura Laune and her characters full of paradoxes gives you chills: is she innocent or mean? Aware of his words or just crazy to link? From a nursery rhyme that goes into a spin, characters of seemingly imperceptible madness, the show has many surprises in store for you. Sheltered under his air of a little fair-haired girl, the Belgian humorist, who caused a sensation by winning all the prizes of the humor festivals of the last two years, uncompromisingly tackles the most difficult themes: maternity, education, parenthood , abuse, homosexuality, racism, homophobia, and many others. With Laura Laune, you will discover the monsters hiding in the closet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp5hb0RQIPi55qxvPuetU2veBdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700446'),
  ('456363510382274245', 'Laura Pausini – Pleased to Meet You', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ivan Cotroneo', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Monica Rametta, Laura Pausini', 'Laura Pausini, Paolo Carta, Paola Carta, Fabrizio Pausini, Gianna Ballardini Pausini, Silvia Pausini, Lorena Xella, Erica Ricciardelli', null, 'It''s the movie that retraces the Laura’s life in a wholly original way. Through never-seen-before footage of her real and fictional life, the artist shows us her essence, giving an honest and bold analysis of her life and how it could have been without that victory at Sanremo that, in 1993, changed her destiny forever.', 'It''s the movie that retraces the Laura’s life in a wholly original way. Through never-seen-before footage of her real and fictional life, the artist shows us her essence, giving an honest and bold analysis of her life and how it could have been without that victory at Sanremo that, in 1993, changed her destiny forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56ozpF0MLHCpmXiCQoCu2ruFsvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852664'),
  ('288704368591292640', 'Laura''s Star', 2004, 'Animation, Family', 'Piet De Rycker, Thilo Rothkirch', 'Rolf Giesen, Thilo Rothkirch', 'Céline Vogt, Sandro Iannotta, Maximilian Artajo, Brit Gülland, Heinrich Schafmeister, Mirco Nontschew, Martin Reinl, Eva Mattes', null, 'Laura sees a shooting star falling to earth and finds it in a park, down on the floor and with a broken point. The star is a living being, and Laura takes her home to reattach its point with a band-aid. The little star has special powers and can make people fly, or bring inanimate objects to life. But the more she stays on Earth, the weaker she becomes and her colors fade away and her powers start to fail. Laura must find a way to send the little star back into outer space.', 'Laura sees a shooting star falling to earth and finds it in a park, down on the floor and with a broken point. The star is a living being, and Laura takes her home to reattach its point with a band-aid. The little star has special powers and can make people fly, or bring inanimate objects to life. But the more she stays on Earth, the weaker she becomes and her colors fade away and her powers start to fail. Laura must find a way to send the little star back into outer space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unNN6JJCghbDOMn3plonB6YsjnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12697'),
  ('213008962198368502', 'Laura''s Star', 2021, 'Family', 'Daniela Knapp, Joya Thome', 'Joya Thome, Claudia Seibl', 'Emilia Kowalski, Michel Johann Koch, Luise Heyer, Ludwig Trepte, Nicholas Bodeux, Ceci Chuh, Felix Nölle, Jonas May', null, 'A new chapter begins for Laura: Together with her parents and her brother Tommy, she moves to a new home. But at first the girl can''t really get used to the new city and has difficulties making friends and socializing. One evening she watches a star fall from the sky. Laura rushes to the injured star''s aid and takes care of him. The two become friends and the star takes Laura on many exciting adventures.', 'A new chapter begins for Laura: Together with her parents and her brother Tommy, she moves to a new home. But at first the girl can''t really get used to the new city and has difficulties making friends and socializing. One evening she watches a star fall from the sky. Laura rushes to the injured star''s aid and takes care of him. The two become friends and the star takes Laura on many exciting adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8IzZpK8LZggHRMQ1xUhDca0XWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:903746'),
  ('1114900921877590129', 'Laure', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli, Louis-Jacques Rollet-Andriane, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Ovidio G. Assonitis, Louis-Jacques Rollet-Andriane, Sonia Molteni', 'Annie Belle, Emmanuelle Arsan, Al Cliver, Orso Maria Guerrini, Pierre Haudebourg, Michele Starck, Lloyd Nelson, Sylvio Simonelli', null, 'At an institute in Manila, researchers and eco-tourists trade stories about the Mara tribe, who live on a remote island and have an annual festival of rebirth in which some of the tribe forget who they are and begin again. Laure is the daughter of the institute''s director; she''s a free spirit who has captured the fancy of Nicola, a European photographer. After a courtship in which the voyeuristic Nick indulges Laure''s exhibitionism and sexual freedom, they set off for Mara land with Gualtier, an anthropologist, and his philosophical lover, Myrte. As they approach the Mara on the night of rebirth, who of the group will actually join the tribe to begin life anew?', 'At an institute in Manila, researchers and eco-tourists trade stories about the Mara tribe, who live on a remote island and have an annual festival of rebirth in which some of the tribe forget who they are and begin again. Laure is the daughter of the institute''s director; she''s a free spirit who has captured the fancy of Nicola, a European photographer. After a courtship in which the voyeuristic Nick indulges Laure''s exhibitionism and sexual freedom, they set off for Mara land with Gualtier, an anthropologist, and his philosophical lover, Myrte. As they approach the Mara on the night of rebirth, who of the group will actually join the tribe to begin life anew?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qM9hb8Tx0jEMlF9KRLWJ3vi9IBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118210'),
  ('75108362091042612', 'Laurel & Hardy: Their Lives and Magic', 2011, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Andreas Baum, Philip Bienmüller, Stephan Thoene', 'Andreas Baum', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Frank Glaubrecht, Booth Colman, Chuck McCann, Jerry Lewis, Marcel Marceau, Hal Roach', null, 'The lives of Stan Laurel (1890-1965) and Oliver Hardy (1892-1957), on the screen and behind the curtain. The joy and the sadness, the success and the failure. The story of one of the best comic duos of all time: a lesson on how to make people laugh.', 'The lives of Stan Laurel (1890-1965) and Oliver Hardy (1892-1957), on the screen and behind the curtain. The joy and the sadness, the success and the failure. The story of one of the best comic duos of all time: a lesson on how to make people laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtukQwqBoSi1kic9Xgkz19CFGOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252611'),
  ('179697488253397762', 'Laurel Canyon', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wally Pfister, Lisa Cholodenko, David McGiffert', 'Lisa Cholodenko', 'Frances McDormand, Christian Bale, Kate Beckinsale, Natascha McElhone, Alessandro Nivola, Lou Barlow, Russell Pollard, Imaad Wasif', 'R', 'When an uptight young man and his fiancée move into his libertine mother''s house, the resulting clash of life attitudes shakes everyone up.', 'When an uptight young man and his fiancée move into his libertine mother''s house, the resulting clash of life attitudes shakes everyone up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7knajZv3nxqN0o2Jq8kIOkpgu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13819'),
  ('37062658959196443', 'Laurin', 1989, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Robert Sigl, Nyika Jancsó', 'Robert Sigl', 'Dóra Szinetár, Brigitte Karner, Károly Eperjes, Hédi Temessy, Barnabás Tóth, Kati Sír, Endre Kátay, János Derzsi', null, 'In a small port town at the end of the 19th century children are disappearing. A mysterious man in black who stalks the town may be Death itself. And nine-year-old Laurin is suffering terrifying dreams and hallucinations of a man carrying a sack and frightened children calling for help from behind closed windows.', 'In a small port town at the end of the 19th century children are disappearing. A mysterious man in black who stalks the town may be Death itself. And nine-year-old Laurin is suffering terrifying dreams and hallucinations of a man carrying a sack and frightened children calling for help from behind closed windows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rmse88RwfOiYNncUI3ngwWrg7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114349'),
  ('951297189736862392', 'Lausbubengeschichten', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Helmut Käutner', 'Kurt Heuser, Franz Seitz Junior', 'Hansi Kraus, Käthe Braun, Renate Kasché, Elisabeth Flickenschildt, Heidelinde Weis, Friedrich von Thun, Georg Thomalla, Harald Juhnke', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNC8uh832B9GDf6A8e6CRH36sDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71638'),
  ('872054819230548878', 'Lautrec', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roger Planchon, Gérard Simon', 'Roger Planchon', 'Régis Royer, Elsa Zylberstein, Anémone, Claude Rich, Hélène Babu, Claire Borotra, Alex Pandev, Amanda Rubinstein', null, 'The life of Henri de Toulouse Lautrec, famous french painter, who lived, enjoyed, loved in the late 1800s Paris'' Montmartre cultural life. He suffered from suffered from congenital health conditions traditionally attributed to inbreeding. His lifestyle and work are a testimony of the late-19th-century parisian bohemian lifestyle, as he was commissioned to produce a series of posters for the Moulin Rouge cabaret opening. As an alcoholic, he was addicted to absinthe. The movie related his love affair with the french painter Suzanne Valadon.', 'The life of Henri de Toulouse Lautrec, famous french painter, who lived, enjoyed, loved in the late 1800s Paris'' Montmartre cultural life. He suffered from suffered from congenital health conditions traditionally attributed to inbreeding. His lifestyle and work are a testimony of the late-19th-century parisian bohemian lifestyle, as he was commissioned to produce a series of posters for the Moulin Rouge cabaret opening. As an alcoholic, he was addicted to absinthe. The movie related his love affair with the french painter Suzanne Valadon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyT1BkYdxHsCdnWhVvnTmHq89S9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136646'),
  ('278950328416233899', 'Lava', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Tadeusz Konwicki, Piotr Sobociński, Krystyna Krupska-Wysocka', 'Tadeusz Konwicki', 'Gustaw Holoubek, Jolanta Piętek-Górecka, Artur Żmijewski, Teresa Budzisz-Krzyżanowska, Maja Komorowska, Grażyna Szapołowska, Henryk Bista, Piotr Fronczewski', null, 'On the eve of the Day of the Dead, among mysterious old rituals of the Vilnius region, ghosts of the past and present start to appear.', 'On the eve of the Day of the Dead, among mysterious old rituals of the Vilnius region, ghosts of the past and present start to appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xAxLU0aiesAKkQOHFgKN1P9qDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377689'),
  ('82579074786356241', 'Lava', 2015, 'Animation, Family', 'James Ford Murphy, Bill Watral', 'James Ford Murphy', 'Napua Greig, Kuana Torres Kahele', 'G', 'Inspired by the isolated beauty of tropical islands and the explosive allure of ocean volcanoes, Lava is a musical love story that takes place over millions of years.', 'Inspired by the isolated beauty of tropical islands and the explosive allure of ocean volcanoes, Lava is a musical love story that takes place over millions of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HI4rM3ewc26yTUfCV0IT0k3wJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286192'),
  ('219817648106331611', 'Lava Storm', 2008, 'Action, TV Movie', 'Sean Dwyer, Robert Mattigetz', 'Bill Hoffman', 'Ian Ziering, Valérie Valois, Vlasta Vrana, Nicole Maillet, Adrien Dixon', null, 'Lori and John Wilson, employees of an emergency response center, must find a way to survive the initial lava storms, to save John''s father and their two teenage children. Even more importantly, they must find a way to slow the path of the lava storms, to give humankind the time to find a solution to this natural disaster, in order to save humanity and our Earth.', 'Lori and John Wilson, employees of an emergency response center, must find a way to survive the initial lava storms, to save John''s father and their two teenage children. Even more importantly, they must find a way to slow the path of the lava storms, to give humankind the time to find a solution to this natural disaster, in order to save humanity and our Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8e0N2QpDNDOyHhZOVcaH32BCx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32896'),
  ('404863678513669375', 'Lavalantula', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mike Mendez, Richard J. Vialet, Josh Long', 'Neil Elman, Ashley O''Neil, Mike Mendez', 'Steve Guttenberg, Nia Peeples, Patrick Renna, Carlos Bernard, Michael Winslow, Marion Ramsey, Leslie Easterbrook, Ralph Garman', null, 'Giant lava breathing tarantulas – Lavalantulas – erupt out of ancient volcanos in the Santa Monica Mountains, raining death and destruction upon Los Angeles. With the City of Angels on the verge of incineration, only a washed up ‘90s action hero actor stands in the way of this monstrous swarm of bloodthirsty creatures who burn their victims alive.', 'Giant lava breathing tarantulas – Lavalantulas – erupt out of ancient volcanos in the Santa Monica Mountains, raining death and destruction upon Los Angeles. With the City of Angels on the verge of incineration, only a washed up ‘90s action hero actor stands in the way of this monstrous swarm of bloodthirsty creatures who burn their victims alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOcUwBJ2eOekwqBtJZncnrshtos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294562'),
  ('376860601042655425', 'Lavatory Lovestory', 2006, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy', 'Konstantin Bronzit', 'Konstantin Bronzit', null, null, 'A single middle aged lady working as receptionist and cleaner in a public lavatory for men spends her time between chores reading "Happy Woman" and daydreaming about a loving partner. When an unknown man starts leaving flowers at her desk, she gets excited but also increasingly stressed out trying to figure out who is her secret admirer or, perhaps, the prankster.', 'A single middle aged lady working as receptionist and cleaner in a public lavatory for men spends her time between chores reading "Happy Woman" and daydreaming about a loving partner. When an unknown man starts leaving flowers at her desk, she gets excited but also increasingly stressed out trying to figure out who is her secret admirer or, perhaps, the prankster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dZoGhKwkto6kPonvC2HeG0BfMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149117'),
  ('935473515829879178', 'Lavender', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ed Gass-Donnelly, Brendan Steacy', 'Ed Gass-Donnelly, Colin Frizzell', 'Abbie Cornish, Dermot Mulroney, Diego Klattenhoff, Justin Long, Peyton Kennedy, Lola Flanery, Sarah Abbott, Mackenzie Muldoon', 'NR', 'A photographer struggling with memory loss discovers her pictures may indicate something sinister is hitting close to home.', 'A photographer struggling with memory loss discovers her pictures may indicate something sinister is hitting close to home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAPvkv0XTeLFqlvMgtlFB8mqk3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340584'),
  ('645276360807049840', 'Lavoreremo da grandi', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Albanese, Italo Petriccione', 'Antonio Albanese, Piero Guerrera', 'Antonio Albanese, Giuseppe Battiston, Nicola Rignanese, Niccolò Ferrero, Alessandro Egger, Chiara Pazzaglia, Claudia Stecher, Francesco Brandi', null, 'Three friends, Beppe, Umberto, and Gigi, await the arrival of young Toni to celebrate his newfound freedom. After an evening of heavy drinking at the village bar, the car they''re about to drive home in hits something. Or rather, someone. Setting off a series of relentless bad decisions, the four flee and take refuge at Umberto''s house. It will be a long night of plot twists, paradoxical and ridiculous situations, encounters and clashes between the protagonists and other improbable figures who populate that interminable day. Until the most unimaginable of solutions arrives at first light.', 'Three friends, Beppe, Umberto, and Gigi, await the arrival of young Toni to celebrate his newfound freedom. After an evening of heavy drinking at the village bar, the car they''re about to drive home in hits something. Or rather, someone. Setting off a series of relentless bad decisions, the four flee and take refuge at Umberto''s house. It will be a long night of plot twists, paradoxical and ridiculous situations, encounters and clashes between the protagonists and other improbable figures who populate that interminable day. Until the most unimaginable of solutions arrives at first light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73rycpKhykMonuXJxigc0LHMlVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1493021'),
  ('961722731904422155', 'Law Abiding Citizen', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'F. Gary Gray, Jonathan Sela', 'Kurt Wimmer', 'Jamie Foxx, Gerard Butler, Colm Meaney, Bruce McGill, Leslie Bibb, Michael Irby, Gregory Itzin, Regina Hall', 'R', 'A frustrated man decides to take justice into his own hands after a plea bargain sets one of his family''s killers free. He targets not only the killer but also the district attorney and others involved in the deal.', 'A frustrated man decides to take justice into his own hands after a plea bargain sets one of his family''s killers free. He targets not only the killer but also the district attorney and others involved in the deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcEXcip7v0O1ndV4VUdFqJSqbOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22803'),
  ('573862439416083734', 'Law and Disorder', 1974, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Hopkins, Ivan Passer, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Kenneth Harris Fishman, Ivan Passer, William Richert', 'Carroll O''Connor, Ernest Borgnine, Karen Black, Ann Wedgeworth, Anita Dangler, Leslie Ackerman, Jack Kehoe, David Spielberg', null, 'In crime ridden New York of the seventies two cops have had enough and decide to take justice into their own hands. Things turn exciting and humorous as no hoodlum goes safe.', 'In crime ridden New York of the seventies two cops have had enough and decide to take justice into their own hands. Things turn exciting and humorous as no hoodlum goes safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCcfN723l9RQ324tJK6Ac8kSsHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119532'),
  ('16219409401557696', 'Law and Order', 1953, 'Western', 'Nathan Juran, Clifford Stine, Joseph Gershenson', 'Gwen Bagni, D.D. Beauchamp, John Bagni', 'Ronald Reagan, Dorothy Malone, Preston Foster, Alex Nicol, Ruth Hampton, Russell Johnson, Barry Kelley, Chubby Johnson', 'NR', 'Frame Johnson''s attempt to settle down in Tombstone is interrupted when a mob tries to mete out some frontier justice.', 'Frame Johnson''s attempt to settle down in Tombstone is interrupted when a mob tries to mete out some frontier justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oG3Gf8Olc4NgKRVqB09yuwHNEOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93562'),
  ('669904969322194586', 'Law and Order', 1969, 'Documentary', 'William Brayne, Frederick Wiseman', 'Frederick Wiseman', 'Richard Nixon', null, 'LAW & ORDER surveys the wide range of work the police are asked to perform: enforcing the law, maintaining order, and providing general social services. The incidents shown illustrate how training, community expectations, socio-economic status of the subject, the threat of violence, and discretion affect police behavior.', 'LAW & ORDER surveys the wide range of work the police are asked to perform: enforcing the law, maintaining order, and providing general social services. The incidents shown illustrate how training, community expectations, socio-economic status of the subject, the threat of violence, and discretion affect police behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0l8Yyb5H2U3NCeoCjnpVCX8dEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114116'),
  ('1057738523850374141', 'Law Breakers', 1971, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marcel Carné, Jean Badal, Antoine Jacquet', 'Marcel Carné, Paul Andréota', 'Jacques Brel, Catherine Rouvel, Paola Pitagora, Charles Denner, François Cadet, Roland Lesaffre, Françoise Giret, Didier Haudepin', null, 'A judge investigating police corruption finds that the deeper he digs, the more roadblocks he finds.', 'A judge investigating police corruption finds that the deeper he digs, the more roadblocks he finds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNzWGWBdsbCd4fAT9dTu8fZY1Ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4386'),
  ('820068108105765565', 'Law of Courage', 1994, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Alessandro Di Robilant, David Scott, Beatrice Banfi', 'Ugo Pirro, Andrea Purgatori, Alessandro Di Robilant', 'Giulio Scarpati, Sabrina Ferilli, Leopoldo Trieste, Regina Bianchi, Paolo De Vita, Renato Carpentieri, Ileana Riganò, Marcello Perracchio', null, 'The true story of Rosario Livatino, a young judge in Sicily in the early 1980s, who have been nicknamed ''The Boy Judge'' from the President of the Republic. He''s strictly incorruptible, working hard and refusing even to shake hands with suspects. He then starts a number of investigations that lead him to touch the mafia power in the area, and then to personal war with the hidden organization.', 'The true story of Rosario Livatino, a young judge in Sicily in the early 1980s, who have been nicknamed ''The Boy Judge'' from the President of the Republic. He''s strictly incorruptible, working hard and refusing even to shake hands with suspects. He then starts a number of investigations that lead him to touch the mafia power in the area, and then to personal war with the hidden organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zW89l7lfflbWtUrz3zfXN1JyibS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69467'),
  ('760263121157377929', 'Law of Tehran', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Saeed Roustaee, Hooman Behmanesh', 'Saeed Roustaee', 'Payman Maadi, Navid Mohammadzadeh, Parinaz Izadyar, Farhad Aslani, Houman Kiai, Maziar Seyedi, Ali Bagheri, Marjan Ghamari', 'NR', 'Samad is nobody’s fool. The narcotics officer has seen his share of a drug dealer’s lies and games, and his patience has come to run thin. While searching for the infamous drug baron Nasser Khakzad, he and his colleague Hamid scour the streets of Tehran, turning an overcrowded prison on its head. With his rough and dubious approach, Samad finally manages to find the criminal’s whereabouts – but things do not quite go according to plan...', 'Samad is nobody’s fool. The narcotics officer has seen his share of a drug dealer’s lies and games, and his patience has come to run thin. While searching for the infamous drug baron Nasser Khakzad, he and his colleague Hamid scour the streets of Tehran, turning an overcrowded prison on its head. With his rough and dubious approach, Samad finally manages to find the criminal’s whereabouts – but things do not quite go according to plan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujNhy2Vu7S1FHuwePMIYMkIbGTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583794'),
  ('1055918371052374545', 'Law of the Border', 1966, 'Crime, Drama', 'Çetin İnanç, Lütfi Akad, Ali Uğur', 'Lütfi Akad, Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney, Pervin Par, Erol Taş, Tuncel Kurtiz, Tuncer Necmioğlu, Muharrem Gürses, Aydemir Akbaş, Sırrı Elitaş', null, 'In Deliviran, a village near Urfa close to the Syrian border, Hidir’s chief is involved in smuggling and gets shot. Hidir tries to stay out of illegal activities but circumstances contrive to push him in the opposite direction until he accepts to take a herd of sheep across the border.', 'In Deliviran, a village near Urfa close to the Syrian border, Hidir’s chief is involved in smuggling and gets shot. Hidir tries to stay out of illegal activities but circumstances contrive to push him in the opposite direction until he accepts to take a herd of sheep across the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGpWiiHLH1ji1lRWC4kIXAZ2b3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197297'),
  ('686750381308414536', 'Law of the Lash', 1947, 'Western', 'Ray Taylor', 'William L. Nolte', 'Lash LaRue, Al St. John, Mary Scott, Jack O''Shea, Lee Roberts, Charles King, Carl Mathews, Matty Roubert', 'G', 'When Decker''s gang holds up a stage, henchman Lefty takes a lady''s rings. Later lefty accidentally exposes the rings buying ammunition and Cheyenne sees them. When Lefty tries to shoot Cheyenne he is captured. Now Cheyenne wants the rest of the gang and their leader.', 'When Decker''s gang holds up a stage, henchman Lefty takes a lady''s rings. Later lefty accidentally exposes the rings buying ammunition and Cheyenne sees them. When Lefty tries to shoot Cheyenne he is captured. Now Cheyenne wants the rest of the gang and their leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZjZQc1SJ4nRV3wKI9KUTVJgpi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182306'),
  ('627083979589579902', 'Law of the North', 1939, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Louis Beydts, Jacques Feyder', 'Charles Spaak, Alexandre Arnoux, Charles Spaak', 'Michèle Morgan, Pierre Richard-Willm, Charles Vanel, Arlette Marchal, Jacques Terrane, Max Michel, Youcca Troubetzkov, Henri Guisol', null, 'Robert Shaw slaughters his wife''s lover and runs away with his secretary Jacqueline. Helped by a French trapper who takes them for film-makers, they hide in Northern Canada.', 'Robert Shaw slaughters his wife''s lover and runs away with his secretary Jacqueline. Helped by a French trapper who takes them for film-makers, they hide in Northern Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oN1Rb6s21HlSrCcrcfm2S6X0AWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463436'),
  ('693627019148331835', 'Lawless', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Western', 'John Hillcoat, Benoît Delhomme', 'Nick Cave', 'Shia LaBeouf, Tom Hardy, Gary Oldman, Guy Pearce, Jason Clarke, Jessica Chastain, Mia Wasikowska, Dane DeHaan', 'R', 'In 1931, the Bondurant brothers of Franklin County, Virginia, run a multipurpose backwoods establishment that hides their true business — bootlegging. Middle brother Forrest is the brain of the operation; older Howard is the brawn, and younger Jack, the lookout. Though the local police have taken bribes and left the brothers alone, a violent war erupts when a sadistic lawman from Chicago arrives and tries to shut down the Bondurants operation.', 'In 1931, the Bondurant brothers of Franklin County, Virginia, run a multipurpose backwoods establishment that hides their true business — bootlegging. Middle brother Forrest is the brain of the operation; older Howard is the brawn, and younger Jack, the lookout. Though the local police have taken bribes and left the brothers alone, a violent war erupts when a sadistic lawman from Chicago arrives and tries to shut down the Bondurants operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ahtzwts22ayviD3LEVslfL4nRWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82633'),
  ('64722428707328769', 'Lawless Range', 1935, 'Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, Archie Stout', 'Lindsley Parsons', 'John Wayne, Sheila Bromley, Frank McGlynn Jr., Jack Curtis, Yakima Canutt, Wally Howe, Julia Griffith, Earl Dwire', 'NR', 'John Middleton is investigating cattle rustling when he is captured and tossed into a cave with Emmett, a rancher who disappeared earlier. They help each other escape and learn that a local banker is trying to scare everyone away to grab up some secret gold mines.', 'John Middleton is investigating cattle rustling when he is captured and tossed into a cave with Emmett, a rancher who disappeared earlier. They help each other escape and learn that a local banker is trying to scare everyone away to grab up some secret gold mines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ekKjd1799h9AzwcFsQjxb7jS23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84908'),
  ('596298681128130142', 'Lawless Street', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Gibaud', 'Jean Halain, Albert Dubout, Marcel Gibaud', 'Louis de Funès, Paul Demange, Max Dalban, Nathalie Nattier, André Gabriello, Albert Dinan, Annette Poivre, Roger Desmare', null, 'The eccentric characters of a street from the comic designs of Andre Dubout are brought to life with human performers instead of drawings.', 'The eccentric characters of a street from the comic designs of Andre Dubout are brought to life with human performers instead of drawings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIzHZQG8rnZjfyCoXxtvFbPt0ms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172223'),
  ('192177306083038207', 'Lawman', 1971, 'Western', 'Michael Winner, Robert Paynter, Michael Dryhurst', 'Gerald Wilson', 'Burt Lancaster, Robert Ryan, Lee J. Cobb, Robert Duvall, Sheree North, Albert Salmi, Richard Jordan, John McGiver', 'R', 'While passing through the town of Bannock, a bunch of drunken cattlemen go overboard with their celebrating and accidentally kill an old man with a stray shot. They return home to Sabbath unaware of his death. Bannock lawman Jered Maddox later arrives there to arrest everyone involved on a charge of murder. Sabbath is run by land baron Vince Bronson, a benevolent despot, who, upon hearing of the death, offers restitution for the incident.', 'While passing through the town of Bannock, a bunch of drunken cattlemen go overboard with their celebrating and accidentally kill an old man with a stray shot. They return home to Sabbath unaware of his death. Bannock lawman Jered Maddox later arrives there to arrest everyone involved on a charge of murder. Sabbath is run by land baron Vince Bronson, a benevolent despot, who, upon hearing of the death, offers restitution for the incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88DTPi738IZD4epYGj58yCm3WTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42500'),
  ('1046344030543228748', 'Lawn Dogs', 1997, 'Drama', 'Elliot Davis, John Duigan, Michael Samson', 'Naomi Wallace', 'Sam Rockwell, Mischa Barton, Christopher McDonald, Kathleen Quinlan, Bruce McGill, David Barry Gray, Eric Mabius, Tom Aldredge', 'R', 'In the affluent, gated community of Camelot Gardens, bored wives indiscriminately sleep around while their unwitting husbands try desperately to climb the social ladder. Trent, a 21-year-old outsider who mows the neighborhood lawns, quietly observes the infidelities and hypocrisies of this overly privileged society. When Devon, a 10-year-old daughter from one family, forges a friendship with Trent, things suddenly get very complicated.', 'In the affluent, gated community of Camelot Gardens, bored wives indiscriminately sleep around while their unwitting husbands try desperately to climb the social ladder. Trent, a 21-year-old outsider who mows the neighborhood lawns, quietly observes the infidelities and hypocrisies of this overly privileged society. When Devon, a 10-year-old daughter from one family, forges a friendship with Trent, things suddenly get very complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNi2M5Z7GUEaSCPjt66yavLlsqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35796'),
  ('1106477251929945494', 'Lawnmower Man 2: Beyond Cyberspace', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Farhad Mann, Ward Russell, John J. Connor', 'Farhad Mann', 'Patrick Bergin, Matt Frewer, Austin O''Brien, Ely Pouget, Camille Cooper, Patrick LaBrecque, Crystal Celeste Grant, Sean P. Young', 'PG-13', 'After being rescued from the ruins of Virtual Space Industries, Jobe is rebuilt and reconnected to virtual reality by corporate mogul Jonathan Walker. Years later, teenage hacker Peter Parkette helps Jobe locate Benjamin Trace, the original creator of virtual reality, only to uncover Jobe’s plan to launch a new world order using Walker’s tech. Now, Peter, Trace, Cori, and a band of runaways must stop Jobe and Walker before they enslave humanity through cyberspace.', 'After being rescued from the ruins of Virtual Space Industries, Jobe is rebuilt and reconnected to virtual reality by corporate mogul Jonathan Walker. Years later, teenage hacker Peter Parkette helps Jobe locate Benjamin Trace, the original creator of virtual reality, only to uncover Jobe’s plan to launch a new world order using Walker’s tech. Now, Peter, Trace, Cori, and a band of runaways must stop Jobe and Walker before they enslave humanity through cyberspace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aP8eGsCyZVCHgSMxhDa4KiC7H9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11525'),
  ('594019189432453435', 'Lawrence of Arabia', 1962, 'Adventure, History, War', 'David Lean, Freddie Young, George Richardson', 'Michael Wilson, Robert Bolt', 'Peter O''Toole, Alec Guinness, Omar Sharif, Anthony Quinn, Jack Hawkins, José Ferrer, Anthony Quayle, Claude Rains', 'PG', 'During World War I, English officer Thomas Edward ''T.E.'' Lawrence sets out to unite and lead the diverse, often warring, Arab tribes to fight the Turks.', 'During World War I, English officer Thomas Edward ''T.E.'' Lawrence sets out to unite and lead the diverse, often warring, Arab tribes to fight the Turks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiAm0EtDvyGqNpVoieRw4u65vD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947'),
  ('1008020929879681744', 'Laws of Attraction', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adrian Biddle, Peter Howitt', 'Aline Brosh McKenna, Robert Harling', 'Pierce Brosnan, Julianne Moore, Michael Sheen, Parker Posey, Frances Fisher, Nora Dunn, Annika Pergament, Mike Doyle', 'PG-13', 'Amidst a sea of litigation, two New York City divorce lawyers find love.', 'Amidst a sea of litigation, two New York City divorce lawyers find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aqR0xwmK0mPOIVShDlT88Vo5W0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11141'),
  ('850630084565480567', 'Laws of Gravity', 1992, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nick Gomez, Jean de Segonzac, Bob Gosse', 'Nick Gomez', 'Peter Greene, Edie Falco, Adam Trese, Arabella Field, Paul Schulze, Saul Stein, Rick Groel, Anibal O. Lleras', 'R', 'The lives of two incompetent young men from Brooklyn spin out of control after a friend returns from Florida with guns to sell.', 'The lives of two incompetent young men from Brooklyn spin out of control after a friend returns from Florida with guns to sell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFN3C7flx1xj3dxGEAsSK7Uz7bB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1482'),
  ('905844795653784975', 'Lawyer Lawyer', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Cheung Man-Po', 'Wong Ho-Wa, Joe Ma Wai-Ho', 'Stephen Chow, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Nancy Lan Sai, Tats Lau Yee-Tat, Law Kar-Ying, Wyman Wong Wai-Man', null, 'Stephen Chow plays a selfish yet in some places kind hearted barrister who tricks his servant in doing things for his own benefit. Eric Kot playing the servant is misguided by what he thinks is love and leaves Chow vowing that he will never need Chow''s help again in life. Shortly afterwards Kot gets into some big trouble (due to be executed) with the British and calls on Chow for help. Chow tries to help his client, but is fish out of water when he has to fight this court room case according to western rules.', 'Stephen Chow plays a selfish yet in some places kind hearted barrister who tricks his servant in doing things for his own benefit. Eric Kot playing the servant is misguided by what he thinks is love and leaves Chow vowing that he will never need Chow''s help again in life. Shortly afterwards Kot gets into some big trouble (due to be executed) with the British and calls on Chow for help. Chow tries to help his client, but is fish out of water when he has to fight this court room case according to western rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc4mjHkvvOwJ4g5eMD7t1lxitvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45487'),
  ('159064813929118340', 'Lawyer Man', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'William Dieterle, Robert Kurrle, Rufus Le Maire', 'Rian James, James Seymour', 'William Powell, Joan Blondell, David Landau, Helen Vinson, Claire Dodd, Alan Dinehart, Allen Jenkins, Irving Bacon', 'NR', 'Idealistic attorney Anton Adam makes headlines when he successfully prosecutes a prominent New York City political party boss named Gilmurry. Adam''s sudden renown attracts the attention of high-profile legal eagle Granville Bentley, who asks Adam to become a partner in his law firm. But Adam''s rising career takes a nosedive when he''s framed by corrupt Dr. Gresham and a sexy actress in a trumped-up breach of promise suit. The only constant in Adam''s life is the loyalty and unrequited love of his secretary Olga.', 'Idealistic attorney Anton Adam makes headlines when he successfully prosecutes a prominent New York City political party boss named Gilmurry. Adam''s sudden renown attracts the attention of high-profile legal eagle Granville Bentley, who asks Adam to become a partner in his law firm. But Adam''s rising career takes a nosedive when he''s framed by corrupt Dr. Gresham and a sexy actress in a trumped-up breach of promise suit. The only constant in Adam''s life is the loyalty and unrequited love of his secretary Olga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDUAwsAxEPjiS846E38EZ9ZOaS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126922'),
  ('391860752909643117', 'Laxmii', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Raghava Lawrence, Balakrishnan Thevar, Mohanjeet Kalsi', 'Raghava Lawrence, Sparsh Khetarpal, Tasha Bhambra', 'Akshay Kumar, Kiara Advani, Ayesha Raza Mishra, Manu Rishi Chadha, Ashwini Kalsekar, Rajesh Sharma, Sharad Kelkar, Tarun Arora', null, 'Aasif''s belief in logic and science shatters when he gets possessed by a transgender''s ghost.', 'Aasif''s belief in logic and science shatters when he gets possessed by a transgender''s ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6COHwokEERAjjvlmNF44Xg9BK1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603673'),
