  ('578762168482864813', 'Layer Cake', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Matthew Vaughn, Ben Davis, Michael Elliott', 'J.J. Connolly', 'Daniel Craig, Sienna Miller, Tom Hardy, Colm Meaney, George Harris, Sally Hawkins, Kenneth Cranham, Jamie Foreman', 'R', 'When a seemingly straight-forward drug deal goes awry, XXXX has to break his die-hard rules and turn up the heat, not only to outwit the old regime and come out on top, but to save his own skin...', 'When a seemingly straight-forward drug deal goes awry, XXXX has to break his die-hard rules and turn up the heat, not only to outwit the old regime and come out on top, but to save his own skin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDOxXteqxALBaSa3V3zTjGJuyWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4836'),
  ('645238427006889672', 'Laz Kit', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Zeki Akinci, Yusuf Atici', 'Aziz Özuysal', 'Tuğba Özay, Çilgin Sedat, Sinan Bengier, Ahmet Çevik, Esra Sönmezer, Dost Elver', null, 'When Kalemiti Ceyn arrives in a small village from America, she faces unexpected circumstances. The young woman, who goes to the field, is attacked by men there. Kalemiti Ceyn, who escapes from the men chasing her, is rescued by Deli Kadir, who witnesses the situation when she arrives at the village square. However, what happens will not end there.', 'When Kalemiti Ceyn arrives in a small village from America, she faces unexpected circumstances. The young woman, who goes to the field, is attacked by men there. Kalemiti Ceyn, who escapes from the men chasing her, is rescued by Deli Kadir, who witnesses the situation when she arrives at the village square. However, what happens will not end there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0yFg2XIEPUy3qig3hhyIvRhhFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674384'),
  ('276841746283535452', 'Lazareth', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Martim Vian, Alec Tibaldi', 'Alec Tibaldi', 'Ashley Judd, Sarah Pidgeon, Katie Douglas, Asher Angel, Edward Balaban, Christine Uhebe, Kyla Brown, Eddie Lee Wollrabe', null, 'Lee is an aunt whose life mission is to protect her orphaned nieces, Imogen and Maeve, from a self-destructing world, raising them in isolation until an outsider threatens their peaceful existence.', 'Lee is an aunt whose life mission is to protect her orphaned nieces, Imogen and Maeve, from a self-destructing world, raising them in isolation until an outsider threatens their peaceful existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36o8ancoKDKW1sstzMi0YYkQkpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1123278'),
  ('1009870774330967569', 'Lazarus: The Awakening', 2026, 'Action, Fantasy, Crime', 'Art Camacho, Adam Biddle, Jackson Dukes', 'Sean Riggs, Anubis Heru, Caroline Roschman, Andrew Stevens', 'R. Marcos Taylor, Courtney Grace, Britton Webb, Gem Marc Collins, Lenita Harris', 'Not Rated', 'A vigilante resurrected from death hunts a drug empire in Jackson, clashing with a kingpin, a reporter, and a city consumed by fentanyl. Justice becomes war.', 'A vigilante resurrected from death hunts a drug empire in Jackson, clashing with a kingpin, a reporter, and a city consumed by fentanyl. Justice becomes war.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F1%2Fgracenote%2F17e8e914b0b7664c73e0db68277e217e.jpg', 'plex:movie:lazarus-the-awakening'),
  ('816233243279687869', 'Lazer Team', 2016, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Matt Hullum, Philip Roy', 'Burnie Burns, Chris Demarais, Josh Flanagan', 'Burnie Burns, Gavin Free, Michael Jones, Colton Dunn, Alexandria DeBerry, Alan Ritchson, Steve Shearer, Kirk C. Johnson', 'PG-13', 'Four losers are thrust into the position of saving the world when they stumble upon a UFO crash site and become genetically equipped to the battle suit on board.', 'Four losers are thrust into the position of saving the world when they stumble upon a UFO crash site and become genetically equipped to the battle suit on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obySpAUFzBBhP86miJnreeGUEtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279096'),
  ('168257658182891405', 'Lazy Eye', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Tim Kirkman, Gabe Mayhan', 'Tim Kirkman', 'Lucas Near-Verbrugghe, Aaron Costa Ganis, Michaela Watkins, Harrison Givens, Debbie Jaffe, Drew Barr, Simon Petrie, Michael Rubenstone', 'NR', 'Passions reignite and hidden secrets revealed when a graphic designer in Los Angeles reconnects with an ex-lover he hasn’t seen or heard from in 15 years. Over the course of a weekend at a vacation house in the desert, they must determine whether or not they have a future together.', 'Passions reignite and hidden secrets revealed when a graphic designer in Los Angeles reconnects with an ex-lover he hasn’t seen or heard from in 15 years. Over the course of a weekend at a vacation house in the desert, they must determine whether or not they have a future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PMqXRm4ICv4JeSBMQP84fNlw7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399417'),
  ('448091804436023669', 'Lazy like a dog', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Stefanos Fotiadis, Stamatis Vlassis', 'Stefanos Fotiadis', 'Dimitris Papamichael, Mairi Hronopoulou, Vasilis Avlonitis, Niki Linardou, Nikos Vastardis, Despo Diamantidou, Lavrentis Dianellos, Alekos Livaditis', null, 'A lazy and wasteful slacker who enjoys living off his hard-working brother reluctantly accepts to work as a debt collector. Now, he is in love, and for once in his life, he is good at something. Can the boss'' daughter straighten him out?', 'A lazy and wasteful slacker who enjoys living off his hard-working brother reluctantly accepts to work as a debt collector. Now, he is in love, and for once in his life, he is good at something. Can the boss'' daughter straighten him out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrxj18cyZU7Ye9BVhqDtO0s3hkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332416'),
  ('584253608753772421', 'Lazybones', 1925, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Frank Borzage, Glen MacWilliams, George Schneiderman', 'Frances Marion', 'Madge Bellamy, Buck Jones, Zasu Pitts, Leslie Fenton, Jane Novak, Virginia Marshall, Edythe Chapman, Emily Fitzroy', null, 'Steve Tuttle, the titular lazybones, takes on the responsibility of raising a fatherless girl, causing a scandal in his small town. Many years later, having returned from World War I, he discovers that he loves the grown-up girl.', 'Steve Tuttle, the titular lazybones, takes on the responsibility of raising a fatherless girl, causing a scandal in his small town. Many years later, having returned from World War I, he discovers that he loves the grown-up girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/extnbHDYv62gVgdkLklfvHd6C8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44439'),
  ('79328369182020668', 'LBJ', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Santiago Álvarez, Pepin Rodriguez, Alberto Hernández', null, 'Lyndon B. Johnson, Martin Luther King Jr., Kwame Ture', null, 'This is a montage of different images from the JFK, Martin Luther King and Bobby Kennedy triumphs and assassinations, all three events being observed by Lyndon Johnson as the dark figure who is plotting the anti-black rights movement.', 'This is a montage of different images from the JFK, Martin Luther King and Bobby Kennedy triumphs and assassinations, all three events being observed by Lyndon Johnson as the dark figure who is plotting the anti-black rights movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxebOalvCQV8Xezo4RCTTE4ycXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146661'),
