  ('373866665198791037', 'LD 50 Lethal Dose', 2003, 'Horror', 'Simon De Selva, Robin Vidgeon', 'Matthew McGuchan', 'Katharine Towne, Mel B, Tom Hardy, Ross McCall, Toby Fisher, Leo Bill, Philip Winchester, Stephen Lord', null, 'Re-formed by a coded message to their web site, a group of animal rights activists set off to free an imprisoned colleague from a terrifying ordeal. Their rescue mission leads them to a disused lab, but what should have been a simple raid turns into a series of twisted and mind bending incidents where the free and the caged switch places, in this tormented psychological horror.', 'Re-formed by a coded message to their web site, a group of animal rights activists set off to free an imprisoned colleague from a terrifying ordeal. Their rescue mission leads them to a disused lab, but what should have been a simple raid turns into a series of twisted and mind bending incidents where the free and the caged switch places, in this tormented psychological horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0OAj6Bb5HtNPQBEMBJyqVSYqgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15473'),
  ('275632695970584000', 'Le acrobate', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Silvio Soldini, Luca Bigazzi', 'Doriana Leondeff, Silvio Soldini', 'Valeria Golino, Licia Maglietta, Mira Sardoč, Angela Marraffa, Manrico Gammarota, Teresa Saponangelo, Maria Consagra, Nicoletta Maragno', null, 'A chemical analyst and a supermarket clerk strike up a friendship after they are brought together by the death of an elderly woman.', 'A chemical analyst and a supermarket clerk strike up a friendship after they are brought together by the death of an elderly woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzl3mrgQZ6SayXWXlLPP8tP0r6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56842'),
  ('679220477593898700', 'Le ali della vita', 2000, null, 'Stefano Reali', null, 'Sabrina Ferilli, Virna Lisi, Tobias Hoesl, Marisa Merlini', null, 'The end of the 1950s: Rosanna returns as a music teacher to the claustrophobic confines of the convent boarding school from which she escaped as a young girl. Her happy, understanding ways, unconventional teaching methods and deep love of music soon win her the hearts of her girl pupils. Vithold, a nice young doctor, is also fascinated by Rosanna and gradually manages to convince her of his deep feelings for her. Rosanna encounters rejection and hatred from Alberta, the Mother Superior, who has a deep belief in strict discipline and order, as well as from her close associate Sister Federica, who is severe to the point of inhumanity.', 'The end of the 1950s: Rosanna returns as a music teacher to the claustrophobic confines of the convent boarding school from which she escaped as a young girl. Her happy, understanding ways, unconventional teaching methods and deep love of music soon win her the hearts of her girl pupils. Vithold, a nice young doctor, is also fascinated by Rosanna and gradually manages to convince her of his deep feelings for her. Rosanna encounters rejection and hatred from Alberta, the Mother Superior, who has a deep belief in strict discipline and order, as well as from her close associate Sister Federica, who is severe to the point of inhumanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30H9vIvjvXhAtHMkQbRJwkXHW2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186137'),
