  ('653803082312268708', 'Le Choc', 1982, 'Crime, Action, Romance', 'Robin Davis, Pierre-William Glenn', null, 'Alain Delon, Catherine Deneuve, Philippe Léotard, Etienne Chicot, Jean-Louis Richard, Catherine Leprince, François Perrot, Féodor Atkine', null, 'Martin Terrier wants to quit his job as a hired hitman, but his organized crime employers are unwilling to see him turned out to pasture, Terrier knows too much, and he is still useful to the organization. He escapes to the countryside where he meets Claire, and the two soon fall in love. Back in Paris to confront his employers, Terrier learns that they''ve stolen all his money from the bank. They give him an ultimatum—do one last job for them and he gets his money and his freedom...', 'Martin Terrier wants to quit his job as a hired hitman, but his organized crime employers are unwilling to see him turned out to pasture, Terrier knows too much, and he is still useful to the organization. He escapes to the countryside where he meets Claire, and the two soon fall in love. Back in Paris to confront his employers, Terrier learns that they''ve stolen all his money from the bank. They give him an ultimatum—do one last job for them and he gets his money and his freedom...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXSPRvXNK48THuuJzj8cfZXec41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124352'),
  ('425128441697532741', 'Le Ciel, les Oiseaux et... ta mère !', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Djamel Bensalah, Martin Legrand', 'Djamel Bensalah, Gilles Laurent', 'Jamel Debbouze, Lorànt Deutsch, Julien Courbey, Stéphane Soo Mongo, Olivia Bonamy, Jessica Beudaert, Julia Vaidis-Bogard, Marie Roversi', null, 'Four guys from a Paris housing project fabricate a documentary about drug dealers working in the City of Lights. When a television network falls hook, line, and sinker for the prank video, the foursome are given a free three-week vacation in the upscale resort community of Biarritz. As they interact with both locals and fellow tourists, they learn about love, friendship, racism, and the differences between the rich and the poor.', 'Four guys from a Paris housing project fabricate a documentary about drug dealers working in the City of Lights. When a television network falls hook, line, and sinker for the prank video, the foursome are given a free three-week vacation in the upscale resort community of Biarritz. As they interact with both locals and fellow tourists, they learn about love, friendship, racism, and the differences between the rich and the poor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCmfK1K7aTbSwciXxwnC0dn1yQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57141'),
