  ('811144333956001818', 'Le Divorce', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Pierre Lhomme, James Ivory, Elisabeth Lefort', 'Diane Johnson, James Ivory, Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Kate Hudson, Naomi Watts, Glenn Close, Marie-Christine Adam, Thierry Lhermitte, Melvil Poupaud, Matthew Modine, Sam Waterston', 'PG-13', 'While visiting her sister in Paris, a young woman finds romance and learns her brother-in-law is a philanderer.', 'While visiting her sister in Paris, a young woman finds romance and learns her brother-in-law is a philanderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucBJrWKCJ1naTylSFN8jpaEqwwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9499'),
  ('846114494959834017', 'Le Donk & Scor-zay-zee', 2009, 'Comedy, Music', 'Shane Meadows, Shane Meadows', 'Shane Meadows', 'Paddy Considine, Dean Palinczuk, Olivia Colman, Shane Meadows, Seamus O''Neill, Richard Graham, Nigel Reeks, Nigel Reeks', null, 'An improvised comedy, shot over five days by Shane Meadows, devised with and starring Paddy Considine. Rock roadie and failed musician, Le Donk has lived, loved and learned. Along the way he''s lost a girlfriend but he has found a new sidekick in up-and-coming rap prodigy Scor-zay-zee. With Meadows'' fly-on-the-wall crew in tow, Donk sets out to make Scor-zay-zee a star...', 'An improvised comedy, shot over five days by Shane Meadows, devised with and starring Paddy Considine. Rock roadie and failed musician, Le Donk has lived, loved and learned. Along the way he''s lost a girlfriend but he has found a new sidekick in up-and-coming rap prodigy Scor-zay-zee. With Meadows'' fly-on-the-wall crew in tow, Donk sets out to make Scor-zay-zee a star...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUrQEbGcxGMR2aMdA2PNGJKzRFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25048'),
  ('495518463604138261', 'Le Doulos', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Nicolas Hayer, Charles L. Bitsch', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Serge Reggiani, Jean Desailly, René Lefèvre, Marcel Cuvelier, Philippe March, Fabienne Dali, Monique Hennessy', 'NR', 'Enigmatic gangster Silien may or may not be responsible for informing on Faugel, who was just released from prison and is already involved in what should be a simple heist. By the end of this brutal, twisting, and multilayered policier, who will be left to trust?', 'Enigmatic gangster Silien may or may not be responsible for informing on Faugel, who was just released from prison and is already involved in what should be a simple heist. By the end of this brutal, twisting, and multilayered policier, who will be left to trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZ3mks1KnoQ4bIZ8fnv57Cd2T36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20778'),
  ('710645755589390377', 'Le duel d''Hamlet', 1900, 'Drama', 'Clément Maurice', null, 'Sarah Bernhardt, Pierre Magnier', null, 'The movie consists solely of a saber fight. Bernhardt plays a cross-gender Hamlet, and Pierre Magnier is her fellow duelist, Laertes. A few bystanders, in Rennaissance dress, stand off to the right of the screen, and in the background, next to a painted backdrop.', 'The movie consists solely of a saber fight. Bernhardt plays a cross-gender Hamlet, and Pierre Magnier is her fellow duelist, Laertes. A few bystanders, in Rennaissance dress, stand off to the right of the screen, and in the background, next to a painted backdrop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scVgBXPbRRlTZzvxFCqZb4M3T3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195626'),
  ('1035388529060803967', 'Le Facteur de Saint-Tropez', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Richard Balducci', null, 'Paul Préboist, Marion Game, Nathalie Kowska, Manuel Gélin, Brigitte Borghese, Henri Génès, Michel Galabru, Françoise Blanchard', null, 'Robin Bellefeuille, postman in Saint-Tropez and his friend gendarme Ficelle, have well-established ecological principles. When they learn about the future construction of a casino in town, they do everything to stop the project', 'Robin Bellefeuille, postman in Saint-Tropez and his friend gendarme Ficelle, have well-established ecological principles. When they learn about the future construction of a casino in town, they do everything to stop the project', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uFIdJ6DgR6b1zEUqM1CmyoH2d9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84017'),
  ('260362532404126275', 'Le fils préféré', 1994, 'Drama', 'Nicole Garcia, Éric Gautier', 'Nicole Garcia, Jacques Fieschi, François Dupeyron', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Gérard Lanvin, Jean-Marc Barr, Roberto Herlitzka, Margherita Buy, Pierre Mondy, Karin Viard, Antoinette Moya', null, 'Jean-Paul Mantegna, the son of Italian immigrants now living in Nice, is a hunted man, riddled with debt and involved in borderline illegal companies. To extricate himself, he has to rely on Philippe and François, his two brothers, and on Raphaël, his father; a family torn by disputes and tragic events. However, by rebuilding family unity, Jean-Paul also discovers the secret of his own destiny...', 'Jean-Paul Mantegna, the son of Italian immigrants now living in Nice, is a hunted man, riddled with debt and involved in borderline illegal companies. To extricate himself, he has to rely on Philippe and François, his two brothers, and on Raphaël, his father; a family torn by disputes and tragic events. However, by rebuilding family unity, Jean-Paul also discovers the secret of his own destiny...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMGb1rXizRVXa48oCxVdPve4N0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67960'),
  ('1119418880236695182', 'Le Gai Savoir', 1969, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Georges Leclerc', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Juliet Berto, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'Night after night, not long before dawn, two young adults, Patricia and Emile, meet on a sound stage to discuss learning, discourse, and the path to revolution. Scenes of Paris''s student revolt, the Vietnam War, and other events of the late 1960s, along with posters, photographs, and cartoons, are backdrops to their words. Words themselves are often Patricia and Emile''s subject, as are images, sounds, and juxtapositions.', 'Night after night, not long before dawn, two young adults, Patricia and Emile, meet on a sound stage to discuss learning, discourse, and the path to revolution. Scenes of Paris''s student revolt, the Vietnam War, and other events of the late 1960s, along with posters, photographs, and cartoons, are backdrops to their words. Words themselves are often Patricia and Emile''s subject, as are images, sounds, and juxtapositions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEDA0zdeZQzyYO5mnlDElDWlOLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51205'),
  ('1088340439123109591', 'Le Gendarme de Saint-Tropez', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault, Marc Fossard, Jean Mylonas', 'Jean Girault, Jacques Vilfrid', 'Louis de Funès, Geneviève Grad, Michel Galabru, Daniel Cauchy, Maria Pacôme, Claude Piéplu, Madeleine Delavaivre, Gabriele Tinti', null, 'The ambitious police officer Cruchot is transferred to St. Tropez. He''s struggling with crimes such as persistent nude swimming, but even more with his teenage daughter, who''s trying to impress her rich friends by telling them her father was a millionaire and owned a yacht in the harbor.', 'The ambitious police officer Cruchot is transferred to St. Tropez. He''s struggling with crimes such as persistent nude swimming, but even more with his teenage daughter, who''s trying to impress her rich friends by telling them her father was a millionaire and owned a yacht in the harbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6510K6Y8eYLf9FJ7O4xaOnwhn2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4727'),
  ('751275386923668263', 'Le Goût du crime', 2023, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Chloé Micout', 'Isabelle Polin, Frédéric J. Lozet', 'Cécile Bois, Charlie Dupont, Antoine Ferey, Denis Maréchal, Victoria Eber, Bernard Le Coq, Stéphanie Pareja, Chloé David', null, 'A former starred chef, Laure Grenadier now devotes herself to her activities as a food critic for the channel she created on the Internet. She is also careful to keep her distance from her ex and father of her daughter Amandine, the police captain Nicolas Garnier as Laure has not digested the fact that he left her for a younger woman. However, when a wave of crimes strikes the restaurant owners of Lyon, Laure''s resolutions are shattered. Nicolas and his new assistant Baptiste understand that Laure''s position in the very closed world of Lyon''s restaurant industry and the respect she inspires in the regional chefs are invaluable assets for their investigation. Emotionally involved - her uncle is the first victim - Laure lets herself be convinced to serve as their informant.', 'A former starred chef, Laure Grenadier now devotes herself to her activities as a food critic for the channel she created on the Internet. She is also careful to keep her distance from her ex and father of her daughter Amandine, the police captain Nicolas Garnier as Laure has not digested the fact that he left her for a younger woman. However, when a wave of crimes strikes the restaurant owners of Lyon, Laure''s resolutions are shattered. Nicolas and his new assistant Baptiste understand that Laure''s position in the very closed world of Lyon''s restaurant industry and the respect she inspires in the regional chefs are invaluable assets for their investigation. Emotionally involved - her uncle is the first victim - Laure lets herself be convinced to serve as their informant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBtIVZJuunNlOxatFfAhx9RFDJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036803'),
  ('1115217922828399427', 'Le goûter champêtre', 1898, 'Documentary', 'Auguste Lumière, Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A group of young women and children enjoy a rowdy picnic in the countryside.', 'A group of young women and children enjoy a rowdy picnic in the countryside.', null, 'tmdb:movie:231127'),
