  ('361788976931004277', 'Le Grand Amour', 1969, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre Étaix, Jean Boffety', 'Pierre Étaix, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Pierre Étaix, Annie Fratellini, Nicole Calfan, Alain Janey, Ketty France, Louis Maïss, Jacqueline Rouillard, Magali Clément', null, 'Pierre married Florence, the only daughter of a small industrialist. 15 years later, he is the boss, but his middle-class life worries him a lot. When a new young and lovely secretary comes, he starts dreaming.', 'Pierre married Florence, the only daughter of a small industrialist. 15 years later, he is the boss, but his middle-class life worries him a lot. When a new young and lovely secretary comes, he starts dreaming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLKBgO0HXkY4cYX4XE35oemETwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138906'),
  ('258461528660919055', 'Le Grand Carnaval', 1983, 'War, Drama', 'Alexandre Arcady', null, 'Philippe Noiret, Roger Hanin, Richard Berry, Peter Riegert, Macha Méril, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Gérard Darmon, Fiona Gélin', null, 'The story follows Americans in Algeria at the time of the Allied invasion of North Africa in 1942.', 'The story follows Americans in Algeria at the time of the Allied invasion of North Africa in 1942.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KjyEhLVu0YJhTMmTEIM75NIidK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114863'),
  ('1078511520571633060', 'Le Grand Chef', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Min-soo, Jeon Yun-su, Hong Chang-pyo', 'Jeon Yun-su, Shin Dong-ik', 'Kim Kang-woo, Im Won-hee, Lee Ha-na, Jung Eun-pyo, Jung Jin, Kim Hee-jin, Lee Tae-ri, Kwon Sung-hoon', null, 'A disgraced chef tries to restore his name by competing in a culinary contest to win the knife of Korea''s last royal chef.', 'A disgraced chef tries to restore his name by competing in a culinary contest to win the knife of Korea''s last royal chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCizXVuPbEQxECnB5uh7go4OTyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82406'),
  ('583781347320199369', 'Le Grand Chef 2: Kimchi Battle', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Kim Min-su, Baek Dong-hoon, Cho Yong-kyu', 'Shin Dong-ik', 'Kim Jung-eun, Jin Goo, Wang Ji-hye, Lee Bo-hee, Choi Jong-won, Lee Byung-joon, Sung Ji-ru, Kim Yeong-ok', null, '"Le Grand Chef 2" begins with the Korean president visiting the Japanese Prime Minister and becoming involved in a heated debate over the origins of kimchi. The Japanese Prime Minister makes the bold claim that kimchi is an original Japanese dish which sets off the Korean president. Upon the Korean''s president return home he sets upon a globalization plan for kimchi, which includes a nationwide "Kimchi Contest". Then, a lady named Jang-eun (Kim Jung-Eun) and her step-brother Sung-Chan (Jin Goo) compete in the Kimchi dish contest, with both siblings using their mother''s kimchi recipe.', '"Le Grand Chef 2" begins with the Korean president visiting the Japanese Prime Minister and becoming involved in a heated debate over the origins of kimchi. The Japanese Prime Minister makes the bold claim that kimchi is an original Japanese dish which sets off the Korean president. Upon the Korean''s president return home he sets upon a globalization plan for kimchi, which includes a nationwide "Kimchi Contest". Then, a lady named Jang-eun (Kim Jung-Eun) and her step-brother Sung-Chan (Jin Goo) compete in the Kimchi dish contest, with both siblings using their mother''s kimchi recipe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV1sXA1zvm9DeSfZ7WfjW5WGD8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72857'),
  ('1018728518491749950', 'Le grand cirque', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Booder, Brice Morin, Denis Mauguit', 'Booder, Gaelle Falzerana', 'Booder, Sarah Jague, Gérard Giroudon, Youssef Sahraoui, Yassir Drief, Samir Boulkroun, Lazlo Callens, Saskia de Melo Dillais', null, 'While visiting a friend at the hospital, Momo, a jobless comedian, meets Michel, the director of an unpaid clown''s association, who visit sick children. Thanks to Michel''s support and belief, Momo sets himself a new challenge : make the children laugh, despite their illness.', 'While visiting a friend at the hospital, Momo, a jobless comedian, meets Michel, the director of an unpaid clown''s association, who visit sick children. Thanks to Michel''s support and belief, Momo sets himself a new challenge : make the children laugh, despite their illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPLzbs2ZtrJtbWIOpVH1JI0JFih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998589'),
  ('825845231625048997', 'Le Grand Méliès', 1952, 'Documentary', 'Georges Franju, Jacques Mercanton, Roland Coste', 'Georges Franju', 'Jehanne d''Alcy, François Lallement, André Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy', null, 'A biographical film about cinematic illusionist Georges Méliès featuring Méliès’s widow, Jeanne d’Alcy, as herself, and their son André as his own father.', 'A biographical film about cinematic illusionist Georges Méliès featuring Méliès’s widow, Jeanne d’Alcy, as herself, and their son André as his own father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDwhkL6Eon8d1vd27t26NVYHsBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235932'),
  ('917289263157764181', 'Le Guignolo', 1980, 'Comedy, Action', 'Georges Lautner, Henri Decaë', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Mirella D''Angelo, Michel Galabru, Carla Romanelli, Paolo Bonacelli, Georges Géret, Von Gretchen Shepard, Pierre Vernier', null, 'After the failure of his recent criminal exploits, international con artist Alexandre Dupré sets off for Venice to try to dupe some Japanese business men into buying a fake copy of a stolen Caneletto. On the aeroplane, a stranger asks him to look after his briefcase until after they have landed. Alexandre agrees, but the stranger is shot dead soon after and Alexandre himself becomes the target of enemy agents who are keen to recover the briefcase...', 'After the failure of his recent criminal exploits, international con artist Alexandre Dupré sets off for Venice to try to dupe some Japanese business men into buying a fake copy of a stolen Caneletto. On the aeroplane, a stranger asks him to look after his briefcase until after they have landed. Alexandre agrees, but the stranger is shot dead soon after and Alexandre himself becomes the target of enemy agents who are keen to recover the briefcase...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPMYgLcegBdu60hQEVQlsMugG8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12541'),
  ('73178466952066688', 'Le Havre', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Lucas Loubaresse, Renaud Gast', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'André Wilms, Kati Outinen, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Blondin Miguel, Elina Salo, Evelyne Didi, Quoc Dung Nguyen, François Monnié', null, 'In the French harbor city of Le Havre, an elderly shoeshiner with an ailing wife crosses paths with a young African refugee pursued by the police for deportation.', 'In the French harbor city of Le Havre, an elderly shoeshiner with an ailing wife crosses paths with a young African refugee pursued by the police for deportation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCoGiKr8hn9fPYnxECjUhpaP8TI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73532'),
  ('595277451770438565', 'Le Jeu de la mort', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Alain-Michel Blanc, Gilles Amado, Thomas Bornot', 'Christophe Nick', 'Tania Young, Laurent Ledoyen, Philippe Torreton', null, 'The Game of Death is a documentary co-produced by France Télévisions and Radio Television Switzerland1 in 2009 and staging a fake game show (The Xtreme Zone) during which a candidate must send electric shocks increasingly strong candidate to another until voltages that can cause death. The staging reproduces the Milgram experiment carried out initially in the United States in 1960 to study the influence of authority on obedience: electric shocks are fictitious, an actor pretending to suffer, and objective is to test the ability to disobey the candidate who inflicts this treatment and who is not aware of the experiment. The notable difference with the original experience is that scientific authority is replaced by a television presenter, Tania Young.', 'The Game of Death is a documentary co-produced by France Télévisions and Radio Television Switzerland1 in 2009 and staging a fake game show (The Xtreme Zone) during which a candidate must send electric shocks increasingly strong candidate to another until voltages that can cause death. The staging reproduces the Milgram experiment carried out initially in the United States in 1960 to study the influence of authority on obedience: electric shocks are fictitious, an actor pretending to suffer, and objective is to test the ability to disobey the candidate who inflicts this treatment and who is not aware of the experiment. The notable difference with the original experience is that scientific authority is replaced by a television presenter, Tania Young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJbTaBNaYmOtg5qV23S3RoTjRrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113258'),
  ('46234595466925376', 'Le Jeu de la vérité', 2014, 'Comedy', 'François Desagnat', null, 'Vanessa Demouy, David Brécourt, Christian Vadim, Philippe Lellouche', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhIKbXTbWFd4FUOMY4KvHqgorGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248249'),
  ('12189564818274697', 'Le Joli Cœur', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Francis Perrin, Didier Tarot, Michel Desrois', 'Francis Perrin, Paul Claudon, Alex Varoux', 'Francis Perrin, Cyrielle Clair, Sylvain Rougerie, Patricia Cartier, Michèle Bernier, Annie Jouzier, Barbara Willar, Jean-Claude Bouillaud', null, 'Frank and Bernard share the same apartment and both work in the same tourist agency. Bernard drives the coach through the streets of Paris and Frank is the guide. The driver longs for a family life but he is not lucky with girls. So he asks his friend, who is a womanizer, to help him find at last his better half. Frank winds up in a hospital and falls for the shrink, Nina. Faithful to his pal, Frank comes to his rescue but he falls in love with Nina too.', 'Frank and Bernard share the same apartment and both work in the same tourist agency. Bernard drives the coach through the streets of Paris and Frank is the guide. The driver longs for a family life but he is not lucky with girls. So he asks his friend, who is a womanizer, to help him find at last his better half. Frank winds up in a hospital and falls for the shrink, Nina. Faithful to his pal, Frank comes to his rescue but he falls in love with Nina too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2xBWz8vgERCYEBAO0DzsMaYrSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178281'),
  ('511567929600125925', 'Le Jour de gloire', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Besnard', null, 'Jean Lefebvre, Pierre Tornade, Darry Cowl, Jacques Marin, Robert Rollis, Pierre Doris, Chantal Nobel, Jean Rougerie', null, 'In 1944, a retired German detachment found itself stranded in a French town. The inhabitants try to live in good harmony with the occupants. But one day kids, playing with a grenade, accidentally cause the death of an SS lieutenant.', 'In 1944, a retired German detachment found itself stranded in a French town. The inhabitants try to live in good harmony with the occupants. But one day kids, playing with a grenade, accidentally cause the death of an SS lieutenant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJUVaXAq8bYOO8FBCWd1FV5tYfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84515'),
  ('1152719163929776148', 'Le Jour de Ma Mort', 2024, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Crime', 'Jérôme Cornuau', 'Johanne Rigoulot', 'Lula Cotton-Frapier, Frédéric Diefenthal, Naidra Ayadi, Mathieu Spinosi, Victor Meutelet, Mona Berard, Isma Kébé, Émilie Gavois-Kahn', null, 'When a fortuneteller predicted Lisa''s death on August 15 in midst of fear and violence, she shrugged. Yet, this morning, as the sun rises over a deserted and heat-scorched city, the police is desperate. The killer of three women will strike again by midnight. Suddenly Lisa feels less serene. Especially since she is sure, a man has broken into the empty building. August 15th will be a very hot day….', 'When a fortuneteller predicted Lisa''s death on August 15 in midst of fear and violence, she shrugged. Yet, this morning, as the sun rises over a deserted and heat-scorched city, the police is desperate. The killer of three women will strike again by midnight. Suddenly Lisa feels less serene. Especially since she is sure, a man has broken into the empty building. August 15th will be a very hot day….', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR0TEnlMuo7aKvCtzNnpzTb3qpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183400'),
  ('86696825389193503', 'Le K Benzema', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Damien Piscarel', null, 'Karim Benzema, Zinédine Zidane, Thierry Henry, Cristiano Ronaldo, Samir Nasri, Franck Ribéry, Gareth Bale, Marcelo', null, 'France''s top scorer in the Champions League, Karim Benzema has 81 caps in the French national team, but has not been called to France since 8 October 2015. On 13 April 2016, the Real Madrid striker was removed from the national team for an indefinite period of time following the "sextape" affair. With Damien Piscarel''s contribution to the footballer''s speech, he was able to look back at the situation, but also evoke his debut at Bron, his Lyon adventure and his transfer to Real Madrid. Zinedine Zidane, Thierry Henry, Cristiano Ronaldo and Franck Ribéry, to mention the Benzema case.', 'France''s top scorer in the Champions League, Karim Benzema has 81 caps in the French national team, but has not been called to France since 8 October 2015. On 13 April 2016, the Real Madrid striker was removed from the national team for an indefinite period of time following the "sextape" affair. With Damien Piscarel''s contribution to the footballer''s speech, he was able to look back at the situation, but also evoke his debut at Bron, his Lyon adventure and his transfer to Real Madrid. Zinedine Zidane, Thierry Henry, Cristiano Ronaldo and Franck Ribéry, to mention the Benzema case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVxKu3MW4Fp9wICVN7HnzZp84A3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497883'),
  ('537480810133904435', 'Le leggi del desiderio', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Federica Ciciarelli, Silvio Muccino, Federico Schlatter', 'Carla Vangelista, Silvio Muccino', 'Silvio Muccino, Nicole Grimaudo, Maurizio Mattioli, Carla Signoris, Luca Ward, Carlo Valli, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Gianni Ferreri', null, 'Giovanni is a famous life coach who claims he can make any desire come true. One day he announces a competition in which three people dissatisfied with their lives will win the chance to be followed by him for six months.', 'Giovanni is a famous life coach who claims he can make any desire come true. One day he announces a competition in which three people dissatisfied with their lives will win the chance to be followed by him for six months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDZeCzHsDO6MoQfJJY30ctAchog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327372'),
  ('467022429993504726', 'Le manoir du diable', 1896, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy', null, 'In a medieval castle, a dark magician thought to be Mephistopheles conjures up a series of bizarre creatures and events in order to torment a pair of interloping cavaliers.', 'In a medieval castle, a dark magician thought to be Mephistopheles conjures up a series of bizarre creatures and events in order to torment a pair of interloping cavaliers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9uPKpQGlKrVRDe0NqDAhSzPSmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133063'),
