  ('194856385937971886', 'Le Marchand de sable', 2023, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Goepfert, Steve Achiepo, Brice Morin', 'Romy Coccia Di Ferro, Steve Achiepo', 'Moussa Mansaly, Benoît Magimel, Aïssa Maïga, Ophélie Bau, Mamadou Minte, Mariama Gueye, Pol White, Yanis Benatallah', null, 'Marked by years of prison, Djo, a parcel delivery man in the Paris suburbs, lives modestly with his mother and daughter. One day, an aunt who has just fled the Ivorian conflict arrives at their home with her three children. In a hurry, Djo manages to find them a place to live. But faced with the growing demand and with the prospect of offering a decent life to his daughter, Djo switches and becomes a sleep merchant.', 'Marked by years of prison, Djo, a parcel delivery man in the Paris suburbs, lives modestly with his mother and daughter. One day, an aunt who has just fled the Ivorian conflict arrives at their home with her three children. In a hurry, Djo manages to find them a place to live. But faced with the growing demand and with the prospect of offering a decent life to his daughter, Djo switches and becomes a sleep merchant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7i4uBko9HTTJkrxo7V4a9YJ3mm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998781'),
