  ('190982699799967190', 'Le nèg''', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Robert Morin, Jean-Pierre St-Louis', 'Robert Morin', 'Iannicko N''Doua, Robin Aubert, Emmanuel Bilodeau, Vincent Bilodeau, Sandrine Bisson, Jean-Guy Bouchard, Claude Despins, René-Daniel Dubois', null, 'In the middle of the night, in the Québec countryside, all hell breaks loose as a black teenager is caught smashing a racially denigrating lawn ornament. Together the neighbours attend to justice against the vandal. Thorough the night there is mounting racism, fueled by alcohol, and violence. Le Nèg'' opens the morning after when the police investigators arrive at the scene to take depositions.', 'In the middle of the night, in the Québec countryside, all hell breaks loose as a black teenager is caught smashing a racially denigrating lawn ornament. Together the neighbours attend to justice against the vandal. Thorough the night there is mounting racism, fueled by alcohol, and violence. Le Nèg'' opens the morning after when the police investigators arrive at the scene to take depositions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AUuNUsMH4F8mCnMqQIKhGJLn5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148271'),
