  ('563951502178756847', 'Le Rouge et le Noir', 1954, 'Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Michel Kelber', 'Jean Aurenche, Claude Autant-Lara, Pierre Bost', 'Gérard Philipe, Danielle Darrieux, Antonella Lualdi, Jean Mercure, Antoine Balpêtré, André Brunot, Anna Maria Sandri, Jean Martinelli', null, 'It''s no holds barred for Julian in pursuit of upward mobility. Although expected to channel career aspirations into the Church of the post-Napoleonic era, his intensely romantic liaisons propel him forward at a pace he cannot control.', 'It''s no holds barred for Julian in pursuit of upward mobility. Although expected to channel career aspirations into the Church of the post-Napoleonic era, his intensely romantic liaisons propel him forward at a pace he cannot control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3s4BzBY9ZLqUr18JDVGo3FfZiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98969'),
  ('813442243143114080', 'Le Sabotier du Val de Loire', 1956, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jacques Demy, Georges Lendi, Georges Rouquier', 'Jacques Demy', 'Yves Demy, Georges Rouquier', null, 'This is October 1955. The place is a village in Loire-Atlantique, La Chapelle-Basse-Mer, where an old clog-maker works and lives with his wife and their adopted son. The clog-maker''s meticulous craft is described with love and close attention to detail. On the other hand, forthcoming death pervades the quiet everyday life of the elderly couple.', 'This is October 1955. The place is a village in Loire-Atlantique, La Chapelle-Basse-Mer, where an old clog-maker works and lives with his wife and their adopted son. The clog-maker''s meticulous craft is described with love and close attention to detail. On the other hand, forthcoming death pervades the quiet everyday life of the elderly couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bO2mK7EqFh1eesMbKlPaCwVLOXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202102'),
  ('585603615017070349', 'Le Secret de la grotte', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Crime', 'Christelle Raynal, Éric Guichard', 'Florence Philipponnat, Olivier Berclaz', 'Samy Gharbi, Élodie Varlet, Franck Adrien, Serge Riaboukine, Catherine Davenier, Guillaume Bouchède, Slimane Benaïssa, Baya Belal', null, 'On the banks of the Ardèche, near Vallon-Pont-d''Arc, kayakers find the body of the museum president of a recently discovered Paleolithic cave. A 40,000-year-old carved stone was embedded in his neck. To investigate, Captain Manon Ferret-Duval of the research section teams up with her counterpart Riad Lekcir. They must overcome a shared past: she is convinced that her partner''s older brother is responsible for the murder of her parents in 1994. Riad has no doubt that Kamel, now deceased, is innocent.', 'On the banks of the Ardèche, near Vallon-Pont-d''Arc, kayakers find the body of the museum president of a recently discovered Paleolithic cave. A 40,000-year-old carved stone was embedded in his neck. To investigate, Captain Manon Ferret-Duval of the research section teams up with her counterpart Riad Lekcir. They must overcome a shared past: she is convinced that her partner''s older brother is responsible for the murder of her parents in 1994. Riad has no doubt that Kamel, now deceased, is innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmtu3dVV6hT6W0q1qDK3Za7sXRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037670'),
  ('718662433428596007', 'Le sei mogli di Barbablù', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Mario Albertelli, Roberto Cinquini', 'Bruno Caravagni, Enrico Maria Ricci', 'Totò, Isa Barzizza, Carlo Ninchi, Tino Buazzelli, Mario Castellani, Luigi Pavese, Aldo Bufi Landi, Marcella Rovena', null, 'Young swain Toto Esposito tries to abduct his beloved to marry her, but he makes a mistake: he kidnaps an ugly woman named Carmela, who loves him--and chases him when he escapes.', 'Young swain Toto Esposito tries to abduct his beloved to marry her, but he makes a mistake: he kidnaps an ugly woman named Carmela, who loves him--and chases him when he escapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDxhWeCi3Tm31PrXLefZHH6fXcr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64955'),
  ('615123444839198924', 'Le Séminaire Caméra Café', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Charles Nemes', null, 'Bruno Solo, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Armelle, Alain Bouzigues, Gérard Chaillou, Jeanne Savary, Scali Delpeyrat, Virginie Hocq', null, 'Six employees of the Geugène company travel to Paris to take part in a motivational seminar.', 'Six employees of the Geugène company travel to Paris to take part in a motivational seminar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srhRukbSLE6qaeCAayHbS8ltMyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15034'),
  ('730626550557529654', 'Le sens de l''humour', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marilyne Canto', 'Marilyne Canto, Maud Ameline', 'Marilyne Canto, Antoine Chappey, Samson Dajczman, Jules Ritmanic, Jean-Marie Chappey', null, 'Élise lives with her 10-year-old son Léo, whose father is deceased. She has a chaotic relationship with Paul her lover. They go from happy moments to intense feuds. Élise introduces him to Léo and in time, they get to know and appreciate each other.', 'Élise lives with her 10-year-old son Léo, whose father is deceased. She has a chaotic relationship with Paul her lover. They go from happy moments to intense feuds. Élise introduces him to Léo and in time, they get to know and appreciate each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emuE8yFyuldwLDNSNmtnHvMfyU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281591'),
  ('167861695963736107', 'Le Septième Juré', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Édouard Niermans, François Lartigue', 'Francis Didelot, Didier Le Pêcheur', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Isabelle Habiague, Pascal Elso, Igor Mendjisky, Éric Naggar, Lahcen Razzougui, Jean-Yves Chatelais', null, 'The action takes place in a typical French town in the early sixties, at the end of the Algerian war. In a fit of criminal madness, a married, affluent and respected town-citizen named Gregoire Duval kills a young woman who spurns his advances. As no one witnesses him committing this crime, he chooses to remain silent while the girl''s boyfriend, a young Algerian farm worker, is wrongly convicted. In a strange twist of fate, the killer becomes one of the jurors of the trial and suddenly does everything in his power to defend the wrongly accused young man.', 'The action takes place in a typical French town in the early sixties, at the end of the Algerian war. In a fit of criminal madness, a married, affluent and respected town-citizen named Gregoire Duval kills a young woman who spurns his advances. As no one witnesses him committing this crime, he chooses to remain silent while the girl''s boyfriend, a young Algerian farm worker, is wrongly convicted. In a strange twist of fate, the killer becomes one of the jurors of the trial and suddenly does everything in his power to defend the wrongly accused young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ACH7EPln90wo1y9Rr7OvGcZqUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247500'),
  ('353802896467727584', 'Le Silence de la mer', 1949, 'Drama, War', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Henri Decaë, Michel Drach', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'Howard Vernon, Nicole Stéphane, Jean-Marie Robain, Amy Aaröe, Georges Patrix, Denis Sadier, Rudelle, Max Fromm', null, 'In a small town in WWII France, a German officer is billeted in the house of an elderly man and his niece who resist the occupation by refusing to interact with him, even as he speaks to them candidly about his life and hopes for the future of France and Germany.', 'In a small town in WWII France, a German officer is billeted in the house of an elderly man and his niece who resist the occupation by refusing to interact with him, even as he speaks to them candidly about his life and hopes for the future of France and Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yagil6aUFTkdYqIoldZmDAGpay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40650'),
  ('1015541505274891599', 'Le Sourire', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Claude Miller, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Claude Miller', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Emmanuelle Seigner, Richard Bohringer, Chantal Banlier, Bernard Verley, Mathilde Seigner, Nathalie Cardone, Catherine Mongodin', null, 'An old psychiatrist finds out that he is likely to suffer a second and probably fatal heart attack in the near future. As a consequence he becomes determined to seduce Odile, a young woman he first encounters in a railway compartment.', 'An old psychiatrist finds out that he is likely to suffer a second and probably fatal heart attack in the near future. As a consequence he becomes determined to seduce Odile, a young woman he first encounters in a railway compartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZJUULjZznWZvEdQodBCzYhmVp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66004'),
  ('676627004477573211', 'Le Syndrome du Titanic', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Nicolas Hulot, Jean-Albert Lièvre', 'Nicolas Hulot, Jean-Albert Lièvre, Mathilde Jounot', 'Ulrich Wickert, Nicolas Hulot, J. Robert Oppenheimer, Pierre Rabhi, Harry S. Truman, Paul Virilio, Muhammad Yunus', null, 'Dieser Dokumentarfilm zeigt die ökologischen Probleme, mit denen die Erde zu kämpfen hat. Mit Bezug auf die lange Entwicklungsgeschichte der auf der Erde lebenden Lebewesen wird insbesondere auch ein Augenmerk auf das Artensterben, das durch den Menschen verursacht wird, gelegt.', 'Dieser Dokumentarfilm zeigt die ökologischen Probleme, mit denen die Erde zu kämpfen hat. Mit Bezug auf die lange Entwicklungsgeschichte der auf der Erde lebenden Lebewesen wird insbesondere auch ein Augenmerk auf das Artensterben, das durch den Menschen verursacht wird, gelegt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j4eSh6BRmAwA6TpueUOCXi5Y5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52374'),
  ('680719105819509731', 'Le tonnelier', 1942, 'Documentary', 'Georges Rouquier', null, null, null, 'A short documentary about the barrel making process.', 'A short documentary about the barrel making process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZMQaBhAbAz0RrDRmxGj29yo7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163386'),
  ('1073535806110963521', 'Le Torrent', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Anne Le Ny, Paul Roland-Levy, Catherine Cambier', 'Axelle Bachman, Anne Le Ny', 'José Garcia, André Dussollier, Capucine Valmary, Christiane Millet, Meimona Soumaré, Victor Pontecorvo, Ophélia Kolb, Zéphyr Elis', null, 'Alexandre finds out his wife Juliette is cheating on him. They quarrel with each over, Juliette runs away during the night, and has a fatal fall. The next day, torrential rain have taken her body away. The police force is investigating and Patrick, Juliette''s father, shows up to find out what happened. Fearing to be charged, Alexandre convinces his 18 years old daughter Lison to cover him. But his lies make things worse, and Patrick has doubts about him. It''s the beginning of a dreadful chain of events.', 'Alexandre finds out his wife Juliette is cheating on him. They quarrel with each over, Juliette runs away during the night, and has a fatal fall. The next day, torrential rain have taken her body away. The police force is investigating and Patrick, Juliette''s father, shows up to find out what happened. Fearing to be charged, Alexandre convinces his 18 years old daughter Lison to cover him. But his lies make things worse, and Patrick has doubts about him. It''s the beginning of a dreadful chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMm51WzScpaqAIRAfat6WGKPMYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944303'),
  ('304834787330336856', 'Le Trou', 1960, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jacques Becker, Ghislain Cloquet, Jean Becker', 'Jacques Becker, José Giovanni, Jean Aurel', 'Michel Constantin, Jean Keraudy, Philippe Leroy, Raymond Meunier, Marc Michel, Jean-Paul Coquelin, André Bervil, Eddy Rasimi', 'NR', 'Four prison inmates have been hatching a plan to literally dig out of jail when another prisoner, Claude Gaspard, is moved into their cell. They take a risk and share their plan with the newcomer. Over the course of three days, the prisoners and friends break through the concrete floor using a bed post and begin to make their way through the sewer system – yet their escape is anything but assured.', 'Four prison inmates have been hatching a plan to literally dig out of jail when another prisoner, Claude Gaspard, is moved into their cell. They take a risk and share their plan with the newcomer. Over the course of three days, the prisoners and friends break through the concrete floor using a bed post and begin to make their way through the sewer system – yet their escape is anything but assured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyZhiOz5NHVBUKlpioxjwajy7pm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29259'),
  ('868470136986501654', 'Le Vent des sables', 2024, 'Crime, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Stéphane Kappes, Alex Talmon, Margot Kappes', 'Frédéric Faurt, Lionel Pasquier', 'Marie-Josée Croze, Tom Leeb, Alexandre Brasseur, William Nadylam, Guillaume Arnault, Gabrielle Atger, Stéphane Brel, Nicolas Jouhet', null, 'As the sailors competing in the Vendée Globe prepare to set sail, the murder of a local figure disrupts preparations. The victim was the sponsor of Yannick Berthomé, a local boy and the race favorite. Lieutenants Judith Kamara and Olivier Finet are dispatched from the Angers SRPJ to investigate.', 'As the sailors competing in the Vendée Globe prepare to set sail, the murder of a local figure disrupts preparations. The victim was the sponsor of Yannick Berthomé, a local boy and the race favorite. Lieutenants Judith Kamara and Olivier Finet are dispatched from the Angers SRPJ to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cs63cc6t2ajUiRlnUhAmZ08T5mr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1197551'),
  ('408794850098396506', 'Le vie del Signore sono finite', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Troisi, Giorgio Basile, Camillo Bazzoni', 'Anna Pavignano, Massimo Troisi', 'Massimo Troisi, Jo Champa, Marco Messeri, Massimo Bonetti, Enzo Cannavale, Clelia Rondinella, Carola Stagnaro, Franco Pistoni', null, 'Set in Italy during the 1920s, a barber is in a wheelchair because of a psychosomatic illness after he lost the woman he loves.', 'Set in Italy during the 1920s, a barber is in a wheelchair because of a psychosomatic illness after he lost the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdDWKSbC3aBsmgUCirpZWWUFLR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57970'),
  ('633433904663605176', 'Le village de Namo - Panorama pris d''une chaise à porteurs', 1900, 'Documentary', 'Gabriel Veyre', null, null, null, 'The film is a panorama shot-scene lasting just under a minute. The panorama film, as coined by Lumière, is a moving-camera shot--usually accomplished by placing the camera on a moving transport, such as a boat or train.', 'The film is a panorama shot-scene lasting just under a minute. The panorama film, as coined by Lumière, is a moving-camera shot--usually accomplished by placing the camera on a moving transport, such as a boat or train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRduQJsUlPBuQAgndDz3cmj7wyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195647'),
  ('1111883331995914690', 'Le village des endormis', 2022, 'Crime, TV Movie, Drama', 'Charlotte Trunet, Philippe Dajoux, Mathieu Danielo', 'Alain Etévé, Frédérique Fall, Mathieu Gleizes', 'Aurélien Wiik, Flore Bonaventura, Lola Dewaere, Vincent Winterhalter, François-David Cardonnel, Stéphane Freiss, Julien Crampon, Anne Conti', null, 'While a murderer, Lucas, escapes during a prison transfer, a strange phenomenon suddenly disrupts the life of a village. One after another, the inhabitants fall into a prolonged sleep. It is in this climate of panic and anguish that Mathieu, a gendarmerie captain on the verge of divorce, must find Lucas and investigate a series of crimes. With the help of Elise, a sleep specialist who has come to the hospital as a backup, he will discover the origin of these mysterious sleepings, which is not unrelated to the murders he is investigating.', 'While a murderer, Lucas, escapes during a prison transfer, a strange phenomenon suddenly disrupts the life of a village. One after another, the inhabitants fall into a prolonged sleep. It is in this climate of panic and anguish that Mathieu, a gendarmerie captain on the verge of divorce, must find Lucas and investigate a series of crimes. With the help of Elise, a sleep specialist who has come to the hospital as a backup, he will discover the origin of these mysterious sleepings, which is not unrelated to the murders he is investigating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ka07pXn8NT11aD36xDfZpqOW3et.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973602'),
  ('780015225732244078', 'Le Viol', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alain Tasma, Marc Koninckx', 'Alain Tasma, Natalie Carter', 'Clotilde Courau, Hippolyte Girardot, Patrick Mille, Yannick Choirat, Sam Karmann, Romane Bohringer, Pierre Andrau, Stéphane Rideau', null, '21 August 1974. In Marseille, two Belgian tourists, Nicole and Malia, are savagely attacked and raped by three men. Their attackers claim that the women consented and are allowed to remain free. Though their friends and family advise them to forget the ordeal, Nicole and Malia instead decide to fight. Helped by their lawyer, Gisèle Halimi, they request that the attackers be judged at the assize court. On 8 May 1978, after a long battle, they finally obtain justice. A trial which made history as until then rape had been considered simply as a misdemeanor, whereas now it became a crime.', '21 August 1974. In Marseille, two Belgian tourists, Nicole and Malia, are savagely attacked and raped by three men. Their attackers claim that the women consented and are allowed to remain free. Though their friends and family advise them to forget the ordeal, Nicole and Malia instead decide to fight. Helped by their lawyer, Gisèle Halimi, they request that the attackers be judged at the assize court. On 8 May 1978, after a long battle, they finally obtain justice. A trial which made history as until then rape had been considered simply as a misdemeanor, whereas now it became a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aBxIqvni5BwgHf4pVeKyWOhl52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473094'),
  ('668061897270769692', 'Le Voleur invisible', 1909, 'Crime, Fantasy, Horror', 'Segundo de Chomón, Segundo de Chomón, Ferdinand Zecca', null, null, null, 'A man in a suit and cap stops in front of the display of a bookseller, finds and flips… "Invisible Man" by H. G. Wells! Fascinated by the subject, he buys the book and goes home with the intention to test the invisibility formula described by the author…', 'A man in a suit and cap stops in front of the display of a bookseller, finds and flips… "Invisible Man" by H. G. Wells! Fascinated by the subject, he buys the book and goes home with the intention to test the invisibility formula described by the author…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twF9MAUca9IUvndhOpJo6w1VgpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194071'),
  ('340572333090884043', 'Le Voyage aux Pyrénées', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Larrieu, Arnaud Larrieu, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Sabine Azéma, Arly Jover, Gurgon Kyap, Cyril Casmèze, Christophe Paou, Amira Casar, Bernard Blancan', null, 'Getting away from it all causes more problems than it solves in this comedy from the French writing-directing team of Jean-Marie Larrieu and Arnaud Larrieu. Alexandre Darou (Jean-Pierre Darroussin) and his wife Aurore Lalu (Sabine Azema) are a pair of well-known actors who need a break from the tension and fast pace of their lives in show biz. Adopting the names "Mr. and Mrs. Go," Alexandre and Aurore head for a village high in the mountains of Southwest France, where they hope to enjoy some relaxing downtime and they won''t be bothered. However, Alexandre and Aurore underestimated their own fame, and it isn''t long before everyone in the town knows that a pair of movie stars are in their midst. As the couple head into the hills, Alexandre and Aurore discover they don''t have much of a talent for roughing it, and while she believed that getting away from the city would help her deal with a recent bout with nymphomania, getting back to nature only increases her appetite for other men.', 'Getting away from it all causes more problems than it solves in this comedy from the French writing-directing team of Jean-Marie Larrieu and Arnaud Larrieu. Alexandre Darou (Jean-Pierre Darroussin) and his wife Aurore Lalu (Sabine Azema) are a pair of well-known actors who need a break from the tension and fast pace of their lives in show biz. Adopting the names "Mr. and Mrs. Go," Alexandre and Aurore head for a village high in the mountains of Southwest France, where they hope to enjoy some relaxing downtime and they won''t be bothered. However, Alexandre and Aurore underestimated their own fame, and it isn''t long before everyone in the town knows that a pair of movie stars are in their midst. As the couple head into the hills, Alexandre and Aurore discover they don''t have much of a talent for roughing it, and while she believed that getting away from the city would help her deal with a recent bout with nymphomania, getting back to nature only increases her appetite for other men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33F61FrpOHlxhAH8QfsrNWy8NTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15333'),
  ('223368273326855030', 'Le Voyage en pyjama', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Adrien Laurent, Paul Roland-Levy, Cédric Bouet', 'Pascal Thomas, Nathalie Lafaurie', 'Alexandre Lafaurie, Constance Labbé, Lolita Chammah, Barbara Schulz, Anouchka Delon, Emmanuelle Bouaziz, Marguerite Perrotte, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', null, '40-something Victor, humanities professor and amateur meteorologist, is a madcap, a friendly dabbler, who lives day by day, alongside is wife Anne.', '40-something Victor, humanities professor and amateur meteorologist, is a madcap, a friendly dabbler, who lives day by day, alongside is wife Anne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rc5poXglhtmCqW3TxGMkrlii5Ld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026220'),
  ('281393251232982596', 'Le Week-End', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roger Michell, Nathalie Durand', 'Hanif Kureishi', 'Jim Broadbent, Lindsay Duncan, Jeff Goldblum, Olly Alexander, Brice Beaugier, Xavier de Guillebon, Marie-France Alvarez, Charlotte Leo', 'R', 'Nick and Meg Burrows return to Paris, the city where they honeymooned, to celebrate their 30th wedding anniversary and rediscover some romance in their long-lived marriage. The film follows the couple as long-established tensions in their marriage break out in humorous and often painful ways.', 'Nick and Meg Burrows return to Paris, the city where they honeymooned, to celebrate their 30th wedding anniversary and rediscover some romance in their long-lived marriage. The film follows the couple as long-established tensions in their marriage break out in humorous and often painful ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5tYBFH0GhWGRbff4AXQXUoieZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209350'),
  ('574165166924882562', 'Le Zèbre', 1992, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jean Poiret', 'Alexandre Jardin, Jean Poiret', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Caroline Cellier, Christian Pereira, Annie Grégorio, François Dyrek, Carine Lemaire, Walter Allouch, Brigitte Chamarande', null, 'Hippolyte, the titular oddball, is a far from typical country lawyer. He has been happily married to the woman of his dreams for 15 years, but has an incurable penchant for practical (or rather impractical) jokes.', 'Hippolyte, the titular oddball, is a far from typical country lawyer. He has been happily married to the woman of his dreams for 15 years, but has an incurable penchant for practical (or rather impractical) jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lT6YkI9sV0NU7c9mtBcCzmTkDKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164126'),
  ('424121787941978269', 'Lea', 2011, 'Drama', 'Bruno Rolland', 'Anne Azoulay, Jihane Chouaib, Bruno Rolland', 'Anne Azoulay, Ginette Garcin, Éric Elmosnino, Nina Roberts, Magali Muxart, Carole Franck, Géraldine Martineau, Thibault de Montalembert', null, 'Léa lives in Le Havre, where she attends college whilst taking care of her elderly grandmother. To make ends meet, she works as a waitress in a night club. Her admittance to the Institute of Political Studies in Paris offers her new opportunities, but at a high price. Léa finds work as a striptease artist, so that each evening she can put into practice the theory of economic liberalism which she learns by day...', 'Léa lives in Le Havre, where she attends college whilst taking care of her elderly grandmother. To make ends meet, she works as a waitress in a night club. Her admittance to the Institute of Political Studies in Paris offers her new opportunities, but at a high price. Léa finds work as a striptease artist, so that each evening she can put into practice the theory of economic liberalism which she learns by day...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A5XuUUMQzszwyUGgbuildGcUuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112508'),
  ('289037956705743547', 'Lea', 2015, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Marco Tullio Giordana', null, 'Vanessa Scalera, Alessio Praticò, Mauro Conte, Linda Caridi, Matilde Piana, Giulia Lazzarini, Roberta Caronia, Bruno Torrisi', null, 'Lea grew up in a crime family in Calabria. The father of her daughter Denise is also a member of the Mafia. Lea, however, wants a different life for her daughter, free of violence, fear and falsehood. She decides to cooperate with justice, to benefit of the witness protection scheme and attempts to run away... Inspired by the true story of Lea Garofalo, the struggle of a woman to escape the Mafia.', 'Lea grew up in a crime family in Calabria. The father of her daughter Denise is also a member of the Mafia. Lea, however, wants a different life for her daughter, free of violence, fear and falsehood. She decides to cooperate with justice, to benefit of the witness protection scheme and attempts to run away... Inspired by the true story of Lea Garofalo, the struggle of a woman to escape the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g62593YBolcHEAn6Aanwl6zhykv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403537'),
  ('1122715396740869385', 'Lead Me Home', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jon Shenk, Pedro Kos', null, null, null, 'Poignant stories of homelessness on the West Coast of the US frame this cinematic portrait of a surging humanitarian crisis.', 'Poignant stories of homelessness on the West Coast of the US frame this cinematic portrait of a surging humanitarian crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrsrOldUfXn5vd5HP3BAYxLTjpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869602'),
  ('697391706664951710', 'Lead Us Not Into Temptation', 2011, 'Drama', 'Cheyenne Carron, Malory Congoste', 'Cheyenne Carron', 'Jean-François Garreaud, Agnès Delachair, Swann Arlaud, Karina Orr, Boris Baum, Walter Shnorkell, Nicky Naudé', null, 'A young woman strikes up an affair with an older married man, but twisted secrets begin to emerge as their tale is told from different points of view.', 'A young woman strikes up an affair with an older married man, but twisted secrets begin to emerge as their tale is told from different points of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KnWU80Xa4aJsSgFfBUERgbWPrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320470'),
  ('949732613479948002', 'Leader-Sheep', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Christian Rouaud, Florent Verdet, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Christian Rouaud', 'José Bové, Léon Maille, Pierre Burguière, Christiane Burguière, Marizette Tarlier, Michel Courtin, Christian Roqueirol, Pierre Bonnefous', null, 'Marizette, Christiane, Pierre, Léon, José... are some of the actors, funny and moving, of an incredible struggle, that of the peasants of Larzac against the State, confrontation of the weak against the strong, which united them in a merciless fight to save their lands. A determined and joyful fight, but sometimes also trying and perilous. It all began in 1971, when the government, through its Defense Minister Michel Debré, declared that the Larzac military camp must expand. Radical, the anger spreads like wildfire, the peasants mobilize and sign an oath: they will never give up their land. In the daily face to face with the army and the police, they will deploy treasures of imagination to make their voices heard. Soon hundreds of Larzac committees will be born throughout France... Ten years of resistance, collective intelligence and solidarity, which will carry them to victory.', 'Marizette, Christiane, Pierre, Léon, José... are some of the actors, funny and moving, of an incredible struggle, that of the peasants of Larzac against the State, confrontation of the weak against the strong, which united them in a merciless fight to save their lands. A determined and joyful fight, but sometimes also trying and perilous. It all began in 1971, when the government, through its Defense Minister Michel Debré, declared that the Larzac military camp must expand. Radical, the anger spreads like wildfire, the peasants mobilize and sign an oath: they will never give up their land. In the daily face to face with the army and the police, they will deploy treasures of imagination to make their voices heard. Soon hundreds of Larzac committees will be born throughout France... Ten years of resistance, collective intelligence and solidarity, which will carry them to victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGg1qRJIGQmuUB13h0QsY6c0vKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110957'),
  ('950501929418581558', 'Leading Lady Parts', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Chloe Thompson, Clare Awdry, Phoebe Vale Markham', 'Jessica Swale', 'Gemma Arterton, Gemma Chan, Emilia Clarke, Lena Headey, Tom Hiddleston, Felicity Jones, Katie Leung, Stacy Martin', null, 'The best women of British acting go to an audition for a dream role, primed to take on the role of a lifetime: that complex woman, the strong woman, a woman for today.', 'The best women of British acting go to an audition for a dream role, primed to take on the role of a lifetime: that complex woman, the strong woman, a woman for today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqaPliWfQbPROdnQIX4qOZ6V8tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539572'),
  ('181400326166434320', 'Leaf Blower', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alejandro Iglesias Mendizábal, Ximena Herrerías, Giulio Franz', 'Alejandro Iglesias Mendizábal, Luis Montalvo', 'Fabrizio Santini, Paco Rueda, Alejandro Guerrero, Carmen Ramos, José Carlos Rodríguez, Gibrán Arias, Adrián Vázquez, Fabiana Perzabal', null, 'Three friends have a special mission: find some keys lost in a pile of dead leaves. It may seem a simple task, but it will turn into an odyssey when it confronts them to their fear to grow up. This afternoon, as trivial as it may sound, could change the course of their lives.', 'Three friends have a special mission: find some keys lost in a pile of dead leaves. It may seem a simple task, but it will turn into an odyssey when it confronts them to their fear to grow up. This afternoon, as trivial as it may sound, could change the course of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXDM5RpGyxCh0omrXHbwLY91hp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345908'),
  ('640993815614418918', 'Leafie, a Hen Into the Wild', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Oh Sung-yoon, Byun Young-kyu, Lee Jong-hyeok', 'Hyeon Nam-seok, Kim Eun-jeong, Na Hyun', 'Moon So-ri, Yoo Seung-ho, Choi Min-sik, Park Cheol-min, Kim Sang-hyun, Jeon Sook-kyung, Um Sang-hyun, Sa Seong-ung', 'G', 'Based on a bestselling preteen novel of the same title that has sold more than 1 million copies in Korea, “Leafie, A Hen into the Wild” is about a laying hen named Leafie who is destined to live the “same old” repetitive life confined on the chicken farm. Her fate changes when she escapes from the chicken farm and hatches a duck egg. With the duckling (who believes Leafie to be his mother), sets off on a journey into the wild with her new son to find her freedom.', 'Based on a bestselling preteen novel of the same title that has sold more than 1 million copies in Korea, “Leafie, A Hen into the Wild” is about a laying hen named Leafie who is destined to live the “same old” repetitive life confined on the chicken farm. Her fate changes when she escapes from the chicken farm and hatches a duck egg. With the duckling (who believes Leafie to be his mother), sets off on a journey into the wild with her new son to find her freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EC4MNOe8TTx4JS8MncXPTj0eWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89623'),
  ('48298344641707237', 'League of Gods', 2016, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Jim Aupperle, Koan Hui, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Cherryyoko, Samson Sun', 'Jet Li, Fan Bingbing, Huang Xiaoming, Louis Koo, AngelaBaby, Jacky Heung, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Andy On Chi-Kit', null, 'During the reign of King Zhou, an official enters his bedchamber, and is devoured by the monstrous tails of Daji, his concubine. Outside their city, several warriors within a metal wagon discuss their strategies to free the Invisible People and their Chief, when Jiang Ziya appears to them. He tells them that when King Zhou was younger, he let himself become possessed by the Black Dragon for his quest for power.', 'During the reign of King Zhou, an official enters his bedchamber, and is devoured by the monstrous tails of Daji, his concubine. Outside their city, several warriors within a metal wagon discuss their strategies to free the Invisible People and their Chief, when Jiang Ziya appears to them. He tells them that when King Zhou was younger, he let himself become possessed by the Black Dragon for his quest for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMiTkBfAmXtCW2tbWHRiGb09Bjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406429'),
  ('1079923587128150788', 'League of Legends: Origins', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Leslie Iwerks, Jonathan Ingalls, Suki Medencevic', null, null, null, 'Fans, experts and creators of “League of Legends” detail the game’s rise from free demo to global esports titan.', 'Fans, experts and creators of “League of Legends” detail the game’s rise from free demo to global esports titan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jB42Dvqo3ITaHlbS4VDRS7EnLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639834'),
  ('518986405304738690', 'Leak', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jean van de Velde', 'Simon de Waal, Jean van de Velde', 'Cas Jansen, Ricky Koole, Thomas Acda, Victor Löw, Gijs Scholten van Aschat, Lou Landré, Jacob Derwig, Ton Kas', null, 'Based on a book about an infamous real scandal in the Dutch crime scene, the film aims at exposing the horrors caused by corruption on both sides of the law. A rookie policeman is coerced into obtaining secret information from a childhood friend turned gangster. The childhood friend turns informant. But his revelations are hardly the most important "leaks" in the story. In fact, the new relationship between old friends goes all wrong, and the young policeman becomes increasingly involved in a deadly web of lies, crimes, treason, and revenge, all seemingly out of control.', 'Based on a book about an infamous real scandal in the Dutch crime scene, the film aims at exposing the horrors caused by corruption on both sides of the law. A rookie policeman is coerced into obtaining secret information from a childhood friend turned gangster. The childhood friend turns informant. But his revelations are hardly the most important "leaks" in the story. In fact, the new relationship between old friends goes all wrong, and the young policeman becomes increasingly involved in a deadly web of lies, crimes, treason, and revenge, all seemingly out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iDdIqMhbJpOypH3MfSkoVYiQCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49325'),
  ('194506986048020076', 'Leal', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Florencia Momo, Nicolás Gorla, Juan Blas Caballero', 'Natacha Caravia, Marcelo Tolces, Alejandro Cabral', 'Luis Aguirre, Fini Bocchino, Bruno Sosa Bofinger, Fabio Chamorro, Dani Da Rosa, José Roberto Fretes Romero, Andrea Frigerio, David Gerber', null, 'Former Colonel Fernandez is appointed Minister of the National Anti-Drug Agency (SENAD) and purges the special forces to fight the first of many battles against drug trafficking on the border of Paraguay and Argentina.', 'Former Colonel Fernandez is appointed Minister of the National Anti-Drug Agency (SENAD) and purges the special forces to fight the first of many battles against drug trafficking on the border of Paraguay and Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AhtbvxwpQD80UuAUuZ3WnUHsre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540871'),
  ('1008152361500463609', 'Lean On Me', 1989, 'Drama', 'John G. Avildsen, Victor Hammer, Dwight Williams', 'Michael Schiffer', 'Morgan Freeman, Beverly Todd, Robert Guillaume, Ethan Phillips, Lynne Thigpen, Michael Beach, Tony Todd, Karen Malina White', 'PG-13', 'When principal Joe Clark takes over decaying Eastside High School, he''s faced with students wearing gang colors and graffiti-covered walls. Determined to do anything he must to turn the school around, he expels suspected drug dealers, padlocks doors and demands effort and results from students, staff and parents. Autocratic to a fault, this real-life educator put it all on the line.', 'When principal Joe Clark takes over decaying Eastside High School, he''s faced with students wearing gang colors and graffiti-covered walls. Determined to do anything he must to turn the school around, he expels suspected drug dealers, padlocks doors and demands effort and results from students, staff and parents. Autocratic to a fault, this real-life educator put it all on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xOyz2NlaoqZ6xIjJh0Goptm0tP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14621'),
  ('199199920654034500', 'Lean on Pete', 2018, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Andrew Haigh, Magnus Nordenhof Jønck, Kathleen Campbell', 'Andrew Haigh', 'Charlie Plummer, Amy Seimetz, Travis Fimmel, Steve Buscemi, Jason Beem, Tolo Tuitele, Ayanna Berkshire, Connor Brenes', 'R', 'Charley Thompson, a teenager living with his single father, gets a summer job working for horse trainer Del Montgomery. Bonding with an aging racehorse named Lean on Pete, Charley is horrified to learn he is bound for slaughter, and so he steals the horse, and the duo embark on an odyssey across the new American frontier.', 'Charley Thompson, a teenager living with his single father, gets a summer job working for horse trainer Del Montgomery. Bonding with an aging racehorse named Lean on Pete, Charley is horrified to learn he is bound for slaughter, and so he steals the horse, and the duo embark on an odyssey across the new American frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SuPHSo9Uw8GACkP2oPst512Qhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407890'),
  ('758323677135270799', 'Leap', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Yu Jing-pin, Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Zhao Xiaoshi', 'Zhang Ji', 'Gong Li, Huang Bo, Wu Gang, Peng Yuchang, Lydia Bai, Li Xian, Xing Jiadong, Юрий Хлыстов', null, 'After 12 years, the Chinese women''s volleyball team again reached the Olympic final. The ups and downs of the Chinese women''s volleyball team for more than three decades have slowly spread away.', 'After 12 years, the Chinese women''s volleyball team again reached the Olympic final. The ups and downs of the Chinese women''s volleyball team for more than three decades have slowly spread away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX2JYxu1riaaPD2sQID6SMPct6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638032'),
  ('597022866215868405', 'Leap of Faith', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Richard Pearce, Matthew F. Leonetti, Scott Chambliss', 'Janus Cercone', 'Steve Martin, Debra Winger, Lolita Davidovich, Liam Neeson, Lukas Haas, Meat Loaf, Philip Seymour Hoffman, M.C. Gainey', 'PG-13', 'Jonas Nightengale is a fraudulent Christian faith healer who makes a living travelling around America holding revival meetings and conducting ''miracles'' with the help of his friend and manager, Jane, and their entourage.', 'Jonas Nightengale is a fraudulent Christian faith healer who makes a living travelling around America holding revival meetings and conducting ''miracles'' with the help of his friend and manager, Jane, and their entourage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqIKuwQYdvoKKGFjjEPdXlUKYvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12772'),
  ('1152011822945019725', 'Leap Year', 1924, 'Comedy', 'James Cruze', 'Walter Woods', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Lucien Littlefield, Mary Thurman, John McKinnon, Clarence Geldart, Harriet Hammond, Allen Durnell, Gertrude Short', 'NR', 'A young man, heir to his misogynistic and millionaire uncle, and in love with a nurse, gets in trouble when he gives advice on marriage to his girlfriends.', 'A young man, heir to his misogynistic and millionaire uncle, and in love with a nurse, gets in trouble when he gives advice on marriage to his girlfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK5Qnh2EBagSBVdSmL9vfIOuu2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175413'),
  ('456985672597871033', 'Leap Year', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Anand Tucker, Newton Thomas Sigel, Ben Howarth', 'Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont', 'Amy Adams, Matthew Goode, Adam Scott, John Lithgow, Noel O''Donovan, Tony Rohr, Pat Laffan, Alan Devlin', 'PG', 'When yet another anniversary passes without a marriage proposal from her boyfriend, Anna decides to take action. Aware of a Celtic tradition that allows women to pop the question on Feb. 29, she plans to follow her lover to Dublin and ask him to marry her. Fate has other plans, however, and Anna winds up on the other side of the Emerald Isle with handsome, but surly, Declan -- an Irishman who may just lead Anna down the road to true love.', 'When yet another anniversary passes without a marriage proposal from her boyfriend, Anna decides to take action. Aware of a Celtic tradition that allows women to pop the question on Feb. 29, she plans to follow her lover to Dublin and ask him to marry her. Fate has other plans, however, and Anna winds up on the other side of the Emerald Isle with handsome, but surly, Declan -- an Irishman who may just lead Anna down the road to true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i86hMi5iEF3WnYLCaGHdT5FPdYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25195'),
  ('1145160798589616158', 'Learn by Heart', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mathieu Vadepied, Bruno Romiguière, Ophélie Gelber', 'Olivier Demangel, Vincent Poymiro, Mathieu Vadepied', 'Balamine Guirassy, Ali Bidanessy, Guillaume Gouix, Joséphine de Meaux, Léontina Fall, Adama Camara, Aristide Tarnagda, Bakary Dramé', null, 'The film follows children growing up in the projects, where they juggle the pressures of school and street life.', 'The film follows children growing up in the projects, where they juggle the pressures of school and street life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufItSrWWGlhrHjVV1iK6cHBUNVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336653'),
  ('978187852733512629', 'Learning to Drive', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Isabel Coixet, Curtis Smith, Radium Cheung', 'Sarah Kernochan', 'Patricia Clarkson, Ben Kingsley, Jake Weber, Sarita Choudhury, Grace Gummer, Avi Nash, Samantha Bee, Matt Salinger', 'R', 'As her marriage dissolves, a Manhattan writer takes driving lessons from a Sikh instructor with marriage troubles of his own. In each other''s company they find the courage to get back on the road and the strength to take the wheel.', 'As her marriage dissolves, a Manhattan writer takes driving lessons from a Sikh instructor with marriage troubles of his own. In each other''s company they find the courage to get back on the road and the strength to take the wheel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7otPK1JLHl1Dte12vXvdfTMxBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284286'),
  ('273598062695678414', 'Learning to Lie', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hendrik Handloegten, Florian Hoffmeister', 'Hendrik Handloegten', 'Fabian Busch, Susanne Bormann, Fritzi Haberlandt, Sophie Rois, Anka Sarstedt, Birgit Minichmayr, Florian Lukas, Tino Mewes', null, '18-year-old school boy Helmut falls in love with fellow pupil Britta. He starts working for a Peace movement to get to know Britta. Britta, however, suddenly moves to San Francisco to live with her father and whilst there, finds a new boyfriend. Helmut studies, literature and politics in his home town and have a relationship with another girl from his former school, now studying medicine at the same university but they break up after having an affair with her roommate. Helmut begins a lot of short affairs with different women but still searches for his first girl.', '18-year-old school boy Helmut falls in love with fellow pupil Britta. He starts working for a Peace movement to get to know Britta. Britta, however, suddenly moves to San Francisco to live with her father and whilst there, finds a new boyfriend. Helmut studies, literature and politics in his home town and have a relationship with another girl from his former school, now studying medicine at the same university but they break up after having an affair with her roommate. Helmut begins a lot of short affairs with different women but still searches for his first girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8zlm6zE8NKgxCBr5UEOW17o488.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1558'),
  ('742239506900164428', 'Learning to Skateboard in a Warzone (If You''re a Girl)', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Carol Dysinger, Lisa Rinzler', null, 'Fatima, Kashida', null, 'The story of young Afghan girls learning to read, write and skateboard in Kabul.', 'The story of young Afghan girls learning to read, write and skateboard in Kabul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhTGumzgP0p6IaKfTWqBMu21lsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612074'),
  ('638203169265513974', 'Learning You', 2026, 'Drama', 'Tyler Sansom', 'Tyler Sansom, Brad J. Silverman, Justen Overlander, J Wayne Davidson', 'Caleb Milby, Stacy Haiduk, John Wells, Seth Phrampus, Daniel Roebuck', 'PG', 'When an architect embarks on a Christmas road trip with his autistic son, their journey of struggle and hope inspires a billionaire developer who has an autistic son of his own.', 'When an architect embarks on a Christmas road trip with his autistic son, their journey of struggle and hope inspires a billionaire developer who has an autistic son of his own.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd9916d0899b1e462e4ef9de4d4c804f3.jpg', 'plex:movie:learning-you'),
  ('796029958601494038', 'Lease on Love', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Michael Kennedy, Caitlin Russell, Juan Carlos Montalvo', 'Courtney Cilman', 'Rebecca Liddiard, Dan Jeannotte, Sarah Deakins, Morgan David Jones, Dorren Lee, Blair Williams, Nikki Grant, Valerie Boyle', 'G', 'Poppy is a marketing specialist whose life is turned upside down when she fakes an engagement with her boss’s handsome new client Milo, to win over her strict building manager and get Milo the penthouse suite. Will Poppy be rewarded with her dream promotion or will her ambitious plan backfire and jeopardize the engagement with her real fiancé?', 'Poppy is a marketing specialist whose life is turned upside down when she fakes an engagement with her boss’s handsome new client Milo, to win over her strict building manager and get Milo the penthouse suite. Will Poppy be rewarded with her dream promotion or will her ambitious plan backfire and jeopardize the engagement with her real fiancé?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGBujiJniTpSBPN76oKuK58IC8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971184'),
  ('778711500117818842', 'Leather Jacket Love Story', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Howard Wexler, David DeCoteau, Jerry Gibson', 'Rondo Mieczkowski', 'Sean Tataryn, Christopher Bradley, Geoff Moody, Héctor Mercado, Stephen J. McCarthy, Erin Krystle, Craig Olsen, Mink Stole', 'NR', 'Kyle is 18, an aspiring poet hoping to find inspiration by moving to the arty Silver Lake neighborhood of LA, and maybe love too. On day one, he finds a funky coffee shop, where he hopes to do some writing, but instead meets an older hunk.', 'Kyle is 18, an aspiring poet hoping to find inspiration by moving to the arty Silver Lake neighborhood of LA, and maybe love too. On day one, he finds a funky coffee shop, where he hopes to do some writing, but instead meets an older hunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk3206i9QJGp8icLqsRSiEK83CZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188870'),
  ('480006393982856875', 'Leather Jackets', 1992, 'Action, Drama', 'Lee Drysdale, Mike Dempsey, Wally Pfister', 'Lee Drysdale', 'D. B. Sweeney, Bridget Fonda, Cary Elwes, James Le Gros, Jon Polito, Neil Giuntoli, Marshall Bell, Chris Penn', 'R', 'Claudia, a girl who gets around, finally lands her dream man in Mickey. However, Mickey''s friend Dobbs spoils their nuptial plans when the thugs of a Vietnamese gangster that he has robbed, come looking for him. In order to save Dobbs, Mickey and Claudia, hide him in the boot of their car as they take off to LA. Things don''t go as smoothly as planned, and Mickey finds out more about his fiancée than he ever needs to know.', 'Claudia, a girl who gets around, finally lands her dream man in Mickey. However, Mickey''s friend Dobbs spoils their nuptial plans when the thugs of a Vietnamese gangster that he has robbed, come looking for him. In order to save Dobbs, Mickey and Claudia, hide him in the boot of their car as they take off to LA. Things don''t go as smoothly as planned, and Mickey finds out more about his fiancée than he ever needs to know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNkI9wHPQ2X5I06p8KyODx9CVvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235085'),
  ('662218413959098976', 'Leatherface', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Edis Seliminski, Alexandre Bustillo, Julien Maury', 'Seth M. Sherwood', 'Stephen Dorff, Vanessa Grasse, Sam Strike, Lili Taylor, James Bloor, Jessica Madsen, Sam Coleman, Lorina Kamburova', 'R', 'A young nurse is kidnapped by a group of violent teens who escape from a mental hospital and take her on the road trip from hell. Pursued by an equally deranged lawman out for revenge, one of the teens is destined for tragedy and horrors that will destroy his mind, moulding him into a monster named Leatherface.', 'A young nurse is kidnapped by a group of violent teens who escape from a mental hospital and take her on the road trip from hell. Pursued by an equally deranged lawman out for revenge, one of the teens is destined for tragedy and horrors that will destroy his mind, moulding him into a monster named Leatherface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nV7LPlyhUxKn5y0nuItCr8D1OSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300665'),
  ('781612781176375336', 'Leatherface: The Texas Chainsaw Massacre III', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Burr, James L. Carter', 'David J. Schow', 'Kate Hodge, Ken Foree, R.A. Mihailoff, William Butler, Viggo Mortensen, Joe Unger, Tom Everett, Miriam Byrd-Nethery', 'R', 'Two college students driving coast to coast are lured off the main highway and onto a deserted Texas road were they are stalked by the menacing Leatherface and his family.', 'Two college students driving coast to coast are lured off the main highway and onto a deserted Texas road were they are stalked by the menacing Leatherface and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Vhv0vRqirhvbudRcNctFgxoFtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25018'),
  ('19462477914768138', 'Leatherheads', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'George Clooney, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Duncan Brantley, Rick Reilly', 'George Clooney, Renée Zellweger, John Krasinski, Wayne Duvall, Stephen Root, Jonathan Pryce, Jack Thompson, Max Casella', 'PG-13', 'A light hearted comedy about the beginnings of Professional American Football. When a decorated war hero and college all star is tempted into playing professional football. Everyone see the chance to make some big money, but when a reporter digs up some dirt on the war hero... everyone could lose out.', 'A light hearted comedy about the beginnings of Professional American Football. When a decorated war hero and college all star is tempted into playing professional football. Everyone see the chance to make some big money, but when a reporter digs up some dirt on the war hero... everyone could lose out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dl2yu8iuwG3dqbpjalm2odadRaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4942'),
