  ('52432840669429635', 'Leave ''Em Laughing', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Reed Heustis', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Charlie Hall, Edgar Kennedy, Dorothy Coburn, Viola Richard, Tiny Sandford', null, 'Stan complains of a toothache and he and Ollie visit the dentist. Ollie gets his teeth pulled by mistake. Under the influence of laughing gas, they leave and cause much commotion on the road annoying a traffic cop.', 'Stan complains of a toothache and he and Ollie visit the dentist. Ollie gets his teeth pulled by mistake. Under the influence of laughing gas, they leave and cause much commotion on the road annoying a traffic cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpeMbnhKIgwMleMUmHmQgPDCto7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48823'),
