  ('96911083589883391', 'Leave It to Beaver', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Andy Cadiff, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Joe Connelly, Brian Levant', 'Christopher McDonald, Janine Turner, Cameron Finley, Erik von Detten, Adam Zolotin, Alan Rachins, Grace Phillips, Geoff Pierson', 'PG', 'The Cleavers are an all-American family living in Ohio – wise father Ward, loving mother June, teenage son Wally, and 8-year-old Theodore, better known as ''Beaver''. Beaver hopes to get a bike as a gift from his father and to please him tries out for his school football team and he makes it, only to be embarrassed. The bike he gets is quickly stolen. Meanwhile, Wally is trying to help his friend Eddie Haskell to get the heart of pretty classmate Karen, but Karen seems to like Wally more, and that leads to tensions between the friends.', 'The Cleavers are an all-American family living in Ohio – wise father Ward, loving mother June, teenage son Wally, and 8-year-old Theodore, better known as ''Beaver''. Beaver hopes to get a bike as a gift from his father and to please him tries out for his school football team and he makes it, only to be embarrassed. The bike he gets is quickly stolen. Meanwhile, Wally is trying to help his friend Eddie Haskell to get the heart of pretty classmate Karen, but Karen seems to like Wally more, and that leads to tensions between the friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBe7rCrImp9XxSGWTWAmYlPEXeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37244'),
  ('325738237693053706', 'Leave it to Kero!', 2000, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Masayuki Kojima, Hisao Shirai', 'Nanase Okawa', 'Aya Hisakawa, Yumi Touma, Sakura Tange, Issei Miyazaki, Junko Iwao, Megumi Ogata, Miwa Matsumoto, Motoko Kumai', null, 'Following the events of Cardcaptor Sakura Movie 2: The Sealed Card, Kero and Spinel share a plate of takoyaki (octopus balls). They get into a fight over who gets the last piece, and in the process send it flying out the window. They both chase the takoyaki, and each other, in a mighty effort to be the "takoyaki captor".', 'Following the events of Cardcaptor Sakura Movie 2: The Sealed Card, Kero and Spinel share a plate of takoyaki (octopus balls). They get into a fight over who gets the last piece, and in the process send it flying out the window. They both chase the takoyaki, and each other, in a mighty effort to be the "takoyaki captor".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iaqSEq8aqq8YP2Bozu3uKa9pgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322686'),
  ('781911320895401858', 'Leave It to Lucie!', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Aurélien Devaux', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Marie Gillain, Emmanuel Mouret, Dolores Chaplin, Georges Neri, Arnaud Simon, Natalia Romanenko, Delphine Zentout, Frédéric Niedermayer', null, 'Lucie makes her living selling bathing costumes on the beach at Marseilles. She would like that her ten-year long boyfriend, Lucien, becomes her best friend. But this requires truth. For Lucien, newly made secret agent who has to play a young idler, it is mission impossible. Even more so when a young american beauty will ask him to initiate her into sensual pleasures.', 'Lucie makes her living selling bathing costumes on the beach at Marseilles. She would like that her ten-year long boyfriend, Lucien, becomes her best friend. But this requires truth. For Lucien, newly made secret agent who has to play a young idler, it is mission impossible. Even more so when a young american beauty will ask him to initiate her into sensual pleasures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RvJjDJDkD6IUV6bTxH0D4WX0Xx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142408'),
  ('635876305328010319', 'Leave No Trace', 2018, 'Drama', 'Debra Granik, Scott Larkin, Michael McDonough', 'Debra Granik, Anne Rosellini', 'Thomasin McKenzie, Ben Foster, Jeff Kober, Dale Dickey, Dana Millican, Alyssa McKay, David Pittman, Bob Werfelman', 'PG', 'A father and daughter live a perfect but mysterious existence in Forest Park, a beautiful nature reserve near Portland, Oregon, rarely making contact with the world. But when a small mistake tips them off to authorities, they are sent on an increasingly erratic journey in search of a place to call their own.', 'A father and daughter live a perfect but mysterious existence in Forest Park, a beautiful nature reserve near Portland, Oregon, rarely making contact with the world. But when a small mistake tips them off to authorities, they are sent on an increasingly erratic journey in search of a place to call their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sygnLx3sZV5P8M2dyaGRegHdEL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443463'),
  ('121221010709123488', 'Leave No Traces', 2021, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Kacper Fertacz, Jan P. Matuszyński, Kacper Habisiak', 'Kaja Krawczyk-Wnuk', 'Tomasz Ziętek, Sandra Korzeniak, Jacek Braciak, Agnieszka Grochowska, Robert Więckiewicz, Tomasz Kot, Aleksandra Konieczna, Adam Bobik', null, 'In 1983, communist Poland is shaken by the case of high school student Grzegorz Przemyk, who is beaten to death by police. The only witness of the beating becomes the number one enemy of the state.', 'In 1983, communist Poland is shaken by the case of high school student Grzegorz Przemyk, who is beaten to death by police. The only witness of the beating becomes the number one enemy of the state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hc7hhghhS7cbhEm00oo2DkdwtyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788931'),
  ('378571834620865740', 'Leave One Day', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Amélie Bonnin, Marie Zoubian, Audrey Boitel', 'Amélie Bonnin, Dimitri Lucas', 'Juliette Armanet, Bastien Bouillon, François Rollin, Tewfik Jallab, Dominique Blanc, Mhamed Arezki, Pierre-Antoine Billon, Amandine Dewasmes', null, 'Cécile is about to open her own gourmet restaurant, finally making her dream come true, when suddenly her father has a heart attack and she is called back to the village where she was born. Far from the hubbub of Paris life, she runs into her teenage crush. The memories come flooding back, destabilizing her certainties.', 'Cécile is about to open her own gourmet restaurant, finally making her dream come true, when suddenly her father has a heart attack and she is called back to the village where she was born. Far from the hubbub of Paris life, she runs into her teenage crush. The memories come flooding back, destabilizing her certainties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txzzgq2Rviv2Ljxnbh9Fy6gfDId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277884'),
  ('373093197322781073', 'Leave the World Behind', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Tod Campbell, Heather Anderson, Peter Kohn', 'Sam Esmail', 'Julia Roberts, Ethan Hawke, Mahershala Ali, Myha''la, Farrah Mackenzie, Charlie Evans, Kevin Bacon, Vanessa Aspillaga', 'R', 'A family''s getaway to a luxurious rental home takes an ominous turn when a cyberattack knocks out their devices—and two strangers appear at their door.', 'A family''s getaway to a luxurious rental home takes an ominous turn when a cyberattack knocks out their devices—and two strangers appear at their door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29rhl1xopxA7JlGVVsf1UHfYPvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726209'),
  ('44607882451736670', 'Leave Us Alone', 1975, 'Drama', 'Ernst Johansen, Lasse Nielsen', 'Lasse Nielsen, Carsten Nielsen', 'Martin Højmark, Ole Meyer, Jens Wagn Rasmussen, Sven Hastel, Kenneth Nielsen, Søren Barnstein-Gercke, Tine Jensen, Anja Bærentzen', null, 'A group of summer camp kids, left to their own devices when their teachers stage a strike, go on a rampage of stealing and looting. A stolen boat brings them to an uninhabited island. When their boat drifts away, the marooned kids must fend for themselves.', 'A group of summer camp kids, left to their own devices when their teachers stage a strike, go on a rampage of stealing and looting. A stolen boat brings them to an uninhabited island. When their boat drifts away, the marooned kids must fend for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvNnddl3bXeu12umAGGf8oMeSyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204073'),
  ('759687245545788789', 'Leave Your Hands on My Hips', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chantal Lauby, Tetsuo Nagata', 'Chantal Lauby', 'Chantal Lauby, Claude Perron, Rossy de Palma, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Jean-Pierre Martins, Alain Chabat, Tatiana Gousseff, Dominique Farrugia', null, 'Odile is 42 years old actress and single mother. One day her 18 year old daughter decided to leave her and start living with the boyfriend. All of a sudden alone in her empty house, the anguish takes over...', 'Odile is 42 years old actress and single mother. One day her 18 year old daughter decided to leave her and start living with the boyfriend. All of a sudden alone in her empty house, the anguish takes over...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZDICcKmTE9Pr5OwBwggk8uqttx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49400'),
  ('924503637810922063', 'Leaves from Satan''s Book', 1920, 'Drama, History, Fantasy, Horror', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, George Schnéevoigt', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Edgar Høyer', 'Helge Nissen, Halvard Hoff, Jacob Texiere, Hallander Helleman, Ebon Strandin, Johannes Meyer, Nalle Halden, Tenna Kraft', null, 'The power of Satan is highlighted in four historical tales: the betrayal and subsequent arrest of Jesus, the Spanish Inquisition, the French Revolution and the execution of Marie Antoinette, and the Finnish War of Independence in 1918.', 'The power of Satan is highlighted in four historical tales: the betrayal and subsequent arrest of Jesus, the Spanish Inquisition, the French Revolution and the execution of Marie Antoinette, and the Finnish War of Independence in 1918.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kElKCJ7pv6egE52087VWwxOj1vD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35075'),
  ('567709022107950390', 'Leaves of Grass', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Tim Blake Nelson, Roberto Schaefer', 'Tim Blake Nelson', 'Edward Norton, Susan Sarandon, Richard Dreyfuss, Keri Russell, Melanie Lynskey, Lucy DeVito, Kent Jude Bernard, Amelia Campbell', 'R', 'An Ivy League professor returns home, where his pot-growing twin brother has concocted a plan to take down a local drug lord.', 'An Ivy League professor returns home, where his pot-growing twin brother has concocted a plan to take down a local drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkIfBUewNDrJYL0UlNsKRUKZJYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12834'),
  ('408707624682880617', 'Leaving', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Corsini, Agnès Godard', 'Catherine Corsini, Gaëlle Macé', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Sergi López, Yvan Attal, Bernard Blancan, Daisy Broom, Aladin Reibel, Alexandre Vidal, Berta Esquirol', null, 'A bourgeois housewife, planning to go back to work as a physiotherapist after having devoted 20 years to her husband and two children, has her comfortable, elegant life turned upside down when she falls for a Spanish builder and begins a runaway affair.', 'A bourgeois housewife, planning to go back to work as a physiotherapist after having devoted 20 years to her husband and two children, has her comfortable, elegant life turned upside down when she falls for a Spanish builder and begins a runaway affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJuIGigEH7YqIkHqHgJTxUs21Nq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43619'),
  ('379558149064084279', 'Leaving Afghanistan', 2019, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Irina Lavrentieva, Nikita Semenov, Pavel Stasenko', 'Pavel Lungin, Alexandr Lungin', 'Kirill Pirogov, Yan Tsapnik, Vitaly Kishchenko, Fyodor Lavrov, Oleg Vasilkov, Anton Momot, Mikhail Kremer, Kirill Ermichev', null, '1988-1989. The end of the Soviet-Afghan war. The USSR begins its withdrawal from Afghanistan. Soviet General Vasiliev''s son - a pilot named Alexander gets kidnapped by the mujahideen after his airplane crashes. As a result the 108th motorized infantry division''s long awaited return home gets put on hold for one last mission: bring the General''s son back. Based on true events the previously untold story of the courageous and tragic withdrawal campaign (through the Salang pass) reveals the danger the horror and the complexity of human nature during wartime.', '1988-1989. The end of the Soviet-Afghan war. The USSR begins its withdrawal from Afghanistan. Soviet General Vasiliev''s son - a pilot named Alexander gets kidnapped by the mujahideen after his airplane crashes. As a result the 108th motorized infantry division''s long awaited return home gets put on hold for one last mission: bring the General''s son back. Based on true events the previously untold story of the courageous and tragic withdrawal campaign (through the Salang pass) reveals the danger the horror and the complexity of human nature during wartime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DNZnzuLzUCIcfQZZz4gT7epvx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512954'),
  ('633152574727206936', 'Leaving Jerusalem by Railway', 1897, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'Lasting for roughly 50 seconds, it shows the goodbyes of many passersby - first Europeans, then local Arab residents, then Jewish residents of the city - as a train leaves Jerusalem, then part of the Ottoman Empire.', 'Lasting for roughly 50 seconds, it shows the goodbyes of many passersby - first Europeans, then local Arab residents, then Jewish residents of the city - as a train leaves Jerusalem, then part of the Ottoman Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfwUZZ0UJolrCVR2UvpVdCpj2h1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178985'),
  ('336168817485839731', 'Leaving Las Vegas', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Declan Quinn, Mike Figgis, Gary Marcus', 'Mike Figgis', 'Nicolas Cage, Elisabeth Shue, Julian Sands, Richard Lewis, Steven Weber, Kim Adams, Emily Procter, Stuart Regen', 'R', 'Ben Sanderson, an alcoholic Hollywood screenwriter who lost everything because of his drinking, arrives in Las Vegas to drink himself to death. There, he meets and forms an uneasy friendship and non-interference pact with prostitute Sera.', 'Ben Sanderson, an alcoholic Hollywood screenwriter who lost everything because of his drinking, arrives in Las Vegas to drink himself to death. There, he meets and forms an uneasy friendship and non-interference pact with prostitute Sera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTrFpGe3U65kXTldIUxuM2hmOAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451'),
  ('863578784407219930', 'Leaving Neverland: ProSieben Spezial', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Dan Reed', null, 'Michael Jackson, Wade Robson, Joe Robson, Chantal Robson, James Safechuck, Stephanie Safechuck, Macaulay Culkin, Lisa Marie Presley', null, 'The world is talking about ''Leaving Neverland. In our ProSieben special, we ask questions that the documentary doesn''t, and look at the most important moments in the life of the superstar. In addition, we explore the question of how the new allegations change the view of Michael Jackson''s overall work. This helps to classify the special documentary ''Leaving Neverland''.', 'The world is talking about ''Leaving Neverland. In our ProSieben special, we ask questions that the documentary doesn''t, and look at the most important moments in the life of the superstar. In addition, we explore the question of how the new allegations change the view of Michael Jackson''s overall work. This helps to classify the special documentary ''Leaving Neverland''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxKsaLxUk8twCYSDp6nAaU0SMrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594404'),
  ('786045592795014107', 'Leaving Normal', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Edward Zwick, Ralf D. Bode, Ken Rabehl', 'Ed Solomon', 'Christine Lahti, Meg Tilly, Patrika Darbo, Lenny Von Dohlen, Maury Chaykin, Brett Cullen, James Gammon, Eve Gordon', null, 'Darly, a waitress with a past that''s weighing her down, decides to drive to Alaska to try and come to terms with her unfortunate history. Along the way, she meets Marianne, an impulsive young woman leaving an abusive relationship. The two hit the road together and keep driving north, bonding over the hardships that they have endured and meeting a number of eccentric characters as they get closer to their destination.', 'Darly, a waitress with a past that''s weighing her down, decides to drive to Alaska to try and come to terms with her unfortunate history. Along the way, she meets Marianne, an impulsive young woman leaving an abusive relationship. The two hit the road together and keep driving north, bonding over the hardships that they have endured and meeting a number of eccentric characters as they get closer to their destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZWTFb1eT9CL8GePAilkRyB8Zut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54715'),
