  ('828259731846312306', 'Lee Rock II', 1991, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lawrence Ah Mon', 'Chan Man-Keung', 'Andy Lau, Aaron Kwok, Sharla Cheung, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Paul Chun Pui, James Tien Chun, Michael Chan Wai-Man', null, 'Lee Rock is now the most powerful person in the police force, but he chooses to retreat, because he knows the rules of the power struggle.', 'Lee Rock is now the most powerful person in the police force, but he chooses to retreat, because he knows the rules of the power struggle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D82CDZWXdgbTilqkLoIr9M2vPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358306'),
  ('950971380069210979', 'Lee''s Adventures', 2009, 'Animation, Drama', 'Li Yang', 'Li Yang', 'Li Yang, DEERPLAY', null, 'A video game nerd must beat through the game in order to time travel and meet his ex-girlfriend once more before they were apart.', 'A video game nerd must beat through the game in order to time travel and meet his ex-girlfriend once more before they were apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRgmEuOLYgFhkpFRRyNFDMheCag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612027'),
  ('851183739809418943', 'Lee''s Adventures', 2011, 'Fantasy, Romance, Adventure', 'Frant Gwo, Li Yang, Liu Yin', 'Frant Gwo, Zhang Xiaobei, Wang Jiawei', 'Jaycee Chan, Wang Ziwen, Jiang Wu, Yao Lu, Fan Ming, Koji Yano, You Benchang, Tony Chan', null, 'Lee suffers from Time Perception Disorder (TPD), a rare psychological illness that makes one unable to judge the length of time. Lee holds a boring job and his biggest interest is to play video games. That is a hobby inspired by Lee’s uncle, who left Lee a mysterious video game disc. His uncle claims that anyone who beats the game would open the door of time travel. Lee’s life dramatically changed when Wang Qian steps into his life. Wang Qian also suffers from TPD so she understands Lee more than anyone else does. Their romance blooms and the two decide to be together. Unfortunately, tragedy strikes and the happy days end abruptly. Wang Qian is killed in a traffic accident after Lee quarrelled with her. Lee’s world collapses. Feeling extremely guilty and desperate, he suddenly comes up with a crazy idea: Beat the video game his uncle left, open the door to time travel and save his girl. From that point on Lee embarks on an amazing journey.', 'Lee suffers from Time Perception Disorder (TPD), a rare psychological illness that makes one unable to judge the length of time. Lee holds a boring job and his biggest interest is to play video games. That is a hobby inspired by Lee’s uncle, who left Lee a mysterious video game disc. His uncle claims that anyone who beats the game would open the door of time travel. Lee’s life dramatically changed when Wang Qian steps into his life. Wang Qian also suffers from TPD so she understands Lee more than anyone else does. Their romance blooms and the two decide to be together. Unfortunately, tragedy strikes and the happy days end abruptly. Wang Qian is killed in a traffic accident after Lee quarrelled with her. Lee’s world collapses. Feeling extremely guilty and desperate, he suddenly comes up with a crazy idea: Beat the video game his uncle left, open the door to time travel and save his girl. From that point on Lee embarks on an amazing journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJgsJRZpDHibgu24xmzuMBOHfsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133466'),
  ('711386096087304116', 'Leeches!', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David DeCoteau, Gary Graver', 'Michael Gingold', 'Matthew Twining, Josh Henderson, Stacey Nelson, Alexandra Westmore, Michael Lutz, Charity Rahmer, Maya Parish, Stephen Sowan', 'R', 'When a crop of doped-up athletes from the Lakecrest College swim team dive into the campus lake to blow off some steam, the bloodsucking leeches below the surface undergo a stunning transformation. After ingesting small amounts of the swimmers'' steroid-laced blood, the slimy creatures grow to unusual sizes and set out to sink their teeth into an unsuspecting student population.', 'When a crop of doped-up athletes from the Lakecrest College swim team dive into the campus lake to blow off some steam, the bloodsucking leeches below the surface undergo a stunning transformation. After ingesting small amounts of the swimmers'' steroid-laced blood, the slimy creatures grow to unusual sizes and set out to sink their teeth into an unsuspecting student population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YPdv12dBSbbtEXRhPtjxm09rOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34737'),
  ('954437655449112607', 'Left Bank', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Eddy Stevesyns, Pieter Van Hees', 'Dimitri Karakatsanis', 'Eline Kuppens, Matthias Schoenaerts, Sien Eggers, Marilou Mermans, Frank Vercruyssen, Robbie Cleiren, Tom Dewispelaere, Ruth Becquart', 'NR', 'When Marie moves into her boyfriend''s apartment, she uncovers a disturbing mystery about the fate of the previous tenant.', 'When Marie moves into her boyfriend''s apartment, she uncovers a disturbing mystery about the fate of the previous tenant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZgQhrl7Jso80Eoj9lFBStkREW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12135'),
  ('127738260292863037', 'Left Behind', 2000, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Vic Sarin, George Tirl', 'Alan B. McElroy, Paul Lalonde, Joe Goodman', 'Kirk Cameron, Brad Johnson, Janaya Stephens, Clarence Gilyard Jr., Colin Fox, Gordon Currie, Chelsea Noble, Daniel Pilon', 'PG-13', 'After learning that millions have completely vanished, an airline pilot, a journalist, and others work together to unravel the mystery of those left behind.', 'After learning that millions have completely vanished, an airline pilot, a journalist, and others work together to unravel the mystery of those left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kT3kifA8Xwkjm1YmSubTw1GwK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37302'),
  ('936233903102132087', 'Left Behind', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Vic Armstrong, Jack N. Green, Matthew Gatlin', 'Paul Lalonde, John Patus', 'Nicolas Cage, Chad Michael Murray, Lea Thompson, Nicky Whelan, Martin Klebba, Quinton Aaron, Jordin Sparks, Gary Grubbs', 'PG-13', 'A small group of survivors are left behind after millions of people suddenly vanish during the rapture and the world is plunged into chaos and destruction.', 'A small group of survivors are left behind after millions of people suddenly vanish during the rapture and the world is plunged into chaos and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9Q2WR62yB5Aq0hd6kyRFS9cc3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218043'),
  ('36494472930890477', 'Left Behind II: Tribulation Force', 2002, 'Fantasy, Drama, Thriller', 'Bill Corcoran, Michael Storey', 'John Patus, Paul Lalonde', 'Kirk Cameron, Brad Johnson, Clarence Gilyard Jr., Janaya Stephens, Gordon Currie, Chelsea Noble, Krista Bridges, Lubomir Mykytiuk', 'PG-13', 'After millions vanish, a group of people must band together to form the Tribulation Force and prepare themselves for the worst seven years the planet has ever seen.', 'After millions vanish, a group of people must band together to form the Tribulation Force and prepare themselves for the worst seven years the planet has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4R0xYkKIOInESYvQcnODukSz5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29229'),
  ('387569156478982753', 'Left Behind: Rise of the Antichrist', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Kevin Sorbo, Jayson Therrien, Charles Hamilton', 'Paul Lalonde, Jessica Parker, John Patus', 'Kevin Sorbo, Neal McDonough, Corbin Bernsen, Bailey Chase, Sarah Fisher, Sam Sorbo, Kathryn Kohut, Greg Perrow', 'PG-13', 'After millions of people vanish and the world falls into chaos, a charismatic leader rises to lead the UN. However, his intentions are more sinister than they appear.', 'After millions of people vanish and the world falls into chaos, a charismatic leader rises to lead the UN. However, his intentions are more sinister than they appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Yn4lvksfagrwH5FARlRXkeJWR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008903'),
  ('786158183241065429', 'Left Behind: World at War', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Craig R. Baxley, David Connell', 'Paul Lalonde, Peter Lalonde, André van Heerden', 'Louis Gossett Jr., Kirk Cameron, Brad Johnson, Jessica Steen, Gordon Currie, Janaya Stephens, Chelsea Noble, Laura Catalano', 'PG-13', 'A year and a half ago, the globe was hit with the biggest catastrophe it had ever seen. Without warning and without explanation, hundreds of millions simply vanished off the face of the Earth. The world was in chaos like never before. Yet somehow one man seemed to rise to the challenge. One man had the strength and conviction to unite a shattered world. One man gave the world hope. That man was Nicolae Carpathia, who now rules the entire world.', 'A year and a half ago, the globe was hit with the biggest catastrophe it had ever seen. Without warning and without explanation, hundreds of millions simply vanished off the face of the Earth. The world was in chaos like never before. Yet somehow one man seemed to rise to the challenge. One man had the strength and conviction to unite a shattered world. One man gave the world hope. That man was Nicolae Carpathia, who now rules the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSkkofYLcjFSkb2o3rZuUBWu92P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38828'),
  ('525595910780357497', 'Left Foot Right Foot', 2013, 'Drama', 'Germinal Roaux', 'Marianne Brun, Aude Py, Germinal Roaux', 'Agathe Schlencker, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Dimitri Stapfer, Mathilde Bisson, Stanislas Merhar', null, 'The loss of youth and innocence can be played for comedy or tragedy. The stunning black-and-white cinematography and hypnotic electric guitar that fill "Left Foot Right Foot", as portentous as they are beautiful, are a pretty clear indication which side of the coin photographer Germinal Roaux intends to focus on in his first feature.', 'The loss of youth and innocence can be played for comedy or tragedy. The stunning black-and-white cinematography and hypnotic electric guitar that fill "Left Foot Right Foot", as portentous as they are beautiful, are a pretty clear indication which side of the coin photographer Germinal Roaux intends to focus on in his first feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mddvRtrfySa93HC9pwTVgvo3R9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248692'),
  ('1030541903269633441', 'Left for Dead', 2007, 'Western, Action, Horror', 'Albert Pyun, Alejandro Millán', 'Chad Leslie', 'Victoria Maurette, Andrés Bagg, María Alché, Javier De la Vega, Janet Bar, Soledad Arocena, Adnen Helali, Oliver Kolker', 'R', 'Set in Mexico, Left For Dead is a bloody and sick dream ... A spaghetti western in terror. A desperate criminal will be caught in the ghost town of Amnesty alongside a vengeful demon ...', 'Set in Mexico, Left For Dead is a bloody and sick dream ... A spaghetti western in terror. A desperate criminal will be caught in the ghost town of Amnesty alongside a vengeful demon ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnbD44UZqQfgcE1RF7AALBzTwzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128598'),
  ('980659640203511519', 'Left High And Dry', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joe Rendón', 'Joe Rendón', 'Regina Blandón, José María de Tavira, Martín Altomaro, Damayanti Quintanar, Ricardo Polanco, Juan Lecanda, Marianna Burelli, Martha Claudia Moreno', null, 'A man is left at the altar by his bride, so his two cousins decide to bring him to the place they used to go on vacation when they were kids.', 'A man is left at the altar by his bride, so his two cousins decide to bring him to the place they used to go on vacation when they were kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzfEOHREJ6k63CJe6vypvgC0fzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554569'),
  ('1063488273946158999', 'Left in Darkness', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steven R. Monroe, Matthew Heckerling', 'Philip Daay, Jane Whitney', 'Monica Keena, David Anders, Tim Thomerson, Chris Engen, Tarah Paige, Jessica Stroup, Travis Van Winkle, Eric Ladin', 'NR', 'Celia has had a rough life, with a mother who died in childbirth and a father who disappeared. Unfortunately for Celia, death is not any easier than life. When she is drugged and raped at a frat party, Celia dies from an overdose, and must battle the terrible Soul Eaters who roam the afterlife.', 'Celia has had a rough life, with a mother who died in childbirth and a father who disappeared. Unfortunately for Celia, death is not any easier than life. When she is drugged and raped at a frat party, Celia dies from an overdose, and must battle the terrible Soul Eaters who roam the afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7Ieigd4wDSCIb590NmAmCtklfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55660'),
  ('538262259184632345', 'Left Luggage', 1998, 'Drama', 'Jeroen Krabbé, Walther van den Ende', 'Edwin de Vries', 'Laura Fraser, Adam Monty, Isabella Rossellini, Jeroen Krabbé, David Bradley, Marianne Sägebrecht, Maximilian Schell, Chaim Topol', null, 'While escaping from Nazis during the WWII, a Jewish man dug suitcases full of things dear to his heart in the ground two. The war deprived him of his family, and afterwards he endlessly turns over the soil of Antwerp to find the suitcases, which makes him look obsessed. He keeps checking old maps and keeps digging, trying to find, in fact, those he lost. His daughter Chaya is a beautiful modern girl looking for a part-time job. She finds a place as a nanny in the strictly observant Chassidic family with many children, although her secular manners clearly fly in the face of many commandments. One of the reasons she is accepted is that mother of the family is absolutely overburdened by the household, so she stays despite the resistance of the father, normally - an indisputable authority in the family. She develops a special bond with the youngest of the boys, four-year old Simcha, so far incapable of speaking.', 'While escaping from Nazis during the WWII, a Jewish man dug suitcases full of things dear to his heart in the ground two. The war deprived him of his family, and afterwards he endlessly turns over the soil of Antwerp to find the suitcases, which makes him look obsessed. He keeps checking old maps and keeps digging, trying to find, in fact, those he lost. His daughter Chaya is a beautiful modern girl looking for a part-time job. She finds a place as a nanny in the strictly observant Chassidic family with many children, although her secular manners clearly fly in the face of many commandments. One of the reasons she is accepted is that mother of the family is absolutely overburdened by the household, so she stays despite the resistance of the father, normally - an indisputable authority in the family. She develops a special bond with the youngest of the boys, four-year old Simcha, so far incapable of speaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcG3g4yblcJC2OlPqYX7Mi54C3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53119'),
  ('320082846869991496', 'Left Right and Centre', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sidney Gilliat, Gerald Gibbs', 'Sidney Gilliat', 'Ian Carmichael, Patricia Bredin, Eric Barker, Richard Wattis, Alastair Sim, Moyra Fraser, Jack Hedley, Gordon Harker', null, 'At the Earndale by-election natural history expert and TV personality Bob Wilcot for the Conservatives finds himself up against Billingsgate girl Stella Stoker for the socialists. Amateur politician against committed activist. But could it become boy-who-fancies-girl against girl-who-fancies-boy? The party agents are soon colluding against such a disaster.', 'At the Earndale by-election natural history expert and TV personality Bob Wilcot for the Conservatives finds himself up against Billingsgate girl Stella Stoker for the socialists. Amateur politician against committed activist. But could it become boy-who-fancies-girl against girl-who-fancies-boy? The party agents are soon colluding against such a disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXzPnhQuuYC0cOvXLUo3Dvmuhl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155405'),
  ('496859583183541466', 'Left-Handed Fate', 1966, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Vicente Aranda, Aurelio G. Larraya, Carlos Durán', 'Vicente Aranda, Gonzalo Suárez', 'Teresa Gimpera, Marianne Benet, Marcos Martí, Antonio Ferrandis, Alberto Dalbés, Antonio Casas, Glòria Roig, Josep Castillo', null, 'Gim, an attractive advertising model, decides to face her destiny and confront a mysterious serial killer who relentlessly pursues the most beautiful women in a disturbingly empty city.', 'Gim, an attractive advertising model, decides to face her destiny and confront a mysterious serial killer who relentlessly pursues the most beautiful women in a disturbingly empty city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhxdxI54uT6C9W3EClrUJP7F8MR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107370'),
  ('1023202644351097431', 'Left-Handed Girl', 2025, 'Drama', 'Tsou Shih-ching, Chen Ko-chin, Kao Tzu-hao', 'Sean Baker, Tsou Shih-ching', 'Ma Shih-yuan, Janel Tsai, Nina Ye, Brando Huang, Akio Chen, Chao Xin-yan, Hsia Teng-hung, Alvin Lin', 'R', 'A mother and her two daughters move to Taipei to open a noodle stand at a vibrant night market, but family secrets and tradition test their fresh start.', 'A mother and her two daughters move to Taipei to open a noodle stand at a vibrant night market, but family secrets and tradition test their fresh start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXlEThtgrTVtQEw1HQ9Qp8I1A3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999075'),
  ('538614283508172120', 'Lefter: The Story of the Ordinarius', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Can Ulkay', 'Ayse Ilker Turgut', 'Erdem Kaynarca, Aslıhan Malbora, Deniz Işın, Aslihan Gurbuz, Halit Ergenç, Taner Barlas, Hamdi Alkan, Bora Akkaş', null, 'A football prodigy rises to fame, battling prejudice and inner turmoil on his quest for greatness. Based on the life of Turkish legend, Lefter.', 'A football prodigy rises to fame, battling prejudice and inner turmoil on his quest for greatness. Based on the life of Turkish legend, Lefter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKy6RsLEC7lloTcHPETgbaAQApq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1386792'),
  ('169105140586127317', 'Leftie', 2003, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Carlos Salcés, Chuy Chávez', 'Hubert Barrero', 'Álex Perea, Alejandro Camacho, Arcelia Ramírez, Giovani Florido, Guillermo Gil, Esteban Soberanes, Eugenio Derbez, Regina Blandón', null, 'Futuristic movie about Alejandro, a gifted left-handed child marble player who must win a competition as the entire town''s hopes - and money - rest on him.', 'Futuristic movie about Alejandro, a gifted left-handed child marble player who must win a competition as the entire town''s hopes - and money - rest on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osU4eBM9Ziy05xZ50DVdbbUmgb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204251'),
  ('812689963491927542', 'Leftover Women', 2019, 'Documentary, Drama, Romance', 'Shosh Shlam, Hilla Medalia, Fan Jian', 'Shosh Shlam, Hilla Medalia', 'Qiu Hua Mei, Xu Min, Gai Qi', null, 'In China, single women are under immense pressure to marry young or face the stigma that comes with being "leftover." Leftover Women follows three hopeful singles seeking to define love on their own terms.', 'In China, single women are under immense pressure to marry young or face the stigma that comes with being "leftover." Leftover Women follows three hopeful singles seeking to define love on their own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXfVyiUxs633sWg52yc1wcdK8UM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597613'),
  ('642162621195205897', 'Legacy', 2006, 'Drama', 'Tariel Meliava, Gela Babluani, Temur Babluani', 'Gela Babluani, Temur Babluani', 'Sylvie Testud, Stanislas Merhar, Olga Legrand, Pascal Bongard, Giorgi Babluani, Leo Gaparidze, Augustin Legrand, Levan Uchaneishvili', null, 'Three French hipsters and their translator travel through rural Georgia to claim a remote, ruined castle that one of them has inherited. En route, they encounter an old man and his grandchild who are on a journey to carry out a mysterious, morbid ritual designed to end a conflict between warring clans.', 'Three French hipsters and their translator travel through rural Georgia to claim a remote, ruined castle that one of them has inherited. En route, they encounter an old man and his grandchild who are on a journey to carry out a mysterious, morbid ritual designed to end a conflict between warring clans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEvPEvJ509tspJCjYBi086fwLTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148853'),
  ('1020133069480304590', 'Legacy', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jason Dudek, Joseph M. Setele, Greg Webb', 'Samantha Silver, Jason Dudek', 'Haylie Duff, Madeline Zima, Monica Lo Suk-Yee, Brett Claywell, Kate Albrecht, Jane Sibbett, Donnell Rawlings, Bret Ernst', null, 'When a geeky, overweight rushee is found dead at the hottest sorority on the campus, the three most popular girls of the house are prime suspects.', 'When a geeky, overweight rushee is found dead at the hottest sorority on the campus, the three most popular girls of the house are prime suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtc945BjW8vqSnYtQXlKOtK2U6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31590'),
  ('557356331565983936', 'Legacy', 2020, 'Action', 'R. Ellis Frazier', 'Robert Orr', 'Luke Goss, Louis Mandylor, Roberto ''Sanz'' Sanchez, Elya Baskin, Audrey De León, Marshal Hilton, Mark Krenik, Ian Sharp', null, 'While on a hunting trip in the isolated wilderness, a father and his adopted teenage son are turned into the prey of unknown assailants. They are unexpectedly joined in their fight for survival by a stranger who reveals the disturbing truth about the son''s biological father, an international crime lord, and why that crime lord has sent trained assassins to kill the teenager.', 'While on a hunting trip in the isolated wilderness, a father and his adopted teenage son are turned into the prey of unknown assailants. They are unexpectedly joined in their fight for survival by a stranger who reveals the disturbing truth about the son''s biological father, an international crime lord, and why that crime lord has sent trained assassins to kill the teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVmhj0GviejGyPucs2JkyJ3NdZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696007'),
  ('1062794895172238855', 'Legacy', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand', 'Franck Courchamp, Michael Pitiot, Isabelle Delannoy', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand', null, 'Ten years after the film Home (2009), Yann Arthus-Bertrand looks back, with Legacy, on his life and fifty years of commitment. It''s his most personal film. The photographer and director tells the story of nature and man. He also reveals a suffering planet and the ecological damage caused by man. He finally invites us to reconcile with nature and proposes several solutions', 'Ten years after the film Home (2009), Yann Arthus-Bertrand looks back, with Legacy, on his life and fifty years of commitment. It''s his most personal film. The photographer and director tells the story of nature and man. He also reveals a suffering planet and the ecological damage caused by man. He finally invites us to reconcile with nature and proposes several solutions', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ef25ocE4tyCuOexDwZBSNMqQ8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790547'),
  ('49710688777016691', 'Legacy of Blood', 1978, 'Horror', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan', 'Andy Milligan', 'Elaine Boies, Louise Gallandra, Jeannie Cusick, Dale Hansen, Stan Schwartz, Peter Barcia, Joe Downing, Marilee Troncone', null, 'Horror movie about three wicked sisters and their equally unsavory husbands who all arrive at a remote inn where they mean to attend the reading of their uncle''s will. One by one, the heirs are dispatched by an unknown killer.', 'Horror movie about three wicked sisters and their equally unsavory husbands who all arrive at a remote inn where they mean to attend the reading of their uncle''s will. One by one, the heirs are dispatched by an unknown killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXM4CTqmjwrtIm7Ixn34jI7Bs9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77109'),
  ('1056800564793590892', 'Legacy of Lies', 2020, 'Thriller, Action', 'Novruz Hikmet, Yanina Kucher, Adrian Bol', 'Adrian Bol', 'Scott Adkins, Honor Kneafsey, Martin McDougall, Yuliia Sobol, Anna Butkevych, Sergey Kalantay, Andrea Vasiliou, Tom Ashley', null, 'An ex-MI6 agent is thrown back into the world of espionage and high stakes to uncover the shocking truth about operations conducted by unknown secret services.', 'An ex-MI6 agent is thrown back into the world of espionage and high stakes to uncover the shocking truth about operations conducted by unknown secret services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhNHCeJDFDaB00A46AoCw2mggdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601165'),
  ('711685774553340690', 'Legacy of Rage', 1986, 'Action, Crime', 'James Chan Hau-Ming, Ronny Yu', 'Raymond Fung Sai-Hung, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum', 'Brandon Lee, Michael Wong, Regina Kent, Mang Hoi, Kirk Wong Chi-Keung, Ku Feng, Chu Hak, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho', null, 'A man is framed for murder by his drug-dealing best friend who covets his girlfriend, leading to eight years in jail and a vow of revenge upon release.', 'A man is framed for murder by his drug-dealing best friend who covets his girlfriend, leading to eight years in jail and a vow of revenge upon release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJl59Cb60xLRYTM0AQlSMLi1w6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68590'),
