  ('554867240654551622', 'Legacy of the Incas', 1965, 'Adventure, Western', 'Georg Marischka, Federico Cianfarini, Winfried Groth', 'Winfried Groth, Georg Marischka, Franz Marischka', 'Guy Madison, Rik Battaglia, Fernando Rey, William Rothlein, Francisco Rabal, Heinz Erhardt, Chris Howland, Walter Giller', null, 'During the 1800s, Peru''s government sends 2 envoys to negotiate peace with the rebellious Incas but a treasure-hunter bandit shoots the Inca ruler and his son, leaving the 2 envoys to take the blame for it.', 'During the 1800s, Peru''s government sends 2 envoys to negotiate peace with the rebellious Incas but a treasure-hunter bandit shoots the Inca ruler and his son, leaving the 2 envoys to take the blame for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXurAIlzknixzUnBFMu4GBRYjnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72573'),
  ('1027068781516542197', 'Legacy Peak', 2022, 'Adventure, Family', 'Aaron Burns, Ryan Spacone', 'Aaron Burns, Matt Mikalatos', 'Lucas Black, Ina Barrón, Todd Terry, Kyleigh Bakker, Roman Engel', 'PG', 'Jason, a man with no parenting experience, is on an adventure to win the hearts of his fiancé''s skeptical kids before they marry. The plan for them to fly to her parent''s remote cabin days before she wraps up work quickly falls apart and the adventure turns to a struggle to survive before this new family can start a life together.', 'Jason, a man with no parenting experience, is on an adventure to win the hearts of his fiancé''s skeptical kids before they marry. The plan for them to fly to her parent''s remote cabin days before she wraps up work quickly falls apart and the adventure turns to a struggle to survive before this new family can start a life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bYsVSeRCCdQpXxsgNPb5A6UyUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028493'),
  ('737397604542298536', 'Legal Aid', 2009, 'Thriller', 'Hannelore Cayre, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Hannelore Cayre', 'Roschdy Zem, Mathias Mlekuz, Sophie Guillemin, Jean-Pierre Martins, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Brigitte Virtudes, Jacky Nercessian, Jean-Claude Montheil', null, 'At the age of forty, Antoine Lahoud is still defending petty criminals who are entitled only to legal aid. He still has a quixotic notion of his mission but, lately, his little income and his arduous working conditions have been eroding his idealism. So, when Henry Marsac, a leading (but seemingly corrupt), professional colleague, offers him to work on bigger and more lucrative cases, he ends up accepting. Little does he know what Marsac is up to...', 'At the age of forty, Antoine Lahoud is still defending petty criminals who are entitled only to legal aid. He still has a quixotic notion of his mission but, lately, his little income and his arduous working conditions have been eroding his idealism. So, when Henry Marsac, a leading (but seemingly corrupt), professional colleague, offers him to work on bigger and more lucrative cases, he ends up accepting. Little does he know what Marsac is up to...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkCBI8j42bj4nj7k8YjGVqZA4hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17659'),
  ('795569977899405424', 'Legal Eagles', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ivan Reitman, László Kovács, Linda Conaway-Parsloe', 'Jim Cash, Jack Epps Jr.', 'Robert Redford, Debra Winger, Daryl Hannah, Brian Dennehy, Terence Stamp, Steven Hill, David Clennon, John McMartin', 'PG', 'District Attorney Tom Logan is set for higher office, at least until he becomes involved with defence lawyer Laura Kelly and her unpredictable client Chelsea Deardon. It seems the least of Chelsea''s crimes is the theft of a very valuable painting, but as the women persuade Logan to investigate further and to cut some official corners, a much more sinister scenario starts to emerge.', 'District Attorney Tom Logan is set for higher office, at least until he becomes involved with defence lawyer Laura Kelly and her unpredictable client Chelsea Deardon. It seems the least of Chelsea''s crimes is the theft of a very valuable painting, but as the women persuade Logan to investigate further and to cut some official corners, a much more sinister scenario starts to emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZKGkQ9rpMyQ75sbdLnpmiM3m73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9930'),
  ('608927731050708479', 'Legal High 2 SP', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Junichi Ishikawa', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masato Sakai, Yui Aragaki, Masahiro Higashide, Ayame Goriki, Michiko Kichise, Nao Omori, Kōtarō Satomi, Junnosuke Taguchi', null, 'Attorneys Kensuke Komikado and Machiko Mayuzumi receive a request from a general hospital. They go up against veteran attorney Kazuma Kujou who is trying to extract money from the general hospital by a medical malpractice lawsuit.', 'Attorneys Kensuke Komikado and Machiko Mayuzumi receive a request from a general hospital. They go up against veteran attorney Kazuma Kujou who is trying to extract money from the general hospital by a medical malpractice lawsuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9opE2XvMVjwvU3YGMKBIGYhdMt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527056'),
  ('363220568811547283', 'Legal High SP', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Junichi Ishikawa', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masato Sakai, Yui Aragaki, Katsuhisa Namase, Eiko Koike, Junnosuke Taguchi, Nana Eikura, Hirosue Ryoko, Kinya Kitaoji', null, 'Kazuhiko Kogure, who is a 2nd grade student in middle school, falls off from one of the school''s rooftop. There were other male students on the roof when Kazuhiko Kogure fell off. According to the other students there, Kazuhiko Kogure tried to jump to another school building, but missed. Fortunately, Kazuhiko Kogure only fractured his leg and ribs. According to Kazuhiko Kogure''s mother Hidemi, the school insists it was students playing around and did not involve bullying. Hidemi though, doesn''t believe it, because Kazuhiko Kogure has a fear of heights. Hidemi goes to see attorney Machiko Mayuzumi and Machiko decides to take her case, but she asks for fellow attorney Kensuke Komikado''s help. Meanwhile, the school hires attorney Teshigahara Isao.', 'Kazuhiko Kogure, who is a 2nd grade student in middle school, falls off from one of the school''s rooftop. There were other male students on the roof when Kazuhiko Kogure fell off. According to the other students there, Kazuhiko Kogure tried to jump to another school building, but missed. Fortunately, Kazuhiko Kogure only fractured his leg and ribs. According to Kazuhiko Kogure''s mother Hidemi, the school insists it was students playing around and did not involve bullying. Hidemi though, doesn''t believe it, because Kazuhiko Kogure has a fear of heights. Hidemi goes to see attorney Machiko Mayuzumi and Machiko decides to take her case, but she asks for fellow attorney Kensuke Komikado''s help. Meanwhile, the school hires attorney Teshigahara Isao.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vtuBs3ZbRlUkTh4YBDf1j5YwTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356255'),
  ('868383865705150175', 'Legalize it!', 2017, 'Drama', 'Johnny Araújo, Gustavo Bonafé', 'Felipe Braga', 'Renato Góes, Ícaro Silva, Marina Provenzzano, Stepan Nercessian, Shirley Cruz, Ernesto Alterio, Rafaela Mandelli, Paulete Maldonado', null, 'The meeting between two young guys, Marcelo —in the future, Marcelo D2— and Skunk , who sold t-shirts and cassette tapes in the center of Rio de Janeiro to survive, resulted in one of the most popular bands in Brazil in the 1990’s, Planet Hemp. Suppressed by a prejudiced society, the two made of their music a cry of alertness and resistance, conquering the hearts and minds of an entire generation.', 'The meeting between two young guys, Marcelo —in the future, Marcelo D2— and Skunk , who sold t-shirts and cassette tapes in the center of Rio de Janeiro to survive, resulted in one of the most popular bands in Brazil in the 1990’s, Planet Hemp. Suppressed by a prejudiced society, the two made of their music a cry of alertness and resistance, conquering the hearts and minds of an entire generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SZ2dcN4LwC4Q9bsS0Li128jksU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479266'),
  ('1074307787969267289', 'Legally Blonde', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Robert Luketic, Marcei A. Brubaker Brown', 'Kirsten Smith, Karen McCullah', 'Reese Witherspoon, Luke Wilson, Selma Blair, Matthew Davis, Victor Garber, Jennifer Coolidge, Holland Taylor, Ali Larter', 'PG-13', 'Fashionable sorority queen Elle Woods has it all, but, she wants nothing more than to be Mrs. Warner Huntington III. But he dumps her before heading to Harvard Law School. Elle rallies all of her resources and gets into Harvard, determined to win him back. While there, she figures out that there is more to herself than just good looks.', 'Fashionable sorority queen Elle Woods has it all, but, she wants nothing more than to be Mrs. Warner Huntington III. But he dumps her before heading to Harvard Law School. Elle rallies all of her resources and gets into Harvard, determined to win him back. While there, she figures out that there is more to herself than just good looks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ohlMrJHQqKhfUKh7Zr3JQqHNLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8835'),
  ('70382239743610501', 'Legally Blonde 2: Red, White & Blonde', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Herman-Wurmfeld, Elliot Davis, Patricia Owen', 'Kate Kondell', 'Reese Witherspoon, Sally Field, Regina King, Jennifer Coolidge, Bruce McGill, Dana Ivey, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Jessica Cauffiel', 'PG-13', 'Now a rising young lawyer, Elle Woods is about to make partner at her firm, but when she finds out her dog''s relatives are being used as cosmetic test subjects, she heads to Washington D.C. to fight for animal rights.', 'Now a rising young lawyer, Elle Woods is about to make partner at her firm, but when she finds out her dog''s relatives are being used as cosmetic test subjects, she heads to Washington D.C. to fight for animal rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kC0UGTuJgFnlZq2ZM6OiY7nuY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10327'),
