  ('886843792928420762', 'Legally Blondes', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Savage Steve Holland, William D. Barber, Louis Paul Tocchet', 'Chad Gomez Creasey, Dara Resnik', 'Milly Rosso, Becky Rosso, Tanya Chisholm, Christopher Cousins, Brittany Curran, Lisa Banes, Curtis Armstrong, Rose Abdoo', 'PG', 'Moving from England to California, the youngest cousins of Elle Woods must defend themselves when their schools reigning forces turn on the girls and try to frame them for a crime.', 'Moving from England to California, the youngest cousins of Elle Woods must defend themselves when their schools reigning forces turn on the girls and try to frame them for a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZnEw0avASZwBWcJo5F1pdJnmO2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16985'),
  ('123127361296187137', 'Legend', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ridley Scott, Alex Thomson, Garth Thomas', 'William Hjortsberg', 'Tom Cruise, Mia Sara, Tim Curry, David Bennent, Alice Playten, Billy Barty, Cork Hubbert, Peter O''Farrell', 'PG', 'Set in a timeless mythical forest inhabited by fairies, goblins, unicorns and mortals, this fantastic story follows a mystical forest dweller, chosen by fate, to undertake a heroic quest. He must save the beautiful Princess Lili and defeat the demonic Lord of Darkness, or the world will be plunged into a never-ending ice age.', 'Set in a timeless mythical forest inhabited by fairies, goblins, unicorns and mortals, this fantastic story follows a mystical forest dweller, chosen by fate, to undertake a heroic quest. He must save the beautiful Princess Lili and defeat the demonic Lord of Darkness, or the world will be plunged into a never-ending ice age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n3PQSYpZRK5YPk2w8JEwED7AZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11976'),
  ('202221864601745959', 'Legend', 2015, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Brian Helgeland, Dick Pope, Oliver Benson', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Tom Hardy, Emily Browning, Christopher Eccleston, David Thewlis, Taron Egerton, Chazz Palminteri, Colin Morgan, Paul Bettany', 'R', 'Suave, charming and volatile, Reggie Kray and his unstable twin brother Ronnie start to leave their mark on the London underworld in the 1960s. Using violence to get what they want, the siblings orchestrate robberies and murders while running nightclubs and protection rackets. With police Detective Leonard "Nipper" Read hot on their heels, the brothers continue their rapid rise to power and achieve tabloid notoriety.', 'Suave, charming and volatile, Reggie Kray and his unstable twin brother Ronnie start to leave their mark on the London underworld in the 1960s. Using violence to get what they want, the siblings orchestrate robberies and murders while running nightclubs and protection rackets. With police Detective Leonard "Nipper" Read hot on their heels, the brothers continue their rapid rise to power and achieve tabloid notoriety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4shf5Alq4KWCKqrAAQe0JGJHYp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276907'),
  ('295346833458333033', 'Legend No. 17', 2013, 'Drama', 'Nikolay Lebedev, Irek Hartowicz', 'Nikolay Lebedev, Mikhail Mestetskiy', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Oleg Menshikov, Vladimir Menshov, Roman Madyanov, Svetlana Ivanova, Alejandra Grepi, Götz Otto, Darya Ekamasova', 'PG-13', 'Biopic of Russian ice hockey legend Valeri Kharlamov from early childhood, rising to the pinnacle of the sport and his untimely death', 'Biopic of Russian ice hockey legend Valeri Kharlamov from early childhood, rising to the pinnacle of the sport and his untimely death', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYXz5nWpZkquk8mzxmpISPwv6Qc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184155'),
  ('799974867102367470', 'Legend of a Fighter', 1982, 'Action, History', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Yuen Shun-Yi, Yuen Yat-Choh', 'Leung Tin', 'Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Yasuaki Kurata, Yuen Yat-Choh, Phillip Ko Fai, Brandy Yuen Jan-Yeung, Lau Hok-Nin, Charlie Chan Yiu-Lam, Steve Lee Ka-Ting', null, 'This is a powerful, yet fictionalized life story of Huo Yuan Chia, a real kung fu master in Southern China who brought respect to the populace and allowed kung fu to be taught to all Chinese during a time of revolt and low morale in the country''s history.', 'This is a powerful, yet fictionalized life story of Huo Yuan Chia, a real kung fu master in Southern China who brought respect to the populace and allowed kung fu to be taught to all Chinese during a time of revolt and low morale in the country''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scnS7grB7Fryr5YQ1z3rVOZxw2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18852'),
  ('415840350561505930', 'Legend of a Ghost', 1908, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Julienne Mathieu', null, 'A young woman passing through a cemetery at night is suddenly startled by a voice coming from one of the graves. She wishes to rush away, but the ghost appearing compels her to remain. He explains to the terrified girl that she must go to the kingdom of Satan and get a bottle of the Water of Life, which she must bring back to him. The girl consents to do as he desires and starts forth on her expedition after the precious fluid. She summons a lot of soldiers and friends to her aid, and we follow the whole army down into the bowels of the earth. (Moving Picture World)', 'A young woman passing through a cemetery at night is suddenly startled by a voice coming from one of the graves. She wishes to rush away, but the ghost appearing compels her to remain. He explains to the terrified girl that she must go to the kingdom of Satan and get a bottle of the Water of Life, which she must bring back to him. The girl consents to do as he desires and starts forth on her expedition after the precious fluid. She summons a lot of soldiers and friends to her aid, and we follow the whole army down into the bowels of the earth. (Moving Picture World)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5ORBKN3OWDMODICkIUnRJkgCZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172135'),
  ('529934654731940534', 'Legend of Crystania: The Motion Picture', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Ryutaro Nakamura, Yasunori Miyazawa, Yoshio Mizumura', 'Akinori Endo', 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Mitsuki Yayoi, Nobutoshi Canna, Hisao Egawa, Akira Kamiya, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Yuka Koyama, Koji Ishii', 'NR', 'Ashram, desperate to find a home for his people, is tricked into selling his soul. 300 years later, Pirotesse''s devotion to her king remains unshaken. In the sacred world of Crystania, amidst a civil war waged by shape-changing warriors, she searches for her beloved Ashram. She meets Redon, a young prince obsessed with avenging his murdered parents. Together, they confront Ashram''s captor Barbas.', 'Ashram, desperate to find a home for his people, is tricked into selling his soul. 300 years later, Pirotesse''s devotion to her king remains unshaken. In the sacred world of Crystania, amidst a civil war waged by shape-changing warriors, she searches for her beloved Ashram. She meets Redon, a young prince obsessed with avenging his murdered parents. Together, they confront Ashram''s captor Barbas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnawlBOVqwZYldBckYyGdCzMm3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31034'),
  ('520484665821558898', 'Legend of Dinosaurs and Monster Birds', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Junji Kurata, Sakuji Shiomi, Tomoomi Yoda', 'Ichirō Ōtsu, Masaru Igami, Isao Matsumoto', 'Tsunehiko Watase, Shōtarō Hayashi, Yōko Koizumi, Tomoko Kiyoshima, Fuyukichi Maki, Kinji Nakamura, Hiroshi Nawa, Masataka Iwao', null, 'A Japanese geologist discovers that dinosaurs still exist in caves beneath the surface of a volcanic lake.', 'A Japanese geologist discovers that dinosaurs still exist in caves beneath the surface of a volcanic lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xweTLsYso2xXyG9VIYFGIJTMpbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72826'),
  ('358216053721142499', 'Legend of Kung Fu Rabbit', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Lijun Sun, Melanie Simka', 'Zou Jingzhi', 'Fan Wei, Ni Yan, Pu Cunxin, Zhang Fengyi, Zhang Yishan, Feng Yuanzheng, Huang Hong, Lin Yongjian', 'PG', 'In order to keep his promise to an aging kung fu master, Fu the Rabbit must venture out of the comfort of his kitchen and team up with Penny, a kung fu prodigy, on a heroic quest to save their kung fu academy.', 'In order to keep his promise to an aging kung fu master, Fu the Rabbit must venture out of the comfort of his kitchen and team up with Penny, a kung fu prodigy, on a heroic quest to save their kung fu academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVvbz9tsdAeZ0SeOws9AYFyJS0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173931'),
  ('65052007896604006', 'Legend of Lemnear', 1989, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kinji Yoshimoto', 'Kinji Yoshimoto', 'Eiko Yamada, Keiko Yokozawa, Ryusei Nakao, Iemasa Kayumi, Nobuo Tanaka, Ryuji Sai, Unsho Ishizuka, Tessyo Genda', null, 'After her village is destroyed and all its residents slaughtered by the evil wizard Gardein and his master The Dark Lord, a warrior known as Lemnear, The Silver Champion, vows to find and kill them both to avenge the massacre.', 'After her village is destroyed and all its residents slaughtered by the evil wizard Gardein and his master The Dark Lord, a warrior known as Lemnear, The Silver Champion, vows to find and kill them both to avenge the massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knaSD8I6NZQJhtUVGxM31TU5Aql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53034'),
  ('1103970676470822716', 'Legend of Lu Bu', 2020, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance', 'Cai Cong', null, 'Charles Lin, David Wu, Sheng Yinghao, Ming Xiaoxi, Shang Na, Jiao Hongxia', null, 'In times of war, the traitor Dou Zhun was in power and used poisonous poison to domesticate the medicine people. Yao Ren 19 escaped after a trial of the body and escaped by chance. By chance, she was rescued by the girl Cicada Clothing and named "Yizhibu". The two became more and more sorrowful. On the other side, Dou Jun sent someone to chase 19, the villagers were innocently killed, cicadas fell off the cliff, a piece of cloth was caught and the memory was tampered with ... Three years later, it was a great disaster Cicada recommended to assassinate Dou Jun, reunite with a piece of cloth that lost memory and became Dou Junyi. Full of hatred turned into grief, one side is home country, the other side is love, where should they go in the chaotic world.', 'In times of war, the traitor Dou Zhun was in power and used poisonous poison to domesticate the medicine people. Yao Ren 19 escaped after a trial of the body and escaped by chance. By chance, she was rescued by the girl Cicada Clothing and named "Yizhibu". The two became more and more sorrowful. On the other side, Dou Jun sent someone to chase 19, the villagers were innocently killed, cicadas fell off the cliff, a piece of cloth was caught and the memory was tampered with ... Three years later, it was a great disaster Cicada recommended to assassinate Dou Jun, reunite with a piece of cloth that lost memory and became Dou Junyi. Full of hatred turned into grief, one side is home country, the other side is love, where should they go in the chaotic world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aC0YLhS0K5JbONctAlIZVvxXO0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710718'),
  ('804401560012898539', 'Legend of the Ancient Sword', 2018, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Renny Harlin, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Huang Hui-Hui, Tai Guangyuan', 'Leehom Wang, Victoria Song, Godfrey Gao, Archie Kao, Karena Ng Chin-Yu, Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Liu Yan, Li Yuan', null, 'Due to a fateful occurrence, Yue Wuyi leaves home. He meets revered master Xie Yi, who imparts to him the magical arts of Yan, and thus begins his journey of cultivation. Along the way he meets Wen Renyu, Xia Yize, Ah Ruan and company. They discover the schemes and conspiracies of Shen Ye, the grand priest of Liu Yue City. The group of adventurers undergoes dangers to defeat Shen Ye, and prevent a disaster from befalling the world.', 'Due to a fateful occurrence, Yue Wuyi leaves home. He meets revered master Xie Yi, who imparts to him the magical arts of Yan, and thus begins his journey of cultivation. Along the way he meets Wen Renyu, Xia Yize, Ah Ruan and company. They discover the schemes and conspiracies of Shen Ye, the grand priest of Liu Yue City. The group of adventurers undergoes dangers to defeat Shen Ye, and prevent a disaster from befalling the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QHwlirJb7MJJcvTICMJvfG3oyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555020'),
  ('26669210178349787', 'Legend of the Bat', 1978, 'Action, Drama', 'Chor Yuen, Chang Chuan-tsan, Chan Fen', 'Chor Yuen', 'Ti Lung, Ling Yun, Derek Yee, Elliot Ngok Wah, Ching Li, Wong Chung, Candice Yu On-On, Yuen Wah', null, 'A group of swordsmen set out on a journey to the mysterious Bat Island to seek answers for their problems but things go south when they run into other parties along the way.', 'A group of swordsmen set out on a journey to the mysterious Bat Island to seek answers for their problems but things go south when they run into other parties along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6ULSiBzjqKZgTqsu5JIJOpxrt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66167'),
  ('687031504948563115', 'Legend of the BoneKnapper Dragon', 2010, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'John Puglisi', 'Peter Steinfeld', 'Jay Baruchel, Gerard Butler, Craig Ferguson, America Ferrera, Jonah Hill, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, T.J. Miller, Kristen Wiig', 'PG', 'Hiccup and friends accompany their mentor, Gobber, on a quest to kill the legendary Boneknapper Dragon.', 'Hiccup and friends accompany their mentor, Gobber, on a quest to kill the legendary Boneknapper Dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74OqO31AaubZGgreiHIomFyOXUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47626'),
  ('624148159804394171', 'Legend of the Demon Cat', 2017, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Cao Yu, Chen Kaige', 'Wang Huiling, Chen Kaige', 'Huang Xuan, Shota Sometani, Hiroshi Abe, Zhang Yuqi, Qin Hao, Zhang Tian''ai, Keiko Matsuzaka, Liu Haoran', null, 'During the Late Tang Dynasty, a manor is invaded by a demon cat and a sense of unrest befalls the capital of Changan. A poet is charged with investigating the case and meets up with a monk. The two work together and pull apart the thread of clues to reveal a history of truths leading to the events.', 'During the Late Tang Dynasty, a manor is invaded by a demon cat and a sense of unrest befalls the capital of Changan. A poet is charged with investigating the case and meets up with a monk. The two work together and pull apart the thread of clues to reveal a history of truths leading to the events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtFfxjspbiAxYuH1LHvb9UDH0Kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434221'),
  ('1001062203450270510', 'Legend of the Doll', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Toshihiro Goto', null, 'Yuria Hidaka, Noriko Kohara, Hideo Tsubota', null, 'An action figure aficionado named Ryouta finally completes a rare action figure collection by buying a doll in Akihabara. His joy is short-lived, however, when a group of juvenile delinquents steals it from him on the way home. Totally defeated, Ryouta wanders into a tiny back-alley shop and finds an even rarer model of a girl named Airu for sale. He rushes home to assemble it, and to his astonishment Airu comes to life and instantly falls in love with him.', 'An action figure aficionado named Ryouta finally completes a rare action figure collection by buying a doll in Akihabara. His joy is short-lived, however, when a group of juvenile delinquents steals it from him on the way home. Totally defeated, Ryouta wanders into a tiny back-alley shop and finds an even rarer model of a girl named Airu for sale. He rushes home to assemble it, and to his astonishment Airu comes to life and instantly falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTXiCcmcWHY92IBx5239wuTaOGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50138'),
  ('714236310312553601', 'Legend of the Dragon', 1991, 'Comedy, Action', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Abdul M. Rumjahn, Tony Miu Kin-Fai', 'Law Kam-Fai', 'Stephen Chow, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Yuen Wah, Lee Hoi-Sang, Lung Fong, Amy Yip Chi-Mei, Corey Yuen', null, 'Chow Siu-lung leaves his hometown in order to study kung fu in the city but ends up getting conned by his own uncle instead.', 'Chow Siu-lung leaves his hometown in order to study kung fu in the city but ends up getting conned by his own uncle instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fp4TRZzmHBnHIJdlYXtPylACuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56118'),
  ('458525915017688363', 'Legend of the Eight Samurai', 1983, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Yoshikuni Matsunaga, Seizō Sengen', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Toshio Kamata', 'Hiroko Yakushimaru, Hiroyuki Sanada, Sonny Chiba, Minori Terada, Masaki Kyomoto, Etsuko Shihomi, Takuya Fukuhara, Shunsuke Kariya', null, 'The evil Hikita clan rises from the dead to fulfill a curse on the Satomi clan by restoring the face of their warlord by using the skin of Princess Shizu. In the process of trying to capture her, the clan murders her entire family, but Princess Shizu escapes their clutches. She enlists the aid of eight samurai warriors, possessors of powerful magic crystal, led by Dosetsu (Sonny Chiba!) to help rescue the remaining members of her court and revenge her family. Along the way, they must fight undead warriors, evil spirits, poisonous beauties and a giant centipede.', 'The evil Hikita clan rises from the dead to fulfill a curse on the Satomi clan by restoring the face of their warlord by using the skin of Princess Shizu. In the process of trying to capture her, the clan murders her entire family, but Princess Shizu escapes their clutches. She enlists the aid of eight samurai warriors, possessors of powerful magic crystal, led by Dosetsu (Sonny Chiba!) to help rescue the remaining members of her court and revenge her family. Along the way, they must fight undead warriors, evil spirits, poisonous beauties and a giant centipede.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51jQTnjpGKRhdvP5IbwW6OCivBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47578'),
  ('881588032225040936', 'Legend of the Evil Lake', 2003, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Lee Kwang-hoon, Lü Yue, Kim Yun-su', 'Ju-ri Hong', 'Jung Jun-ho, Kim Hyo-jin, Hye-ri Kim, Won-seok Choi, San Ho, Lee Han-gal, Kang Shin-il, Kwon Hae-sung', null, 'A thousand years ago, an evil spirit was kept imprisoned in a lake by the first emperor of the Chilla empire. Now unleashed, it possesses the body of Ja Woon-bi, the wife of general Biharang, with the aim to bring down the very dynasty that destroyed his people. Biharang is torn; to kill the spirit, he has to also kill his wife.', 'A thousand years ago, an evil spirit was kept imprisoned in a lake by the first emperor of the Chilla empire. Now unleashed, it possesses the body of Ja Woon-bi, the wife of general Biharang, with the aim to bring down the very dynasty that destroyed his people. Biharang is torn; to kill the spirit, he has to also kill his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKhb1FmhzW2EthPitJ2w1TPlsLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41853'),
  ('751326864260825528', 'Legend of the Fist: The Return of Chen Zhen', 2010, 'Drama, Action, History, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Ho Yiu-Leung, Ng Man-Ching', 'Gordon Chan', 'Donnie Yen, Shu Qi, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Huang Bo, Huo Siyan, Angela Jiajia Chen, Zhou Yang, Ryu Kohata', 'R', 'The Japanese forces occupy Shanghai and slowly start spreading terror in the city. Chen Zhen, who was presumed dead, returns to fight against the Japanese and put an end to their tyrannical rule.', 'The Japanese forces occupy Shanghai and slowly start spreading terror in the city. Chen Zhen, who was presumed dead, returns to fight against the Japanese and put an end to their tyrannical rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qT6KI2jNiskkB4VuNz4uN0ng4Ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47854'),
  ('745032488057493971', 'Legend of the Forest', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Osamu Tezuka, Takashi Ui, Masaaki Fujita', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, 'A tranquil forest and all of its residents must face the destruction of man. A squirrel, born and raised in the forest, fights to defend his home and faces trials and adversities along the way.', 'A tranquil forest and all of its residents must face the destruction of man. A squirrel, born and raised in the forest, fights to defend his home and faces trials and adversities along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKuiJyIl17cEMIJwysWqvEsilh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85793'),
  ('897249754190376156', 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes: Die Neue These - Intrigue 1', 2022, 'Animation, Science Fiction, War, Drama', 'Shunsuke Tada', 'Noboru Takagi', 'Kenichi Suzumura, Mamoru Miyano, Teruyuki Tanzawa, Kaito Ishikawa, Shinnosuke Ogami, Koji Hiwatari, Tetsu Inada, Tsuguo Mogami', null, 'The story focuses on the exploits of rivals Reinhard von Lohengramm and Yang Wen-li, as they rise to power and fame in the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance, respectively.', 'The story focuses on the exploits of rivals Reinhard von Lohengramm and Yang Wen-li, as they rise to power and fame in the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance, respectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brrgSFtcymZWaXl5a23GJRWdOSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030419'),
  ('195121901863206143', 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes: Golden Wings', 1992, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Keizo Shimizu, Yoshihiro Ueda, Yuuji Ikeda', 'Yoshiki Tanaka', 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Hiromi Murata, Etsuo Yokobori, Koji Ishii, Hiromi Tsuru, Mitsuaki Hoshino, Masaharu Sato, Mitsurou Kamei', null, 'Reinhard von Müsel, a poor nobleman''s son, one day discovers that his sister, Annerose, has been sold to the royal family. To get her back he sets out to rise quickly through the military along with his friend Siegfried Kircheis.', 'Reinhard von Müsel, a poor nobleman''s son, one day discovers that his sister, Annerose, has been sold to the royal family. To get her back he sets out to rise quickly through the military along with his friend Siegfried Kircheis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNC7UBy3x4qEN99hN6fwZPdDekR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154501'),
  ('705570150464751120', 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes: My Conquest Is the Sea of Stars', 1988, 'Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Noboru Ishiguro, Matsuri Okuda, Akio Sakai', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Kei Tomiyama, Masashi Hironaka, Ryo Horikawa, Katsuji Mori, Kazuhiko Inoue, Norio Wakamoto, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Issei Futamata', null, 'For the past 150 years, humanity’s two greatest nations have been deadlocked in a meaningless war. In what is hoped to be a miraculous victory, the Alliance embarks on a battle to break through the Empire’s frontline. Like many other “decisive” battles, this can only end in disaster; a sentiment shared by Imperial nobleman Reinhard von Lohengramm and Alliance Commodore Yang Wen Li, both of whom realize how to turn the fight in their favor. And while the tides of war may never change, these two men must rise to the occasion, solidifying their place in history as heroes.', 'For the past 150 years, humanity’s two greatest nations have been deadlocked in a meaningless war. In what is hoped to be a miraculous victory, the Alliance embarks on a battle to break through the Empire’s frontline. Like many other “decisive” battles, this can only end in disaster; a sentiment shared by Imperial nobleman Reinhard von Lohengramm and Alliance Commodore Yang Wen Li, both of whom realize how to turn the fight in their favor. And while the tides of war may never change, these two men must rise to the occasion, solidifying their place in history as heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emneZ1gGMJnW4mv3HZW16FskqiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154738'),
  ('955793356039097565', 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes: Overture to a New War', 1993, 'Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Kenichi Maeda, Keizo Shimizu, Hideo Okazaki', 'Masatoshi Tahara', 'Kei Tomiyama, Ryo Horikawa, Gorō Naya, Hiroshi Ito, Hideyuki Tanaka, Issei Futamata, Katsuji Mori, Kazuhiko Inoue', null, 'Reinhard von Müsel and Yang Wen-li return to their respective homes, one victorious and the other defeated. While Reinhard earns the new name Lohengramm, while Yang and his friends celebrate some welcome news.', 'Reinhard von Müsel and Yang Wen-li return to their respective homes, one victorious and the other defeated. While Reinhard earns the new name Lohengramm, while Yang and his friends celebrate some welcome news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/litE6EGYwrwcP58lG939yABc2YU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154727'),
  ('413976599118089306', 'Legend of the Guardians: The Owls of Ga''Hoole', 2010, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Zack Snyder, David Scott', 'John Orloff, Emil Stern', 'Jim Sturgess, Ryan Kwanten, Hugo Weaving, Helen Mirren, Geoffrey Rush, Emily Barclay, Abbie Cornish, Anthony LaPaglia', 'PG', 'When a young owl is abducted by an evil Owl army, he must escape with new-found friends and seek the legendary Guardians to stop the menace.', 'When a young owl is abducted by an evil Owl army, he must escape with new-found friends and seek the legendary Guardians to stop the menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qweKCtPdnIP2uGp1PgWZyCV7gzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41216'),
  ('829801726559712156', 'Legend of the Lost', 1957, 'Adventure', 'Henry Hathaway, Jack Cardiff, Joseph Lenzi', 'Ben Hecht, Robert Presnell Jr.', 'John Wayne, Sophia Loren, Rossano Brazzi, Kurt Kasznar, Sonia Moser, Angela Portaluri, Ibrahim El Hadish', null, 'American ne''er-do-well Joe January is hired to take Paul Bonnard on an expedition into the desert in search of treasure.', 'American ne''er-do-well Joe January is hired to take Paul Bonnard on an expedition into the desert in search of treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SIcFeARS3BgyOkGRJarKuVtjP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25848'),
  ('548430532539448161', 'Legend of the Millennium Dragon', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Shinji Hashimoto, Tatsuya Tomaru, Hirotsugu Kawasaki', 'Naruhisa Arakawa, Hirotsugu Kawasaki', 'Satomi Ishihara, Kentaro Ito, Yasuyuki Kase, Sôsuke Komori, Kensho Ono, Takashi Kondo, Masaaki Tsukada, Shunsuke Sakuya', null, 'A spectacular journey of an unwilling young hero thrust into a mysterious past full of monsters, dragons, and strange hidden powers. Through a series of out of this world battles and adventures, Jun, a shy middle school boy, is transformed into a hero destined to battle evil and ensure harmony and tranquility in the world.', 'A spectacular journey of an unwilling young hero thrust into a mysterious past full of monsters, dragons, and strange hidden powers. Through a series of out of this world battles and adventures, Jun, a shy middle school boy, is transformed into a hero destined to battle evil and ensure harmony and tranquility in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thIp92OiHGCl8CB8CmbwfgSQfmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74842'),
  ('785026289330774330', 'Legend of the Mountain', 1979, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'King Hu, Henry Chan', 'King Hu, Ling Chung', 'Shih Chun, Hsu Feng, Sylvia Chang, Tung Lin, Rainbow Hsu, Tien Feng, Chen Hui-Lou, Sun Yueh', null, 'A traveling scholar, intent on translating a Buddhist sutra that is said to have power over the creatures of the afterlife. He slowly finds himself entangled in a mysterious plot involving witchcraft, demons, and a battle to preserve his own soul from the attacks of the supernatural underworld.', 'A traveling scholar, intent on translating a Buddhist sutra that is said to have power over the creatures of the afterlife. He slowly finds himself entangled in a mysterious plot involving witchcraft, demons, and a battle to preserve his own soul from the attacks of the supernatural underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94ZZwpRyTlstNNSw67jFxCJQhYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191531'),
  ('829522559796600631', 'Legend of the Mummy', 1998, 'Horror', 'Jeffrey Obrow', null, 'Louis Gossett Jr., Amy Locane, Eric Lutes, Mark Lindsay Chapman, Lloyd Bochner, Mary Jo Catlett, Aubrey Morris, Richard Karn', null, 'Louis Gossett Jr., Richard Karn, and Amy Locane star in this supernatural horror tale about a mummy with a heart that bears a power beyond that of our world. When the mummy attacks archaeologist Dr. Trelawny, his colleagues have to trace the source of the ghoul''s power and find a way to stop it.', 'Louis Gossett Jr., Richard Karn, and Amy Locane star in this supernatural horror tale about a mummy with a heart that bears a power beyond that of our world. When the mummy attacks archaeologist Dr. Trelawny, his colleagues have to trace the source of the ghoul''s power and find a way to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udUGaJ9gI7YVJNOlRctxEmAIeFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118043'),
  ('551482009585454593', 'Legend of the Naga Pearls', 2017, 'Romance, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Yang Lei, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Charcoal Tan, Xu Zhaoqing', 'Darren Wang, Zhang Tian''ai, Simon Yam, Sheng Shao, Wang Xun, Zhao Jian, Xing Yu, Hu Bing', null, 'After being defeated by humans centuries ago, the Winged Tribe has lost their ability to fly. Seeking vengeance, a royal descendant of the tribe has begun searching for the magical Naga Pearls, which he plans to use to destroy the humans. When the legendary pearls fall into - and out of - the hands of Heiyu, a wily human street punk, he must join a team of unlikely heroes as they race to prevent the destruction of their people in this magical fantasy adventure.', 'After being defeated by humans centuries ago, the Winged Tribe has lost their ability to fly. Seeking vengeance, a royal descendant of the tribe has begun searching for the magical Naga Pearls, which he plans to use to destroy the humans. When the legendary pearls fall into - and out of - the hands of Heiyu, a wily human street punk, he must join a team of unlikely heroes as they race to prevent the destruction of their people in this magical fantasy adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xX7Plx8yT2hL7jjvQGUYiBfUAww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466438'),
  ('419565338083344750', 'Legend of the Red Dragon', 1994, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Tom Lau Moon-Tong, Wong Jing, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Jet Li, Xie Miao, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Deanie Ip, Ji Chunhua, Sun Jiankui, Chan Chung-Yung, Damian Lau Chung-Yan', 'R', 'A young father and his infant son are beset by forces of evil and corruption. They wander China, upholding their sense of honor and protecting the weak. When they are forced into combat, spectacular and hilarious fast-motion kung fu sequences follow. In the end, they must call on all of their abilities in a battle royale, to attempt to vanquish a supernatural man-monster or die trying.', 'A young father and his infant son are beset by forces of evil and corruption. They wander China, upholding their sense of honor and protecting the weak. When they are forced into combat, spectacular and hilarious fast-motion kung fu sequences follow. In the end, they must call on all of their abilities in a battle royale, to attempt to vanquish a supernatural man-monster or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57kngzlMiKkn6yg5lDfcxNmcYF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18670'),
  ('600574874163368', 'Legend of the Tsunami Warrior', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, History', 'Nonzee Nimibutr', 'Win Lyovarin', 'Jacqueline Apithananont, Anna Reese, Dan Chupong, Suwinit Panjamawat, Sorapong Chatree, Ananda Everingham, Jakrit Panichpatikam, Manassanan Patcharasopachai', null, 'As sea pirates threaten to invade their kingdoms, three queens of Langkasuka must band together to defend their lands and peoples.', 'As sea pirates threaten to invade their kingdoms, three queens of Langkasuka must band together to defend their lands and peoples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qTqdxSsiHcHqdB8Ob4Im24f6Rl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52651'),
  ('723682721650239483', 'Legend of the Werewolf', 1975, 'Horror', 'Freddie Francis, John Wilcox', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Peter Cushing, Ron Moody, Hugh Griffith, Roy Castle, David Rintoul, Stefan Gryff, Lynn Dalby, Renée Houston', null, 'In 19th-century Paris, a man raised by wolves works at a travelling circus, but on full moon nights, he transforms into a dangerous beast. Professor Paul Cataflanque is in charge of hunting him down as the young man develops an obsession for a prostitute.', 'In 19th-century Paris, a man raised by wolves works at a travelling circus, but on full moon nights, he transforms into a dangerous beast. Professor Paul Cataflanque is in charge of hunting him down as the young man develops an obsession for a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSKNrc2nclQflKcLF0cEvFmtorP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42333'),
  ('619111306742492530', 'Legend of the Witches', 1970, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Malcolm Leigh', 'Malcolm Leigh', 'Guy Standeven, Alex Sanders, Maxine Sanders', null, 'A visual exploration into the origins of witchcraft in the UK and in particular the demystification of symbolism still embedded today within many modern religious artefacts and rituals. X-rated upon its original release, this documentary looks in detail at previously hidden magic rites and rituals. Sharing the secrets of initiation into a coven, divination through animal sacrifice, ritual scrying, the casting of a ''death spell'', and the chilling intimacy of a Black Mass.', 'A visual exploration into the origins of witchcraft in the UK and in particular the demystification of symbolism still embedded today within many modern religious artefacts and rituals. X-rated upon its original release, this documentary looks in detail at previously hidden magic rites and rituals. Sharing the secrets of initiation into a coven, divination through animal sacrifice, ritual scrying, the casting of a ''death spell'', and the chilling intimacy of a Black Mass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztn4l79KrgkXadVMndtweiRjCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179880'),
  ('457634385655700509', 'Legend of the Wolf', 1997, 'Action', 'Donnie Yen, Ally Wong', 'Bill Lui Tak-Wai, Cub Chin Kong-Hon, Donnie Yen', 'Donnie Yen, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Edmond Leung Hon-Man, Bonnie Lai Suk-Yin, Mak Wai-Cheung, Tony Tam Chun-To', null, 'Wolf is a war veteran who recounts the tale of his legendary youth to a young upstart killer. Flashback to a post-World War 2 time when the young Wolf is wandering the Chinese countryside in search of his missing memories. He only knows to meet someone at an abandoned temple. He ends up hooking up with a local villager, who intends to guide the Wolf to his destination. On the way, they find Wai-Yee, who’s been waiting for Wolf for quite some time. However, Wolf still can’t remember anything, until the bad guys come to find him, and they bear the terrible secret of the Wolf''s past.', 'Wolf is a war veteran who recounts the tale of his legendary youth to a young upstart killer. Flashback to a post-World War 2 time when the young Wolf is wandering the Chinese countryside in search of his missing memories. He only knows to meet someone at an abandoned temple. He ends up hooking up with a local villager, who intends to guide the Wolf to his destination. On the way, they find Wai-Yee, who’s been waiting for Wolf for quite some time. However, Wolf still can’t remember anything, until the bad guys come to find him, and they bear the terrible secret of the Wolf''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cq2qsC19lPVM8OhPiESucvrJJ5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33537'),
  ('811424146087322403', 'Legendary', 2010, 'Drama', 'Mel Damski, Kenneth Zunder', 'John Posey', 'Patricia Clarkson, Devon Graye, John Cena, Madeleine Martin, Danny Glover, John Posey, Tyler Posey, Teo Olivares', 'PG-13', 'A book-smart teenager joins his school''s wrestling team as a way to reunite his surviving family members, who split apart after the death of his father, a college wrestling legend, 10 years ago.', 'A book-smart teenager joins his school''s wrestling team as a way to reunite his surviving family members, who split apart after the death of his father, a college wrestling legend, 10 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu3uIbULL54pRXuvobGwDjy780n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43922'),
  ('66747445578843288', 'Legendary Amazons', 2011, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Frankie Chan Fan-Kei', 'Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Liu Heng', 'Cecilia Cheung, Richie Jen, Cheng Pei-Pei, Ge Chun-Yan, Yukari Ôshima, Li Jing, Jin Qiaoqiao, Yang Zitong', 'NR', 'In 11th century China, the Emperor Renzong reigns his country poorly, neglecting state affairs while the government sinks into corruption and war rages at his borders, whose only protection left is the famous Yang clan. However, when the last man of the family falls, leaving the country open to its invaders, the clan’s formidable women take up arms to lead the army to victory and seek vengeance against corrupt officials.', 'In 11th century China, the Emperor Renzong reigns his country poorly, neglecting state affairs while the government sinks into corruption and war rages at his borders, whose only protection left is the famous Yang clan. However, when the last man of the family falls, leaving the country open to its invaders, the clan’s formidable women take up arms to lead the army to victory and seek vengeance against corrupt officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcmb3NIoghYcCzHZjK4tioQmG6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82190'),
  ('121227203043944251', 'Legendary Assassin', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Nicky Li Chung-Chi, Wu Jing', 'Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang', 'Wu Jing, Celina Jade, Noriko Aoyama, Alex Fong Lik-Sun, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Sammy Leung, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Lam Suet', 'R', 'An assassin who is fresh from his latest kill becomes stranded in an island, when he inadvertently befriends a female police officer. As the night progresses, the unspoken truth honored by the two sides of the law is broken. After the remains of a body that belonged to a drug lord and syndicate crime leader are found, chaos ensues and criminals ravage the once peaceful streets in a race against time to find the mysterious murderer that''s loose and out for blood.', 'An assassin who is fresh from his latest kill becomes stranded in an island, when he inadvertently befriends a female police officer. As the night progresses, the unspoken truth honored by the two sides of the law is broken. After the remains of a body that belonged to a drug lord and syndicate crime leader are found, chaos ensues and criminals ravage the once peaceful streets in a race against time to find the mysterious murderer that''s loose and out for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erSXACAv01EnWdCwaThOcFxYJGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26010'),
  ('420223594906276411', 'Legendary Weapons of China', 1982, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lee Tai-Hang, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lee Tai-Hang', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Hsiao Ho, Alexander Fu Sheng, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Lau Kar-Wing, Chu Tit-Wo, Wong Ching-Ho', null, 'Legendary Weapons of China is a martial arts fantasy film taking place during the late Qing Dynasty when Empress Dowager Cixi dispatches her agents to various factions of the Boxer Rebellion in order find supernatural martial artists that are invulnerable to western bullets. When one of the leaders of these groups disbands his forces, assassins from the remaining factions are sent out to kill him.', 'Legendary Weapons of China is a martial arts fantasy film taking place during the late Qing Dynasty when Empress Dowager Cixi dispatches her agents to various factions of the Boxer Rebellion in order find supernatural martial artists that are invulnerable to western bullets. When one of the leaders of these groups disbands his forces, assassins from the remaining factions are sent out to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ3WAYY69A7vIt2BTNfnart5GV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19156'),
  ('1120418387597210335', 'Legendary: Tomb of the Dragon', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Eric Styles, Yang Shu', 'Andy Briggs', 'Scott Adkins, Dolph Lundgren, Crystal Huang Yi, James Lance, Lydia Leonard, Nathan Lee, Geng Le, Murray Clive Walker', 'PG-13', 'Travis and his team travel to China in search of what isn''t supposed to exist ... their mission to capture a Cryptid which is wreaking havoc in a remote village and they need to do this before it is killed by Harker, the legendary bounty hunter.', 'Travis and his team travel to China in search of what isn''t supposed to exist ... their mission to capture a Cryptid which is wreaking havoc in a remote village and they need to do this before it is killed by Harker, the legendary bounty hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wmdfVx5RCSCFXDvitqIA5YRqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226672'),
  ('500755229791368468', 'Legends of Oz: Dorothy''s Return', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Dan St. Pierre, Dougg Williams, Will Finn', 'Adam Balsam, Randi Barnes', 'Lea Michele, Martin Short, Bernadette Peters, Dan Aykroyd, Kelsey Grammer, Jim Belushi, Oliver Platt, Hugh Dancy', 'PG', 'Dorothy wakes in post-tornado Kansas, only to be whisked back to Oz to try to save her old friends, the Scarecrow, the Lion, the Tin Man, and Glinda, from a devious new villain, the Jester. New comrades Wiser the Owl, Marshal Mallow, China Princess, and Tugg the Tugboat join Dorothy on her latest magical journey through the colorful landscape of Oz to restore order and happiness to Emerald City.', 'Dorothy wakes in post-tornado Kansas, only to be whisked back to Oz to try to save her old friends, the Scarecrow, the Lion, the Tin Man, and Glinda, from a devious new villain, the Jester. New comrades Wiser the Owl, Marshal Mallow, China Princess, and Tugg the Tugboat join Dorothy on her latest magical journey through the colorful landscape of Oz to restore order and happiness to Emerald City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XiNCjFudNX0Wj5LanPuIb8E9pU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59981'),
  ('291234048282874565', 'Legends of the Condor Heroes: The Gallants', 2025, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Tsui Hark', 'Tsui Hark, Song Xuan', 'Xiao Zhan, Sabrina Zhuang, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Zhang Wenxin, Bayaertu, Alan Aruna, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Hu Jun', 'R', 'Under Genghis Khan, the Mongolian army pushes west to destroy the Jin Dynasty, setting its sights on the Song Dynasty next. Amid internal conflicts among martial arts schools, Guo Jing unites the Central Plains'' warriors to defend Xiangyang, embodying courage and loyalty in the fight for the nation.', 'Under Genghis Khan, the Mongolian army pushes west to destroy the Jin Dynasty, setting its sights on the Song Dynasty next. Amid internal conflicts among martial arts schools, Guo Jing unites the Central Plains'' warriors to defend Xiangyang, embodying courage and loyalty in the fight for the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUCFEGFlMIFet9ja72JDAeG1he8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1185528'),
  ('558764155218508605', 'Legends of the Fall', 1994, 'Drama, Western, Romance, War', 'Edward Zwick, John Toll, Lewin Webb', 'Susan Shilliday, William D. Wittliff', 'Brad Pitt, Anthony Hopkins, Aidan Quinn, Julia Ormond, Henry Thomas, Karina Lombard, Gordon Tootoosis, John Novak', 'R', 'In early 20th-century Montana, Col. William Ludlow lives on a ranch in the wilderness with his sons, Alfred, Tristan, and Samuel. Eventually, the unconventional but close-knit family are bound by loyalty, tested by war, and torn apart by love, as told over the course of several decades in this epic saga.', 'In early 20th-century Montana, Col. William Ludlow lives on a ranch in the wilderness with his sons, Alfred, Tristan, and Samuel. Eventually, the unconventional but close-knit family are bound by loyalty, tested by war, and torn apart by love, as told over the course of several decades in this epic saga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1KPGlW0UGd0m515LPQmk2F4nu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4476'),
  ('323116681859261231', 'Legends of the Hidden Temple', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Joe Menendez, Tom Harting', null, 'Isabela Merced, Dee Bradley Baker, Daniel Cudmore, Michael Benyaer, James Black, Jet Jurgensmeyer, Catia Ojeda, Kirk Fogg', 'PG', 'Three siblings who break away from a lackluster temple tour in a jungle finds themselves immersed in a real-life mission comprised of obstacles that they must complete in order to escape alive.', 'Three siblings who break away from a lackluster temple tour in a jungle finds themselves immersed in a real-life mission comprised of obstacles that they must complete in order to escape alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4uB43sOjgfDzRh0q7DZKpH91Bj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424661'),
  ('101831031457922355', 'Legends of Valhalla: Thor', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Toby Genkel, Óskar Jónasson, Gunnar Karlsson', 'Óskar Jónasson, Toby Genkel, Friðrik Erlingsson', 'Atli Rafn Sigurðsson, Egill Ólafsson, Þórhallur Sigurðsson, Ágústa Eva Erlendsdóttir, Katla Margrét Þorgeirsdóttir, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Esther Talia Casey, Helga Braga Jónsdóttir', null, 'An over confident teen with a magical weapon and a handful of imperfect gods join forces against an evil queen and her army of giants', 'An over confident teen with a magical weapon and a handful of imperfect gods join forces against an evil queen and her army of giants', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gs0642LLTa5Nl6vUR06ZQ3stTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106631'),
  ('709501024113768387', 'Leggings Mania', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Kim', null, 'James, Im Cho-hee, Im Tae-mok, Do Hee', null, 'Jeong-hee was living with a man due to a de facto marriage. One day, her daughter, Dam-hoi, returned from her study abroad. Dam-hoi always wears leggings. The soon-to-be stepdad, Byeong-min, who is usually a fan of leggings, pays attention to her daughter''s clothes. Jeong-hee noticed it, so she also started wearing leggings to distract her young prospective husband.', 'Jeong-hee was living with a man due to a de facto marriage. One day, her daughter, Dam-hoi, returned from her study abroad. Dam-hoi always wears leggings. The soon-to-be stepdad, Byeong-min, who is usually a fan of leggings, pays attention to her daughter''s clothes. Jeong-hee noticed it, so she also started wearing leggings to distract her young prospective husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjxDVxLXM3fOSl3wm2WujNVNzs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190586'),
  ('970458395032051532', 'Legion', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Jon Hess, Frank Reiber', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Parker Stevenson, Terry Farrell, Corey Feldman, Rick Springfield, Troy Donahue, Audie England, Trevor Goddard, Patricia M. Peters', null, 'This future-set sci-adventure follows a band of brave soldiers in an epic battle against a government-created monster.', 'This future-set sci-adventure follows a band of brave soldiers in an epic battle against a government-created monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ro4BujCD9aFaTI1YMH76Fj9Fgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45326'),
  ('203224909905735788', 'Legion', 2010, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Scott Stewart, John Lindley, Bruce McCleery', 'Peter Schink, Scott Stewart', 'Paul Bettany, Dennis Quaid, Lucas Black, Kate Walsh, Tyrese Gibson, Adrianne Palicki, Willa Holland, Charles S. Dutton', 'R', 'When God loses faith in humankind, he sends his legion of angels to bring on the Apocalypse. Humanity''s only hope for survival lies in a group of strangers trapped in an out-of-the-way, desert diner with the Archangel Michael.', 'When God loses faith in humankind, he sends his legion of angels to bring on the Apocalypse. Humanity''s only hope for survival lies in a group of strangers trapped in an out-of-the-way, desert diner with the Archangel Michael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykocDqwg5PRUopnBVb1x1DWnEJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22894'),
  ('126720632872812553', 'Legion of Fire: Killer Ants', 1998, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'George Manasse, Jim Charleston', 'Wink Roberts', 'Mitch Pileggi, Eric Lutes, Julia Campbell, Jeremy Foley, Dallen Gettling', null, 'When a hive of deadly killer ants attack a town in Alaska, a small group races to survive and to find a way to stop the ruthless ants.', 'When a hive of deadly killer ants attack a town in Alaska, a small group races to survive and to find a way to stop the ruthless ants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNpK3zhp0z3ZKL6znVMPxbz7jME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98084'),
  ('1020033063085189669', 'Legion of Super-Heroes', 2023, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jeff Wamester', 'Josie Campbell', 'Meg Donnelly, Harry Shum Jr., Jensen Ackles, Gideon Adlon, Matt Bomer, Darren Criss, Robbie Daymond, Darin De Paul', 'PG-13', 'Kara, devastated by the loss of Krypton, struggles to adjust to her new life on Earth. Her cousin, Superman, mentors her and suggests she leave their space-time to attend the Legion Academy in the 31st century, where she makes new friends and a new enemy: Brainiac 5. Meanwhile, she must contend with a mysterious group called the Dark Circle as it searches for a powerful weapon held in the Academy’s vault.', 'Kara, devastated by the loss of Krypton, struggles to adjust to her new life on Earth. Her cousin, Superman, mentors her and suggests she leave their space-time to attend the Legion Academy in the 31st century, where she makes new friends and a new enemy: Brainiac 5. Meanwhile, she must contend with a mysterious group called the Dark Circle as it searches for a powerful weapon held in the Academy’s vault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M6bA5t2q5u1nWDTEIXuGDwvboW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003580'),
  ('289088165185882068', 'Legion of the Dead', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Bales, Megan Schoenbachler', 'Paul Bales', 'Courtney Clonch, Claudia Lynx, Bruce Boxleitner, Zach Galligan, Chad Michael Collins, Rhett Giles, Andrew Lauer, Emily Falkenstein', 'R', 'When the mummified remains of an evil Egyptian queen are brought back to life, she resurrects an army of living dead to help fulfill the prophecy that promises her all the powers of the Underworld.', 'When the mummified remains of an evil Egyptian queen are brought back to life, she resurrects an army of living dead to help fulfill the prophecy that promises her all the powers of the Underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zBqX7R8bFEkY9pEt52nd9UgYtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31541'),
  ('182264819572939832', 'Legionnaire', 1998, 'Action, War, Adventure, History', 'Peter MacDonald, Douglas Milsome, Jamie Christopher', 'Sheldon Lettich, Rebecca Morrison', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Steven Berkoff, Nicholas Farrell, Jim Carter, Ana Sofrenović, Daniel Caltagirone, Joseph Long', 'R', 'Alain Lefevre is a boxer paid by a Marseille mobster to take a dive. When he wins the fight he attempts to flee to America with the mobster''s girlfriend Katrina. This plan fails and he seeks escape by joining the foreign legion. As part of the legion he tangles with abusive lieutenant Steinkampf and bonds with legionnaires Luther, Mackintosh and Rosetti.', 'Alain Lefevre is a boxer paid by a Marseille mobster to take a dive. When he wins the fight he attempts to flee to America with the mobster''s girlfriend Katrina. This plan fails and he seeks escape by joining the foreign legion. As part of the legion he tangles with abusive lieutenant Steinkampf and bonds with legionnaires Luther, Mackintosh and Rosetti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHezb1DIEB3DyBx9gp914y03yAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3513'),
  ('963024509652998137', 'Legions', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mariano Suárez, Fabián Forte', 'Fabián Forte', 'Germán de Silva, Lorena Vega, Mariana Anghileri, Ezequiel Rodríguez, Demián Salomón, Alexia Moyano, Berta Muñiz, María Laura Cali', null, 'While evil forces descend on Argentina, humanity’s best hope, a once-legendary shaman is confined to an insane asylum, powerless to avert the demonic resurrection.', 'While evil forces descend on Argentina, humanity’s best hope, a once-legendary shaman is confined to an insane asylum, powerless to avert the demonic resurrection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bpmojZqoclbXGcsG2VJq4GOWa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709195'),
  ('699269357962909076', 'Legitimate Violence', 1982, 'Action, Crime', 'Serge Leroy, Ramón F. Suárez', 'Pierre Fabre, Richard Morgiève, Patrick Laurent', 'Claude Brasseur, Véronique Genest, Christopher Lambert, Thierry Lhermitte, Valérie Kaprisky, Roger Planchon, Michel Aumont, Plastic Bertrand', null, 'In the course of a violent hold-up at Deauville station, several innocent bystanders are shot dead. The victims include a politician, Robert Andréani, and three members of the same family. Devastated by the death of his wife, daughter and mother, Martin Modot resolves that their killers will be brought to justice. When the police fail to make any progress in their investigation, he decides to take matters into his own hands, with the support of a neo-fascist vigilante organization.', 'In the course of a violent hold-up at Deauville station, several innocent bystanders are shot dead. The victims include a politician, Robert Andréani, and three members of the same family. Devastated by the death of his wife, daughter and mother, Martin Modot resolves that their killers will be brought to justice. When the police fail to make any progress in their investigation, he decides to take matters into his own hands, with the support of a neo-fascist vigilante organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR7IvXMx1wA28dcYBdi73FGWPvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222146'),
  ('4485410809265352', 'LEGO Batman: The Movie - DC Super Heroes Unite', 2013, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jon Burton, Jeremy Pardon', 'Jon Burton, David A. Goodman', 'Troy Baker, Charlie Schlatter, Travis Willingham, Clancy Brown, Christopher Corey Smith, Rob Paulsen, Townsend Coleman, Brian Bloom', 'G', 'Joker teams up with Lex Luthor to destroy the world one brick at a time. It''s up to Batman, Superman and the rest of the Justice League to stop them.', 'Joker teams up with Lex Luthor to destroy the world one brick at a time. It''s up to Batman, Superman and the rest of the Justice League to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY8lQeVN7wq6UAg3bLffVugK3p9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177271'),
  ('312366363670659121', 'LEGO DC Batman: Family Matters', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Action, Comedy', 'Matt Peters', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Troy Baker, Jason Spisak, Will Friedle, Tara Strong, Alyson Stoner, Scott Menville, Nolan North, Christian Lanz', 'NR', 'Suspicion is on high after Batman, Batgirl, Robin and other DC superheroes receive mysterious invitations. However, family values must remain strong when Batman and his team encounter the villainous Red Hood, who is obsessed with destroying the Bat-family and all of Gotham City.', 'Suspicion is on high after Batman, Batgirl, Robin and other DC superheroes receive mysterious invitations. However, family values must remain strong when Batman and his team encounter the villainous Red Hood, who is obsessed with destroying the Bat-family and all of Gotham City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA5bdwbzEAKfvjHRzza6Q3r0otq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602307'),
  ('1083872963054730221', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: Aquaman - Rage of Atlantis', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Action, Comedy', 'Matt Peters', 'Jim Krieg, Jeremy Adams', 'Dee Bradley Baker, Susan Eisenberg, Trevor Devall, Jonathan Adams, Troy Baker, Nolan North, Grey DeLisle, Khary Payton', 'NR', 'Aquaman must battle foes in the air, on land and in the depths of the Seven Seas, along with some help from The Justice League, to save the day.', 'Aquaman must battle foes in the air, on land and in the depths of the Seven Seas, along with some help from The Justice League, to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BqoJXMhrV9KfKmodPtyi67VgBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513736'),
  ('63563666589735090', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: Batman Be-Leaguered', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rick Morales', 'Jim Krieg', 'Troy Baker, Dee Bradley Baker, John DiMaggio, Grey DeLisle, Tom Kenny, Khary Payton, James Arnold Taylor, Nolan North', null, 'When Batman, claiming to be a loner, refuses to join the Justice League, he is drawn into working with them when they are kidnapped one-by-one and held prisoner by one of Batman''s nemeses.', 'When Batman, claiming to be a loner, refuses to join the Justice League, he is drawn into working with them when they are kidnapped one-by-one and held prisoner by one of Batman''s nemeses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JmTzxQx78PfRKVuQjpG80jjXoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300424'),
  ('982978254826841233', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: Justice League - Attack of the Legion of Doom!', 2015, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Rick Morales', 'Jim Krieg', 'Mark Hamill, Troy Baker, Nolan North, Josh Keaton, Khary Payton, James Arnold Taylor, Grey DeLisle, John DiMaggio', null, 'Crime is on the run as the newly formed Justice League keeps Metropolis safe and this makes evil genius Lex Luthor very unhappy. Together with Black Manta, Sinestro and a gang of ruthless recruits, Lex builds his own league and declares them the Legion of Doom. With this super powered team of terror and a plan to attack the top-secret government site, Area 52, can Lex finally be on the verge of victory? Sound the alarm and get ready for the bricks to fly when Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman and the rest of the Justice League face off against the world''s greatest Super-Villains! It''s the next all-new original movie from LEGO® and DC Comics.', 'Crime is on the run as the newly formed Justice League keeps Metropolis safe and this makes evil genius Lex Luthor very unhappy. Together with Black Manta, Sinestro and a gang of ruthless recruits, Lex builds his own league and declares them the Legion of Doom. With this super powered team of terror and a plan to attack the top-secret government site, Area 52, can Lex finally be on the verge of victory? Sound the alarm and get ready for the bricks to fly when Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman and the rest of the Justice League face off against the world''s greatest Super-Villains! It''s the next all-new original movie from LEGO® and DC Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7RowYDdokZgb8yW2cAlOS70JiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353595'),
  ('819760199848324361', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: Justice League - Cosmic Clash', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Rick Morales', 'Jim Krieg', 'Troy Baker, Grey DeLisle, Phil LaMarr, Nolan North, James Arnold Taylor, Kari Wahlgren, Khary Payton, Yuri Lowenthal', 'NR', 'Earth, a shiny jewel floating in the blackness of space... and for the robot known as Brainiac, the last piece to capture for his collection of planets. Not if the Justice League has anything to say about it!', 'Earth, a shiny jewel floating in the blackness of space... and for the robot known as Brainiac, the last piece to capture for his collection of planets. Not if the Justice League has anything to say about it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRsWTDTf0YJhcoDEDIW6xAFxBiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382512'),
  ('433195291150846507', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: Justice League - Gotham City Breakout', 2016, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Melchior Zwyer, Matt Peters', 'Jim Krieg', 'Troy Baker, Eric Bauza, Greg Cipes, John DiMaggio, Will Friedle, Grey DeLisle, Amy Hill, Sarah Hyland', 'NR', 'The caped crusader reluctantly agrees to let Batgirl and Nightwing take him on a long overdue vacation from crime-fighting, while Superman and the Justice League watch over Gotham City.', 'The caped crusader reluctantly agrees to let Batgirl and Nightwing take him on a long overdue vacation from crime-fighting, while Superman and the Justice League watch over Gotham City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVlV77juRfkB4gXtkgEqZyqHzkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396330'),
  ('1043228459521621228', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: Justice League vs. Bizarro League', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Brandon Vietti', 'Michael Jelenic', 'Nolan North, Troy Baker, Diedrich Bader, Khary Payton, James Arnold Taylor, John DiMaggio, Kari Wahlgren, Tony Todd', 'NR', 'Superman’s clone, Bizarro, has become an embarrassing problem. Chaos and destruction follow Bizarro everywhere as he always hears the opposite of what is said, says the opposite of what he means and does the opposite of what is right. And when the citizens of Metropolis keep confusing Bizarro with Superman, the Man of Steel decides it’s time to find a new home for him…on another planet! It’s up to the Justice League to come to terms with their backward counterparts and team up with them to stop Darkseid and save the galaxy!', 'Superman’s clone, Bizarro, has become an embarrassing problem. Chaos and destruction follow Bizarro everywhere as he always hears the opposite of what is said, says the opposite of what he means and does the opposite of what is right. And when the citizens of Metropolis keep confusing Bizarro with Superman, the Man of Steel decides it’s time to find a new home for him…on another planet! It’s up to the Justice League to come to terms with their backward counterparts and team up with them to stop Darkseid and save the galaxy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3EP0qrVY9k08OABBsLQMHzA0nG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322456'),
  ('362416726136207474', 'LEGO DC Comics Super Heroes: The Flash', 2018, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Ethan Spaulding', 'Jeremy Adams, Jim Krieg', 'James Arnold Taylor, Troy Baker, Nolan North, Dwight Schultz, Grey DeLisle, Eric Bauza, Tom Kenny, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'NR', 'Reverse-Flash manipulates the Speed Force to put the Flash into a time loop that forces him to relive the same day over and over again—with progressively disastrous results, including losing his powers and being fired by the Justice League. The Flash must find a way to restore time to its original path and finally apprehend his worst enemy before all is lost for the Flash…and the world!', 'Reverse-Flash manipulates the Speed Force to put the Flash into a time loop that forces him to relive the same day over and over again—with progressively disastrous results, including losing his powers and being fired by the Justice League. The Flash must find a way to restore time to its original path and finally apprehend his worst enemy before all is lost for the Flash…and the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxz7Qo3GhiHkkFl26tWJ3uIwXiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504997'),
  ('301184339640319038', 'LEGO DC Super Hero Girls: Brain Drain', 2017, 'Animation', 'Lindsay Halper, Daphne Fei, Matthew Girardi', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Grey DeLisle, Tara Strong, Anais Fairweather, Teala Dunn, Stephanie Sheh, Ashlyn Madden, Yvette Nicole Brown, Greg Cipes', 'NR', 'When Supergirl, Wonder Woman, Batgirl, Bumblebee and Katana suddenly realize they cannot remember a single moment from their Monday at Super Hero High, the young DC Super Heroes spring into sleuthing action! Suspecting foul-play, they band together to retrace their steps and uncover the mystery of who exactly stole their memories – and what nefarious plan might be afoot?', 'When Supergirl, Wonder Woman, Batgirl, Bumblebee and Katana suddenly realize they cannot remember a single moment from their Monday at Super Hero High, the young DC Super Heroes spring into sleuthing action! Suspecting foul-play, they band together to retrace their steps and uncover the mystery of who exactly stole their memories – and what nefarious plan might be afoot?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niLX2txdI5GlVowJlnb5Hr26QpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460135'),
  ('258934634565558208', 'LEGO DC: Shazam! Magic and Monsters', 2020, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Matt Peters', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Sean Astin, Troy Baker, Zach Callison, Grey DeLisle, Nolan North, Cristina Milizia, James Arnold Taylor, Imari Williams', null, 'It’s high time the Justice League took notice of Shazam, but joining the world’s greatest team of superheroes is a lot harder when they’ve all been turned into kids.', 'It’s high time the Justice League took notice of Shazam, but joining the world’s greatest team of superheroes is a lot harder when they’ve all been turned into kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziIyuNNNwYqv0qbOpV9VvvdnRBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690369'),
  ('1109202378847854733', 'Lego Disney Princess: The Castle Quest', 2023, 'Animation', 'Michael D. Black', 'Rachel Vine, Jenny Lee', 'Jodi Benson, Auliʻi Cravalho, Mandy Moore, Anika Noni Rose, Katherine Von Till, Richard White, Jo Anne Worley, Corey Burton', 'G', 'Tiana, Moana, Snow White, Rapunzel, and Ariel are off on an adventure as they are each unexpectedly transported to a mysterious castle. Shortly after arriving, they soon discover that Gaston has hatched an evil plan to take over all their kingdoms! The Princess characters must work together to solve challenges hidden deep within the castle walls and try to save their kingdoms from Gaston. Will bravery, quick-thinking, and teamwork prevail?', 'Tiana, Moana, Snow White, Rapunzel, and Ariel are off on an adventure as they are each unexpectedly transported to a mysterious castle. Shortly after arriving, they soon discover that Gaston has hatched an evil plan to take over all their kingdoms! The Princess characters must work together to solve challenges hidden deep within the castle walls and try to save their kingdoms from Gaston. Will bravery, quick-thinking, and teamwork prevail?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q17tXNROOslj7uCGicKNlIf9Rx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153222'),
  ('1121071530296182210', 'LEGO Disney Princess: Villains Unite', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Randi Rodrigues, Jake Wilkinson', 'Rachel Vine', 'Jodi Benson, Anika Noni Rose, Mandy Moore, Auliʻi Cravalho, Katherine Von Till, Jennifer Hale, Julie Nathanson, Kate Higgins', 'G', 'After Ariel, Moana, Tiana, Rapunzel, and Snow White thwarted Gaston''s plan to take over all of their kingdoms, he calls upon Ursula, Jafar, and the Evil Queen to help take the Princesses down once and for all. The Princesses learn about Gaston''s scheme and recruit a few friends of their own with the help of Magic Mirror: Aurora, Belle, and Cinderella! Together, the Princesses team up for an ultimate showdown of good versus evil.', 'After Ariel, Moana, Tiana, Rapunzel, and Snow White thwarted Gaston''s plan to take over all of their kingdoms, he calls upon Ursula, Jafar, and the Evil Queen to help take the Princesses down once and for all. The Princesses learn about Gaston''s scheme and recruit a few friends of their own with the help of Magic Mirror: Aurora, Belle, and Cinderella! Together, the Princesses team up for an ultimate showdown of good versus evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajcRSuv1rYbrDxnlNN5xx5H44Ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1515395'),
  ('452232734094540826', 'LEGO Frozen Northern Lights', 2017, 'Animation, Family', null, null, 'Kristen Bell, Ashlyn Faith Williams, Josh Gad, Jonathan Groff, Idina Menzel, Frank Welker', null, 'Elsa, Anna and friends search for the Northern Lights.', 'Elsa, Anna and friends search for the Northern Lights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlk5MeGlNSiy773SWot9dGAQ2as.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431562'),
  ('724265613079898766', 'LEGO Frozen: Operation Puffins', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Alexandru Nagy', null, 'Abby Trott, Danielle Bisutti, Alan Tudyk, Stephen J. Anderson, Jake Green, Matt Lowe, Paul Briggs', 'G', 'After the events of Frozen, Anna and Elsa want to start fresh in Arendelle, and make the castle feel a bit more comfortable. While they struggle to break free of the bounds of tradition, the Duke of Weselton has other plans for their beloved home alongside a flock of menacing puffins.', 'After the events of Frozen, Anna and Elsa want to start fresh in Arendelle, and make the castle feel a bit more comfortable. While they struggle to break free of the bounds of tradition, the Duke of Weselton has other plans for their beloved home alongside a flock of menacing puffins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gcpeI5drcUI81KbZjRLm4EAJII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1549292'),
