  ('971965579259722409', 'Legong: Dance of the Virgins', 1935, 'Drama', 'Henri de la Falaise', 'Henri de la Falaise', 'Poetoe Aloes Goesti, Njong Njong Njoman, Saplak Njoman, Bagus Mara Goesti', null, 'In Bali, a young woman falls for a musician, but he may have eyes for her half sister.', 'In Bali, a young woman falls for a musician, but he may have eyes for her half sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsPDG2kouuicDkIujpC1d11OfFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138087'),
  ('387717133507637312', 'Legs of Gold', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Turi Vasile, Roberto Pariante, Lucio Romeo', 'Antonio Margheriti, Turi Vasile', 'Rossella Como, Scilla Gabel, Paolo Ferrari, Rosario Borelli, Dolores Palumbo, Elsa Merlini, Giampiero Littera, Turi Pandolfini', null, 'Baron Luigi Fontana is a rich and stinging producer of fine wines, as well as president of the amateur football team of Cerignola who, to crown a triumphant championship, is about to be promoted to Serie C.', 'Baron Luigi Fontana is a rich and stinging producer of fine wines, as well as president of the amateur football team of Cerignola who, to crown a triumphant championship, is about to be promoted to Serie C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m44okQ6sHDEZ2OlVqedhpFMwG2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167418'),
  ('836077698372186649', 'Lei mi parla ancora', 2021, 'Drama', 'Riccardo Marchesini, As Chianese, Pupi Avati', 'Pupi Avati, Tommaso Avati', 'Renato Pozzetto, Stefania Sandrelli, Isabella Ragonese, Lino Musella, Fabrizio Gifuni, Chiara Caselli, Alessandro Haber, Serena Grandi', null, 'Nino and Caterina have been married for 65 years. After Caterina''s death, their daughter Elisabetta, trying to help her father to overcome the loss, hires an author to write a book on their love story.', 'Nino and Caterina have been married for 65 years. After Caterina''s death, their daughter Elisabetta, trying to help her father to overcome the loss, hires an author to write a book on their love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpR6v7Ce3sEIzSNQWrpK6K3DJS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702479'),
  ('29861973233695453', 'Leibstandarte: My Honor Was Loyalty', 2015, 'Drama, War', 'Alessandro Pepe', null, 'Leone Frisa, Francesco Migliore, Paolo Vaccarino, Albrecht Weimer, Alessandra Oriti, Alessandro Pepe, Giulia Dichiaro, Alessio Perrone', null, 'Captain Ludwig Herckel a devoted and patriotic soldier of the SS Leibstandarte fights in every major conflict from the Eastern front to the battle of the bulge. Fiercely loyal to his country and his brothers in arms, loved by his men, Herckel will face his greatest battle yet when he discovers the truth about the Nazi regime.', 'Captain Ludwig Herckel a devoted and patriotic soldier of the SS Leibstandarte fights in every major conflict from the Eastern front to the battle of the bulge. Fiercely loyal to his country and his brothers in arms, loved by his men, Herckel will face his greatest battle yet when he discovers the truth about the Nazi regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nU4oFu7ys6TwdvYWcMazDeNQ6xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383001'),
  ('219914713235670818', 'Leif', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Claes Eriksson, Michael Sevholt, Johan Thorén', 'Claes Eriksson', 'Anders Eriksson, Kerstin Granlund, Claes Eriksson, Knut Agnred, Per Fritzell, Peter Rangmar, Jan Rippe, Laila Westersund', null, 'In the small working community, the entry in the local newspaper hits like a bomb. The signature "Leif" claims that the town''s large arms company Rotum exports weapons illegally. Gunnar Volt, CEO of Rotum, gets a shock. Imagine that someone has the audacity to say that about the community''s pride Rotum - even if it now happens to be true. He immediately gathers the management and everyone agrees: Leif must be found - and stopped. But who is this mysterious Leif?', 'In the small working community, the entry in the local newspaper hits like a bomb. The signature "Leif" claims that the town''s large arms company Rotum exports weapons illegally. Gunnar Volt, CEO of Rotum, gets a shock. Imagine that someone has the audacity to say that about the community''s pride Rotum - even if it now happens to be true. He immediately gathers the management and everyone agrees: Leif must be found - and stopped. But who is this mysterious Leif?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3O7wlAY5hmNjadZzDWQOzITa0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41076'),
  ('212789385927179785', 'Leila', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Mahmoud Kalari', 'Mahnaz Ansarian, Dariush Mehrjui', 'Leila Hatami, Ali Mosaffa, Jamileh Sheikhi, Turan Mehrzad, Amir Pievar, Mohammadreza Sharifinia, Shaghayegh Farahani, Payam Saberi', null, 'This film tells the story of a semi modern Iranian couple, who are trying to fight the old beliefs and old generation. This is a failing battle because the man is not strong enough.', 'This film tells the story of a semi modern Iranian couple, who are trying to fight the old beliefs and old generation. This is a failing battle because the man is not strong enough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWD44o01amfOAQ2mAouIYogtS0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45899'),
  ('236571222859581574', 'Leila', 2011, 'Music, Romance', 'Audrey Estrougo, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Audrey Estrougo', 'Leïla Bekhti, Benjamin Siksou, Cécile Cassel, Chantal Lauby, Nicolas Briançon, Selim Clayssen, Abel Jafri, Sara Martins', null, 'Gab has a well-ordered life: a fiancée, a wealthy family. Leïla, who struggles to juggle her studies, odd jobs, and a brother to support, does not allow herself to live her own life... When Gab meets Leïla, it is a clash of worlds, the beginning of a great love story that will collide violently with reality.', 'Gab has a well-ordered life: a fiancée, a wealthy family. Leïla, who struggles to juggle her studies, odd jobs, and a brother to support, does not allow herself to live her own life... When Gab meets Leïla, it is a clash of worlds, the beginning of a great love story that will collide violently with reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jPfmAyQgNLF0h1yvnooASrdKU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58253'),
  ('928262470862743743', 'Leila', 2018, 'Drama', 'Naidra Ayadi', 'Naidra Ayadi', 'Roschdy Zem, Natacha Krief, Darina Al Joundi, Camille Aguilar, Doria Achour, Fayçal Safi, Meriem Serbah, Valérie Sibilia', null, 'Hakim and Latifa fled the Algerian civil war in the early 90s. They live since in the Jura, with their two daughters: Nedjma 14 years, and Leila, the eldest, left to study hair in Paris. Three days before Christmas, Nedjma receives a terse SMS from her older sister. She will not be able to come to join them for the holidays, pretexting once more an overload of work - Latifa attacks Hakim and pushes him to fetch Leïla. Nedjma will come with him, they will take the opportunity to discover Paris. Upon their arrival in the hair salon, they learn that Leila has actually never worked. It is the journey of a father who begins in Paris one night until dawn.', 'Hakim and Latifa fled the Algerian civil war in the early 90s. They live since in the Jura, with their two daughters: Nedjma 14 years, and Leila, the eldest, left to study hair in Paris. Three days before Christmas, Nedjma receives a terse SMS from her older sister. She will not be able to come to join them for the holidays, pretexting once more an overload of work - Latifa attacks Hakim and pushes him to fetch Leïla. Nedjma will come with him, they will take the opportunity to discover Paris. Upon their arrival in the hair salon, they learn that Leila has actually never worked. It is the journey of a father who begins in Paris one night until dawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUf7obaJVpurCPpnMjnJjqzrOtr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533048'),
  ('665448270891605434', 'Leila''s Brothers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Saeed Roustaee, Hooman Behmanesh', 'Saeed Roustaee', 'Taraneh Alidoosti, Saeed Poursamimi, Navid Mohammadzadeh, Payman Maadi, Farhad Aslani, Nayereh Farahani, Mohammad Ali Mohammadi, Mehdi Hosseininia', null, 'At the age of 40, Leila has spent her entire life caring for her parents and four brothers. A family that is constantly arguing and under pressure from various debts in the face of sanctions against Iran. While her brothers are struggling to make ends meet, Leila makes a plan.', 'At the age of 40, Leila has spent her entire life caring for her parents and four brothers. A family that is constantly arguing and under pressure from various debts in the face of sanctions against Iran. While her brothers are struggling to make ends meet, Leila makes a plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onQUSikPNXVvoT3wCLzHgiOPrHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962558'),
  ('923593392687485065', 'Leily is with Me', 1996, 'War, History, Comedy', 'Kamal Tabrizi', null, 'Parviz Parastouei, Mahmud Azizi, Maziar Lorestani, Sahereh Matin', null, 'During the Iran-Iraq war, a television cinematographer, having financial problems, needs to get a loan from the TV to complete his half-built flat so one of his colleagues suggests him going to the war zone under the pretext of making a documentary about the Iraqi captives for the sake of accompanying another man who is so influential in TV''s treasury, so that he can take his loan more easily. However he doesn''t want to get to the line of fire, his sanctimonious demeanor leads him to something more precious than what he started his journey for.', 'During the Iran-Iraq war, a television cinematographer, having financial problems, needs to get a loan from the TV to complete his half-built flat so one of his colleagues suggests him going to the war zone under the pretext of making a documentary about the Iraqi captives for the sake of accompanying another man who is so influential in TV''s treasury, so that he can take his loan more easily. However he doesn''t want to get to the line of fire, his sanctimonious demeanor leads him to something more precious than what he started his journey for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1X6NpO2w79uVdG0bCZiwb1xb6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384295'),
  ('157147753670547171', 'Leisure', 1976, 'Animation', 'David Denneen, Bruce Petty', null, 'Alexander Archdale', null, 'The animated history of leisure: that concept most commonly known as free time.', 'The animated history of leisure: that concept most commonly known as free time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiZxQQF3qQNh0Kb29OBqPm7wqQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207437'),
  ('539901476864992082', 'Lejos de casa', 2020, 'Drama', 'María Laura Dariomerlo, Adrián Lorenzo', 'Javier Martínez Foffani', 'Cumelén Sanz, Gabriel Gallicchio, Ana Celentano, Abel Ayala, Daniel Kuzniecka', null, 'Florencia was raised with an absent mother and a father who rebuilt his life. Endure that reality with drugs and alcohol. Faced with her extreme behavior, her father sends her to her mother''s house, where he will jeopardize his bond with her, but she will also meet Sebastián.', 'Florencia was raised with an absent mother and a father who rebuilt his life. Endure that reality with drugs and alcohol. Faced with her extreme behavior, her father sends her to her mother''s house, where he will jeopardize his bond with her, but she will also meet Sebastián.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJciZnoegkorXydE5h4c0zf24Kj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663037'),
  ('811464947336890655', 'Lelam', 1997, 'Action', 'Joshiy, Ouseppachan', 'Renji Panicker', 'Suresh Gopi, M G Soman, Kausalya, Kaviyoor Renuka, Siddique, Maniyanpilla Raju, N F Varghese, Spadikam George', null, 'Rivalry between two liquor business groups led by Anakkattil family and Kadayadi family in Kerala. Chackochi must fight to retain Anakkattil family''s control in the business.', 'Rivalry between two liquor business groups led by Anakkattil family and Kadayadi family in Kerala. Chackochi must fight to retain Anakkattil family''s control in the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPotF8bXx7o1cP9ZeoNIbRzgBvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351632'),
  ('308959382196292929', 'Lelíček in the Services of Sherlock Holmes', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Karel Lamač, Jan Stallich, Otto Heller', 'Václav Wasserman', 'Vlasta Burian, Martin Frič, Lída Baarová, Theodor Pištěk, Eva Jansenová, Fred Bulín, Arnold Reimann, Jára Beneš', null, 'The Portorican prime minister asks British detective Sherlock Holmes to find a twin for King Fernando XXIII, a weak and frightened man who fears anarchists and does not want to show himself in public. Holmes finds in the Czech newspapers a photo of the perfect double, František Lelíček, a daring bon vivant drowned in debt, so when Holmes offers him money, Lelíček decides to travel to Portorico and play the role.', 'The Portorican prime minister asks British detective Sherlock Holmes to find a twin for King Fernando XXIII, a weak and frightened man who fears anarchists and does not want to show himself in public. Holmes finds in the Czech newspapers a photo of the perfect double, František Lelíček, a daring bon vivant drowned in debt, so when Holmes offers him money, Lelíček decides to travel to Portorico and play the role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcuSN0ATlQcfy7tbccncwo2pwNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163163'),
  ('581618832924158959', 'LelleBelle', 2010, 'Music, Romance', 'Mischa Kamp, Anne van Dongen, Daniël Bouquet', 'Tamara Monzon, Jacqueline Epskamp', 'Anna Raadsveld, Benja Bruijning, Charlie Dagelet, Tom Van Landuyt, Renée Fokker, Joost Bolt, Isis Cabolet, Roscoe Leijen', null, '19-year old Belle practices playing the violin diligently, but is unable to impart her music with a sensitive undertone. Her life changes when she discovers that sexual desire stimulates passion in her music.', '19-year old Belle practices playing the violin diligently, but is unable to impart her music with a sensitive undertone. Her life changes when she discovers that sexual desire stimulates passion in her music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osDWrq7tQzj1zD5AsAyFejFUHWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52371'),
  ('919874492257097147', 'Lembayung', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Baim Wong, Ipung Rachmat Syaiful, Bakti Adhitama', 'Ruben Adrian S., Baim Wong, Gemati Rahayu', 'Taskya Namya, Yasamin Jasem, Arya Saloka, Anna Jobling, Daffa Wardhana, Oka Antara, Tio Pakusadewo, Paula Verhoeven', null, 'Arum and Pica, who wanted to complete their internship at Lembayung hospital, had to face mysterious terror from a woman satan who was suspected of hanged herself in the bathroom. The situation became even more tense after they asked others for help to the point where they threatened their own lives and those closest to them.', 'Arum and Pica, who wanted to complete their internship at Lembayung hospital, had to face mysterious terror from a woman satan who was suspected of hanged herself in the bathroom. The situation became even more tense after they asked others for help to the point where they threatened their own lives and those closest to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5x9LrW0yvtt6S3XovIQHgXfYvLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1164355'),
  ('1002129515301364112', 'Lemebel', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Lissette Orozco, Joanna Reposi, Niles Atallah', null, 'Pedro Lemebel, Tevo Díaz, Pía Barros', null, 'Pedro Lemebel, the writer and visual artist, defeated a marginal childhood to become one of the first to shake up Chile’s conservative society during Pinochet’s dictatorship. Dressed in feather boas, stilettos and a sharp tongue, he staged revolutionary performances that defied the era’s terror, he said what no one wanted to hear in a homophobic, repressed and militarized country.', 'Pedro Lemebel, the writer and visual artist, defeated a marginal childhood to become one of the first to shake up Chile’s conservative society during Pinochet’s dictatorship. Dressed in feather boas, stilettos and a sharp tongue, he staged revolutionary performances that defied the era’s terror, he said what no one wanted to hear in a homophobic, repressed and militarized country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqXbYgaXOtZxIRNE6dS9Nynvw2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577080'),
  ('195727939179090079', 'Lemming', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Dominik Moll, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Gilles Marchand, Dominik Moll', 'Laurent Lucas, Charlotte Gainsbourg, André Dussollier, Charlotte Rampling, Jacques Bonnaffé, Véronique Affholder, Michel Cassagne, Florence Desille', null, 'After the death of his boss''s wife, a young engineer faces the sudden psychological metamorphosis of his own wife, seemingly possessed by the soul of the deceased...', 'After the death of his boss''s wife, a young engineer faces the sudden psychological metamorphosis of his own wife, seemingly possessed by the soul of the deceased...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzGmXQnc9xsFoVM1Zqqm7r4hfBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1622'),
  ('739425964537386518', 'Lemmy', 2010, 'Music, Documentary', 'Greg Olliver, Wes Orshoski', 'Greg Olliver, Wes Orshoski', 'Lemmy Kilmister, Dave Brock, Phil Campbell, ''Fast'' Eddie Clark, Jarvis Cocker, Alice Cooper, Mikkey Dee, C.C. DeVille', 'NR', 'Over four decades, Motorhead frontman Lemmy Kilmister has registered an immeasurable impact on music history. Nearly 65, he remains the living embodiment of the rock and roll lifestyle, and this feature-length documentary tells his story, one of a hard-living rock icon who continues to enjoy the life of a man half his age.', 'Over four decades, Motorhead frontman Lemmy Kilmister has registered an immeasurable impact on music history. Nearly 65, he remains the living embodiment of the rock and roll lifestyle, and this feature-length documentary tells his story, one of a hard-living rock icon who continues to enjoy the life of a man half his age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj6YpG93RjzryMdue93rcbUHK4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53344'),
  ('462787665495019329', 'Lemon', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'Light begins to illuminate the small, nipple-like end of a lemon on the right edge of the frame and gradually spreads until the entire lemon is clearly visible. Then the light recedes across the frame.', 'Light begins to illuminate the small, nipple-like end of a lemon on the right edge of the frame and gradually spreads until the entire lemon is clearly visible. Then the light recedes across the frame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syxhcP0ypDLKNKM1OyoB4GM3g8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146827'),
  ('193004718902978391', 'Lemon', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Janicza Bravo, Jason McCormick', 'Janicza Bravo, Brett Gelman', 'Brett Gelman, Judy Greer, Michael Cera, Gillian Jacobs, Jeff Garlin, Kayla Harrity, Shiri Appleby, Megan Mullally', null, 'Isaac has seen better days. His acting career is tanking, his blind girlfriend of 10 years plans to leave him, and his own family singles him out as a constant disappointment. Even as he takes a chance on new romance, he struggles to define his place in a world that has seemingly turned against him.', 'Isaac has seen better days. His acting career is tanking, his blind girlfriend of 10 years plans to leave him, and his own family singles him out as a constant disappointment. Even as he takes a chance on new romance, he struggles to define his place in a world that has seemingly turned against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZWjfUKuqufDjp3C9ufI8DLAxH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428585'),
  ('4231078112300384', 'Lemon and Poppy Seed Cake', 2021, 'Drama', 'Benito Zambrano', 'Benito Zambrano, Cristina Campos', 'Elia Galera, Eva Martín, Mariona Pagès, Marilú Marini, Tommy Schlesser, Hoji Fortuna', null, 'In a small town located in the island of Mallorca, Anna and Marina, two sisters who were separated when they were teenagers, meet again to sell a bakery they’ve inherited from a mysterious woman they know nothing about. The two sisters have led very different lives. Anna has barely left the island and is unhappily married to a man she no longer loves. Marina travels the world working as a doctor for an NGO. As the sisters try to uncover the secrets hidden behind their enigmatic benefactor and her property, they are forced to confront old family disputes and make up for lost time.', 'In a small town located in the island of Mallorca, Anna and Marina, two sisters who were separated when they were teenagers, meet again to sell a bakery they’ve inherited from a mysterious woman they know nothing about. The two sisters have led very different lives. Anna has barely left the island and is unhappily married to a man she no longer loves. Marina travels the world working as a doctor for an NGO. As the sisters try to uncover the secrets hidden behind their enigmatic benefactor and her property, they are forced to confront old family disputes and make up for lost time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dimBDXhSiP2MCq0SxxRagLIvYi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793157'),
  ('984795810554882090', 'Lemon Popsicle', 1978, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adam Greenberg, Boaz Davidson', 'Boaz Davidson, Eli Tavor', 'Yftach Katzur, Anat Atzmon, Jonathan Sagall, Zachi Noy, Dvora Kedar, Ophelia Shtruhl, Menashe Warshavsky, Rachel Steiner', 'R', 'Benji, Bobby, and Huey are three 17 year olds who spend their days chasing girls and hanging out at Montana''s Ice Cream Parlor. In their constant pursuit for sex, they are caught in the apartment of local nymphomaniac Stella by her boyfriend and get more than they bargained for from hooker Ze Ze! Meanwhile, Benji has fallen for new girl Nikki and is the only person who comes to her aid after Bobby gets her pregnant then dumps her.', 'Benji, Bobby, and Huey are three 17 year olds who spend their days chasing girls and hanging out at Montana''s Ice Cream Parlor. In their constant pursuit for sex, they are caught in the apartment of local nymphomaniac Stella by her boyfriend and get more than they bargained for from hooker Ze Ze! Meanwhile, Benji has fallen for new girl Nikki and is the only person who comes to her aid after Bobby gets her pregnant then dumps her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14tlbgXfd3Q3bGIdAPdBfSAyTM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10580'),
  ('924965996642530187', 'Lemon Tree', 2008, 'Drama', 'Eran Riklis, Rainer Klausmann', 'Suha Arraf, Eran Riklis', 'Hiam Abbass, Tarik Kopty, Ali Suliman, Doron Tavory, Rona Lipaz-Michael, Amos Lavi, Amnon Wolf, Liron Baranes', null, 'Salma Zidane, a widow, lives simply from her grove of lemon trees in the West Bank''s occupied territory. The Israeli defence minister and his wife move next door, forcing the Secret Service to order the trees'' removal for security. The stoic Salma seeks assistance from the Palestinian Authority, Israeli army, and a young attorney, Ziad Daud, who takes the case. In this allegory, does David stand a chance against Goliath?', 'Salma Zidane, a widow, lives simply from her grove of lemon trees in the West Bank''s occupied territory. The Israeli defence minister and his wife move next door, forcing the Secret Service to order the trees'' removal for security. The stoic Salma seeks assistance from the Palestinian Authority, Israeli army, and a young attorney, Ziad Daud, who takes the case. In this allegory, does David stand a chance against Goliath?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja6wxZbjuv6hwnZ7LCHfN85kd0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7860'),
  ('639843792288523802', 'Lemon Tree Passage', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Campbell', 'David Campbell, Erica Brien', 'Jessica Tovey, Nicholas Gunn, Pippa Black, Andrew Ryan, Tim Pocock, Piéra Forde, Tim Phillipps', null, 'An Australian urban legend comes screaming on the Ozploitation scene. It’s said that if you drive down the creepy road of Lemon Tree Passage, and witness a sudden flash of light in the trees, you''ll be forever haunted by the tormented spirit of a man killed by thrill speeding teenagers. Wanting to put this old wives’ tale to the test, a car-load of non-believers take the supposedly cursed journey and do indeed see a strange manifestation. But it’s not the one of popular myth - this sudden possession of one of their number involves another altogether more shocking crime. That of a young girl raped and murdered on the same stretch of highway. As one urban legend trumps another, the scared passengers must sort out the facts of both cases before vengeful justice from beyond the grave can be meted out with moody atmosphere, ghostly thrills and supernatural suspense.', 'An Australian urban legend comes screaming on the Ozploitation scene. It’s said that if you drive down the creepy road of Lemon Tree Passage, and witness a sudden flash of light in the trees, you''ll be forever haunted by the tormented spirit of a man killed by thrill speeding teenagers. Wanting to put this old wives’ tale to the test, a car-load of non-believers take the supposedly cursed journey and do indeed see a strange manifestation. But it’s not the one of popular myth - this sudden possession of one of their number involves another altogether more shocking crime. That of a young girl raped and murdered on the same stretch of highway. As one urban legend trumps another, the scared passengers must sort out the facts of both cases before vengeful justice from beyond the grave can be meted out with moody atmosphere, ghostly thrills and supernatural suspense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHjyhqP4v9srcV5mKYNvfHEnJsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280000'),
  ('984053556333022454', 'Lemonade', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ali Atay, Ahmet Sesigürgil', 'Ali Atay, Ertan Saban', 'Ertan Saban, Serkan Keskin, Funda Eryiğit, Luran Ahmeti, Zekir Sipahi, Bedia Begovska, Sebahattin Bilal, Ciguli', null, 'So begins an entertaining road story where we witness two brothers with different cultural backgrounds, who don''t even know each other, have similarities, differences and even their fights.', 'So begins an entertaining road story where we witness two brothers with different cultural backgrounds, who don''t even know each other, have similarities, differences and even their fights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MazYGwGlJ7zNQKTzh8Y30mpnwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333886'),
  ('453803953421909132', 'Lemonade', 2016, 'Music, Documentary', 'Beyoncé, Kahlil Joseph, Chayse Irvin', 'Warsan Shire, Beyoncé', 'Beyoncé, Brittani Alexander, Jasmine Badie, Fulani Bahati, Chloe Bailey, Halle Bailey, Denee Baptiste, Kendra Bracy', 'R', 'The second "visual album" (a collection of short films) by Beyoncé, this time around she takes a piercing look at racial issues and feminist concepts through a sexualized, satirical, and solemn tone.', 'The second "visual album" (a collection of short films) by Beyoncé, this time around she takes a piercing look at racial issues and feminist concepts through a sexualized, satirical, and solemn tone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8Kr7GwRFKh7sdd9wy2tQYPGaOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394269'),
  ('1030739659334744065', 'Lemonade Joe', 1964, 'Comedy, Western', 'Oldřich Lipský, Tomáš Svoboda, Vladimír Novotný', 'Jiří Brdečka, Oldřich Lipský', 'Karel Fiala, Miloš Kopecký, Rudolf Deyl, Květa Fialová, Olga Schoberová, Bohuš Záhorský, Josef Hlinomaz, Karel Effa', null, 'A satire of the Great American Way, with Lemonade Joe a "clean living" gunfighter who drinks only Kola-Loca Lemonade and convinces everyone else in town (with his gun skills) that all "real men" drink ONLY lemonade!', 'A satire of the Great American Way, with Lemonade Joe a "clean living" gunfighter who drinks only Kola-Loca Lemonade and convinces everyone else in town (with his gun skills) that all "real men" drink ONLY lemonade!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQM8tVWVRoYbyDe0qWyu5luixjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20629'),
  ('292363385295527156', 'Lemonade Mouth', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Kaären F. Ochoa, Checco Varese, Sarah Lemon', 'April Blair', 'Bridgit Mendler, Adam Hicks, Hayley Kiyoko, Naomi Scott, Blake Michael, Christopher McDonald, Nick Roux, Tisha Campbell', 'G', 'When five ragtag freshman first meet in detention, it seems they have nothing in common. But, through music, they form an unbreakable bond and discover they have the makings of the greatest high school garage band in history! In the face of incredible odds, Olivia, Stella, Wen, Mohini and Charlie find they can make a real difference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.', 'When five ragtag freshman first meet in detention, it seems they have nothing in common. But, through music, they form an unbreakable bond and discover they have the makings of the greatest high school garage band in history! In the face of incredible odds, Olivia, Stella, Wen, Mohini and Charlie find they can make a real difference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65218'),
  ('1066694963047560264', 'Lemony Snicket''s A Series of Unfortunate Events', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Brad Silberling, Emmanuel Lubezki, John Dexter', 'Robert Gordon', 'Emily Browning, Liam Aiken, Kara Hoffman, Shelby Hoffman, Jim Carrey, Meryl Streep, Jude Law, Timothy Spall', 'PG', 'Three wealthy children''s parents are killed in a fire. When they are sent to a distant relative, they find out that he is plotting to kill them and seize their fortune.', 'Three wealthy children''s parents are killed in a fire. When they are sent to a distant relative, they find out that he is plotting to kill them and seize their fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76Xi8z7Whv5WFIdfzzvC5tKSicd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11774'),
  ('1129123940545740691', 'Lemora: A Child''s Tale of the Supernatural', 1974, 'Horror', 'Richard Blackburn, Robert Caramico', 'Robert Fern, Richard Blackburn', 'Lesley Gilb Taplin, Cheryl Smith, William Whitton, Hy Pyke, Maxine Ballantyne, Steve Johnson, Parker West, Richard Blackburn', 'PG', 'A notorious bank robber kills his wife and flees the police, only to be captured by a mysterious group of figures in an abandoned town. His beautiful daughter, Lila Lee, receives a letter stating that her father is near death and that he needs to see her. Sneaking away at night from her minister guardian, Lila embarks on a terrifying journey...', 'A notorious bank robber kills his wife and flees the police, only to be captured by a mysterious group of figures in an abandoned town. His beautiful daughter, Lila Lee, receives a letter stating that her father is near death and that he needs to see her. Sneaking away at night from her minister guardian, Lila embarks on a terrifying journey...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdV3CGZ88oglZWRdCRYoNY69izZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31596'),
  ('452437131302711262', 'LenaLove', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Florian Gaag, Christian Rein', 'Florian Gaag', 'Emilia Schüle, Jannik Schümann, Sina Tkotsch, Kyra Sophia Kahre, Anna Bederke, Felix Knopp, Sandra Borgmann, Georg Böhm', null, 'Set in your average suburban town, a young girl suddenly disappears after being in contact with a strange boy on a social networking platform, and after being bullied by her former best friend. Some people in town start to get nervous as the facade of suburban perfection crumbles, lifting the shadow to reveal a monstrous intrigue and an appalling truth...', 'Set in your average suburban town, a young girl suddenly disappears after being in contact with a strange boy on a social networking platform, and after being bullied by her former best friend. Some people in town start to get nervous as the facade of suburban perfection crumbles, lifting the shadow to reveal a monstrous intrigue and an appalling truth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OIFi06IoWRKyzV0oBHgaWghT8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410924'),
  ('118783255529834830', 'Lend a Paw', 1941, 'Family, Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi, Don A. Duckwall', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', 'G', 'Jealous over Mickey''s attention to a kitten, Pluto''s devil-self argues with his angel-self over whether or not to rescue the kitten when it falls into a well. The angel-self wins, and Pluto is treated like a hero. In the end, he and the kitten become friends.', 'Jealous over Mickey''s attention to a kitten, Pluto''s devil-self argues with his angel-self over whether or not to rescue the kitten when it falls into a well. The angel-self wins, and Pluto is treated like a hero. In the end, he and the kitten become friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J7EJbQE1jEgU5BhkMZsWZQoue0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51024'),
  ('593726536072299346', 'Lenin in 1918', 1939, 'Drama, History', 'Mikhail Romm, Boris Volchek, Evgeny Aron', 'Aleksei Kapler, Tatyana Zlatogorova', 'Boris Shchukin, Nikolai Okhlopkov, Aleksandr Shatov, Vasiliy Markov, Vasili Vanin, Nikolai Cherkasov, Leonid Lyubashevsky, Vladimir Solovyov', null, 'Historical-revolutionary film about Lenin’s activities in the first years after the Great October Revolution in Russia.', 'Historical-revolutionary film about Lenin’s activities in the first years after the Great October Revolution in Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2N9iEFGEyXGJzktkKauzMfGHij0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337711'),
  ('324897737352612473', 'Lenin in October', 1937, 'Drama, History', 'Mikhail Romm, Boris Volchek, Isidor Simkov', 'Aleksei Kapler', 'Boris Shchukin, Nikolai Okhlopkov, Vasili Vanin, Nikolai Arsky, Nikolai Chaplygin, Vladimir Vladislavskiy, Semyon Goldshtab, Nikolai Svobodin', null, 'Commissioned by Josef Stalin to commemorate the 20th anniversary of the Soviet Revolution, Lenin in October was the first of Russian director Mikhail Romm''s tributes to the Marxist visionary who helped orchestrate the insurrection of October, 1917.', 'Commissioned by Josef Stalin to commemorate the 20th anniversary of the Soviet Revolution, Lenin in October was the first of Russian director Mikhail Romm''s tributes to the Marxist visionary who helped orchestrate the insurrection of October, 1917.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AVnDjpu42ECPyvfFeFSPVrzoOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204802'),
  ('668170107369797692', 'Lenin in Paris', 1981, 'History', 'Sergei Yutkevich, Boris Travkin, Leonid Ejdlin', 'Yevgeni Gabrilovich, Sergei Yutkevich', 'Yuriy Kayurov, Claude Jade, Vladimir Antonik, Valentina Svetlova, Pavel Kadochnikov, Antonina Maksimova, Boris Ivanov, Albert Filozov', null, '1911. Lenin organizes the first Bolshevik party school near Paris, in the small town of Longjumeau. Through a chain of historical parallels and associations, this time is intertwined with the events of the Paris Commune, the October Revolution and the political struggles of the post-revolutionary years.', '1911. Lenin organizes the first Bolshevik party school near Paris, in the small town of Longjumeau. Through a chain of historical parallels and associations, this time is intertwined with the events of the Paris Commune, the October Revolution and the political struggles of the post-revolutionary years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t68DlGnMS5xhGwWyjXfVrEMOjwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2381'),
  ('481926700689771618', 'Lenin in Poland', 1966, 'Drama', 'Sergei Yutkevich, Jan Rutkiewicz, Zbigniew Kociuba', 'Sergei Yutkevich, Yevgeni Gabrilovich', 'Maksim Shtraukh, Ilona Kuśmierska-Kocyłak, Anna Lisyanskaya, Tadeusz Fijewski, Edmund Fetting, Gustaw Lutkiewicz, Kazimierz Rudzki, Ludwik Benoit', null, 'The life of the great Bolshevik leader before the Russian revolution is chronicled in this bio-pic. Much of the tale centers on his exile in Poland where Lenin becomes friends with two peasants. The little girl has a strong belief in the nationalist cause. Later Lenin hears she was killed for withholding information about him.', 'The life of the great Bolshevik leader before the Russian revolution is chronicled in this bio-pic. Much of the tale centers on his exile in Poland where Lenin becomes friends with two peasants. The little girl has a strong belief in the nationalist cause. Later Lenin hears she was killed for withholding information about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ws7yRtphg4aypvfg4jki8Sno1j1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198802'),
  ('684082074302197499', 'Leningrad', 2009, 'War, Drama', 'Vladimir Klimov, Aleksandr Buravskiy, Leo Zisman', 'Aleksandr Buravskiy', 'Gabriel Byrne, Mira Sorvino, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Alexander Beyer, Christian Berkel, Eckehard Hoffmann, Olga Sutulova, Aleksandr Abdulov', 'PG-13', 'When in 1941 Nazi Germany invaded the Soviet Union, their troops quickly besieged Leningrad. Foreign journalists are evacuated but one of them, Kate Davies, is presumed dead and misses the plane. Alone in the city she is helped by Nina Tsvetnova a young and idealist police officer and together they will fight for their own survival and the survival of the people in the besieged Leningrad.', 'When in 1941 Nazi Germany invaded the Soviet Union, their troops quickly besieged Leningrad. Foreign journalists are evacuated but one of them, Kate Davies, is presumed dead and misses the plane. Alone in the city she is helped by Nina Tsvetnova a young and idealist police officer and together they will fight for their own survival and the survival of the people in the besieged Leningrad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dofjiUPkEiGY7iFVPv6LSAAwII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2325'),
  ('1110187020777050129', 'Leningrad Cowboys Go America', 1989, 'Comedy, Music', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Pauli Pentti', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Matti Pellonpää, Kari Väänänen, Sakke Järvenpää, Heikki Keskinen, Pimme Korhonen, Sakari Kuosmanen, Puka Oinonen, Silu Seppälä', 'PG-13', 'The Leningrad Cowboys, a group of Siberian musicians, and their manager, travel to America seeking fame and fortune. As they cross the country, trying to get to a wedding in Mexico, they are followed by the village idiot, who wishes to join the band.', 'The Leningrad Cowboys, a group of Siberian musicians, and their manager, travel to America seeking fame and fortune. As they cross the country, trying to get to a wedding in Mexico, they are followed by the village idiot, who wishes to join the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYI5IAKwqOl6nPcAYL58VzI0EXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11475'),
  ('361757976754391133', 'Leningrad Cowboys Meet Moses', 1994, 'Comedy, Adventure, Music', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Erkki Astala', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Twist-Twist Erkinharju, Ben Granfelt, Sakke Järvenpää, Jore Marjaranta, Ekke Niiva, Jyri Närvänen, Pemo Ojala, Silu Seppälä', null, 'After years of fame and misfortune in Mexico, the members of the Leningrad Cowboys decide to return to their native village. Their former manager Vladimir, who now calls himself Moses lead them on their way home.', 'After years of fame and misfortune in Mexico, the members of the Leningrad Cowboys decide to return to their native village. Their former manager Vladimir, who now calls himself Moses lead them on their way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjozVQnmZKH0gKbPz8A8OIkkzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30366'),
  ('825291496789542218', 'Lenny', 1974, 'Drama', 'Bruce Surtees, Bob Fosse, Ted Zachary', 'Julian Barry', 'Dustin Hoffman, Valerie Perrine, Jan Miner, Stanley Beck, Frankie Man, Rashel Novikoff, Gary Morton, Guy Rennie', 'R', 'The story of acerbic 1960s comic Lenny Bruce, whose groundbreaking, no-holds-barred style and social commentary was often deemed by the establishment as too obscene for the public.', 'The story of acerbic 1960s comic Lenny Bruce, whose groundbreaking, no-holds-barred style and social commentary was often deemed by the establishment as too obscene for the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avhk4pGdz3YQrzqLU65icjnE6vn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27094'),
  ('1085552045174323839', 'Lenny Bruce: Swear to Tell the Truth', 1998, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Robert B. Weide', 'Lenny Bruce, Robert B. Weide', 'Robert De Niro, Steve Allen, Lenny Bruce, Honey Harlow', 'R', 'In 1948, Lenny Bruce was just another comic who couldn''t get arrested. By 1961, all that would change.', 'In 1948, Lenny Bruce was just another comic who couldn''t get arrested. By 1961, all that would change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c25HajWlwZyUoWAurRtEJ4YtE3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103162'),
  ('279428986168859972', 'Lensman', 1984, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Kazuyuki Hirokawa, Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Kazuo Tomizawa', 'Soji Yoshikawa', 'Toshio Furukawa, Mami Koyama, Chikao Ohtsuka, Nachi Nozawa, Katsuya Kobayashi, Seizo Kato, Eiji Kanie, Hidekatsu Shibata', 'PG-13', 'In this animated adaptation of E. E. Doc Smith''s groundbreaking science fiction serial "Grey Lensman" from the 1930s-1950s, Kimball Kinnison, a young man from the agricultural planet Mquie and his Valerian companion, Buscirk find a dying man with a legendary crystal lens embedded in his hand. As the man was dying, he mysteriously passed on the Lens to Kim. With more companions to come by, Kim must find out the purpose of the Lens before the Boskone dynasty does.', 'In this animated adaptation of E. E. Doc Smith''s groundbreaking science fiction serial "Grey Lensman" from the 1930s-1950s, Kimball Kinnison, a young man from the agricultural planet Mquie and his Valerian companion, Buscirk find a dying man with a legendary crystal lens embedded in his hand. As the man was dying, he mysteriously passed on the Lens to Kim. With more companions to come by, Kim must find out the purpose of the Lens before the Boskone dynasty does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roy8HIZFXfNKHpvXoZIrlZ9dcVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25525'),
  ('186743780121714871', 'Leo', 2002, 'Drama', 'Mehdi Norowzian, Zubin Mistry', 'Amir Tadjedin, Massy Tadjedin', 'Joseph Fiennes, Elisabeth Shue, Justin Chambers, Sam Shepard, Dennis Hopper, Deborah Kara Unger, Mary Stuart Masterson, Jake Weber', null, 'A young mother is plagued by a tragic mistake and alienates her little boy. A brilliant writer is released from prison after serving a 15-year sentence and begins working at Vic''s Diner. Their stories converge when the man must overcome obstacles of the past to save the little boy and ultimately himself.', 'A young mother is plagued by a tragic mistake and alienates her little boy. A brilliant writer is released from prison after serving a 15-year sentence and begins working at Vic''s Diner. Their stories converge when the man must overcome obstacles of the past to save the little boy and ultimately himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xruKRV7BOR3cG2Kw8PMIz8LFi7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30862'),
  ('1143140315770676922', 'Leo', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Kristen Anderson, Jason Figliozzi, David Wachtenheim', 'Robert Smigel, Adam Sandler, Paul Sado', 'Adam Sandler, Bill Burr, Cecily Strong, Jason Alexander, Rob Schneider, Allison Strong, Jo Koy, Sadie Sandler', 'PG', 'Jaded 74-year-old lizard Leo has been stuck in the same Florida classroom for decades with his terrarium-mate turtle. When he learns he only has one year left to live, he plans to escape to experience life on the outside but instead gets caught up in the problems of his anxious students — including an impossibly mean substitute teacher.', 'Jaded 74-year-old lizard Leo has been stuck in the same Florida classroom for decades with his terrarium-mate turtle. When he learns he only has one year left to live, he plans to escape to experience life on the outside but instead gets caught up in the problems of his anxious students — including an impossibly mean substitute teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSOVog7ydsaF1YpgAqBqnKYFGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075794'),
  ('939201117155349470', 'Leo Da Vinci: Mission Mona Lisa', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Sergio Manfio', 'Francesco Manfio, Davide Stefanato, Anna Manfio', 'Alex Polidori, Emanuela Gabriela Ionică, Gabriele Patriarca, Arianna Vignoli, Giulio Bartolomei, Franco Mannella, Roberto Draghetti, Davide Garbolino', 'G', 'Life flows peacefully in Vinci: Leonardo is struggling with his incredible inventions, Lorenzo helps him and Gioconda observes them mockingly. When A mysterious storyteller comes to town and speaks of a hidden treasure, an adventure begins.', 'Life flows peacefully in Vinci: Leonardo is struggling with his incredible inventions, Lorenzo helps him and Gioconda observes them mockingly. When A mysterious storyteller comes to town and speaks of a hidden treasure, an adventure begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jQAmqOZrpWcIPyAiOLurDXLB88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486072'),
  ('310783059522824163', 'Leo the Last', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Boorman, Peter Suschitzky', 'John Boorman, Bill Stair', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Billie Whitelaw, Calvin Lockhart, Vladek Sheybal, Graham Crowden, Gwen Ffrangcon Davies, Glenna Forster-Jones, David de Keyser', 'R', 'Prince Leo, last in the line of rulers of a long-deposed monarchy on continental Europe and jaded with the frenetic search for kicks with the European jet-set, returns to his father''s London town house for rest.', 'Prince Leo, last in the line of rulers of a long-deposed monarchy on continental Europe and jaded with the frenetic search for kicks with the European jet-set, returns to his father''s London town house for rest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n00wxf5fDcYVgpJySih5A3Q9FiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77333'),
  ('1042865381580227446', 'Leo the Lion', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Mario Cambi, Giulia Dietrich, Marco Carosi', 'Pierstefano Marangoni, Mario Cambi', 'Neri Marcorè, Leo Gullotta, Carlo Conti, Simona Marchini, Elio Pandolfi, Dario Penne, Emanuela Rossi, Manuel Meli', 'G', 'It’s a hard life for young Leo: his family just doesn’t understand why he’s a vegetarian lion. His solitude ends when he meets Avoria, the elephant queen, who has recently given birth to two calves with braided tails. Mysteriously widowed, Avoria is courted by dapper Zanco. By a series of misfortunes she is separated from her young. Leo steps in to take care of them: thus begins his search for legendary Milk Lake, during which he experiences all sorts of incredible adventures. This fable with a happy ending handles the themes of diversity and racism with engaging originality.', 'It’s a hard life for young Leo: his family just doesn’t understand why he’s a vegetarian lion. His solitude ends when he meets Avoria, the elephant queen, who has recently given birth to two calves with braided tails. Mysteriously widowed, Avoria is courted by dapper Zanco. By a series of misfortunes she is separated from her young. Leo steps in to take care of them: thus begins his search for legendary Milk Lake, during which he experiences all sorts of incredible adventures. This fable with a happy ending handles the themes of diversity and racism with engaging originality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVNxVlY629T1kTuFDD21dwJBeYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109423'),
  ('209633810426930370', 'Leo the Lion: King of the Jungle', 1994, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Takashi Masunaga, Toshiyuki Hiruma', 'George Arthur Bloom', 'Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Bailee Reid, Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Lillian Carlson, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan', null, 'Leo is the lion king of the jungle, but unfortunately he doesn''t know well what a king''s job is. He believes it is his right to do as he pleases, even if it means disrupting the peace of others or being plain rude to them, as a king, Leo thinks everyone should look out for his well-being and comfort. One day, Leo meets a lion cub named Tooey whose mother has been recently taken away and who comes to Leo for help, being as selfish as he is, Leo turns the young lion away. However, after several different adventures, Leo learns what his place as a king is and how he must behave and treat the creatures who have almost lost all faith in him. Leo rallies the jungle animals to the rescue, and in the epilogue, the narrator Michael Donovan says that Leo asked Tooey''s mother to be his queen, and the cub himself grew into a strong young lion, now called Leo II and one day he would be the Jungle King.', 'Leo is the lion king of the jungle, but unfortunately he doesn''t know well what a king''s job is. He believes it is his right to do as he pleases, even if it means disrupting the peace of others or being plain rude to them, as a king, Leo thinks everyone should look out for his well-being and comfort. One day, Leo meets a lion cub named Tooey whose mother has been recently taken away and who comes to Leo for help, being as selfish as he is, Leo turns the young lion away. However, after several different adventures, Leo learns what his place as a king is and how he must behave and treat the creatures who have almost lost all faith in him. Leo rallies the jungle animals to the rescue, and in the epilogue, the narrator Michael Donovan says that Leo asked Tooey''s mother to be his queen, and the cub himself grew into a strong young lion, now called Leo II and one day he would be the Jungle King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCdG9YYEbUzK0Z1fiIPOemV9FLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256285'),
  ('1073773201565885020', 'Leo''s Return', 2021, 'Drama', 'Vinod Vijayasankaran, Anshul Chauhan', 'Anshul Chauhan', 'Nozomi de Lencquesaing, Kai Hoshino Sandy, Yurika Minami, Alisia, Noy Ichito, Zip King, Sara Kordi, Hiroshi Akaike', null, 'Leo, an actor playing the lead in his breakthrough role, returns home to Tokyo after the pandemic canceled his film shoot only to face more problems with his wife.', 'Leo, an actor playing the lead in his breakthrough role, returns home to Tokyo after the pandemic canceled his film shoot only to face more problems with his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6hCei9Kb8vliyawbj80ooXceM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851790'),
  ('342051714814820595', 'Leo''s Room', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Enrique Buchichio', 'Enrique Buchichio', 'Martín Rodríguez, Cecilia Cósero, Gerardo Begérez, Arturo Goetz, Mirella Pascual, Rafael Soliwoda, Carolina Alarcón, Sylvia Murninkas', null, 'Leo, a young man coming to terms with his own sexuality, runs into Caro, a primary school friend he fancied when they were kids, who''s now trying to ward off her own personal demons. This casual re-encounter will affect their personal conflicts without either truly grasping the other''s problem.', 'Leo, a young man coming to terms with his own sexuality, runs into Caro, a primary school friend he fancied when they were kids, who''s now trying to ward off her own personal demons. This casual re-encounter will affect their personal conflicts without either truly grasping the other''s problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w76e5s1ampJypUfePjdT2Xrw0U9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87017'),
  ('846922749815242123', 'Léolo', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Guy Dufaux, Jean-Claude Lauzon', 'Jean-Claude Lauzon', 'Gilbert Sicotte, Maxime Collin, Ginette Reno, Julien Guiomar, Giuditta Del Vecchio, Andrée Lachapelle, Denys Arcand, Germain Houde', null, 'The story of an imaginative boy who pretends he is the child of a sperm-laden Sicilian tomato upon which his mother accidentally fell.', 'The story of an imaginative boy who pretends he is the child of a sperm-laden Sicilian tomato upon which his mother accidentally fell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HDTXmngKg6NHKGVnKADpxGPye5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11139'),
  ('102998990614852349', 'Leon and Olvido', 2005, 'Drama', 'Xavier Bermúdez', null, 'Marta Larralde, Guillem Jiménez, Gary Piquer, Jaime Vázquez, Mighello Blanco', null, 'The love-hate relations between a girl and his disabled brother.', 'The love-hate relations between a girl and his disabled brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tXBD8WEa7FmqEEfPnrHbsCFaKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188739'),
  ('1058592961807092308', 'Léon Morin, Priest', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Volker Schlöndorff, Bertrand Tavernier', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'Emmanuelle Riva, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Irène Tunc, Nicole Mirel, Gisèle Grimm, Marco Behar, Marc Eyraud, Monique Hennessy', null, 'Barny, although a Marxist, is intrigued by the mysteries of religion. In confession, she teases a priest, Léon Morin, but he is a young and intelligent man and ready to discuss anything.', 'Barny, although a Marxist, is intrigued by the mysteries of religion. In confession, she teases a priest, Léon Morin, but he is a young and intelligent man and ready to discuss anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i89R891gei0UVS8xY6ymOUPExtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63892'),
  ('868019822028814447', 'Leon Must Die', 2017, 'Science Fiction', 'Lars Kokemüller', 'Lars Kokemüller', 'Nisan Arikan, Philip Spreen, Alexander F. Obe, Ebba Ekholm, Viktoria Steiber, Christoph Hars, Jens Holzheuer, Dustin Leitol', null, 'Leon is in his mid-twenties and terminally ill. He invents a technology that allows him to computerize his mind and live forever. This technology will be the downfall of mankind, so freedom fighter Aqua travels back from the future to kill him. The two fall in love and turbulent events follow.', 'Leon is in his mid-twenties and terminally ill. He invents a technology that allows him to computerize his mind and live forever. This technology will be the downfall of mankind, so freedom fighter Aqua travels back from the future to kill him. The two fall in love and turbulent events follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUveljPGGlCdzLGYXM3ppeXYjJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440831'),
  ('658518703683128198', 'Leon the Pig Farmer', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Vadim Jean, Gary Sinyor', null, 'Mark Frankel, Janet Suzman, Brian Glover, Connie Booth, David de Keyser, Maryam D''Abo, Gina Bellman, Vincent Riotta', null, 'An irreverent comedy is set in motion when Leon Geller, a sensitive Jewish boy from London, accidentally learns that his is the product of artificial insemination.', 'An irreverent comedy is set in motion when Leon Geller, a sensitive Jewish boy from London, accidentally learns that his is the product of artificial insemination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwUGDnOVCzgEt6tZfGMpTNEYJUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54716'),
  ('710530811930529009', 'Léon: The Professional', 1994, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Thierry Arbogast, Camille Lipmann, Eric McGinty', 'Luc Besson', 'Jean Reno, Natalie Portman, Gary Oldman, Danny Aiello, Peter Appel, Michael Badalucco, Ellen Greene, Elizabeth Regen', 'R', 'Léon, the top hit man in New York, has earned a rep as an effective "cleaner". But when his next-door neighbors are wiped out by a loose-cannon DEA agent, he becomes the unwilling custodian of 12-year-old Mathilda. Before long, Mathilda''s thoughts turn to revenge, and she considers following in Léon''s footsteps.', 'Léon, the top hit man in New York, has earned a rep as an effective "cleaner". But when his next-door neighbors are wiped out by a loose-cannon DEA agent, he becomes the unwilling custodian of 12-year-old Mathilda. Before long, Mathilda''s thoughts turn to revenge, and she considers following in Léon''s footsteps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxB2q91nKYp8JNzqE7t7TWBVupB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101'),
  ('1049911177470482509', 'Leona', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isaac Cherem', 'Isaac Cherem, Naian González Norvind', 'Naian González Norvind, Christian Vazquez, Jorge Caballero, Carlos Aragón, Adriana Llabrés, Margarita Sanz, Emma Dib, Marcos Bucay', null, 'Ariela, a traditional Jew, meets Ivan, a young man who is not Jewish with whom she begins a secret relationship despite her family beliefs.', 'Ariela, a traditional Jew, meets Ivan, a young man who is not Jewish with whom she begins a secret relationship despite her family beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qihOpckyg296IEEQSG5XtbLUCSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541187'),
  ('1106645535672273808', 'Leonard Cohen: I''m Your Man', 2006, 'Documentary, Music', 'Lian Lunson, Brit Marling, Mike Cahill', 'Lian Lunson', 'Leonard Cohen, Martha Wainwright, Rufus Wainwright, Beth Orton, Jarvis Cocker, Bono, The Edge, Nick Cave', null, 'Poet, singer / songwriter and ladies man Leonard Cohen is interviewed in his home about his life and times. The interview is interspersed with archive photos and exuberant praise and live perfomances from an eclectic mix of musicians, including: Jarvis Cocker, Rufus & Martha Wainwright, Teddy Thompson, ANOHNI, The Handsome Family and U2''s Bono and The Edge.', 'Poet, singer / songwriter and ladies man Leonard Cohen is interviewed in his home about his life and times. The interview is interspersed with archive photos and exuberant praise and live perfomances from an eclectic mix of musicians, including: Jarvis Cocker, Rufus & Martha Wainwright, Teddy Thompson, ANOHNI, The Handsome Family and U2''s Bono and The Edge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5b2G1junuUkQn5MtMDXobzHUbDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57406'),
  ('295314836618934686', 'Leonard Part 6', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Paul Weiland, Aldric La''Auli Porter, Joseph Ray', 'Jonathan Reynolds', 'Bill Cosby, Tom Courtenay, Joe Don Baker, Moses Gunn, Pat Colbert, Gloria Foster, Victoria Rowell, Anna Thomson', 'PG', 'After separating from his wife, Leonard Parker quit the spy business and became a restaurateur. His wife refuses to speak with him, and his daughter, who changes her career more often than her clothes, has begun dating a man old enough to be Leonard''s father! On top of it all, the government has asked him to come back and save the world again.', 'After separating from his wife, Leonard Parker quit the spy business and became a restaurateur. His wife refuses to speak with him, and his daughter, who changes her career more often than her clothes, has begun dating a man old enough to be Leonard''s father! On top of it all, the government has asked him to come back and save the world again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouT2pkDmasvSUZNUmVIm5Gki6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24828'),
  ('642638755139561278', 'Leonardo da Vinci: The Genius in Milan', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Luca Lucini, Nico Malaspina, Davide Artusi', 'Jacopo Ghilardotti, Gabriele Scotti', 'Vincenzo Amato, Cristiana Capotondi, Alessandro Haber, Gabriella Pession, Paolo Briguglia', null, 'An exhibit of Da Vinci''s works traces the pathways of the great artist''s mind.', 'An exhibit of Da Vinci''s works traces the pathways of the great artist''s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pSglq6kPbJXNnMDhmLAVtCm7Ws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393663'),
  ('590356231104070969', 'Leonardo DiCaprio: Most Wanted!', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Henrike Sandner', null, 'Brigitte Steinmetz, Michael Caton-Jones, Katja Nicodemus, Tim Cogshell, Agnieszka Holland, Leonardo DiCaprio, Martin Scorsese, David Nathan', null, 'From his juvenile, tormented, heroic roles, which made him a global phenomenon, to his darker mature roles, a portrait of American actor Leonardo DiCaprio, a consummate performer and probably the most successful film star of his generation.', 'From his juvenile, tormented, heroic roles, which made him a global phenomenon, to his darker mature roles, a portrait of American actor Leonardo DiCaprio, a consummate performer and probably the most successful film star of his generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oO8CotrnqhHAGbVMcCqNHrb89pP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792166'),
  ('824422401747243190', 'Leonardo: The Mystery of the Lost Portrait', 2018, 'Documentary, History', 'Luca Trovellesi Cesana', 'Flore Kosinetz', 'Anna Flori-Lamour', null, 'Leonardo da Vinci is not just the most famous and most admired of all painters - he is an icon, a superstar. Yet, the man himself remains elusive. Accounts during his lifetime describe a man too handsome, too strong, too perfect to be accurate. But in 2009, the chance discovery in the South of Italy of an ancient portrait with strangely familiar features takes the art world by storm. Could this be an unknown self-portrait by Leonardo da Vinci? Controversy erupts among the experts. The implications of such a discovery have far-reaching consequences for our understanding of the work of this great Renaissance master.', 'Leonardo da Vinci is not just the most famous and most admired of all painters - he is an icon, a superstar. Yet, the man himself remains elusive. Accounts during his lifetime describe a man too handsome, too strong, too perfect to be accurate. But in 2009, the chance discovery in the South of Italy of an ancient portrait with strangely familiar features takes the art world by storm. Could this be an unknown self-portrait by Leonardo da Vinci? Controversy erupts among the experts. The implications of such a discovery have far-reaching consequences for our understanding of the work of this great Renaissance master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny3W37i5L9fLrX6jrwnF82ExkgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547549'),
  ('700247318657631473', 'Leonardo''s Diary', 1972, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Jiří Šafář', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'Animated drawings inspired by Leonardo da Vinci are intercut with seemingly unrelated (but in fact strangely similar) live-action scenes.', 'Animated drawings inspired by Leonardo da Vinci are intercut with seemingly unrelated (but in fact strangely similar) live-action scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zek4ZFSkT93JpffAjxEtaVyguGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19031'),
  ('79825978660369391', 'Leonor', 1975, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Juan Luis Buñuel, Luciano Tovoli, José María Gutiérrez Santos', 'Juan Luis Buñuel, Roberto Bodegas, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Michel Piccoli, Liv Ullmann, Ornella Muti, Antonio Ferrandis, Ángel del Pozo, George Rigaud, José María Caffarel, Carmen Maura', null, 'Richard is a medieval nobleman. After his first wife dies in an accident and is buried in the family vault, he remarries and has children by his second wife. A mad longing for his first wife Leonor comes over him, and he sells his soul to the devil for a chance to get her back. But when she returns, she is a murderous vampire.', 'Richard is a medieval nobleman. After his first wife dies in an accident and is buried in the family vault, he remarries and has children by his second wife. A mad longing for his first wife Leonor comes over him, and he sells his soul to the devil for a chance to get her back. But when she returns, she is a murderous vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjerBd6PEWJPB2NzFsDtqBGka8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104498'),
  ('477299121899136808', 'Leonor Will Never Die', 2022, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Martika Ramirez Escobar, Carlos Mauricio', 'Martika Ramirez Escobar', 'Sheila Francisco, Bong Cabrera, Rocky Salumbides, Anthony Falcon, Rea Molina, Allan Bautista, Tami Monsod, John Paulo Rodriguez', null, 'Fiction and reality blur when Leonor, a retired filmmaker, falls into a coma after a television lands on her head, compelling her to become the action hero of her unfinished screenplay.', 'Fiction and reality blur when Leonor, a retired filmmaker, falls into a coma after a television lands on her head, compelling her to become the action hero of her unfinished screenplay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RhMTthNne58E2P0moPWZcJjpkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913689'),
  ('778794885972628658', 'Leonora addio', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Paolo Taviani, Paolo Carnera, Simone Zampagni', 'Paolo Taviani', 'Fabrizio Ferracane, Martina Catalfamo, Nathalie Rapti Gomez, Roberto Herlitzka, Claudio Bigagli, Giulio Pampiglione, Francesco La Mantia, Biagio Barone', null, 'A tale of the three funerals for the ashes of Italian writer Luigi Pirandello intertwined with a murder committed by a young Sicilian immigrant boy in 1930s Brooklyn for what is described as a surreal, grotesque, complex narrative.', 'A tale of the three funerals for the ashes of Italian writer Luigi Pirandello intertwined with a murder committed by a young Sicilian immigrant boy in 1930s Brooklyn for what is described as a surreal, grotesque, complex narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKzk1ARlCDubcSpcGUa4G2tMNXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822177'),
  ('126969574023090379', 'Leopardi', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'Guido Colla, Barbara Melega, Edoardo Petti', 'Ippolita Di Majo, Mario Martone', 'Elio Germano, Michele Riondino, Massimo Popolizio, Anna Mouglalis, Valerio Binasco, Paolo Graziosi, Iaia Forte, Sandro Lombardi', null, 'In 19th-century Italy, Giacomo Leopardi channels his debilitating illness and isolation into poetry.', 'In 19th-century Italy, Giacomo Leopardi channels his debilitating illness and isolation into poetry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Lv3SME2Dz8WNOrP1xqFXCL9aJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283704'),
  ('614912869339602353', 'Leprechaun', 1993, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Levie Isaacks, Mark Jones, Adam C. Taylor', 'Mark Jones', 'Warwick Davis, Jennifer Aniston, Ken Olandt, Mark Holton, Robert Hy Gorman, Shay Duffin, John Voldstad, John Sanderford', 'R', 'A demonic leprechaun terrorizes a group of young people whom he believes stole his gold.', 'A demonic leprechaun terrorizes a group of young people whom he believes stole his gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIpzSHNX9lQlCKnh1cQwIXDFX5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11811'),
  ('350854494659223983', 'Leprechaun 2', 1994, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jane Castle, Rodman Flender, Eddie Ziv', 'Turi Meyer, Alfredo Septién', 'Warwick Davis, Charlie Heath, Shevonne Durkin, Adam Biesk, Arturo Gil, Linda Hopkins, James Lancaster, Sandy Baron', 'R', 'A thousand years ago, the Leprechaun left a bloody trail when he ripped through the countryside in search of his stolen gold. Now he''s back in the big city using all of his deadly tricks to snare the girl of his nightmares. His bloody quest becomes more deadly when her boyfriend steals one of the Leprechaun''s gold coins. The town soon discovers two dead bodies and a trail of gold dust leads them to the Leprechaun''s lair.', 'A thousand years ago, the Leprechaun left a bloody trail when he ripped through the countryside in search of his stolen gold. Now he''s back in the big city using all of his deadly tricks to snare the girl of his nightmares. His bloody quest becomes more deadly when her boyfriend steals one of the Leprechaun''s gold coins. The town soon discovers two dead bodies and a trail of gold dust leads them to the Leprechaun''s lair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnCLZ3rpy3enYSHrzcBxnx3fozK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18009'),
  ('1013974251877220867', 'Leprechaun 3', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'David Lewis, Brian Trenchard-Smith, Lynn K. D''Angona', 'David DuBos', 'Warwick Davis, John Gatins, Lee Armstrong, John DeMita, Michael Callan, Caroline Williams, Marcelo Tubert, Tom Dugan', 'R', 'It was a normal night in Las Vegas, Nevada, all the lights were flashing brightly, until a man with one hand, one eye, and one leg walks into a pawn shop with a statue of a hideous looking Leprechaun. The owner claims it''s a good luck charm. The statue also wore a medallion around it''s neck. The careless pawn shop owner took off the medallion setting the Leprechaun free...', 'It was a normal night in Las Vegas, Nevada, all the lights were flashing brightly, until a man with one hand, one eye, and one leg walks into a pawn shop with a statue of a hideous looking Leprechaun. The owner claims it''s a good luck charm. The statue also wore a medallion around it''s neck. The careless pawn shop owner took off the medallion setting the Leprechaun free...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9NT2smK66pYOjBtmZuKFFTZ478.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19286'),
  ('931896441720094082', 'Leprechaun 4: In Space', 1997, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'David Lewis, Brian Trenchard-Smith, R. Michael Stringer', 'Dennis A. Pratt', 'Warwick Davis, Brent Jasmer, Jessica Collins, Guy Siner, Gary Grossman, Rebekah Carlton, Tim Colceri, Miguel A. Núñez Jr.', 'R', 'On a planet in a distant galaxy, a power hungry Leprechaun, holds a beautiful alien princess hostage in order to marry her for her royal title. With her title and his beloved gold, he''ll be able to rule the universe. While making his maniacal plans, what he doesn''t count on is an invading platoon of marines from Earth, to save the princess and foil his plans. An accomplished trickster, the Leprechaun stows himself away on the orbiting spaceship and wreaks havoc on the crew in an attempt to recapture his bride.', 'On a planet in a distant galaxy, a power hungry Leprechaun, holds a beautiful alien princess hostage in order to marry her for her royal title. With her title and his beloved gold, he''ll be able to rule the universe. While making his maniacal plans, what he doesn''t count on is an invading platoon of marines from Earth, to save the princess and foil his plans. An accomplished trickster, the Leprechaun stows himself away on the orbiting spaceship and wreaks havoc on the crew in an attempt to recapture his bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nt0095grCSepz6xU24a5yP5mwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19287'),
  ('424203560655288704', 'Leprechaun in the Hood', 2000, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Kim Williams, Mike Mickens, Rob Spera', 'Doug Hall, Jon Huffman', 'Warwick Davis, Ice-T, Anthony Montgomery, Rashaan Nall, Red Grant, Bebe Drake, Dan Martin, Lobo Sebastian', 'R', 'When Butch, Postmaster P, and Stray Bullet loot the local hip-hop mogul''s studio to fund their demo album, the threesome unwittingly ends up with the secret of Mack Daddy''s success: a magical flute. Their gigs instantly turn golden but a blood-thristy Leprechaun and an angry Mack Daddy are hot on their trail, leaving a wake of destruction tainted by politically incorrect limericks.', 'When Butch, Postmaster P, and Stray Bullet loot the local hip-hop mogul''s studio to fund their demo album, the threesome unwittingly ends up with the secret of Mack Daddy''s success: a magical flute. Their gigs instantly turn golden but a blood-thristy Leprechaun and an angry Mack Daddy are hot on their trail, leaving a wake of destruction tainted by politically incorrect limericks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCRwtuxnJWkZ04gwtfYF9h1GUkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18011'),
  ('578074617750620758', 'Leprechaun Returns', 2018, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gary Knowles, Lynette Mitchell, Cuan Prytz', 'Suzanne Keilly', 'Taylor Spreitler, Pepi Sonuga, Sai Bennett, Emily Reid, Ben McGregor, Oliver Llewellyn Jenkins, Mark Holton, Linden Porco', 'R', 'A group of unwitting sorority sisters accidentally awaken the serial-killing Leprechaun after they build a sorority house on his hunting grounds.', 'A group of unwitting sorority sisters accidentally awaken the serial-killing Leprechaun after they build a sorority house on his hunting grounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kToQsV04Jel1ob7VJ471LDz7wD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518158'),
  ('308420115408247426', 'Leprechaun: Back 2 tha Hood', 2003, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Steven Ayromlooi, David Daniel, Amy Armstrong', 'Steven Ayromlooi', 'Warwick Davis, Tangi Miller, Laz Alonso, Page Kennedy, Sherrie Jackson, Donzaleigh Abernathy, Keesha Sharp, Sticky Fingaz', 'R', 'When Emily Woodrow and her friends happen on a treasure chest full of gold coins, they fail to to heed the warnings of a wise old psychic who had foretold that they would encounter trouble with a very nasty and protective Leprechaun.', 'When Emily Woodrow and her friends happen on a treasure chest full of gold coins, they fail to to heed the warnings of a wise old psychic who had foretold that they would encounter trouble with a very nasty and protective Leprechaun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBXtcz92oigWaWnFDyS8j5tMAc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19288'),
  ('9857706689078155', 'Leprechaun: Origins', 2014, 'Horror', 'Zach Lipovsky, Mahlon Todd Williams, Michelle Fitzpatrick', 'Harris Wilkinson', 'Stephanie Bennett, Andrew Dunbar, Melissa Roxburgh, Brendan Fletcher, Garry Chalk, Teach Grant, Dylan Postl, Bruce Blain', 'R', 'Two young couples backpacking through Ireland discover that one of Ireland''s most famous legends is a terrifying reality.', 'Two young couples backpacking through Ireland discover that one of Ireland''s most famous legends is a terrifying reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyZ7folrZTqEJFD7wUuGf84CmPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126172'),
  ('35749212707171878', 'Leprechaun''s Revenge', 2012, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Drew Daywalt, Jordan Edwards, Michael Chochol', 'Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Billy Zane, Courtney Halverson, William Devane, Derek Babb, Kent Jude Bernard, Chase Boltin, Dave Davis, Matty Ferraro', 'R', 'An evil leprechaun who has been imprisoned within the roots of a majestic old oak tree, is accidentally set loose on St. Patrick''s Day. Once free, he takes out his bloody revenge on the descendants of the people who originally imprisoned him.', 'An evil leprechaun who has been imprisoned within the roots of a majestic old oak tree, is accidentally set loose on St. Patrick''s Day. Once free, he takes out his bloody revenge on the descendants of the people who originally imprisoned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuK7NORkzywqB257WwgPn1qxYDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97589'),
  ('550727614788687142', 'Leptirica', 1973, 'Horror, Drama', 'Đorđe Kadijević, Branko Ivatović', 'Đorđe Kadijević', 'Mirjana Nikolić, Petar Božović, Vasja Stanković, Slobodan ''Cica'' Perović, Aleksandar ''Aca'' Stojković, Tanasije Uzunović, Ivan Đurđević, Bogoljub Petrović', null, 'A young man wants to marry the beautiful daughter of a landowner who refuses to allow the marriage. To prove his worth, the young man becomes a miller in a vampire-infested local mill.', 'A young man wants to marry the beautiful daughter of a landowner who refuses to allow the marriage. To prove his worth, the young man becomes a miller in a vampire-infested local mill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tTqoYRhE9yyZviloYr3T5QPZ5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220638'),
  ('467019914108487474', 'Leroy', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Armin Völckers, Tony Mitchell', 'Armin Völckers', 'Alain Morel, Anna Hausburg, Constantin von Jascheroff, Günther Kaufmann, Eva Mannschott, Conrad F. Geier, Cay Helmich, Wilfried Hochholdinger', null, 'A gently humorous look at otherness and xenophobia in modern day German with this tale of a black Berlin teen named Leroy who rediscovers his roots after falling for a pretty white girl and meeting her racist family.', 'A gently humorous look at otherness and xenophobia in modern day German with this tale of a black Berlin teen named Leroy who rediscovers his roots after falling for a pretty white girl and meeting her racist family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udG4B26N4gJ9U7NXuteopjgiBAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3562'),
  ('794467374147538303', 'Leroy & Stitch', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Bobs Gannaway, Joe Chen, Jessie Xiong', 'Bobs Gannaway, Jess Winfield', 'Daveigh Chase, Chris Sanders, Tia Carrere, Zoe Caldwell, Kevin McDonald, Kevin Michael Richardson, Rob Paulsen, Jeff Bennett', 'G', 'Lilo, Stitch, Jumba, and Pleakley have finally caught all of Jumba''s genetic experiments and found the one true place where each of them belongs. Stitch, Jumba and Pleakley are offered positions in the Galactic Alliance, turning them down so they can stay on Earth with Lilo, but Lilo realizes her alien friends have places where they belong – and it''s finally time to say "aloha".', 'Lilo, Stitch, Jumba, and Pleakley have finally caught all of Jumba''s genetic experiments and found the one true place where each of them belongs. Stitch, Jumba and Pleakley are offered positions in the Galactic Alliance, turning them down so they can stay on Earth with Lilo, but Lilo realizes her alien friends have places where they belong – and it''s finally time to say "aloha".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LCfRArffse3PnqkACooOHkWcry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21316'),
  ('849491264942924350', 'Les 3 Boutons', 2015, 'Fantasy', 'Frederic Alexandre, Agnès Varda, Pierre-Hugues Galien', 'Agnès Varda', 'Jasmine Thire, Michel Jeannes, Jacky Patin, Leon Mezard, Corentin Vignet, Patricia Wang, Cecilia Rose', null, '“Miss Jasmine! I have a package for you!” The 14-year-old girl with braces takes a break from milking the goat. Her local postman has delivered a surprise. She opens it up. Out floats a magical magenta ball dress ten times her teenage size. “I am curious,” she says, and enters the folds of the dress. From here, Jasmine⎯headstrong, a dreamer, a realist⎯takes us on a modern anti-fairy tale through caves and stalagmites, streets and shop windows, obsessions and everyday empowerment.', '“Miss Jasmine! I have a package for you!” The 14-year-old girl with braces takes a break from milking the goat. Her local postman has delivered a surprise. She opens it up. Out floats a magical magenta ball dress ten times her teenage size. “I am curious,” she says, and enters the folds of the dress. From here, Jasmine⎯headstrong, a dreamer, a realist⎯takes us on a modern anti-fairy tale through caves and stalagmites, streets and shop windows, obsessions and everyday empowerment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuBpts0kN1l5zvwHc73EfjpP9lA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358341'),
  ('245694748630886047', 'Les 4 saisons d''Espigoule', 1999, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Christian Philibert', 'Hervé Philibert, Christian Philibert', 'Jacques Bastide, Jean-Marc Ravera, Fernande Béraud, Alain Passet, Christian Comte, Roger Lanfranchi, Jean-Christophe Ambiel, Philippe Bastide', null, 'Filmmaker Christian Philibert takes a tongue-in-cheek look at his old hometown in this mock-documentary about a small French community and the people who live there. In Les 4 Saisons d''Espigoule, Philibert returns to the town where he grew up (and left when he was 25) to film the residents for a year. In addition to capturing Espigoule''s annual Goat Rodeo and New Year''s Eve costumes, the audience gets an inside look at the backbone of the local economy (sheep herding) and a night of big excitement (a bingo match). We also meet a few of the locals, who show off their talents (painting, classical piano, imitating Liza Minnelli). While scripted in advance by Philibert, the film was indeed shot in his hometown, and the "actors" playing the citizens of Espigoule actually do live there.', 'Filmmaker Christian Philibert takes a tongue-in-cheek look at his old hometown in this mock-documentary about a small French community and the people who live there. In Les 4 Saisons d''Espigoule, Philibert returns to the town where he grew up (and left when he was 25) to film the residents for a year. In addition to capturing Espigoule''s annual Goat Rodeo and New Year''s Eve costumes, the audience gets an inside look at the backbone of the local economy (sheep herding) and a night of big excitement (a bingo match). We also meet a few of the locals, who show off their talents (painting, classical piano, imitating Liza Minnelli). While scripted in advance by Philibert, the film was indeed shot in his hometown, and the "actors" playing the citizens of Espigoule actually do live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QOPwu5CvSf8PGGFlLbn9CZedkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59955'),
  ('924403952168158217', 'Les Affaires publiques', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Robert Bresson', 'Robert Bresson', 'Beby, Simone Cressier, Marcel Dalio, André Numès, Gilles Margaritis, Franck Maurice, Andrée Servilanges, Jane Pierson', null, 'A slapstick comedy centered on two neighboring republics, Crogandia and Miremia, and the various disasters that befall the ceremonial unveiling of a statue, the launching of a ship, and the crash-landing of a Miremian pilot in Crogandian territory.', 'A slapstick comedy centered on two neighboring republics, Crogandia and Miremia, and the various disasters that befall the ceremonial unveiling of a statue, the launching of a ship, and the crash-landing of a Miremian pilot in Crogandian territory.', null, 'tmdb:movie:143951'),
  ('64895105831395767', 'Les Apaches', 2013, 'Drama', 'Thierry de Peretti, Hélène Louvart', 'Benjamin Baroche, Thierry de Peretti', 'François-Joseph Cullioli, Aziz El Hadachi, Hamza Meziani, Maryne Cayon, Joseph Ebrard, Henri-Noël Tabary, Michel Ferracci, Andréa Brusque', null, 'While thousands of tourists invade the beaches, camping grounds and clubs, five teenagers from Porto Vecchio hang out. One evening one of them leads the others to an unoccupied luxury villa. They spend the night there. Before they leave, they steal some objects of no value and two prize rifles. When the house owner arrives from Paris, she complains about the theft to a small local boss she knows…', 'While thousands of tourists invade the beaches, camping grounds and clubs, five teenagers from Porto Vecchio hang out. One evening one of them leads the others to an unoccupied luxury villa. They spend the night there. Before they leave, they steal some objects of no value and two prize rifles. When the house owner arrives from Paris, she complains about the theft to a small local boss she knows…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cygq28ojXQmFGHoYhmgtBzZcXPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190851'),
  ('645685629818294637', 'Les Aristos', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Charlotte de Turckheim, Pascal Ridao', 'Jean-Marie Duprez, Charlotte de Turckheim', 'Charlotte de Turckheim, Jacques Weber, Vincent Desagnat, Victoria Abril, Rossy de Palma, Rudi Rosenberg, Hélène de Fougerolles, Catherine Jacob', null, 'The Arbac de Neuvilles are one of the oldest families in France. They have inhabited their ancient château for fifty-two generations and are proud of their noble ancestry. But today they are stone broke. When a bailiff turns up notifying them that they owe two million euros in back taxes, these proud aristocrats are understandably shaken to the core of their ancestral seat. Just how are they to find this amount of money when none of them has any capacity for work?', 'The Arbac de Neuvilles are one of the oldest families in France. They have inhabited their ancient château for fifty-two generations and are proud of their noble ancestry. But today they are stone broke. When a bailiff turns up notifying them that they owe two million euros in back taxes, these proud aristocrats are understandably shaken to the core of their ancestral seat. Just how are they to find this amount of money when none of them has any capacity for work?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79VUP5QJKOqJiIGBlqVi0eEM5Et.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52682'),
  ('955833776050266855', 'Les Arnaud', 1967, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Léo Joannon, Charly Willy-Gricha, Roger Dallier', 'Léo Joannon', 'Bourvil, Salvatore Adamo, Christine Delaroche, Gérard Croce, Alain Doutey, Xavier Fonty, Martial Rèbe, Gisèle Grandpré', null, 'In the sunny landscapes of Provence, Henri Arnaud is a conscientious law student who''s got a lovely girlfriend, Tina. The person who used to pay for his studies dies and the poor young man''s disposable funds are low. He asks an antique dealer if he can lend him some money. This shady guy agrees, but in return for homosexual relations. Henri kills him and runs away. Fortunately, a good judge, who bears the same name as him, comes to his rescue.', 'In the sunny landscapes of Provence, Henri Arnaud is a conscientious law student who''s got a lovely girlfriend, Tina. The person who used to pay for his studies dies and the poor young man''s disposable funds are low. He asks an antique dealer if he can lend him some money. This shady guy agrees, but in return for homosexual relations. Henri kills him and runs away. Fortunately, a good judge, who bears the same name as him, comes to his rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35qfHTUFW6SfuhjtCQmE0DaQ09z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163752'),
  ('381789224049514549', 'Les Barons', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Nabil Ben Yadir, Danny Elsen', 'Nabil Ben Yadir, Laurent Brandenbourger', 'Nader Boussandel, Mourade Zeguendi, Mounir Ait Hamou, Amelle Chahbi, Mohamed Fellag, Julien Courbey, Édouard Baer, Bougar', null, 'The Barons have a motto: "slack off more to live longer." Every human being is born with a credit of steps. Every step you take brings you closer to death. We Barons know this from the start.', 'The Barons have a motto: "slack off more to live longer." Every human being is born with a credit of steps. Every step you take brings you closer to death. We Barons know this from the start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epIP1brIFem0JdPEt8CkooiSBTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28417'),
  ('266638117346443672', 'Les Bêtises', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Rose Philippon, Alice Philippon', 'Rose Philippon, Alice Philippon', 'Jérémie Elkaïm, Sara Giraudeau, Jonathan Lambert, Anne Alvaro, Alexandre Steiger, Jacques Weber, Frédéric Pierrot, Béatrice de Staël', null, 'A man named François, adopted as a child, sets out to find his biological mother. Posing as a waiter at a family gathering, he infiltrates her home, hoping to uncover the truth. His clumsy nature leads to a series of comedic mishaps, disrupting the event and causing chaos. As he stumbles through misunderstandings and awkward encounters, his quest for identity becomes increasingly complicated.', 'A man named François, adopted as a child, sets out to find his biological mother. Posing as a waiter at a family gathering, he infiltrates her home, hoping to uncover the truth. His clumsy nature leads to a series of comedic mishaps, disrupting the event and causing chaos. As he stumbles through misunderstandings and awkward encounters, his quest for identity becomes increasingly complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1yjyv6KRTWkxvpUbeiY94NseK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347477'),
  ('23964103577756900', 'Les Biches', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Claude Bakka', 'Claude Chabrol, Paul Gégauff', 'Stéphane Audran, Jacqueline Sassard, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Nane Germon, Serge Bento, Henri Attal, Dominique Zardi, Henri Frances', 'NR', 'A bored bisexual millionaire picks up a young destitute street artist and whisks her away to her villa in Saint Tropez. They meet a dashing local architect and both fall for him, setting in motion a ménage à trois of deception and betrayal.', 'A bored bisexual millionaire picks up a young destitute street artist and whisks her away to her villa in Saint Tropez. They meet a dashing local architect and both fall for him, setting in motion a ménage à trois of deception and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aso44GAzBFgw7q4FtbHVHbvJxos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1787'),
  ('992663084820245542', 'Les Bidasses en vadrouille', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Christian Ardan', null, 'Gérard Blanc, Alain Pewzner, Sylvain Pauchard, René Guérin, Guilhaine Dubos', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCOyN7hJLWI71UjrQIwy1e7zuNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334598'),
  ('338178973120617559', 'Les Blagues de Toto', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Bourdiaux, Antoine Deflandre, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Mathias Gavarry', 'Gavril Dartevelle, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Anne Marivin, Ramzy Bedia, Daniel Prévost, Pauline Clément, Jean-François Cayrey, Simon Faliu', null, 'Back-to-school! For troublemaker Toto, it’s the best playground for fooling around. When a sculpture collapses during the opening of a museum, Toto is immediately blamed. To prove his innocence, Toto has no other option but making a pact with Igor, the school nerd. In exchange for his help, Toto will help Igor being cool. The unlikely duo turns into little detectives. A fun and exciting adventure begins…', 'Back-to-school! For troublemaker Toto, it’s the best playground for fooling around. When a sculpture collapses during the opening of a museum, Toto is immediately blamed. To prove his innocence, Toto has no other option but making a pact with Igor, the school nerd. In exchange for his help, Toto will help Igor being cool. The unlikely duo turns into little detectives. A fun and exciting adventure begins…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1saY5VbcR0APaSFex4Yegh2yRKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671047'),
  ('144150749957265762', 'Les Blagues de Toto 2 - Classe verte', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Pascal Bourdiaux, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Mathias Gavarry', 'Hugo Trophardy, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Anne Marivin, Valérie Karsenti, Pauline Clément, Sarah Stern, Nicolas Lumbreras, Barbara Bolotner', null, 'This field trip seemed to be a good idea... Five days away from school, away from parents, in an organic farm, in order to enjoy the fresh air and initiate to ecology... But, in fact, everyone was a bit worried. Toto''s parents, leaving their son for the first time ; Toto''s teacher, at the idea of watching after him 24 hours a day ; and Toto himself, without the possibility of driving his parents nuts, without the neighbour''s cat to torment, far away from the schoolyard... he was afraid to feel like time was dragging.', 'This field trip seemed to be a good idea... Five days away from school, away from parents, in an organic farm, in order to enjoy the fresh air and initiate to ecology... But, in fact, everyone was a bit worried. Toto''s parents, leaving their son for the first time ; Toto''s teacher, at the idea of watching after him 24 hours a day ; and Toto himself, without the possibility of driving his parents nuts, without the neighbour''s cat to torment, far away from the schoolyard... he was afraid to feel like time was dragging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f61DkUw6NlTxGJc5mWNKQlQMnJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944387'),
