  ('1116306449160882968', 'Les Déguns', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Cyrille Droux, Claude Zidi Jr.', null, 'Karim Jebli, Nordine Salhi, Joseph Malerba, Catherine Benguigui, Raphaël Thiéry, Kelly Vedovelli', null, 'Karim and Nono, two "disguises" from Marseille''s neighborhoods, are locked up in a military recovery camp after a burglary. They manage to escape and go on the roads of France to find Karim''s girlfriend in Saint-Tropez. Their trip will be made of meeting more delirious than the others.', 'Karim and Nono, two "disguises" from Marseille''s neighborhoods, are locked up in a military recovery camp after a burglary. They manage to escape and go on the roads of France to find Karim''s girlfriend in Saint-Tropez. Their trip will be made of meeting more delirious than the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQnl0vlDE00ifRGcZZObaU6O751.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544769'),
