  ('629567514368274558', 'Les duos impossibles de Jérémy Ferrari : 4ème édition', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuel Carriau', null, 'Jérémy Ferrari, Cécile Giroud, Yann Stotz, Guillaume Bats, Ahmed Sylla, Virginie Hocq, Éric Antoine, Anthony Kavanagh', null, 'Comedian with a caustic humor, Jérémy Ferrari is never afraid to do what it takes to make his audience laugh. For the fourth consecutive year, he has assembled a cast of comedians to act out a series of improbable sketches in duos.', 'Comedian with a caustic humor, Jérémy Ferrari is never afraid to do what it takes to make his audience laugh. For the fourth consecutive year, he has assembled a cast of comedians to act out a series of improbable sketches in duos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urmAkILBTaVHhmbNw9NodbtTHkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483206'),
  ('982967365044799968', 'Les Enfants des justes', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Fabien Onteniente, Kika Ungaro', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Valerie Zenatti, Fabien Onteniente', 'Mathilde Seigner, Gérard Lanvin, Philippe Torreton, Ambre Pallas, François Bureloup, Cyril Lecomte, Sophie Guillemin, Danièle Lebrun', null, 'In France in 1942. Blanche and Virgile live in the free zone and use a boat to help a local network of resistance fighters and refugees. One day the couple propose to take in Sarah, a Jewish child who is impatiently awaiting her parents', 'In France in 1942. Blanche and Virgile live in the free zone and use a boat to help a local network of resistance fighters and refugees. One day the couple propose to take in Sarah, a Jewish child who is impatiently awaiting her parents', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZ2StCzMtPKihw89uUhLyY3Qc6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951615'),
  ('1092565012259195300', 'Les Enfoirés 2011 - Dans l''oeil des Enfoirés', 2011, 'Music', 'Pascal Duchêne', null, 'Pascal Obispo, Kad Merad, Gérard Jugnot, Mimie Mathy, Patrick Bruel, Zazie, Jean-Louis Aubert, Garou', null, 'Dans l’œil des Enfoirés est le vingt-et-unième album des Enfoirés, enregistré lors de leurs sept concerts à l’Arena Montpellier du mercredi 26 janvier au lundi 31 janvier 2011.', 'Dans l’œil des Enfoirés est le vingt-et-unième album des Enfoirés, enregistré lors de leurs sept concerts à l’Arena Montpellier du mercredi 26 janvier au lundi 31 janvier 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukqEneXu1mOUTvDF6nSzeCyPpaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85500'),
