  ('1042404606479502685', 'Les Frangines', 2002, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Laurence Katrian', 'Lorraine Lévy, Didier Lacoste', 'Arielle Dombasle, Michèle Bernier, Guillaume Gallienne, Olivier Loustau, Michèle Garcia, Laurence Yayel, Paulo Pires, Quimbé', null, 'After the death of her father, the model Alix Castelac discovers that she must share the will, and the family property, with a half-sister hidden by the name of Noémie Boileau, a truck driver.', 'After the death of her father, the model Alix Castelac discovers that she must share the will, and the family property, with a half-sister hidden by the name of Noémie Boileau, a truck driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuaJMhbmiDB3mOIRuN6YfCCC9fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270172'),
  ('451888151039818191', 'Les Fusillés', 2015, 'TV Movie, History', 'Philippe Triboit', null, 'Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Michaël Grégorio, Lionnel Astier, Sara Giraudeau, Marie Kauffmann, Scali Delpeyrat, Nathalie Cerda, Paul Frechou', null, 'Louis is a 27-year-old reservist and patriot, as is his childhood friend and longtime rival Bastien, who sees the war, like everything else, as an opportunity. One night, as their unit sleeps near the front, they''re bombed. Louis and his comrades fall back in disarray and in the general panic lose their regiment. When they locate it again a few hours later, their general accuses them of desertion.', 'Louis is a 27-year-old reservist and patriot, as is his childhood friend and longtime rival Bastien, who sees the war, like everything else, as an opportunity. One night, as their unit sleeps near the front, they''re bombed. Louis and his comrades fall back in disarray and in the general panic lose their regiment. When they locate it again a few hours later, their general accuses them of desertion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zneFDRahS45GLdDFv04mzmYhAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367976'),
  ('92968939067490460', 'Les Gagnants', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Junca, AZ', 'Laurent Junca, AZ', 'JoeyStarr, Adèle Galloy, Alban Ivanov, AZ, Samuel Bambi, Titoff, Eric Laugérias, Gloria Colston', null, 'Two winners of a contest will spend a week in Marseille with their idol, filmed live on social media. Problem: the two winners are trouble.', 'Two winners of a contest will spend a week in Marseille with their idol, filmed live on social media. Problem: the two winners are trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmyRcw8lnOnNlywEPxZVAeEkWGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942498'),
  ('734968653048567284', 'Les Gauloises blondes', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Jean Jabely, Pierre Fattori', 'Jean Jabely', 'Pierre Tornade, Gérard Hernandez, Roger Carel, Sylvaine Charlet, Jean Rougerie, Marina Pastor, Natala Sevenants, Virginie Robert', null, 'In the year 100, the village of Lutèce was invaded by a Roman troop. The Gauls decide to send their naked women to confuse them.', 'In the year 100, the village of Lutèce was invaded by a Roman troop. The Gauls decide to send their naked women to confuse them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FhMhxkbDl2scoE9r3ZbzRC91Sp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286866'),
  ('392955850508363004', 'Les Gazelles', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Mona Achache, Patrick Blossier', 'Camille Chamoux, Mona Achache, Cécile Sellam', 'Camille Chamoux, Audrey Fleurot, Anne Brochet, Joséphine de Meaux, Naidra Ayadi, Franck Gastambide, Samuel Benchetrit, Josiane Balasko', null, 'Marie and Eric, a couple in their thirties who have been together since college, buy their first apartment when Marie is suddenly overcome by doubt. Her encounter with a handsome, dark-haired man forces her to make a decision...', 'Marie and Eric, a couple in their thirties who have been together since college, buy their first apartment when Marie is suddenly overcome by doubt. Her encounter with a handsome, dark-haired man forces her to make a decision...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqlzbmw32y9d3nxv9sU7sbd1315.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223946'),
  ('560239180207245932', 'Les Girls', 1957, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'George Cukor, Robert Surtees', 'John Patrick', 'Gene Kelly, Mitzi Gaynor, Kay Kendall, Taina Elg, Jacques Bergerac, Leslie Phillips, Henry Daniell, Patrick Macnee', 'NR', 'After writing a tell-all book about her days in the dance troupe "Barry Nichols and Les Girls", Sybil Wren is sued for libeling her fellow dancer Angele. A Rashômon style narrative presents the story from three points of view where Sybil accuses Angele of having an affair with Barry, while Angele insists that it was actually Sybil who was having the affair. Finally, Barry gives his side of the story.', 'After writing a tell-all book about her days in the dance troupe "Barry Nichols and Les Girls", Sybil Wren is sued for libeling her fellow dancer Angele. A Rashômon style narrative presents the story from three points of view where Sybil accuses Angele of having an affair with Barry, while Angele insists that it was actually Sybil who was having the affair. Finally, Barry gives his side of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78ot7b75r5yWKt0rW9XjXqH7GY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43232'),
  ('873636201152774272', 'Les Gorilles', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Denis Rouden, Tristan Aurouet', 'Matthieu Le Naour, Alexandre Coquelle', 'Manu Payet, JoeyStarr, Alice Belaïdi, Jean Benguigui, Camille Cottin, Adel Bencherif, Almamy Kanoute, Sébastien Castro', null, 'Alfonso, brutal agent of the Department of Protection of High Personalities, is forced to team up with young inexperienced recruit Walter, fascinated by the world of show biz. This improbable duo is in charge of the protection of Jal-Y, a young R''n''B star threatened by his ex, a criminal on the run.', 'Alfonso, brutal agent of the Department of Protection of High Personalities, is forced to team up with young inexperienced recruit Walter, fascinated by the world of show biz. This improbable duo is in charge of the protection of Jal-Y, a young R''n''B star threatened by his ex, a criminal on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qq0WSx3HfXLvd4vjUe21K3osoD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323432'),
  ('112136149205587188', 'Les Habitants', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon', null, 'des habitants', null, 'Raymond Depardon sets out to meet French people to listen to them tell their tales. From Charleville-Mézières to Nice, Sète to Cherbourg, he invites people encountered in the street to continue their conversation in front of Depardon''s camera and us, unfettered from any constraints.', 'Raymond Depardon sets out to meet French people to listen to them tell their tales. From Charleville-Mézières to Nice, Sète to Cherbourg, he invites people encountered in the street to continue their conversation in front of Depardon''s camera and us, unfettered from any constraints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zenYbv6r4Z8qpaMrUCHs7EKYWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393710'),
  ('402052951874837168', 'Les Hautes solitudes', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Philippe Garrel, Philippe Garrel', 'Philippe Garrel', 'Jean Seberg, Nico, Tina Aumont, Laurent Terzieff', null, 'Garrel convinced Jean Seberg, in the midst of a long struggle with mental illness, alcohol and drug, to “star” in this silent document of her daily life. Consisting mostly of meditative B&W close-ups of Seberg and her friends, as her torments and inner life flicker across her eerily beautiful face.', 'Garrel convinced Jean Seberg, in the midst of a long struggle with mental illness, alcohol and drug, to “star” in this silent document of her daily life. Consisting mostly of meditative B&W close-ups of Seberg and her friends, as her torments and inner life flicker across her eerily beautiful face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXx0T1UJXPlSdJZGo0Zd4xzAhTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149145'),
  ('216054140565746394', 'Les Inconnus - La Totale ! (Vol. 1)', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Bernard Campan, Didier Bourdon, Pascal Légitimus', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVkNcMBMPoTHf3NZH0DDYkTnBop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535722'),
