  ('982953543869567631', 'Les Indésirables', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ladj Ly, Caroline Leroy, Julien Poupard', 'Ladj Ly, Giordano Gederlini', 'Anta Diaw, Alexis Manenti, Jeanne Balibar, Steve Tientcheu, Valentin Pradier, Aristote Luyindula, Aurélia Petit, Judy Al Rashi', null, 'A local activist and a budding young mayor clash over the best path forward for their impoverished suburb.', 'A local activist and a budding young mayor clash over the best path forward for their impoverished suburb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSTsxkSlOa9IoPCN7jh81PJQweW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978035'),
  ('721276272619902844', 'Les Invisibles', 2012, 'Romance, Documentary', 'Sébastien Lifshitz, Philippe Thiollier, Julien Triger', null, 'Thérèse Clerc, Bernard Romieu, Christian de Leusse, Monique Isselé', null, 'Several elderly homosexual men and women speak frankly about their pioneering lives, their fearless decision to live openly in France at a time when society rejected them.', 'Several elderly homosexual men and women speak frankly about their pioneering lives, their fearless decision to live openly in France at a time when society rejected them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xzojCU2WdrckkrCVjS6fo4KIFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126331'),
  ('1001781991932231893', 'Les Irréductibles', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Koninckx, Renaud Bertrand', 'Claude Scasso', 'Jacques Gamblin, Kad Merad, Rufus, Anne Brochet, Hélène Vincent, Valérie Kaprisky, Édouard Collin, Soko', null, 'On the day that his son fails his baccalaureate, Michel loses his job. He has been employed at the same factory for twenty years and now he has no job, no qualifications, no prospects. Michel soon realises that the only way he is going to get another job is by first passing his baccalaureate. So, he goes back to school, with his friend Gérard, who is in the same position. Naturally, Michel’s son is not at all pleased to find himself in the same class as his dad...', 'On the day that his son fails his baccalaureate, Michel loses his job. He has been employed at the same factory for twenty years and now he has no job, no qualifications, no prospects. Michel soon realises that the only way he is going to get another job is by first passing his baccalaureate. So, he goes back to school, with his friend Gérard, who is in the same position. Naturally, Michel’s son is not at all pleased to find himself in the same class as his dad...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iv7byM1iZHjQ0HXtn17snH1kYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49887'),
  ('172302439611664530', 'Les Jours venus', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Romain Goupil, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Romain Goupil', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Marina Hands, Romain Goupil, Jackie Berroyer, Noémie Lvovsky, Esther Garrel, Arnaud Desplechin', null, 'The day comes when your children look at your past as if you had fought at Verdun. The day comes when an official letter questions your age and your status and pushes you toward retirement. The day comes when your latest screenplay idea does not turn into a film. The day comes when your new bank manager urgently summons you. The day comes when you remember meeting Her during the war in Sarajevo. The day comes when you begin all your sentences with “before.” The day comes when all your time is measured out, the children grow up, your parents grow weak. The day comes when you meet a young woman who loves old men: the old married ones.', 'The day comes when your children look at your past as if you had fought at Verdun. The day comes when an official letter questions your age and your status and pushes you toward retirement. The day comes when your latest screenplay idea does not turn into a film. The day comes when your new bank manager urgently summons you. The day comes when you remember meeting Her during the war in Sarajevo. The day comes when you begin all your sentences with “before.” The day comes when all your time is measured out, the children grow up, your parents grow weak. The day comes when you meet a young woman who loves old men: the old married ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Brk16J9HiKT8895ofwDtsawQdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323421'),
  ('165970031424901430', 'Les K d''Or', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Jérémy Ferrari, Antoine Marteau, Sandra Durando', 'Jérémy Ferrari, Clément Peny, Saïd Belktibia', 'Jérémy Ferrari, Laura Felpin, Éric Judor, Fred Testot, Zaynab Alji, Céline Groussard, David Ayala, Karina Marimon', null, 'Noah, who grew up believing he’s Gaddafi’s secret son, is now a treasure hunter obsessed with finding the Libyan leader’s lost gold, scattered across the Sahel after his death. To reach it, he teams up with Zoulika—formerly Louise—an endearing, unpredictable firebrand freshly out of civic reintegration camp. Their cover: joining forces with Ryan, a 52-year-old conservative, visually impaired late bloomer determined to run the legendary Marathon des Sables. Noah wants his father’s gold, Zoulika wants to slip across the border, and Ryan wants to fulfill a childhood dream. Off they go, heading straight into the Sahel.', 'Noah, who grew up believing he’s Gaddafi’s secret son, is now a treasure hunter obsessed with finding the Libyan leader’s lost gold, scattered across the Sahel after his death. To reach it, he teams up with Zoulika—formerly Louise—an endearing, unpredictable firebrand freshly out of civic reintegration camp. Their cover: joining forces with Ryan, a 52-year-old conservative, visually impaired late bloomer determined to run the legendary Marathon des Sables. Noah wants his father’s gold, Zoulika wants to slip across the border, and Ryan wants to fulfill a childhood dream. Off they go, heading straight into the Sahel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZODXZeys9ARnXe2DekYFoUx385.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1295722'),
  ('761553686869859070', 'Les Kidnappeurs', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Graham Guit, Dominique Chapuis', 'Graham Guit, Éric Névé', 'Melvil Poupaud, Élodie Bouchez, Romain Duris, Isaac Sharry, Élie Kakou, Hélène Fillières, Patrick Lizana, Sacha Bourdo', null, 'Ulysse, a gun-toting hood, gets together a team of four people, including himself, to carry out what he thinks will be a fail-safe heist...', 'Ulysse, a gun-toting hood, gets together a team of four people, including himself, to carry out what he thinks will be a fail-safe heist...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jENDTAP1qwaUtFZUPB8UOCDAKMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72365'),
  ('235041787634863296', 'Les longs manteaux', 1986, 'Action, Adventure', 'Gilles Béhat, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Jean-Louis Leconte, Gilles Béhat', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Claudia Ohana, Robert Charlebois, Federico Luppi, Oscar Martínez, Paulino Andrada, Ricardo Darín, Luis Aranda', null, 'A reporter becomes involved with a band of terrorists hiding in the mountains between Peru and Bolivia.', 'A reporter becomes involved with a band of terrorists hiding in the mountains between Peru and Bolivia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vipXu2FfoVrE1z2kPMwNZeXukKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250634'),
  ('219846777165043171', 'Les Mains négatives', 1978, 'Drama', 'Marguerite Duras, Pierre Lhomme, Eric Dumage', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Marguerite Duras', null, 'Traces a slow advance through Paris in the early hours of the morning. The deserted boulevards of Paris are punctuated by interspersed groups of dark-skinned workers, stray prostitutes and vagabonds.', 'Traces a slow advance through Paris in the early hours of the morning. The deserted boulevards of Paris are punctuated by interspersed groups of dark-skinned workers, stray prostitutes and vagabonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ere4PIkPtQOBpJXPICreX0edzgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163378'),
  ('784850006328196775', 'Les malheurs d''un photographe', 1908, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A family goes to a photographer. The photographer pushes the boy around, and no one seems to care. The boy gets his revenge.', 'A family goes to a photographer. The photographer pushes the boy around, and no one seems to care. The boy gets his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pbgU9CEElqpEdxpnqH6YPNM6su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196608'),
  ('863368867867858987', 'Les Milles', 1995, 'War, Drama', 'Sébastien Grall, Andrzej J. Jaroszewicz', 'Sébastien Grall, Jean-Claude Grumberg', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Kristin Scott Thomas, Ticky Holgado, Philippe Noiret, Rüdiger Vogler, François Perrot, François Berléand, Jean-Marie Winling', null, 'In the beginning of the Second World War, Germans, Austrians and persons without nationality living in France are sent to the concentration camp of Les Milles by France government. Commander Charles Perrochon is the responsible for this camp and he promises to the leaders of the prisoners to protect them from the Nazis. When France is invaded by the Germans, Commander Perronchon will disobey orders and his superiors trying to save these men. He gets a train, a ship and money from USA to send about eight hundred of these prisoners to the safety of Casablanca, in Marrocos.', 'In the beginning of the Second World War, Germans, Austrians and persons without nationality living in France are sent to the concentration camp of Les Milles by France government. Commander Charles Perrochon is the responsible for this camp and he promises to the leaders of the prisoners to protect them from the Nazis. When France is invaded by the Germans, Commander Perronchon will disobey orders and his superiors trying to save these men. He gets a train, a ship and money from USA to send about eight hundred of these prisoners to the safety of Casablanca, in Marrocos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tq1JJIHcRZzV5embE5y88dkVJPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180965'),
  ('767274862602298175', 'Les Miserables', 1952, 'Adventure, Drama, History, Romance', 'Lewis Milestone, Joseph LaShelle', 'Richard Murphy', 'Michael Rennie, Debra Paget, Robert Newton, Edmund Gwenn, Sylvia Sidney, Cameron Mitchell, Elsa Lanchester, James Robertson Justice', null, 'In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', 'In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNjUYTCqMHAeRUOcTKHCoFtvl7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132654'),
  ('232089736500249455', 'Les Miserables', 1995, 'Drama, History', 'Claude Lelouch, Claude Lelouch, Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Michel Boujenah, Alessandra Martines, Salomé Lelouch, Annie Girardot, Philippe Léotard, Philippe Khorsand, Ticky Holgado', null, 'In WWII France, poor and illiterate Henri Fortin is introduced to Victor Hugo''s classic novel Les Misérables and begins to see parallels between the book and his own life.', 'In WWII France, poor and illiterate Henri Fortin is introduced to Victor Hugo''s classic novel Les Misérables and begins to see parallels between the book and his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toQ6BJCiKVSnklpsma2GnJ6KKah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48750'),
