  ('246562104137956618', 'Les Misérables', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, History, Romance', 'Jörgen Persson, Bille August', 'Rafael Yglesias', 'Liam Neeson, Geoffrey Rush, Uma Thurman, Claire Danes, Hans Matheson, Peter Vaughan, Reine Brynolfsson, Tim Barlow', 'PG-13', 'In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', 'In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TOgmlIY8X3WjIjvU7Z0jqeNkyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4415'),
  ('121812759379269729', 'Les Misérables', 2012, 'History, Drama', 'Tom Hooper, Danny Cohen, Ben Howarth', 'Herbert Kretzmer, Alain Boublil', 'Hugh Jackman, Russell Crowe, Amanda Seyfried, Anne Hathaway, Eddie Redmayne, Sacha Baron Cohen, Helena Bonham Carter, Aaron Tveit', 'PG-13', 'An adaptation of the successful stage musical based on Victor Hugo''s classic novel set in 19th-century France. Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', 'An adaptation of the successful stage musical based on Victor Hugo''s classic novel set in 19th-century France. Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CuzBs2Lb8At7qQr64mLXg2RYRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82695'),
  ('1069601312312378904', 'Les Misérables', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Julien Verron, Ladj Ly, Valentin Jolivot', 'Ladj Ly, Alexis Manenti', 'Damien Bonnard, Djebril Zonga, Alexis Manenti, Amara Ly, Boris Gamthety, Nizar Ben Fatma, Mohamed Traoré, Floriane Khayat', null, 'With a gun at his belt and a truncheon in his hand, Pento has just joined the Seine-Saint-Denis anti-crime brigade. With his teammates, he develops specific methods.', 'With a gun at his belt and a truncheon in his hand, Pento has just joined the Seine-Saint-Denis anti-crime brigade. With his teammates, he develops specific methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mntqRLjyJxMcHou2Ue1Il6jT1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444424'),
  ('650683574776613684', 'Les Misérables', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Arthur Guerrand, Ladj Ly, Julien Poupard', 'Ladj Ly, Giordano Gederlini, Alexis Manenti', 'Damien Bonnard, Alexis Manenti, Djebril Zonga, Steve Tientcheu, Jeanne Balibar, Issa Perica, Al-Hassan Ly, Almamy Kanoute', 'R', 'Stéphane has recently joined the Anti-Crime Squad in Montfermeil, in the suburbs of Paris, France, where Victor Hugo set his famed novel “Les Miserables”. Alongside his new colleagues Chris and Gwada – both experienced members of the team – he quickly discovers tensions running high between local gangs. When the trio finds themselves overrun during the course of an arrest, a drone captures the encounter, threatening to expose the reality of everyday life.', 'Stéphane has recently joined the Anti-Crime Squad in Montfermeil, in the suburbs of Paris, France, where Victor Hugo set his famed novel “Les Miserables”. Alongside his new colleagues Chris and Gwada – both experienced members of the team – he quickly discovers tensions running high between local gangs. When the trio finds themselves overrun during the course of an arrest, a drone captures the encounter, threatening to expose the reality of everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZQV9rPFXF0iFfKbsAvVIweQ1yM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586863'),
  ('445925954581903513', 'Les Misérables: 10th Anniversary Concert at the Royal Albert Hall', 1995, 'Music', 'Gavin Taylor', 'Claude-Michel Schönberg, Herbert Kretzmer, Alain Boublil', 'Colm Wilkinson, Michael Ball, Michael Maguire, Ruthie Henshall, Philip Quast, Alun Armstrong, Judy Kuhn, Lea Salonga', null, 'The top stars from the original London and Broadway productions join together with a 150-voice chorus and the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra in London''s venerated Royal Albert Hall for a truly magical gala performance of Les Misérables. You''ll watch and listen time and again to the magnificent Tony Award-winning score as sung by stars forever linked to these roles.', 'The top stars from the original London and Broadway productions join together with a 150-voice chorus and the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra in London''s venerated Royal Albert Hall for a truly magical gala performance of Les Misérables. You''ll watch and listen time and again to the magnificent Tony Award-winning score as sung by stars forever linked to these roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yngQrpLlAKO273rLzX1zcBFr3lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37445'),
  ('176489540306055879', 'Les Misérables: The Story of Jean Valjean', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Éric Besnard, Matthieu de la Mortière, Anne Juin', 'Éric Besnard', 'Grégory Gadebois, Bernard Campan, Isabelle Carré, Alexandra Lamy, Loup Cousteil, Dominique Pinon, Albert Dupontel, Romane Libert', null, 'Jean Valjean is released from prison after nineteen years of hard labor, violence, and suffering. Filled with anger and a deep sense of injustice, he has become a dangerous man who trusts no one and nothing. When he arrives in a small village in Provence, he is repeatedly turned away. Desperate, he unknowingly finds refuge at the house of Bishop Bienvenu, who lives simply, with his sister and a single servant. There, he is surprised by their warm welcome, and his inner demons start to waver. But the temptation to be what society sees in him still haunts him, and he steals the Bishop’s silverware. When the police ultimately catches him, the Bishop forgives him and gifts him the candlesticks. This acts becomes the starting point of Jean Valjean’ transformation into a new man who reclaims his humanity.', 'Jean Valjean is released from prison after nineteen years of hard labor, violence, and suffering. Filled with anger and a deep sense of injustice, he has become a dangerous man who trusts no one and nothing. When he arrives in a small village in Provence, he is repeatedly turned away. Desperate, he unknowingly finds refuge at the house of Bishop Bienvenu, who lives simply, with his sister and a single servant. There, he is surprised by their warm welcome, and his inner demons start to waver. But the temptation to be what society sees in him still haunts him, and he steals the Bishop’s silverware. When the police ultimately catches him, the Bishop forgives him and gifts him the candlesticks. This acts becomes the starting point of Jean Valjean’ transformation into a new man who reclaims his humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVyRpwTgsd0XzueCt7mImX6CNnZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1376439'),
  ('244744647346615103', 'Les Municipaux : Trop c''est trop', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Éric Carrière, Francis Ginibre', null, 'Éric Carrière, Francis Ginibre, Bruno Lochet, Constance Pittard', null, 'The charming small port of Port-Vendres, with its 280 municipal employees, is shaken by a rumour: the Mayor, assisted by his department head, a Parisian who has studied at an elite business school, have the dark intention of reducing the staff of communal employees. Revolt rumbles, the majority and almost single union of the municipal employees organizes a response. The national secretary himself comes to consult. Upon his proposition, an historic decision is made: the municipal employees will strike.', 'The charming small port of Port-Vendres, with its 280 municipal employees, is shaken by a rumour: the Mayor, assisted by his department head, a Parisian who has studied at an elite business school, have the dark intention of reducing the staff of communal employees. Revolt rumbles, the majority and almost single union of the municipal employees organizes a response. The national secretary himself comes to consult. Upon his proposition, an historic decision is made: the municipal employees will strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jefrX6rs0BgSyS6Lk2JQbVvjxF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613317'),
  ('974546935748629348', 'Les Municipaux, ces héros', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Éric Carrière, Francis Ginibre, Jean-Claude Aumont', 'Éric Carrière', 'Éric Carrière, Francis Ginibre, Bruno Lochet, Sophie Mounicot, Lionel Abelanski, Marthe Villalonga, Eric Delcourt, Annie Grégorio', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmErmXJIefJaFX2HPLcSwFjaTVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499720'),
  ('32272645890267657', 'Les murs du souvenir', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Sylvie Ayme', 'Nathalie Hugon, Gilles Cahoreau', 'Gaëlle Bona, David Kammenos, Mhamed Arezki, Bulle Ogier, Ladislawa Torunski-Laval, Maëlia Gentil, Olivier Chantreau, Clément Aubert', null, 'A detective captain learns that a mummy in an SS uniform has just been discovered, walled up in an old building undergoing renovation in Colmar...', 'A detective captain learns that a mummy in an SS uniform has just been discovered, walled up in an old building undergoing renovation in Colmar...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccpJfqpYLYCPfFCLfnssmem87wJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602176'),
  ('799597235874614073', 'Les Mystères de la chorale', 2020, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Emmanuelle Dubergey', 'Philippe Le Dem', 'Maud Baecker, Nicolas Marié, Fabrice Deville, Jean-Michel Noirey, Marwan Berreni, Shemss Audat, Alix Bénézech, Fatima Adoum', null, 'Caroline Jeune, a gendarme captain, takes on her first murder. An 18-year-old Kurdish woman, Sabrya, was murdered on her way home from the choir she sang in.', 'Caroline Jeune, a gendarme captain, takes on her first murder. An 18-year-old Kurdish woman, Sabrya, was murdered on her way home from the choir she sang in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVSrs6h6Jc3wh3VZnVvFelvTkG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765096'),
  ('997049470243318607', 'Les Mystères de la marée', 2023, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime', 'Lorenzo Gabriele, Philippe Lardon', 'Laure Duthilleul, Lorenzo Gabriele', 'Garance Thénault, Christopher Bayemi, Julie Gayet, Stéphane Metzger, Kim Schwarck, Louise Marion, Jérémy Barrière, Martin Mille', null, 'On the Atlantic coast, bales of pure cocaine were found at low tide several days ago. That morning, the body of Lucas Lagne, captain and son of a family that owned a shipyard in the region, was found. Sarah, a gendarmerie captain, is in charge of the investigation and will have to team up with Ben, from the narcotics squad, who has just been called in as backup by the prosecutor. The surprise of meeting face to face is great. 19 years ago, they lived in the same city, where Sarah fled when she was pregnant...', 'On the Atlantic coast, bales of pure cocaine were found at low tide several days ago. That morning, the body of Lucas Lagne, captain and son of a family that owned a shipyard in the region, was found. Sarah, a gendarmerie captain, is in charge of the investigation and will have to team up with Ben, from the narcotics squad, who has just been called in as backup by the prosecutor. The surprise of meeting face to face is great. 19 years ago, they lived in the same city, where Sarah fled when she was pregnant...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWZvlGlr83JNxLRaHTE1TN2jAHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1085205'),
  ('481059471115714533', 'Les Mystères des majorettes', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Lorenzo Gabriele', 'Laure Duthilleul', 'Isabelle Vitari, Alexandre Varga, Marie Bunel, Michèle Moretti, Jean Dell, Laurent Fernandez, Lucia Passaniti, Matthieu Lermite', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXUmViFaZRm5moSF3oziAe6wPJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672956'),
  ('524201603826339356', 'Les Mythos', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Denis Thybaud', 'Samir Oubechou, Chérif Saïs, Béatrice Fournera', 'Stéphanie Crayencour, Ralph Amoussou, Alban Ivanov, William Lebghil, Charlie Dupont, Renaud Rutten, Emeline Bayart, Momo Debbouze', null, 'In spite of their total inexperience, three suburban lascars launch themselves into close protection. Thanks to a "mythical plan", they are assigned to protect Marie Van Verten: a capricious and whimsical young woman, heiress of the biggest fortune in Belgium... And incidentally, a target for over-trained killers! Will our heroes'' sense of improvisation be enough to get them out of trouble?', 'In spite of their total inexperience, three suburban lascars launch themselves into close protection. Thanks to a "mythical plan", they are assigned to protect Marie Van Verten: a capricious and whimsical young woman, heiress of the biggest fortune in Belgium... And incidentally, a target for over-trained killers! Will our heroes'' sense of improvisation be enough to get them out of trouble?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Asr21oO27vWEUUtGhqWN0EleJuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66128'),
  ('477788607843722319', 'Les Naufragés', 2016, 'Comedy', 'David Charhon', 'David Charhon, Maxime Motte', 'Daniel Auteuil, Laurent Stocker, Julie Ferrier, Philippe Morier-Genoud, Ken Samuels, Laurent Bateau, Julia Faure, Laurent Poitrenaux', null, 'A shady businessman ,about to be arrested after ruining his country (and more) ,has to get away from his native France ;he meets a dry cleaner,William ,who''s got a private plane and they crash on an island.', 'A shady businessman ,about to be arrested after ruining his country (and more) ,has to get away from his native France ;he meets a dry cleaner,William ,who''s got a private plane and they crash on an island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiURHqVlb8ofuG2rG2KxBbDgOga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377798'),
