  ('667757487796890634', 'Les Parasites', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Philippe de Chauveron, Wilfrid Sempé', 'Oulage Abour, Philippe de Chauveron', 'Oulage Abour, Sabine Bail, Pascal Elbé, Atmen Kelif, Élie Semoun, Estelle Skornik, Roland Marchisio, Frédéric Saurel', null, 'Oulage has it all planned: New Year''s eve, at the stroke of midnight, he''ll finally kiss Brigitte, the girl he''s madly in love with. That''ll be the moment, because Brigitte is having a costume party. Oulage has it all planned—except for the fact that Brigitte has also invited a gang of truly parasitical friends: an old girl friend who never leaves Brigitte''s side, a manic-depressive police officer, a paranoid psychopath, a cannabis-addict suffering withdrawal pains, a stunning Cuban woman on the prowl for immigration papers, and many others who do everything to ruin Oulage''s life.', 'Oulage has it all planned: New Year''s eve, at the stroke of midnight, he''ll finally kiss Brigitte, the girl he''s madly in love with. That''ll be the moment, because Brigitte is having a costume party. Oulage has it all planned—except for the fact that Brigitte has also invited a gang of truly parasitical friends: an old girl friend who never leaves Brigitte''s side, a manic-depressive police officer, a paranoid psychopath, a cannabis-addict suffering withdrawal pains, a stunning Cuban woman on the prowl for immigration papers, and many others who do everything to ruin Oulage''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MyDVywaF6OcBSmPOUuhjbxI44i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35818'),
  ('347395881271458299', 'Les Particules élémentaires', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Antoine Garceau', 'Gilles Taurand', 'Pascale Arbillot, Déborah François, Jean-Charles Clichet, Guillaume Gouix, Michel Vuillermoz, Liliane Rovère, Patrick Mille, Milan Cerisier', null, '2009. Michel Djerzinski, a genius researcher specialized in molecular biology, mysteriously disappears in Ireland. His latest discoveries would have opened the way to a major upheaval in the history of human genetics. This is the occasion for a dizzying plunge in time where we discover his half-brother Bruno, a tortured joker who will meet love in a post-sixties campsite, Janine, Bruno''s and Michel''s mother, a former hippie who has always refused to raise her children in a conventional way, and Annabelle, with whom Michel will fall in love as a child.', '2009. Michel Djerzinski, a genius researcher specialized in molecular biology, mysteriously disappears in Ireland. His latest discoveries would have opened the way to a major upheaval in the history of human genetics. This is the occasion for a dizzying plunge in time where we discover his half-brother Bruno, a tortured joker who will meet love in a post-sixties campsite, Janine, Bruno''s and Michel''s mother, a former hippie who has always refused to raise her children in a conventional way, and Annabelle, with whom Michel will fall in love as a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgZDh2rS3cRzVugNXOuU05bp3LN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926296'),
  ('945184412014485553', 'Les Patterson Saves the World', 1987, 'Comedy', 'David Connell, George T. Miller', 'Barry Humphries, Diane Millstead', 'Barry Humphries, Pamela Stephenson, Thaao Penghlis, Andrew Clarke, Henri Szeps, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Elizabeth McIvor, Garth Meade', null, 'Fat middle aged 24/7 drunkard Les Patterson represents Australia at the UN where his fart literally incinerates an Arab ambassador. Patterson is reassigned to the Middle East so he can be tortured to death by the country he insulted. Patterson''s arrival is the prefect distract of a coup and he is spared. At a bar Patterson meets a bio weapons scientist who''s developed a horrific disease for the KGB whom plan to distribute it to the Pentagon via toilet seats. Patterson of course is far too drunk to understand anything happening and teams up with Dane Edna to save the world.', 'Fat middle aged 24/7 drunkard Les Patterson represents Australia at the UN where his fart literally incinerates an Arab ambassador. Patterson is reassigned to the Middle East so he can be tortured to death by the country he insulted. Patterson''s arrival is the prefect distract of a coup and he is spared. At a bar Patterson meets a bio weapons scientist who''s developed a horrific disease for the KGB whom plan to distribute it to the Pentagon via toilet seats. Patterson of course is far too drunk to understand anything happening and teams up with Dane Edna to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2cnvXZSlhySI3m6sOqWsfM7SKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136254'),
