  ('1020076940846149503', 'Les Petites Fugues', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yves Yersin, Robert Alazraki', 'Yves Yersin, Claude Muret', 'Michel Robin, Fred Personne, Fabienne Barraud, Dore de Rosa, Mistra Préchac, Laurent Sandoz, Nicole Vautier, Léo Maillard', null, 'The old farm worker Pipe is old enough to retire. Even so he cannot imagine a life without work. So he keeps on doing his job and wonders what to do with his additional financial means.', 'The old farm worker Pipe is old enough to retire. Even so he cannot imagine a life without work. So he keeps on doing his job and wonders what to do with his additional financial means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pegWbTG11RgS7ZSbihbkkPIZ3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151794'),
  ('994676659934224639', 'Les Petits Princes', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vianney Lebasque', 'Mathieu Gompel, Vianney Lebasque', 'Paul Bartel, Reda Kateb, Eddy Mitchell, Samy Seghir, Margot Bancilhon', null, 'JB suffers from a heart malformation .He falsifies his medical file ,so that he can enter a top athlete training center.', 'JB suffers from a heart malformation .He falsifies his medical file ,so that he can enter a top athlete training center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1rNDMWzGSvtwS4HDpqDWkOVp2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202980'),
  ('530559659873078436', 'Les Rêveurs', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Isabelle Carré, Quentin Janssen, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Agnès de Sacy', 'Bernard Campan, Judith Chemla, Tessa Dumont Janod, Isabelle Carré, Alex Lutz, Pablo Pauly, Nicole Garcia, Vincent Dedienne', null, 'Elisabeth, an actress, leads writing workshops at Necker Hospital with teenagers experiencing severe psychological distress. Through her interactions with them, she revisits her own story: her institutionalization at age 14. Little by little, the memories resurface. And with them, the discovery of theater, which one day saved her.', 'Elisabeth, an actress, leads writing workshops at Necker Hospital with teenagers experiencing severe psychological distress. Through her interactions with them, she revisits her own story: her institutionalization at age 14. Little by little, the memories resurface. And with them, the discovery of theater, which one day saved her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6W6nKyFSOcHSX1qq4qDsOR8MaSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221724'),
  ('777557082042272220', 'Les Rois du gag', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', null, 'Michel Serrault, Thierry Lhermitte, Gérard Jugnot, Macha Méril, Mathilda May, Didier Kaminka, Coluche, Maurice Baquet', null, 'Paul Martin and François Leroux are brothers-in-law and comics without fame. One day, the famous television comics, Gaëtan, finds himself in the little theater where Paul and François produce themselves under the name of "Gagsters".', 'Paul Martin and François Leroux are brothers-in-law and comics without fame. One day, the famous television comics, Gaëtan, finds himself in the little theater where Paul and François produce themselves under the name of "Gagsters".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArWoBfO9q67tMk805WeVQ2rX8L1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64675'),
  ('1121090059252723050', 'Les secrets de l''invisible', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Simon Roca, Antonin Peretjatko', 'Antonin Peretjatko', 'Luc Catania, Benjamin Blanchy, Marie-Lorna Vaconsin, Carole Le Page, Pierre Merejkowsky, Sara Rastegar, Marcello Cavagna, Daniel Isoppo', null, 'In a Paris in full economic slump, Jojo and Eugène have one after the other loving failures. And if all this was connected ? Our two infiltrated agents thus begin a investigation on young girls. We discover that the young girls are not always young and sometimes not even a girl.', 'In a Paris in full economic slump, Jojo and Eugène have one after the other loving failures. And if all this was connected ? Our two infiltrated agents thus begin a investigation on young girls. We discover that the young girls are not always young and sometimes not even a girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN0e7SRUMBd1HMrYLzMjyXPMK4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547185'),
  ('206455599395693242', 'Les SEGPA', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Hakim Bougheraba, Ali Bougheraba', null, 'Ichem Bougheraba, Walid Ben Amar, Arriles Amrani, Abd-el-Kader Biskri, Charles Nyobe, Lahcène Amari, Anthony Pinheiro, Emma Smet', null, 'SEGPAs are fired from their establishment. To their surprise, they joined the prestigious Franklin D. Roosevelt. The Principal, reluctant to see his school''s reputation deteriorate, imagines a ploy to fire SEGPA while retaining aid.', 'SEGPAs are fired from their establishment. To their surprise, they joined the prestigious Franklin D. Roosevelt. The Principal, reluctant to see his school''s reputation deteriorate, imagines a ploy to fire SEGPA while retaining aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60EgLsQZTxBdRVjIRSh6bJZrSyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922705'),
  ('571113188220580671', 'Les SEGPA au ski', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Ali Bougheraba, Hakim Bougheraba, Brice Morin', null, 'Ichem Bougheraba, Emma Smet, Arriles Amrani, Charles Nyobe, Anthony Pinheiro, Abd-el-Kader Biskri, Walid Ben Amar, Lahcène Amari', null, 'SEGPAs are in their last year in high school. They have to get their diploma, and to win the inter-high schools'' Olympic Winter Games.', 'SEGPAs are in their last year in high school. They have to get their diploma, and to win the inter-high schools'' Olympic Winter Games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VxOYI8SrQNGVLPVSaWx8eD2OaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1098987'),
  ('1037284589977260645', 'Les Sœurs Soleil', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Jeannot Szwarc, Fabio Conversi', 'Marie-Anne Chazel, Michel Delgado', 'Marie-Anne Chazel, Clémentine Célarié, Thierry Lhermitte, Léonore Confino, Didier Bénureau, Bernard Farcy, Isabelle Carré, Patrick Mazet', null, 'This gently satirical French comedy centers on the resulting brouhaha that erupts when the preadolescent daughter of a very conservative bourgeoisie couple gets the chance to appear in a raucous music video starring a raunchy, aging female rocker. When pipe-puffing patriarch and solid citizen Brice learns that his daughter Clemence has been to selected for the music video with tacky has-been rocker Gloria, he nearly comes unglued. His prim wife, Benedicte, the organist for the local congregation, has a different perspective and understands her daughter''s eagerness. She quietly agrees to secretly accompany Clemence during the shoot. Once there, the two are filmed dancing around and having fun. Neither realize that they will become special-effects victims by time production on the film ends and find themselves apparently dancing amongst men who but for the presence of small rubber sea creatures, would be buck naked.', 'This gently satirical French comedy centers on the resulting brouhaha that erupts when the preadolescent daughter of a very conservative bourgeoisie couple gets the chance to appear in a raucous music video starring a raunchy, aging female rocker. When pipe-puffing patriarch and solid citizen Brice learns that his daughter Clemence has been to selected for the music video with tacky has-been rocker Gloria, he nearly comes unglued. His prim wife, Benedicte, the organist for the local congregation, has a different perspective and understands her daughter''s eagerness. She quietly agrees to secretly accompany Clemence during the shoot. Once there, the two are filmed dancing around and having fun. Neither realize that they will become special-effects victims by time production on the film ends and find themselves apparently dancing amongst men who but for the presence of small rubber sea creatures, would be buck naked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCCN4SNqBFCkyWGsdPXvOFiXg81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91131'),
  ('303826195874510663', 'Les Sous-Doués En Vacances', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', 'Didier Kaminka, Michel Fabre', 'Daniel Auteuil, Guy Marchand, Grace de Capitani, Charlotte de Turckheim, Jean-Paul Farré, Hubert Deschamps, Gaëtan Bloom, Patrick Laurent', null, 'A group of friends are planning how to spend their summer vacation. One plans to go to the Seychelles with his American girlfriend. At the airport she dumps him for another guy. He has no money so he steals a backpack and goes camping. Somehow he meets a pretty girl and convinces her to share his tent. But a famous singer sees the girl and wants her too. He convinces the luckless guy to act like a fool and the girl leaves him and goes with the singer to the French Rivera.', 'A group of friends are planning how to spend their summer vacation. One plans to go to the Seychelles with his American girlfriend. At the airport she dumps him for another guy. He has no money so he steals a backpack and goes camping. Somehow he meets a pretty girl and convinces her to share his tent. But a famous singer sees the girl and wants her too. He convinces the luckless guy to act like a fool and the girl leaves him and goes with the singer to the French Rivera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a46lJ3NnGnfpZ98p7e2FcUqliQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51925'),
  ('144565166088196495', 'Les Souvenirs', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Christophe Offenstein', 'Jean-Paul Rouve', 'Michel Blanc, Annie Cordy, Mathieu Spinosi, Chantal Lauby, Audrey Lamy, Jean-Paul Rouve, William Lebghil, Flore Bonaventura', null, 'Twenty-three years old Romain would like to be a writer, but, for the moment, he''s night watchman in a hotel. His sixty-two years old father is retired and seems to not give a damn about anything. He shares an apartment with a twenty-four-year-old guy whose sole purpose in life is to seduce a woman, no matter who, and no matter the cost. His eighty-five years old grandmother is living in an old people''s home, and she wonders what on earth she is doing with stuck with all these old people. One day, Romain''s father turns up in a fluster. His grandmother has disappeared. In fact, she kind of escaped. Romain sets out to find her, somewhere in his memories.', 'Twenty-three years old Romain would like to be a writer, but, for the moment, he''s night watchman in a hotel. His sixty-two years old father is retired and seems to not give a damn about anything. He shares an apartment with a twenty-four-year-old guy whose sole purpose in life is to seduce a woman, no matter who, and no matter the cost. His eighty-five years old grandmother is living in an old people''s home, and she wonders what on earth she is doing with stuck with all these old people. One day, Romain''s father turns up in a fluster. His grandmother has disappeared. In fact, she kind of escaped. Romain sets out to find her, somewhere in his memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZgJEAv2wpRnL2nlRAJG8lpXqDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316854'),
  ('700618554791670227', 'Les souverains et les invités se rendant au sacre (escalier rouge)', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Charles Moisson', null, 'Czar Nicholas II of Russia, Alexandra Feodorovna', null, 'Sovereign Nicholas II and Alexandra Feodorovna and their suite slowly walk down a staircase, preceded by a company of cuirassiers.', 'Sovereign Nicholas II and Alexandra Feodorovna and their suite slowly walk down a staircase, preceded by a company of cuirassiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0w57tRcbAr1hrqLIYltForwPdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194594'),
  ('800765275934480060', 'Les Têtes givrées', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stéphane Cazes, Thierry Pouget, Manon Dubois-Muret', 'Stéphane Cazes, Isabelle Fontaine', 'Clovis Cornillac, Claudia Tagbo, Marwa Merdjet Yahia, Malonn Lévana, Betina Flender, Shirel Nataf, Maïssa Diawara, Louis Durant', null, 'Alain, a former mountain guide, decides to change his life and become a teacher. He finds himself faced with colorful ninth graders who are not interested in anything. Seeking to motivate them and bring them together, Alain decides to organize an outing... in the bowels of a glacier. The students discover a breathtakingly beautiful world of ice. The idea that this glacier could disappear is unbearable for them. Trained by Alain, the students throw themselves body and soul into a crazy project: to prevent the glacier from melting and nothing can stop them!', 'Alain, a former mountain guide, decides to change his life and become a teacher. He finds himself faced with colorful ninth graders who are not interested in anything. Seeking to motivate them and bring them together, Alain decides to organize an outing... in the bowels of a glacier. The students discover a breathtakingly beautiful world of ice. The idea that this glacier could disappear is unbearable for them. Trained by Alain, the students throw themselves body and soul into a crazy project: to prevent the glacier from melting and nothing can stop them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQzhvlbxGh2rAdo9qbnKn8t89el.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846977'),
  ('173809045342607794', 'Les Tribulations d''une caissière', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Rambaldi, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Michel Siksik', 'Déborah François, Elsa Zylberstein, Nicolas Giraud, Gilles Cohen, Firmine Richard, Alice Belaïdi, Jean-Luc Couchard, Marc Lavoine', null, 'A young woman, working as a cashier for a large retailer, writes anonymously about the working conditions that she and all the cashiers face everyday. Her blog becomes famous all over the country, some people want to know who she is.', 'A young woman, working as a cashier for a large retailer, writes anonymously about the working conditions that she and all the cashiers face everyday. Her blog becomes famous all over the country, some people want to know who she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlATdSrq5lNxOk0wRKL1gDmVWkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87558'),
  ('920948846081962151', 'Les Vengeances de Maître Poutifard', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Nicolas Gaurin, Florence Gilson', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval', 'Christian Clavier, Isabelle Nanty, Gabrielle Lazure, Roby Schinasi, Jacky Nercessian, Mourade Zeguendi, Sophia Leboutte, Éric De Staercke', null, 'The tasty story of a retired teacher who decides to make his former students pay for years of heckling and humiliation.', 'The tasty story of a retired teacher who decides to make his former students pay for years of heckling and humiliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0wMePwCqsHcoX8zWQ1ZWAcx6PS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005685'),
  ('1024018858641679966', 'Les yeux dans les Bleus', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Stéphane Meunier', 'Régine Jusserand, Stéphane Meunier', 'Zinédine Zidane, Didier Deschamps, David Trezeguet, Lilian Thuram, Aimé Jacquet', null, 'This documentary follows the French soccer team on their way to victory in the 1998 World Cup in France. Stéphane Meunier spent the whole time filming the players, the coach and some other important characters of this victory, giving us a very intimate and nice view of them, as if we were with them.', 'This documentary follows the French soccer team on their way to victory in the 1998 World Cup in France. Stéphane Meunier spent the whole time filming the players, the coach and some other important characters of this victory, giving us a very intimate and nice view of them, as if we were with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6E1ThCKtaujIdKiYcuej5U9w7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1881'),
