  ('581629315443696364', 'Lesbian Schoolgirls and the Pleasure of Perverting', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Balcázar, José Antonio del Álamo, Federico Canudas', 'Alfonso Balcázar', 'Concha Valero, Andrea Albani, Jordi Batalla, Mirna Bel, James Garci, Joaquín Gómez, Jennifer James', null, 'Aunt Mary is not happy with her recent marriage. Her husband always wants to go to bed, and she doesn’t like it. Her sister’s daughter comes with a girl to spend some days in the house. Mary learns how to love both men and women.', 'Aunt Mary is not happy with her recent marriage. Her husband always wants to go to bed, and she doesn’t like it. Her sister’s daughter comes with a girl to spend some days in the house. Mary learns how to love both men and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1PH4MZoX5RXfPV76TGn5fuCaDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348697'),
  ('50352539019960866', 'Lesbian Vampire Killers', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Phil Claydon, David Higgs', 'Paul Hupfield, Stewart Williams', 'James Corden, Mathew Horne, MyAnna Buring, Paul McGann, Silvia Colloca, Emer Kenny, Vera Filatova, Lucy Gaskell', 'R', 'With their women having been enslaved by a pack of lesbian vampires, the remaining menfolk of a rural town send two hapless young lads out onto the moors as a sacrifice.', 'With their women having been enslaved by a pack of lesbian vampires, the remaining menfolk of a rural town send two hapless young lads out onto the moors as a sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IROnPMgDnI1TYQ4PZBB0nn6CwX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18238'),
